<br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agnolist-c.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\n沒有血盟小屋的名單<br><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","agnolist-e.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\nAgit's list is not available. <br><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agnolist-j.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\nAgit's list is not available. <br><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agnolist-k.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\n嬴雖お 跡煙檜 橈蝗棲棻. <br><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agnoname-c.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\n這裡是<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font>.<br>\r\n正在買賣。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","agnoname-e.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThis is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font>.<br>\r\nCurrently being auctioned.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agnoname-j.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThis is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font>.<br>\r\nCurrently being auctioned.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agnoname-k.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\n檜夠擎 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font>殮棲棻.<br>\r\n⑷營 唳衙醞殮棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agnopay-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n沒有要付的稅金。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","agnopay-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nNo taxes to be paid.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agnopay-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nNo taxes to be paid.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agnopay-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n陶睡й 撮旎檜 橈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agpay-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n這次得支付的稅金是<var src=\"#1\">金幣<br><br>\r\n支付期限為<var src=\"#2\">月<var src=\"#3\">日<var src=\"#4\">時。 \r\n一定要在這時間前支付。<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"payfee\">支付稅金</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","agpay-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe amount of taxes to be paid for this term is <var src=\"#1\"> adenas.<br><br>\r\nThe deadline is <var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\">. \r\nPlease make sure you pay your taxes on time. <br><br>\r\n<a action=\"payfee\">Pay Taxes</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agpay-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe amount of taxes to be paid for this term is <var src=\"#1\"> adenas.<br><br>\r\nThe deadline is <var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\">. \r\nPlease make sure you pay your taxes on time. <br><br>\r\n<a action=\"payfee\">Pay Taxes</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agpay-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n檜廓 晦除翕寰 陶睡п撿 й 撮旎擎 <var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭殮棲棻<br><br>\r\n陶睡 晦и擎 <var src=\"#2\">錯 <var src=\"#3\">橾 <var src=\"#4\">衛殮棲棻. \r\n奩萄衛 晦除 頂縑 陶睡й 熱 氈紫煙 褐唳 賦 輿衛晦 夥奧棲棻. <br><br>\r\n<a action=\"payfee\">撮旎擊 陶睡и棻</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agpayfee-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n已繳納<var src=\"#1\">金幣。<br>\r\n謝謝<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agpayfee-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nYou have paid <var src=\"#1\"> adena in taxes. <br>\r\nThank You<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agpayfee-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nYou have paid <var src=\"#1\"> adena in taxes. <br>\r\nThank You<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agpayfee-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n撮旎 <var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭蒂 陶睡ж樟蝗棲棻. <br>\r\n馬餌м棲棻<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agsel-c.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\n名稱: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n位置: <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n寬度: <var src=\"#2\">坪 <br>\r\n前屋主: <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n現任屋主: <var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\n售屋價格 : <var src=\"#5\">金幣<br>\r\n結束時間: <var src=\"#6\">月 <var src=\"#7\">日 <var src=\"#8\">時<br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"map\">查詢位置</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"apply\">參加買賣</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","agsel-e.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\nName: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\nLocation: <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\nSize: <var src=\"#2\"> Squares <br>\r\nPrevious Owner: <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\nCurrent Highest Bidder: <var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\nCurrent Highest Bid: <var src=\"#5\"> Adenas<br>\r\nAuction Ends on: <var src=\"#6\"> <var src=\"#7\"> <var src=\"#8\"><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"map\">Get more information.</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"apply\">Join the Auction.</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agsel-j.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\nName: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\nLocation: <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\nSize: <var src=\"#2\"> Squares <br>\r\nPrevious Owner: <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\nCurrent Highest Bidder: <var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\nCurrent Highest Bid: <var src=\"#5\"> Adenas<br>\r\nAuction Ends on: <var src=\"#6\"> <var src=\"#7\"> <var src=\"#8\"><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"map\">Get more information.</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"apply\">Join the Auction.</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agsel-k.html":"<body>\r\n<br><br>\r\n檜葷: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n嬪纂: <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n創檜: <var src=\"#2\"> 蘊 <br>\r\n檜瞪 模嶸輿: <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n⑷營 殮雞濠: <var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\n⑷營 殮雞 陛問 : <var src=\"#5\"> 嬴等釭<br>\r\n葆馬 衛除: <var src=\"#6\">錯 <var src=\"#7\">橾 <var src=\"#8\">衛<br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"map\">嬪纂蒂 憲嬴獄棻.</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"apply\">唳衙縑 霤罹и棻.</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agsell-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n你的血盟小屋想賣多少？<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","agsell-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nHow much do you want to sell this house for? <br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agsell-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nHow much do you want to sell this house for? <br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agsell-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n餵擊 橡葆縑 頂場戲衛啊蝗棲梱? <br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agupay-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n在這段時間要繳的稅金為<var src=\"#1\">金幣<br><br>\r\n繳費期限為<var src=\"#2\">月<var src=\"#3\">日<var src=\"#4\">時。 \r\n請注意，若沒有在這時間前繳費，你會被取消你的血盟小屋的擁有權。<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"payfee\">繳稅金</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agupay-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nYou owe <var src=\"#1\"> adenas in taxes.<br><br>\r\nThe deadline is <var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\">. \r\nThe ownership of this house will be lost if you do not pay taxes on time.<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"payfee\">Pay Taxes</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agupay-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nYou owe <var src=\"#1\"> adenas in taxes.<br><br>\r\nThe deadline is <var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\">. \r\nThe ownership of this house will be lost if you do not pay taxes on time.<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"payfee\">Pay Taxes</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","agupay-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n檜廓 晦除翕寰 陶睡п撿 й 撮旎擎 <var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭殮棲棻<br><br>\r\n陶睡 晦и擎 <var src=\"#2\">錯 <var src=\"#3\">橾 <var src=\"#4\">衛殮棲棻. \r\n虜橾 晦除頂縑 陶睡ж衛雖 彊戲賊 餵曖 模嶸掏擊 檠啪 腎棲 輿曖ж罹 輿褊衛螃.<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"payfee\">撮旎擊 陶睡и棻</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","alda1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>阿爾達:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n犯罪的人必須要遭受懲罰。若有地獄，可以將所有犯罪的人送到地獄那該有多好呢？\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","alda1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>憲棻 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n彰賸濠菟擎 奩萄衛 弊擊 嫡嬴撿 п蹂. 虜擒 雖螟檜塭朝 夠檜 氈橫憮 鼻蝗瞳檣 彰賸濠菟擊 賅舒 斜夠戲煎 爾頂幗萵 熱 氈棻賊 橡葆釭 謠擊梱蹂?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","aldred1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>阿德瑞斯 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n我是園丁。在此都市和城堡裡的所有花園都由我來照顧。哈哈...漂不漂亮？看到漂亮的花朵會讓心情變得更愉快。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","aldred1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>憲萄溯萄 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n陪 薑錳餌蹂. 檜 紫衛諦 撩寰 夠夠縑 氈朝 粒寧擎 棻 頂陛 陛羞 匙檜塭螃. �饑�... 霤 爾晦 謠雖 彊模? 嬴葷棻遴 粒菟擊 爾賊 盪瞰煎 晦碟檜 謠嬴霞棻螃.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","alfons-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>愛爾芬 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>請問...。可以給我１０枚金幣嗎?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","alfons1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>愛爾芬 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>好心先生、小姐們。可憐可憐我，施捨我１０枚金幣吧！\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","alfons1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Alfons :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sir... Please spare 10 adenas...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","alfons1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Alfons :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sir... Please spare 10 adenas...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","alfons1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>憲ア蝶 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>椒... 10嬴筆虜...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","alice1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>愛麗絲 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n你是否聽過哥布林這個怪物？雖然它是個很弱的怪物，但若它們組織一群團隊之後來攻擊，也是相當強的。而且他們的頭頭 哈柏哥布林 的戰鬥力非常出色。在這裡附近有許多哥布林團隊，請小心。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","alice1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撼葬蝶 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n堅綰萼檜塭朝 跨蝶攪縑 渠п憮 嬴衛釭蹂? ж釭ж釭朝 擒ж雖虜 餵欽戲煎 渾滬菟賊 紮 嬪⑺瞳檣 惚僭檜奧棲棻. 斜葬堅 斜 餵欽擊 檜莖朝 �庚簅竀偯� 瞪癱溘紫 紮 嗨橫陪 ら檜雖蹂. 檜斬籀縑朝 堅綰萼 ぬ剪葬陛 號戲棲 褻褕ж衛朝 啪 謠擊 匏棲棻.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>歐蒙 :</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>必須保護自己馴養的寵物。\r\n<p>甚麼，但是若發生無法繼續帶著寵物的時候，可以找我寄養。寄養１隻寵物需要給我 <var src=\"#0\">金幣的保管費。\r\n<p>啊，當然我只接受你自己馴養的寵物而已。不會接受用魔法來暫時馴養的怪物。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> 寄養寵物</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> 取回寵物</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問馴養寵物的方法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Almon:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are responsible for your own animals.\r\n<p>But, if something comes up, you can trust them to me at only <var src=\"#0\"> adenas per pet.\r\n<p>Ah, of course I can only take animals you trained yourself. I won't take enchanted monsters. They are too dangerous.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Trust Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Almon:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are responsible for your own animals.\r\n<p>But, if something comes up, you can trust them to me at only <var src=\"#0\"> adenas per pet.\r\n<p>Ah, of course I can only take animals you trained yourself. I won't take enchanted monsters. They are too dangerous.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Trust Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>憲跨:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠晦陛 望菟檣 翕僭擎 部梱雖 疇歜擊 雖堅 爾�ㄧ� п撿雖.\r\n<p>凳, ж雖虜 薑 橫聶 熱 橈朝 橾檜 儅啣擊 陽朝 釭и纔 蜆晦紫煙 ж衛螃, и葆葬渡 <var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭縑 蜆嬴輿雖.\r\n<p>嬴, 僭煩 頂陛 蜆朝 匙擎 渡褐檜 霜蕾 望菟檣 翕僭 閨檜螃. 橫蛤憮 葆徹戲煎 �次� 跨蝶攪 評嬪朝 蜆雖 彊啊棻堅.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> 翕僭擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> 翕僭擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>歐蒙:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>等我一下。我處理完這件事之後馬上過去。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問馴養寵物的方法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Almon:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, just a moment. I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Almon:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, just a moment. I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>憲跨:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴, 褻旎虜 晦棻溥蹂. 檜 橾虜 部頂堅 埠 陛葬棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>歐蒙:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>咦？你沒有寄養寵物？\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問馴養寵物的方法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Almon:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huh? You never trusted any animals to me?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Almon:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huh? You never trusted any animals to me?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>憲跨:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橡溯? 渡褐擎 翕僭擊 蜆曹 瞳檜 橈朝等蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>歐蒙:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>咦？你沒有寄養寵物？\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問馴養寵物的方法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Almon:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't even have animals to trust!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Almon:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't even have animals to trust!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","almon4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>憲跨:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橡溯? 蜆望 翕僭紫 橈戲賊憮 劂 蜆曹棻朝 剪蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","amanda1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>阿曼達:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n最近新的城主任職後。稅金漲高了，生活也越來越貧窮。我也要出去賣些水果，以後不能只靠我丈夫了。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","amanda1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Amanda :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nAfter the Current Lord raised taxes so high life has become difficult. I should start a little business in fruit vending instead of relying on my husband.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","amanda1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Amanda :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nAfter the Current Lord raised taxes so high life has become difficult. I should start a little business in fruit vending instead of relying on my husband.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","amanda1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嬴虜棻 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n譆斬 艙輿椒檜 夥莎 檜�譟� 撮旎檜 傘鼠 螢塭 髦晦陛 ��菟橫蹂. 釭紫 陴ら虜 圖堅 氈擊 啪 嬴棲塭 嫣弊檜蒂 嬪п 婁橾 濰餌塭紫 衛濛п撿 й 匙 偽嬴蹂.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","andrew1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>安德魯 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n在亞丁國的各個領土間交易沒有那麼頻繁，因此物價不同。\r\n若好好的利用這一點，也許可賺一筆錢。\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","andrew1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Andrew :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nThe towns in Aden do not have much trading so the prices may vary. If you use your knowledge well you may make a lot of money. \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","andrew1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Andrew :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nThe towns in Aden do not have much trading so the prices may vary. If you use your knowledge well you may make a lot of money. \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","andrew1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撻萄盟 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n嬴筆縑 氈朝 陝 艙雖朝 憮煎除縑 掖羲檜 斜葬 �偎萩� ら檜 嬴棲晦 陽僥縑 僭勒 高縑 褻旎噶 離檜陛 氈雖. 檜蒂 澀 虜 檜辨ж賊 贖 絲擊 弊 熱 氈擊雖紫 路塭. \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","andyn-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>安迪：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎∼我的店是這附近最好的喔∼！對了，你看看這些可憐的老婦人∼</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"andyn3\">問稅金的事</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","andyn-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Andyn:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome~ Mine is the best shop around this area! Look at these goodies~</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"andyn3\">Ask about the price</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","andyn-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Andyn:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome~ Mine is the best shop around this area! Look at these goodies~</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"andyn3\">Ask about the price</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","andyn-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>寰蛞:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮褫敷~ 檜 輿嬪縑憮朝 盪�騆裔� 陛啪陛 橈蝗轄! 僭勒菟 爾堅陛撮蹂~</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"andyn3\">蹂闈 僭陛縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","andyn2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>安迪：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>不論我生活再怎麼苦，我也不會把東西賣給你這種無賴！\r\n</body>\r\n","andyn2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Andyn:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>However hard life may be, I won't sell my goods to ruffians like you!\r\n</body>\r\n","andyn2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Andyn:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>However hard life may be, I won't sell my goods to ruffians like you!\r\n</body>\r\n","andyn2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>寰蛞:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴鼠葬 詳堅 髦晦 橫溥錶紫 渡褐偽擎 餌塋и纔 つ 僭勒擎 橈熱棻.\r\n</body>","andyn3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>安迪：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在這些低身份的老婦人被課以<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">％</font> 的稅金，所以得不停的工作才繳得起。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","andyn3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Andyn:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>These goodies are taxed at the rate of <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font> nowadays. I'm hard-pressed to keep up with it.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","andyn3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Andyn:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>These goodies are taxed at the rate of <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font> nowadays. I'm hard-pressed to keep up with it.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","andyn3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>寰蛞:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂闈縛 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>薑紫蒂 頂堅 氈蝗轄. 辦葬紫 詳堅 髦晦 橫滑蝗棲棻蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","anicom-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"attackchr\">指定攻擊目標</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"aggressive\">攻擊狀態</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"defensive\">防禦狀態</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"stay\">停留</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"extend\">散開</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"alert\">警戒</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"getitem\">收集</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"dismiss\">解散</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"changename\">取名</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n現在狀態: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n飢餓度: <var src=\"#7\"><br>\r\n體力: <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n魔力: <var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\n等級: <var src=\"#5\"><br>\r\n經驗值：<var src=\"#8\"><br>\r\n善惡值：<var src=\"#9\"><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpnpc\">關於NPC操作之說明</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","anicom-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"attackchr\">Select target</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"aggressive\">Agressive State</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"defensive\">Defensive State</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"stay\">Stay</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"extend\">Extend</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"alert\">Alert</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"getitem\">Collect</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"dismiss\">Dismiss</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"changename\">Set Name</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\nCurrent State: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\nStomach: <var src=\"#7\"><br>\r\nHP: <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\nMP: <var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\nLevel: <var src=\"#5\">\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpnpc\">Help about NPC Control</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","anicom-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"attackchr\">Select target</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"aggressive\">Agressive State</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"defensive\">Defensive State</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"stay\">Stay</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"extend\">Extend</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"alert\">Alert</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"getitem\">Collect</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"dismiss\">Dismiss</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"changename\">Set Name</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\nCurrent State: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\nStomach: <var src=\"#7\"><br>\r\nHP: <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\nMP: <var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\nLevel: <var src=\"#5\">\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpnpc\">Help about NPC Control</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","anicom-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"attackchr\">奢問 跡ル 雖薑</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"aggressive\">奢問 鷓撮</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"defensive\">寞橫 鷓撮</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"stay\">�瑍�</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"extend\">骯偃</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"alert\">唳啗</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"getitem\">熱餵</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"dismiss\">п骯</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"changename\">檜葷 薑ж晦</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n⑷營 鼻鷓: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n寡堅Ь 鼻鷓: <var src=\"#7\"><br>\r\nHP: <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\nMP: <var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\n溯漣: <var src=\"#5\">\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpnpc\">NPC褻謙縑 渠и 紫遺蜓</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","anotte1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>安納特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這個村莊�堻ㄛO一些全身肌肉發達想當騎士的小伙子而已。唉∼我想我還是要趕快離開這裡。話雖如此，但說起來傑瑞德還是個不錯的人，如果你也想成為一個出色的騎士，那就以傑瑞德為榜樣吧。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你問我傑瑞德在那裡嗎？就在那個村莊北邊的別墅裡。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","anotte1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Anotte:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This town is up to it's eyeballs with wannabe knights. Whew - I should leave this place as soon as possible...though Lord Gerard is quite nice. If you want to be a knight, you should take him as your example.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you looking for Lord Gerard? He lives in the mansion north of the town.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","anotte1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Anotte:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This town is up to it's eyeballs with wannabe knights. Whew - I should leave this place as soon as possible...though Lord Gerard is quite nice. If you want to be a knight, you should take him as your example.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you looking for Lord Gerard? He lives in the mansion north of the town.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","anotte1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嬴圍纔:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 葆擊縑朝 螞鱔 斬幫窖橫葬縑 颶蝓偽擎 晦餌 雖蜂儅菟 夤縑 橈橫.. �敻�.. 橡艇 檜夠擊 集釭撿雖.. 斜楚紫 啪塭萄椒擎 紮釭 詣霞 碟檜雖虜.. 渡褐紫 晦餌蒂 雖蜂и棻賊 啪塭萄椒擊 獄爾晦煎 鳴戲塭掘蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>啪塭萄椒檜 橫蛤 啗衛傍掘蹂? 夥煎 盪晦 葆擊 磁薹縑 氈朝 盪鷗縑 啗衛濫嬴蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","anton1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>工藝師安東:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>請不要妨礙我，我正在工作中。\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","anton1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Anton the Artist :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>umm...Don't bother me. I am working on a project right now.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","anton1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Anton the Artist :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>umm...Don't bother me. I am working on a project right now.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","anton1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>奢蕨餌 寰驛 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>戲擠... 寞пж雖 葆衛螃. 陪 雖旎 濛機醞檜塢 蜓檜螃.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","arachnee1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>芮克妮：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我們芮克妮族就是創造者。我們在此森林裡無論是多細微不起眼的東西，我們都可以將它做成有價值的東西。</p>\r\n<p>我們長者之中的<a link=\"arachnee2\">娜魯帕</a>是在我族之中最卓越的創造者。光看著她所製作出來的東西，就像幼蟲<a link=\"arachnee3\">蛻皮</a>一樣的感覺，那是一種很神秘的感覺。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">製作線</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">製作米索利線</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">索取蛻下的皮</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">聊網的採集</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We arachnes are creators. We can make valuable things from all the things in this forest.</p>\r\n<p><a link=\"arachnee2\">Nerupa</a>, one of the elders, is the best among us. When I see the things created from her hands, it reminds me of the serenity at the moment of <a link=\"arachnee3\">ecdysis</a>.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">Ask about thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">Ask about mithril thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">Ask about ecdysis</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">Ask about web</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We arachnes are creators. We can make valuable things from all the things in this forest.</p>\r\n<p><a link=\"arachnee2\">Nerupa</a>, one of the elders, is the best among us. When I see the things created from her hands, it reminds me of the serenity at the moment of <a link=\"arachnee3\">ecdysis</a>.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">Ask about thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">Ask about mithril thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">Ask about ecdysis</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">Ask about web</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嬴塭觼啻:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦葬 嬴塭觼啻 褶擎 賅舒陛 璽褻濠檜棻. 辦葬朝 檜 膛 寰縑 氈朝 橫集и 撮撮и 匙檜塭紫 斜匙擊 餌辨п憮 陛纂氈朝 匙擊 虜菟橫鳥 熱 氈棻.</p>\r\n<p>濰煎 醞 и餌塋檣 <a link=\"arachnee2\">啻瑞だ</a>朝 辦葬菟 醞縑憮紫 陛濰 嗨橫陪 璽褻濠檜棻. 斜喪曖 罹楝 陛款曖 槳望 寰縑憮 虜菟橫雖朝 僭勒菟擊 爾堅 氈戲賊, 葆纂 辦葬菟曖 嶸儅檜 <a link=\"arachnee3\">驍Я</a>ж朝 匙擊 爾朝 蛭ж棻. 斜匙擎...衙辦 褐綠煎遴 牖除檜雖.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">褒擊 虜菟橫殖塭堅 и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">嘐蝶萵 褒擊 虜菟橫殖塭堅 и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">ъ僭擊 殖塭堅 и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">剪嘐還曖 瓣餵縑 渠п 樽晦и棻</a>\r\n</body>","arachnee2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>芮克妮：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在她正專心地在<font fg=ffffff>迷幻森林之母</font>的附近製作物品，但她以前是我們之中最偉大的勇士。</p>\r\n<p>也許你會認為她和商店代用品一樣，可是她用<font fg=ffffff>潘的鬃毛</font>編織出<font fg=ffffff>線</font>，並在線的外面還塗上一層<font fg=ffffff>米索莉</font>！啊∼若你能<font fg=ffffff>親眼</font>看看這些<font fg=ffffff>美麗的線</font>的製作過程，你一定會被深深地感動的。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">關於線的事情</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">關於米索莉線的事情</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">關於蛻化的事情</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">關於網的事情</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now she has devoted herself to <font fg=ffffff>making things and being near the Mother of the Forest and Elves</font>, but she used to be the greatest warrior among us.</p>\r\n<p>While she can buy and sell items, her true skills involve spinning <font fg=ffffff>thread</font> out of <font fg=ffffff>Pan's mane</font> and making <font fg=ffffff>mithril thread</font> by coating <font fg=ffffff>mithril</font> on <font fg=ffffff>thread</font>.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">Ask about thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">Ask about mithril thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">Ask about ecdysis</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">Ask about web</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now she has devoted herself to <font fg=ffffff>making things and being near the Mother of the Forest and Elves</font>, but she used to be the greatest warrior among us.</p>\r\n<p>While she can buy and sell items, her true skills involve spinning <font fg=ffffff>thread</font> out of <font fg=ffffff>Pan's mane</font> and making <font fg=ffffff>mithril thread</font> by coating <font fg=ffffff>mithril</font> on <font fg=ffffff>thread</font>.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">Ask about thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">Ask about mithril thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">Ask about ecdysis</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">Ask about web</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嬴塭觼啻:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎擎 <font fg=ffffff>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲 啁縑憮 ゎ�風荌� 僭勒 虜菟晦</font>縑 翮醞ж堅 啗衛雖虜, и陽朝 辦葬 謙褶 譆堅曖 瞪餌檜晦紫 ж樟湍 碟檜棻.</p>\r\n<p>嬴葆 傘�騊橉� ら葬и 鼻薄 渠褐鎢戲煎 儅陝ж堅 氈啊雖虜... 斜碟眷憮 <font fg=ffffff>っ曖 陞晦瓚</font>煎 彌晦釭朝 <font fg=ffffff>褒</font>擊 濕堅 傳 斜 <font fg=ffffff>褒</font>縑 <font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵</font>擊 蛟閡 殮⑵ 嬴葷棻遴 <font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵 褒</font>擊 虜菟橫 頂朝 婁薑擎...嬴朝 餌塋檜 爾賊 薑蜓煎 馬驕擊 旎й 熱 橈擊 匙檜棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">褒擊 虜菟橫殖塭堅 и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">嘐蝶萵 褒擊 虜菟橫殖塭堅 и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">ъ僭擊 殖塭堅 и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">剪嘐還曖 瓣餵縑 渠п 樽晦и棻</a>\r\n</body>","arachnee3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>芮克妮：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我們蛻化和織線的回復時間與安特有關。因為<font fg=ffffff>安特的樹枝</font>中有一種元素可以幫助我們<font fg=ffffff>織網</font>，而<font fg=ffffff>安特的樹皮</font>中的一種元素可以加速我們的<font fg=ffffff>蛻化</font>。</p><br>\r\n<p>如你所見，守護神之間也彼此信賴。這也就是說，沒有人可以獨自在這森林中生存。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">關於線的事情</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">關於米索莉線的事情</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">關於蛻化的事情</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">關於網的事情</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","arachnee3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Our period of ecdysis and spinning thread is related to the Ent-kind. That's because an element found which can be found in <font fg=ffffff>the twig of Ent</font> helps us producing <font fg=ffffff>the web</font>, and an element in <font fg=ffffff>the bark of Ent</font> accelerates our <font fg=ffffff>ecdysis</font>.</p><br>\r\n<p>As you can see, we guardians also depend on one another. From our perspective, no one can survive alone in this Forest - and you might learn from this as well.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">Ask about thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">Ask about mithril thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">Ask about ecdysis</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">Ask about web</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Our period of ecdysis and spinning thread is related to the Ent-kind. That's because an element found which can be found in <font fg=ffffff>the twig of Ent</font> helps us producing <font fg=ffffff>the web</font>, and an element in <font fg=ffffff>the bark of Ent</font> accelerates our <font fg=ffffff>ecdysis</font>.</p><br>\r\n<p>As you can see, we guardians also depend on one another. From our perspective, no one can survive alone in this Forest - and you might learn from this as well.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">Ask about thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">Ask about mithril thread</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">Ask about ecdysis</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">Ask about web</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嬴塭觼啻:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦葬陛 剪嘐還擊 濕堅 ъ僭擊 慇朝 輿晦朝 縛お諦 贖 翱婦擊 陛霞棻. <font fg=ffffff>縛お曖 還晦</font>縑 氈朝 橫雯 撩碟檜 辦葬陛 <font fg=ffffff>剪嘐還</font>擊 頂朝 匙擊 紫諦輿堅, <font fg=ffffff>縛お曖 皎韓</font>縑 氈朝 撩碟擎 辦葬曖 <font fg=ffffff>驍Я</font>蒂 襠霞ж雖.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜溢蛭 熱��濠郭葬紫 魂檜 塵蕾ж啪 翱婦腎橫 氈棻. 渦 贖 換戲煎 爾賊 檜 膛 瞪羹縑 餌朝 襄營醞 �母� 翕雲橫霞 襄營朝 橈朝 匙檜棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee4\">褒擊 虜菟橫殖塭堅 и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee5\">嘐蝶萵 褒擊 虜菟橫殖塭堅 и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee6\">ъ僭擊 殖塭堅 и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"arachnee7\">剪嘐還曖 瓣餵縑 渠п 樽晦и棻</a>\r\n</body>","arachnee4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>芮克妮：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>紡織絲線這方面我們是很有自信的，我們還可以用這些線來製作任何物品。尤其那用<font fg=ffffff>潘的鬃毛</font>紡出的<font fg=ffffff>線</font>擁有很高的彈性和力量，因此甚至可以幫你製作小妖精們的<font fg=ffffff>弓、衣服、斗蓬、手套，和好穿的長靴</font>，你應該要感謝我們。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request thread\">索取線</a></p>\r\n</body>","arachnee4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Our refined and skillful crafting can produce anything, but we take great pride in spinning thread. Especially the <font fg=ffffff>thread</font> of <font fg=ffffff>pan's mane</font> - which has high resilience and strength.  It can be even used in making elven <font fg=ffffff>bows, clothes, cloaks, gloves, and even boots</font>. Someday, you may be able to use such garments yourself!</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request thread\">Request thread</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Our refined and skillful crafting can produce anything, but we take great pride in spinning thread. Especially the <font fg=ffffff>thread</font> of <font fg=ffffff>pan's mane</font> - which has high resilience and strength.  It can be even used in making elven <font fg=ffffff>bows, clothes, cloaks, gloves, and even boots</font>. Someday, you may be able to use such garments yourself!</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request thread\">Request thread</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嬴塭觼啻:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦葬曖 撰撮ж堅 薑�旁� 槳啾葡擎 鼠歙檜萇 虜菟橫 鳥 熱 氈雖虜 斜 醞 褒擊 瞼朝 匙縑 陛濰 濠睡褕擊 陛霞棻. か�� <font fg=ffffff>っ曖 陞晦瓚</font>擊 檜橫 禮 <font fg=ffffff>褒</font>擎 驕溘檜 謠堅 韓啖憮, 傘�� 蹂薑菟檜 噙朝 <font fg=ffffff>��</font>檜釭 殮堅 棻棲朝 <font fg=ffffff>褡 塽 蜂饜, 濰骨, 濰��</font>縑 梱雖 噙橾 薑紫檜棲 蹂薑菟擎 о鼻 辦葬縑啪 堅葆錶п撿й 匙檜棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request thread\">褒擊 虜菟橫 殖塭堅 и棻</a></p>\r\n</body>","arachnee5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>芮克妮︰</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如果你在<font fg=ffffff>線</font>上面塗上<font fg=ffffff>米索莉</font>，它可以變得既堅固又有彈性。你們妖精們還能帶<font fg=ffffff>米索莉線</font>到<a link=\"arachnee2\">娜魯帕</a>那裡去製造<font fg=ffffff>盔甲、優質的手套或是長靴</font>。現在你能了解我們對你們妖精們帶來了多少好處吧？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request mithril thread\">索取米索莉線</a></p>\r\n</body>","arachnee5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you coat <font fg=ffffff>mithril</font> on <font fg=ffffff>thread</font>, it can be made even tougher without losing its resilience. You elves can bring this <font fg=ffffff>mithril thread</font> to <a link=\"arachnee2\">Nerupa</a> to make <font fg=ffffff>armor, quality gloves, or boots</font>. Now can you imagine how much good we do for you elves?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request mithril thread\">Request Mithril Thread</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you coat <font fg=ffffff>mithril</font> on <font fg=ffffff>thread</font>, it can be made even tougher without losing its resilience. You elves can bring this <font fg=ffffff>mithril thread</font> to <a link=\"arachnee2\">Nerupa</a> to make <font fg=ffffff>armor, quality gloves, or boots</font>. Now can you imagine how much good we do for you elves?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request mithril thread\">Request Mithril Thread</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嬴塭觼啻:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>褒</font>縑棻 <font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵</font>擊 摩橫憮 棻衛 鉻嬴 虜萄朝 <font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵 褒</font>擎 驕溘擊 檠雖 彊戲賊憮紫 渦遵 韓啖雖啪 脹棻. 傘�� 蹂薑菟擎 斜勘 <a link=\"arachnee2\">啻瑞だ</a>椒眷 萄溥憮 <font fg=ffffff>骨褡擊 虜菟剪釭 堅晝 濰骨檜釭 濰��</font>蒂 虜菟雖 彊朝陛? 辦葬曖 嗨橫陪 槳營輿陛 橡葆釭 蹂薑菟縑啪 紫遺擊 輿朝雖 檜薯 憲啊朝陛?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request mithril thread\">嘐蝶萵 褒擊 虜菟橫 殖塭堅 и棻</a></p>\r\n</body>","arachnee6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>芮克妮：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>芮克妮們在吃下<font fg=ffffff>安特的樹皮</font>後，經過蛻化就會得到一個新軀體。<font fg=ffffff>蛻下的皮</font>可以保持原來的用途，或者把<font fg=ffffff>米索莉</font>塗在上面製成盔甲或盾牌。事實上，這些蛻皮的力量，能讓你的盔甲更加完美。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ecdysis of arachne\">索取蛻下的皮</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We arachnes get a new body by ecdysis after eating of the <font fg=ffffff>bark of ent</font>.<font fg=ffffff>the skin of ecdysis</font> can be used as is, or it can be used to make <font fg=ffffff>armor or shields</font> by coating mithril on it. As a matter of fact, those skins are so light and strong that they are make glorious armor.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ecdysis of arachne\">Request the skin</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We arachnes get a new body by ecdysis after eating of the <font fg=ffffff>bark of ent</font>.<font fg=ffffff>the skin of ecdysis</font> can be used as is, or it can be used to make <font fg=ffffff>armor or shields</font> by coating mithril on it. As a matter of fact, those skins are so light and strong that they are make glorious armor.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ecdysis of arachne\">Request the skin</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嬴塭觼啻:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦葬 嬴塭觼啻菟擎 <font fg=ffffff>縛お曖 皎韓</font>蒂 詳戲賊 陸擎 皎韓擊 驍Яп憮 億煎遴 跺擊 橢朝棻. <font fg=ffffff>驍Яи ъ僭</font>擎 傘�� 蹂薑菟檜 斜傖 噙剪釭 嘐蝶萵擊 殮⑵憮 輿煎 <font fg=ffffff>骨褡檜釭 寞ぬ</font>蒂 虜萄朝 等 餌辨и棻堅 菟歷棻. ж曹 辦葬曖 皎韓擎 陛滬辦賊憮紫 欽欽п憮 ��檜 擒и 傘�騊橉� 骨褡 營猿煎朝 寰撩蜃辭檜雖.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ecdysis of arachne\">嬴塭觼啻曖 ъ僭擊 橢朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","arachnee7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>芮克妮：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>聽說你用我們的<font fg=ffffff>網線</font>去捆綁、鞏固東西。可是，娜魯帕無法不斷的生產這種網線，不過如果我們吃下<font fg=ffffff>安特的樹枝</font>後會回復生產能力。如果你急需要它，可以給我樹枝後<font fg=ffffff>輕拍我的腹部</font>，這樣就可以加速生產。</p>\r\n</body>","arachnee7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I heard that you are using our silvery web to <font fg=ffffff>bind and solidify things</font>. Nerupa no longer produces this web, but we used to produce it after eating <font fg=ffffff>the twig of Ent</font>. If you want it in a hurry, you can accelerate the process by <font fg=ffffff>patting my stomach</font>.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I heard that you are using our silvery web to <font fg=ffffff>bind and solidify things</font>. Nerupa no longer produces this web, but we used to produce it after eating <font fg=ffffff>the twig of Ent</font>. If you want it in a hurry, you can accelerate the process by <font fg=ffffff>patting my stomach</font>.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnee7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嬴塭觼啻:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦葬菟擎 鉻嬴頂朝 擎維檜 剪嘐還煎 傘�騊橉� <font fg=ffffff>罹楝 僭勒擊 馬嬴憮 擬堅</font>衛酈朝 等 噹棻堅 菟歷棻. 啻瑞だ椒擎 渦 檜鼻 剪嘐還擊 鉻戲衛霞 彊雖虜, 錳楚 辦葬菟擎 <font fg=ffffff>縛お曖 還晦</font>蒂 詳堅 剪嘐還擊 鉻嬴頂堆 и棻. 渦 說葬 剪嘐還擊 橢堅 談棻賊 <font fg=ffffff>寡蒂 覬 舒菟啖憮</font> 濠斛擊 遽棻賊 旎寞 鉻嬴 還 熱紫 氈棻.</p>\r\n</body>","arachnem1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>芮克妮：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我們對你並沒有成見。但是在殷海薩的名下，我將因你擅自闖入妖精們的休息地而懲罰你。</p>\r\n</body>","arachnem1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We have no hard feelings toward you... But in the name of God who created us, we'll punish you, you who invaded the resting place of elves!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnem1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Arachne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We have no hard feelings toward you... But in the name of God who created us, we'll punish you, you who invaded the resting place of elves!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","arachnem1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嬴塭觼啻:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>傘�鬵※� 錳и擎 橈雖虜...辦葬蒂 璽褻и 褐曖 檜葷縑 評塭 蹂薑曖 寰衝籀蒂 藹彰и 傘蒂 籀欽ж啊棻.</p>\r\n</body>","aruno1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>奧諾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n冠石是商業中心，也是有名的城市之一。我為了想大賺一筆，把之前的財產都賣掉離開故鄉來到這裡。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在呢... 到底要做甚麼比較好呢？</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","ashton1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>艾須同︰</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>唉，一年辛苦的工作卻因為戰爭而化為烏有。因為他們禁止我們離開這裡，在戰後我們也找不到工作。也許我該進入北方森林的<a link=\"ashton2\">燃柳村</a>找找機會吧。\r\n</body>\r\n","ashton1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashton:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sigh, one year's hard work became nothing - all due to the recent war! Even after the war, we can't work - they forbade us to remove the bodies as an example. I may have to enter the northern forest to work on the <a link=\"ashton2\">burnt field</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","ashton1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashton:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sigh, one year's hard work became nothing - all due to the recent war! Even after the war, we can't work - they forbade us to remove the bodies as an example. I may have to enter the northern forest to work on the <a link=\"ashton2\">burnt field</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","ashton1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>擁蓮驛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>縑掘掘, 譆斬 橾橫陪 瞪爵戲煎 1喇 堅儅檜 瞪睡 ②堅儅檜 腎歷棻螃. 瞪爵檜 部陪 �醴△� 獄爾晦塭堅 衛羹蒂 纂辦雖紫 跤ж啪 ж棲 橾擊 й熱陛 氈釭. 釭紫 棻艇 餌塋菟籀歲 磁薹 膛縑 菟橫陛 <a link=\"ashton2\">�倣�</a>檜釭 陞梱 п蹂.\r\n</body>","ashton2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>艾須同：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>燃燒土地可以使貧瘠的土壤能開始生產，在那裡種田，又累又賺不到什麼錢。可是以現在的狀況來說，現在土地這麼少。說實話，北方的森林相當危險，那裡有許多大型的妖魔部落。但最近這裡就跟北方森林沒兩樣了，所以聽說有許多人已經到北方森林，去重新建造新的村莊。\r\n</body>\r\n","ashton2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashton:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We burn the fields to make the barren soil more productive. We don't do that usually because the profit is quite low, especially compared to the amount of work involved. But, since there is no field to work on...what choice do we have?  The Northern Forest is dangerous because of the many large orc tribes, and this place is no different - but I've heard that many people moved to the Northen Forest and built a new village.\r\n</body>\r\n","ashton2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashton:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We burn the fields to make the barren soil more productive. We don't do that usually because the profit is quite low, especially compared to the amount of work involved. But, since there is no field to work on...what choice do we have?  The Northern Forest is dangerous because of the many large orc tribes, and this place is no different - but I've heard that many people moved to the Northen Forest and built a new village.\r\n</body>\r\n","ashton2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>擁蓮驛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>膛擊 鷓遴 奢攪縑憮 寧堯餌蒂 騁朝 堯徹檜塭螃. ��菟晦虜 ж堅 模轎擎 寰謠嬴憮 ゎ模陽 偽戲賊撿 瞰渠煎 寰ж啊雖虜 雖旎籀歲 階檜 橈橫憮撿...磁薹 膛縑朝 贖 螃觼 睡褶菟檜 號嬴憮 嬪яж曹 ж雖虜 蹂闈縑撿 檜 斬寞紫 滌 離檜 橈濫熱. 斜楚憮 餌塋菟檜 號檜菟 斜薹戲煎 陛憮 億煎 葆擊擊 虜菟歷棻堅 м蛤棻.\r\n</body>","ashur-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>亞修：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辛苦囉！在沙漠旅行。我這雖然沒有特別好的東西，但旅行需要的東西\r\n都有。你慢慢看吧。</p>\r\n<p>對了，若你有妖魔的武器，就賣給我吧。我會付多一點金幣買下來。</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">問附近的路</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ashurEv7\">問最近的物價</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashur-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What are you doing in this desert? I don't have any of that high-quality city stuff, but I got everything a traveller could like you might need.\r\nFeel free to take your time.</p>\r\n<p>Ah, and if you have any orcish weapons sell them to me. You won't regret it.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ashurEv7\">Ask about the prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashur-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What are you doing in this desert? I don't have any of that high-quality city stuff, but I got everything a traveller could like you might need.\r\nFeel free to take your time.</p>\r\n<p>Ah, and if you have any orcish weapons sell them to me. You won't regret it.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ashurEv7\">Ask about the prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashur-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 嬴蓬腦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>餌虞擊 罹чж替塭 堅儅檜 號蝗棲棻. 嗨橫釭啪 謠擎 僭勒擎 橈雖虜 罹ч縑 窕 в蹂и\r\n僭勒菟擎 賅舒 棻 氈蝗棲棻. 繭繭�� 埤塭爾撮蹂.</p>\r\n<p>嬴, 斜葬堅 螃觼褶 鼠晦陛 氈戲賊 盪縑啪 だ褊衛螃. 槳п釭雖 彊啪 藥萄萵纔棲.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">輿滲曖 雖葬蒂 僖朝棻</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ashurEv7\">蹂闈 僭陛縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","ashur2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>亞修：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖然我不太想賣給你這種人，但這次就算了啦。</p>\r\n<p>嗯∼那你看看要啥吧。</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">問附近的路</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ashurEv7\">問最近的物價</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashur2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I don't like selling goods to people like -you- - but, perhaps this one time.</p>\r\n<p>Well, choose what ya want...</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ashurEv7\">Ask about the prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashur2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I don't like selling goods to people like -you- - but, perhaps this one time.</p>\r\n<p>Well, choose what ya want...</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ashurEv7\">Ask about the prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashur2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 嬴蓬腦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐偽擎 餌塋縑啪 僭勒擊 つ晦朝 褓雖虜, 斜楚紫 檜廓 и 廓擎 瑭輿啊模.</p>\r\n<p>濠, 埤塭爾衛螃.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">輿滲曖 雖葬蒂 僖朝棻</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ashurEv7\">蹂闈 僭陛縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>亞修：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<a link = AshurEv2>說語島</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv3>古丁領地</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv4>風木之城</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv5>銀騎士之家</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv6>風木村</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>","ashurEv1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<a link = AshurEv2>說語島</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv3>Gludio Estate</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv4>Castle Windawood</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv5>Silver Knights Town</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv6>Woodbec Town</a>\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<a link = AshurEv2>說語島</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv3>Gludio Estate</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv4>Castle Windawood</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv5>Silver Knights Town</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv6>Woodbec Town</a>\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 嬴蓬腦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<a link = AshurEv2>蜓ж朝 撰</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv3>旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv4>孺棻辦萄 撩</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv5>擎晦餌曖 葆擊</a><br>\r\n<a link = AshurEv6>辦鍔漱 葆擊</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>","ashurEv2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>亞修：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link = AshurEv3>從古丁的碼頭</a>坐船就可以到那裡，我妹潘朵拉在那裡做生意。我偶爾到那裡幫妹妹賣東西。</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">問附近的路</a>\r\n</body>","ashurEv2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can go there by taking a ship from the <a link = AshurEv3>Gludion estate</a>. My sister Pandora has a shop there. I go there sometimes to sell stuff, and restock supplies.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can go there by taking a ship from the <a link = AshurEv3>Gludion estate</a>. My sister Pandora has a shop there. I go there sometimes to sell stuff, and restock supplies.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 嬴蓬腦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link = AshurEv3>旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖</a>縑憮 寡蒂 顫賊 陞 熱 氈朝 夠檣等, 薯 翕儅 っ紫塭陛 斜夠縑憮\r\n濰餌蒂 ж堅 氈雖蹂. 盪紫 陛莠 斜夠縑 陛憮 僭勒擊 つ晦紫 м棲棻.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">輿滲曖 雖葬蒂 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","ashurEv3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>亞修：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>從這裡往北邊走就看到古丁領土，據說，其領土的領主意圖挑戰反王失敗，現在古丁變成廢墟之城，唉∼真是悲哀的事情。</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">問附近的路</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you go northwest for a while from here you can find the Gludio estate. But, sadly, I heard that it's in ruins now due to the revolution against Ken Rauhel.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you go northwest for a while from here you can find the Gludio estate. But, sadly, I heard that it's in ruins now due to the revolution against Ken Rauhel.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 嬴蓬腦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹晦憮 磁憮薹戲煎 и霤擊 螢塭陛賊 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖陛 釭褫棲棻. \r\n斬等 斜 夠曖 艙輿陛 奩諾縑啪 奩晦蒂 菟橫憮 諫瞪�� わъ陛 腎橫幗溜棻雖蹂?\r\n霤 碳чи 橾殮棲棻.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">輿滲曖 雖葬蒂 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","ashurEv4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>亞修：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>從這裡往南邊走就到風木之城。那裡的領主很可怕的，竟然向我這種流浪商人課稅∼∼。這實在是太過份了你不覺得嗎？</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">問附近的路</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you go south from here, there is a castle where the Lord of Windawood lives. But, he imposes taxes even on poor peddlers like me...if only someone would beseige the castle and lower the rates!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you go south from here, there is a castle where the Lord of Windawood lives. But, he imposes taxes even on poor peddlers like me...if only someone would beseige the castle and lower the rates!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 嬴蓬腦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹晦憮 陴薹戲煎 軀 頂溥陛賊 孺棻辦萄 艙輿椒檜 髦堅 氈朝 撩檜 釭褫棲棻.\r\n斬等, 釭偽擎 集給檜 ч鼻檣縑啪憮紫 撮旎擊 飲陛棻棲... 薑蜓 傘鼠и棻堅\r\n儅陝ж雖 彊蝗棲梱?\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">輿滲曖 雖葬蒂 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","ashurEv5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>亞修：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你是說傑瑞德避開反王的勢力建立的騎士訓練場村莊嗎？從這裡往東一直走後就會發現有一個森林，在那裡附近找找看。</p> \r\n<p>但是其他的事情我無法說。也許你是反王派過來的間諜。</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">問附近的路</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ashurEv5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You mean the town Gerard built to avoid the eyes of Ken Rauhel? If you go to the southeast from here you will see the ant tower, once you see it, head east.\r\nThen you will see the forest, the town is located somewhere in there...</p>\r\n<p>But I can't say any more. You might be the spy sent by Ken Rauhel!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You mean the town Gerard built to avoid the eyes of Ken Rauhel? If you go to the southeast from here you will see the ant tower, once you see it, head east.\r\nThen you will see the forest, the town is located somewhere in there...</p>\r\n<p>But I can't say any more. You might be the spy sent by Ken Rauhel!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 嬴蓬腦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>奩諾曖 換擊 Яп 啪塭萄陛 晦餌菟曖 熱溼擊 嬪п 撮遴 葆擊擊 蜓噪ж衛朝 剪捱蹂.\r\n檜夠縑憮 陴翕薹戲煎 頂溥陛棻陛 偃嘐鱉檜 爾檜賊 斜夠縑憮 翕薹戲煎 蹕遵 陛撮蹂.\r\n斜楝賊 膛檜 釭螃朝等 斜 膛樓 橫蛞陛縑 氈蝗棲棻.</p> \r\n<p>ж雖虜 斜 檜鼻擎 蜓п萄萵 熱 橈蝗棲棻. 渡褐檜 奩諾曖 繪濠橾雖紫 賅腦棲梱...\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">輿滲曖 雖葬蒂 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","ashurEv6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>亞修：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>從這裡往西南部走會出現一個村莊，叫做風木村的村莊。那個村莊很小啦，就算你到那裡也買不到比我這多樣的道具。</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">問附近的路</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ashurEv6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you go southwest from here, you can find the small town of Woodbec. But since the town is so small, there won't be anything interesting - you're much better off buying from me!</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you go southwest from here, you can find the small town of Woodbec. But since the town is so small, there won't be anything interesting - you're much better off buying from me!</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">Ask about nearby territories</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 嬴蓬腦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹晦憮 陴憮薹戲煎 陛衛賊 辦鍔漱檜塭朝 褻斜虜 葆擊檜 ж釭 釭褫棲棻.\r\n葆擊檜 錶釩 濛棻爾棲 滌煎 餌褒 僭勒紫 橈擊 匏棲棻.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"ashurEv1\">輿滲曖 雖葬蒂 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","ashurEv7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>亞修：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這�堛熊|是<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>。所以就算你買二手貨時還是收新品的價格。不然不符合成本。</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","ashurEv7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The tax is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>. But when buying used goods, I will calculate the tax according to the original price. Otherwise, it's hard for me to break even!\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ashur the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The tax is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>. But when buying used goods, I will calculate the tax according to the original price. Otherwise, it's hard for me to break even!\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ashurEv7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 嬴蓬腦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>殮棲棻. 斜楚紫 醞堅 僭勒擊 髦 陽朝 錳楚 僭勒 陛問戲煎 啗骯м棲棻. 寰斜楝賊 熱雖陛 寰 蜃嬴憮蹂.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","auction1-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>拍賣管理者:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n你好。想知道甚麼事情呢？\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<a link = \"auction2\">詢問關於血盟小屋。</a><br>\r\n<a link = \"auction3\">詢問拍賣。</a><br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n若你擁有血盟小屋或參與拍賣的時候，解散<font fg=ffffff>血盟</font>對血盟小屋的<font fg=ffffff>所有權將被剝奪</font>。請注意一下。\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","auction1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>唳衙婦葬濠 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n寰喟ж撮蹂. 鼠歙檜 掙旎ж衛轄?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<a link = \"auction2\">嬴雖お縑 渠п 僖朝棻.</a><br>\r\n<a link = \"auction3\">唳衙縑 渠п 僖朝棻.</a><br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n嬴雖お蒂 模嶸ж剪釭 唳衙縑 霤罹醞橾陽, <font fg=ffffff>⑸裊擊 п羹</font>ж剪釭 撩 傳朝 棻艇 嬴雖お蒂 乾啪脹棻賊 嬴雖お縑 渠и 賅萇 <font fg=ffffff>掏葬蒂 夢驍</font>ж啪 腌棲棻. 輿曖ж撮蹂.\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","auction2-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>拍賣管理者:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n血盟小屋是指在村莊裡的房子之中，血盟能擁有的地方。<font fg=ffffff>等級15以上</font>並且已經組織血盟的王族透過拍賣能夠擁有血盟小屋，若血盟已經擁有城堡，則無法擁有血盟小屋。\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n若擁有血盟小屋的血盟成員在遊戲進行中死亡，會在血盟小屋重新開始。若使用傳送回家的捲軸，會傳送到血盟小屋。若在血盟小屋休息，與旅館一樣可快速恢復體力和魔力。更可利用<font fg=ffffff>家具</font>，佈置血盟小屋的環境。\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n但是本來血盟小屋是這兒的領主管制的，因此在一定的時間內必須將<font fg=ffffff>稅金</font>繳給領主才可使用血盟小屋。透過血盟小屋的女僕可繳稅。除此之外利用女僕，可以下管理血盟小屋的許多命令。\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n在旁邊的<font fg=ffffff>拍賣公佈欄</font>，公佈目前沒有主人的血盟小屋之目錄。若想購買血盟小屋，請透過拍賣公佈欄參與拍賣。\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","auction2-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>唳衙婦葬濠 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n嬴雖お塢 葆擊縑 氈朝 餵菟 醞 ⑸裊檜 模嶸й 熱 氈朝 夠擊 蜓м棲棻. <font fg=ffffff>溯漣 15檜鼻</font>腎朝 ⑸裊擊 陛霞 捱輿虜檜 唳衙蒂 鱔ж罹 嬴雖お蒂 �僱磈� 熱 氈戲貊, 檜嘐 撩擊 模嶸ж堅 氈朝 ⑸裊擎 嬴雖お蒂 模嶸й 熱 橈蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n嬴雖お蒂 乾擎 ⑸裊擎 啪歜 醞 餌蜂ж啪 腎賊 濠褐曖 ⑸裊檜 乾堅 氈朝 嬴雖お縑憮 營衛濛擊 ж啪 腌棲棻. 傳и 敝�索砦挺飛� 餌辨й 唳辦縑紫 陛梱遴 葆擊檜 嬴棋 嬴雖お煎 腎給嬴 螃啪 腌棲棻. 斜葬堅 嬴雖お 寰縑 氈戲賊 罹婦籀歲 ゎ模縑 綠п HP諦 MP曖 �蛹匱茧粥� 說塭餵棲棻. 傳, 嬴雖お 寰擊 <font fg=ffffff>陛掘</font>蒂 檜辨ж罹 濠褐檜 錳ж朝 渠煎 紱塵 熱紫 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\nж雖虜 嬴雖お朝 錳楚 檜夠 艙輿曖 模嶸檜嘎煎 艙輿縑啪 橾薑晦除葆棻 <font fg=ffffff>撮旎</font>擊 頂撿 嬴雖お蒂 啗樓 餌辨й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 撮旎擎 餵寰縑 氈朝 ж喪蒂 鱔п 陶睡м棲棻. 檜諼縑紫 ж喪蒂 檜辨п 嬴雖お蒂 婦葬ж朝 罹楝陛雖 貲滄擊 頂萵 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n蕙縑 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>唳衙啪衛っ</font>縑朝 ⑷營 模嶸濠陛 橈朝 嬴雖お曖 跡煙檜 釭諦氈蝗棲棻. 嬴雖お蒂 掘殮ж堅 談戲褐 碟擎 唳衙啪衛っ擊 鱔п 唳衙縑 霤罹ж撮蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","auction3-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>拍賣管理者:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n僅透過拍賣才可購買血盟小屋。透過旁邊的拍賣公佈欄，可以參與拍賣，但必須遵守如下流程。\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n首先在目錄中選擇想要購買的血盟小屋。在目錄上有說明血盟小屋的名稱，拍賣結束日期以及目前的投標價格。<br>\r\n在目錄上選定血盟小屋之後，選擇視窗右下的<font fg=ffffff>'Read'</font>小圖示，即可顯示血盟小屋的位置，寬度，以前的擁有者，目前投標者，目前投標價格，拍賣結束時間等詳細情報。若欲利用地圖得知血盟小屋位置，請點選<font fg=ffffff>'觀看位置'</font> 選單即可。\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n利用'參加拍賣'選項參與拍賣後，輸入投標價格。沒有擁有城堡或血盟小屋和等級15以上，並且已組織血盟的王族才可參與拍賣。然而輸入投標價格之後，同時會在自己的持有金錢上自動扣掉投標的價格。此時，將通告拍賣失敗的<font fg=ffffff>信</font>寄至以前的投標者之後，將房子的錢也自動返回至道具視窗。\r\n<br>\r\n透過已上過程，拍賣結束時間後，決定給提出最多金額者購買血盟小屋。拍賣結束之後，將通知拍賣成功者以信件寄至提出最多金額者，然而將血盟小屋的使用權給提出最多金額者，並且將房子販賣金給以前的使用者。\r\n<br>\r\n原來擁有者透過女僕販賣血盟小屋的時候開始拍賣，結束期間為<font fg=ffffff>5天</font>。\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","auction3-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>唳衙婦葬濠 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n嬴雖お朝 唳衙蒂 鱔п憮虜 掘殮й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 唳衙朝 蕙曖 唳衙啪衛っ擊 檜辨п憮 霤罹й 熱 氈戲貊, 棻擠婁 偽擎 瞰離蒂 評落棲棻.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n辦摹 跡煙縑 螢塭諦 氈朝 餵菟 醞 濠褐檜 餌堅談擎 餵擊 摹鷗м棲棻. 跡煙縑朝 餵曖 檜葷婁 唳衙葆馬橾, 斜葬堅 ⑷營曖 殮雞陛問檜 除欽ж啪 釭諦氈蝗棲棻. <br>\r\n跡煙縑憮 餵擊 摹鷗и �� '檗晦'蒂 ж賊, 摹鷗и 餵縑 渠и 嬪纂, 創檜, 檜瞪 模嶸輿, ⑷營 殮雞濠, ⑷營 殮雞 陛問, 唳衙 葆馬 衛除 蛔曖 濠撮и 薑爾陛 釭褫棲棻. 摹鷗и 餵曖 嬪纂蒂 雖紫蒂 鱔п 憲堅 談戲賊 <font fg=ffffff>'嬪纂蒂 憲嬴獄棻.'</font> 詭景蒂 摹鷗ж賊 腌棲棻. \r\n\r\n<br>\r\n'唳衙縑 霤罹и棻.'蒂 檜辨п 唳衙縑 霤罹蒂 ж啪腎賊 殮雞陛問擊 賦厥啪 腌棲棻. 欽, 唳衙縑朝 餵 傳朝 撩擊 模嶸ж堅 氈雖 彊擎 溯漣 15檜鼻曖 ⑸裊擊 陛霞 捱輿虜檜 霤罹陛 陛棟м棲棻. 斜葬堅 殮雞陛問擊 殮溘л婁 翕衛縑 濠褐檜 乾堅 氈湍 絲檜 濠翕戲煎 緒螳釭陛啪 腌棲棻. 檜 陽 檜瞪 殮雞濠縑啪朝 唳衙褒ぬ蒂 憲溥輿朝 <font fg=ffffff>ら雖</font>陛 寡殖腎堅 絲紫 濠翕戲煎 嬴檜蠱 璽縑 奩�秘侅炴�.\r\n<br>\r\n檜楝и 婁薑擊 鱔п 唳衙 葆馬衛除陽梱雖 陛濰 號擎 旎擋擊 薯衛ж罹 ⑷營 殮雞濠煎 蛔煙腎橫 氈朝 餌塋檜 譆謙 釩雞濠陛 腌棲棻. 唳衙陛 部釭賊 釩雞濠縑啪朝 唳衙 撩奢擊 憲溥輿朝 ら雖陛 紫雜ж貊 餵曖 模嶸掏檜 剩橫陛啪 腎堅, 檜瞪 模嶸輿縑啪朝 餵檜 っ衙脹 旎擋檜 爾頂雖啪 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n唳衙朝 錳 模嶸輿陛 ж喪蒂 鱔п 餵擊 だ朝 牖除 衛濛腎貊, 唳衙 葆馬陽梱雖曖 <font fg=ffffff>晦除擎 5橾殮棲棻.</font>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","bahof-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>巴歐：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n我來自『鐵門』公會，在這的倉庫保管費用都是由城堡內的國庫支出。所以請不要客氣，去使用倉庫吧！\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>個人倉庫︰<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\">存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\">取出物品</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟倉庫︰<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\">存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\">取出物品</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","bahof-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bahof the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nI am from \"Iron Gate\" guild - it seems that the transaction fees are coming from the castle treasury, so feel free to use the storage.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Blood Pledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","bahof-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bahof the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nI am from \"Iron Gate\" guild - it seems that the transaction fees are coming from the castle treasury, so feel free to use the storage.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Blood Pledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","bahof-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪濰檜 夥��Щ:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n釭朝 '鬼繹曖 僥'縑憮 釭螞 だ唯錳檜蹂. 絲擎 奢旎縑憮 釭陛朝 賅曄檜棲 璽堅朝 葆擠渠煎 檜辨ж紫煙 ж衛螃.<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>偃檣 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑸裊 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","bahofop-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>巴歐︰</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>上面命令我只能跟<var src=\"#0\">血盟的成員交易。不好意思，你必須去找我們公會的其他成員了。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","bahofop-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bahof the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm ordered to deal with only members of the <var src=\"#0\"> Bloodpledge. I'm sorry, but you'll have to find other members of my guild.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","bahofop-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bahof the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm ordered to deal with only members of the <var src=\"#0\"> Bloodpledge. I'm sorry, but you'll have to find other members of my guild.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","bahofop-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪濰檜 夥��Щ:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>釭朝 望萄煎睡攪 <var src=\"#0\"> ⑸裊婁虜 剪楚ж紫煙 貲滄嫡懊模. 嘐寰ж雖虜 諼睡曖 棻艇 望萄錳擊 瓊嬴爾衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","balsim-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>巴辛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>不...不要殺我！我...我是個...愛好和平的妖魔！</p>\r\n<p>我販賣...歐西思物品…</p>\r\n<p>我也...也...出價購買歐西思物品...</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link = \"balsimEv1\">詢問有關夏洛伯。</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","balsim-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orcish merchant Balsim:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>D-d-don't kill me! M-m-me is a p-p-peaceful orc - hiding here from S-s-shelobs!</p>\r\n<p>Me sell o-orcish stuff...</p>\r\n<p>Me b-b-buy orcish stuff, too!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link = \"balsimEv1\">Ask about S-s-shelobs</p>\r\n</body>","balsim-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orcish merchant Balsim:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>D-d-don't kill me! M-m-me is a p-p-peaceful orc - hiding here from S-s-shelobs!</p>\r\n<p>Me sell o-orcish stuff...</p>\r\n<p>Me b-b-buy orcish stuff, too!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link = \"balsimEv1\">Ask about S-s-shelobs</p>\r\n</body>","balsim-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>螃觼 鼻檣 嫦褕:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>陽葬, 陽葬雖 葆塭. 釭 ゎ�倣� 螃觼.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>螃, 螃觼褶 鼠晦 っ棻.</p>\r\n<p>螃, 螃觼褶 鼠晦 氈戲賊 餌晦, 餌, 餌晦紫 и棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link = \"balsimEv1\">撚煎粽縑 渠п 僖朝棻.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>","balsimEv1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>巴辛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>好...恐怖的<font fg=ffffff></font>蜘蛛。<br><br>\r\n住在這附近的<font fg=ffffff>森林</font>�堙C記得...遠遠的看到...就...快跑。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","balsimev1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orcish merchant Balsim:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>S-s-shleobs?  S-scary <font fg=ffffff>spider like monster</font>. <br><br>\r\nThey live around this <font fg=ffffff>f-f-forest</font>. If you s-see them, you should r-run away immediately, if you c-c-can.</p>\r\n<p>  Usually, the o-o-only way to escape is with a teleportation s-scroll - if I sold those here like P-P-Pandora does to the east, I'd be r-r-rich!!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","balsimev1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orcish merchant Balsim:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>S-s-shleobs?  S-scary <font fg=ffffff>spider like monster</font>. <br><br>\r\nThey live around this <font fg=ffffff>f-f-forest</font>. If you s-see them, you should r-run away immediately, if you c-c-can.</p>\r\n<p>  Usually, the o-o-only way to escape is with a teleportation s-scroll - if I sold those here like P-P-Pandora does to the east, I'd be r-r-rich!!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","balsimEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>螃觼 鼻檣 嫦褕:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>鼠,鼠憮遴 <font fg=ffffff>剪嘐惚僭</font>檜棻. <br><br>\r\n檜 斬籀 熱,<font fg=ffffff>膛</font>縑 骯棻. 爾,爾賊 闊衛 紫蜂,紫蜂陛塭.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","bauman1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>巴門：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>村莊的東邊都被黃土掩覆了，怎麼可能種得出好的農作物？若是說去市區，也只不過能勉強維持生活而已。待這裡，只要怪物不會從黃土那邊來襲，最起碼還有個安定的生活...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","bauman1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Bauman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The east of town is a wasteland - you can't raise crops there.  And near here, the sea only has enough fish to eat day-to-day. If only there weren't monsters invading...\r\n</body>\r\n","bauman1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Bauman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The east of town is a wasteland - you can't raise crops there.  And near here, the sea only has enough fish to eat day-to-day. If only there weren't monsters invading...\r\n</body>\r\n","bauman1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>夥辦試:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>葆擊曖 翕薹擎 �硃姦鷊� 虞⑵氈戲棲 堯餌蒂 薯渠煎 雖擊 熱 氈釭 斬п縑 釭陛瑭撿 啖辦 詳堅 髦 薑紫夤縑 寰腎堅.. 斜釭葆 陛莠噶 �硃姦鷊庥恓� 藥菟橫螃朝 跨蝶攪菟虜 橈橫紫 髦虜ж啊朝等..</p>\r\n</body>","bazure1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>巴瑞阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在這樹林中所有的妖魔部落都有相當長的歷史...但從來沒有一個強大的領導者可以統一。然而沙罕阿吐巴是擁有強大能力的人。\r\n<p>但是...，唉∼即使擁有這個力量，他最後還是必須跪在你們人類面前∼∼\r\n</body>\r\n","bazure1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Bazure Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All the orc tribes in this forest have a fairly long history...but they never managed to ally under one strong leader. Seghem Atuba is the one of that power.\r\n<p>...But, alas, even with that power he had to kneel before you...you...HUMANS.\r\n</body>\r\n","bazure1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Bazure Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All the orc tribes in this forest have a fairly long history...but they never managed to ally under one strong leader. Seghem Atuba is the one of that power.\r\n<p>...But, alas, even with that power he had to kneel before you...you...HUMANS.\r\n</body>\r\n","bazure1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>夥輿嬴 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 膛曖 螃觼 睡褶菟擎 賅舒菟 鼻渡�� 螃楠 羲餌蒂 陛雖堅 氈棻...ж雖虜 頂陛 嬴朝 и ж釭曖 鬼溘и 雖紫濠 壽縑 雖旎籀歲 號擎 睡褶檜 犒樓脹 橾擎 橈歷棻. 撮啞 嬴癱夥朝 斜薑紫曖 棟溘擊 陛霞 陴濠檜棻. \r\n<p>...ж雖虜 斜 薑紫曖 褒溘擊 陛螺橫紫 渡褐啻菟 檣除縑啪朝 鼠葉擊 翌擊 熱 夤縑 橈棻棲...\r\n</body>","bob1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>鮑伯：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我媽媽告訴我，我爸爸住在更好的地方，因為他一直都作對國家有益的事。\r\n<p>他不帶我去真是可惜。\r\n</body>","bob1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Bob:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My mom says that my papa is in a better place because he did good things for the country.\r\n<p>It's too bad he didn't take me with him.\r\n</body>\r\n","bob1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Bob:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My mom says that my papa is in a better place because he did good things for the country.\r\n<p>It's too bad he didn't take me with him.\r\n</body>\r\n","bob1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嫣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>樵葆陛 斜楝朝等 嬴緒朝 釭塭蒂 雖酈朝 �К〥� 橾擊 п憮 雖旎擎 罹晦 爾棻 �徆� 謠擎等 氈等蹂. \r\n<p>嬴緒朝 傘鼠п~ 釭紫 等溥陛雖.\r\n</body>","borgin-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>寶金：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n我來自『鐵門』公會，在這的倉庫保管費用都是由城堡內的國庫支出。所以請不要客氣，去使用倉庫吧！\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>個人倉庫︰<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\">存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\">取出物品</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟倉庫︰<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\">存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\">取出物品</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","borgin-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bahof the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nI am from the \"Iron Gate\" guild. It seems that our transaction fee is coming from the castle treasury, so feel free to use the storage.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Blood Pledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","borgin-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bahof the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nI am from the \"Iron Gate\" guild. It seems that our transaction fee is coming from the castle treasury, so feel free to use the storage.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Blood Pledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","borgin-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 爾曹:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n釭朝 '鬼繹曖 僥'縑憮 釭螞 だ唯錳檜蹂. 絲擎 奢旎縑憮 釭陛朝 賅曄檜棲 璽堅朝 葆擠渠煎 檜辨ж紫煙 ж衛螃.<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>偃檣 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑸裊 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","borginop-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>寶金：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>上面命令我只能跟<var src=\"#0\">血盟的成員交易。不好意思，你必須去找我們公會的其他成員了。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","borginop-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bahof the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm ordered to deal only with members of the <var src=\"#0\"> Bloodpledge. I'm sorry but you will have to find other members of my guild to do your banking.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","borginop-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bahof the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm ordered to deal only with members of the <var src=\"#0\"> Bloodpledge. I'm sorry but you will have to find other members of my guild to do your banking.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","borginop-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 爾曹:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>釭朝 望萄煎睡攪 <var src=\"#0\"> ⑸裊婁虜 剪楚ж紫煙 貲滄嫡懊模. 嘐寰ж雖虜 諼睡曖 棻艇 望萄錳擊 瓊嬴爾衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","bridget1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>布萊杰 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n為甚麼人只關心自己的事情。她感覺不到我對他的感情。 他總是望著別人...。啊...！暗戀是很痛苦的。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","bridget1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>粽葬蟀 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n餌塋檜塢 橫臍 斜葬 濠褐曖 橾 檜諼縑朝 褐唳擊 噙雖 彊堅 氈朝 匙橾梱蹂. 斜朝 樹薯釭 棻艇 餌塋擊 夥塭爾堅 氈橫蹂. 螃概翕寰 斜蒂 雖麵瑭 螞 釭曖 衛摹擊 瞪⑵ 替郭雖紫 跤и 瓣 蜓檜轄. 嬴... 援捱陛蒂 餌嫌и棻朝 匙擎 霤 嬴Ъ 橾檣陛瑭蹂.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","brogin-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>伯金：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n我是從“鋼鐵之門“派過來的人員。錢是從公款出去，倉庫隨時都可以用。<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>個人倉庫：<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 儲存物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 取回物品</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟倉庫：<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\">儲存物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\">取回物品</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","broginop-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>伯金：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我是從吉爾德的命令下，只跟<var src=\"#0\">血盟往來。很抱歉，請你找其他人.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","brunner1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>布朗諾：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你好，我是這個村莊的村長，我叫布朗諾。就像你看到的，這個村莊是很貧窮。不∼應該說風木之城全部都是窮困的地區，這裡有的只是無邊境的荒地和在那邊出沒的可怕怪物而已，完全沒有可以耕作的土地，所以村民們只能靠著捕撈的魚和田裡的收割水稻來維持生活而已。領主到底知不知道現在的狀況，如果讓建立風木之城的卡勒知道這情況的話，九泉之下也會死不瞑目的。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n現在我們大部分的所得都拿去<a link=\"brunner2\">納稅</a>了。唉...真的是走投無路哪。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","brunner1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Brunner:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome! I'm Brunner, the the mayor of this town. As you can see, this is but a poor village. Actually the whole of Windawood is poor; all we have here are huge wastes and invading monsters. The people here are supporting their lives by catching fish from the sea and raising crops from our small fields. But most of the crops are being taken as tax...sigh.  If only someone benevolent were able to seige the castle!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nI wonder if the current usurper knows how bad things are. If <a link=\"brunner2\">Karel Tanford</a>, who built the Windawood with his own hand, were to find this out, his rest in the world beyond would be troubled indeed...\r\n</body>\r\n","brunner1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Brunner:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome! I'm Brunner, the the mayor of this town. As you can see, this is but a poor village. Actually the whole of Windawood is poor; all we have here are huge wastes and invading monsters. The people here are supporting their lives by catching fish from the sea and raising crops from our small fields. But most of the crops are being taken as tax...sigh.  If only someone benevolent were able to seige the castle!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nI wonder if the current usurper knows how bad things are. If <a link=\"brunner2\">Karel Tanford</a>, who built the Windawood with his own hand, were to find this out, his rest in the world beyond would be troubled indeed...\r\n</body>\r\n","brunner1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>粽瑞傘:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>寰喟ж衛螃. 陪 檜 葆擊檜 襟濰檣 粽瑞傘塭堅 ж螃. 爾衛棻衛Я 檜 葆擊擎 陛陪и 葆擊檜螃. 嬴棲 孺棻辦萄 瞪羹陛 掙ди 雖羲檜雖. 堯餌雖擊 階 渠褐 氈朝 剪塭堆 剪渠и �硃姦鶹� 剪晦憮 轎僭ж朝 鼠衛鼠衛и 跨蝶攪 夤縛 橈棻螃. 檜 葆擊 餌塋菟擎 斬п煎 釭陛憮 濩嬴 螢葬朝 僭堅晦諦 橡葆 寰腎朝 寧曖 熱�捆健� 啖辦 髦嬴陛堅 氈棻螃. 斜釭葆 渠睡碟 撮旎戲煎 貍憾晦堅 釭賊 薑蜓 虞虞ж棻螃.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n雖旎曖 艙輿朝 檜楛 鼻�窕� 憲堅釭 氈朝 勒雖.. 孺棻辦萄蒂 槳熱 撮辦樟湍 <a link=\"brunner2\">蘋滂 驕ん萄</a>椒檜 檜楛 鼻�窕� 嬴褐棻賊 盪蝓縑憮紫 ら�� 換馬雖 跤ж褒 啪 ぎ葡橈棻螃.</p>\r\n</body>","brunner2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>布朗諾：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖然他被稱作『背叛的藍騎士』卡勒，但是我也不知道為什麼他會有這樣的綽號。最初，風木之城在人類還來不及掌管時，曾經是怪獸的天下，到處是一片狼藉、慘不忍睹。傳說那時的卡勒親自帶領優秀的騎士隊征伐怪獸的頭目－巴列斯。之後他為了囚禁巴列斯，所以建立了風木之城。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>不管是以前或現在，因為風木之城的土地貧瘠，加上那裡的怪物一直都排斥與人類的往來，雖然如此，他們也曾有想要把這裡開發成豐盛的土地的計畫...真是懷念那個時候啊。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","brunner2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Brunner:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'Karel, the Blue Knight of Betrayal' is the one...but I don't know how he got such a name. It is said that when Windawood was only inhabited by monsters, Lord Karel, with his best knights, invaded a dark lair of monsters and built the castle over the dungeon seal the evil creatures within. </p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Even then, Windawood, a naturally barren field, was nearly uninhabitable - but at least then there was the ambition to make it rich land. I miss the old days.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","brunner2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Brunner:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'Karel, the Blue Knight of Betrayal' is the one...but I don't know how he got such a name. It is said that when Windawood was only inhabited by monsters, Lord Karel, with his best knights, invaded a dark lair of monsters and built the castle over the dungeon seal the evil creatures within. </p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Even then, Windawood, a naturally barren field, was nearly uninhabitable - but at least then there was the ambition to make it rich land. I miss the old days.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","brunner2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>粽瑞傘:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'寡褐曖 羶晦餌 蘋滂'檜塭 碳葬辦朝 碟檜歷雖虜 謁 斜楛 滌貲檜 稱歷朝雖朝 賅艇棻螃. 嬴霜 孺棻辦萄縑 檣除曖 槳望檜 嘐纂雖 彊堅 跨蝶攪 繭雖艘湍 衛瞰, 蘋滂椒擎 濠褐曖 嗨橫陪 晦餌欽擊 檜莊堅 跨蝶攪曖 獄剪雖檣 湍蟒擊 薑弊ж堅朝 蝶蝶煎 湍蟒曖 馬衛濠陛 腎晦 辦п 斜夠縑 孺棻辦萄 撩擊 撮辦樟棻堅 瞪п雖雖蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜 陽釭 雖旎檜釭 孺棻辦萄朝 繫夢и 階檜塭 餌塋擊 剪睡ц雖虜, Ё褶и 階戲煎 偃嫦ж堅濠 ж朝 曖踹虜擎 渠欽ц朝等.. 薑蜓 斜 衛瞰檜 斜董模.</p>\r\n</body>","bruno1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>布魯諾 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n冠石是以商業聞名的都市。我把所有的財產賣掉之後，為了賺錢來到這裡。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>不過... 到底在這裡怎麼樣才能賺到錢呢？</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","bruno1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Bruno :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nGiran is the center of business trade. I also left my home town to make a fortune for myself.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>But...Where should I start?</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","bruno1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Bruno :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nGiran is the center of business trade. I also left my home town to make a fortune for myself.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>But...Where should I start?</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","bruno1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>睡腦喻 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n晦塢擎 鼻機曖 醞褕雖煎 嶸貲и 紫衛檜雖. 釭紫 檜夠縑憮 и 跟 濩嬴爾溥堅 瞪營骯擊 つ嬴纂辦堅 堅щ擊 集釭諮雖.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斬等... 渠羹 劂 ж賊 謠雖?</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","cana1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>卡娜：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>世風日下人心不古，我像母親一樣地擔憂孩子們，在這樣的世界上他們會變成什麼樣子呢？\r\n</body>","cana1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cana:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's hard to trust people nowadays. As a parent, I'm really worried about my children - what will they become in such a world?\r\n</body>\r\n","cana1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cana:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's hard to trust people nowadays. As a parent, I'm really worried about my children - what will they become in such a world?\r\n</body>\r\n","cana1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蘋釭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂闈 撮鼻檜 霤 �靿鞁媬�. 濠衝 氈朝 睡賅煎賦朝 薑蜓 檜楛等憮 橫萼 嬴檜菟檜 橫飩啪 贗梱 談橫 副薑檜 脹棻堅蹂.\r\n</body>","CastleS-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在的城堡治安管理如下。<br>\r\n<br>\r\n圍城之前檢查城堡: <var src=\"#1\"><br><br>\r\n若叫我圍城之前檢查城堡，首先會僱用幾位法師，在圍城之前把一些勢力驅逐掉。 <br>\r\n但是要執行此任務得花100,000金幣，請確認國庫是否有足夠的金幣。<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"enableclear\">圍城之前檢查城堡。</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"disableclear\">圍城之前不檢查城堡。</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","CastleS-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sir, here is the current status of castle security.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n Castle Inspection before war : <var src=\"#1\"><br><br>\r\nIf you tell me to secure the castle before war, I'll hire some wizards to clear outsiders from the castle right before the siege starts.<br>\r\nBut sir, please remember that it will cost you 100,000 adena to do that. And if there isn't enough in the castle treasury, I won't be able to perform the check.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"enableclear\">Secure the castle before war</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"disableclear\">No need to secure the castle before war</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","CastleS-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sir, here is the current status of castle security.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n Castle Inspection before war : <var src=\"#1\"><br><br>\r\nIf you tell me to secure the castle before war, I'll hire some wizards to clear outsiders from the castle right before the siege starts.<br>\r\nBut sir, please remember that it will cost you 100,000 adena to do that. And if there isn't enough in the castle treasury, I won't be able to perform the check.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"enableclear\">Secure the castle before war</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"disableclear\">No need to secure the castle before war</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","CastleS-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營曖 撩 纂寰婦葬 鼻鷓朝 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n奢撩瞪 霜瞪 撩 匐儀: <var src=\"#1\"><br><br>\r\n虜擒 奢撩瞪 瞪縑 撩擊 匐餌ж塭堅 盪縑啪 橾楝 輿衛賊 賃貲曖 葆徹餌蒂 堅辨п憮 奢撩瞪 霜瞪縑 撩縑 獗橫氈朝 碳牖 撮溘菟擊 賅舒 撩夤戲煎 蹺寞衛酈啊蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n斜楝釭 檜蒂 熱чж晦 嬪п憮朝 100,000 嬴等釭陛 模賅腎螃棲 措堅蒂 �挫恉狤� 輿衛晦 夥奧棲棻.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"enableclear\">奢撩瞪 霜瞪縑 撩擊 褻餌и棻.</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"disableclear\">奢撩瞪 霜瞪縑 撩擊 褻餌ж雖 彊朝棻.</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","catty-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱蒂：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哈囉！想買什麼嗎？</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"catty2\">詢問最近的傳聞</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"catty3\">詢問稅率</a>\r\n</body>","catty-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Catty:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hello? What can I do for you?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"catty2\">Ask about recent rumors</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"catty3\">Ask about prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","catty-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Catty:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hello? What can I do for you?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"catty2\">Ask about recent rumors</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"catty3\">Ask about prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","catty-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>馨じ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃撮蹂. 鼠歙擊 紫諦萄萵梱蹂?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"catty2\">譆斬曖 模僥擊 菔朝棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"catty3\">蹂闈 僭陛縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","catty1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱蒂：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>很抱歉，我們老闆告訴我，不可以把東西賣給奇怪的人。</p>\r\n</body>","catty1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Catty:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm very sorry, sir, but my master said not to sell any goods to suspicious looking characters.</p>\r\n</body>","catty1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Catty:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm very sorry, sir, but my master said not to sell any goods to suspicious looking characters.</p>\r\n</body>","catty1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>馨じ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>槳椒, 渠欽�� 賸歎м棲棻虜...熱鼻и 餌塋縑啪朝 僭勒擊 つ雖 跤ж紫煙 腎橫氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n</body>","catty2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱蒂：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這村莊在晚上還會被怪獸襲擊。他們說怪獸們來自村莊北方的廢墟。唉∼難道我們在戰後吃的苦還不夠，真不知道要到什麼時候，那些自認為應得王位的人才會終止這些無意義的戰爭？</p>\r\n</body>","Catty2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Catty:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The village is being attacked by monsters at night!  They say the monsters come from the ruins north of the village...as if we weren't suffering enough hardships after the war! When will the Pretender-king cease these senseless battles?</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","catty2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Catty:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The village is being attacked by monsters at night!  They say the monsters come from the ruins north of the village...as if we weren't suffering enough hardships after the war! When will the Pretender-king cease these senseless battles?</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","catty2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>馨じ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>譆斬 葆擊 磁薹縑 氈朝 わъ縑憮 嫘檜 腎賊 惚僭菟檜 葆擊擊 蝗問ж堅 氈橫蹂. 陛嗣檜釭 瞪爵 霜�譯� 髦晦 橫溥遴等...薑蜓 奩諾擎 樹薯釭 腎撿 藹楞 瞪爵擊 斜虜舒溥朝雖...</p>\r\n</body>","catty3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱蒂：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>領主殿下對所有購買行為都要課<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">％</font>的稅。真是荒謬啊！</p>\r\n</body>","catty3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Catty:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The prince of <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font> has levied a <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\">%</font> tax on all purchases. What's the world coming to!?!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","catty3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Catty:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The prince of <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font> has levied a <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\">%</font> tax on all purchases. What's the world coming to!?!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","catty3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>馨じ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿椒檜 蜓噪ж衛晦蒂 撮旎擎 僭勒高曖 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>奧棲棻. 釭 霤 晦陛虞⑵憮...鎳. </p>\r\n</body>","changepass-c.tbl":"10\r\n要更改密碼，首先請在\r\n『舊密碼』欄位輸入原始\r\n密碼，在『新密碼』欄位\r\n輸入新密碼，在『確認』\r\n欄位再輸入一次新密碼\r\n\r\n密碼應該盡量不要太容易\r\n讓人猜到（例如：跟您的\r\n帳號名稱一樣）","changepass-e.tbl":"10\r\nTo change your password, type\r\nyour current password in\r\nthe \"Old\" box, and your new\r\npassword in the \"New\" and \r\n\"Confirm\" boxes\r\n\r\nYour password should not be\r\none that others could guess\r\neasily (for example, not the\r\nsame as your account name).\r\n","changepass-j.tbl":"10\r\nTo change your password, type\r\nyour current password in\r\nthe \"Old\" box, and your new\r\npassword in the \"New\" and \r\n\"Confirm\" boxes\r\n\r\nYour password should not be\r\none that others could guess\r\neasily (for example, not the\r\nsame as your account name).\r\n","changepass-k.tbl":"16\r\n餌辨濠 橫蘋遴お曖 ぬ蝶錶\r\n萄蒂 滲唳й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\nOld縑  晦襄縑 餌辨ж衛湍\r\nぬ蝶錶萄蒂  殮溘ж褐  ��\r\nNew縑 滲唳ж衛堅濠  ж朝\r\nぬ蝶錶萄蒂 殮溘п 輿褊衛\r\n螃.\r\n檜 陽, 滲唳脹 ぬ蝶錶萄蒂\r\n�挫恉炱� 嬪п  Confirm陪\r\n縑 New縑  殮溘ж褐  匙婁\r\n翕橾и Password蒂  и 廓\r\n渦 殮溘ж敷撿 м棲棻.\r\n\r\nぬ蝶錶萄朝 棻艇 餌塋檜 蔣\r\n啪 蹺難й 熱 橈朝 匙檜橫\r\n撿 м棲棻.\r\n","chaotictp1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>『天上傳來的聲音』：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>所有事物都必須依其本質而行。\r\n<p>若萬物之父格蘭肯為惡，則所有事物在本質上也就是惡。因此所有事物須盡力去彰顯其本質。所有事物必須在真實之『惡』之前解放。\r\n<p>在這本『邪惡與自由之神』的經典中，包含了格蘭肯的真相，對那些想要變得更邪惡的怪物來說，他們很需要這本書。若你也想要得到這惡的力量，就必須拿到怪物身上那既邪惡又自由的聖約書。當真實的邪惡回應，你就能得到一部份邪神的力量。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這是格蘭肯的正義。格蘭肯的意志。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>你永不該在此限制甚至禁止談論神的教義。對人類來說，被限制自由是很痛苦的。\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","chaotictp1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'Voice from the sky':</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...All things... have to do what they truly want...\r\n<p>......Since Gran Kain, the father of all things, was evil, everything is inherently evil...  Thus, all things should work to reveal their true nature. All things must be free before the true 'Evil'.\r\n<p>...The books containing the truth of Gran Kain, 'the God of evil and freedom'... are sought after by all monsters who want to be more evil. If you also want to gain evil power, you should take the Libram of Evil and Freedom from these monsters, and then when the truth of evil is echoing here, you will gain part of the Evil God's power.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is the justice of Gran Kain. The will of Gran Kain.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>But ... You should never speak the teachings of the God of Restriction and Oppression here. Woe to the one who restricts the Freedom...\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","chaotictp1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'Voice from the sky':</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...All things... have to do what they truly want...\r\n<p>......Since Gran Kain, the father of all things, was evil, everything is inherently evil...  Thus, all things should work to reveal their true nature. All things must be free before the true 'Evil'.\r\n<p>...The books containing the truth of Gran Kain, 'the God of evil and freedom'... are sought after by all monsters who want to be more evil. If you also want to gain evil power, you should take the Libram of Evil and Freedom from these monsters, and then when the truth of evil is echoing here, you will gain part of the Evil God's power.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is the justice of Gran Kain. The will of Gran Kain.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>But ... You should never speak the teachings of the God of Restriction and Oppression here. Woe to the one who restricts the Freedom...\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","chaotictp1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'ж棺煎睡攪曖 模葬':</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...賅萇 襄營朝...濠晦陛 霞薑 葆擠戲煎 錳ж朝 橾擊 п撿 и棻...\r\n<p>......賅萇 襄營曖 嬴幗雖檣 斜嫌 蘋檣檜 學ж艘戲嘎煎, 賅萇 襄營曖 斬獄擎 餌學ж棲...賅萇 襄營菟擎 渦遵 濠褐曖 獄撩擊 萄楝頂晦 嬪п 喻溘ж罹撿 и棻. 賅萇 襄營朝 '學л' 擅縑...濠嶸煎諦撿 и棻.\r\n<p>...'學婁 濠嶸曖 褐' 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 霞葬陛 瞳�� 疇菟擎...爾棻 餌學и 襄營陛 腎晦 錳ж朝 賅萇 跨蝶攪菟檜 錳ж罹 瓊朝 匙. 斜渠 傳и 餌學и ��擊 橢堅濠 и棻賊 檜菟煎睡攪 學婁 濠嶸曖 褐曖 唳瞪擊 貍憾嬴撿 и棻. 斜夠縑 瞳�� 學曖 霞葬陛 檜夠縑憮 選溥ぷ韓 陽 斜渠紫 學и 褐曖 ��曖 橾睡蒂 陛雖啪 腆 匙檜棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜匙檜 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 薑曖. 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 嗆.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>ж雖虜 唸囀...樓夢婁 橘憶曖 褐曖 掖葬蒂 檜夠縑憮 蜓ж罹憮朝 寰脹棻. 濠嶸蒂 樓夢ж朝 濠縑啪朝 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 盪輿陛 氈擊 匙檜棲...\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","christmas-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>讓我們慶祝殷海薩的誕生吧！\r\n<p>雖然在聖約書沒人提這件事，不過傳說這些紅色短襪是殷海薩親自送給第一個人類的東西，藉著襪子的保護，她的腳就不會因粗糙的地面而受傷。\r\n<p>為了紀念那個事件，我們便習慣和鄰居交換短襪。希望殷海薩賜予第一個人類的祝福也能降臨到我們身上。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>誰知道？如果在12月25日殷海薩的生日之前，你作了許多好事， 他可能賜給你一個很大的禮物也不一定！\r\n</body>\r\n","christmas-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Let's celebrate the birth date of Einhasad!\r\n<p>Though it's not specified in the libram, I heard that these red socks were given to the first human by Einhasad Himself, so that she would not hurt her feet on the rough ground.\r\n<p>So to commemorate that event, we have a custom to exchange socks with neighbors. In this way, we hope that the blessing Einhasad gave to the first human may fall upon us as well!\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Who knows? If you perform good deeds until the December 25, Einhasad Himself may give you a great reward!\r\n</body>\r\n","christmas-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Let's celebrate the birth date of Einhasad!\r\n<p>Though it's not specified in the libram, I heard that these red socks were given to the first human by Einhasad Himself, so that she would not hurt her feet on the rough ground.\r\n<p>So to commemorate that event, we have a custom to exchange socks with neighbors. In this way, we hope that the blessing Einhasad gave to the first human may fall upon us as well!\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Who knows? If you perform good deeds until the December 25, Einhasad Himself may give you a great reward!\r\n</body>\r\n","christmas-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>嬴檣ж餌萄曖 璽褻瞰擊 蹴жм衛棻!\r\n<p>唳瞪縑 釭諦氈朝 檜撿晦朝 嬴棲雖虜, 檜 碩擎 曄蜓擎 譆蟾煎 虜菟橫霞 檣除檜 剪耀 階擊 嫖堅 棻纂雖 彊紫煙 嬴檣ж餌萄眷憮 斜喪縑啪 摹餌ж褐 匙檜塭渦捱蹂.\r\n<p>斜勘 晦喃п憮 嬴筆 醞陴睡縑憮朝 衙喇 檜蜀陽鎢 檜醒 餌塋菟婁 檜 曄蜓擊 掖�納炴� Ё蝗檜 氈港棲棻. 譆蟾曖 檣除縑啪 頂溥螺湍 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 蹴犒檜 辦葬縑啪紫 氈晦蒂 晦錳ж朝 匙檜轄.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>傳 憲嬴蹂? 12錯 25橾曖 璽褻瞰梱雖 雜ж啪 雖頂朝 餌塋縑啪朝 嬴檣ж餌萄眷憮 薑蜓 謠擎 摹僭擊 輿褒鎬.\r\n</body>","clause.txt":"\t    葬棲雖 檜辨擒婦\r\n\r\n檜 擒婦擎 (輿)縛噢模Щお(檜ж '�蜓�')陛\r\n薯奢ж朝 檣攪喘 晦奩 MPOG(Multi-Player\r\nOnline Game)檣 葬棲雖 啪歜 憮綠蝶\r\n檜辨濠諦 �蜓蝪ˋ� 憮綠蝶曖 檜辨縑 婦и\r\n晦獄瞳檣 餌о擊 敘薑ж朝 匙擊 跡瞳戲煎\r\nм棲棻.\r\n\r\n檜 擒婦擎 葬棲雖 �事靺攽�\r\n(http://www.lineage.co.kr)縑憮\r\n螞塭檣 戲煎 奢衛ж貊, м葬瞳檣 餌嶸陛\r\n嫦儅й 唳辦 滲唳腆 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 棻虜,\r\n檜辨堅偌曖 掏葬 傳朝 曖鼠縑 婦и 醞蹂и\r\n敘薑曖 滲唳擎 譆模и 7橾瞪縑 奢衛м棲棻.\r\n滲唳脹 擒婦擎 螞塭檣戲煎 奢衛蒂 и ��\r\n7橾檜 唳婁и 陳睡攪 �蕙臍� 嫦儅м棲棻.\r\n\r\n薯1褻 [辨橫曖 薑曖]\r\n1. 葬棲雖 啪歜 憮綠蝶(檜ж '憮綠蝶') :\r\n�蜓蝧□� ⑷營 檣攪喘婁 PC啪歜寞, PC鱔褐擊\r\n鱔ж罹 瞪撮啗縑 憮綠蝶ж堅 氈朝 檣攪喘\r\n晦奩 MPOG(Multi-Player Online Game)擊\r\n曖嘐м棲棻.\r\n2. 葬棲雖 啪歜 檜辨濠(檜ж '檜辨堅偌') :\r\n�蜓蝧� 葬棲雖 憮綠蝶 陛殮擊 褐羶ж堅\r\n餌辨濠啗薑擊 蛔煙ж罹 檣攪喘婁 啪歜寞,\r\nPC鱔褐 蛔擊 鱔ж罹 葬棲雖 啪歜 憮綠蝶蒂\r\n檜辨ж朝 賅萇 檜辨濠蒂 曖嘐м棲棻.\r\n3. 葬棲雖 餌辨濠啗薑(檜ж '餌辨濠啗薑') :\r\n�蜓蝧□� 薯奢ж朝 憮綠蝶曖 檜辨擊 嬪ж罹\r\n檜辨堅偌曖 憮綠蝶 檜辨ID蒂 んли 橾奩\r\n薑爾, 啪歜 薑爾 蛔擊 婦葬й 熱 氈朝 偃檣\r\n啗薑擊 曖嘐м棲棻.\r\n4. 憮綠蝶 檜辨 ID(檜ж '檜辨濠 ID') :\r\n檜辨 堅偌曖 衝滌婁 檜辨堅偌曖 憮綠蝶\r\n檜辨擊 嬪ж罹 檜辨堅偌檜 摹薑ж堅 �蜓蝪�\r\n睡罹ж朝 艙僥濠 塽 璋濠曖 褻м擊 蜓м棲棻.\r\n5. 葬棲雖 薑擋餌辨濠(檜ж '薑擋餌辨濠') :\r\n檜辨堅偌 醞 葬棲雖 �事靺攽鶹□� 薑擋餌辨\r\n蛔煙擊 и �� 錯 薑擋 餌辨猿 陶睡陛 �挫庰�\r\n餌辨濠蒂 曖嘐м棲棻.\r\n6. 葬棲雖 IP 憮綠蝶(檜ж 'IP憮綠蝶') :\r\n檜辨堅偌檜 葬棲雖 薑擋 餌辨