\n<br>\r\n寰喟ж褊棲梱, <var src=\"#0\">椒. 盪�� '�盛敯�'欽曖 辨煽菟擎 樹薯塭紫 瞪溘擊 棻п 諄選 熱 氈啪 遽綠腎橫 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">寡纂嫡擎 辨煽擊 蹂掘и棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傭兵隊長庫爾巴特:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n不好意思，你要求的傭兵還沒有募集完畢。\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Colbert:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sorry Sir. Mercenaries hired by Chamberlain have not arrived yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Colbert:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sorry Sir. Mercenaries hired by Chamberlain have not arrived yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辨煽渠濰 屬幗お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n賸歎м棲棻. 嬴霜 衛謙濰椒眷憮 曖煆ж褐 辨煽菟檜 紫雜ж韓 彊懊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傭兵隊長庫爾巴特:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n現在人力不足，無法配給你所要求的人數。需要再僱用更多的人才行。\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Colbert:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nI don't have enough mercenaries. You should hire more people.\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Colbert:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nI don't have enough mercenaries. You should hire more people.\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辨煽渠濰 屬幗お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n雖旎 該葩熱陛 褻旎 睡褶п憮 寡纂嫡戲褐 虜躑 煽溘擊 瓣錶萄萵 熱陛 橈啊朝等蹂.  餌塋擊 渦 鉻嬴撿 ж啊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left> 傭兵隊長庫爾巴特:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n喂！我只聽命於領主。若你要跟我挑戰，再去練一練再來吧！<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Colbert:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nLook! I only take orders from my Lord. Why don't you train more? Because you don't want to mess with me.<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Colbert:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nLook! I only take orders from my Lord. Why don't you train more? Because you don't want to mess with me.<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","colbert4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辨煽渠濰 屬幗お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n檜 瑭! 陪 螃霜 ж釭閨檣 辦葬 捱輿椒曖 貲滄虜 菔朝棻. 釭縑啪 ъが 熱濛 勘晦 瞪縑 濠啻 輿詳檜釭 欽溼衛酈朝 啪 橫陽?<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","cold1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=91FEFF><p align=left>商人：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>商店內有許多補給品提供給勇者們</p>\r\n<p>可以在此補充須多需要冒險的道具</p>\r\n<p>貨品售出概不退換，請自行注意!</p>\r\n<p>再次感謝您的支持!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","colticket-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賽場門票管理者:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎光臨。需要我的幫忙嗎？</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"colticket2\">詢問關於觀看比賽</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","colticket-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>癱晦濰 婦塋ル 婦葬檣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃撮蹂. 鼠歙擊 紫諦萄萵梱蹂?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"colticket2\">癱晦濰 婦塋縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a><br>\r\n</body>","colticket2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賽場門票管理者:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>若使用競賽場觀看票，會變成觀看模式，因此可以觀看整個賽場。好像戰鬥就在眼前展現一般。若要出去賽場，跟賽場的警衛說一聲就可以了。</p>\r\n<p>您要特別注意！！看不見身體的時候，您的寵物會變成沒有主人的狀態，所以請注意一下。最近在這裡常發生遺失寵物的事件，我也好煩。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","colticket2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>癱晦濰 婦塋ル 婦葬檣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>癱晦濰 婦塋ル蒂 餌辨ж賊 爾檜雖 彊朝 換檜 腎橫 癱晦濰 寰擊 霜蕾 給嬴棻棲貊 婦塋й 熱 氈棻螃. 葆纂 換 擅縑憮 瞪癱蒂 獐 熱 氈朝 蛭и 雜陝擊 替郭啪 腎雖. 棻衛 緒螳釭螢溥賊 唳晦濰 寰曖 唳綠煽縑啪 睡饕ж賊 腎螃.</p>\r\n<p>欽 渡褐檜 爾檜雖 彊朝 換檜 腎橫 氈朝 翕寰 渡褐曖 擁諫 翕僭擎 輿檣橈朝 鼻鷓陛 腎橫幗葬棲 輿曖ж衛望 夥塭螃. 碟貲�� 釭朝 唳堅ц模檜棻. 錶釩 斜楛 餌堅陛 號檜 橾橫釭棲 釭紫 雖啜模.</p>\r\n</body>","cray1-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>卡瑞：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>我是為對付邪惡之龍，而追蹤到這裡來。冒著生命的危險與邪惡之龍對抗，雖然我的身體埋在\"安塔瑞斯\"的黑暗之處，但我的靈魂依附在屠龍劍上。我正在等待能繼承我的意志之英雄。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>若你擁有能擊敗邪惡之龍“安塔瑞斯”的意志與力量，就接受<a link=\"cray10\">我的試練</a>。通過試練證明你是真正英雄，我會給你對付龍的獨一無二之<font fg=ffffff>屠龍劍</font>。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"craytrial\">‘接受卡瑞之試練’</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I, the One who came to this gloomy darkness, following 'Antharas' the earth dragon; the One who fought against the fathomless horror at the risk of my life; the One whose body is engulfed by the dark breath of 'Antharas' but whose soul is bound in the sword; I am waiting for the true hero who will follow my will.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you have the courage to face the evil earth dragon 'Antharas', accept my challenge. If you can prove that you are a true hero, I'll give you <a link=\"cray10\">Dragon Slayer</a>, the one and only sword that can face the Dragon.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"craytrial\">Accept the Cray's Ordeal</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I, the One who came to this gloomy darkness, following 'Antharas' the earth dragon; the One who fought against the fathomless horror at the risk of my life; the One whose body is engulfed by the dark breath of 'Antharas' but whose soul is bound in the sword; I am waiting for the true hero who will follow my will.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you have the courage to face the evil earth dragon 'Antharas', accept my challenge. If you can prove that you are a true hero, I'll give you <a link=\"cray10\">Dragon Slayer</a>, the one and only sword that can face the Dragon.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"craytrial\">Accept the Cray's Ordeal</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>觼溯檜:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>釭朝 雖瑟 寰顫塭蝶蒂 覲嬴 檜夠 藻�磍� 橫菸梱雖 螞 濠, 鼠и曖 奢ん縑 貲蕨諦 儅貲擊 勘堅 蜃賦 諄遴 濠, 綠煙 幫羹朝 寰顫塭蝶曖 匐擎 獗唸縑 僖⑼雖虜 釭曖 艙�母� 鬼霜и 匐縑 樓夢腎橫 釭曖 嗆擊 檜擊 艙錠擊 晦棻葬堅 氈棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜渠陛 虜擒 釭曖 嗆擊 檜橫 盪 餌學и 雖瑟 寰顫塭蝶蒂 噙楝嗑萵 曖雖蒂 陛雖堅 氈棻賊 <a link=\"cray10\">釭曖 衛溼</a>擊 嫡嬴菟罹塭. 斜渠陛 衛溼擊 鱔п 霞褒и 艙錠歜擊 隸貲и棻賊 釭朝 斜渠縑啪 辨婁 蜃撲 熱 氈朝 嶸橾鼠檜и 匐 <font fg=ffffff>萄楚堆 蝸溯檜橫</font>蒂 輿紫煙 ж啊棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"craytrial\">'觼溯檜曖 衛溼'擊 嫡朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","cray10-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>卡瑞：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>為了通過試練，你將會移動到已準備好的房間。在那房間裡怪物會不斷的出來攻擊你，將把你逼到絕望的邊緣。為了證明你的勇氣和力量，<font fg=ffffff>你得與許多怪物戰鬥</font>到最後才行。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>但真正的英雄該戰鬥的時候戰鬥，該讓步的時候讓步，這才是能戰勝一切的智慧。在無力支撐時，踩在房間的最中間的<font fg=ffffff>白色的魔法陣</font>你會回到這裡來，我將對你的才華做出評論。記住！不要為當英雄，而選擇死亡。死亡只有帶來空虛而已...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray10-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now you will be moved to the special room which has been prepared for this ordeal. In this room, countless traps and endless monsters' ghosts will try to lead you into despair. These ghosts are the challenge against which you must prove your strength and courage.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>A true hero should have the wisdom to withdraw along with the courage to face their enemies. If you step on the white magic circle in the center of the room, you will return here - and be judged. Remember! Do not choose a death of reckless courage, for death returns everything into the void...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray10-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now you will be moved to the special room which has been prepared for this ordeal. In this room, countless traps and endless monsters' ghosts will try to lead you into despair. These ghosts are the challenge against which you must prove your strength and courage.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>A true hero should have the wisdom to withdraw along with the courage to face their enemies. If you step on the white magic circle in the center of the room, you will return here - and be judged. Remember! Do not choose a death of reckless courage, for death returns everything into the void...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>觼溯檜:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>斜渠朝 檜 衛溼擊 嬪п か滌�� 遽綠脹 寞戲煎 檜翕ж啪 腆 匙檜棻. 斜 寞縑朝 乾陛雖 л薑婁 部紫 橈檜 踏嬴雖朝 跨蝶攪曖 �紊耋� 斜渠蒂 瞰蜂 樓戲煎 檜莊 匙檜棻. 斜渠朝 部橈檜 檜橫憮 釭螃朝 <font fg=ffffff>跨蝶攪曖 �紊粥� 蜃賦 諄錶</font> 斜渠曖 辨晦諦 ��擊 隸貲п撿虜 и棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜楝釭 霞薑и 艙錠擎 瞳婁 蜃憮 諄辦朝 辨晦諦 л眷 僭楝撲 陽 僭楝撲 還 嬴朝 雖�� 羲衛 陛螳撿虜 ж朝 徹, 寞曖 и 陛遴等縑 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>ж擔 葆徹霞</font>擊 嫖戲賊 斜渠朝 檜 夠戲煎 腎給嬴諦憮 斜渠曖 濠韓擊 ゎ陛嫡啪 腆 匙檜棻. 貲褕ж塭! 瞰渠 鼠賅и 辨晦煎 避擠擊 摹鷗ж雖 蜓塭. 避擠擎 賅萇 勘 ъ鼠煎 腎給萵 閨檜棲..</p>\r\n</body>","cray11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>卡瑞:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>啊，你已證明了你是勇者之中的最強戰士，你是否已用屠龍劍來斬斷了我的怨恨之源？！是否在劍身上沾滿了“安塔瑞斯”的血？！在擊敗最強的怪物之後，是否確認你自己就是這把劍的主人了？！</p>\r\n<p>請你告訴我！！！地上的最強者。<p>\r\n</body>","cray11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>Ah! One who has proved to be the mightiest warrior! Answer me - did you kill my nemesis with my sword, 'Dragon Slayer'? Did you spill the blood of Antharas with the Sword that supports the sky and cuts the ground?! Did you prove yourself as the owner of that sword after killing the most vicious monster!?!</p>\r\n<p>Please answer me, oh one who may be the strongest human on earth!<p>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>Ah! One who has proved to be the mightiest warrior! Answer me - did you kill my nemesis with my sword, 'Dragon Slayer'? Did you spill the blood of Antharas with the Sword that supports the sky and cuts the ground?! Did you prove yourself as the owner of that sword after killing the most vicious monster!?!</p>\r\n<p>Please answer me, oh one who may be the strongest human on earth!<p>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>觼溯檜:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>螃螃 譆鬼曖 辨餌歜擊 隸貲и 譆堅曖 晦餌罹! 渠港п 輿啪. 斜渠朝 頂陛 ж餌и 萄楚堆 蝸楚檜橫煎 釭曖 錳и擊 漆歷朝陛! ж棺擊 集嫡纂堅 階擊 陛腦朝 斜 匐褐縑 寰顫塭蝶曖 Я蒂 僖⑼朝陛! 斜渠朝 譆鬼曖 葆僭擊 鼠鎬腦堅 斜 匐曖 輿檣歜擊 蝶蝶煎 �挫恉葧簞�!</p>\r\n<p>渠港п 爾啪! 階 嬪縑 陛濰 鬼и 檣除檜罹.<p>\r\n</body>","cray2-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>卡瑞：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>我是為對付邪惡之龍，而追蹤到這裡來。冒著生命的危險與邪惡之龍對抗，雖然我的身體埋在“安塔瑞斯”的黑暗之處，但我的靈魂依附在屠龍劍上。我正在等待能繼承我的意志之英雄。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你就是我所等待的英雄嗎？若你就是，你得通過我所給你的試練。若你願意接受試練，首先<a link=\"cray3\">證明</a>給我看，你是否適合當英雄。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I, the One who came to this gloomy darkness, following 'Antharas' the earth dragon; I, the One who fought against the fathomless horror at the risk of my life; I, the One whose body is engulfed by the dark breath of 'Antharas' but whose soul is bound in a sword; I await the true hero who will follow my will.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you the hero I was waiting for? Then you must pass my ordeal. But if you want to face this ordeal, you must first prove that you are suitable.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I, the One who came to this gloomy darkness, following 'Antharas' the earth dragon; I, the One who fought against the fathomless horror at the risk of my life; I, the One whose body is engulfed by the dark breath of 'Antharas' but whose soul is bound in a sword; I await the true hero who will follow my will.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you the hero I was waiting for? Then you must pass my ordeal. But if you want to face this ordeal, you must first prove that you are suitable.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>觼溯檜:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>釭朝 雖瑟 寰顫塭蝶蒂 覲嬴 檜夠 藻�磍� 橫菸梱雖 螞 濠, 鼠и曖 奢ん縑 貲蕨諦 儅貲擊 勘堅 蜃賦 諄遴 濠, 綠煙 幫羹朝 寰顫塭蝶曖 匐擎 獗唸縑 僖⑼雖虜 釭曖 艙�母� 鬼霜и 匐縑 樓夢腎橫 釭曖 嗆擊 檜擊 艙錠擊 晦棻葬堅 氈棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜渠陛 頂陛 晦棻葬朝 艙錠檣陛? 斜溢棻賊 頂陛 輿朝 衛溼擊 鱔婁ж塭. 虜擒 頂陛 睡罹ж朝 衛溼擊 嫡晦蒂 錳и棻賊 試盪 斜縑 м渡и 濠檣雖 釭縑啪 <a link=\"cray3\">隸貲</a>擊 п撿虜 и棻.</p>\r\n</body>","cray3-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>卡瑞：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>你要證明是否是適合接受試練的人，你需要帶來<font fg=ffffff>飛龍的爪、蜥蜴的角、水晶球、妖魔戰士護身符</font>各一個。和對付龍的困難相比，這應該不算甚麼困難吧...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to prove that you are suitable for the ordeal, you must bring to me <font fg=ffffff>a 'drake craw', a 'basilist horn', a 'crystal ball of the necromancer', and an 'amulet of orc warriors'</font>. If you would challenge the Dragon, I don't think these paltry foes will prove to be a problem.\r\n</body>\r\n","cray3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to prove that you are suitable for the ordeal, you must bring to me <font fg=ffffff>a 'drake craw', a 'basilist horn', a 'crystal ball of the necromancer', and an 'amulet of orc warriors'</font>. If you would challenge the Dragon, I don't think these paltry foes will prove to be a problem.\r\n</body>\r\n","cray3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>觼溯檜:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>斜渠陛 衛溼擊 嫡晦縑 瞳ми 濠檣雖蒂 隸貲ж溥賊 辨餌曖 啻 陛雖 隸ル檣 <font fg=ffffff>萄溯檜觼曖 嫦體, 夥褒葬蝶觼曖 閩, 啻觼煎裔憮曖 熱薑掘, 螃觼 癱餌曖 跡勘檜</font>蒂 陝陝 ж釭噶 陛螳螃塭. 辨擊 鼻渠ж溥朝 濠縑啪 斜 薑紫朝 滌 僥薯紫 腎雖 彊啊雖..</p>\r\n</body>","cray4-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>卡瑞之聲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>你的能力還不足以對付龍。不知你有多幸運才來能到這裡，如果你不想送命在邪惡之龍“安塔瑞斯”爪下，立即離開此地。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">光榮之堂</a> \r\n</body>\r\n","cray4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray's voice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are too immature to face the Dragon. Perhaps you were lucky enough to survive this far, but it will take far more than luck to face the evil dragon 'Antharas' - you'd better leave this place while you can. </p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Cray's Recording</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray's voice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are too immature to face the Dragon. Perhaps you were lucky enough to survive this far, but it will take far more than luck to face the evil dragon 'Antharas' - you'd better leave this place while you can. </p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Cray's Recording</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>觼溯檜曖 跡模葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>斜渠朝 嬴霜 辨擊 鼻渠ж晦縑朝 棟溘檜 睡褶ж棻. 橫飩啪 遴檜 謠嬴 檜 夠梱雖 諮擊雖朝 路塭紫 餌學и 辨 寰顫塭蝶曖 獗唸縑 跡獗擊 檠堅 談雖 彊棻賊 橫憮 檜夠擊 慇橫釭朝 ら檜 謠擊 匙檜棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">貲蕨曖 瞪渡</a> \r\n</body>","cray5-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>卡瑞之聲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>我肯定你就是能對付邪惡之龍的真正英雄。以我灰騎士卡瑞之名，給你龍騎士之稱號和能對付龍的獨一無二之劍“屠龍劍”。只希望以此忠實之劍，擊毀邪惡之龍“安塔瑞斯”...</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">光榮之堂</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray's voice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You must be the true hero, the one who can defeat Antharas - if armed with the proper weapon. I'll give you the title of Dragon Knight, and put in your hands the mighty power of 'Dragon Slayer' - the one and only Sword of Faith. I can but pray that you, armed with Dragon Slayer, can defeat the evil 'Antharas'...for if not, we have no hope at all.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Cray's Recording</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray's voice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You must be the true hero, the one who can defeat Antharas - if armed with the proper weapon. I'll give you the title of Dragon Knight, and put in your hands the mighty power of 'Dragon Slayer' - the one and only Sword of Faith. I can but pray that you, armed with Dragon Slayer, can defeat the evil 'Antharas'...for if not, we have no hope at all.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Cray's Recording</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>觼溯檜曖 跡模葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>斜渠撿 蜓煎 醱霜и 匐戲煎 盪 餌學и 辨擊 鼠鎬蒂 霞薑и 艙錠歜縑 ぎ葡橈棻. 斜渠縑啪 釭 �蜓鶺� 晦餌 觼溯檜曖 檜葷戲煎 辨晦餌曖 蘆�ˋ� 辨擊 鼻渠й 熱 氈朝 嶸橾鼠檜曖 瞰渠 �� '萄楚堆 蝸溯檜橫'蒂 頂葬紫煙 ж啊棻. 睡蛤 醱霜и 匐戲煎 橫菸擊 陞塭 盪 餌學и '寰顫塭蝶'蒂 鼠鎚楝 輿望..</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">貲蕨曖 瞪渡</a>\r\n</body>","cray6-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<P>'卡瑞的試練'歷代順位</p>\r\n<br>\r\n第1名 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n第2名 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n第3名 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n第4名 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#3\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n第5名 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#4\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n第6名 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#5\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n第7名 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n第8名 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#7\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n第9名 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#8\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n第10名 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#9\"></font>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray6-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Cray's ordeal previous ranking</p>\r\n<br>\r\n1st -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n2nd -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n3rd -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n4th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#3\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n5th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#4\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n6th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#5\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n7th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n8th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#7\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n9th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#8\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n10th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#9\"></font>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray6-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Cray's ordeal previous ranking</p>\r\n<br>\r\n1st -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n2nd -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n3rd -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n4th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#3\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n5th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#4\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n6th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#5\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n7th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n8th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#7\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n9th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#8\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n10th -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#9\"></font>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray6-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<P>'觼溯檜曖 衛溼' 羲渠 牖嬪</p>\r\n<br>\r\n1嬪 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n2嬪 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n3嬪 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n4嬪 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#3\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n5嬪 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#4\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n6嬪 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#5\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n7嬪 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n8嬪 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#7\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n9嬪 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#8\"></font>\r\n<br>\r\n10嬪 -<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#9\"></font>\r\n</body>","cray7-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>卡瑞之聲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>若你滿足現在平凡騎士之身分，以現在的你的能力就夠了。但若你要擊敗龍，取得英雄之榮光，你的實力就不夠了。飛龍根本無法與龍比較，龍像個魔鬼一般的強。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我給你<font fg=ffffff>武士刀</font>你回家去吧。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">光榮之堂</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray's Voice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you are satisified to be merely a normal knight, your strength is...sufficient. But if you want to kill the dragon and become a true hero, you are far from your goal. The drake you barely defeated is nothing - NOTHING compared to the Dragon.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'll give you this <font fg=ffffff>Katana</fg> as a reward - but I suggest you turn around now.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Cray's Recording</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray's Voice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you are satisified to be merely a normal knight, your strength is...sufficient. But if you want to kill the dragon and become a true hero, you are far from your goal. The drake you barely defeated is nothing - NOTHING compared to the Dragon.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'll give you this <font fg=ffffff>Katana</fg> as a reward - but I suggest you turn around now.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Cray's Recording</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>觼溯檜曖 跡模葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>斜渠陛 虜擒 ゎ彰и 晦餌煎 虜褶и棻賊 雖旎曖 褒溘戲煎紫 醱碟ж棻. ж雖虜 釭曖 嗆擊 檜橫 辨擊 噙楝嗑葬堅 艙錠戲煎憮曖 艙惜擊 橢晦縑朝 曬橈朝 褒溘檜啻. 辨擎 濠啻陛 ��菟啪 噙楝嗑萼 萄溯檜觼 評嬪諦朝 綠掖紫 й 熱 橈朝 葆僭橾撮.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜渠縑啪 模模и 爾鼻戲煎 <font fg=ffffff>橾獄紫</font>蒂 還攪檜棲 斜虜 給嬴陛啪釭.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">貲蕨曖 瞪渡</a>\r\n</body>","cray8-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>卡瑞之聲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>你擁有充分的英雄之才，只不過自己感覺不到。現在對你最重要的是將在你腦海裡潛藏的勇敢之心表現出來。</p> \r\n<br>\r\n<p>為表彰你的貢獻，送給你<font fg=ffffff>雙手劍</font>。下次挑戰試練時，祝你得到英雄之名。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">光榮之堂</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray's voice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have...potential, I see. What you need right now is the confidence to manifest your true strength.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As a reward, I'll give you this<font fg=ffffff>two-handed sword</font>. I pray that it will serve you well the next time you challenge the ordeal.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Cray's Recording</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray's voice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have...potential, I see. What you need right now is the confidence to manifest your true strength.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As a reward, I'll give you this<font fg=ffffff>two-handed sword</font>. I pray that it will serve you well the next time you challenge the ordeal.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Cray's Recording</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>觼溯檜曖 跡模葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>斜渠朝 醱碟�� 艙錠曖 濠韓檜 氈棻. 棻虜 蝶蝶煎 斜匙擊 梟殘雖 跤ж堅 氈擊 閨.. 雖旎 斜渠縑啪 в蹂и 匙擎 濠褐曖 獄楚 ��擊 氈朝 斜渠煎 萄楝頂晦 嬪и 濠褐馬檜塭啻.</p> \r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜渠曖 喻堅蒂 纂ж朝 嗆縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>曄槳匐</font>擊 ж餌ж啊啻. 棻擠縑 衛溼縑 紫瞪й 陽 睡蛤 斜渠縑啪 艙錠曖 艙惜檜 氈晦蒂..</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">貲蕨曖 瞪渡</a>\r\n</body>","cray9-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>卡瑞之聲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>真了不起。你得到英雄之榮光是應得的。但獨一無二之“屠龍劍”是最強的英雄才能夠擁有，很可惜無法給你。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>不過為表達你的光榮之心，我給你<font fg=ffffff>大馬士革刀</font>。我希望由此刀輝煌燦爛你的名聲。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">光榮之堂</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray's voice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>Ah, wonderful! You truly deserve the title, 'Hero'. But the one and only Sword of Faith, 'Dragon Slayer' is only for the one with the mightiest strength - perhaps you may yet earn it, after gaining in might.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>For now, I'll give you this <font fg=ffffff>Damascus Sword</font> to reward your valor - it will serve for you to make your name known throughout the land.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Cray's Recording</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Cray's voice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>Ah, wonderful! You truly deserve the title, 'Hero'. But the one and only Sword of Faith, 'Dragon Slayer' is only for the one with the mightiest strength - perhaps you may yet earn it, after gaining in might.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>For now, I'll give you this <font fg=ffffff>Damascus Sword</font> to reward your valor - it will serve for you to make your name known throughout the land.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Cray's Recording</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","cray9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>觼溯檜曖 跡模葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>螃螃 �К〥炡�. 斜渠朝 艙錠曖 貲蕨擊 橢晦縑 褻旎紫 睡褶ж晦 彊啻. ж雖虜 辨擊 噙楝嗑萵 嶸橾鼠檜и 匐, 萄溯堆 蝸溯檜橫朝 螃霜 譆鬼曖 ��擊 陛霞 и餌塋曖 艙遺虜檜 噩 熱 氈朝 匐. 斜渠縑啪朝 還 熱 橈朝 匙檜 寰顫梱選 閨檜棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渠褐 斜渠曖 貲蕨蒂 纂жж朝 嗆縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>棻葆蝶醴蝶 匐</font>擊 輿紫煙 ж啊啻. 檜匙戲煎 睡蛤 斜渠曖 檜葷擊 維頂晦 夥塭啻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">貲蕨曖 瞪渡</a>\r\n</body>","craytomb1-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>老舊的石碑：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>正注視著此文章的人是否是我正在等待的英雄？是能繼承我的怨恨和意志，對抗安塔瑞斯的勇者嗎？</p> \r\n<p>若你是的話，在<font fg=ffffff>日落</font>之時，帶著四項證明-<font fg=ffffff>飛龍的爪、蜥蜴的角、水晶球、妖魔戰士護身符</font>來這裡。然後你得接受屠龍劍付與的試練。</p>\r\n<p>在此石碑下，刻著真正英雄之名。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">光榮之堂</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","craytomb1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Old tombstone:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>Is the one who is reading this the hero I was waiting for? Are you the one with the true courage to defeat the evil earth dragon \"Antharas\", succeeding by will and hatred?</p>\r\n<p>If you have the courage to answer the challenge, bring <font fg=ffffff>'drake craw', 'basilist horn', 'crystal ball of necromancer', and 'amulet of orc warrior'</font> here as the day turns into the night - and then overcome the ordeal that will be bestowed upon you by Cray - the Dragon Slayer.\r\n<p>The names of those heroes who have overcome my ordeal have been engraved herein.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Hall of fame</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","craytomb1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Old tombstone:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>Is the one who is reading this the hero I was waiting for? Are you the one with the true courage to defeat the evil earth dragon \"Antharas\", succeeding by will and hatred?</p>\r\n<p>If you have the courage to answer the challenge, bring <font fg=ffffff>'drake craw', 'basilist horn', 'crystal ball of necromancer', and 'amulet of orc warrior'</font> here as the day turns into the night - and then overcome the ordeal that will be bestowed upon you by Cray - the Dragon Slayer.\r\n<p>The names of those heroes who have overcome my ordeal have been engraved herein.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">Hall of fame</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","craytomb1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陸擎 綠戮:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>檜 旋擊 檗朝 斜渠朝 頂陛 晦棻葬朝 艙錠檣陛? 釭曖 錳и婁 曖雖蒂 檜橫 盪 餌學и 雖瑟 寰顫塭蝶蒂 鼠鎬蒂 霞薑 辨晦氈朝 濠檣陛?</p> \r\n<p>斜渠陛 檜 韓僥縑 '斜溢模'塭堅 渠港й 熱 氈朝 辨晦氈朝 濠塭賊 <font fg=ffffff>雪檜 嫘戲煎 夥船朝 橾路</font>曖 衛除縑 辨餌曖 4陛雖 隸ル <font fg=ffffff>萄溯檜觼曖 嫦體, 夥褒葬蝶觼曖 閩, 啻觼煎裔憮曖 熱薑掘, 螃觼 癱餌曖 跡勘檜</font>蒂 陛雖堅 檜 夠戲煎 螃塭. 斜葬堅 釭 萄楚堆 蝸溯檜橫 觼溯檜陛 睡罹ж朝 衛溼擊 嗨橫剩橫塭.</p>\r\n<p>檜 綠戮 嬴楚縑 釭曖 衛溼擊 嗨橫剩擎 霞薑и 艙錠菟曖 檜葷擊 晦雌 葆擠戲煎 億啖厥歷棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"crayscore\">貲蕨曖 瞪渡</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","credits-c.tbl":"61\r\nLineage\r\n\r\n\r\n執行製作\r\n                      Taekjin Kim\r\n\r\n導演\r\n                        Jake Song\r\n\r\n美術指導\r\n                       Minsoo Kim\r\n\r\n程式設計\r\n                        Jake Song\r\n                     Sungjae Park\r\n                      Jaehyun Bae\r\n                      HeeSang Lee