            Minsoo Kim\r\n                      Younho Chae\r\n                     Jaeyoung Seo\r\n                     Jongsook Kim\r\n                     Soonhwa Jung\r\n                       Kwangro Yi\r\n                      Water Hwang\r\n                     Hanwoong Lee\r\n                    Sangyong Song\r\n                         J. Dolly\r\n                      Sungjae Lee\r\n                       Taeman Lim\r\n                    Nak-woo Chung\r\n                      So-Yeon Lee\r\n                   Chul-Joong Kim\r\n                  Young-Joon Park\r\n                     Sook-Hi Park\r\n                      Seon-Ju Yoo\r\n                      Sun-Han Kim\r\n                     Ji-Heun Kang\r\n                       Eun-Hwa Yu\r\n                      Hyun-Ju Kim\r\n                      Ki-Bum Hahm\r\n\r\nDesign\r\n                     Hyungjin Kim\r\n                   Youngtaek Shin\r\n                             Harn\r\n\r\nSound\r\n                    Yoonseob Yeom\r\n\t\t      Leewha Choi\r\n\r\nMusic\r\n                    Youngchan Kim\r\n\r\nOriginal Comics\r\n                      Ilsook Shin\r\n\r\nSpecial Thanks To\r\n                        Jinho Hur\r\n","credits-k.tbl":"61\r\n葬棲雖\r\n\r\n\r\n薯濛\r\n                           梯鷗霞\r\n\r\n馬絮\r\n                           歎營唳\r\n\r\n嘐獎 馬絮\r\n                           梯團熱\r\n\r\nЩ煎斜極\r\n                           歎營唳\r\n                           夢撩營\r\n                           寡營⑷\r\n                           檜�鬈�\r\n                           薑璽賅\r\n                           堅翕橾\r\n                           夢辨⑷\r\n                           梯薑餵\r\n                           ⑷貲遵\r\n                           憮璽寡\r\n                           槳辨陴\r\n\r\n斜楚а\r\n                           梯團熱\r\n                           瓣彌��\r\n                           憮營艙\r\n                           梯謙熨\r\n                           薑牖��\r\n                           檜惜煎\r\n                           �盛埳�\r\n                           檜и錠\r\n                           歎鼻辨\r\n                           褻檣⑽\r\n                           檜撩營\r\n                           歜鷓虜\r\n                           薑釩辦\r\n                           檜模翱\r\n                           梯繹醞\r\n                           夢艙遽\r\n                           夢熨��\r\n                           嶸摹輿\r\n                           梯摹и\r\n                           鬼雖��\r\n                           嶸擎��\r\n                           梯⑷輿\r\n                           л晦彰\r\n\t\t\t   \r\n啪歜 蛤濠檣\r\n                           梯⑽霞\r\n                           褐艙鷗\r\n                           梯釩⑽\r\n\r\n擠щ �膩�\r\n                           膩彌撥\r\n                           譆檜��\r\n\r\n寡唳 擠學\r\n                           梯艙雙\r\n\r\n錳濛\r\n                           褐橾熨\r\n\r\n紫諦輿褐 碟菟\r\n                           ъ霞��\r\n","daisy1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>黛西 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n我最討厭沒有勇氣的男生。若真心愛一個人，勇氣會自然的產生。若沒有勇氣告白，表示並不是真的愛她。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","daisy1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>等檜雖 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n薯陛 陛濰 褓橫ж朝 顫殮擎 辨晦陛 橈朝 陴濠縑蹂. 援捱陛蒂 薑蜓 翮溺�� 餌嫌и棻賊 辨晦塢 盪瞰煎 儅啖釭朝 匙 嬴棋陛蹂? 堅寥й 辨晦陛 橈棻朝 匙擎 滌煎 斜 餌塋擊 餌嫌ж堅 氈雖 彊棻朝 匙檜啊轄.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","damon1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>戴蒙 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n你是否想過當領導者？若想當個領導者，有時為了成員需要犧牲自己，保護弱者，表現公正的態度。最近我遇見的人之中沒有具備以上條件的人。碰到的人都是偷別人的東西啦，欺負弱者，為了守住自己的財產做卑鄙的行動。唉…究竟具備真正君主素質的人在哪裡才可以找得到呢？\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","damon1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>等檜試 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n濠啻 葬渦曖 濠韓縑 渠п 儅陝п 獄 瞳 氈釭? 賅葷雖晦 и ⑸裊擊 檜莖朝 捱輿塭賊 棻艇餌塋擊 嬪п �鬈�擊 й 還紫 憲堅, 擒и 檜蒂 爾��и棻湍雖, 奢貲薑渠и ч翕擊 и棻湍雖 п撿ж朝 剪 嬴棋陛? 蹂闈 頂陛 虜釭獄 餌塋菟 醞縑朝 剪曖 斜楛 餌塋檜 橈歷湍 匙 偽嬴. 陴曖 僭勒擊 �卍躁� 殖嬴陪棻湍雖, ぬ剪葬蒂 虜菟橫憮 擒и餌塋菟擊 д夢и棻湍雖, 綠翮и ч翕戲煎 濠褐曖 營骯擊 雖酈晦縑 晝晝ж棻湍雖 蜓檜撿. 嬴... 橫蛤 霞薑и 捱輿曖 賅蝗擊 爾罹輿朝 檜陛 橈擊梱?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","daniel1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>丹尼爾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎光臨...歡迎光臨。我是從象牙塔派過來的法師叫保羅。\r\n<p>為了針對魔法於公益之上的運用，我在此為您服務。 \r\n<p>你想要甚麼樣的服務？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">傳送到對岸</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","Daniel1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Wizard Daniel:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, traveller. I'm from the 'Ivory Tower' at Oren.\r\n<p>We're trying to utilize our research, which is mostly involved with the disassembly of people - which we'll do for free.\r\n<p>For a small fee, we'll even reassemble you in a different place! \r\n<p>Where would you like to be assembled?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">Teleport to the other side of the river</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","Daniel1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Wizard Daniel:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, traveller. I'm from the 'Ivory Tower' at Oren.\r\n<p>We're trying to utilize our research, which is mostly involved with the disassembly of people - which we'll do for free.\r\n<p>For a small fee, we'll even reassemble you in a different place! \r\n<p>Where would you like to be assembled?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">Teleport to the other side of the river</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","daniel1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>葆徹餌 棻棲縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃衛螃. 釭朝 螃溶曖 '鼻嬴鱉'縑憮 檜夠戲煎 だ唯釭螞 葆徹餌 棻棲縣殮棲棻.\r\n<p>螃溶曖 鼻嬴鱉擎 葆徹曖 奢櫛縑曖 �倏蹀� 嬪п 罹楝陛雖 憮綠蝶蒂 ж堅 氈雖蹂. \r\n<p>渡褐擎 橫雯 憮綠蝶蒂 錳ж褊棲梱?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">鬼 勒傘ら戲煎 蘿溯んおи棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","daria1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>戴芮雅 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n以前在這村莊最富有的人就是叫愛爾芬的人，自從賽狗場開業之後，他每天都去那裡賭博。結果將自己所有財產通通輸光之後就沒消息了。我也不知道他現在的近況如何？\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","daria1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>棻葬嬴 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n蕪陳 檜 葆擊 譆堅曖 睡濠陛 援掘艘朝 雖 嬴撮蹂? 夥煎 憲ア蝶塭朝 餌塋檣等, 偃 唳輿濰檜 儅曹 檜�� 剪晦縑 緒螳 陛骯擊 鰻霞ж堅朝 橫蛤煩陛 餌塭螳 幗溜渠蹂. 雖旎擎 鼠蝦 橾擊 ж堅 氈擊梱蹂?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","deker1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>戴克：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>您是第一次來我們村莊嗎？就如你所見到的，這裡是個淒涼的漁村，再加上這附近有海流的問題導致漁獲很差，所以為了能維持生計，我們同時耕種一些作物。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>不過...海依然是很美麗的地方，那一望無際的水平線和深遠的蔚藍，讓看到的人視野寬廣。啊！對了。你有看過<a link=\"deker2\">鯨魚</a>嗎？牠有著比妖精森林中的安特還要大的身體，牠偶爾會把身體浮在水面上噴水喔，而每當我看到那情景時，打從心底就湧出一股火熱的感覺。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","deker1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Deker:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Is this your first time here? As you can see, this is just a humble fishing town. Thanks to the current, there are actually not many fish to be found here, so we have taken up farming as well.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>But...I wish we could live solely from the sea. The unfathomable (so to speak) blue color has the power to overwhelm mere mortals. Have you ever seen a <a link=\"deker2\">whale</a>? It's a fish even bigger than the Ents in the elven forest! Seeing one of them surface and spraying water makes me shiver just to think of it...ahhh.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","deker1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Deker:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Is this your first time here? As you can see, this is just a humble fishing town. Thanks to the current, there are actually not many fish to be found here, so we have taken up farming as well.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>But...I wish we could live solely from the sea. The unfathomable (so to speak) blue color has the power to overwhelm mere mortals. Have you ever seen a <a link=\"deker2\">whale</a>? It's a fish even bigger than the Ents in the elven forest! Seeing one of them surface and spraying water makes me shiver just to think of it...ahhh.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","deker1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>等醴:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦葬 葆擊縛 籀擠 螃衛釭蹂? 爾衛棻衛Я 嬴鼠匙紫 橈朝 蟾塭и 橫襟檜轄. 啪棻陛 檜 斬籀朝 п盟 僥薯煎 濩�鰲� 堅晦菟紫 爾澀匙檜 橈橫憮 寧堯餌紫 售ж堅 氈橫蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜楚紫...夥棻朝 霤 詣霞 夠殮棲棻. 斜 創擎 熱ゎ摹婁 桶檜蒂 憲 熱 橈朝 ヰ艇 儀擎 爾朝 餌塋擊 憶紫ж轄. <a link=\"deker2\">堅楚</a>蒂 爾褐 橾檜 氈釭蹂? 蹂薑曖 膛縑 髦堅 氈棻朝 縛お菟爾棻紫 贖 跺餵擊 陛霞 僭堅晦殮棲棻. 斜喫檜 陛莠噶 僭 嬪梱雖 螢塭諦憮 僭擊 閣朝 賅蝗擊 獐 陽賊 陛蝙 樓檜 �觸� 殖嬴螃腦堆 и港棲棻.</p>\r\n</body>","deker2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>戴克：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我一直盼望著總有一天能抓到牠。 </p>\r\n<p>你說牠值多少錢？這我也不知道...因為我到現在都還沒聽說過有人抓過鯨魚。不過啊，這不是問題，我是漁夫，對我來說抓鯨魚就好像是跟大海協商談判一樣。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗯...也許這個想法對住在陸地上的人來說是無法理解的。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","deker2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Deker:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's my dream to catch one someday. </p>\r\n<p>Why? I don't know... I've never heard of anyone catching a whale before. But it's not an issue of why - I'm a fisherman, and catching a whale is like fighting against the master of an unknown world.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmm...It looks like that it's an alien concept to mud-stompers...er, land people like you. Go battle some goblins or frogs instead.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","deker2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Deker:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's my dream to catch one someday. </p>\r\n<p>Why? I don't know... I've never heard of anyone catching a whale before. But it's not an issue of why - I'm a fisherman, and catching a whale is like fighting against the master of an unknown world.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmm...It looks like that it's an alien concept to mud-stompers...er, land people like you. Go battle some goblins or frogs instead.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","deker2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>等醴:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>瞪 樹薇陛 и廓鎢 斜喫擊 濩嬴爾朝啪 翎殮棲棻. </p>\r\n<p>斜啪 絲檜 腎傍堅蹂? 斜剪撿 賅腦轄...嬴霜梱雖 堅楚蒂 濩嬴疑棻朝 餌塋 檜撿晦蒂 菟擎 瞳檜 橈戲棲梱蹂. ж雖虜, 絲檜 僥薯陛 嬴椎棲棻. 盪朝 橫睡堅, 堅楚蒂 濩朝 匙擎 夥棻塭朝 滌繭雖曖 輿檣婁 иっ 稱橫獄棻朝 檜撿晦塭堅蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...擠...羲衛 僩縑憮虜 餌朝 餌塋縑啪朝 檜п陛 澀 寰腎朝 賅曄檜捱蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","denis1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>丹尼斯：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哇！看你那把刀...你是騎士嗎？嗯？不是嗎？</p>\r\n<p>你好，我叫丹尼斯，今年11歲囉，再過不久啊，我就要拜託<a link=\"denis2\">傑瑞德</a>讓我參加騎士考試！</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","denis1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Denis:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Wow, what a shiny sword! Are you a knight? Yes? No?</p>\r\n<p>I'm Denis. I'm 11! I'm going to ask <a link=\"denis2\">Lord Gerard</a> for a test to be a real knight soon.\r\n</body>\r\n","denis1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Denis:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Wow, what a shiny sword! Are you a knight? Yes? No?</p>\r\n<p>I'm Denis. I'm 11! I'm going to ask <a link=\"denis2\">Lord Gerard</a> for a test to be a real knight soon.\r\n</body>\r\n","denis1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>等棲蝶:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>諦- 盪 蠔覬 瑭. 渡褐 晦餌檣陛蹂? 擬? 嬴棋陛?</p>\r\n<p>欽 等棲蝶撿. 11髦檜雖. 檜薯 埠 <a link=\"denis2\">啪塭萄</a>椒眷 睡饕擊 萄溥憮 晦餌 衛я擊 獐疏撿!</p>\r\n</body>","denis2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>丹尼斯：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>傑瑞德是世界上最強的騎士！之前我還看過他戰勝妖魔呢！像你這樣的人只要看到妖魔，就會把你嚇跑的？更不用說是傑瑞德。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","denis2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Denis:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Lord Gerard is the strongest knight in the world! I saw him defeating an Orc Fighter the other day! Probably people like you won't even a match for a mere orc!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","denis2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Denis:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Lord Gerard is the strongest knight in the world! I saw him defeating an Orc Fighter the other day! Probably people like you won't even a match for a mere orc!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","denis2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>等棲蝶:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>啪塭萄椒擎 檜 撮鼻縑憮 陛濰 趟 晦餌撿! 瞪縑 螃觼 瞪餌諦 諄錶憮 檜晦衛朝 匙紫 疑棻堅! 渡褐偽擎 餌塋擎 螃觼虜 瑭紫 鼠憮錶憮 笞鼠棲蒂 賑 痊?</p>\r\n</body>","derek1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>獵人戴芮克 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>若你要使用弓箭，就得訓練敏捷度。要獵取動作迅速的動物就不簡單。獵物的動作越快越需要冷靜。當然你的弓也好的話，就會省力不少。哈哈...你在覬覦我的弓，是嗎？\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","derek1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Derek the Hunter :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To use a Bow well your body must be agile. It's very hard to hit a fast moving target. You need the ability to follow and shoot the moving target to be affective. It helps of course if you have a powerful bow. Haha... You want the Bow I made?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","derek1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Derek the Hunter :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To use a Bow well your body must be agile. It's very hard to hit a fast moving target. You need the ability to follow and shoot the moving target to be affective. It helps of course if you have a powerful bow. Haha... You want the Bow I made?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","derek1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>餌傖羞 等滓 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>�偯� 澀 棻瑞溥賊 鼠歙爾棻紫 跺啾葡檜 團繪п撿雖. 緒腦啪 遺霜檜朝 跡ル僭擊 啖傖ж晦塢 罹除 橫溥遴 啪 嬴棲剪萇. 斜 遺霜歜擊 覲嬴陛賊憮 藹雜ж啪 �偯� 渡望 熱 氈朝 棟溘檜 в蹂ж棻啻. 僭煩 嬪溘瞳檣 �做� 乾堅 氈棻賊 旎鼻繩�俯�. жж... �公� 濠啻 頂陛 虜萇 �偯� 鬚釭朝 勒陛?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","derek2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>獵人戴芮克:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哼！我是不會跟邪惡的人交易的。\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","derek2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Derek the Hunter :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Look. I don't deal with your kind.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","derek2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Derek the Hunter :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Look. I don't deal with your kind.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","derek2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>餌傖羞 等滓 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜瑭. 陪 學檣婁朝 剪楚ж雖 彊嬴.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","desc-c.tbl":"1817\r\n長劍\r\n斧\r\n燈\r\n雙手劍\r\n金幣\r\n警衛\r\n漂浮之眼\r\n骷骨\r\n史萊姆\r\n揮舞\r\n打開\r\n無油\r\n精靈匕首\r\n歐西斯匕首\r\n亞連\r\n小刀\r\n武士刀\r\n日本劍\r\n狼人\r\n長者\r\n釘錘\r\n門\r\n屍體\r\n肉\r\n弓\r\n矛\r\n治癒藥水\r\n楓木