es\r\nwhite dragon scales\r\norange dragon scales\r\nblack dragon scales\r\nblue dragon scales\r\ngreen dragon scales\r\nyellow dragon scales\r\nplate mail\r\ncrystal plate mail\r\nbronze plate mail\r\nsplint mail\r\nbanded mail\r\ndwarvish mithril-coat\r\nelven mithril-coat\r\nchain mail\r\norcish chain mail\r\ncrude chain mail\r\nscale mail\r\nstudded leather armor\r\nring mail\r\norcish ring mail\r\ncrude ring mail\r\nleather jacket\r\nT-shirt\r\nmummy wrapping\r\nelven cloak\r\nfaded pall\r\norcish cloak\r\ncoarse mantelet\r\ndwarvish cloak\r\nhooded cloak\r\noilskin cloak\r\nslippery cloak\r\ncloak of protection\r\ntattered cape\r\ncloak of invisibility\r\nopera cloak\r\ncloak of magic resistance\r\nornamental cope\r\ncloak of displacement\r\npiece of cloth\r\nsmall shield\r\nelven shield\r\nblue and green shield\r\nUruk-hai shield\r\nwhite-handed shield\r\norcish shield\r\nred-eyed shield\r\nlarge shield\r\ndwarvish roundshield\r\nlarge round shield\r\nshield of reflection\r\npolished silver shield\r\nleather gloves\r\nold gloves\r\ngauntlets of fumbling\r\npadded gloves\r\ngauntlets of power\r\nriding gloves\r\ngauntlets of dexterity\r\nfencing gloves\r\nlow boots\r\nwalking shoes\r\niron shoes\r\nhard shoes\r\nhigh boots\r\njackboots\r\nspeed boots\r\ncombat boots\r\nwater walking boots\r\njungle boots\r\njumping boots\r\nhiking boots\r\nelven boots\r\nmud boots\r\nfumble boots\r\nriding boots\r\nlevitation boots\r\nsnow boots\r\nshirt\r\ncloak\r\narmor\r\nblessed\r\ncursed\r\nwand of wishing\r\nscroll of teleportation\r\nfuel\r\nblue potion\r\ncyan potion\r\ngreen potion\r\norange potion\r\npurple potion\r\nred potion\r\nclear potion\r\nopaque potion\r\nguard\r\nring of teleport control\r\npotion of blindness\r\nscroll of remove curse\r\nscroll of enchant weapon\r\nblue\r\nblack\r\nmoment\r\nwhile\r\nscroll of enchant armor\r\nvibrates\r\nglows\r\nsilver\r\nviolently\r\nscroll of destroy armor\r\npotion of extra healing\r\nfrog\r\nscroll of resurrection\r\nwand of create monster\r\nDuel field\r\nwand of polymorph\r\nring of polymorph control\r\nwand of call lightning\r\nebony wand\r\npotion of haste self\r\nshelob\r\norc fighter\r\norc archer\r\nwolf\r\npandora\r\ngunter\r\neagle\r\nblack knight\r\nblack knight chief\r\nKurtz\r\nThis must be the '說語島.'\r\nThis was told by one who trained in 'the House of the Red Knight.' I am assured that the information is accurate.  \r\nAnd it is also true that those who oppose his majesty's rule live here.\r\nBut surely his majesty is over reacting! What can one boy do? Even though he is the son of Duke Dephil, he is only a child.  \r\nWatch your mouth. Do you think you are in the position to question his majesty's orders?\r\nSir! Of course not! Forgive me. \r\nOkay, let us scout around the island first. Remember, do not draw your sword unless necessary.\r\nYes, sir!\r\nI think it would be faster to hire a informant among the island people.\r\nWouldn't it be better to find Gunter and ask him? \r\nGunter is not on good terms with his majesty. What makes you think he will help us?\r\nWhy don't we just kill everybody on this island, including Gunter? Then there won't be any troublemakers left.\r\nDidn't I tell you to watch your mouth? I assure you, anyone spilling innocent blood will pay ten times as much.\r\nThe problem is... Is does the person we're looking for have any influence on this island?  \r\nNo, it is the other way around. If someone here is influencing the people, then we must find and eliminate that person. Now, stay alert and spread out!\r\nYes, sir!\r\nLet's hear the report.\r\nYes, sir! No one suspicious looking up till now, sir.\r\nBut it seems that the people of this island are generaly opposed to his majesty.\r\nWe were almost attacked once, while scouting.\r\nWe haven't found anyone 'noteworthy.' That means everyone here is suspicious in some way. \r\nHmm. Then we must continue to watch this island.\r\nOkay, We are retiring for today. Everyone, withdraw!\r\nYes, sir!\r\nHow dare you attack us!\r\nFools. You can't even recognize your enemy's skill. \r\nUrgh!\r\nHmph, you may have defeated me, but I have already informed his majesty that traitors are on this island. A new expedition will come soon.\r\nTraining Area\r\nBalsim\r\nDungeon\r\nBaphomet\r\ngolden key\r\npale silver key\r\nDorin\r\nTotal:\r\nnail of shelob\r\ncloak of Red Knights\r\nsword of Red Knights\r\nticket to mainland\r\nticket to island\r\npotion of cure poison\r\nghoul\r\nspartoi\r\nungoliant\r\nharbor master\r\n...Glooriiy..to thee Grancain...\r\n...he whoo is the ki, ing of all deeeads...\r\n...Oh...Grancain my unholiness...may death to the pretender kiiing!\r\nGruman\r\nbugbear\r\nlantern\r\nlantern oil\r\npotion of greater healing\r\nboots\r\ngloves\r\nnecromancer\r\nCatty\r\nLuth\r\nKarim\r\nBaltuzar\r\nCaspa\r\nMerkyor\r\nSema\r\nWhere are you! Orim, the betrayer!\r\nYou can't hide from us, Orim!\r\nCome out and beg your pardon to the great wizard!\r\nHe is generous and will surely forgive you...come out!\r\nslime race ticket\r\n#Cannon Boy\r\n#Lady Hawk\r\n#Lightning\r\n#Guardian\r\n#Evenstar\r\n#Superblack\r\n#Machiavelli\r\n#Mybabe\r\n#Shootingstar\r\n#Bullet\r\n#Elven arrow\r\n#Sayha\r\n#Hawkwind\r\n#Falcon\r\n#Fumble\r\n#Jellyfish\r\nKent castle\r\nSlime race circuit\r\nGludin town\r\nReady!\r\nGo!\r\nAaman\r\nThe winner of this game is\r\n!\r\nGood\r\nNormal\r\nBad\r\n","desc-e.tbl":"1404\r\nlong sword\r\naxe\r\nlamp\r\ntwo handed sword\r\nadena\r\njanitor\r\nfloating eye\r\nskeleton\r\nslime\r\nwielded\r\nturned on\r\nno oil\r\nelven dagger\r\norcish dagger\r\nathame\r\nscalpel\r\nkatana\r\ntsurugi\r\nwerewolf\r\nelder\r\nmace\r\ndoor\r\ncorpse\r\nmeat\r\nbow\r\nspear\r\npotion of healing\r\nmaple wand\r\npine wand\r\noak wand\r\nscroll labeled ZELGO MER\r\nscroll labeled JUYED AWK YACC\r\nscroll labeled NR 9\r\nscroll labeled XIXAXA XOXAXA XUXAXA\r\nscroll labeled PRATYAVAYAH\r\nscroll labeled DAIYEN FOOELS\r\nscroll labeled LEP GEX VEN ZEA\r\ns