\r\n頂撩 陴僥\r\n頂撩 憮僥\r\n頂撩 翕僥\r\n褒瑞縉\r\n","dgkeeperk1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>守門人：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>之前已經有人來傳令過了，聽說你是這次接受考試的實習騎士？希望你能有個好成績。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你往入口下去的話，將會看到四個分岔路，雖然每條路都很...，但是反正在那其中一定會有鑰匙，把鑰匙插在入口附近的狼人房間，進到房間內，再把狼人殺死取回它的牙做為証明就可以了。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如果你打累了也可以出來休息，那是你的自由。不過因為這裡有很多騎士等著過關，所以如果你出來休息了，就必須再重新請傑瑞德准許你參加考試的資格。加油吧！\r\n<p>那你準備好了嗎？</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"entertestdg\">進入考試的入口。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The messenger has just been here - from him, I heard you have come to train in the Passage of Hardship. Good luck!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Once you pass the entrance, there will be four roads. Each road leads to the a complex maze, but one leads you to the key. All you have to do is enter the werewolf's room near the entrance with the key, and slay the werewolf.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you get exhausted, you can leave, but you should get permission from Lord Gerard before attempting the maze again, because many young knights are waiting to test their mettle.</p>\r\n<p>Are you ready?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"entertestdg\">Enter the Passage of Hardship.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The messenger has just been here - from him, I heard you have come to train in the Passage of Hardship. Good luck!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Once you pass the entrance, there will be four roads. Each road leads to the a complex maze, but one leads you to the key. All you have to do is enter the werewolf's room near the entrance with the key, and slay the werewolf.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you get exhausted, you can leave, but you should get permission from Lord Gerard before attempting the maze again, because many young knights are waiting to test their mettle.</p>\r\n<p>Are you ready?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"entertestdg\">Enter the Passage of Hardship.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>寞旎 瞪滄檜 棻喪鬲棻辦. 檜廓縑 衛溼曖 鱔煎蒂 雖釭陞 唯蝗 晦餌塭雖? и 廓 澀п 爾衛掘溥.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>殮掘蒂 頂溥陛賊 啻 陞楚曖 望檜 氈棻辦. 陝 陞楚望擎 犒濩и 嘐煎雖虜 嬴鼠が 斜 部 醞 и 夠縑 翮潸陛 氈擊疏嶸. 斜 翮潸煎 殮掘 斬籀縑 氈朝 期渠 檣除曖 寞縑 菟橫陛憮 期渠 檣除擊 п纂辦晦虜 ж賊 腎朝 撬檜雖.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>��菟賊 樹薯萇雖 釭螃朝 剪撿 渥曖 濠嶸雖虜, 渠褐 棻衛 啪塭萄椒戲煎睡攪 衛я 濠問擊 嫡堅 諦撿 й疏嶸. 號擎 唯蝗 晦餌陛 檜夠擊 鱔婁ж晦 嬪п 晦棻葬堅 氈戲棲 蜓檜辦.\r\n<p>斜歲 遽綠朝 腎樟模?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"entertestdg\">衛溼曖 鱔煎煎 菟橫除棻.</a>\r\n</body>","dgkeeperk2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>守門人：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>剛才已經有別的實習騎士先進去考試了，那是屬於他個人的試練，旁人不能打擾。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我很了解你的心情，但是等待也是騎士的美德之一，不是嗎？你就有耐心點，再等一等吧。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Another student just entered here - I'm sorry, but you can't disturb his test.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I can understand your frustration, but isn't patience one of the virtues of a knight?</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Another student just entered here - I'm sorry, but you can't disturb his test.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I can understand your frustration, but isn't patience one of the virtues of a knight?</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>寞旎 棻艇 唯蝗 晦餌陛 衛溼擊 嫡戲楝 虞 菟橫鬲棻辦. 斜 餌塋曖 衛溼擎 斜 餌塋曖 跟檜棲 寞пж賊 寰腎雖.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>葆擠擎 憲啊模虜, 晦棻萵 還 嬴朝 匙紫 晦餌曖 湯跡檜雖 彊啊模? 替晚ж啪 晦棻葬掘楫.</p>\r\n</body>","dgkeeperk3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>守門人：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我看你大概沒聽清楚傑瑞德的話吧。傑瑞德他不是說過接受考試時，不能穿戴裝備嗎？試練是只能憑著自己的力量完成的，小子。\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As Lord Gerard said, you can't carry anything into this passage...you should solve the problem relying only upon yourself.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As Lord Gerard said, you can't carry anything into this passage...you should solve the problem relying only upon yourself.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐擎 啪塭萄椒曖 蜓噪縑 敝 晦選雖 彊懊掘試. 啪塭萄椒檜 衛溼曖 鱔煎縑朝 嬴鼠匙紫 跺縑 雖棲堅 陞 熱 橈棻堅 蜓噪ж衛雖 彊戲樟模? 衛溼擎 螃霜 蝶蝶煎曖 ��戲煎虜 п唸п撿ж朝 徹檜塭螃.\r\n</body>","dgkeeperk4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>守門人：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如果你想要進入考試入口的話，首先要得請傑瑞德准許你的考試資格。要就快去吧，很多人在排隊的。\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to enter, please get permission from Lord Gerard.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to enter, please get permission from Lord Gerard.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>衛溼曖 鱔煎蒂 菟橫陞溥賊 辦摹 啪塭萄椒戲煎睡攪 試盪 衛я擊 嫡擊 濠問擊 橢堅 螃衛掘楫.\r\n</body>","dgkeeperk5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>守門人：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>咦？你不是已經通過考試了嗎？如果你已經拿到了傑瑞德發的准許證，怎麼不趕快去更大的都市修練，卻在這裡流蕩呢？趕快去你找尋屬於你自己的路吧。祝你好運啦！騎士！</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Didn't you already pass the test? Once you have been promoted to a Knight by Lord Gerard, the world where you should train. Hurry! The whole world is waiting for you!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Didn't you already pass the test? Once you have been promoted to a Knight by Lord Gerard, the world where you should train. Hurry! The whole world is waiting for you!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeeperk5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫塭? 渡褐擎 檜嘐 衛溼擊 鱔婁ц濫模. 啪塭萄椒戲煎睡攪 晦餌 憮歜擊 嫡懊戲賊 橡艇 渦 創擎 夠戲煎 陛憮 熱溼擊 ж雖彊堅 罹晦憮 橡薩剪葬辦? 橡艇 濠褐曖 望擊 陛掘楫.</p>\r\n</body>","dgkeepero1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>守門人：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這裡是為了讓『銀騎士之家』的實習騎士修練的場所。唯有通過傑瑞德許可的騎士，才有資格來這裡修練，所以不要來這裡搗亂，快點離開。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeepero1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is the test place for knight-apprentices who are training in the \"House of the Silver Knights\". Only those with the invitation of Lord Gerard can enter here, so please don't bother me and the other students.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeepero1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is the test place for knight-apprentices who are training in the \"House of the Silver Knights\". Only those with the invitation of Lord Gerard can enter here, so please don't bother me and the other students.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dgkeepero1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹晦朝 '擎晦餌曖 餵'縑憮 熱溼ж堅 氈朝 唯蝗晦餌菟擊 嬪и 衛я 濰模塭螃. 螃霜 啪塭萄椒檜 衛я 濠問擊 睡罹и 濠虜檜 晦餌陛 腎晦 嬪и 衛溼擊 嫡戲楝 罹晦 螞棻辦. 斜楝棲 寞пж雖 蜓堅 橡艇 陞望檜釭 陛衛掘楫.</p>\r\n</body>","dick1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>迪克：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你對自己的動物是有責任的。\r\n<p>但是，如果有什麼事發生，你也可以把他們以<var src=\"#0\">金幣的價錢託付給我。\r\n<p>啊，當然我只能帶走你自己訓練的動物。我不會替人保管被施與魔法的怪物。它們太危險了。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\">託管動物</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\">帶走動物</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問關於馴服的野生動物</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","dick1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dick:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You must be responsible for your own pets!\r\n<p>If the need arises, I can keep your animals for only <var src=\"#0\"> adena per pet.\r\n<p>And, of course I can only take animals you have trained yourself - I won't take enchanted monsters!  They are too dangerous...as I know ever since those bugbears devoured poor, poor Rex.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Store Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dick:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You must be responsible for your own pets!\r\n<p>If the need arises, I can keep your animals for only <var src=\"#0\"> adena per pet.\r\n<p>And, of course I can only take animals you have trained yourself - I won't take enchanted monsters!  They are too dangerous...as I know ever since those bugbears devoured poor, poor Rex.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Store Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>蛐:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠晦陛 望菟檣 翕僭擎 部梱雖 疇歜擊 雖堅 爾�ㄧ� п撿雖.\r\n<p>凳, ж雖虜 薑 橫聶 熱 橈朝 橾檜 儅啣擊 陽朝 釭и纔 蜆晦紫煙 ж衛螃, и葆葬渡 <var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭縑 蜆嬴輿雖.\r\n<p>嬴, 僭煩 頂陛 蜆朝 匙擎 渡褐檜 霜蕾 望菟檣 翕僭 閨檜螃. 橫蛤憮 葆徹戲煎 �次� 跨蝶攪 評嬪朝 蜆雖 彊啊棻堅.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> 翕僭擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> 翕僭擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>迪克：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哦，請等一下，等我做完，我就會馬上過去。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問關於馴服的動物</a>\r\n</body>","dick2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dick:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, just a moment. I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dick:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, just a moment. I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>蛐:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴, 褻旎虜 晦棻溥蹂. 檜 橾虜 部頂堅 埠 陛葬棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>迪克：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>咿？你沒有在我們這托管動物丫？\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">問養寵物之問題</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dick:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huh? You never stored any animals with me.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dick:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huh? You never stored any animals with me.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>蛐:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橡溯? 渡褐擎 翕僭擊 蜆曹 瞳檜 橈朝等蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>迪克：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>什麼？你竟然沒有可信任的動物！\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問關於馴服的動物</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dick:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't even have animals to store!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dick:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't even have animals to store!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dick4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>蛐:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橡溯? 蜆望 翕僭紫 橈戲賊憮 劂 蜆曹棻朝 剪蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dio1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迪歐:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哇...你看，這麼美麗的藍寶石，不覺得真的是美麗極了嗎？另外鑽石、紅寶石、綠寶石的美麗也都讓我覺得感動。你身上有沒有帶著寶石？\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","dio1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Dio the Jeweller:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh...Look at the shade of this bright blue sapphire. Isn't it beautiful? Diamonds, Rubys, and Emerald's all give me a great feeling when I see them. Do you have any Gems with you?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","dio1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Dio the Jeweller:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh...Look at the shade of this bright blue sapphire. Isn't it beautiful? Diamonds, Rubys, and Emerald's all give me a great feeling when I see them. Do you have any Gems with you?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","dio1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>爾戮鼻 蛤螃:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>螃... 檜 餌だ檜橫曖 換睡褐 ヰ艇 維擊 爾啪釭. 薑蜓 嬴葷港雖 彊擎陛? 棻檜嬴跨萄, 瑞綠, 縑詭塒萄 賅舒 棻 頂啪 檜瑞 蜓й 熱 橈朝 馬翕擊 寰啖輿雖. 濠啻 �公� 陛雖堅 氈朝 爾戮檜 氈朝陛? \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","dio2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迪歐:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我看到你貪婪的眼神就不想跟你交易，說不定在你身上的所有物品都是用不正當的方式取得的，請你離開。\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","dio2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Dio the Jeweller:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I do not want to do a business with you after looking into your greedy eyes. All the items you have for sale may be from your dirty ways. Please get out.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","dio2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Dio the Jeweller:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I do not want to do a business with you after looking into your greedy eyes. All the items you have for sale may be from your dirty ways. Please get out.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","dio2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>爾戮鼻 蛤螃:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠啻曖 鬚踹蝶楛 換擊 爾棲 濠啻諦 剪楚й 儅陝檜 橈橫螺啻. 濠啻陛 乾堅 氈朝 僭勒菟紫 僭煩 睡薑и 寞徹擊 檜辨п 橢擎 匙檜啊雖. 賤 釭陛輿啪.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","doettce1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你！！你這被拋棄到黑暗之火中的黑暗妖精！\r\n如果有黑暗妖精碰觸到米索莉，那它將失去光輝，你最好走開！\r\n我很怕你...\r\n<p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettCE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You!! You are one of the dark elves who have thrown themselves to the flame of darkness!\r\nIf a dark elf touches the Mithril, its brilliance will dim forever - you'd better go away!\r\n<p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettCE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You!! You are one of the dark elves who have thrown themselves to the flame of darkness!\r\nIf a dark elf touches the Mithril, its brilliance will dim forever - you'd better go away!\r\n<p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettCE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐擎!! 橫該棲 撮啗熱蒂 幗葬堅 橫菸曖 碳粒縑 跺擊 \r\n湍霞 橫菸曖 蹂薑檜煎捱! 橫菸曖 蹂薑檜 嘐蝶萵擊 虜雖賊 \r\n雙塢�� 惜�硌黃� �髀昒媮鰤� 蜓雖. 橫憮 餌塭螳 幗葬衛螃! \r\n陪 渡褐檜 舒滑模.\r\n<p>\r\n</body> ","doette1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>但願<a link=\"doettE2\">米索莉</a>的光芒能永遠在森林與湖泊上閃亮...\r\n<br>\r\n你聽說過煉金術中有利用<a link=\"doettE3\">布拉伯</a>來製造道具的法門嗎？我古老的祖先弗得倫，他是偉大的發明家，也是艾瓦寇羅斯之眼的一員，自從他發明了從布拉伯中提煉製造東西的方法後，我們妖精們就可以製造出更好的武器和盔甲。如果你不知道方法，並願意作一個誠實的信徒，我就把方法告訴你。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE4\">短劍的劍身</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE5\">長劍的劍身</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE6\">奧里哈魯根的劍身</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE7\">覆上米索莉的角</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE8\">覆上奧里哈魯根的角</a>\r\n<p>\r\n</body> \r\n","doettE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>May the radiant light of <a link=\"doettE2\">Mithril</a> shine upon the forest and lake forever...\r\n<br>\r\nHave you ever heard of alchemy performed using <a link=\"doettE3\">brob</a>? Ever since my ancestor Fuadalen, the great inventor of the Evercurious Eyes, discovered how to harvest items from Brob, we elves could acquire better weapons and armors than the roundears. As a sincere follower of Fuadalen, I will tell you the secrets!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE4\">Body of Short Sword</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE5\">Body of Long Sword</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE6\">Body of Oriharukon Sword</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE7\">Mithril-coated Horn</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE8\">Oriharukon-coated Horn</a>\r\n<p>\r\n</body> \r\n","doettE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>May the radiant light of <a link=\"doettE2\">Mithril</a> shine upon the forest and lake forever...\r\n<br>\r\nHave you ever heard of alchemy performed using <a link=\"doettE3\">brob</a>? Ever since my ancestor Fuadalen, the great inventor of the Evercurious Eyes, discovered how to harvest items from Brob, we elves could acquire better weapons and armors than the roundears. As a sincere follower of Fuadalen, I will tell you the secrets!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE4\">Body of Short Sword</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE5\">Body of Long Sword</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE6\">Body of Oriharukon Sword</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE7\">Mithril-coated Horn</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE8\">Oriharukon-coated Horn</a>\r\n<p>\r\n</body> \r\n","doettE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雙塢и <a link=\"doettE2\">嘐蝶萵</a>曖 惜�眥� 膛婁 �ˉ鶹�  \r\n艙錳�� 維釭望.. \r\n<br>\r\n渡褐擎 <a link=\"doettE3\">粽照</a>擊 檜辨и  \r\n紫旎縑 渠п 憲堅 氈模? 釭曖 螃楠 摹褻檜濠 嬪渠и 翱掘陛,  \r\n廓嗣檜朝 �ㄠ熀劦� 換檜歷湍 Щ嬴筐煩檜 粽照擊 檜辨и  \r\n紫旎擊 嫦唯魚 檜�� 辦葬 蹂薑褶擎 釭鼠蒂 鳴酈雖 彊堅紫  \r\n�К〥� 鼠濰婁 僥貲曖 檜晦蒂 槳縑 厥擊 熱 氈歷模. 嬴霜  \r\n渡褐檜 賅艇棻賊 斜碟曖 �躁梏抸� 裊溺и  \r\n蹺謙濠煎憮 頂陛 陛腦藥 萄葬葬棻\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE4\">欽匐褐曖 紫旎</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE5\">濰匐褐曖 紫旎</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE6\">螃葬ж瑞夔 匐褐曖 紫旎</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE7\">嘐蝶萵 紫旎 閩曖 紫旎</a> \r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"doettE8\">螃葬ж瑞夔 紫旎 閩曖 紫旎</a>\r\n<p>\r\n</body> ","doette10-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>它是類似<a link=\"doettE9\">精靈</a>背上的羽翼那樣的東西。\r\n精靈羽翼是用來在精靈的物質平面和元素平面之間旅行。\r\n所以我們妖精們能使用<font fg=ffffff>精靈羽翼</font>而<font fg=ffffff>傳送</font>到\r\n迷幻森林之外。覆蓋了米索莉所製成的羽翼的薄膜邊緣是非常銳利且很堅硬的，\r\n那些米索莉可是非常有用的。但是要得到它，你必須拿\r\n<font fg=ffffff>５條米索莉線和４０個精靈粉末</font>給精靈。我聽說他們喜歡用這些來打扮。</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","doettE10-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a wing like thing on the back of <a link=\"doettE9\">Fairy</a>.\r\nAla of fairy is used to travel between the material plane and elemental plane of fairies.\r\nSo we elves can use the <font fg=ffffff>ala of fairy</font> to <font fg=ffffff>teleport</font> through the\r\nElven Forest. Also the membrane of ala is very sharp and can be made quite tough\r\nby coating it with mithril - which could prove to be quite useful. But to get it you have to give\r\n<font fg=ffffff>5 mithril threads and 40 fairy dust</font> to the fairies. I've heard that the fairies use the thread and dust to clothe themselves - but that's just a rumor.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE10-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a wing like thing on the back of <a link=\"doettE9\">Fairy</a>.\r\nAla of fairy is used to travel between the material plane and elemental plane of fairies.\r\nSo we elves can use the <font fg=ffffff>ala of fairy</font> to <font fg=ffffff>teleport</font> through the\r\nElven Forest. Also the membrane of ala is very sharp and can be made quite tough\r\nby coating it with mithril - which could prove to be quite useful. But to get it you have to give\r\n<font fg=ffffff>5 mithril threads and 40 fairy dust</font> to the fairies. I've heard that the fairies use the thread and dust to clothe themselves - but that's just a rumor.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"doettE9\">む橫葬</a>曖 蛔縑 殖萼 橫溫Е檜 維釭朝 陳偃蒂 蜓ж朝 剪塭螃.\r\nむ橫葬曖 陳偃朝 む橫葬菟檜 堅щ檣 薑滄啗諦 ⑷撮啗蒂 剩釭菟晦 嬪и 熱欽檜雖.\r\n斜楚憮 辦葬 蹂薑紫 <font fg=ffffff>む橫葬曖 陳偃蒂 餌辨</font>ж賊 薑滄啗蒂 鱔п 蹂薑曖 膛 頂睡蒂 <font fg=ffffff>牖除檜翕</font>й 熱 氈棻螃.\r\n傳и 陳偃曖 虞擎 部檜 陳蘋照堅 嘐蝶萵擊 殮�鷒� 捲濰�� 欽欽п 雖晦   \r\n陽僥縑 嶸辨ж啪 噙檜朝 僭勒檜雖. ж雖虜 斜勘 橢戲溥賊 \r\n<font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵 褒 5顫楚諦 む橫葬 渦蝶お 40偃</font>蒂 む橫葬菟縑啪 輿橫撿 и棻螃.\r\n斜菟擎 斜勘煎 跺纂濰擊 ж朝等 噹棻堅 ж渦捱.</p>\r\n</body> \r\n","doette11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>它是<font fg=ffffff>劍跟矛</font>的材料。但是我聽說你已經<font fg=ffffff>可以使用這些東西了\r\n</font>，雖然這威力的確比較弱...不論如何，你不認為向\r\n<a link=\"doettE12\">娜魯帕</a>詢問這些細節是比較明智的嗎？</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","doettE11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a material to make a <font fg=ffffff>Sword or Spear</font>. But I've heard that you can use it just <font fg=ffffff>as it is\r\n</font>, even though it's weaker...if you want more details, I'd ask \r\n<a link=\"doettE12\">Nerupa</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a material to make a <font fg=ffffff>Sword or Spear</font>. But I've heard that you can use it just <font fg=ffffff>as it is\r\n</font>, even though it's weaker...if you want more details, I'd ask \r\n<a link=\"doettE12\">Nerupa</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>璽檜釭 匐</font>擊 虜萄朝 等 噙檜朝 營猿檜雖. ж雖虜 <font fg=ffffff>斜匙虜戲煎紫\r\n槳縑 菟堅 餌辨</font>й 熱 氈曹 氈棻堅 ж渦捱. 擒ж曹 ж雖虜.. 濠撮и 匙擎\r\n棺鼻 褐撮蒂 雖朝 <a link=\"doettE12\">啻瑞だ</a>縑啪 陛憮 僭橫爾朝  \r\nら檜 �徆� 緒腦雖 彊啊模?</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doette12-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>她是芮克妮中的一位長者，並且居住在城鎮廣場中<font fg=ffffff>迷幻森林之母</font>後的地下城中。即使我不確定迷幻森林之母和她的關係...\r\n但可以確定的，是她生產我們妖精們需要的東西。當然你必須帶來你自己的<font fg=ffffff>材料</font>。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE12-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>She is one of the Elders of Arachnes and lives below the dungeon near the <font fg=ffffff>Mother of the forest and elves</font> in the town plaza. Even though I'm not sure about her relationship with the mother tree...\r\nShe produces things we elves need. Of course you have to bring your own <font fg=ffffff>materials</font> with you.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE12-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>She is one of the Elders of Arachnes and lives below the dungeon near the <font fg=ffffff>Mother of the forest and elves</font> in the town plaza. Even though I'm not sure about her relationship with the mother tree...\r\nShe produces things we elves need. Of course you have to bring your own <font fg=ffffff>materials</font> with you.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE12-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>葆擊 醞懈縑 氈朝 剪渠и 撮啗熱, <font fg=ffffff>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲諦 奢儅ж貊\r\n蕙曖 饜掉</font>縑 髦堅 氈朝 嬴塭觼啻褶 濰煎蒂 蜓ж朝 剪蹂. 斜喪諦 \r\n橫該棲 撮啗熱諦曖 婦啗朝 釭紫 澀 賅腦雖虜, 懍が 斜喪朝 \r\n辦葬 蹂薑菟縑啪 罹楝 嶸辨и <font fg=ffffff>僭勒擊 虜菟橫</font> 輿堅 氈棻螃. \r\n僭煩 <font fg=ffffff>營猿朝 霜蕾 掘п憮</font> 陛螳陛撿 ж雖虜..</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doette13-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>它是藉由精煉<font fg=ffffff>米索莉</font>而產生。也有人稱它為『上帝的金屬』。因為一旦你用這種金屬來製造武器，它會比直接用米索莉製作的武器更有威力。\r\n但是精煉的方法 只有<font fg=ffffff>精靈女皇</font>知道，如果你想見她，你可以沿著<font fg=ffffff>花床</font>的道路，到村莊西北方的正義神殿去看看。\r\n但是精靈可是相當反覆無常的，所以小心一點。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>奧里哈魯根也可以用來修理破損的武器和防具，假如你的武器被布拉伯所腐蝕，這就是修理你的武器最好的方法。</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE13-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a metal produced by refining <font fg=ffffff>Mithril</font>. It is also called \"God's metal\" - once you make a weapon with this, the weapon is more powerful than one made with Mithril.\r\nHowever, the refining method is only known to the <font fg=ffffff>Fairy Queen</font>. If you want to see her, you should check the <font fg=ffffff>flower bed</font> on the way to the lawful temple located to the north-west of town.\r\nFairies can be quite capricious, so be careful once you find them!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh - also, oriharukons can also be used to fix eroded weapons and armors. In fact, that's the best way to fix armors eroded by Brob.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE13-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a metal produced by refining <font fg=ffffff>Mithril</font>. It is also called \"God's metal\" - once you make a weapon with this, the weapon is more powerful than one made with Mithril.\r\nHowever, the refining method is only known to the <font fg=ffffff>Fairy Queen</font>. If you want to see her, you should check the <font fg=ffffff>flower bed</font> on the way to the lawful temple located to the north-west of town.\r\nFairies can be quite capricious, so be careful once you find them!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh - also, oriharukons can also be used to fix eroded weapons and armors. In fact, that's the best way to fix armors eroded by Brob.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE13-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵</font>擊 薑薯п憮 橢擊 熱 氈朝 旎樓戲煎 \r\n檜匙戲煎 紫旎и 鼠晦朝 嘐蝶萵煎 и 匙爾棻 �徆� \r\n鬼溘ж啪 腎晦 陽僥縑 檜艇夥 褐曖 旎樓檜塭 и棻螃. ж雖虜 薑薯 寞徹擎 <font fg=ffffff>む橫葬 覽</font>虜檜 憲堅 \r\n氈棻堅 ж渦捱. む橫葬 覽擊 虜釭溥賊 葆擊縑憮 磁憮薹縑 氈朝 煎辦ヴ 褐瞪戲煎 陛朝 紫醞縑 釭螃朝 <font fg=ffffff>粒寧</font> 斬籀縑 氈棻堅 ж螃.\r\nむ橫葬菟擎 滲湯檜 褕и 謙褶檜棲 斜喪 擅縑憮 睡蛤 輿曖п憮 蕨曖蒂 雖酈望 夥塭螃.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴, 螃葬ж瑞夔擎 <font fg=ffffff>鼻ж剪釭 睡衝脹 鼠晦蒂 堅藥輿朝 �膩�</font>紫 氈棻螃. 粽照縑啪 睡衝渡и 鼠晦縑朝 斜啪 譆堅雖蹂.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doette14-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這得歸功於那些用來裝飾<a link=\"doettE9\">潘</a>頭部那華麗的角。\r\n這華麗的角表現出他們的勇氣和鹵莽。他們的角又尖又銳利，所以常被用來當作製<font fg=ffffff>矛</font>的材料。</p>\r\n\r\n</body>","doettE14-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>That refers to the gorgeous horn which adorns the head of <a link=\"doettE9\">Pan</a>.\r\nThe horn represents their courage, but also their recklessness. Their horn is quite hard and sharp and thus very useful to make a <font fg=ffffff>Spear</font>.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE14-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>That refers to the gorgeous horn which adorns the head of <a link=\"doettE9\">Pan</a>.\r\nThe horn represents their courage, but also their recklessness. Their horn is quite hard and sharp and thus very useful to make a <font fg=ffffff>Spear</font>.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE14-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辨裊蝶楛 <a link=\"doettE9\">っ</a>菟曖 該葬蒂 濰衝ж堅 \r\n氈朝 詣霞 閩擊 蜓ж朝 剪蹂. 斜 閩擎 っ曖 辨裊л婁 傳и \r\n翕衛縑 斜菟曖 鼠賅л擊 鼻癒ж朝 匙檜塭堅 ж渦捱. 斜菟曖 閩擎 \r\n欽欽ж堅 部檜 銨褶п憮 輿煎 <font fg=ffffff>璽</font>擊 虜萄朝 等 嶸辨ж啪 \r\n噙檣棻螃.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doette15-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link = \"doettE12\">娜魯帕</a>用研磨<font fg=ffffff>元素石</font>的方法來製造它。\r\n森林的四個守護神潘、芮克妮、精靈和安特是由基本的元素所構成。所以他們非常喜歡<font fg=ffffff>精靈粉末</font>。\r\n所以這就是如果你把粉末撒在地面上，他們就會靠過來的原因。</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE15-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link = \"doettE12\">Nerupa</a> produces it by grinding <font fg=ffffff>Elemental Stone</font>.\r\nThe four guardians of the forest Pan, Arachne, Fairy, and Ent were originally elementals...and because of this, they\r\nfg=ffffff>like fairy dust very much.</font> That's the reason why they may come when you put dust on the ground.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE15-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link = \"doettE12\">Nerupa</a> produces it by grinding <font fg=ffffff>Elemental Stone</font>.\r\nThe four guardians of the forest Pan, Arachne, Fairy, and Ent were originally elementals...and because of this, they\r\nfg=ffffff>like fairy dust very much.</font> That's the reason why they may come when you put dust on the ground.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE15-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>薑滄曖 給</font>擊 <a link = \"doettE12\">啻瑞だ</a>陛 澀啪 豪嬴 薑薯и 陛瑞雖蹂. 4渠 熱�� 謙褶檣 っ, 嬴塭觼啻, む橫葬, 縛お朝 獄楚朝 薑滄檜歷晦 陽僥縑 薑滄曖 晦遴擊 陛濰 澀 替野 熱 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>む橫葬 渦蝶お蒂 鼠繫 謠嬴и棻螃.</font> 斜渠憮 檜勘 夥款縑 銑溥舒賊 熱�� 謙褶菟檜 陛梱檜螃雖蹂.</p>\r\n</body> \r\n","doette2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我們妖精們一旦碰觸到普通金屬就會失去力量。所以我們不能靠近鐵或銅。那是因為他們都是致命的金屬。\r\n<br>\r\n但是米索莉是不同的。它直接受殷海薩的祝福，所以精靈的本質還在上面。此外它是非常光亮的。所以在迷幻森林我們用米索莉製造武器。\r\n<br>\r\n啊？如何製造米索莉？如何將<font fg=ffffff>粗糙的米索莉精煉成純粹的米索莉</font>這只有“精靈”知道了。\r\n如果你帶著粗糙的米索莉去找他們，他們就會用自己的方式精煉出純粹的米索莉。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","doettE2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We elves lose our power once we touch normal metal...so we can't approach iron or copper - they are metals.\r\n<br>\r\nMithril, however, is different - it's blessed by Einhasaad Himself, so the essence of fairy is still there. Further it's very light, and strong - quite suitable for making weapons.\r\n<br>\r\nHow to make mithril? The way to <font fg=ffffff>refine rough mithril into pure mithril </font>is known only to the fairie folk.\r\nIf you can bring rough mithril to them, they will make it pure.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We elves lose our power once we touch normal metal...so we can't approach iron or copper - they are metals.\r\n<br>\r\nMithril, however, is different - it's blessed by Einhasaad Himself, so the essence of fairy is still there. Further it's very light, and strong - quite suitable for making weapons.\r\n<br>\r\nHow to make mithril? The way to <font fg=ffffff>refine rough mithril into pure mithril </font>is known only to the fairie folk.\r\nIf you can bring rough mithril to them, they will make it pure.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦葬 蹂薑褶擎 橾奩 旎樓縑 湊戲賊   \r\n蔣啪 薑滄溘檜 槳鼻擊 殮堅 蜓雖蹂. 斜楚憮 繹檜塭萇陛   \r\n掘葬偽擎 匙縑 蔣啪 蕾斬й 熱 橈模. 斜匙菟擎 賅舒 避擎   \r\n匙菟檜棲.. \r\n<br>\r\nж雖虜 嘐蝶萵擎 棻腦螃. 嬴檣ж餌萄 褐曖 蹴犒擊 斜 旎樓擎 \r\n薑滄曖 獗望檜氈模. 傳и 鼠繫 陛滷雖. 斜楚憮 蹂薑曖 膛縑摹 賅萇 鼠濰擊   \r\n嘐蝶萵煎 虜萇棻螃. \r\n<br>\r\n擠? 嘐蝶萵擊 虜萄朝 寞徹? <font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵 錳戮縑憮 嘐蝶萵擊 薑薯</font>ж朝 寞徹擎 \r\nむ橫葬虜檜 憲堅 氈棻螃. 嘐蝶萵 錳戮擊 陛螳棻 む橫葬\r\n菟縑啪 睡饕ж賊 斜菟 か嶸曖 薑薯 葆徹戲煎 嘐蝶萵擊 虜菟橫 遽棻螃.</p>  \r\n  \r\n</body>  ","doette3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你知道位在迷幻森林西方中的<font fg=ffffff>眠龍洞</font>嗎？\r\n牠會躲藏在陰影之中偷襲你。雖然牠的外型蠻惹人討厭，但其實他很溫和也很虛弱，當然更是無助。牠們可以被用來幫助製成物品。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Do you know the <font fg=ffffff>Cave of the Sleeping Dragon</font> to the west of the\r\nElven Forest? They hide among the shadows there and surprise you...looking much like slimes but far more weak...and far more helpful of course as they can be harvested to produce items.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","doettE3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Do you know the <font fg=ffffff>Cave of the Sleeping Dragon</font> to the west of the\r\nElven Forest? They hide among the shadows there and surprise you...looking much like slimes but far more weak...and far more helpful of course as they can be harvested to produce items.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","doettE3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂薑曖 膛 憮睡縑 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>辨檜 濡濠朝 翕掉</font>擊 嬴衛螃? 斜 翕掉 斜棺縑 獗橫 氈棻 雖釭陛朝 碳齒 碳齒 釭顫釭憮 啾楚酈朝\r\n跨蝶攪塭螃. 蝸塭歜ж堅 綠蝌ж啪 儅啣雖虜 覬 渦 螞牖ж堅 擒и 喪戮檜塭 й 熱 氈雖. 斜葬堅 蝸塭歜爾棻 �徆� 紫遺檜  \r\n腎朝 耀掘塭螃. 夥煎 <font fg=ffffff>紫旎</font>擊 й 熱 氈棻朝 薄縑憮 蜓檜螃.</p> \r\n </body> \r\n ","doette4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>給<a link=\"doettE3\">布拉伯</a>１個<a link=\"doettE10\">精靈羽翼</a>和５０個<a link=\"doettE2\">純粹的米索莉塊</a>，如果這個動作在２０秒內\r\n完成並把它殺死，那麼你可以得到<a link=\"doettE11\">短劍的劍身</a>。\r\n<br>\r\n但是注意！\r\n如果超過<font fg=ffffff>２０秒</font>你還沒有完成這個動作，那布拉伯會把他們全部都融化掉。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Give a <a link=\"doettE3\">Brob</a> an <a link=\"doettE10\">ala of fairy</a> and 50 <a link=\"doettE2\">mithril</a> and slay it\r\nwithin 20 seconds to get the <a link=\"doettE11\">body of short sword</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nBut beware!\r\nSpend more than <font fg=ffffff>20 seconds</font> and the Brob will digest it all!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Give a <a link=\"doettE3\">Brob</a> an <a link=\"doettE10\">ala of fairy</a> and 50 <a link=\"doettE2\">mithril</a> and slay it\r\nwithin 20 seconds to get the <a link=\"doettE11\">body of short sword</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nBut beware!\r\nSpend more than <font fg=ffffff>20 seconds</font> and the Brob will digest it all!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"doettE10\">む橫葬曖 陳偃</a> 1偃諦 <a link=\"doettE2\">嘐蝶萵</a>       \r\n50偃蒂 <a link=\"doettE3\">粽照</a>縑啪 詳檣 �� 20蟾 寰縑 粽照擊       \r\n避檜賊 <a link=\"doettE11\">欽匐褐</a>擊 橢擊 熱 氈模. \r\n<br>\r\n輿曖ж衛螃!       \r\n<font fg=ffffff>20蟾</font>蒂 剩晦賊 粽照擎 渡褐檜 遽 詳檜蒂       \r\n檜嘐 蛻氈啪 模�倆媢鷏� �釋� 纔棲梱.</p>      \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n","doette5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>給<a link=\"doettE3\">布拉伯</a>３個<a link=\"doettE10\">精靈羽翼</a>和１５０個<a link=\"doettE2\">純粹的米索莉塊</a>，這個動作要在２０秒內\r\n完成並把布拉伯殺掉，那麼你可以得到<a link=\"doettE11\">長劍的劍身。</a>.\r\n<br>\r\n但是注意！\r\n如果超過<font fg=ffffff>２０秒</font>你還沒有完成這個動作，那布拉伯會把他們全部都融化掉。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Give a <a link=\"doettE3\">Brob</a> three <a link=\"doettE10\">ala of fairy</a> and 150 <a link=\"doettE2\">mithril</a> and kill it\r\nwithin 20 seconds and you can get the <a link=\"doettE11\">body of long sword</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nBut beware!\r\nSpend more than <font fg=ffffff>20 seconds</font>, and the Brob will digest it all.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Give a <a link=\"doettE3\">Brob</a> three <a link=\"doettE10\">ala of fairy</a> and 150 <a link=\"doettE2\">mithril</a> and kill it\r\nwithin 20 seconds and you can get the <a link=\"doettE11\">body of long sword</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nBut beware!\r\nSpend more than <font fg=ffffff>20 seconds</font>, and the Brob will digest it all.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"doettE10\">む橫葬曖 陳偃</a> 3偃諦 <a link=\"doettE2\">嘐蝶萵</a>    \r\n150偃蒂 <a link=\"doettE3\">粽照</a>縑啪 詳檣 �� 20蟾 寰縑 粽照擊    \r\n避檜賊 <a link=\"doettE11\">濰匐褐</a>擊 橢擊 熱 氈模. \r\n<br>\r\n輿曖ж衛螃!    \r\n<font fg=ffffff>20蟾</font>蒂 剩晦賊 粽照擎 渡褐檜 遽 詳檜蒂    \r\n檜嘐 蛻氈啪 模�倆媢鷏� �釋� 纔棲梱.</p>   \r\n   \r\n</body>   \r\n","doette6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>給<a link=\"doettE3\">布拉伯</a>３個<a link=\"doettE10\">精靈羽翼</a>，１５０個\r\n<a link=\"doettE2\">奧里哈魯根</a>，和<font fg=ffffff>３個紅寶石</font>，並在２０秒內\r\n完成這個動作並把它殺死，那你就能得到<a link=\"doettE11\">奧里哈魯根的劍身。</a>\r\n<br>\r\n但是注意！如果超過<font fg=ffffff>２０秒</font>你還沒有完成這個動作，那布拉伯會把他們全部都融化掉。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Give a <a link=\"doettE3\">Brob</a> three <a link=\"doettE10\">ala of fairy</a>, 150\r\n<a link=\"doettE13\">oriharukon</a>, and <font fg=ffffff>three rubies</font> and kill it\r\nwithin 20 seconds and you can get the <a link=\"doettE11\">body of oriharukon sword</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nBut beware!\r\nIf you spend more than <font fg=ffffff>20 seconds</font>, then the Brob will digest everything.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Give a <a link=\"doettE3\">Brob</a> three <a link=\"doettE10\">ala of fairy</a>, 150\r\n<a link=\"doettE13\">oriharukon</a>, and <font fg=ffffff>three rubies</font> and kill it\r\nwithin 20 seconds and you can get the <a link=\"doettE11\">body of oriharukon sword</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nBut beware!\r\nIf you spend more than <font fg=ffffff>20 seconds</font>, then the Brob will digest everything.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doettE6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"doettE10\">む橫葬曖 陳偃</a> 3偃諦 <a link=\"doettE13\">螃葬ж瑞夔</a>   \r\n150偃, <font fg=ffffff>瑞綠3偃</font>蒂 <a link=\"doettE3\">粽照</a>縑啪 詳檣 �� 20蟾 寰縑  \r\n粽照擊 避檜賊 <a link=\"doettE11\">螃葬ж瑞夔   \r\n匐褐</a>擊 橢擊 熱 氈模. \r\n<br>\r\n輿曖ж衛螃! <font fg=ffffff>20蟾</font>蒂 剩晦賊 粽照擎   \r\n渡褐檜 遽 詳檜蒂 檜嘐 蛻氈啪 模�倆媢鷏� �釋� 纔棲梱.</p>  \r\n  \r\n</body>  \r\n","doette7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>給<a link=\"doettE3\">布拉伯</a>２個<a link=\"doettE14\">潘的角</a>，８０個\r\n<a link=\"doettE2\">純粹的米索莉塊</a>，在２０秒內完成這個動作並把它殺死，那麼你可以得到<a link=\"doettE11\">包覆米索莉的角</a>。\r\n<br>\r\n但是注意！\r\n如果你超過<font fg=ffffff>２０秒</font>你還沒有完成這個動作，那布拉伯會把他們全部都融化掉。</p>\r\n\r\n</body>  \r\n","doettE7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Give a <a link=\"doettE3\">Brob</a> two <a link=\"doettE14\">Pan's horn</a> and 80\r\n<a link=\"doettE2\">mithril</a>, and kill it within 20 seconds and you can get the <a link=\"doettE11\">Mithril-coated horn</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nBut beware!\r\nIf you spend more than <font fg=ffffff>20 seconds</font>, then the Brob will digest everything.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>  \r\n","doettE7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Give a <a link=\"doettE3\">Brob</a> two <a link=\"doettE14\">Pan's horn</a> and 80\r\n<a link=\"doettE2\">mithril</a>, and kill it within 20 seconds and you can get the <a link=\"doettE11\">Mithril-coated horn</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nBut beware!\r\nIf you spend more than <font fg=ffffff>20 seconds</font>, then the Brob will digest everything.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>  \r\n","doettE7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"doettE14\">っ曖 閩</a> 2偃諦 <a link=\"doettE2\">嘐蝶萵</a> 80偃蒂 \r\n<a link=\"doettE3\">粽照</a>縑啪 詳檣 �� 20蟾 寰縑 粽照擊   \r\n避檜賊 <a link=\"doettE11\">嘐蝶萵 紫旎 閩</a>擊 橢擊 熱 氈模.   \r\n<br>\r\n輿曖ж衛螃! <font fg=ffffff>20蟾</font>蒂 剩晦賊 粽照擎 渡褐檜   \r\n遽 詳檜蒂 檜嘐 蛻氈啪 模�倆媢鷏� �釋� 纔棲梱.</p>  \r\n  \r\n</body>  \r\n","doette8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>給<a link=\"doettE3\">布拉伯</a>４個<a link=\"doettE14\">潘的角</a>，８０個\r\n<a link=\"doettE2\">奧里哈魯根</a>，和<font fg=ffffff>３個紅寶石</font>並在２０秒內把它殺掉，那麼你可以得到<a link=\"doettE11\">包覆奧里哈魯根的角</a>。\r\n<br>\r\n但是注意！\r\n如果你超過<font fg=ffffff>２０秒</font>你還沒有完成這個動作，那布拉伯會把他們全部都融化掉。</p>\r\n\r\n</body>  \r\n","doettE8-e.html":"<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Give a <a link=\"doettE3\">Brob</a> four <a link=\"doettE14\">Pan's horn</a>, 80\r\n<a link=\"doettE2\">mithril</a>, and <font fg=ffffff>three rubies</font> and kill it within 20 seconds, then you can get the <a link=\"doettE11\">Oriharukon-coated horn</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nBut beware!\r\nIf you spend more than <font fg=ffffff>20 seconds</font>, then the Brob will, unfortunately, digest everything.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>  \r\n","doettE8-j.html":"<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Give a <a link=\"doettE3\">Brob</a> four <a link=\"doettE14\">Pan's horn</a>, 80\r\n<a link=\"doettE2\">mithril</a>, and <font fg=ffffff>three rubies</font> and kill it within 20 seconds, then you can get the <a link=\"doettE11\">Oriharukon-coated horn</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nBut beware!\r\nIf you spend more than <font fg=ffffff>20 seconds</font>, then the Brob will, unfortunately, digest everything.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>  \r\n","doettE8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"doettE14\">っ曖 閩</a> 4偃諦 <a link=\"doettE13\">螃葬ж瑞夔</a>   \r\n80偃, 瑞綠3偃蒂 <a link=\"doettE3\">粽照</a>縑啪 詳檣 �� 20蟾 寰縑  \r\n粽照擊   \r\n避檜賊 <a link=\"doettE11\">螃葬ж瑞夔 紫旎 閩</a>擊 橢擊 熱 氈模.   \r\n<br>\r\n輿曖ж衛螃! <font fg=ffffff>20蟾</font>蒂 剩晦賊 粽照擎 渡褐檜   \r\n遽 詳檜蒂 檜嘐 蛻氈啪 模�倆媢鷏� �釋� 纔棲梱.</p>  \r\n  \r\n</body>  \r\n","doette9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>他們是精靈森林四個守護神之一。他們非常粗暴而且衝動，但是\r\n一旦你認識他們，你將了解在他們心中是很有禮貌又敏感的種族。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>潘的鬃毛可以用在很多方面，但是當你收集的時候，你必須小心。因為有時候即使是妖精族，他還是會攻擊你。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","doettE9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>They are one of the four guardians of the Elven Forest, usually very rough and impulsive, but\r\nbut you will find that they are a very gentle and sensitive race in their hearts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pan's mane is used for many things, but while you are collecting manes, be careful - sometimes even elves can be attacked.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","doettE9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>They are one of the four guardians of the Elven Forest, usually very rough and impulsive, but\r\nbut you will find that they are a very gentle and sensitive race in their hearts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pan's mane is used for many things, but while you are collecting manes, be careful - sometimes even elves can be attacked.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","doettE9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂薑曖 膛婁 膛曖 擎��蒂 嫡朝 賅萇 儅貲擊 爾��ж朝 4渠 熱��濠(Guardian)謙褶   \r\n醞 ж釭塭螃. 撩韓檜 剪艦堅 晝ж雖虜, 莫晦蒂 陛雖堅 餌敝橫 爾賊 頂褕擎 牖ж堅 馬熱撩檜 鬼и 謙褶檜雖蹂.</p> \r\n<p>っ曖 陞晦 蛔檜 嬴檜蠱擊 虜萄朝等 號檜 噙檜堆 ж朝等, っ擎 陛莠噶 蹂薑檜塭紫 餌薑擊 瑭輿雖 彊堅 陽葬堆 ж棲 瓣餵й 陽 褻褕п撿 й皎棲棻.</p>\r\n</body> \r\n ","doettm1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>多特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>真是奇怪，竟然可以在這迷幻森林中，看到一個只得到一點點神的庇佑的人類。\r\n即使你已經得到控制所有世界的能力，旦你又是怎麼能夠進來這個禁區？\r\n<br>\r\n你創造自己的世界，又如火焰燃燒自己發出光芒一般地任意吞噬其他事物。\r\n<br>\r\n你最好了解一點。一旦你吞噬掉所有東西，不留下一物。那將代表著火焰的熄滅。\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doettM1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is very rare to see one blessed with a limited time in the Elven Forest.\r\nHow could you come to this place which is forbidden to you - you, who already control all the outside world?\r\n<br>\r\nYou dominate the world, devouring even as a flame consumes everything in its path.\r\n<br>\r\nBut think on this this: once a flame is left with nothing else to devour...what then happens to the flame?\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doettM1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Doett:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is very rare to see one blessed with a limited time in the Elven Forest.\r\nHow could you come to this place which is forbidden to you - you, who already control all the outside world?\r\n<br>\r\nYou dominate the world, devouring even as a flame consumes everything in its path.\r\n<br>\r\nBut think on this this: once a flame is left with nothing else to devour...what then happens to the flame?\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","doettM1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫縑お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嶸ии 衛除曖 蹴犒擊 嫡擎 濠陛 蹂薑曖 膛縑 菟橫螃棻棲 \r\n滌陪 橾檜捱蹂. 檜嘐 撮鼻曖 輿紫掏擊 槳縑 厥擎 渡褐菟檜 \r\n嶸橾ж啪 嬴霜 斬蕾й 熱 橈朝 檜夠縑 菟橫螃棻棲.. \r\n<br>\r\n斜渠菟擎 蝶蝶煎蒂 隻嬴憮 �納炾� 維擊 頂朝 碳粒籀歲 賅萇 \r\n錳楚曖 匙菟擊 鳴麵憮 濠褐菟曖 撮鼻擊 虜菟堅 氈模. \r\n<br>\r\nж雖虜 梟殘朝 匙檜 謠擊 剪蹂. 渦 檜鼻 鳴鑒 匙檜 陴嬴 氈雖 彊擎 \r\n斜 陽陛 夥煎 斜 碳粒曖 謙蜓歜擊..</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","dogdealer-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>寵物商人羅德尼:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你要不要養一隻寵物？只要好好兒的照顧他們，打獵時有很大的幫助，在競技場可以賺一大筆錢。</p>\r\n<p>我只有品種好的寵物，請你挑選一隻好傢伙吧。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 1\">狼 等級 4</a><p align=right>400 金幣</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 2\">狼 等級 5</a><p align=right>800 金幣 </p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 3\">狼 等級 6</a><p align=right>1600 金幣 </p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 4\">杜賓狗 等級 6</a><p align=right>2000 金幣 </p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 5\">杜賓狗 等級 7</a><p align=right>4400 金幣 </p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 6\">杜賓狗 等級 8</a><p align=right>9600 金幣 </p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 7\">牡羊犬 等級 5</a><p align=right>800 金幣 </p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 8\">牧羊犬 等級 6</a><p align=right>1700 金幣 </p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 9\">牧羊犬 等級 7</a><p align=right>3800 金幣 </p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 10\">小獵犬 等級 3</a><p align=right>160 金幣 </p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 11\">小獵犬 等級 4</a><p align=right>360 金幣 </p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 12\">小獵犬 等級 5</a><p align=right>760 金幣 </p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogdealer-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Dog Dealer Rodeny:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey there! You, don't you want to raise dogs? If you raise them well you can use them to hunt, or you can make them fighting dogs and make money at that arena.</p>\r\n<p>I have only the best of the best. Feel free to choose.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 1\">Wild dog level 4</a><p align=right>400 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 2\">Wild dog level 5</a><p align=right>800 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 3\">Wild dog level 6</a><p align=right>1600 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 4\">Doberman level 6</a><p align=right>2000 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 5\">Doberman level 7</a><p align=right>4400 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 6\">Doberman level 8</a><p align=right>9600 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 7\">Shepherd level 5</a><p align=right>800 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 8\">Shepherd level 6</a><p align=right>1700 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 9\">Shepherd level 7</a><p align=right>3800 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 10\">Beagle level 3</a><p align=right>160 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 11\">Beagle level 4</a><p align=right>360 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 12\">Beagle level 5</a><p align=right>760 adena</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogdealer-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Dog Dealer Rodeny:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey there! You, don't you want to raise dogs? If you raise them well you can use them to hunt, or you can make them fighting dogs and make money at that arena.</p>\r\n<p>I have only the best of the best. Feel free to choose.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 1\">Wild dog level 4</a><p align=right>400 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 2\">Wild dog level 5</a><p align=right>800 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 3\">Wild dog level 6</a><p align=right>1600 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 4\">Doberman level 6</a><p align=right>2000 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 5\">Doberman level 7</a><p align=right>4400 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 6\">Doberman level 8</a><p align=right>9600 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 7\">Shepherd level 5</a><p align=right>800 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 8\">Shepherd level 6</a><p align=right>1700 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 9\">Shepherd level 7</a><p align=right>3800 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 10\">Beagle level 3</a><p align=right>160 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 11\">Beagle level 4</a><p align=right>360 adena</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 12\">Beagle level 5</a><p align=right>760 adena</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogdealer-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>偃 鼻檣 煎萄棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 爾蓬! 渡褐, 偃 и葆葬 望楝爾雖 彊啊熱? 檜 喫菟 澀虜 酈辦賊 餌傖 陽紫 紫遺檜 腎堅, 盪晦 癱唯濰縑憮 癱唯戲煎 鼻旎紫 弊 熱 氈棻辦.</p>\r\n<p>頂陛 謠擎 喫菟虜 鉻嬴堡戲棲 蜀縑 萄朝 喫戲煎 埤塭 爾衛掘楫.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 1\">撿儅唯 溯漣 4</a><p align=right>400 嬴等釭</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 2\">撿儅唯 溯漣 5</a><p align=right>800 嬴等釭</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 3\">撿儅唯 溯漣 6</a><p align=right>1600 嬴等釭</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 4\">紫漆腦虜 溯漣 6</a><p align=right>2000 嬴等釭</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 5\">紫漆腦虜 溯漣 7</a><p align=right>4400 嬴等釭</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 6\">紫漆腦虜 溯漣 8</a><p align=right>9600 嬴等釭</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 7\">樁ぷ萄 溯漣 5</a><p align=right>800 嬴等釭</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 8\">樁ぷ萄 溯漣 6</a><p align=right>1700 嬴等釭</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 9\">樁ぷ萄 溯漣 7</a><p align=right>3800 嬴等釭</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 10\">綠旋 溯漣 3</a><p align=right>160 嬴等釭</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 11\">綠旋 溯漣 4</a><p align=right>360 嬴等釭</p>\r\n<a action=\"buy 12\">綠旋 溯漣 5</a><p align=right>760 嬴等釭</p>\r\n</body>","dogfight0-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這裡是動物競技場。就是寵物和寵物比賽的地方...想不想看競賽？</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"join\">參加動物競技賽</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">觀看有關動物競技賽的說明</a>\r\n","dogfight0-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Wanna enter the 'Animal Colosseum'?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"join\">Enter the 'Animal Colosseum'</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Colosseum'</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight0-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Wanna enter the 'Animal C