inner... Tsk!\r\n</body>\r\n","dogfight10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...渡褐擎 辦蝓濠紫 嬴棲賊憮 鼻旎擎 鼠蝦....鎳.\r\n</body>","dogfight11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你想要以那隻來參賽？</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog2\">選擇寵物</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">觀看有關動物競技賽的說明</a>\r\n","dogfight11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Which one?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog2\">Select an animal</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about the Animal Colosseum</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Which one?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog2\">Select an animal</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about the Animal Colosseum</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...橫雯 喫擊 諄遺縑 頂爾鳥剪嶸?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog2\">頂爾鳥 偃蒂 摹鷗и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">癱唯 唳晦縑 渠и 撲貲擊 獄棻</a>\r\n","dogfight2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你想要以那隻來參加比賽？</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog1\">選擇參賽的寵物</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">觀看有關動物競技賽的說明</a>\r\n","dogfight2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...which one shall fight?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog1\">Select the animal</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Colosseum'</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...which one shall fight?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog1\">Select the animal</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Colosseum'</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...橫雯 喫擊 諄遺縑 頂爾鳥剪嶸?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog1\">頂爾鳥 偃蒂 摹鷗и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">癱唯 唳晦縑 渠и 撲貲擊 獄棻</a>\r\n","dogfight3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>賭率是多少？\r\n<br><br><br></body>\r\n","dogfight3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...How much would you like to bet?\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n","dogfight3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...How much would you like to bet?\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n","dogfight3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...っ絲擎 橡葆薑紫 勘疏嶸?\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n","dogfight4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在的冠軍是<var src=\"#1\">。若下注即可挑戰...你要挑戰嗎？</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>動物名稱:<var src=\"#3\">\r\n<p>賭本:<var src=\"#4\">金幣\r\n<p>累積的獎金:<var src=\"#5\">金幣\r\n<p>勝數:<var src=\"#6\"> 連勝\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a action=\"challenge\">挑戰</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">詢問有關動物競技賽的說明</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">販賣競賽票。</a></body>\r\n","dogfight4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can challenge if you bet as much as the one who is waiting... Wanna bet?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Name of master: <var src=\"#1\">\r\n<p>Name of animal: <var src=\"#3\">\r\n<p>Bet: <var src=\"#4\">\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a action=\"challenge\">Challenge</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Colosseum'</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can challenge if you bet as much as the one who is waiting... Wanna bet?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Name of master: <var src=\"#1\">\r\n<p>Name of animal: <var src=\"#3\">\r\n<p>Bet: <var src=\"#4\">\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a action=\"challenge\">Challenge</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Colosseum'</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎 辦蝓濠朝 <var src=\"#1\">塭辦. っ絲擊 勘賊 紫瞪й 熱 氈朝等...и廓 п爾啊熱?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>翕僭 檜葷: <var src=\"#3\">\r\n<p>っ絲: <var src=\"#4\"> 嬴等釭\r\n<p>援瞳脹 鼻旎: <var src=\"#5\"> 嬴等釭\r\n<p>蝓熱: <var src=\"#6\"> 翱蝓\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a action=\"challenge\">紫瞪и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">癱唯 唳晦縑 渠и 撲貲擊 獄棻</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">じ鰍擊 っ棻.</a></body>\r\n","dogfight5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>還在準備當中。</p>\r\n<p>等我準備好了之後再來吧。</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">觀看有關動物競技賽的說明</a>\r\n","dogfight5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...We are not ready!</p>\r\n<p>...Go over there...and come when we're ready.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about 'Animal Colosseum'</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...We are not ready!</p>\r\n<p>...Go over there...and come when we're ready.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about 'Animal Colosseum'</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...嬴霜 遽綠醞檜嶸.</p>\r\n<p>...盪薹縑憮 褻辨�� 氈棻陛 遽綠 棻 腎賊 螃蓬</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">癱唯 唳晦縑 渠и 撲貲擊 獄棻</a>\r\n","dogfight6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在冠軍<var src=\"#1\">的是<var src=\"#2\">跟挑戰者<var src=\"#3\">的<var src=\"#4\">會開始金額高達<var src=\"#5\">金幣的比賽。</p>\r\n<p>現在<var src=\"#2\">等級是<var src=\"#6>已經<var src=\"#7\">場連續勝利，但挑戰的<var src=\"#4\">的等級是<var src=\"#8\">，可能也不簡單。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>不知誰會獲得冠軍，要不要試試看？\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br><a action=\"batting\">試試看</a></body>\r\n","dogfight6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...雖旎擎 濠葬陛 粕獺捱. 釭醞縑 螃蓬.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about Animal Colosseum</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...雖旎擎 濠葬陛 粕獺捱. 釭醞縑 螃蓬.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about Animal Colosseum</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠濠 檜薯 埠 辦蝓濠 <var src=\"#1\">曖 貲唯 <var src=\"#2\">諦 紫瞪濠 <var src=\"#3\">曖 醱唯 <var src=\"#4\"> 餌檜縑 <var src=\"#5\"> 嬴等釭塭朝 橫葆橫葆и 鼻旎擊 勒 諄遺檜 衛濛腆剪嶸.</p>\r\n<p>⑷營 <var src=\"#2\">朝 溯漣檜 <var src=\"#6\">檜堅 檜嘐 <var src=\"#7\">翱蝓擊 剪舒堅 氈雖虜, 紫瞪ж朝 <var src=\"#4\">紫 溯漣檜 <var src=\"#8\">檜棲 虜虜纂朝 彊擊剪嶸.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫飩熱 援陛 檜望雖 頂晦 и 廓 п爾雖 彊擊溥辦?\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br><a action=\"betting\">頂晦蒂 и棻</a></body>","dogfight7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>別吵…我正在做生意。晚點再來。\r\n</body>\r\n","dogfight7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...I'm dealing with the other people. Please come back later.\r\n</body>\r\n","dogfight7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...I'm dealing with the other people. Please come back later.\r\n</body>\r\n","dogfight7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...雖旎 棻艇 餌塋檜嫌 樽晦醞檜棲 釭醞縑 螃澗.\r\n</body>","dogfight8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>終於開始進入競賽了。</p>\r\n<p>目前冠軍<var src=\"#1\">的<var src=\"#2\">的賠率為<var src=\"#3\">，挑戰者<var src=\"#4\">的<var src=\"#5\">的賠率為<var src=\"#6\">。</p>\r\n<p>賭錢的人的心忐忑不安，連口都乾了。呵呵...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogfight8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...There's a game going on now...Come back when it's over.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Colosseum'</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n\r\n","dogfight8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...There's a game going on now...Come back when it's over.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdog\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Colosseum'</a>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n\r\n","dogfight8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠濠 萄蛤橫 唳晦蒂 衛濛ц掘楫.</p>\r\n<p>⑷營 辦蝓濠 <var src=\"#1\">曖 <var src=\"#2\">曖 寡渡徽擎 <var src=\"#3\">, 紫瞪濠 <var src=\"#4\">曖 <var src=\"#5\">曖 寡渡徽擎 <var src=\"#6\">檜螃.</p>\r\n<p>頂晦絲擊 魚 餌塋菟擎 援陛 檜望雖 雖旎 殮寰檜 夥誕夥誕 葆蒂剪嶸. 野野..</p>\r\n</body>","dogfight9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這個競賽的優勝者是<var src=\"#1\">的<var src=\"#2\">。\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">要求獎品</a></body>\r\n","dogfight9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...The winner of this match is <var src=\"#1\">'s <var src=\"#2\">!\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...The winner of this match is <var src=\"#1\">'s <var src=\"#2\">!\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br><a action=\"sell\">Claim the prize</a></body>\r\n","dogfight9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...檜廓 唳晦朝 <var src=\"#1\">曖 <var src=\"#2\">陛 蝓葬ц模.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">辦蝓 鼻旎擊 瓊朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","dogtorn1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>關於動物錦標賽的競賽你覺得如何？登錄費是<var src=\"#1\">金幣。</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"join\">進入『動物錦標賽』</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">讀『動物錦標賽』的說明</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣勝利的票</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How 'bout a game of Animal Tournament? The entry fee is only <var src=\"#1\">adena.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"join\">Enter the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How 'bout a game of Animal Tournament? The entry fee is only <var src=\"#1\">adena.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"join\">Enter the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>翕僭 饜傘試お иっ 橫集蓬? 霤陛綠朝 <var src=\"#1\">嬴等陪等.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"join\">'翕僭 饜傘試お' 唳晦縑 霤陛и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">翕僭 饜傘試お縑 渠и 撲貲擊 獄棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">辦蝓 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","dogtorn2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>看參賽者的名單：</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>名稱&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;等級&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;勝／負</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#1\"><var src=\"#2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#3\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#4\"><var src=\"#5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#6\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#7\"><var src=\"#8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#9\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#10\"><var src=\"#11\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#12\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#13\"><var src=\"#14\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#15\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#16\"><var src=\"#17\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#18\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#19\"><var src=\"#20\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#21\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#22\"><var src=\"#23\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#24\"></p>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>See the list of runners:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Name&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Level&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Win/Lose</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#1\"><var src=\"#2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#3\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#4\"><var src=\"#5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#6\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#7\"><var src=\"#8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#9\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#10\"><var src=\"#11\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#12\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#13\"><var src=\"#14\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#15\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#16\"><var src=\"#17\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#18\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#19\"><var src=\"#20\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#21\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#22\"><var src=\"#23\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#24\"></p>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>See the list of runners:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Name&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Level&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Win/Lose</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#1\"><var src=\"#2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#3\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#4\"><var src=\"#5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#6\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#7\"><var src=\"#8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#9\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#10\"><var src=\"#11\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#12\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#13\"><var src=\"#14\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#15\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#16\"><var src=\"#17\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#18\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#19\"><var src=\"#20\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#21\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#22\"><var src=\"#23\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#24\"></p>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 蛔煙腎橫 氈朝 摹熱曖 貲欽檜嶸:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜葷&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;溯漣&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;蝓 / ぬ</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#1\"><var src=\"#2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#3\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#4\"><var src=\"#5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#6\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#7\"><var src=\"#8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#9\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#10\"><var src=\"#11\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#12\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#13\"><var src=\"#14\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#15\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#16\"><var src=\"#17\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#18\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#19\"><var src=\"#20\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#21\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#22\"><var src=\"#23\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<var src=\"#24\"></p>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","dogtorn3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在比賽要開始了！到哪裡下賭注？</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">下賭注</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">讀關於『動物錦標賽』的說明</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣勝利的票。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The game will begin soon! Place yer bets!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">Bet money</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The game will begin soon! Place yer bets!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">Bet money</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠, 褻旎氈戲賊 饜傘試お陛 衛濛и棻堅! 橫蛤棻 勘啊橫?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">饜傘試お縑 絲擊 勒棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">翕僭 饜傘試お縑 渠и 撲貲擊 獄棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">辦蝓 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","dogtorn4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嘿，比賽正進行到一半唷。</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">讀關於『動物錦標賽』的說明</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣勝利的票。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey!  We're in the middle of a game!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey!  We're in the middle of a game!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎擎 唳晦醞檜撿.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">翕僭 饜傘試お縑 渠и 撲貲擊 獄棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">辦蝓 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","dogtorn5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>比賽還沒準備好，等一下再下注。</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">讀關於『動物錦標賽』的說明</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣勝利的票。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The game isn't ready yet...gotta clean up after those animals.  Please wait a bit.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The game isn't ready yet...gotta clean up after those animals.  Please wait a bit.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎擎 遽綠醞檜棲 褻旎虜 晦棻葬敷.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">翕僭 饜傘試お縑 渠и 撲貲擊 獄棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">辦蝓 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","dogtorn6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>看，那裡已經有８位競賽者了，所以你不能加入。</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">讀關於『動物錦標賽』的說明</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣勝利的票。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Look, sorry - there are already 8 runners. You can't join.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Look, sorry - there are already 8 runners. You can't join.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜瑭, 檜廓 唳晦朝 轎瞪 摹熱 8貲檜 粕離憮 渡褐擎 跤釭陛啊橫.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">翕僭 饜傘試お縑 渠и 撲貲擊 獄棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">辦蝓 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","dogtorn7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>很抱歉，登記時間已經截止。下次請早。</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">讀關於『動物錦標賽』的說明</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣勝利的票。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sorry, but the registration time is over. See ya next game!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sorry, but the registration time is over. See ya next game!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>摹熱 蛔煙 晦除擎 部陬熱棻. 棻擠 唳晦縑 轎瞪ж敷.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">翕僭 饜傘試お縑 渠и 撲貲擊 獄棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">辦蝓 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","dogtorn8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>誰要加入錦標賽？</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog1\">選擇動物</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">讀關於『動物錦標賽』的說明</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣勝利的票</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Who is gonna enter the tournament?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog1\">Select an animal</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Who is gonna enter the tournament?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog1\">Select an animal</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">Read the explanation about the 'Animal Tournament'</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell a winning ticket.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dogtorn8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>饜傘試お縑 頂爾鳥 摹熱蒂 唸薑ж衛掘楫.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"selectdog1\">翕僭擊 摹鷗и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpdogt\">翕僭 饜傘試お縑 渠и 撲貲擊 獄棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">辦蝓 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","dorin-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>朵琳：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n我們可以幫你保管物品。你們人類也許不明白，但是我們的『鐵門』公會有久遠的歷史和值得信賴的服務。你的物品在這裡會很安全的。<br>\r\n一項物品只要３０金幣而且沒有時間限制。當你取回物品的時候，就會結清你的帳戶。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>個人倉庫：<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\">存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\">取出物品</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟倉庫：<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\">存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\">取出物品</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","dorin-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dorin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. It might not make sense to you an' yer human folk, but our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of trustworthy service. Yer items are quite safe with us. <br>\r\nIt'll cost ye, though - 30 adena to retrieve an item or stack o' items regardless of how long ye stored it.  We settle the account when ye get yer items back, an' not before.  However, ye can get yer items at any member of our guild, regardless of place. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dorin-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dorin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. It might not make sense to you an' yer human folk, but our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of trustworthy service. Yer items are quite safe with us. <br>\r\nIt'll cost ye, though - 30 adena to retrieve an item or stack o' items regardless of how long ye stored it.  We settle the account when ye get yer items back, an' not before.  However, ye can get yer items at any member of our guild, regardless of place. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","dorin-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 紫萼:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n僭勒擊 蜆嬴 萄董棲棻. 渡褐菟 檣除菟擎 澀 賅腦啊雖虜, \r\n辦葬 '鬼繹曖 僥' 望萄朝 螃楠 羲餌蒂 陛霞 ががи 褻霜檜塭螃.\r\n凳萇 寰褕ж堅 蜆晦紫煙 п蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n陛問擎 僭勒 ж釭渡 鼠褻勒 30嬴等釭, 絲擎 僭勒擊 瓊擊 陽 頂朝 剪蹂.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>偃檣 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑸裊 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","dorinl-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>朵琳：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嘿，為什麼我們要幫你這種無名小子儲存物品？如果你要享用我們的服務，給自己爭取個名號再來吧。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","dorinl-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dorin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Aye, why should we store items for some nameless whelp such as you? If ye want to use our service, make a name for yerself. Come back when ye've earned some fame - and levels.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","dorinl-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Dorin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Aye, why should we store items for some nameless whelp such as you? If ye want to use our service, make a name for yerself. Come back when ye've earned some fame - and levels.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","dorinl-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 紫萼:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>檜瑭蹂, 辦葬陛 劂 圖堅 渡褐偽擎 Е啻晦曖 僭勒擊 蜆嬴遽欽 蜓檜螃? 僭勒擊 蜆晦堅 談棻賊 檜葷擊 覬 陳萼 棻擠縑 螃衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","doris1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>桃瑞絲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n莫麗雅天天研究奇奇怪怪的東西和神秘的研究。雖然對於她的研究我不太了解，但我保證她一定是研究非常偉大的東西。我每天都聽到從她那傳來的霹哩啪啦爆炸聲音。噓...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","doris1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>紫葬蝶 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n翱旎獎餌 賅葬嬴朝 樹薯釭 褐晦и 翱掘虜擊 ж堅 氈橫蹂. 劂 ж朝 雖朝 澀 賅腦啊雖虜 渠欽и 橾擊 ж朝 匙擎 碟貲п蹂. ж瑞紫 緒雖雖 彊堅 髡и ァ嫦擠檜 菟溥螃棲 蜓檜蹂...�饑�\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","duck1-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>鴨子:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>呱呱呱...呱呱呱...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","duck1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Duck:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Quack!...quack.  Quack.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","duck1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Duck:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Quack!...quack.  Quack.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","duck1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>螃葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>脰脰脰...紱縑縈</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dunboard1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align = center>地下訓練場</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這個地方由甘特和哈汀發現，而且被甘特和吉倫轉換成一個訓練騎士的地方。</p>\r\n<p>那些膽小、對刀劍不熟練的人不能進來，只有強壯又熟練的人才能進入。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dunboard1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align = center>Underground training ground</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This place was discovered by Gunter and Hardin, and was converted into a training ground for knights by Gunter and Gereng. </p>\r\n<p>Those who are timid of heart and unskilled of sword - Do Not Enter. Only the strong and skilled may proceed.</p>\r\n</body>","dunboard1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align = center>Underground training ground</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This place was discovered by Gunter and Hardin, and was converted into a training ground for knights by Gunter and Gereng. </p>\r\n<p>Those who are timid of heart and unskilled of sword - Do Not Enter. Only the strong and skilled may proceed.</p>\r\n</body>","dunboard1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align = center>雖ж 熱溼濰</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 夠擎 捱攪諦 ж蛞縑 曖п 嫦唯腎堅, 捱攪諦 啪滅縑 曖п 虜菟橫 霞 晦餌菟曖 熱溼濰檜棻. </p>\r\n<p>匐婁 л眷 骯 撮錯檜 橾繭и 濠朝 л睡煎 檜夠縑 菟橫螃雖 蜓塭, 檜夠擎 褒溘氈朝 濠菟擊 嬪и 夠檜棲.</p>\r\n</body>","dunboard2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>甘特和哈汀雖然想要消滅在這個島上的邪惡之王，但他沒有成功，只能封印住他。因此，邪惡之王的靈魂跟身體還留在這裡，而且被稱為永恆迷宮之王—『巴風特』。</p>\r\n<p>那些想要挑戰他的人大可以進入。不過別忘了－你將會失敗。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p align = right>甘特</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","dunboard2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Within this place the evil lord of the island, who Gunter and Hardin tried unsuccessfully to destroy, remains sealed. To this day, the evil lord's undying soul and body remain here, and the being once called \"Baphomet\" has become the eternal lord of this labyrinth.</p>\r\n<p>Those who wish to challenge him may enter. But know this - you will most certainly fail.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p align = right>Gunter</p>\r\n</body>","dunboard2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Within this place the evil lord of the island, who Gunter and Hardin tried unsuccessfully to destroy, remains sealed. To this day, the evil lord's undying soul and body remain here, and the being once called \"Baphomet\" has become the eternal lord of this labyrinth.</p>\r\n<p>Those who wish to challenge him may enter. But know this - you will most certainly fail.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p align = right>Gunter</p>\r\n</body>","dunboard2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>檜夠擎 釭 捱攪諦 ж蛞檜 唸措 籀葬ж雖 跤и, 檜 撰曖 餌學и 輿檣檜 瑰檣腎橫 氈朝 夠. 斜 幫羹諦 艙�母� 碳資л戲煎 檣п 檜薯朝 檜 嘐掙虜曖 艙錳и 輿檣檜 脹 濠曖 檜葷擎 '夥ん詭お'.</p>\r\n<p>斜縑啪 紫瞪ж堅濠 ж朝 濠朝 檜 僥擊 鱔婁п紫 謠棻. ж雖虜, 斜渠朝 褒ぬй 匙檜棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p align = right>捱攪</p>\r\n</body>","dunkan1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>鄧肯：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我聽說國王又換人了。算了，反正我們也沒有資格去討論在上位的人在做什麼，但是每次換國王就要加稅...<br>唉…那要我們怎麼活呀！我真懷疑他要那麼多錢做什麼！\r\n</body>\r\n","dunkan1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Dunkan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I've heard that the Lord has changed again. Even though we are not in a position to discuss the doings of our betters, the tax seems to increas everytime the Lord changes.... <br>it's hard to make a living. Well, I wonder what they -do- with all that money?\r\n</body>\r\n","dunkan1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Dunkan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I've heard that the Lord has changed again. Even though we are not in a position to discuss the doings of our betters, the tax seems to increas everytime the Lord changes.... <br>it's hard to make a living. Well, I wonder what they -do- with all that money?\r\n</body>\r\n","dunkan1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>湍鐘:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>譆斬 傳 艙輿椒檜 夥船歷棻賊憮蹂. 嬪曖 碟菟 ж衛朝 橾檜撿 辦葬偽擎 階稱檜菟檜 憲夥 嬴棲雖虜, 艙輿椒檜 夥莞 陽葆棻 撮旎擎 鼠剪錶虜 陛棲 橫蛤 髦熱陛 氈釭蹂. 霤 釭, 艙輿椒擎 斜 號擎 絲 務橫憮 棻 橫蛤棻 噙朝雖...\r\n</body>","dunsign1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>牆上的魔法雕像：</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>共有３條路可以到達禁地：</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;第一條是遙遠又危險的路，但卻是最直接的。</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;第二條路是最簡單但卻最蜿蜒的路，那些選擇困難路徑的人最後將會遭遇不幸。</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;第三條路是隱藏的路。鑰匙放在盒子裡面，但是在盒子裡面，死亡也在等著你們。</p>\r\n</font>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","dunsign1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Magical runes carved on wall:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are three roads to reach the forbidden place:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;The first is a long and hazardous road, but also a honest one.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;The second is the easy but dishonest road. Those who take the deceitful path eventually encounter disaster.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;The third is the hidden road. The key is within the boxes, but inside the boxes, death also awaits you.</p>\r\n</font>\r\n</body>","dunsign1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Magical runes carved on wall:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are three roads to reach the forbidden place:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;The first is a long and hazardous road, but also a honest one.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;The second is the easy but dishonest road. Those who take the deceitful path eventually encounter disaster.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;The third is the hidden road. The key is within the boxes, but inside the boxes, death also awaits you.</p>\r\n</font>\r\n</body>","dunsign1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>漁縑 億啖螳 氈朝 葆徹僥濠:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>旎雖脹 匙縑 陛晦 嬪и 望擎 3陛雖:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;羅廓簞 望擎 詩堅 яж釭 薑霜и 望.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;舒廓簞 望擎 蓮辦釭 睡薑и 望. 睡薑и 望擊 陛朝 濠曖 譆�醴� �降� 氈戲葬.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;撮廓簞 望擎 獗啖霞 望. 翮潸朝 鼻濠菟 樓縑, 斜楝釭 避擠 傳и 鼻濠菟 寰縑.</p>\r\n</font>\r\n</body>","dunsign2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>牆上的魔法雕像：</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我問自己在做什麼。我在逃避嗎？\r\n<p>那麼為什麼我寫這些話在這裡？為什麼我必須寫下線索跟暗示，指點出『他』的下落？\r\n<p>我不了解我自己...也許我被內疚刺激、也許我暗地裡希望有人去揭露我的罪並交付審判...\r\n<p>但還不行...時候未到...\r\n</body>\r\n","dunsign2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Magical Glyphs carved on wall:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I ask myself what am I doing. Am I fleeing?\r\n<p>Then why do I write these words in this place? Why must I write clues and hints, pointing to \"his\" whereabouts?\r\n<p>...I do not understand this myself...Mayhap I am motivated by guilt. Mayhap I am secretly wishing someone to uncover my sins and pass judgement...\r\n<p>...But not yet...It is too early...\r\n</body>\r\n","dunsign2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Magical Glyphs carved on wall:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I ask myself what am I doing. Am I fleeing?\r\n<p>Then why do I write these words in this place? Why must I write clues and hints, pointing to \"his\" whereabouts?\r\n<p>...I do not understand this myself...Mayhap I am motivated by guilt. Mayhap I am secretly wishing someone to uncover my sins and pass judgement...\r\n<p>...But not yet...It is too early...\r\n</body>\r\n","dunsign2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>漁縑 億啖螳 氈朝 葆徹僥濠:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>頂陛 雖旎 鼠歙擊 ж堅 氈朝 匙檜雖? 紫蜂纂堅 氈朝 匙檣陛?\r\n<p>斜溢棻賊 橫簞憮 釭朝 檜楛 夠縑 旋擊 億晦堅 氈朝 匙檜雖? 橫簞憮 斜 嶸瞳 漁縑 '斜'縑啪煎 陛朝 �爩捂� 瞳橫場擎 匙檜雖?\r\n<p>...賅腦啊棻...釭朝 橫翹賊 賸疇馬檜塭朝 匙擊 替郭堅 氈朝雖紫 賅艇棻. 援捱陛陛 樹薇陛 釭曖 賸蒂 嫦唯п 釭蒂 褕っп 輿晦蒂 夥塭朝 匙橾雖紫...\r\n<p>...ж雖虜 斜 陽朝 雖旎擎 嬴棲撿...雖旎擎 嬴霜 橾楝...\r\n</body>","eban1-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>伊班:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n擁有血盟小屋的人需要每個月付一次的稅。不然的話，領主會沒收你的房子。\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","eban1-e.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Eban :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nWhoever owns the house should not forget to pay taxes to the Lord. If something goes wrong and you make the Lord angry you may lose your house.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","eban1-j.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Eban :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nWho ever owns the house should not forget to pay taxes to the Lord. If something goes wrong and you make the Lord angry you may loose your house.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","eban1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縑奩 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n餵擊 陛霞碟擎 斜 渠陛煎 衙殖 艙輿椒眷 撮旎擊 夥纂朝 匙擊 濱雖 蜓嬴撿м棲棻. 澀跤п憮 艙輿椒擊 �韋狐� и棻賊 渡濰 餵擊 貍憾嬴 陞雖紫 賅腦朝 橾檜剪萇蹂.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","elce1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">艾爾：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你很怪異...你的眼神令我感到顫抖與恐懼。\r\n</p>\r\n<p>難道你是...跟隨格蘭肯的黑暗妖精？真是噁心...快滾！<br>\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","elCE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">El:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are odd...just seeing your eyes makes me shiver.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Are you the dark elf who follows Gran Kain?  Fie!\r\nGet out of my way right now!<br>\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","elCE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">El:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are odd...just seeing your eyes makes me shiver.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Are you the dark elf who follows Gran Kain?  Fie!\r\nGet out of my way right now!<br>\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","elCE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">縣:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐 劃陛 檜鼻п蹂. 渡褐曖 換擊 爾堅 氈戲賊 凳陛 \r\n港港ж堅 擠蝗и 替釵檜 菟橫.</p>\r\n<p>�公� 渡褐檜 斜嫌蘋檣擊 評腦朝 橫菸曖 蹂薑? 晦碟 釭緒.. \r\n橫憮 頂 擅縑憮 餌塭螳 幗溥蹂!<br>     \r\n</p>\r\n</body>     \r\n","ele1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">艾爾：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n記得要累積財富與同情...\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n這是妖精們的公有倉庫，你可以把任何東西放在這裡，\r\n只是在森林之外你就沒辦法看到這裡。\r\n雖然我聽說另外有侏儒在經營的倉庫。哈哈哈...但願是有...\r\n<br>\r\n我曾經在森林遊玩並且旅遊全世界…\r\n現在卻無法離開，只因為我是倉庫的看守者…\r\n<br>\r\n儘管如此，這些都是我必須為這職責所付出的...\r\n你取回物品時。我會按照規定向你收取２個純粹米索莉塊。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>公有倉庫：<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-elven\">存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-elven\">取回物品</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","elE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">El:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nRemember to accumulate not just wealth, but also compassion...\r\n<br>\r\n\r\nThis is the communal storage for elves. You can put anything here,\r\nbut you won't find it again outside of the forest.\r\nI heard that there are other storage repositories run by dwarves. Hah!  I wish\r\n<br>\r\nI were playing in the forest and travelling the world... but I can't even move\r\ndue to my responsibility as a storage keeper...'tis a sad thing, being pinned here like a dwarf.\r\n<br>\r\nUnfortunately, even though it's communal I still have to be paid - I'll\r\ncollect two mithrils when you retrieve your items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Communal Storage:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-elven\">store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-elven\">retrieve item</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","elE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">El:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nRemember to accumulate not just wealth, but also compassion...\r\n<br>\r\n\r\nThis is the communal storage for elves. You can put anything here,\r\nbut you won't find it again outside of the forest.\r\nI heard that there are other storage repositories run by dwarves. Hah!  I wish\r\n<br>\r\nI were playing in the forest and travelling the world... but I can't even move\r\ndue to my responsibility as a storage keeper...'tis a sad thing, being pinned here like a dwarf.\r\n<br>\r\nUnfortunately, even though it's communal I still have to be paid - I'll\r\ncollect two mithrils when you retrieve your items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Communal Storage:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-elven\">store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-elven\">retrieve item</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","elE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">縣:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n賅戲朝 營�倍� 漆ヰ朝 檣薑曖 �譬鷍埬� 晦橘ж貊..\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n罹晦朝 蹂薑菟曖 奢辨璽堅縑蹂. 鼠歙檜萇 蜆望 熱 氈雖虜,\r\n蹂薑曖 膛 夥梨縑憮 僭勒擊 瓊擊 熱朝 橈橫蹂. 膛 夥梨縑摹\r\n陪爵檜菟檜 遴艙ж朝 璽堅陛 氈棻雖蹂?\r\n\r\n<br>\r\nж嬴.. 釭紫 膛擊 嗨橫棻棲貊 撮鼻擊 罹чж堅 談擎等..\r\n璽堅雖晦蒂 蜆啪 腎橫憮 褻旎紫 遺霜橾 熱 橈朝 褐撮塭棲..\r\n<br>\r\n凳 嬴鼠が, 奢辨璽堅檜曹 ж雖虜 璽堅雖晦檣 盪紫 渠陛蒂\r\n嫡嬴撿 ж晦 陽僥縑.. ④⑩. 敘薑 鼻 僭勒擊 瓊嬴陛褒 陽\r\n嘐蝶萵2偃蒂 嫡紫煙 腎橫 氈港棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>奢辨 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-elven\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-elven\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n</body>     \r\n","elf-c.tbl":"39\r\n        妖精\r\n\r\n  在亞丁王國的東方\r\n  有座『迷幻森林』，\r\n   住在那兒的妖精\r\n  有躲避人類的傾向。\r\n\r\n 他們有著人類的特徵，\r\n 偶爾，也會和人類交際\r\n   甚至守護人類。\r\n\r\n  不論是愛或被愛\r\n   妖精都是照著\r\n  世界與萬物的神\r\n --殷海薩--的意志，\r\n 而創造出來的生物。\r\n\r\n 他們很明白自己的命運\r\n       同時\r\n 也觀察著人類的行為。\r\n   他們不吝惜地\r\n 熱心真誠地對待人類。\r\n\r\n    比起其他職業，\r\n 妖精有最佳的敏捷力。\r\n    此外也能使用\r\n  多種武器與魔法。\r\n    不過有時候，\r\n 他們無法在人類社會中\r\n     自由地活動。\r\n\r\n   世界上有些村莊，\r\n  對於非人類的種族\r\n  決不會善意地對待。\r\n      也就是說，\r\n有些怪物和人類攻擊他們\r\n 就只是因為他們是個\r\n       妖精。\r\n","elf-e.tbl":"46\r\nElves\r\n\r\nThe Elven race inhabits\r\nthe Elven Forest, located\r\nin the eastern part of \r\nthe Kingdom of Aden. \r\nThe Elvenkind tend to \r\navoid contact with humans,\r\nbut occasionally they are\r\nknown to form friendship\r\nbonds with special members\r\nof the short-lived race.\r\n\r\nElves are naturally \r\ndexterous, and this a \r\ngreat aid to those who\r\nchoose to follow the path\r\nof archery.  Additionally,\r\nElves are second only to\r\nhuman wizards in magic,\r\nand sometimes are quite\r\nintelligent and wise to \r\nsupport this tendency. \r\n\r\nOther elves choose to \r\nfocus on their constitution\r\nto go head-to-head to \r\ncleanse the land of the \r\nmonstrous swarms that can\r\nencroach on the Elven Forest.\r\nTruly, Elves are among the\r\nmost flexible of races in\r\nterms of the roles they can\r\nplay.  However, elves are\r\nnot universally loved \r\noutside of their forest, and\r\nthere are places where humans\r\nare accepted where elves are\r\nhunted.\r\n\r\nElves start out with \r\nnight vision, which allows\r\nthem to see clearly even\r\nat night outside.\r\n\r\n\r\n","elf-j.tbl":"46\r\nElves\r\n\r\nThe Elven race inhabits\r\nthe Elven Forest, located\r\nin the eastern part of \r\nthe Kingdom of Aden. \r\nThe Elvenkind tend to \r\navoid contact with humans,\r\nbut occasionally they are\r\nknown to form friendship\r\nbonds with special members\r\nof the short-lived race.\r\n\r\nElves are naturally \r\ndexterous, and this a \r\ngreat aid to those who\r\nchoose to follow the path\r\nof archery.  Additionally,\r\nElves are second only to\r\nhuman wizards in magic,\r\nand sometimes are quite\r\nintelligent and wise to \r\nsupport this tendency. \r\n\r\nOther elves choose to \r\nfocus on their constitution\r\nto go head-to-head to \r\ncleanse the land of the \r\nmonstrous swarms that can\r\nencroach on the Elven Forest.\r\nTruly, Elves are among the\r\nmost flexible of races in\r\nterms of the roles they can\r\nplay.  However, elves are\r\nnot universally loved \r\noutside of their forest, and\r\nthere are places where humans\r\nare accepted where elves are\r\nhunted.\r\n\r\nElves start out with \r\nnight vision, which allows\r\nthem to see clearly even\r\nat night outside.\r\n\r\n\r\n","elf-k.tbl":"39\r\n蹂薑\r\n\r\n嬴筆 諾措 醞憮睡曖 '蹂薑\r\n曖 膛'縑 剪薄擊 葆溼ж堅\r\n氈朝  蹂薑褶菟擎  濠翱曖\r\n�亳鰾� 斜菟曖  か撩鼻 檣\r\n除婁 蕾ж朝 匙擊  Яж雖\r\n虜, 斜  援掘爾棻  檣除擊\r\n嬪п 撮鼻擊 璽褻и '摹и\r\n褐' 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 嗆縑 評\r\n塭 陽煎朝 檣除擊  熱��ж\r\n晦 嬪п,  陽煎朝  檣除擊\r\n餌嫌ж晦 嬪п(傳朝  餌嫌\r\n嫡晦 嬪п) 檣除婁 婦啗м\r\n棲棻. \r\nж雖虜 檜菟擎 濠褐曖  檜\r\n楝и 遴貲擊 憲堅 氈晦 陽\r\n僥縑 棻艇 援掘爾棻紫  陳\r\n蘋照啪 濠褐婁 婦啗й  檣\r\n除菟擊 ゎ陛ж堅,  睡瞳м\r\nи 濠菟縑啪 衙薑ж啪  渠\r\nж晦蒂 輿盪ж雖 彊蝗棲棻\r\n.\r\n\r\n蹂薑擎 賅萇 贗楚蝶 醞 陛\r\n濰 敕⑽濩�� 棟溘纂蒂  陛\r\n雖堅 氈蝗棲棻. 傳и 檜菟\r\n擎 號擎 謙盟曖 鼠晦蒂 棻\r\n瑙 熱 氈戲貊 傳и 葆徹瞳\r\n檣 棟溘紫 陛雖堅  氈蝗棲\r\n棻. \r\nж雖虜 賃賃 跨蝶攪菟煎睡\r\n攪 蹂薑檜塭朝 檜嶸煎  奢\r\n問擊 嫡朝 唳辦紫  氈戲貊\r\n檣除 檜諼曖 謙褶擊  疏葬\r\n朝 葆擊縑憮朝 渠蕾擊  嫡\r\n雖 跤ж朝 蛔 檣除檜 虜萇\r\n餌�� 頂縑憮曖 薯и檜  號\r\n蝗棲棻.\r\n","eliza1-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>伊麗莎:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>許多可怕的怪物住在城堡外面附近。若要去比較遠的地方，需要準備齊全才行。 </p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","eliza1-e.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Eliza :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>There are many strong monsters living outside the guard tower. You should get prepared if you are planning a long trip.</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","eliza1-j.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Eliza :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>There are many strong monsters living outside the guard tower. You should get prepared if you are planning a long trip.</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","eliza1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縣葬濠 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>陛萄 顫錶 夥梨薹縑朝 鼠憮遴 跨蝶攪菟檜 號檜 髦堅 氈港棲棻. 詩葬 罹чж褒 橾檜 氈戲衛棻賊 遽綠蒂 欽欽�� ж衛朝啪 謠擊 剪縑蹂.</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","ellne1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>伊連：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>耕作被燃燒的地區？我們在這被燃燒過的森林區域進行耕作。這些土地只能使用三到四年，然後這又將由肥沃回歸貧脊。之後我們就必須離開再去燃燒其他的森林。\r\n<p>我們今年才來到這裡，所以我們能在這裡居住三到四年之久。哎∼何時才能有個安定的生活呢？\r\n</body>\r\n","ellne1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ellne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Farming the burnt field - bah. It's just sowing seeds in the field after burning the forest. We can use the field for three to four years, but then the earth loses its meager fertility. Then we must move, and burn another forest.\r\n<p>We came here this year, so we can stay here for a few years.  But is this all there is to life?  Shouldn't there be more?\r\n</body>\r\n","ellne1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ellne:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Farming the burnt field - bah. It's just sowing seeds in the field after burning the forest. We can use the field for three to four years, but then the earth loses its meager fertility. Then we must move, and burn another forest.\r\n<p>We came here this year, so we can stay here for a few years.  But is this all there is to life?  Shouldn't there be more?\r\n</body>\r\n","ellne1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縣艇:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>�倣� 堯徹? 爾衛棻衛Я 葆擊 輿滲曖 膛擊 鷓遴 棻擠 碳驕 濠葬縑棻 寧濛僭擊 褕朝剪轄. 3, 4喇鎢 и夠縑憮 唳濛擊 ж堅 氈戲賊 雖溘檜 棻ж棲 棻艇 夠戲煎 檜翕擊 п憮 傳 斜 斬籀 膛擊 鷓辦堅...\r\n<p>螢п 檜夠戲煎 衡啖諮戲棲 罹晦憮 傳 и 3, 4喇 髦嬴撿轄. 嬴檜掘..樹薯釭 檜 儅�� 慇橫陳梱.\r\n</body>","elm1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">艾爾：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n喔？你...難道是...人類？\r\n<br>\r\n哇！我以前從沒有看過人類。難道你就是那個傳說中像流星一樣可以劃過黑暗長夜的人類？說真的，在妖精的城鎮中看見人類真是一件稀罕的事。\r\n<br>\r\n長老們非常不喜歡人類，而且守護神也會攻擊人類，但是我喜歡人類。\r\n即使你的生命很短暫，但是你燃燒生命去試著活出自己的人生道路。我真的認為生命就像一顆慧星，因此生命讓你們成為世界的擁有者。甚至可以這麼說吧，妖精們的傲慢一定是由於嫉妒他們所看見的人類行為，大概這也是他們為什麼要與外面的人類建立關係的原因。\r\n<br>\r\n我想從你這兒聽到更多外面的事情。可是很抱歉，我正忙著我的工作。唉∼要到什麼時候，我才能去外面的世界看看呢...？\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","elM1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">El:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nYou ... are, perhaps... Human?\r\n<br>\r\nAmazing! I've never seen a human before. You are the kind who is supposed to blaze through the long night like a falling star?  'Tis a rare thing to see human in the Elven Town.\r\n<br>\r\nBeware, for the Elders don't like humankind very much, and the guardians will attack you.  I like humans, though -\r\neven though your lives are short, you consume your life force, living your life to the fullest.  It, I think, is exactly the force that has made you the owners of the world. Even we haughty elves must be envious, and mayhaps that's why they are forming relationships with humans in the outside.\r\n<br>\r\nI'd love to hear more about the outside from you, but I'm so busy with my work.  What must it be like to have your life be so fleeting?  If only I could go to the outside world!\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","elM1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">El:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nYou ... are, perhaps... Human?\r\n<br>\r\nAmazing! I've never seen a human before. You are the kind who is supposed to blaze through the long night like a falling star?  'Tis a rare thing to see human in the Elven Town.\r\n<br>\r\nBeware, for the Elders don't like humankind very much, and the guardians will attack you.  I like humans, though -\r\neven though your lives are short, you consume your life force, living your life to the fullest.  It, I think, is exactly the force that has made you the owners of the world. Even we haughty elves must be envious, and mayhaps that's why they are forming relationships with humans in the outside.\r\n<br>\r\nI'd love to hear more about the outside from you, but I'm so busy with my work.  What must it be like to have your life be so fleeting?  If only I could go to the outside world!\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","elM1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">縣:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n橫? �公� 渡褐... 檣除?   \r\n<br>   \r\n諦嬴! 釭 檣除擎 籀擠 瑭蹂. 晦釭曹 嫘擊 穠擎 嶸撩籀歲   \r\n雖釭除棻朝 斜 檣除檜煎捱蹂? ж雖虜 蹂薑曖 葆擊縑憮   \r\n檣除擊 獄棻朝 勒 斛�� 萄僥 橾檣等?   \r\n<br>  \r\n葆擊曖 橫艇菟擎 檣除擊 斜棻雖 謠嬴ж雖 彊朝 蛭ж堅,  \r\n熱��濠菟擎 褕雖橫 膛縑 菟橫 螞 檣除擊 奢問ж晦紫 ж雖虜,  \r\n陪 檣除檜 謠嬴蹂. 綠煙 穠雖虜 碳粒籀歲 換睡衛啪 骯�倆牉�  \r\n翮褕�� 髦嬴陛朝 渡褐菟曖 儅貲溘檜 蜓 斜渠煎 嶸撩婁  \r\n偽棻堅 儅陝п蹂. 斜楛 ��檜 渡褐菟擊 撮鼻曖 輿檣戲煎  \r\n虜菟歷濫嬴蹂? 斜葬堅 參戲煩 辦轍п ж雖虜 蹂薑菟紫 斜楛  \r\n檣除檜 睡楝錶憮 號擎 蹂薑菟檜 撮鼻縑 釭陛 檣除菟婁  \r\n婦啗蒂 裕堅 氈朝 剪掘蹂. \r\n<br> \r\n \r\n渡褐縑啪 夥梨 撮鼻縑 渠п 渦 號擎 勘 菔堅 談雖虜, \r\n賸歎ж啻蹂. 瞪 盪曖 橾煎 夥際剪萇蹂. �瓡�.. 陪 樹薯鎢 \r\n夥梨 撮鼻縑 釭陛獐梱..\r\n\r\n</body>     \r\n","elmina-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>艾米娜：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡...歡迎光臨，這裡販賣各類藥水和收購魔術書喔</p>\r\n<p>便宜賣出，高價收購，歡迎參觀。</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n<a action=\"elmina3\">詢問最近的稅率。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","elmina-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Elmina:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>C..come in. I'm selling potions or scrolls...</p>\r\n<p>...at a bargain price... please buy...</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n<a action=\"elmina3\">Ask about the current prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","elmina-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Elmina:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>C..come in. I'm selling potions or scrolls...</p>\r\n<p>...at a bargain price... please buy...</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n<a action=\"elmina3\">Ask about the current prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","elmina-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縣嘐釭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫...橫憮螃撮蹂. 僭擒檜釭 輿僥憮 で棲棻...</p>\r\n<p>...諄啪 萄萵纔棲 號檜 餌陛撮蹂...</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n<a action=\"elmina3\">蹂闈 僭陛縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","elmina1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>艾米娜：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這...這裡沒有東西可以賣給你！要是你還不趕快離開這裡，我...我就去叫警衛來！</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","elmina1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Elmina:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I..I have nothing to sell to you! If you don't go out now I'll call a g..guardian!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","elmina1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Elmina:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I..I have nothing to sell to you! If you don't go out now I'll call a g..guardian!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","elmina1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縣嘐釭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>棻..渡褐и纔 つ 僭勒擎 橈橫蹂! 說葬 罹晦縑憮 寰釭陛賊 啖...唳綠蒂 睡蒂纔撿!</p>\r\n</body>","elmina3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>艾米娜：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>最近是<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">％</font>。你問這個做什麼？</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","elmina3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Elmina:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>N..nowadays it's all about<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>. </p>\r\n</body>\r\n","elmina3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Elmina:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>N..nowadays it's all about<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>. </p>\r\n</body>\r\n","elmina3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縣嘐釭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂...蹂闈擎 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>鎢 ж釭瑭蹂. </p>\r\n</body>","engineer-c.tbl":"37\r\n鍛冶師\r\n\r\n鍛冶師追求著\r\n『科學與技術』\r\n這是跟魔法\r\n完全不同\r\n且相反的知識。\r\n他嘲笑著魔法師\r\n在他們的知識中\r\n世界是因為神的眷顧，\r\n發現許多自然的法則\r\n和醫學的知識；\r\n並發明許多裝置來使用。\r\n雖然大部分的時候，\r\n他們是樂觀主義者，\r\n相信發展技術會讓世界\r\n更美好；\r\n但是其中有一些人\r\n有著黑暗的邪惡渴望，\r\n因而試著用技術來克服\r\n他們相較魔法師或騎士的\r\n自卑。\r\n\r\n鍛冶師能夠自行製造武器、\r\n盔甲以及一些只有鍛冶師\r\n能使用的特別物品；\r\n因此能克服他們所不擅長\r\n的格鬥能力和魔法。\r\n他可以發展新的技術，\r\n以獲得新的東西。\r\n此外，\r\n鍛冶師也是偉大的戰術家。\r\n他製作出來的道具，\r\n其強大的威力\r\n在殘酷的戰爭中獲得證明。","engineer-e.tbl":"37\r\nEngineer\r\n\r\nEngineer pursues 'science\r\nand technology' in real\r\nsense different from\r\nmagic. He sneers wizard\r\nwho decribe the world as\r\npower and providence of\r\nGod, discovers physical\r\nlaw and medical knowledge\r\nand invents many devices\r\nin application of their\r\nknowledge. While most of\r\nthem are optimists who\r\nbelieve development of\r\ntechnology improve the\r\nworld happily, some of\r\nthem have dark aspect to\r\ntry to overcome their\r\ninferiority by means of\r\ntechnology.\r\n\r\nEngineer can make weapon,\r\narmor and some special\r\nthing only engineer can\r\nuse. Of course, engineer\r\ncan overcome his lower\r\nfighting ability and\r\nmagic he can't obtain due\r\nto disbelief by\r\ndeveloping new\r\ntechnology. Besides,\r\nengineer is so great a\r\nstrategist that he\r\ndemonstrates mighty force\r\nin war between Blood\r\nPledges.\r\n","engineer-j.tbl":"37\r\nEngineer\r\n\r\nEngineer pursues 'science\r\nand technology' in real\r\nsense different from\r\nmagic. He sneers wizard\r\nwho decribe the world as\r\npower and providence of\r\nGod, discovers physical\r\nlaw and medical knowledge\r\nand invents many devices\r\nin application of their\r\nknowledge. While most of\r\nthem are optimists who\r\nbelieve development of\r\ntechnology improve the\r\nworld happily, some of\r\nthem have dark aspect to\r\ntry to overcome their\r\ninferiority by means of\r\ntechnology.\r\n\r\nEngineer can make weapon,\r\narmor and some special\r\nthing only engineer can\r\nuse. Of course, engineer\r\ncan overcome his lower\r\nfighting ability and\r\nmagic he can't obtain due\r\nto disbelief by\r\ndeveloping new\r\ntechnology. Besides,\r\nengineer is so great a\r\nstrategist that he\r\ndemonstrates mighty force\r\nin war between Blood\r\nPledges.\r\n","engineer-k.tbl":"43\r\n晦獎濠\r\n\r\n檜菟擎 葆徹婁朝 棻艇  霞\r\n薑и 曖嘐縑憮曖  '婁з婁\r\n晦獎'擊 蹺掘ж朝  餌塋菟\r\n殮棲棻. 檜菟擎 撮鼻擊 褐\r\n曖 ��婁 撥葬煎  撲貲ж朝\r\n葆徹餌菟擊 綠醒戲貊 渠褐\r\n僭葬 徹罌婁 曖з瞳  雖衝\r\n擊 嫦唯п 頂歷堅, 檜楝и\r\n錳葬蒂 檜辨ж罹 號擎  嫦\r\n貲ヶ擊 虜菟橫 頂堅  氈蝗\r\n棲棻.\r\n檜菟擎 渠睡碟 晦獎曖  嫦\r\n瞪檜 撮鼻擊 摹ж堅  ч犒\r\nж啪 夥紱葬塭堅 圖堅  氈\r\n朝 雀虜輿曖濠 菟檜雖虜, \r\n偃醞縑朝 濠褐曖 葆擠  樓\r\n桶擎 夠縑 氈朝  翮蛔馬擊\r\n晦獎檜塭朝  渠鼻擊  鱔п\r\n斛犒ж堅濠  ж朝  橫舒遴\r\n欽賊擊 陛霞 餌塋菟紫  氈\r\n蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n晦獎濠朝 鼠晦諦 寞橫掘蒂\r\n虜菟 熱 氈戲貊, 偃醞縑朝\r\n晦獎濠虜檜 餌辨й 熱  氈\r\n朝 嬴輿 か檜ж堅  鬼溘и\r\n匙菟紫 氈蝗棲棻.  檜菟擎\r\n棻艇 贗楚蝶縑 綠п  雲橫\r\n雖朝 瞪癱 棟溘, か�� '圖\r\n雖 彊擠戲煎 п憮 橢雖 跤\r\nи' 葆徹瞳 棟溘擊 檜楝и\r\n褐晦獎 偃嫦煎 斛犒п  鹿\r\n棲棻. \r\n傳и  晦獎濠菟擎  嗨橫陪\r\n瞪楞陛煎賦 ⑸裊郭葬曖 餵\r\n欽瞪 衛 斜 嬪溘擊 嫦�秷�\r\n晦紫 м棲棻. 瞪癱縑 氈橫\r\n憮曖 斜菟曖 棟溘擎  餵欽\r\n瞪縑憮撿蜓煎  斜  霞薑и\r\n賊賅蒂 爾檣棻堅 п紫  婁\r\n樹檜 嬴椎棲棻.\r\n","ente1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>安特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>……</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ente2\">問關於收集的事</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ente1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ente2\">Ask about collecting</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ente1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ente2\">Ask about collecting</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ente1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縛お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ente2\">瓣餵縑 渠п 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>","ente2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>安特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>妖精...你需要...我的枝脈、樹皮、水果...</p>\r\n<p>枝脈、水果、我的莖、恰好的陽光、過來吧！但是...得到...樹皮...我需要...蘑菇汁...！</p>\r\n<p>枝脈、<font fg=ffffff>箭</font>、樹皮、<font fg=ffffff>盔甲</font>、水果、<font fg=ffffff>治癒</font>...</p>\r\n<p>我的枝脈...吃吧...<font fg=ffffff>中和毒性...</font></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>萬世萬物皆來自我...妖精們...好使用...快樂...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ente2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Fairy. Me. Twig, Bark, Fruit need.</p>\r\n<p>Twig. Fruit, My stem. Pat light. Come. But. Bark. Fungus Juice. Give me. Get.</p>\r\n<p>With twig. <font fg=ffffff>Arrow</font>.. With Bark. <font fg=ffffff>Armor</font>.. With Fruit. <font fg=ffffff>Heal</font>.</p>\r\n<p>My twig, eat. <font fg=ffffff>neutralize poison.</font></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Everything from me. Elf. Use well. Happy.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","ente2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Fairy. Me. Twig, Bark, Fruit need.</p>\r\n<p>Twig. Fruit, My stem. Pat light. Come. But. Bark. Fungus Juice. Give me. Get.</p>\r\n<p>With twig. <font fg=ffffff>Arrow</font>.. With Bark. <font fg=ffffff>Armor</font>.. With Fruit. <font fg=ffffff>Heal</font>.</p>\r\n<p>My twig, eat. <font fg=ffffff>neutralize poison.</font></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Everything from me. Elf. Use well. Happy.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","ente2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縛お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂薑. 頂. <font fg=ffffff>陛雖, 皎韓, 翮衙</font> в蹂.</p>\r\n<p>陛雖. 翮衙. 頂 跺. <font fg=ffffff>髦髦 舒萄葬賊</font>. 釭螞棻. ж雖虜. <font fg=ffffff>皎韓. 幗撓 闆.</font> 釭縑啪 醜撿. 橢擠.</p>\r\n<p>陛雖煎. <font fg=ffffff>�香�</font>.. 皎韓煎. <font fg=ffffff>骨褡</font>.. 翮衙朝. <font fg=ffffff>羹溘 �蛹�.</font></p>\r\n<p>頂. 陛雖. <font fg=ffffff>詳戲賊. п絮 濛辨.</font></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>頂啪憮. 釭螃朝. 匙. 蹂薑. 澀 餌辨. 晦際棻.</p>\r\n</body>","entm1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>安特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>人類...離開...森林...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","entm1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Forest. Leave. Human.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","entm1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Forest. Leave. Human.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","entm1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縛お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...膛. 集釭. 檣除.</p>\r\n</body>","ernest1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>厄莉斯特 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n哼，那傢伙到底跑那兒去了呢？哼...無聊。我要回家了。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","ernest1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>橫棲蝶お :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n藕, 渠羹 檜喪戮檜 橫蛤煎 除剪雖. 縑檜... 營嘐橈橫. 斜傖 餵縑 給嬴陛撿 啊棻.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","estce1-c.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>伊斯特 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 你是跟著格蘭肯的黑暗妖精。我偶爾會看到這樣的人...不過我不想跟你有接觸，請你趕快離開此地。\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","estce1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Est: </p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are a dark elf who follows Gran Kain. Though I have seen such before, I have no interest in talking with you...Please go away.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","estce1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Est: </p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are a dark elf who follows Gran Kain. Though I have seen such before, I have no interest in talking with you...Please go away.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","estCE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縑蝶お :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 渡褐擎 斜嫌蘋檣擊 評腦朝 橫菸曖 蹂薑檜捱蹂. 陛莠 檣除菟 醞縑 斜楛 檜蒂 爾晦朝 ц雖虜... 渡褐婁朝 鼻渠ж堅 談雖 彊捱蹂. 橫憮 集釭 輿撮蹂.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","estE1-c.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>伊斯特 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 我們妖精是屬於這森林的一部分，能夠運用自然的語言與樹木聊天。但是，有些妖精因長時間與人類接觸，而忘記自己的母語。因此這些妖精利用人間的能力，製作了 <font fg=ffffff>地圖</font>這個東西。<br>\r\n若你對人類的文化有興趣，我可以幫你弄一張地圖，不過你得給我一個 <font fg=ffffff>安特的果實</font>。因為凡事...總是須要一些代價嘛！</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elvenforest map\">交換地圖</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","este1-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Est: </p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Actually we elves are parts of the forest and can talk with trees in the language of nature...but some elves who have lived so long among the humans have lost that language.   Those who can't talk with trees can become lost in the forest, and so they've made a thing called a...<font fg=ffffff>map</font> with help from the humans.<br>\r\nIf you are interested in the human culture, I can give you one. But in return, you have to give me one <font fg=ffffff>fruit of ent</font>.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elvenforest map\">Exchange for the map of elven forest</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","este1-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Est: </p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Actually we elves are parts of the forest and can talk with trees in the language of nature...but some elves who have lived so long among the humans have lost that language.   Those who can't talk with trees can become lost in the forest, and so they've made a thing called a...<font fg=ffffff>map</font> with help from the humans.<br>\r\nIf you are interested in the human culture, I can give you one. But in return, you have to give me one <font fg=ffffff>fruit of ent</font>.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elvenforest map\">Exchange for the map of elven forest</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","estE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縑蝶お :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 餌褒 蹂薑檣 辦葬菟擎 膛曖 橾睡檜晦 陽僥縑 濠翱曖 樹橫煎 釭鼠菟婁 檜撿晦蒂 й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. ж雖虜 檣除撮鼻縑憮 檣除菟婁 螃概翕寰 婦啗蒂 裕橫螞 蹂薑菟擎 除�� 濠翱曖 樹橫蒂 濱橫 膛樓縑憮 望擊 檠剪釭 ж朝 唳辦陛 氈雖蹂. 檜菟擎 檣除曖 ��擊 網橫 <font fg=ffffff>雖紫</font>塭朝 匙擊 虜菟歷港棲棻.<br>\r\n 檣除菟曖 僥�倍� �儮怜� 氈棻賊 渡褐縑啪紫 ж釭 掘п 萄萵 熱朝 氈雖虜 渠褐 <font fg=ffffff>縛お曖 翮衙</font>蒂 ж釭 輿敷撿 п蹂. 檣除菟擎 樹薯釭 渠陛蒂 夥塭棲梱蹂...</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elvenforest map\">蹂薑曖 膛 雖紫諦 掖�納挬�</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","estM1-c.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>伊斯特 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你不是屬於這裡的人，怎麼可能敢進來這裡。也許對於像你有這種才華的人，這不是什麼困難的事吧。因為我每次覺得都<font fg=ffffff>地圖</font>這東西很神奇。<br>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","estm1-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Est :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm really quite surprised to see you humans here. I've always admired your talent for making such a thing as a...what is it called? <font fg=ffffff>Map</font>?<br>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","estm1-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Est :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm really quite surprised to see you humans here. I've always admired your talent for making such a thing as a...what is it called? <font fg=ffffff>Map</font>?<br>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","estM1-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縑蝶お :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 檣除檣 渡褐檜 檜夠梱雖 菟橫螃棻棲 薑蜓 啾塭選 評葷檜捱蹂. ж雖虜 渡褐菟曖 營輿塭賊 斜葬 橫溥遴 橾檜 嬴棍雖紫 賅腦轄. 渡褐菟檜 虜萇 <font fg=ffffff>雖紫</font>塭朝 僭勒縑 渠п憮朝 樹薯釭 馬驕ж堅 氈戲棲梱...<br>\r\n棻擠縛 傳 鼠歙擊 虜菟橫 鳥 剪轄?\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","evelyn1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>愛弗琳 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n要小心由妖魔法師領導的妖魔團隊。妖魔法師會幫體力降下來的妖魔補血後，讓它們繼續作戰。所以若遇到妖魔團隊，必須先殺死妖魔法師。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","evelyn1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>縑綰萼 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n螃觼葆徹餌陛 檜莖朝 螃觼 鼠葬菟擎 輿曖п撿й 鼻渠縑蹂. 螃觼葆徹餌陛 羹溘檜 雲橫霞 螃觼菟擊 �蛹厭藥� 啗樓 瞪癱蒂 衛酈剪萇蹂. 螃觼 鼠葬菟擊 虜釭賊 試盪 螃觼葆徹餌睡攪 薯憶ж紫煙 ж撮蹂.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","event-e.html":" ","event-j.html":" ","event-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Summer Event!</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>7錯 1橾睡攪 8錯 31橾梱雖, 葬棲雖 堅偌 馬餌 檜漸お!<br>\r\n檜 ч餌朝 賅萇 葬棲雖 餌辨濠蒂 嬪п 馬餌曖 葆擠戲煎 葆溼и 爾傘蝶 蹴薯殮棲棻. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n\"葬棲雖紫 闌晦堅!  爾傘蝶紫 嫡堅!\"<br>\r\nT敷隴朝 晦獄, 衙輿 50偃噶 葆檜觼煎模Щお �椓馭儠�,<br> \r\n衙輿 2渠噶 識 12渠曖 闡ね 喻お磁, 衙殖 援掘釭 翎脯諮湍 啪歜辨 PC梱雖..<br>\r\n<br>\r\n雖旎 霤罹ж褊衛螃. 摹鷗曖 檜嶸陛 碟貲м棲棻. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>爾傘蝶 1</font>\r\n<br>ч餌 晦除醞 薑擋陛殮ж賊 <b>援掘釭</b> か滌 薯濛脹 `葬棲雖 屬滓暮 T敷隴'蒂 嫡擊 熱 氈蝗棲棻.  \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>爾傘蝶 2</font>\r\n<br>ч餌 晦除醞 3偃錯 檜鼻 薑擋陛殮ж賊 援掘釭 `葬棲雖 雖斜模 ぷ闌(1000Я蝶)'擊 嫡擊 熱 氈蝗棲棻. \r\n僭煩, 葬棲雖 屬滓暮 T敷隴紫 л眷 萄董棲棻. \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>爾傘蝶 3</font>\r\n<br>ч餌 晦除醞 薑擋陛殮ж朝 賅萇 碟 醞 衙輿 50貲擊 蹺繩 `葆檜觼煎模Щお �� 葆辦蝶'蒂 萄董棲棻. \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>爾傘蝶 4</font>\r\n<br>ч餌 晦除醞 衙輿 譆堅 溯漣曖 陴,罹 議葛攪蒂 摹薑 `闡ね 喻お磁 闡У攪'蒂 2渠噶, 識 12渠'蒂 萄董棲棻. \r\n衙輿(衙殖 葆雖虞 輿朝 薯諼) 諾濠/奢輿, 晦餌, 蹂薑, 葆徹餌 醞 ж釭曖 贗楚蝶蒂 鉻嬴,\r\n 斜 贗楚蝶縑憮 陛濰 溯漣檜 堪擎 陴, 罹 議葛攪縑啪 堅晝 喻お磁 闡У攪(Compaq Armada 1500C)蒂 陝 и渠噶 萄董棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>爾傘蝶 5</font>\r\n<p>ч餌 晦除醞 衙殖 葆雖虞 輿朝 譆堅 ⑸裊擊 摹嫦, ⑸裊 捱輿縑啪 啪歜 衙棲嬴塭賊 援掘釭 乾堅 談橫ж朝 \r\n`�粉騔� 啪歜 PC'蒂 萄董棲棻. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>婦褕 餵醞 !! - 檜漸お 鼻�� 樓爾蒂 憲溥萄董棲棻</font><br>\r\n - 檜漸お 晦除 翕寰 葬棲雖 啪歜頂 奢雖餌о縑憮 衙橾 檜漸お 景蝶蒂 瞪п萄葬啊蝗棲棻. <br>\r\n - 渡繩濠 貲欽擎 衙輿 旎,饜蹂橾縑 檜漸お 鼻�笙�(http:// lineage.ncsoft.co.kr/lineage_new/event/)婁 啪歜頂 奢雖餌о縑憮 奢雖м棲棻.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>譆堅 議葛攪, 譆堅 ⑸裊 啪歜 敘罌</font><br>\r\n - 獄 ч餌 晦除 翕寰 薑擋陛殮ж賊 援掘釭 霤陛й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. <br><br>\r\n- 譆堅 議葛攪 摹轎 晦遽 : (衙輿 錯蹂橾 0衛 - 旎蹂橾 20衛梱雖) 雖薑脹 憮幗縑憮 儅撩脹 議葛攪縑 им棲棻. <br>\r\n*衙輿 雖薑 憮幗諦 摹薑 議葛攪蒂 啪歜 頂 奢雖餌о縑憮 奢雖м棲棻. <br><br>\r\n- 譆堅 ⑸裊 摹轎 晦遽 : 議葛攪 儅撩 橾濠縑 薯и擎 橈蝗棲棻. 欽, ⑸裊錳 賅舒陛 薑擋 餌辨濠罹撿 м棲棻. <br><br>\r\n- 譆堅 議葛攪 塽 ⑸裊 摹轎 衛 霤陛濠 醞 晦除翕寰 и廓檜塭紫 PK蒂 и 議葛攪朝 霤陛 濠問檜 夢驍腌棲棻. <br>\r\n評塭憮 PK蒂 и 議葛攪陛 樓п 氈朝 ⑸裊紫 霤陛 濠問檜 夢驍腌棲棻. <br><br>\r\n<p> - 譆堅 議葛攪 塽 ⑸裊 摹轎衛 и 啗薑渡 雖襄檜 腆 熱 氈朝 晦�葩� и 廓 閨殮棲棻. <br>\r\n譆堅 ⑸裊檜 腆 熱 氈朝 晦�� 傳и и ⑸裊渡 и 廓 閨殮棲棻.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>","eventscroll-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>破舊的文卷：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>『試練的結束就在骷骨的手上』</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","eventscroll-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Old Scroll:</p></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>'The end of suffering lies in the direction of a skeletal hand.'</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","eventscroll-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Old Scroll:</p></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>'The end of suffering lies in the direction of a skeletal hand.'</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","eventscroll-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陸擎 舒瑞葆葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'衛溼曖 部擎 п埤曖 曄 つ醞 и薹檜 陛葬酈朝 夠縑 氈棻.'</p>\r\n</body>","evert1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>愛弗特:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我對布料很有興趣，只要是布料我都會買。侏儒製作的布料很特別，人類怎麼可能製做的出這麼好的布料？</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","evert1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Evert the Fabric Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I will buy all types of fabric and collect unique cloths. Dwarvish fabrics especially interest me...How do they get that great quality.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","evert1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Evert the Fabric Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I will buy all types of fabric and collect unique cloths. Especially Dwarvish fabrics interest me...How do they get that great quality.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","evert1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>褡馬鼻檣 縑幗お :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>陪 繭戲煎 腎橫氈朝 匙檜塭賊 賅萇 雖 餌遽棻啻. �騉虰� 褡馬菟擊 賅戲堅 氈剪萇. か�� 陪爵檜褶檜 虜萇 繭擎 霤 �儮抪怷�... 橫飩啪 斜楛 韓馬擊 鳥 熱 氈朝 剪雖?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","evert2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>愛弗特 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>警衛！警衛！</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","evert2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Evert the Fabric Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Guard! Guard!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","evert2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Evert the Fabric Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Guard! Guard!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","evert2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>褡馬鼻檣 縑幗お :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>唳綠! 唳綠!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","exchamoney-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>金幣寶石交換所:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n我們侏儒要擴大與人類的交易。也需要你們人類使用的金幣。\r\n<br>\r\n所以不要帶著那麼重的金幣。\r\n請你換成寶石，又方便，又很輕。\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">金幣換成寶石</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">寶石換成金幣</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","exchamoney-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Dwarf Exchanger:</p></font>\r\n<br>We dwarves want to extend our trade relationship with the humans, and so we need human money.\r\n<br>\r\nFor that reason, we have grudgingly decided to exchange gems from our guild mine for your human money. So please trade your bulky money for our light, shiny gems.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">Exchange adena for gems</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Exchange gems for adena</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","exchamoney-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Dwarf Exchanger:</p></font>\r\n<br>We dwarves want to extend our trade relationship with the humans, and so we need human money.\r\n<br>\r\nFor that reason, we have grudgingly decided to exchange gems from our guild mine for your human money. So please trade your bulky money for our light, shiny gems.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">Exchange adena for gems</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Exchange gems for adena</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","exchamoney-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陪爵檜 �秧搎�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n辦葬 陪爵檜菟擎 檣除婁曖 掖羲擊 �捎踿珝蟆� ж螃. 斜楚憮 檣除曖 絲檜 в蹂ж螃.\r\n<br>\r\n斜楛 翱嶸煎 鬼繹曖 僥 望萄縑憮朝 惜骯縑憮 釭朝 爾戮婁 檣除菟曖 絲擊 掖�納炱漞� ц戲棲 鼠剪遴 絲 陛雖堅 棻棲雖 蜓堅 爾戮婁 掖�納牮藩�.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">嬴等釭蒂 爾戮戲煎 夥羞棻</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">爾戮擊 嬴等釭煎 夥羞棻</a>\r\n</body>","exitghost1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>是否結束觀看競賽，出去外面？\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"exitghost\">出去競賽場。</a><br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","exitghost1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>唳晦濰 婦塋擊 部頂堅 夤戲煎 釭陛衛啊蝗棲梱?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"exitghost\">唳晦濰 夤戲煎 釭除棻.</a><br>\r\n\r\n</body>","fairye1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>精靈：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這個世界已經被格蘭肯污染，但是迷幻森林是被我們這些跟隨殷海薩教義的守護者所保護著的善良世界。</p>\r\n<p>不必在意邪惡的人們，而且我們自己能生活得很好∼我的<a link=\"fairye2\">女皇</a>是這麼說的∼</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye3\">問米索莉的事</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye4\">問精靈羽翼的事</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","fairye1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The world is already contaminated by Gran Kain, but this Elven Forest is bastion of peace protected by us guardians through the teachings of Einhasad.</p>\r\n<p>Don't pay attention to the evil humans beings, we can take care of ourselves~ My <a link=\"fairye2\">queen</a> has said so~</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye3\">Ask about Mithril</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye4\">Ask about ala of Fairy</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairye1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The world is already contaminated by Gran Kain, but this Elven Forest is bastion of peace protected by us guardians through the teachings of Einhasad.</p>\r\n<p>Don't pay attention to the evil humans beings, we can take care of ourselves~ My <a link=\"fairye2\">queen</a> has said so~</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye3\">Ask about Mithril</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye4\">Ask about ala of Fairy</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairye1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>む橫葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撮鼻擎 檜嘐 斜嫌 蘋檣縑 曖п 渦毀⑵螺雖虜, 檜夠 蹂薑曖 膛虜擎 嬴檣ж餌萄椒曖 貲擊 嫡嬴 辦葬菟 熱��濠陛 爾��ж朝 摹и 襄營菟曖 釭塭撿!</p>\r\n<p>釭雌 檣除菟 評嬪縑 褐唳噙雖 蜓堅, 辦葬菟郭葬 闌匏啪 啾濠~ 辦葬 <a link=\"fairye2\">罹諾椒</a>眷憮紫 斜溢啪 蜓噪ж樟橫~</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye3\">嘐蝶萵 薯濛擊 睡饕и棻</a><br>                                                                    <a link=\"fairye4\">む橫葬曖 陳偃蒂 殖塭堅 и棻</a>\r\n</body>","fairye2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>精靈：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>女皇通常停留在花園，就在迷幻森林東方正義神殿的東邊花園。</p>\r\n<p>總之對我們來說，能看一眼那美麗的翅膀就已經是非常光榮的了∼</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye3\">索取米索莉</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye4\">問精靈羽翼的事</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","fairye2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The Queen usually stays at the flower garden, east of the good God's temple in the Elven Forest.</p>\r\n<p>'Tis a great pleasure for us to catch a glimpse of Her beautiful wing~</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye3\">Ask about Mithril</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye4\">Ask about ala of Fairy</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairye2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The Queen usually stays at the flower garden, east of the good God's temple in the Elven Forest.</p>\r\n<p>'Tis a great pleasure for us to catch a glimpse of Her beautiful wing~</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye3\">Ask about Mithril</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye4\">Ask about ala of Fairy</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairye2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>む橫葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹諾椒眷憮朝 爾鱔 蹂薑曖 膛 醞縑憮 陛濰 葆擠縑 菟橫ж衛朝 <font fg=ffffff>摹и 褐曖 褐瞪 翕薹縑 氈朝 粒寧</font>縑憮 該鼠衛湍勘.</p>\r\n<p>橫繚萇 陛莠檜釭葆 斜 碟曖 嬴葷棻遴 碟�姣� 陳偃蒂 盡 熱 氈棻朝勒 辦葬菟曖 贖 闌剪遺檜撿~</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye3\">嘐蝶萵 薯濛擊 睡饕и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"fairye4\">む橫葬曖 陳偃蒂 殖塭堅 и棻</a>\r\n</body>","fairye3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>精靈：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你不能想像要精煉那些粗糙的米索莉是多麼困難的∼你們妖精們總是要求我們用極大量的純粹米索莉，去製造你們的武器和盔甲。對我們來說是很困難的工作，你們妖精們還真的沒有一點概念啊！唉∼那你希望我們能做什麼？\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request lump of pure mithril\">要求純粹的米索莉</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairye3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can't imagine how hard it is to refine pure mithril from rough mithril~ It's always you elves with your huge amount of mithril for more weapons, more armor...it's quite hard for us... You elves really have no idea!  But what can we do?...that's our lot in life, I suppose.\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request lump of pure mithril\">Request pure Mithril</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairye3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can't imagine how hard it is to refine pure mithril from rough mithril~ It's always you elves with your huge amount of mithril for more weapons, more armor...it's quite hard for us... You elves really have no idea!  But what can we do?...that's our lot in life, I suppose.\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request lump of pure mithril\">Request pure Mithril</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairye3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>む橫葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵 錳戮</font>縑憮 嘐蝶萵擊 薑薯ж朝等 橡葆釭 撮塵и 葆徹 濛機檜 в蹂ж棻掘~ 斜啪 橡葆釭 ��萇雖 憲嬴? 渦掘釭 傘�� 蹂薑菟擎 斜匙擊 鼠晦釭 寞橫掘蒂 虜菟晦 嬪и <font fg=ffffff>璽,匐褐檜釭 っ旎</font>縑 殮�� 紫旎戲煎 樵羶陪 曄擊 蹂掘ж棲 辦葬陛 橡葆釭 廓剪照堅 ��檜 萄朝 還 憲嬴? 薑蜓檜雖 蹂薑菟擎 鼠衝ж棻棲梱.. 斜楚紫 凳 й 熱 橈雖. 斜啪 辦葬曖 橾檣 勘.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request lump of pure mithril\">嘐蝶萵 薯濛擊 睡饕и棻</a></p>\r\n</body>","fairye4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>精靈：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要我的羽翼？？嗯∼當然我的羽翼是非常美麗的，它是天生的...你想要它...。嗯∼沒有關係，我能再給你一些。\r\n<br>順便一提，你知道這個嗎？這是能用來收集元素能量的羽翼。聽說你們妖精利用我們的美麗羽翼，還在外面塗上米索莉來製造武器...，那實在很差勁的行為！\r\n<br>但是如果你能給我５個<font fg=ffffff>米索莉線</font>和４０個<font fg=ffffff>精靈粉末</font>，我會很樂意的交給你。嘿嘿∼在下次的祭典時，把這些統統裝飾在我身上，不曉得會有多棒！\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ala of fairy\">要求精靈羽翼</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairye4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You want my wing? Hmpf, of course you do, my wing is very beautiful. It's natural you covet it.  I can always make another, so I suppose it doesn't really matter.\r\n<br>But do you know this? It is a collection of elemental energy which can be used to go to elemental plane. But you elves just use our beautiful wings to coat mithril and make weapons...awful!\r\n<br>However, I do need new rainment, I suppose, so some good may come of it. If you can give me five <font fg=ffffff>mithril threads</font> and 40 <font fg=ffffff>fairy dusts</font>, I'm willing to part with it. I will look beautiful at the next fairy festival! Hee hee! ~\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ala of fairy\">Request ala of Fairy</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairye4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You want my wing? Hmpf, of course you do, my wing is very beautiful. It's natural you covet it.  I can always make another, so I suppose it doesn't really matter.\r\n<br>But do you know this? It is a collection of elemental energy which can be used to go to elemental plane. But you elves just use our beautiful wings to coat mithril and make weapons...awful!\r\n<br>However, I do need new rainment, I suppose, so some good may come of it. If you can give me five <font fg=ffffff>mithril threads</font> and 40 <font fg=ffffff>fairy dusts</font>, I'm willing to part with it. I will look beautiful at the next fairy festival! Hee hee! ~\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ala of fairy\">Request ala of Fairy</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairye4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>む橫葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>頂 陳偃陛 鬚陪棻掘? �� ж曹 頂 陳偃陛 爾晦虜 п紫 乾堅 談擊 薑紫煎 嬴葷港曹 ж雖. 釭撿 凳 傳 虜菟橫 鳥 熱 氈戲棲梱 鼻婦 橈曹 ж雖虜.. \r\n<br>斬等 斜剪 憲嬴? 檜勒 錳楚 辦葬菟檜 獄楚 堅щ檣 薑滄啗蒂 鱔婁ж晦 嬪п 薑滄縑傘雖蒂 賅擎剪塭掘. 傘�� 蹂薑菟紫 薑滄啗縑 該僭 牖 橈雖虜 <font fg=ffffff>陳偃蒂 餌辨</font>ж賊 薑滄啗蒂 鱔п 橫蛤萇 <font fg=ffffff>牖除 檜翕</font>й 牖 氈雖.\r\n<br>ж雖虜 傘�騊橉� 辦葬曖 嬴葷棻遴 陳偃蒂 陛雖堅 嘐蝶萵蒂 殮⑵憮 <font fg=ffffff>匐偽擎 鼠晦</font>釭 虜菟堅 氈濫嬴? 晦碟 釭際棻掘! ж雖虜 凳 釭縑啪 <font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵 褒 5顫楚嫌 む橫葬 渦蝶お 40偃</font>蒂 輿賊 還 牖 氈橫. 棻擠 む橫葬 蹴薯 陽 斜勘煎 跺纂濰擊 ж賊 薑蜓 詣韓剪撿. ④縑~\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ala of fairy\">む橫葬曖 陳偃蒂 橢朝棻</a></p>\r\n</body>","fairym1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>精靈：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>喂！人類！</p>\r\n<p>醜惡的人類！立刻滾出這個森林！</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairym1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huk! What's that smell?  Human!</p>\r\n<p>Filthy human! Get out, get out of the forest!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairym1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huk! What's that smell?  Human!</p>\r\n<p>Filthy human! Get out, get out of the forest!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairym1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>む橫葬:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>憾! 檣除檜棻!</p>\r\n<p>渦楝遴 檣除! 說葬 檜 膛縑憮 釭陛!</p>\r\n</body>","fairyqe1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>精靈女皇：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>殷海薩的小樹葉？想尋找前往元素空間，是你們來精靈草原的原因嗎？</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request lump of pure mithril\">索取米索莉</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request oriharukon\">索取奧里哈魯根</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ala of fairy\">索取精靈羽翼</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","fairyqe1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy Queen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Little leaf of Einhasad? What on the elemental plane has brought you to to this land of fairies?</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request lump of pure mithril\">Request Mithril</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request oriharukon\">Request Oriharukon</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ala of fairy\">Request ala of Fairy</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairyqe1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy Queen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Little leaf of Einhasad? What on the elemental plane has brought you to to this land of fairies?</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request lump of pure mithril\">Request Mithril</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request oriharukon\">Request Oriharukon</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ala of fairy\">Request ala of Fairy</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairyqe1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>む橫葬 覽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴檣ж餌萄曖 橫萼 濟餌敝衛罹? 斜渠陛 橫職 辨鼠煎 檜夠 む橫葬曖 菟っ梱雖 螃啪 腎歷釭蹂?</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request lump of pure mithril\">嘐蝶萵 薯濛擊 睡饕и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request oriharukon\">螃葬ж瑞夔 薯濛擊 睡饕и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request ala of fairy\">む橫葬曖 陳偃蒂 殖塭堅 и棻</a>\r\n</body>","fairyqm1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>精靈女皇：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>任何不能看穿自然法則者，現在就離開這裡...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairyqm1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy Queen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ah, one who cannot even perceive what is in front of your eyes. Leave here now.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairyqm1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fairy Queen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ah, one who cannot even perceive what is in front of your eyes. Leave here now.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fairyqm1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>む橫葬 覽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠翱擊 檜пж雖 跤ж朝 濠菟, 說葬 檜夠擊 集釭塭.</p>\r\n</body>","farbo1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>法波：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如你所見，我是個水手。我通常是在由這兒開到說語島的船上工作。然而，現在我的船將前往<a link=\"farbo2\">北方</a>。\r\n</body>\r\n","farbo1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Farbo:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As you can see, I'm a sailor. I used to work on the ship between here and 說語島. Now I sail on a ship to <a link=\"farbo2\">the North</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","farbo1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Farbo:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As you can see, I'm a sailor. I used to work on the ship between here and 說語島. Now I sail on a ship to <a link=\"farbo2\">the North</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","farbo1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>だ腦爾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>爾衛棻衛Я 釭朝 察餌塋檜雖. и翕寰擎 罹晦諦 蜓ж朝 撰擊 螃陛朝 寡蒂 鰾歷朝等, 蹂闈縛 <a link=\"farbo2\">磁薹</a>戲煎 陛朝 寡蒂 顫堅 氈橫. \r\n</body>","farbo2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>法波：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>當你乘船去北方的時候，有個被稱為歐瑞的地方。它是一座非常古老的城市，有人說那裡有一群人們會聚集在一個被稱為是大學的地方，一起學習眾多知識…。\r\n<p>像我這樣一個沒有學問的人怎麼能夠了解這些事物？但是看見歐瑞城還是使我感受到文化修養之類的感覺啦。\r\n</body>\r\n","farbo2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Farbo:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There is a place called Oren to the north - you can get there by ship. Oren is an ancient city, and I've heard there is a University there where people gather and study...\r\n<p>Even an unlearned person like me has learnt lots from being near the city...now I've got tons of smarts!\r\n</body>\r\n","farbo2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Farbo:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There is a place called Oren to the north - you can get there by ship. Oren is an ancient city, and I've heard there is a University there where people gather and study...\r\n<p>Even an unlearned person like me has learnt lots from being near the city...now I've got tons of smarts!\r\n</body>\r\n","farbo2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>だ腦爾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹晦憮 寡蒂 顫堅 磁薹戲煎 避 陛賊 螃溶檜塭朝 夠檜 釭螞棻啻. 鼻渡�� 羲餌陛 桶擎 釭塭檣等, 剪晦縑朝 渠з檜塭朝 匙紫 氈橫憮 餌塋菟檜 賅罹憮 奢睡蒂 и棻渦捱.\r\n<p>釭撿 鼠衝п憮 斜楛勒 澀 賅腦啊雖虜, 螃溶曖 紫衛菟擊 爾堅 氈戲賊 掖曄檜塒梱 ヶ嬪塒梱, 斜楛啪 覬 氈橫爾檜晦朝 ж渦掘虜.\r\n</body>","farlin1-c.HTML":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>金屬工藝師：</p></font>\r\n<br><p>你跟我說的話，我會馬上轉告我師父，立刻製作給你。你需要甚麼？</p>  \r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">賣金屬塊</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin3\">製作銀釘皮帽</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin4\">製作銀釘皮涼鞋</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin5\">製作銀釘皮背心</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin6\">製作銀釘皮盾</a>  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","farlin1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br><p>If you tell me I'll ask my master. What can I do for you?</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">Sell lumps of metal</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"farlin3\">Make studded leather cap</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"farlin4\">Make studded leather sandal</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"farlin5\">Make studded leather vest</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"farlin6\">Make studded leather shield</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","farlin1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br><p>If you tell me I'll ask my master. What can I do for you?</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">Sell lumps of metal</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"farlin3\">Make studded leather cap</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"farlin4\">Make studded leather sandal</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"farlin5\">Make studded leather vest</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"farlin6\">Make studded leather shield</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","farlin1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜曖 紫薯:</p></font>\r\n<br><p>薯啪 檜撿晦ж衛賊 摹儅椒眷 蜓噪萄溥 旎寞 虜菟橫 萄葬紫煙\r\nж啊蝗棲棻. 鼠歙檜 в蹂ж褐陛蹂?</p>  \r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">繹惚蒂 っ棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin3\">癒夢擎 陛避賅濠蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin4\">癒夢擎 陛避僻殖擊 虜萇棻</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin5\">癒夢擎 陛避褻郭蒂 虜萇棻</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin6\">癒夢擎 陛避寞ぬ蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","farlin2-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>金屬工藝師：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我出5枚金幣1塊金屬塊的價錢來收購金屬塊。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request adena5\">賣金屬塊</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlin2-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜曖 紫薯:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 繹惚朝 偃渡 5嬴等釭煎 掖�納� 萄董棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request adena5\">繹惚蒂 っ棻</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","farlin3-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>金屬工藝師：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 若要做銀釘皮帽，需要皮帽子和10個金屬塊，2張高級皮革。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather cap\">製作銀頂皮帽</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlin3-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> To make a studded leather cap, I need a leather cap, 10 lumps of metal, and 2 hard leathers.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather cap\">Request studded leather cap</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlin3-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> To make a studded leather cap, I need a leather cap, 10 lumps of metal, and 2 hard leathers.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather cap\">Request studded leather cap</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlin3-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜曖 紫薯:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 癒夢擎 陛避賅濠蒂 虜菟溥賊 陛避賅濠諦 繹惚 10偃, 堅晝Я⑶ 2濰檜 в蹂м棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather cap\">癒夢擎 陛避賅濠蒂 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","farlin4-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>金屬工藝師：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>若要製作銀釘皮涼鞋，需要皮涼鞋和12個金屬塊，3張高級皮革。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather sandal\">製作銀釘皮涼鞋</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlin4-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> To make a studded leather sandal, you must bring me a leather sandal, 12 lumps of metal, and 3 hard leathers.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather sandal\">Request studded leather sandal</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlin4-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> To make a studded leather sandal, you must bring me a leather sandal, 12 lumps of metal, and 3 hard leathers.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather sandal\">Request studded leather sandal</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlin4-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜曖 紫薯:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 癒夢擎 陛避僻殖擊 虜菟溥賊 陛避僻殖婁 繹惚 12偃, 堅晝Я⑶ 3濰檜 в蹂м棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather sandal\">癒夢擎 陛避僻殖擊 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","farlin5-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>金屬工藝師：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 若要製作銀釘皮背心，需要皮背心和10個金屬塊，2張高級皮革。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather vest\"> 製作銀釘皮背心</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","farlin5-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> To make a studded leather vest, I need a leather vest, 10 lumps of metal, and 2 hard leathers.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather vest\">Request studded leather vest</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlin5-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> To make a studded leather vest, I need a leather vest, 10 lumps of metal, and 2 hard leathers.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather vest\">Request studded leather vest</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlin5-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜曖 紫薯:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 癒夢擎 陛避褻郭蒂 虜菟溥賊 陛避褻郭諦 繹惚 10偃, 堅晝Я⑶ 2濰檜 в蹂м棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather vest\">癒夢擎 陛避褻郭蒂 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","farlin6-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>金屬工藝師：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>若要製作銀釘皮盾，需要皮盾牌和20個金屬塊，5張高級皮革。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather shield\">製作銀釘皮盾</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","farlin6-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> To make a studded leather shield, you should bring me a leather shield, 20 lumps of metal, and 5 hard leathers. </p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather shield\">Request studded leather shield</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlin6-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> To make a studded leather shield, you should bring me a leather shield, 20 lumps of metal, and 5 hard leathers. </p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather shield\">Request studded leather shield</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlin6-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜曖 紫薯:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 癒夢擎 陛避寞ぬ蒂 虜菟溥賊 陛避 寞ぬ諦 繹惚 20偃, 堅晝Я⑶ 5濰檜 в蹂м棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather shield\">癒夢擎 陛避寞ぬ蒂 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","farlinC1-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>金屬工藝師：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我的師父叫我不要像你這種人說話。</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlinC1-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My master said that I shouldn't deal with you evil types.</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlinC1-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Blacksmith's Apprentice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My master said that I shouldn't deal with you evil types.</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","farlinC1-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜曖 紫薯:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>摹儅椒眷憮 渡褐偽擎 學渡婁朝 檜撿晦ж雖 蜓塭堅 ж樟蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>","felf-e.tbl":"8\r\nElf(female)\r\n\r\nElf is good at elven items\r\nand agile.\r\n\r\nShe should find a character\r\nwho will be her lord, and\r\nregain the kingdom.\r\n","felf-k.tbl":"8\r\n蹂薑(罹濠)\r\n\r\n蹂薑擎 團繪撩檜 堪堅 蹂薑褶\r\n鼠晦蒂 澀 餌辨и棻.\r\n\r\n蹂薑擎 濠褐檜 輿捱戲煎 賅褒\r\n檣僭擊 瓊嬴 偽檜 奩諾擊 鼠鎬\r\n腦堅 諾措擊 腎瓊嬴撿 и棻.\r\n","ferdinand1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>斐迪南 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n知不知道在這世界上最強的武器是甚麼嗎？能殺龍的傳說之劍？能打破盾牌的矛？不...我認為人的意志力和團結就是最強的武器。若許多人一同團結就可打敗強大的龍。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","ferdinand1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>む腦蛤陪萄 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n檜撮鼻縑憮 陛濰 鬼溘и 鼠晦陛 鼠歙檜塭堅 儅陝ж釭? 瞪撲縑 頂溥螃朝 萄楚堆擊 避橾 熱 氈棻朝 匐? 橫集и 寞ぬ紫 勢擊 熱 氈朝 璽? 嬴棲... 陪 夥煎 餌塋曖 曖雖諦 欽唸溘檜塭堅 儅陝ж啻. 罹殿檜 ��擊 賅擎棻賊 薑蜓 僭葬纂雖 跤 й 惚僭檜 橈棻啻. 薯 嬴鼠葬 瞪撲曖 萄楚堆檜塭紫 蜓檜撿.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","fiin1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>芬：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>什麼？你說甘特藉由征服怪物橫行之島而解救人們嗎？別說笑了！我的姊妹在三天前被妖魔們攻擊而且到現在還不能走路哩！\r\n<p>如果他是那個島的管理人，他要做的應該更多！為什麼他不關閉那該死的洞穴，阻止怪物不再出現！哼...也許甘特也有無法擊敗的怪物吧！\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","fiin1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fiin:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Bah!  You're saying that Gunter saved people by slaying the monsters of the island?  My sister was attacked by orcs just three days ago and now she can't even walk!\r\n<p>If he is the 'conqueror' of that island, he should do a better job! Why didn't he close that damn cave and prevent the monsters from emerging! Hmpf. Mayhaps there is a monster even Gunter can't defeat, and he just won't admit it!\r\n</body>\r\n","fiin1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fiin:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Bah!  You're saying that Gunter saved people by slaying the monsters of the island?  My sister was attacked by orcs just three days ago and now she can't even walk!\r\n<p>If he is the 'conqueror' of that island, he should do a better job! Why didn't he close that damn cave and prevent the monsters from emerging! Hmpf. Mayhaps there is a monster even Gunter can't defeat, and he just won't admit it!\r\n</body>\r\n","fiin1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>��:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>捱攪陛 跨蝶攪陛 菜褒剪葬朝 蜓ж朝 撰擊 ゎ薑ж堅 餌塋菟擊 掘錳ц棻堅? 醒晦雖 蜓塭堅! 頂 罹翕儅檜 夥煎 3橾 瞪縑 螃觼菟縑啪 棻藥憮 務雖紫 跤ж堅 氈朝等! \r\n<p>撰曖 婦葬濠賊 婦葬濠 港啪 僅夥煎 ж塢 蜓檜撿! 謁 斜 嬪яи 翕掉擎 わ潑ж雖 彊堅 堤萋憮 惚僭檜 啗樓 釭螃啪 ж朝 剪撿! 寰縑 捱攪紫 跤檜望虜и 惚僭檜塭紫 氈釭爾雖?\r\n</body>","fknight-e.tbl":"8\r\nKnight(female)\r\n\r\nKnight is good at weapons and\r\narmors, but no good at magic.\r\n\r\nShe should find a character\r\nwho will be her lord, and\r\nregain the kingdom.\r\n","fknight-k.tbl":"10\r\n晦餌(罹濠)\r\n\r\n晦餌朝 鼠晦蒂 澀 餌辨ж堅\r\n瞪癱縑 鬼ж貊 骨褡擊 殮擊 熱\r\n氈戲釭 葆徹擎 澀 餌辨ж雖 跤\r\nи棻.\r\n\r\n晦餌朝 濠褐檜 輿捱戲煎 賅褒\r\n檣僭擊 瓊嬴 偽檜 奩諾擊 鼠鎬\r\n腦堅 諾措擊 腎瓊嬴撿 и棻.\r\n","garth1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賈斯:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n啊...很想去看看領主住的城堡。應該會非常漂亮。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","garth1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛噙 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n艙輿椒檜 髦堅 啗褐 撩擎 橡葆釭 詣韓梱? 嬴.. и 廓檜塭紫 謠戲棲 窕 寰擊 掘唳п 爾堅 談橫.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeper-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>看門人：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">先生，我能為你做什麼？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\">\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">打開內門</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">關閉內門</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeper-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gatekeeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sir <var src=\"#0\">, I am yours to command.  What can I do for you?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\">\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">Open the inner gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">Close the inner gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeper-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gatekeeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sir <var src=\"#0\">, I am yours to command.  What can I do for you?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\">\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">Open the inner gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">Close the inner gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeper-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">椒 寰喟ж褊棲梱. 鼠蝦 橾檜衛轄?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\">\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">撩僥擊 翱棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">撩僥擊 殘朝棻</a><br>\r\n</body>","gatekeeper2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱登城堡警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哦！我的王啊！\r\n<p>所有事都很順利，閣下！\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#0\">\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openegate\">打開外門</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeegate\">關閉外門</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeper2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My lord!  I am at your command!\r\n<p>Everything is all right, Sir!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#0\">\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openegate\">Open the outer gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeegate\">Close the outer gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeper2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My lord!  I am at your command!\r\n<p>Everything is all right, Sir!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#0\">\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openegate\">Open the outer gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeegate\">Close the outer gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeper2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>憾, 撩輿椒!\r\n<p>斬鼠醞 檜鼻 橈蝗棲棻!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#0\">\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openegate\">諼撩僥擊 翱棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeegate\">諼撩僥擊 殘朝棻</a><br>\r\n</body>","gatekeeper3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>看門人：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">先生，我能為你做什麼？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\">\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeper3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gatekeeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sir <var src=\"#0\">, what can I do for you?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\">\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeper3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gatekeeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sir <var src=\"#0\">, what can I do for you?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\">\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeper3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">椒 寰喟ж褊棲梱. 鼠蝦 橾檜衛轄?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\">\r\n</body>","gatekeeperop-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>看門人：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你是誰？你是可疑的人，快報上你的名字！\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeperop-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gatekeeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Who are you? You look like one o' dem sneaky types to me. Tell me your name!\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeperop-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gatekeeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Who are you? You look like one o' dem sneaky types to me. Tell me your name!\r\n</body>\r\n","gatekeeperop-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>傘朝 援掘傍? 熱鼻и 喫檜捱. 檜葷婁 轎褐雖蒂 渠 瑭!\r\n</body>","gateokeeper-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>守衛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>啊， <var src=\"#0\">殿下！\r\n<p>現在沒甚麼異常動靜!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">開外城門</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">關外城門</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gateokeeper-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hail! <var src=\"#0\">!\r\n<p>Everything is all right, Sir!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">Open the outer gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">Close the outer gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gateokeeper-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hail! <var src=\"#0\">!\r\n<p>Everything is all right, Sir!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">Open the outer gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">Close the outer gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gateokeeper-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>憾, <var src=\"#0\">椒!\r\n<p>斬鼠醞 檜鼻 橈蝗棲棻!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">撩僥擊 翱棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">撩僥擊 殘朝棻</a><br>\r\n</body>","gayle1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蓋爾：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哦∼我很抱歉但是我剛好用完工作上的材料。嗯！看來這段時間我會沒有辦法<a link=\"gayle2\">鍛造東西</a>。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","gayle1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gayle the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, I'm very sorry but I am quite out of materials to work with. It seems that I can't do any <a link=\"gayle2\">forging</a> for a while.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gayle1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gayle the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, I'm very sorry but I am quite out of materials to work with. It seems that I can't do any <a link=\"gayle2\">forging</a> for a while.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gayle1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜 啪橾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴, 檜剪 賸歎ж啪 腎歷蝗棲棻. 雖旎 葆藹 營猿陛 雲橫螳憮蹂, и翕寰 <a link=\"gayle2\">渠濰除橾</a>擎 跤ж啪 儅啣橫蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","gayle2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蓋爾：:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我可以修好你那些<a link=\"gayle3\">受損的</a>武器和盔甲；或者讓我修修你的劍，我可以讓它的刀鋒更銳利。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","gayle2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gayle the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I can fix <a link=\"gayle3\">erosion</a> of your weapons and armor. Or let me see your sword...I can make its blade sharper if I tinker with it.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gayle2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gayle the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I can fix <a link=\"gayle3\">erosion</a> of your weapons and armor. Or let me see your sword...I can make its blade sharper if I tinker with it.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gayle2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜 啪橾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>凳 <a link=\"gayle3\">僥薯</a>陛 儅曹 鼠晦釭 寞橫掘蒂 堅耀棻湍雖...蠔偽擎勒 罹晦 盪晦 槳擊 覬 瑭憮 陳檜 渦 澀 菟啪 虜菟晦紫 ж轄.</p>\r\n</body>","gayle3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蓋爾：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如果你用刀劍直接來打石頭或城門，刀劍可能會受損。難道你沒有聽說過能腐蝕你的盔甲或武器的怪物嗎？比如說，用刀劍或矛來打高侖石頭怪就非常愚蠢的。那些武器才不能真正傷害到牠，只會損壞到武器罷了。哦！沒錯，刀鋒砍不死牠的，唯一就只能用那些無鋒或是刀鋒較鈍的武器攻擊牠，例如流星錘或斧頭之類的。</p>\r\n<p>唔，如果那種狀況發生，你可能就只有一種選擇，那就是放棄這柄刀劍。但是如果你把它帶來，我可以把它修復到和新的沒兩樣。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","gayle3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gayle the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Well, yer sword may lose its teeth if ye hit something hard like a castle door with it. And there are tales of monsters who can erode your armor or weapons - 'tis brainless, I tell ye, to hit stone golems with a sword or spear. It damages yer weapon, and barely scratches the golem. Much better to hit 'em with blunt weapons like a morning star, or something heavy like an axe.</p>\r\n<p>Ye may want ta throw it away if that happens, but if ye bring it to me, I can make it as good as new - ye won't be able te tell the difference.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gayle3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gayle the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Well, yer sword may lose its teeth if ye hit something hard like a castle door with it. And there are tales of monsters who can erode your armor or weapons - 'tis brainless, I tell ye, to hit stone golems with a sword or spear. It damages yer weapon, and barely scratches the golem. Much better to hit 'em with blunt weapons like a morning star, or something heavy like an axe.</p>\r\n<p>Ye may want ta throw it away if that happens, but if ye bring it to me, I can make it as good as new - ye won't be able te tell the difference.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gayle3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜 啪橾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蠔煎 給窖橫葬釭 撩僥偽檜 欽欽и 匙擊 頂葬藥憮 檜說檜 緒韓熱紫 氈堅, 傳 跨蝶攪醞縑朝 鼠晦釭 寞橫掘蒂 睡衝衛酈朝 喪戮菟紫 氈棻堅 ж濫蝗棲梱. 給埤源偽擎 喪戮擊 蠔檜釭 璽戲煎 鼻渠ж朝勒 鼠賅и 橾檜雖蹂. 鼠晦陛 跤噙啪 腎朝匙紫 僥薯雖虜, 餌褒 斜楛 漆剪釭 鎬腦朝 鼠晦煎朝 斜喪戮縑啪 檜溢棻й Яп蒂 殮�� 熱陛 橈剪萇蹂. 紫郭釭 賅棚 蝶顫偽擎 菩晦盟塭賊 滌 僥薯 橈雖虜 蜓殮棲棻.\r\n<p>爾鱔 餌塋菟擎 斜溢啪 腎橫憮 鼠晦陛 跤噙啪腎賊 斜傖 幗葬堆 ж雖虜, 盪и纔 陛螳螃衛賊 億匙偽檜 堅藥萄萵 濠褐檜 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","gayle4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蓋爾：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>進來吧∼你一定是想要來這裡修補你破損的武器。嗯∼看來我得告訴你要使用武器要注意的部份。 \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"fix\">檢查並修補武器</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gayle3\">問武器為什麼會受損</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","gayle4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gayle the Blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Come in. Ye must be here to repair yer damaged weapons. I'll tell you which of yer weapon requires attention.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"fix\">Check and repair yer damaged weapons</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gayle3\">Ask how weapons get damaged</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gayle4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gayle the Blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Come in. Ye must be here to repair yer damaged weapons. I'll tell you which of yer weapon requires attention.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"fix\">Check and repair yer damaged weapons</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gayle3\">Ask how weapons get damaged</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gayle4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜 啪橾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃衛螃. 鼠晦蒂 堅纂楝 螃樟釭爾捱蹂. 橫蛤, 睡憮霞 鼠晦菟檜 氈釭 覬 瑣衛棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"fix\">睡憮霞 鼠晦蒂 熱摹и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gayle3\">鼠晦陛 樹薯 睡憮雖釭 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n\r\n</body>","gayle5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蓋爾：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗯∼你沒有任何東西需要修理！隨時歡迎你再來！ \r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gayle5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmmm, ye've got nothing requiring my services jest now. Please bang up yer weapons a bit and come back later.\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gayle5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmmm, ye've got nothing requiring my services jest now. Please bang up yer weapons a bit and come back later.\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gayle5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>�敻�, 頂陛 爾晦縛 堅艦 僭勒檜 嬴鼠匙紫 橈朝 匙 偽擎勘. \r\n</body>","gerarde1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗯∼原來你就是妖精族的小朋友，對人類的事情沒有興趣的你們，居然從迷幻森林遠道而來這裡，真是難得的事啊。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在服侍王的那段時間內，我也曾經看過一次妖精。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>他就是月之騎士季里安。不過不管別人怎麼說，我可不認為他是騎士，怎麼可能有不服侍主人的騎士呢？因為騎士的本質就是忠誠和勇氣，不是嗎？所以我也不是很欣賞你們，不管世界有什麼變動，你們都只會把自己隱居起來，什麼事也不想管了。就像現在叛王的殘暴越來越嚴重，但由精靈和妖精掌管的迷幻森林卻一直維持沉默。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如果你正在尋找值得讓你付出力量的人類的話，在這些騎士當中說不定會有你要找的人吧。但是若你只是走出森林來散散步的話，我看你還是早點回去好了，人類的世界可沒有你想像得那麼單純。 \r\n</br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerarde1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmm... You are an elf, a descendant of elementals. I didn't think that I would see one of your race here considering that you're usually not interested in the human world. In fact, I've only seen one elf before - that was when I was serving the King.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The elf's name was Zillian, the Moon Knight. But whatever other people think, I can't regard him as a knight. A knight without a lord is preposterous, because Royalty and Courage are basic principles of knights.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>That's why I don't like you so much. Whatever happens in the world, you elves just remain inside your quiet little nest. Even now, when the Pretender King's tyranny is getting worse, the elven forest keeps itself in silence.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Anyway, if you are looking for human help, you will find good people among the knights here. But if you just came here thinking of traipsing your little way through the forest, I suggest you to go back immediately - the human world is not as easy as your forest.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","gerarde1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmm... You are an elf, a descendant of elementals. I didn't think that I would see one of your race here considering that you're usually not interested in the human world. In fact, I've only seen one elf before - that was when I was serving the King.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The elf's name was Zillian, the Moon Knight. But whatever other people think, I can't regard him as a knight. A knight without a lord is preposterous, because Royalty and Courage are basic principles of knights.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>That's why I don't like you so much. Whatever happens in the world, you elves just remain inside your quiet little nest. Even now, when the Pretender King's tyranny is getting worse, the elven forest keeps itself in silence.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Anyway, if you are looking for human help, you will find good people among the knights here. But if you just came here thinking of traipsing your little way through the forest, I suggest you to go back immediately - the human world is not as easy as your forest.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","gerarde1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>�敻�.. 渡褐擎 薑滄曖 濠衝菟檣 蹂薑檜煎捱蹂. 檣除 撮鼻縑朝 婦褕檜 橈朝 渡褐菟檜 蹂薑曖 膛縑憮 詩葬 雲橫霞 檜夠梱雖 螃棻棲 萄僥 橾檜捱蹂. 釭 羲衛 諾擊 啁縑憮 賅褒 陽 詞 и 廓 蹂薑擊 爾懊擊 閨檜塭螃.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>殖曖 晦餌 韓葬樹檜 夥煎 斜艘雖. ж雖虜 棻艇 餌塋擎 路塭紫 釭朝 斜蒂 晦餌塭堅 儅陝ж雖 彊模. 輿檣擊 賅衛雖 彊朝 晦餌塭棲 蜓紫 腎雖 彊模. 醱撩褕婁 辨晦撿 蜓煎 晦餌曖 獄韓檜晦 陽僥檜螃.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜楚憮 釭朝 渡褐菟紫 斜棻雖 謠嬴ж霞 彊模. 撮鼻檜 橫鎬 腎歷萇 渡褐菟擎 濠褐曖 爾旎濠葬縑 ぎ橫夢⑵憮 嬴鼠匙紫 ж雖 彊堅 氈模. 奩諾檜 ん學л檜 陳煎 褕п雖堅 氈朝 雖旎紫 蹂薑曖 膛擎 藹僧擊 雖酈堅 氈模.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜楚紫 虜擒 渡褐檜 渡褐曖 ��擊 網溥 還 檣除擊 瓊堅 氈棻賊 檜夠 晦餌菟 醞縑 惘雛擎 喪戮檜 氈擊 雖紫 賅腦螃. ж雖虜 欽牖�� 模Ё釭螞 晦碟戲煎 膛擊 釭螞 匙檜塭賊 橫憮 給嬴陛衛螃. 檣除撮鼻擎 渡褐曖 膛虜躑 虜虜и 夠檜 嬴棲螃.</br>\r\n</body>","gerardk1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你也是為了想要得到<a link=\"gerardk2\">騎士資格</a>而來接受考試的嗎？</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這裡也有很多年輕人像你一樣想要當騎士而聚集在一起，不過同時兼具實力和人格的優秀騎士卻不多。我看你很有騎士素質。但在成為正式的騎士之前，可是要通過許多的考驗的。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>把你的力量用在正當的地方上吧，如果你為了毀滅<a link=\"gerardk4\">叛王</a>，不惜犧牲生命的話，希望你能在這個地方加強修練。如果你充分地修練的話，我可以以我的名譽賜給你騎士的資格。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"gerardtest\">接受傑瑞德的測驗</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardk1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome. Here, many youths strive to become a <a link=\"gerardk2\">knight</a> - but few fulfill their dreams. Though you do seem to have potential...Hmmm.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you make up your mind to devote your strength towards only good ends, and are willing to risk your life to defeat <a link=\"gerardk4\">the Pretender King</a> you can train here at any time.\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"gerardtest\">Undergo 'Gerard's test'</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome. Here, many youths strive to become a <a link=\"gerardk2\">knight</a> - but few fulfill their dreams. Though you do seem to have potential...Hmmm.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you make up your mind to devote your strength towards only good ends, and are willing to risk your life to defeat <a link=\"gerardk4\">the Pretender King</a> you can train here at any time.\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"gerardtest\">Undergo 'Gerard's test'</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮 螃啪. 檜夠擎 濠啻籀歲 <a link=\"gerardk2\">晦餌</a>陛 腎晦蒂 錳ж朝 熱號擎 瞬擎檜菟檜 賅檣棻啻. 斜楝釭 斜 嗆擊 檜瑞朝 濠朝 號雖 彊雖. 濠啻曖 イ億蒂 爾嬴ж棲 瞪⑵ 濠韓檜 橈橫 爾檜霞 彊啻虜..</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠啻陛 濠褐曖 ��擊 螢夥艇 夠縑虜 餌辨ж堅, <a link=\"gerardk4\">奩諾</a>擊 路嬴頂晦 嬪п 跡獗擊 夥艦 陝螃陛 腎橫 氈棻賊 樹薯萇 檜夠縑憮 熱溼擊 論晦 夥塭啻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"gerardtest\">'啪塭萄曖 衛溼'擊 嫡朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","gerardk2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>從你的眼睛就看得出來，你的血氣旺盛，只想要成為強者...但是不是說只穿上閃亮的鐵甲、或是劍術不凡就可以成為騎士。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在危險的時刻讓自己成為盾牌保護<a link=\"gerardk3\">君主</a>，就算犧牲自己的生命也要能保護騎士的尊嚴並不失其名譽！這就是騎士的精神，具有騎士精神的人是不會讓騎士之名受到羞辱的。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardk2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Your eyes say that you want to be stronger...but shining armor and a skill with swords doesn't make one a true knight.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Protecting the <a link=\"gerardk3\">Lord</a> at the critical moment with his own shield and also defending his own honor at the risk of all his blood!  That's the spirit of knight! Only the one with the spirit of knight truly deserves the title of a knight.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Your eyes say that you want to be stronger...but shining armor and a skill with swords doesn't make one a true knight.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Protecting the <a link=\"gerardk3\">Lord</a> at the critical moment with his own shield and also defending his own honor at the risk of all his blood!  That's the spirit of knight! Only the one with the spirit of knight truly deserves the title of a knight.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑸晦 諾撩и 濠啻曖 換擎 螃霜 鬼п雖晦虜擊 錳ж朝 蛭 ж捱.. ж雖虜 欽雖 廓翻剪葬朝 骨褡擊 殮堅, 匐擊 澀 棻琿棻堅 п憮 晦餌檣 勒 嬴棲雖.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬪я曖 牖除縑憮 濠褐曖 寞ぬ煎 <a link=\"gerardk3\">輿捱</a>擊 雖麵頂堅 濠褐曖 Я蒂 棻 踏嬴憮塭紫 濠褐曖 貲蕨蒂 雖酈朝 匙! 檜匙檜 夥煎 晦餌曖 薑褐檜雖. 晦餌曖 薑褐擊 陛霞 濠虜檜 晦餌曖 檜葷縑 睡莖毀雖 彊棻啻.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","gerardk3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>凡是騎士都要對自己的君主忠心才能發揮他的價值。現在的亞丁因恐怖的叛王而產生不少流浪的騎士，在這當中就有很多自稱為擁有王族血統之人。此時，對騎士來說，選擇自己的終身服侍的君主就是件需要多加考慮的事。無論如何，你必須要去尋找一位具有王族血統和高尚目標的君主，同時要發誓終身服侍。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardk3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The knight's existence has meaning only when he meets the lord to whom he will pledge his loyalty. In this chaotic time, there are numerous princes claiming to be descended from royal blood.  During the confusion that resulted from the Pretender King's horror, much was left in chaos, and now it takes a virtuous will to find a true prince. 'Tis time for knights to decide who deserves their loyalty - you must find a lord with true blood and virtue before swearing your allegiance!\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The knight's existence has meaning only when he meets the lord to whom he will pledge his loyalty. In this chaotic time, there are numerous princes claiming to be descended from royal blood.  During the confusion that resulted from the Pretender King's horror, much was left in chaos, and now it takes a virtuous will to find a true prince. 'Tis time for knights to decide who deserves their loyalty - you must find a lord with true blood and virtue before swearing your allegiance!\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>晦餌朝 鼠萱 醱撩擊 夥艦 輿捱擊 虜釭撿虜 濠褐曖 陛纂陛 維釭朝 襄營檜雖. 斜楝釭 雖旎 嬴筆擎 奩諾曖 奢ん煎 橫雖毀晦 斜雖橈堅 斜 ぐ擊 顫 奩諾縑啪 覲啖陪 諾褶曖 Я蒂 檜歷棻堅 濠蘆ж朝 濠菟檜 鼠熱�� 儅啖陬棻啻. 晦餌煎憮朝 援掘縑啪 醱撩擊 夥藥撿虜ж朝雖 惚煎遴 摹鷗擊 п撿虜 ж朝 衛晦檜雖. 斜楝棲 剪騁橈朝 換戲煎 霞薑и ⑸鱔擊 毚堅 堪擎 嗆擊 陛霞 輿捱擊 瓊嬴憮 醱撩擊 裊撮п撿虜 й 匙橾撮.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","gerardk4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>當亞丁唯一的國王杜克過世後，就有人冒充國王的堂兄把溫柔的迪雅王妃用惡毒的黑魔術誘惑後，而篡位成為國王，從此亞丁就滿城烏雲。因為他的關係，我看到王的忠臣們一個一個被陷害而死去，所以我立刻離開了亞丁城，越過死亡之路來到<a link=\"gerardk5\">這個地方</a>。\r\n<p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardk4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As soon as the one true king Duke Dephil died, he took the crown by pretending to be the king's cousin and seducing Queen Gadria with black magic. After watching him kill the king's blood pledge members one by one under false pretenses, I left the castle Aden, crossed the Wilderness of Death, and arrived <a link=\"gerardk5\">here</a>.\r\n<p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As soon as the one true king Duke Dephil died, he took the crown by pretending to be the king's cousin and seducing Queen Gadria with black magic. After watching him kill the king's blood pledge members one by one under false pretenses, I left the castle Aden, crossed the Wilderness of Death, and arrived <a link=\"gerardk5\">here</a>.\r\n<p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴筆曖 嶸橾и 諾 菽觼 等в檜 給嬴陛衛濠葆濠 諾曖 餌襟擊 餌蘆ж堅 薑熨и 陛萄葬嬴 諾綠蒂 餌學и �皜飲�煎 嶸�匹狤� 諾嬪蒂 雙驍и 濠檜雖. 斜 檜�譟� 嬴筆曖 橫菸擎 薄薄 桶橫虜 除棻啻. 斜 濠縑 曖п 諾曖 耀嬪渠陛 ж釭萃噶 援貲擊 噙堅 餌塭螳陛朝 勘 爾堅, 釭朝 闊衛 嬴筆撩擊 集釭 避擠曖 �硃姦鷏� 勒傘 <a link=\"gerardk5\">檜夠</a>梱雖 螃啪 腎歷雖.\r\n<p>\r\n</body>","gerardk5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我從亞丁城逃出來之後，為了消滅叛王，我知道一定要有支持我的新力量才行。所以我就在風木之城盟主的庇護下，組織了騎士的<a link=\"gerardk6\">的修練營地</a>。本來這是個很平凡的地方，但是因為從南方海岸的山洞和西方的黃土地不斷的出現凶暴的怪獸，所以這裡根本無人敢住，然而我倒覺得這個地方是訓練騎士最好的營地。\r\n<p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardk5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>After fleeing from the castle Aden, I realized that I would need more allies to defeat the Pretender King - thus, I created this training ground for true knights, under the protection of the Lord of Windawood Castle. This area was once a prospering town, but due to many monsters from <a link=\"gerardk6\">the cave on the southern beach</a> and the western wilderness, this area was almost deserted. I realized that, with time and effort, this place could become a good place for the kinghts' training ground.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>After fleeing from the castle Aden, I realized that I would need more allies to defeat the Pretender King - thus, I created this training ground for true knights, under the protection of the Lord of Windawood Castle. This area was once a prospering town, but due to many monsters from <a link=\"gerardk6\">the cave on the southern beach</a> and the western wilderness, this area was almost deserted. I realized that, with time and effort, this place could become a good place for the kinghts' training ground.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴筆撩擊 紫蜂耀 �� 釭朝 奩諾擊 路嬴頂晦 嬪п憮朝 億煎遴 ��檜 號檜 в蹂ж啪 腆 匙檜塭 儅陝ц啻. 斜楚憮 孺棻辦萄 艙輿曖 綠�� 嬴楚 晦餌曖 熱溼濰擊 葆溼ж啪 腎歷雖. 罹晦朝 獄楚 ゎ彰и 葆擊檜歷雖虜 <a link=\"gerardk6\">陴薹 п寰陛曖 翕掉</a>婁 憮薹 �硃姦鷊庥恓� 莒歜橈檜 �鞄醾� 跨蝶攪菟檜 轎⑷п憮 剪曖 餌塋檜 髦雖 彊朝 夠檜歷雖. ж雖虜 陪 檜楛 夠檜撿蜓煎 晦餌菟曖 熱溼濰模煎朝 寰撩蜃辭檜塭堅 儅陝ц棻啻.\r\n<p>\r\n</body>","gerardk6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>出了村莊，往南西方的方向去，就會發現海岸附近有像山洞的入口。在很久以前，風木之城的始祖卡勒壓制現在位於風木之城的巴列斯，建立了一座城堡之後，走投無路的怪獸們就把那個地方當做自己的安身立命的地方。如果你在村莊的附近受過較高的訓練的話，那麼一定可以在那裡接受更高一層的訓練。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardk6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you go southwest from the town, you will find an entrance to the cave along the beach. Long time ago, when Karel Tanford built Windawood on the ruins of the dungeon he conquered, the remaining monsters fled to that cave. If you feel you have had enough training near the town, their lair may be a good place to advance to higher level.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you go southwest from the town, you will find an entrance to the cave along the beach. Long time ago, when Karel Tanford built Windawood on the ruins of the dungeon he conquered, the remaining monsters fled to that cave. If you feel you have had enough training near the town, their lair may be a good place to advance to higher level.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardk6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>葆擊縑憮 陴憮薹 寞щ戲煎 釭賊 п寰 斬籀縑 陪 翕掉 殮掘陛 氈雖. 螃楚 瞪縑 孺棻辦萄曖 衛褻檣 蘋滂 驕ん萄陛 ⑷營曖 孺棻辦萄 撩 嬪纂縑 氈湍 湍蟒擊 薯憶ж堅 撩擊 撮遴 ��, 陞 夠擊 檠擎 跨蝶攪 濤渡菟擎 斜 夠擊 憮衝雖陛 腎歷棻啻. 濠啻陛 葆擊 斬籀縑憮 橫替 薑紫 熱溼擊 論懊棻賊 斜夠縑憮 覬 渦 堪擎 唳雖煎 螢塭撲 熱 氈擊 匙檜塭啻.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","gerardkev1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>嗯，不錯，你也成長不少了，我想也是該把騎士試鍊的准考證給你的時候了。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>經過弓箭訓練地後，你就會看到試練的通道，那邊有三個跟隨我多年的屬下。要進入那個地方，首先要尋找放在某處的狼人之屋的鑰匙，拿著那個進入狼人的房間，殺了狼人之後，把狼人的犬齒當成證據拿來給我。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖然狼人可能已經不是你的對手，可是決不能因此就覺得你的試練很簡單。因為你不能穿戴任何裝備進入試練的通道，你只能利用通道附近守衛配備給你的匕首和蠟燭來通過考試。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>四處流蕩的狼是你最危險的對手，此外在那裡已經點燃可以致命的毒香，所以時間也是你的大敵。 </p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>騎士絕對不是靠武裝和裝備的，要能知道自己的弱點而超越自己的人，才能得到真正的騎士之名。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardkev1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmmm... So, you have advanced this far. I have been thinking that you might soon deserve the title of Knight.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There is a place called the \"Dungeon of Hardship\" above the target range field for the archers; you can see three of my old lieutenants guarding the area. Go there, find the key hidden in the dungeon, and enter the Room of The Werewolf with that key. Kill the werewolf, and bring me the fang of werewolf as a proof.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nYou may think that werewolves are no match for you - but the test won't be so easy. You can bring nothing with you into the dungeon; you must go through the dungeon with only a dagger and a candle to aid you.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nDue to the poison gas in the dungeon, time won't be your friend...and if this were not trouble enough, many wolves in the dungeon may threaten your life.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nA knight should never depend on surviving merely through good equipment, but upon his or her innate courage and perseverance. If you can recognize your weakness and overcome it, you will be able to truly be called a Knight.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardkev1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmmm... So, you have advanced this far. I have been thinking that you might soon deserve the title of Knight.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There is a place called the \"Dungeon of Hardship\" above the target range field for the archers; you can see three of my old lieutenants guarding the area. Go there, find the key hidden in the dungeon, and enter the Room of The Werewolf with that key. Kill the werewolf, and bring me the fang of werewolf as a proof.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nYou may think that werewolves are no match for you - but the test won't be so easy. You can bring nothing with you into the dungeon; you must go through the dungeon with only a dagger and a candle to aid you.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nDue to the poison gas in the dungeon, time won't be your friend...and if this were not trouble enough, many wolves in the dungeon may threaten your life.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nA knight should never depend on surviving merely through good equipment, but upon his or her innate courage and perseverance. If you can recognize your weakness and overcome it, you will be able to truly be called a Knight.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardkEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>�敻� 斜楚, 傘紫 橫替窗 檜 虜躑檜釭 撩濰擊 п掘釭. 釭紫 傘縑啪 蝸蝸 晦餌曖 濠問擊 輿橫撿 啊棻堅 儅陝ж堅 氈歷棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>�� 熱溼濰 傘該縑 衛溼曖 鱔煎塭朝 夠檜 氈棻. 釭曖 螃楠 睡ж 3貲檜 雖酈堅 氈雖. 斜夠縑 菟橫陛憮 湍蟒 橫蛞陛縑 場罹 氈朝 翮潸蒂 瓊堅 斜勘煎 期渠 檣除擊 陛舒橫 場擎 寞縑 菟橫陛憮 期渠 檣除擊 避檜堅 斜 隸ル煎 期渠 檣除曖 歎夠棲蒂 釭縑啪 陛螳 螃傘塭.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>期渠 檣除擎 檜嘐 傘縑啦 鼻渠紫 腎雖 彊啊雖虜 斜溢棻堅 輿橫霞 衛溼檜 唸囀 陛滬遴 匙擎 嬴棲棻. 傘朝 橫雯 僭勒紫 跺縑 雖棲堅 衛溼曖 鱔煎縑 菟橫陞 熱 橈棻. 傘朝 欽雖 鱔煎 殮掘縑 場罹螳 氈朝 欽匐婁 曄蟾 ж釭虜戲煎 衛溼擊 鱔婁п撿 й 匙檜棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>傳и 斜夠縑朝 絮щ檜 Я錶螳 氈戲棲 衛除擎 唸囀 傘曖 ら檜 嬴棍 匙檜棻. 罹晦盪晦 ヴ橫場擎 期渠葆螳 傘縑啦 醴棻塢 嬪⑺檜 腆 匙檜棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>晦餌朝 唸囀 謠擎 鼠濰縑 曖襄п憮朝 寰脹棻. 濠褐曖 釭擒л擊 梟殘堅 斜匙擊 嗨橫剩擊 陽, 傘朝 霞薑и 晦餌曖 檜葷擊 橢擊 熱 氈擊 匙檜棻.</p>\r\n</body>","gerardkev2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>憑你這樣的實力要接受試練，你太傲慢了。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>難道你看不到自己的弱點嗎？知道自己的能力到哪裡，那才是修練的基本。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要再修練才行。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardkev2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Do you think you can take the test with your current skills? What pride!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Knowing oneself is the basic tenet of training.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Please train more.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardkev2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Do you think you can take the test with your current skills? What pride!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Knowing oneself is the basic tenet of training.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Please train more.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardkEv2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>啖辦 斜 薑紫曖 褒溘戲煎 衛溼擊 嫡戲溥堅 ж棻棲. 螃虜ж掘釭.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>傘縑啦 濠褐曖 嘐擒и 褒溘檜 爾檜雖 彊朝欽 蜓檜傍? 濠褐曖 棟溘擊 嬴朝 匙! 斜匙檜 熱溼曖 晦獄檜剪棺.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>覬 渦 熱溼擊 論紫煙 ж塭.</p>\r\n</body>","gerardkev3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>我給你的試練你都一一通過了，身為老師的我真的感到高興啊！你再也不是一個實習騎士，而是有資格得到騎士之證，名符其實的騎士了。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我以之前的亞丁大將『銀騎士』傑瑞德之名賜給你騎士之名，並將這盾牌賜予你做為證明。不管你去那裡，這個銀盾牌都可以為你和我的名譽作證。去吧！用這盾牌保護你自己的身體以及你選擇終身服侍的君主。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我再也沒有什麼可以教你的了，如果你還覺得自己的實力不足，那就去西北邊的古丁領地的古丁城鎮，從那裡坐船就可以去『說語島』上的『甘特之屋』。那裡的老師是高明的騎士，你一定會學到很多東西的。我聽說那裡也有從叛王那裡逃出來的王族在修練，也許會有令人期待的緣份也不一定，願你的前途與好運相伴...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardkev3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have finished my test in one piece! I am proud to see you have followed your training so well - now you truly deserve to be called a knight!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now I, 'Gerard', once the royal Silver Knight of Aden, bestow upon you your knighthood. And as proof, I give you this shield. This shield will represent you, and also my honor, wherever you go. Protect both your lord and yourself with this shield.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I have nothing else to teach you now, but if you think that you still need more training, go to the Gludin town to the northwest of Gludio Territory. There you can take a ship to the '說語島', to seek the 'House of the Red Knight'. As the master of the house, 'Gunter the Undefeated', is a truly exceptional knight, you may learn many things from him. Also I heard that some escaped princes of royal blood have taken refuge there - one of these may prove worthy of your blood pledge. May Einhasad's good will be with you!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardkev3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have finished my test in one piece! I am proud to see you have followed your training so well - now you truly deserve to be called a knight!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now I, 'Gerard', once the royal Silver Knight of Aden, bestow upon you your knighthood. And as proof, I give you this shield. This shield will represent you, and also my honor, wherever you go. Protect both your lord and yourself with this shield.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I have nothing else to teach you now, but if you think that you still need more training, go to the Gludin town to the northwest of Gludio Territory. There you can take a ship to the '說語島', to seek the 'House of the Red Knight'. As the master of the house, 'Gunter the Undefeated', is a truly exceptional knight, you may learn many things from him. Also I heard that some escaped princes of royal blood have taken refuge there - one of these may prove worthy of your blood pledge. May Einhasad's good will be with you!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardkEv3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>頂陛 頂萼 衛溼擊 鼠餌�� 鱔婁ж棻棲 蝶蝓戲煎憮 晦際晦 斜雖 橈掘釭. 檜薯 傘朝 唯蝗 晦餌陛 嬴棋 и貲曖 渡渡и 晦餌曖 濠問擊 橢晦縑 睡褶л檜 橈棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜薯 釭曖 瞪 嬴筆 耀嬪渠 擎晦餌 啪塭萄曖 檜葷戲煎 傘縑啪 晦餌曖 檜葷擊 頂葬啊棻. 斜葬堅 斜 隸ル煎 檜 寞ぬ蒂 輿啊棻. 檜 擎寞ぬ朝 啻陛 橫蛤縑 氈萇 釭諦 傘曖 貲蕨蒂 隸貲й 匙檜棻. 檜 寞ぬ煎 濠褐曖 跺婁 啻陛 醱撩擊 夥耀 捱輿蒂 雖酈紫煙 ж塭</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>陪 渦 檜鼻 濠啻縑啪 陛腦艦 匙檜 橈棻. 斜楝釭 嬴霜 蝶蝶煎 濠褐曖 褒溘檜 睡褶ж棻堅 替酗棻賊 磁憮薹縑 氈朝 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖曖 旋瑞蛞 葆擊煎 陛剪塭. 斜夠縑憮 寡蒂 顫賊 '碩擎 晦餌曖 餵'檜 氈朝 '蜓ж朝 撰'戲煎 陞 熱 氈棻. 斜夠 蝶蝓檣 '碳ぬ曖 捱攪'朝 堅貲и 晦餌檜棲 號擎 匙擊 寡選 熱 氈擊 匙檜棻. 傳и 斜夠縑朝 奩諾擊 Яп 紫蜂耀 諾褶檜 熱溼擊 ж堅 氈棻朝 模僥紫 菟歷棻. 橫翹賊 謠擎 虜陴檜 晦棻葬堅 氈擊雖紫 賅艇棻. 斜歲 傘曖 擅陳縑 號擎 ч遴檜 梓菟晦蒂.. </p>\r\n</body>","gerardkev4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>只有強大的力量和卓越的劍術是絕不能稱為騎士的。像你具有不良心機的人只會產生惡勢力而已，趕快從我眼前消失！也再也不要踏入這裡一步。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardkev4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Power and sword skill alone do not make one a knight - an evil heart like yours can only bring destruction. Get away now, and do not dare come here again!\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardkev4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Power and sword skill alone do not make one a knight - an evil heart like yours can only bring destruction. Get away now, and do not dare come here again!\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardkEv4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>樵羶陪 ��婁 嗨橫陪 匐獎褒溘虜戲煎朝 唸囀 晦餌塭 睡蒂 熱 橈棻. 傘籀歲 學и 葆擠擊 陛霞 濠縑啪 ��擎 だ惚虜擊 睡蒂 閨檜棻. 渡濰 頂 擅縑憮 餌塭螳塭. 斜葬堅 棻衛朝 檜夠縑 嫦擊 菟罹場雖 葆塭.\r\n</body>","gerardkev5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>容易解決的事就不是試練了。一旦面對考驗，絕對不會遇上困難和失敗就退縮，這就是騎士的精神。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我會再跟試練通道的守衛說明，不要輕易放棄，再試一次吧。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardkev5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If it were an easy task, I wouldn't call it the Dungeon of Hardship!  But the true knight should not fear a difficult mission.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I will inform the dungeon keeper that you will attempt your trial again.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardkev5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If it were an easy task, I wouldn't call it the Dungeon of Hardship!  But the true knight should not fear a difficult mission.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I will inform the dungeon keeper that you will attempt your trial again.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardkEv5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蔣啪 п唸й 熱 氈朝 匙擎 衛溼檜 嬴棲雖. 斜楝釭 衛溼擊 擅縑 舒堅 唸囀 僭楝憮雖 彊朝 匙檜 晦餌曖 葆擠 陛颶檜塭啻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>頂陛 棻衛 衛溼曖 鱔煎 僥雖晦縑啪 蜓п 萃纔棲 ん晦ж雖 蜓堅 棻衛 衛紫п爾啪.</p>\r\n</body>","gerardp1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>你自稱是為了躲避叛王的壓制下所逃出來的王族？如果你真的具有崇高血統的人，那麼你一定有能力可以找到你想要的人。但因為在戰亂時，我也曾看過很多像你一樣自稱是王族的假冒王子和公主，所以我不能輕易相信你。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>真正的王必須以自己的力量索回自己的寶座，如果你消滅了欺騙溫靜的迪雅王妃篡王位的叛王，以自己的力量登上王座，到了那時候我會向你發誓終身服侍你。 </p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>若你是為了消滅叛王而來到這裡尋找一起能戰鬥的同伴，我必須稱讚你，這真的是很明理的選擇。這裡有很多年輕人也有著和你一樣的目標，其中也有我親自賜下資格承認的騎士，我以我的名譽來擔保，他們都拿著可以證明他們身分的『銀盾牌』。</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardp1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you saying that you are from the royal blood who ran from the Pretender King's tyranny? Well, it looks like you have certain power to attract other people that is natural among noble bloods. But I've seen so many false princes and princesses who claim to be royal bloods during the numerous wars. So I can't trust you so easily.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The true king will claim his rightful place by himself. If you can prove that you are the true king by disposing the Pretender King, who took the throne by deceiving the innocent queen Gadria, then I'll plead my royalty to you.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you came here to search for allies who will share bloods to defeat the Pretender King, you made a wise decision. Here are many reliable young knights who want to share your dreams. Especially for the ones whom I bestowed the knighthood I can guarantee with my honor. You can distinguish them easily because all of them will carry the \"Shield of Silver Knights\" as a proof of training they went through here.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardp1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you saying that you are from the royal blood who ran from the Pretender King's tyranny? Well, it looks like you have certain power to attract other people that is natural among noble bloods. But I've seen so many false princes and princesses who claim to be royal bloods during the numerous wars. So I can't trust you so easily.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The true king will claim his rightful place by himself. If you can prove that you are the true king by disposing the Pretender King, who took the throne by deceiving the innocent queen Gadria, then I'll plead my royalty to you.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you came here to search for allies who will share bloods to defeat the Pretender King, you made a wise decision. Here are many reliable young knights who want to share your dreams. Especially for the ones whom I bestowed the knighthood I can guarantee with my honor. You can distinguish them easily because all of them will carry the \"Shield of Silver Knights\" as a proof of training they went through here.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardp1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>斜渠陛 夥煎 奩諾曖 驕憶擊 Яп 紫蜂耀 諾褶檜塭堅? 旋撮, 斜渠朝 碟貲 堅敝и ⑸鱔曖 餌塋虜檜 陛韓 熱 氈朝 餌塋擊 莊橫菟檜朝 棟溘檜 氈朝 匙 偽晦朝 ж捱. ж雖虜 釭朝 瞪塢 鱔縑 斜渠籀歲 蝶蝶煎蒂 諾褶檜塭 蘆ж朝 熱號擎 剪騁 諾濠諦 奢輿蒂 爾嬴諮啻. 斜楝棲 撓碳葬 圖擊 熱朝 橈雖.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>鼠萱 霞薑и 諾擎 蝶蝶煎曖 棟溘戲煎 諾曖 濠葬縑 螃腦朝 徹檜啻. 虜擒 濠啻陛 薑熨и 陛萄葬嬴 諾綠蒂 樓檜堅 諾嬪蒂 雙驍и 奩諾擊 橈擁堅 蝶蝶煎曖 ��戲煎 諾歜擊 隸貲и棻賊 斜 陽縑撿 蜓煎 斜渠縑啪 醱撩擊 裊撮ж啊啻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>虜擒 斜渠陛 奩諾擊 藥睡熱晦 嬪п Я蒂 釭揚 翕猿蒂 掘ж溥堅 檜夠縑 諮棻賊 螢夥艇 摹鷗檜歷啻. 罹晦縛 濠啻曖 翎縑 翕霤й 萇萇и 瞬擎檜菟檜 號檜 氈啻. 斜 醞縑憮紫 頂陛 耀�� 濠問擊 頂萼 晦餌菟曖 濠韓縑 渠п憮朝  釭曖 貲蕨蒂 勘 熱紫 氈雖. 斜菟擎 賅舒 檜 夠 轎褐歜擊 隸貲ж朝 '擎晦餌曖 寞ぬ'蒂 陛雖堅 氈戲棲梱.</p>\r\n","gerardw1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑瑞德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>魔法師，歡迎歡迎。不過，就像很多人第一次見到魔法師都會問道的，請問您是侍奉善良之神殷海薩，還是侍奉邪惡之神格蘭肯呢？</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如果你侍奉殷海薩，一定會聯合騎士幫助毀滅叛王，善良的魔法師和強壯的騎士總會是友軍；但是如果你是侍奉邪惡之神格蘭肯，我便無法原諒你，因為叛王肯恩使用了惡毒的黑魔法欺騙了迪雅王妃，我猜想叛王屬下中一定有一個是恐怖黑魔法師。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerardw1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, sorcerer. Having met wizards like you before, I have a question to ask of you: Do you serve the good god Einhasad, or the evil good Gran Kain?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you are serving Einhasad, You should work to aid the knights who try to defeat the Pretender King. Good wizards have always been the trustworthy allies of knights... But if you are serving Gran Kain, I cannot forgive you - I'm sure that Ken Rauhel the Pretender King used black magic to deceive Queen Gadria. It seems certain that the Pretender King has the forces of a powerful black wizard under his disposal...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardw1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gerard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, sorcerer. Having met wizards like you before, I have a question to ask of you: Do you serve the good god Einhasad, or the evil good Gran Kain?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you are serving Einhasad, You should work to aid the knights who try to defeat the Pretender King. Good wizards have always been the trustworthy allies of knights... But if you are serving Gran Kain, I cannot forgive you - I'm sure that Ken Rauhel the Pretender King used black magic to deceive Queen Gadria. It seems certain that the Pretender King has the forces of a powerful black wizard under his disposal...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerardw1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪塭萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃衛螃. 葆徹餌罹. 斜楛等, 葆徹餌蒂 籀擠 虜釭朝 賅萇 餌塋菟檜 僭橫爾蛭, 斜渠朝 摹и 褐 嬴檣ж餌萄蒂 撰晦衛螃, 嬴棲賊 學и 褐 斜嫌蘋檣擊 撰晦衛螃?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜渠陛 嬴檣ж餌萄蒂 撰曹棻賊 碟貲 晦餌蒂 紫諦憮 奩諾擊 路嬴頂朝 等 ⑺褻蒂 й 匙檜 ぎ葡橈擊 匙檜螃. 樹薯萇 摹и 葆徹餌朝 晦餌曖 萇萇и 辦捱檜歷戲棲梱.. ж雖虜 虜擒 斜渠陛 學и 褐 斜嫌蘋檣擊 撰曹棻賊 陪 紫盪�� 斜渠蒂 辨憮й 熱 橈模. 謁傍ж賊 奩諾 騰 塭辦⑦檜 陛萄葬嬴 諾綠蒂 樓檜朝等, 餌學и �皜飪�擊 噹 匙檜 ぎ葡橈戲棲梱. 碟貲 奩諾擎 鼠衛鼠衛и �皜飪�餌蒂 �秷牉� 舒堅 氈朝 啪 ぎ葡橈模.</p>\r\n</body>","gerenge1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>嗯∼我從沒想到我會在一個如此淒涼的地方遇見一個妖精。你想尋找什麼有趣的東西嗎？我想也是...因為這個地方就是傳言中的那個訓練<a link=\"gerenge2\">魔法師</a>的場所。在這裡發現了許多魔法的 <a link=\"gerenge3\">成分</a>，在本地 <a link=\"gerenge4\">精神的訓練</a> 也是非常活躍的。\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">學習魔法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerenge1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Hmm...I never thought I would meet an elf in such a forlorn place. Looking for something interesting, eh? If I could venture some guesses, it'd be because this place is rumored to have been a training ground for <a link=\"gerenge2\">wizards</a> - also, many magical <a link=\"gerenge3\">ingredients</a> are to be found here, and the local <a link=\"gerenge4\">spirits</a> are very active, as well.  Quite a bit to draw you, I suppose!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">Learn magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenge1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Hmm...I never thought I would meet an elf in such a forlorn place. Looking for something interesting, eh? If I could venture some guesses, it'd be because this place is rumored to have been a training ground for <a link=\"gerenge2\">wizards</a> - also, many magical <a link=\"gerenge3\">ingredients</a> are to be found here, and the local <a link=\"gerenge4\">spirits</a> are very active, as well.  Quite a bit to draw you, I suppose!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">Learn magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenge1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>�ˋ�...檜楛 諼霞 夠縑憮 蹂薑擊 爾啪 腎棻棲 曖諼煎捱蹂. 檜夠縑 鼠樹陛 �儮抸硒� 匙檜塭紫 氈蝗棲梱? ж曹...檜夠擎 諼雖曹 п紫 蕨瞪睡攪 <a link=\"gerenge2\">葆徹餌</a>菟曖 熱溼濰戲煎 餌辨腎湍 夠檜棲 葆徹縑 в蹂и <a link=\"gerenge3\">營猿</a>朝 Ё睡и ら檜雖蹂...<a link=\"gerenge4\">薑滄</a>菟曖 遺霜歜紫 �偎萩� ら檜堅 蜓殮棲棻.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a>\r\n\r\n</body>","gerenge2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>殷海薩的和格蘭肯的是構成我們世界現象的基礎。那些學習這兩種對立的力量的人，他們知道很多關於神的事，但是他們也是距離所信奉學習的神最遙遠的，因為<a link=\"gerenge5\">我們魔法師不相信任何的神...</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerenge2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Those who study the two opposing forces which underlie every phenomena of our world - Einhasad's benovelence and Grancain's malovelence - know much about the gods, but are also the furthest from those deities whom they study.  Some even say <a  link = \"gerenge5\">we wizards don't believe in any gods</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenge2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Those who study the two opposing forces which underlie every phenomena of our world - Einhasad's benovelence and Grancain's malovelence - know much about the gods, but are also the furthest from those deities whom they study.  Some even say <a  link = \"gerenge5\">we wizards don't believe in any gods</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenge2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 撮啗曖 賅萇 ⑷鼻擊 撲貲й 熱 氈朝 舒 蹴 - 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 摹л婁 斜嫌蘋檣曖 學л - 擊 翱掘ж朝 餌塋菟檜雖蹂...褐菟縑 渠п 陛濰 澀 嬴朝 餌塋菟檜雖虜, 翕衛縑 褐菟縑啪憮 陛濰 試 夠縑 氈朝 餌塋菟檜晦紫 м棲棻. <a link = \"gerenge5\">辦葬 葆徹餌菟擎 褐擊 圖雖 彊剪萇蹂</a>.\r\n</body>","gerenge3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>深紅色蕈類、龍的牙齒、神聖的藍色葡萄、野山人參、漂浮之眼的肉、柳樹根、玉的碎片和骨頭粉末。這八種成分被用在法術上，每種成分各有不同的性質。因此，費用是不同，幸運地是漂浮之眼睛的肉和骨頭粉末，在這個區域相當豐富。但是更有價值的材料，例如龍的牙齒和深紅色蕈類就很難到手了。 \r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerenge3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>There are eight ingredients used in magic spells - crimson mushroom, dragon's teeth, holy blue grapes, mountain ginseng, floating-eye meat, willow root, shard of jade, and bone powder. Each ingredient has different properties and therefore, costs different amounts. Fortunately this area has an abundant supply of floating-eye meat and bone powder, but more valuable ones such as dragon's teeth and crimson mushrooms are hard to come by...\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenge3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>There are eight ingredients used in magic spells - crimson mushroom, dragon's teeth, holy blue grapes, mountain ginseng, floating-eye meat, willow root, shard of jade, and bone powder. Each ingredient has different properties and therefore, costs different amounts. Fortunately this area has an abundant supply of floating-eye meat and bone powder, but more valuable ones such as dragon's teeth and crimson mushrooms are hard to come by...\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenge3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>葆徹縑 餌辨腎朝 8陛雖曖 營猿蒂 蜓ж朝 匙殮棲棻. 霞�姣� 幗撓, 辨曖 檜說, 撩蝶楝遴 ヰ艇 該瑞, 骯鳴, 惚僭換 堅晦, 幗萄釭鼠 銑葬, 螟給 褻陝, 斜葬堅 鄙陛瑞陛 氈雖蹂. 陝陝 撩問紫 ぎ葬堅, 傳 鼠歙爾棻紫 陛問檜 觼啪 離檜陛 釭雖蹂. 檜夠縑憮朝 棻ч�� 惚僭換 堅晦釭 鄙陛瑞蛔擎 Ё睡ж雖虜, 錶釩 襟檜塭 辨曖 檜說檜釭 霞�姣� 幗撓 偽擎 敝и 營猿朝 掘唳紫 ж晦 ��萇 鼻�窕抾矕炴�.\r\n</body>","gerenge4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哈哈哈∼是的，我是知道的你的種族並不感激那樣的方式。我道歉...但對於人類來說，妖精在人類與自然可以理解的範圍內安靜地遵崇世界的法則，像是非常不同的實體。因此人類把人的特性賦予他們。  \r\n<p>四種自然的元素對人類的生活是很重要的，水、火、土和風分別地被稱為伊娃、帕格立歐、梅弗、沙哈。如果傳聞是真實的，那麼這些就是在過去曾經很偉大的魔法師的名字。 \r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerenge4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hahaha...Yes, I am aware that your kind does not appreciate that term; my apologies. But to humans, spirits - with conciousness understandable by humans, and nature - which quietly follows universal laws, seem to be very different entities. Therefore humans attribute human characteristics to the the motivating forces.  \r\n<p>The four natural elements important to human life  are water, fire, earth and wind; each of these have acquired divine qualities called Eva, Pargrio, Maphrr, and Sayha, respectively. If the rumors are true, those are the names of once-great wizards of the past - but of this, I know not.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenge4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hahaha...Yes, I am aware that your kind does not appreciate that term; my apologies. But to humans, spirits - with conciousness understandable by humans, and nature - which quietly follows universal laws, seem to be very different entities. Therefore humans attribute human characteristics to the the motivating forces.  \r\n<p>The four natural elements important to human life  are water, fire, earth and wind; each of these have acquired divine qualities called Eva, Pargrio, Maphrr, and Sayha, respectively. If the rumors are true, those are the names of once-great wizards of the past - but of this, I know not.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenge4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>жжж..蕨...渡褐菟擎 斜 ル⑷擊 褓橫ц雖蹂. 嘐寰м棲棻. ж雖虜 辦葬 檣除菟曖 唳辦朝 檣除檜 檜пй 熱 氈朝 謙盟曖 '曖雖'陛 氈朝 薑滄婁, 斜盪 牖葬縑 評塭 �篞秣●� 蛭 藹僧ж朝 濠翱擎 偽擎 匙檜塭 爾晦 橫滑雖蹂. 斜楚憮 睡菜檜 曖檣�飛� 衛酈啪 脹港棲棻. \r\n<p>か�� 僭, 碳, 渠雖, 夥塋婁 偽檜 檣除 儅�偽� 婦溼檜 桶擎 濠翱曖 蹂模菟擎 陝陝 縑夥, だ嬴斜葬螃, 葆Щ腦, 餌檜ж塭 碳葬辦朝 褐撩葆盪 陛雖啪 腎歷雖蹂. 凳, 罹晦縑 渠п憮朝 檜菟 賅舒陛 褒襄ц湍 鬼渠и 葆徹餌菟檜塭朝 撲檜 鬼ж雖虜 蜓殮棲棻.\r\n</body>","gerenge5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>其實，這是很自然的。對我們來說，神的存在只是一個『前提』。真正使我們感興趣的東西是起源於那些實體的許多法則。自然的法則給了我們力量，而明白那些法則就是神學者們的重要工作。</p>\r\n<p>哈∼當然，像你這樣的妖精會遵從殷海薩的意志，對抗那些已經把他們的靈魂賣給格蘭肯的『黑暗妖精』。魔法師們則從不考慮『神的意志』。雖然如此，我們也仍該是他們的忠實追隨者。 \r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerenge5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Actually, it is quite simple. To us, the existence of the gods is merely a assumption - what really interests us are the many laws derived from those entities. Understanding such laws gives us our power; ascribing meaning to those laws is a job for theologians.\r\n<p>Hahaha...of course, an elf such as yourself will follow the will of Einhasad, except the 'Dark Elves' which have sold their souls to Gran Kain. Wizards do not generally spend time pondering 'the will of the gods', though one must fill the time waiting for one's energies to replenish with SOME thought, one hopes...but despite this, we may be the gods' most loyal followers.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenge5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Actually, it is quite simple. To us, the existence of the gods is merely a assumption - what really interests us are the many laws derived from those entities. Understanding such laws gives us our power; ascribing meaning to those laws is a job for theologians.\r\n<p>Hahaha...of course, an elf such as yourself will follow the will of Einhasad, except the 'Dark Elves' which have sold their souls to Gran Kain. Wizards do not generally spend time pondering 'the will of the gods', though one must fill the time waiting for one's energies to replenish with SOME thought, one hopes...but despite this, we may be the gods' most loyal followers.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenge5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>橫飩啪 儅陝ж賊 渡翱и 橾檜塭 й 熱 氈啊雖蹂. 褐菟曖 襄營朝 辦葬縑啪 氈橫憮朝 欽牖и '渠瞪薯'縑 雖釭雖 彊蝗棲棻. 辦葬陛 婦褕檜 氈朝 匙擎 斜菟曖 襄營縑 曖п だ儅腎朝 熱號擎 徹罌菟 - 夥煎 '��'殮棲棻. 褐菟檜 檜楝и 徹罌縑 橫集и 嗆擊 氬懊朝陛蒂 儅陝ж朝 匙擎 褐з濠菟曖 跟檜雖蹂. \r\n<p>жжж...僭煩 渡褐婁 偽擎 蹂薑檜塭賊 渡翱�� 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 嗆縑 評塭 髦嬴陛啊雖蹂 - 斜嫌蘋檣曖 嬴葷棻遺縑 �母� っ '匐擎 蹂薑'菟擊 薯諼ж賊 蜓殮棲棻. 葆徹餌菟擎 褐曖 '嗆'擊 儅陝ж雖 彊蝗棲棻. ж雖虜, 橫翹賊 辦葬撿蜓煎 斜菟曖 嗆擊 陛濰 翮溺�� 熱чж朝 濠菟檣雖紫 賅落棲棻.\r\n</body>","gerengev1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>靠著刀劍生活的騎士、任何的無神論者等無法承認神的存在的人，是不能學習魔法的知識。從這一刻起，你的腳踏在魔法之上，來承認神吧，不論祂是善良或邪惡的，你都必須要在大地的所有角落發揚祂的力量。\r\n<p>學習魔法需要很多時間，除非你天生就會...。再說，有一些高等級的法術還需要很多罕見的物品。不過一旦你準備好，你可以很輕易地學會比較低階的法術。但是在每次教完一個法術之後，照慣例，教師通常會收取一些禮物。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"buyspell\">學習魔法</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"gerenghp1\">問魔法的事</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerengEv1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> Knights or any of those who refuse to acknowledge the existence of gods can't learn magic. From the moment you accept magic, you come to acknowledge a god, whether good or evil, and channel His power to the earth.\r\n<p> Learning magic is costly - in several ways.  While some high level spells require rare ingredients, all spells have a cost to your mind and possibly even your health.  I can teach you lower level spells fairly easily once you are ready - at a relatively small cost, since it merely impacts your store of adena...\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"buyspell\">Learn magic</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"gerenghp1\">Ask about magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengEv1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> Knights or any of those who refuse to acknowledge the existence of gods can't learn magic. From the moment you accept magic, you come to acknowledge a god, whether good or evil, and channel His power to the earth.\r\n<p> Learning magic is costly - in several ways.  While some high level spells require rare ingredients, all spells have a cost to your mind and possibly even your health.  I can teach you lower level spells fairly easily once you are ready - at a relatively small cost, since it merely impacts your store of adena...\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"buyspell\">Learn magic</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"gerenghp1\">Ask about magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>匐虜擊 曖雖ж貊 餌朝 晦餌釭 褐曖 襄營蒂 諫瞪�� 睡薑ж朝 鼠褐煩濠朝 褐曖 撥葬檣 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 橈啻. 葆徹擊 寡辦朝 牖除睡攪, 渡褐擎 摹ж萇 學ж萇 褐擊 檣薑ж堅 斜 ��擊 雖鼻縑憮 羹⑷ж朝 濠陛 腎朝 匙檜雖.\r\n<p>葆徹擊 奢睡ж晦 嬪п憮朝 號擎 匙檜 в蹂ж棻啻. 僭煩 摹繭瞳戲煎 樵羶陪 模韓擊 顫堅陬棻賊 賅腦啊雖虜...斜溢雖 彊棻賊 渦 堅紫曖 葆徹擊 寡錶 釭陞 熱煙 渦遵 號擎 紫掘諦 衛猿蒂 в蹂煎 ж剪萇. 爾鱔 葆徹擊 陛腦艦 陽朝 輿僥 ж釭渡 熱機猿蒂 嫡朝 衝戲煎 ж堆 ж雖.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"buyspell\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"gerenghp1\">葆徹縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","gerengev2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>不管是靠著刀劍生活的騎士，還是任何的無神論者，只要是不承認神的存在的人，就無法學習魔法。基本上，魔法是為已經信賴神的人而生。像你一樣如此強壯的人是不會需要它的。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerengEv2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> Knights live by the sword; I can't teach you any magic. Some say magic is basically for weaklings who have to rely on God...strong people like you don't need it.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengEv2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> Knights live by the sword; I can't teach you any magic. Some say magic is basically for weaklings who have to rely on God...strong people like you don't need it.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengEv2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>匐虜擊 曖雖ж貊 餌朝 晦餌釭 褐曖 襄營蒂 諫瞪�� 睡薑ж朝 鼠褐煩濠朝 褐曖 撥葬檣 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 橈棻啻. 葆徹擎 斬獄瞳戲煎 褐擊 曖雖п撿 ж朝 擒и 濠曖 匙...濠啻偽擎 鬼и 餌塋縑啪朝 в蹂 橈朝 匙檜雖.\r\n</body>","gerengev3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你已經學完這個等級所有的課程。 \r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp3\">學習魔法的狀態</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","GerengEv3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You've already learned everything you can at your level - congratulations!\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp3\">Conditions of learning magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengEv3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You've already learned everything you can at your level - congratulations!\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp3\">Conditions of learning magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengEv3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠啻朝 濠啻 熱遽縑憮 寡選 熱 氈朝 葆徹擊 賅舒 寡錫啻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp3\">葆徹擊 寡辦朝 褻勒</a>\r\n</body>","gerenghp1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你希望知道什麼？ \r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp2\">魔法的原則</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp3\">魔法的等級</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp4\">白魔法與黑魔法</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp5\">魔法的儀式</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerenghp1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What do you wish to know?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp2\">The Principles of Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp3\">The Stages of Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp4\">White Magic and Black Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp5\">Ritual Magic</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenghp1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What do you wish to know?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp2\">The Principles of Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp3\">The Stages of Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp4\">White Magic and Black Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp5\">Ritual Magic</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenghp1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>鼠歙檜 憲堅 談擎陛?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp2\">葆徹曖 錳葬</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp3\">葆徹曖 欽啗</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp4\">寥葆徹婁 �皜飪�</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerenghp5\">曖衝 葆徹</a><br>\r\n</body>","gerenghp2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你聽過『兩個神的神話』嗎？我們所使用的魔法是善神殷海薩和邪神格蘭肯帶來這個世界上的力量。就某方面來說，與其這說是魔術，倒不如說是奇蹟。所以那些在歐瑞的象牙塔中，藉著遵從神的意志的神學者，將它定義為『魔法』。在這個宇宙的意識中，所有與知識不同的，都稱它們叫做自然的法則，這也是那群魔法師們的想法之一。</p>\r\n<p>但是當然有一個例外。神不授與不信任他的人力量，或藉著他自己力量生活像騎士一樣。那是因為他們嫉妒。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>施放法術時，魔法師會消耗精神上的力量。他們習慣稱它做『魔力』。有些人說有較多的『魔力』的人比較虔誠...但是那有點誤差，因為基本上來說，所有的法術都需要魔力。</p>\r\n<p>有一些法術也需要施法者的肉體力量。你必須很小心地施展，因為這些法術可能會嚴重的影響你的身體。</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerenghp2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Have you ever heard about the 'Myth of the Two Gods'? The magic we use channels the power of Einhasad the Good God and Gran Kain the Evil God to this world. In that sense, it's closer to being a miracle than magic. The reason why wizards from the Ivory Tower of Oren defines this power as 'Magic' despite the theory of a few mythologists is because the Will of God is, in a cosmic sense, very inspecific - and thus no different from what we call the Law of Nature.</p>\r\n<p>But of course there is an exception. Naturally the Gods don't grant power to people who don't believe in them, or to those who live entirely by their own power, such as Knights.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Wizards consume a spiritual power called \"mana\" when casting the spell. Some people say the man with more mana is more pious..., but that's not always true. All spells consume Mana in some amount, in any case.</p>\r\n<p>Some of the spells also drain the caster's physical power - you have to be careful when casting these spells since it could affect your body significantly.  Quite significantly, if it leaves you dead!</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenghp2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Have you ever heard about the 'Myth of the Two Gods'? The magic we use channels the power of Einhasad the Good God and Gran Kain the Evil God to this world. In that sense, it's closer to being a miracle than magic. The reason why wizards from the Ivory Tower of Oren defines this power as 'Magic' despite the theory of a few mythologists is because the Will of God is, in a cosmic sense, very inspecific - and thus no different from what we call the Law of Nature.</p>\r\n<p>But of course there is an exception. Naturally the Gods don't grant power to people who don't believe in them, or to those who live entirely by their own power, such as Knights.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Wizards consume a spiritual power called \"mana\" when casting the spell. Some people say the man with more mana is more pious..., but that's not always true. All spells consume Mana in some amount, in any case.</p>\r\n<p>Some of the spells also drain the caster's physical power - you have to be careful when casting these spells since it could affect your body significantly.  Quite significantly, if it leaves you dead!</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenghp2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'2渠褐 褐懈'縑 渠п憮 憲堅 氈朝陛? 辦葬陛 餌辨ж朝 葆徹擎 獄楚 '摹и 褐' 嬴檣ж餌萄諦 '學и 褐' 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 嗆檜 檜 撮鼻縑 掘羹�音Ж� 寞徹檜塭啻. 斜楛 薄縑憮朝 葆徹檜塭晦 爾棻朝 螃�鷛� 晦瞳縑 陛梆雖. ж雖虜 賃賃 褐з濠菟曖 奩渠 曖唯縑紫 碳掘ж堅 螃溶曖 鼻嬴鱉擊 醞褕戲煎 и 葆徹餌 餵欽檜 檜蒂 '葆徹'戲煎 敘薑ж朝 匙擎, 褐曖 撥葬塭朝 匙擎 辦輿瞳檣 婦薄縑憮 獐 陽 傘鼠釭 爾ら瞳檜橫憮, 辦葬陛 濠翱 徹罌檜塭堅 睡腦堅 氈朝 匙菟婁 ж蛔 棻蒂夥 橈晦 陽僥檜雖.</p>\r\n<p>ж雖虜 僭煩 蕨諼朝 氈雖. 渡翱�� 褐擎 濠褐曖 襄營蒂 圖雖 彊朝 濠菟縑啪 ��擊 輿雖朝 彊朝棻啻. 傳 濠晦 濠褐曖 ��虜擊 圖堅 髦嬴陛朝 餌塋菟 - 晦餌偽擎 贗楚蝶陛 渠ル瞳檜啊雖 - 縑啪朝 褐擎 羲餌ж衛雖 彊朝棻啻. 謁傍ж賊 褐擎 韓癱ж朝 襄營檜晦 陽僥檜雖. </p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>葆徹餌朝 葆徹擊 餌辨й 陽 鼻渡и 薑褐溘擊 в蹂煎 ж雖. 葆徹餌菟擎 檜匙擊 ら曖鼻 '葆釭'塭 睡腦啻. 謙掖瞳戲煎朝 葆釭蒂 Ё睡ж啪 陛雖堅 氈朝 餌塋擊 褐懈褕檜 謠棻塭堅紫 ж雖虜...窕 斜楛勒 嬴棲撿. 橫繚萇 晦獄瞳戲煎 賅萇 葆徹擎 葆釭蒂 餌辨и棻啻.</p>\r\n<p>賃賃 葆徹擎 葆釭 諼縑 濠褐曖 羹溘擊 模賅ж晦紫 п. 檜楛 葆徹擎 餌辨й 陽 褒薯煎 跺縑 鬼и 醱問檜 螃棲 餌辨й 陽 輿曖п撿 ж啻. </p>\r\n\r\n</body>","gerenghp3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>法術的等級總共有１０個等級。第一級的法術很簡單，就像是使物體發光或是治癒輕微的創傷。但是高階法術時則很有威力，不過那些法術並不是每個人都可以用；特別是第七級以上的法術，這些都只有專業的魔法師才能學習。妖精們有很好的魔法本質，能學習到第六級的法術；不過身負重任的王子或公主就只能學到第二級了。</p>\r\n<p>此外，在增加法術等級上限的速度方面也有不同。 魔法師們在等級４時就能學習第一級的法術，而且也可以在晉升到下一個等級時，再學習另外四個額外的法術。妖精們可以在等級８時，學習第一階段的符咒，不過如果想要學習下一級的法術，就還要到等級１６才行。王子或公主只能在等級１０學習第一階段的符咒，在等級２０學習第二階段，但這也是他們的最大極限了。</p>\r\n<p>不過，我只可以教你到第三階段法術，說真的就算比我更有力量的魔法師也不能真的『教』第４或更高階段的法術。即使魔法師們仍然在研究，但決不會表現出說他們明白這魔法的所有秘密。你只能藉著拜訪世界各地的神殿而且經過一些儀式，才能學習比較高階段的符咒。在那裡，神會告訴你應如何去學習它們。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerenghp3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are a total of 10 levels of Magic. First level magic are simple cantrips - making your staff shine or making light wounds close.  High-level spells are far, far more powerful than that - but those spells are not for everyone. 7th level or higher spells can be learned only by professional wizards. Elves who are innately good at magic from their elemental nature can learn spells up to level 6, princes or princesses who but dabble in the arts can only learn up to level 2.</p>\r\n<p>There is also a difference in rate of learning in addition to the limits on total power - wizards can learn the first level spells at level 4 and get an opportunity to learn the next level of spells every four levels thereafter.  Elves, on the other hand, can learn their first level spells at level 8 and next for each 8 levels. Those of royal blood can only learn first level spells at level 10 and 2nd at level 20.</p>\r\n<p>I can teach you, but I am limited to third level spells...in fact, even wizards of more power than I can't really 'teach' 4th or higher level spells - for some things, a wizard must prove themselves worthy by their own research.  You can only learn higher level spells by acquiring spellbooks, and then visiting the temples around the world and performing an appropriate ritual. There, the Gods will tell you how you can learn the spells.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenghp3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are a total of 10 levels of Magic. First level magic are simple cantrips - making your staff shine or making light wounds close.  High-level spells are far, far more powerful than that - but those spells are not for everyone. 7th level or higher spells can be learned only by professional wizards. Elves who are innately good at magic from their elemental nature can learn spells up to level 6, princes or princesses who but dabble in the arts can only learn up to level 2.</p>\r\n<p>There is also a difference in rate of learning in addition to the limits on total power - wizards can learn the first level spells at level 4 and get an opportunity to learn the next level of spells every four levels thereafter.  Elves, on the other hand, can learn their first level spells at level 8 and next for each 8 levels. Those of royal blood can only learn first level spells at level 10 and 2nd at level 20.</p>\r\n<p>I can teach you, but I am limited to third level spells...in fact, even wizards of more power than I can't really 'teach' 4th or higher level spells - for some things, a wizard must prove themselves worthy by their own research.  You can only learn higher level spells by acquiring spellbooks, and then visiting the temples around the world and performing an appropriate ritual. There, the Gods will tell you how you can learn the spells.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenghp3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>葆徹擎 賅舒 10偃曖 溯漣煎 檜瑞橫雖啻. 1溯漣擎 菟堅 氈朝 雖な檜蒂 維釭啪 и棻萇雖, 唳嘐и 鼻籀蒂 纂猿ж朝 匙 偽擎 欽牖и 匙菟檜雖虜, 溯漣檜 螢塭陞 熱煙 薄薄 鬼溘и 葆徹菟檜 蛔濰ж啪 腎雖. ж雖虜 檜楝и 堅溯漣曖 葆徹菟擎 嬴鼠釭 寡選 熱 氈朝 匙檜 嬴棲塭啻. か�� 7溯漣 檜鼻曖 堅紫и 葆徹菟擎 瞪僥瞳檣 葆徹餌 檜諼縑朝 寡辦朝 匙檜 碳陛棟ж雖. 錳楚睡攪 葆徹瞳檣 模韓檜 氈朝 蹂薑褶檜 除褐�� 6溯漣梱雖曖 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈堅, 賅萇 匙縑 棟鱔п撿 ж朝 諾濠釭 奢輿菟擎 2溯漣梱雖 寡辦朝 匙檜 堅濛橾 匙檜撿.</p>\r\n<p>寡辦朝 溯漣曖 鼻и 閨虜檜 嬴棲塭 寡辦朝 樓紫縑紫 贗楚蝶 滌煎 離檜陛 氈雖. 葆徹餌 偽擎 唳辦朝 籀擠 4溯漣檜 腎賊憮 葆徹溯漣 1曖 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈啪 腎堅 斜 �� 4溯漣檜 螃蒂 陽葆棻 億煎遴 溯漣曖 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈雖. ж雖虜 蹂薑曖 唳辦朝 8溯漣檜 腎橫憮撿 綠煎模 1溯漣 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈堅, 斜 �� 8溯漣檜 螃蒂 陽葆棻 億煎遴 溯漣曖 葆徹擊 寡遴棻啻. 10溯漣檜 腎橫撿 1溯漣 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈堅 斜釭葆 20溯漣縑 2溯漣 葆徹擊 寡辦堅 部檣 諾濠, 奢輿偽擎 贗楚蝶紫 氈朝勘.</p>\r\n<p>ж雖虜 頂陛 陛腦藥還 熱 氈朝 匙擎 堅濛п撿 3溯漣梱雖塭啻...餌褒 釭爾棻 �徆� 嗨橫陪 棟溘擊 陛霞 葆徹餌塭堅 п紫 嬴鼠 熱溼紫 論雖 彊擎 餌塋縑啪 4溯漣 檜鼻曖 葆徹擊 '陛腦纂朝' 匙擎 碳陛棟ж雖. 葆徹餌菟檜 翮褕�� 翱掘蒂 ж堅朝 氈雖虜, 嬴霜梱雖 褐曖 撥葬陛 賅舒 п貲脹 匙擎 嬴棲剪萇. 檜�釋� 葆徹菟擎 濠啻陛 霜蕾 撮啗 陝雖縑 ぷ螳氈朝 褐瞪擊 寞僥п 斜夠縑憮 瞳瞰и 曖衝擊 纂瑞堅 褐饕擊 嫡嬴撿虜 寡選 熱 氈棻啻. 葆徹擊 寡辦朝 寞徹擎 褐眷憮 憲溥輿褐棻朝 蜓檜雖.\r\n</body>","gerenghp4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>就像是人，法術也有它自己的本性。善良的法術可以救人；而邪惡的就會破壞所有事物；當然也有一些是中立的。魔法師為了區別善神殷海薩的魔法和邪神格蘭肯的魔法，所以分別稱呼它們為白魔法和黑魔法。</p>\r\n<p>同樣的，如果你已經研究過魔法的目錄，你或許知道每個等級的法術都包含著白魔法和黑魔法兩者。我將盡我所能，教你這兩種法術...但是如果你要學習比較高等級的法術，你就必須拜訪正義神殿學習白魔法，或拜訪邪惡神殿學習黑魔法。</p>\r\n<p>使用白魔法時，你會變得更守法；黑魔法則會使你更無紀律。一些比較年輕的魔法師任性說著「魔法的性質因施法者而定」，而且毫不後悔地使用最黑暗的法術。但是當他們驚覺的時候，早已為時已晚，因為他們的靈魂已經被污染了。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerenghp4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Like people, spells have their own nature - some good, some evil; as well as some neutral ones. Wizards categorized the good and evil as magic of Einhasad the Good God or of Gran Kain the Evil God, and call them White Magic and Black Magic respectively.</p>\r\n<p>As you probably know if you have studied your the magic lists, each level of spells contain both White and Black Magics. I'm going to teach you both spells as far as I can... but if you want to learn higher level spells, you have to visit the Temple of Law for White Magic, and the Temple of Evil for Black Magic.</p>\r\n<p>As the sword of knight affects a knight, magic also can influence the caster  - the use of white magic will make you lawful while the black magic will make you chaotic. Some younger wizards keep saying that 'the nature of magic depends on the caster' and use the darkest spells without any remorse...but it shall be too late when they realizes that their souls are contaminated!\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenghp4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Like people, spells have their own nature - some good, some evil; as well as some neutral ones. Wizards categorized the good and evil as magic of Einhasad the Good God or of Gran Kain the Evil God, and call them White Magic and Black Magic respectively.</p>\r\n<p>As you probably know if you have studied your the magic lists, each level of spells contain both White and Black Magics. I'm going to teach you both spells as far as I can... but if you want to learn higher level spells, you have to visit the Temple of Law for White Magic, and the Temple of Evil for Black Magic.</p>\r\n<p>As the sword of knight affects a knight, magic also can influence the caster  - the use of white magic will make you lawful while the black magic will make you chaotic. Some younger wizards keep saying that 'the nature of magic depends on the caster' and use the darkest spells without any remorse...but it shall be too late when they realizes that their souls are contaminated!\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenghp4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>餌塋菟葆棻 濠晦曖 撩щ檜 氈蛭, 葆徹縑紫 撩щ檜 氈棻啻. 餌塋擊 掘ж朝 摹曖曖 葆徹檜 氈朝陛 ж賊, 賅萇匙擊 だ惚й 閨檣 餌學и 葆徹紫 氈剪萇. 偃醞縑朝 陛纂醞董瞳檣 葆徹紫 氈雖虜 蜓檜撿. 葆徹餌菟擎 檜楝и 葆徹菟擊 摹и 褐 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 葆徹婁 學и 褐 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 葆徹戲煎 釭援堅, 瞪濠曖 葆徹縑 寥葆徹, �釋睎� 葆徹縑 �皜飪�檜塭朝 檜葷擊 稱艘橫.</p>\r\n<p>濠啻紫 葆徹 葬蝶お蒂 灘橫疑棻賊 憲啊雖虜, 葆徹曖 陝 溯漣縑朝 �皜飪�婁 寥葆徹檜 摩罹氈棻啻. 頂陛 陛腦藥還 熱 氈朝 и縑憮朝 寥葆徹婁 �皜飪� 賅舒蒂 瞪熱ж啊雖虜...濠啻陛 堅溯漣曖 葆徹擊 寡辦溥 и棻賊, 寥葆徹擎 摹и 褐曖 褐瞪縑憮, �皜飪�擎 學и 褐曖 褐瞪縑憮 褐饕擊 嫡朝 熱 夤縑 橈棻啻. </p>\r\n<p>傳, 晦餌曖 蠔檜 晦餌縑啪 艙щ擊 嘐纂蛭 葆徹紫 斜 葆徹擊 噙朝 餌塋縑啪 艙щ擊 嘐耀棻啻. 寥葆徹擊 號檜 餌辨ж賊 й熱煙 摹и 撩щ戲煎, �皜飪�擊 號檜 餌辨ж賊 й熱煙 學и 撩щ戲煎 陛啪 腎雖. 蹂鍔擠曖 瞬擎 葆徹餌菟擎 '葆徹擎 噙朝 餌塋 釭葷'檜塭 蜓ж貊 嬴鼠楛 疏葬釵 橈檜 �皜飪�擊 餌辨и棻虜...學и 撩щ縑 碩啪 僭萇 �醴●� �饑裔媯� 棵擊 匙檜撿.\r\n</body>","gerenghp5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>一些法術需要某種儀式才會生效。當然儀式會依照精確的法術而改變，不過對神的供品則是稀鬆平常的事。那些細節因精確的法術改變，所以在學習那些法術之前，你應該先研究儀式的一些規則。</p>\r\n<p>還有，一些法術除了『魔力』之外，還需要一種特別的材料叫作『魔法寶石』。沒有這個寶石是不可能使用這些法術的。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerenghp5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Some spells require a ritual to be in effect. Of course the ritual varies according to the exact spell, but sacrificing something to a god is usual - often your magical energies or even your life force. The details depend on the exact spell, so you should search for the ritual after learning those spells.</p>\r\n<p>Also some spells require a special material called a 'magic gem' in addition to Mana - casting certain spells is impossible without these gems.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenghp5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Some spells require a ritual to be in effect. Of course the ritual varies according to the exact spell, but sacrificing something to a god is usual - often your magical energies or even your life force. The details depend on the exact spell, so you should search for the ritual after learning those spells.</p>\r\n<p>Also some spells require a special material called a 'magic gem' in addition to Mana - casting certain spells is impossible without these gems.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerenghp5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>賃賃 葆徹菟擎 �膩�蒂 嫦�秷炱� 嬪п 曖衝檜 в蹂ж棻啻. 僭煩 曖衝擎 葆徹縑 評塭 棻腦雖虜, 渠睡碟 鼠樹陛 嬴檜蠱擊 褐縑啪 夥纂剪釭 ж朝 謙盟曖 匙檜雖. 濠撮и 匙擎 葆徹葆棻 棻腦棲 斜 葆徹擊 寡遴 �醴� 撲貲擊 菟橫爾啪釭.</p>\r\n<p>傳 葆釭(MP)釭 羹溘(HP)檜諼縑 '葆溘曖 給'檜塭 碳葬辦朝 葆徹 僭韓檜 в蹂и 葆徹紫 賃陛雖 氈棻啻. 檜 給檜 橈戲賊 檜楛 謙盟曖 葆徹擎 餌辨й 熱陛 橈雖.\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>醴蝶: ぬ歇塭檜鍔</font>, <font fg=ffffff>錚ア 粽溯檜觼</font>, <font fg=ffffff>蝸煎辦</font>, <font fg=ffffff>觼葬縑檜お 覬綠</font>, <font fg=ffffff>憮試 跨蝶攪</font>, <font fg=ffffff>ん斜 螃粽 蝸葬ё</font>, <font fg=ffffff>觼葬縑檜お 衙雖鏽 錚ア</font>, <font fg=ffffff>葬Ы滓た ヴ</font>, <font fg=ffffff>蝶體</font> 蛔曖 葆徹檜 葆溘曖 給擊 餌辨п撿 ж朝 葆徹戲煎 憲溥螳 氈啻.\r\n</body>","gerengk1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>啊∼甘特的學生，為什麼你來到這裡？難道你已經厭倦劍術，並且決定變成一個<a link=gerengk2>魔法師</a>？ \r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerengk1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ah, a pupil of Gunter. What brings you here? Mayhap you have tired of swordplay and decided to become a <a link=gerengk2>wizard</a>?  Quite wise, quite wise - for as a knight, you will never be able to learn the mystical arts of spellcasting.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengk1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ah, a pupil of Gunter. What brings you here? Mayhap you have tired of swordplay and decided to become a <a link=gerengk2>wizard</a>?  Quite wise, quite wise - for as a knight, you will never be able to learn the mystical arts of spellcasting.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengk1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠啻朝 捱攪曖 薯濠煎捱. 檜夠縛 諷橾檣陛? 撲葆 匐獎檜 鏃嘐縑 蜃雖 彊朝棻堅 <a link=gerengk2>葆徹餌</a>陛 腎楝 螞 匙擎 嬴棲啊雖?\r\n</body>","gerengk2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>殷海薩的和格蘭肯的這兩種對立力量是構成我們的世界的基礎，他們也就是那最偉大的神。\r\n<p>這裡被稱為是訓練法師的場所，但是當<a link=gerengk3>哈汀</a>仍然活躍之時，迷幻森林或<a link=gerengk4>歐瑞的象牙塔</a>才是魔術的真正盛行的中心地。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerengk2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Those who study the two opposing forces which underlies every phenomena of our world - Einhasad's benovelence and Gran Kain's malovelence...They know much about the gods, but they are also the furthest from those deities. \r\n<p>This place is known to have been a training ground for wizards, but when <a link=gerengk3>Hardin</a> was still active, the Forest of Elves or the <a link=gerengk4>Ivory Tower of Oren</a> were true centers of magical activity.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengk2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Those who study the two opposing forces which underlies every phenomena of our world - Einhasad's benovelence and Gran Kain's malovelence...They know much about the gods, but they are also the furthest from those deities. \r\n<p>This place is known to have been a training ground for wizards, but when <a link=gerengk3>Hardin</a> was still active, the Forest of Elves or the <a link=gerengk4>Ivory Tower of Oren</a> were true centers of magical activity.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengk2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 撮啗曖 賅萇 ⑷鼻擊 撲貲й 熱 氈朝 舒 蹴 - 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 摹л婁 斜嫌蘋檣曖 學л - 擊 翱掘ж朝 餌塋菟檜雖...褐菟縑 渠п 陛濰 澀 嬴朝 餌塋菟檜雖虜, 翕衛縑 褐菟縑啪憮 陛濰 試 夠縑 氈朝 餌塋菟檜晦紫 ж棻啻. \r\n<p>檜夠紫 蕨瞪睡攪 葆徹餌菟曖 熱溼濰戲煎 嶸貲ц雖虜, <a link=gerengk3>ж蛞</a>椒眷憮 啗褒 陽曖 蹂薑曖 膛檜釭 <a link=gerengk4>螃溶曖 鼻嬴鱉</a> 蛔檜 斜撿蜓煎 葆徹曖 獄堅濰檜塭 й 虜 ж雖.\r\n</body>","gerengk3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>他是昔日亞丁的君主－杜克的一位血親兄弟。在這個大陸上沒有其他的人比他更了解善惡的原則了。\r\n<p>他也是甘特的恩人，你知道吧？甘特就是著名的『甘特之屋』的主人。他們說甘特從哈汀的口中得知了這個島的位置與存在。\r\n<p>在甘特之前，沒有劍客曾經踏上這個島，現在，有許多人像你一樣稱這個島為他們的家。相當有趣吧，嗯∼？\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerengk3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hardin - a blood brother of Duke Dephil, the former king of Arden. No other person on the continent is more knowledgeable about the principles of good and evil.\r\n<p>He was a benefactor of Gunter, the master of the 'House of the Red Knight.' They say Gunter learned of this island from Hardin.\r\n<p>In fact, supposedly, before Gunter, no swordman ever set foot on this island - however, thanks to his training ground,. many such as yourself call this island their home. Quite interesting, hmm?\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengk3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hardin - a blood brother of Duke Dephil, the former king of Arden. No other person on the continent is more knowledgeable about the principles of good and evil.\r\n<p>He was a benefactor of Gunter, the master of the 'House of the Red Knight.' They say Gunter learned of this island from Hardin.\r\n<p>In fact, supposedly, before Gunter, no swordman ever set foot on this island - however, thanks to his training ground,. many such as yourself call this island their home. Quite interesting, hmm?\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengk3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴筆曖 摹諾檜樟湍 菽觼 等в曖 ⑸裊醞 и碟檜衛雖. 嬴葆 渠睛縑憮紫 斜碟爾棻 摹婁 學曖 撥葬縑 渠п 薑鱔ж褐 碟擎 寰啗褒痊撮.\r\n<p>'碩擎 晦餌曖 餵'曖 捱攪諦朝 螃楠 耀碟檜 氈戲衛棻渦捱. 斜陛 檜 撰擊 憲啪 脹 匙紫 ж蛞椒曖 模偃塭 ж艘啻.\r\n<p>斜瞪梱雖朝 匐擊 濩擎 濠陛 檜 撰擊 瓊嬴螞 瞳檜 橈歷棻虜, 檜薯朝 濠啻諦 偽擎 瞬擎檜陛 號檜 菟橫螃啪 腎歷雖. 儅陝п 爾賊 褐晦и 橾檜撿.\r\n</body>","gerengk4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歐瑞是位於大陸的東北部份的一個多山的小國家。它的領土雖小，但卻已經產生許多天才學者。\r\n<p>在歐瑞的魔法師學院是公認的學習法術最好的機構，因此被叫做『象牙塔』。當你旅行到大陸的時候，找一天去拜訪它吧。不過當然囉，也許法術對你而言是一個無聊的科目吧。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerengk4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oren is a small mountainous country located on the northeast part of the continent. Its territory is very small, but Oren has produced many gifted scholars.\r\n<p>The wizard's academy at Oren is acknowledged to be the best institution of magical learning, and is called the \"Ivory Tower.\" Try visiting it sometime, when you travel the main continent. Then of course, magic might be a boring subject for you.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengk4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oren is a small mountainous country located on the northeast part of the continent. Its territory is very small, but Oren has produced many gifted scholars.\r\n<p>The wizard's academy at Oren is acknowledged to be the best institution of magical learning, and is called the \"Ivory Tower.\" Try visiting it sometime, when you travel the main continent. Then of course, magic might be a boring subject for you.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengk4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>螃溶擎 渠睛 磁翕薹縑 氈朝 濛擎 骯學 措陛塭啻. 艙饜朝 濛雖虜 蕨瞪睡攪 з僥瞳戲煎 勘轎и 檣僭菟擊 號檜 寡轎ж堅 氈雖.\r\n<p>斜夠曖 葆徹 з錳擎 賅萇 葆徹餌菟檜 譆堅曖 з僥 晦婦檜塭 檣薑ж朝 曖嘐縑憮 '鼻嬴鱉'檜塭 碳葬辦堅 氈棻啻. 濠啻紫 渠睛縑 釭陛啪 腎剪萇 и廓鎢 菟楝爾啪釭. 濠啻撿 葆徹縑朝 斜葬 �儮怜� 橈啊雖虜 蜓檜撿, жжж.\r\n</body>","gerengp1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你是擁有杜克血脈的後裔？哈哈哈...嗯∼好吧，你說的也許是事實。\r\n<p>但前任國王已經去世，<a  link=gerengp2>從前的國王血盟員</a>若不是已經死亡就是失蹤了。現在唯一能證明你確實是杜克的孩子，我想只有在亞丁城堡的<a link=gerengp3>迪雅皇后</a>了。為了證明你的血統，你必須到亞丁去。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">學習魔法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerengp1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are of Duke Dephil's blood? Hahaha...hmm, well, you may be telling the truth, stranger things have happened in these chaotic times. \r\n<p>But the former king has passed away, and <a  link=gerengp2>the former king's blood pledges</a> have all died or are missing. Now the only one who can prove that you are of Duke Dephil's blood would <a link=gerengp3>Queen Gadria</a> at Aden Castle...To prove your lineage, you must travel to Aden.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">Learn magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengp1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are of Duke Dephil's blood? Hahaha...hmm, well, you may be telling the truth, stranger things have happened in these chaotic times. \r\n<p>But the former king has passed away, and <a  link=gerengp2>the former king's blood pledges</a> have all died or are missing. Now the only one who can prove that you are of Duke Dephil's blood would <a link=gerengp3>Queen Gadria</a> at Aden Castle...To prove your lineage, you must travel to Aden.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">Learn magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengp1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠啻陛 菽觼 等в曖 ⑸鱔檜塭堅? жжж...擠, 斜楚, 斜歇 熱紫 氈啊雖. \r\n<p>摹諾檜 避堅 <a link=gerengp2>摹諾曖 ⑸裊菟</a>紫 賅舒 避剪釭 ч寞碳貲檜 脹 雖旎 橈橫霞 菽觼 等в曖 濠衝擊 隸貲п 還 熱 氈朝 匙擎 嬴筆撩縑 氈朝 <a link=gerengp3>陛萄葬嬴 諾綠</a> 閨...橫鎬腎歷湍 濠啻陛 菽觼 等в曖 薑鱔 �襤飺睎蚗� 隸貲ж晦 嬪п憮朝 嬴筆戲煎 陛朝 熱 夤縑 橈棻啻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a></body>","gerengp2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>杜克的五個血盟成員－忠誠的巴森先生、千雅的伊琳、恩得的薩巴斯汀、貴族卡斯特和亞魅巨．哈汀。\r\n<p>在他們的時代他們曾是最棒的。我並不了解劍術，但是身為一個魔法師，我必須承認，哈汀是一個真的有才華的魔法師。他的力量已經到達 <a link=gerengp4>魔法的頂峰</a>。 \r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerengp2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The five bloodpledge companions of Duke Dephil - Sir Balsen the Loyal, Erain of Trya, Sebastian of Endhe, Castor the Noble, and the Archmage Hardin.\r\n<p>They were the best in their time. I am not familiar with swordsmanship, but as a wizard I can honestly say that Hardin is truly brilliant mage. His powers have reached the <a link=gerengp4>pinnacle of magic</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengp2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The five bloodpledge companions of Duke Dephil - Sir Balsen the Loyal, Erain of Trya, Sebastian of Endhe, Castor the Noble, and the Archmage Hardin.\r\n<p>They were the best in their time. I am not familiar with swordsmanship, but as a wizard I can honestly say that Hardin is truly brilliant mage. His powers have reached the <a link=gerengp4>pinnacle of magic</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengp2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>菽觼 等в曖 5貲曖 ⑸裊...曖葬曖 晦餌 嫦撫, お葬嬴曖 橫溯檣, 縛等曖 撮夥蝶簾, 堅唸и 蘋蝶驗, 斜葬堅 渠 葆徹餌 ж蛞.\r\n<p>斜菟擎 賅舒 渡渠曖 嗨橫陪 濠菟檜歷棻啻. 釭朝 匐縑 渠п憮朝 澀 賅腦雖虜, ж蛞椒擎 薑蜓煎 渠欽и 碟檜雖. 斜碟檜撿蜓煎 霞薑 <a link=gerengp4>葆徹曖 掙斛</a>縑 螃艇 碟檜塭啻.\r\n</body>","gerengp3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如果你說的都是真的，那麼她就是你的母親了。\r\n<p>我在這個島上停太久了，所以我自己也沒有看過她，然而我仍不時聽得到對她美貌的讚美的話。\r\n<p>一位高貴的淑女和一個嗜殺的軍閥，對肯恩和她的關係來說真是諷刺啊！不是嗎？\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerengp3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If what you say is true, than she would be your mother.\r\n<p>Too long I have stayed on this island - I have never seen her myself.  Even here, I have heard praises of her great beauty.\r\n<p>A noble lady and a bloodthirsty warlord...her relationship to Ken Rauhel is truly ironic.  If she could be interested in a lowly mage...ahem, er, never mind.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengp3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If what you say is true, than she would be your mother.\r\n<p>Too long I have stayed on this island - I have never seen her myself.  Even here, I have heard praises of her great beauty.\r\n<p>A noble lady and a bloodthirsty warlord...her relationship to Ken Rauhel is truly ironic.  If she could be interested in a lowly mage...ahem, er, never mind.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengp3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠啻 蜓檜 餌褒檜塭賊 濠啻 橫該棲陛 腆 碟檜 嬴棋陛.\r\n<p>頂 檜 撰縑憮 雖魚雖陛 螃楚腎橫 斜喪蒂 霜蕾 獄 橾擎 橈雖虜 渠欽�� 嬴葷棻遴 碟檜塭堅 ж渦捱.\r\n<p>堅唸и 敝睡檣婁 瞪爵縑 掛輿萼 學葆塭...斜喪諦 騰 塭辦⑦曖 婦啗朝 斜撿蜓煎 嬴檜楝棣ж雖. 斜溢雖 彊擎陛?\r\n</body>","gerengp4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>最高等級的法術，例如召喚從天空降下來的隕石來破壞巨大的山、或祈求驅使神之力完全地破壞目標。對我來說，那些都是寫在書頁上的公式，但是對哈汀而言，他有絕對的力量來使用那些魔法。\r\n<p>... \r\n<p>嗯∼是的！在某處也許另外一個人可能做的到同樣的事...『歐瑞的陰影』的歐林。哈汀，謠傳他秘密地幫助杜克，但是多年來他都沒有作一個公開的表示。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerengp4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The highest level of spells, such as summoning meteorites from the skies to destroy vast mountains, employing godly might to utterly destroy objects... To me, until I learn more, those are but scribbles on a page.  Hardin has the power to actually employ those magics.\r\n<p>......\r\n<p>Hmm...Yes. There may be one other who can do such things.  \"Orim the Shadow,\" the archmage of Oren... He is rumored to have secretly helped Duke Dephil, but has not been seen these many years.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengp4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The highest level of spells, such as summoning meteorites from the skies to destroy vast mountains, employing godly might to utterly destroy objects... To me, until I learn more, those are but scribbles on a page.  Hardin has the power to actually employ those magics.\r\n<p>......\r\n<p>Hmm...Yes. There may be one other who can do such things.  \"Orim the Shadow,\" the archmage of Oren... He is rumored to have secretly helped Duke Dephil, but has not been seen these many years.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengp4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嶸撩擊 模�納狤� 贖 骯葆盪 だ惚ж堅 褐曖 掏棟戲煎 餌僭曖 襄營 濠羹蒂 模資衛鑒 熱 氈朝 掙斛曖 葆徹菟...釭縑啪 氈橫憮朝 疇 樓曖 撮啗檜雖虜, 斜匙擊 褒⑷й 熱 氈朝 餌塋檜 夥煎 ж蛞椒檜塭啻.\r\n<p>......\r\n<p>擠...斜溢捱. 儅陝п爾賊 斜楝и 橾擊 й 熱 氈朝 餌塋檜 傳 и貲 氈歷捱. '斜葡濠 螃葡'檜塭 碳葬辦朝 螃溶曖 渠葆徹餌 螃葡...綠塵葬縑 菽觼 等в擊 紫諮棻朝 模僥紫 氈雖虜, 雖旎擎 賃喇簞 撮樓縑朝 釭螃堅 氈雖 彊擎等.\r\n</body>","gerengTe1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你現在可以離開這裡了。我已經沒有東西可以教你了。</p>\r\n<p>在最後我要測驗你。就是以起死回生術擊敗史巴扥之後，帶來\"史巴托的骨頭\"吧。</p>\r\n<p>但要注意測驗途中，不能接受任何人的幫助。祝你成功...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have reached the level at which you should leave this place, for I have nothing else to teach you.</p>\r\n<p>However, there is one final test. You have to bring me a <font fg=ffffff>'bone of spartoi'</font> - find a spartoi, and slay it with only the spell <font fg=ffffff>Turn Undead</font>.</p>\r\n<p>Keep in mind that as your test, this should be accomplished alone.  You may find the Detection spell to be useful in drawing out the spartoi, for they skulk in the darkness...now go, and may the blessings of Einhasad be with you...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have reached the level at which you should leave this place, for I have nothing else to teach you.</p>\r\n<p>However, there is one final test. You have to bring me a <font fg=ffffff>'bone of spartoi'</font> - find a spartoi, and slay it with only the spell <font fg=ffffff>Turn Undead</font>.</p>\r\n<p>Keep in mind that as your test, this should be accomplished alone.  You may find the Detection spell to be useful in drawing out the spartoi, for they skulk in the darkness...now go, and may the blessings of Einhasad be with you...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengTe1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>傘紫 橫替窗 檜 熱溼模蒂 集陳 陽陛 脹 蛭 談掘釭. 檜薯 釭朝 渦 檜鼻 陛腦艦 匙檜 橈棻.</p>\r\n<p>葆雖虞戲煎 褸機 衛я擊 爾啊棻. 婁薯朝 <font fg=ffffff>欐 樹等萄 葆徹</font>虜戲煎 <font fg=ffffff>蝶だ饜檜</font>蒂 避檜堅 <font fg=ffffff>'辨嬴煽曖 鄙'</font>蒂 陛螳 螃朝 匙檜撿.</p>\r\n<p>輿曖 й 匙擎 衛я 紫醞 <font fg=ffffff>援掘曖 紫遺擊 嫡嬴憮紫 寰脹棻</font>朝 匙檜雖. 睡蛤 濠啻縑啪 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 陛�ㄟ� 氈晦蒂..</p>\r\n</body>","gerengTe2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>你還沒有能力把一棵橘子樹換成蘋果樹不是嘛？</p>\r\n<p>那∼你得更加努力</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>You couldn't even turn an orange tree into an apple tree!</p>\r\n<p>... You should study harder.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>You couldn't even turn an orange tree into an apple tree!</p>\r\n<p>... You should study harder.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengTe2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>啻 喪戮擎 嬴霜 螃溶雖 釭鼠蒂 餌婁 釭鼠煎 夥紱朝 婁薯紫 跤п頂堅 氈雖 彊替傍.</p>\r\n<p>..覬 渦 熱溼縑 ��噙紫煙 ж剪塭.</p>\r\n</body>","gerengTe3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>你終於過畢業考驗了，恭喜你。\r\n<p>老實說，現在的你實力已遠遠的超過我了。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>把這魔杖帶著吧，隨著你的實力不斷的增強以後使用魔法的時候，會常常遇到魔力不足的情況。若好好使用此魔仗，將對你有很大的幫助。這是我最後能給你的了。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>那∼去吧。我真的很高興能教導出像你這樣的徒弟。\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Congratulations!</p>\r\n<p>To tell you the truth, you know as much as I, now - my knowledge is so limited.<p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Take this staff. You will need more mana as your spells grow in power, so use this staff while waiting to regain your magical energies. This is the last favor I can do for you, but you have earned it.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now, however, it is time to go. I have been proud to have you as a apprentice.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Congratulations!</p>\r\n<p>To tell you the truth, you know as much as I, now - my knowledge is so limited.<p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Take this staff. You will need more mana as your spells grow in power, so use this staff while waiting to regain your magical energies. This is the last favor I can do for you, but you have earned it.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now, however, it is time to go. I have been proud to have you as a apprentice.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengTe3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>褸機 衛я擊 鼠餌�� 纂楝魚 匙擊 霞褕戲煎 蹴жж啻.\r\n<p>樂霜�� 雖旎 諦憮 蜓ж朝 夥檜啻虜, 濠啻朝 頂陛 馬渡ж晦縛 覬 幔雙 濠薯艘啻.. 頂 褒溘檜 睡褶и 鰱檜雖.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 雖な檜蒂 陛螳陛啪 擅戲煎 鬼溘и 葆徹擊 餌辨й 熱煙 葆釭陛 睡褶и 唳辦陛 號擊 剪撿. 檜勘 澀 餌辨ж賊 覬 紫遺檜 腆勘撮. 頂 葆雖虞 撩曖橾撮.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠 檜薯 集釭啪釭. 濠啻籀歲 �К〥� 薯濠蒂 晦蒂 熱 氈橫憮 鼠繫 闌剪錫啻.\r\n</body>","gerengTe4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>魔法分為黑魔法和白魔法。雖然我的魔法沒那麼厲害，但我不肯認同黑魔法。黑魔法帶來的只有破壞而已。\r\n<p>立刻滾。我沒有像你這種徒弟。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There is black magic and white magic in this world, and the Gods leave us to choose which to follow. But, I'm not a god, so get out!  Black magic will only bring destruction to you and those you care for, if you can care for ought besides yourself.</p>\r\n<p>Now get away from me - you are no apprentice of mine!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There is black magic and white magic in this world, and the Gods leave us to choose which to follow. But, I'm not a god, so get out!  Black magic will only bring destruction to you and those you care for, if you can care for ought besides yourself.</p>\r\n<p>Now get away from me - you are no apprentice of mine!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengTe4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撮鼻縛 寥葆徹紫 氈堅 �皜飪�紫 氈雖. ж雖虜 頂陛 嬴鼠葬 褒溘檜 賅濠塢 葆徹餌檜雖虜 �皜飪�蒂 檣薑й 牖 橈啻. �皜飪�擎 賅萇 勘 だ惚虜 й 閨檜撿.\r\n<p>..頂 擅縑憮 餌塭雖啪. 陪 濠啻諦 偽擎 熱溼儅擊 菩 瞳檜 橈啻.</p>\r\n</body>","gerengTe5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>當然以你的起死回生術很難一次打死史巴扥。</p>\r\n<p>但我能教的已經全都教了。現在只能靠你的勇氣和毅力了。</p>\r\n<p>僅以知識是無法通過畢業考驗的，更何況是成為一位具有實力的魔法師呢！再去試試吧。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Well, I know that it's not so easy to kill a <font fg=ffffff>spartoi</font> with <font fg=ffffff>'turn undead'</font> spells.</p>\r\n<p>At least it doesn't cost you magic gems!  But I have taught you everything I know; all that remains is your courage and perseverance.</p>\r\n<p>Knowledge alone cannot make you pass the final test or make you a good wizard...please do try again.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Well, I know that it's not so easy to kill a <font fg=ffffff>spartoi</font> with <font fg=ffffff>'turn undead'</font> spells.</p>\r\n<p>At least it doesn't cost you magic gems!  But I have taught you everything I know; all that remains is your courage and perseverance.</p>\r\n<p>Knowledge alone cannot make you pass the final test or make you a good wizard...please do try again.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengTe5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>僭煩 雖旎 濠啻曖 褒溘戲煎 <font fg=ffffff>欐 樹等萄</font>煎 <font fg=ffffff>蝶だ饜檜</font>蒂 и 廓縑 鼠鎬腦朝 啪 蓮遴 橾擎 嬴棲曹 ж雖.</p>\r\n<p>ж雖虜 頂陛 陛腦艦 熱 氈朝 勒 棻 陛腦蟻啻. 陴擎 勒 濠啻曖 辨晦諦 莫晦閨檜撿.</p>\r\n<p>雖衝虜 氈橫憮朝 褸機 衛я縑 鱔婁й 熱紫 橈擊 閨渦楝 �К〥� 葆徹餌紫 腆 熱 橈棻啻.. 棻衛 и 廓 п爾啪.</p>\r\n</body>","gerengTe6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎。畢業之後能再見到你真高興。</p>\r\n<p>現在是否正在探求比我更高的境界？我一眼就看得出你的實力。</p>\r\n<p>在這兒不要客氣，休息吧。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, do come in. I'm so glad that you have come to visit me after your graduation.</p>\r\n<p>You are aiming for a higher level even than myself - I can easily see how your power has grown.</p>\r\n<p>You can always feel at home here.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengte6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, do come in. I'm so glad that you have come to visit me after your graduation.</p>\r\n<p>You are aiming for a higher level even than myself - I can easily see how your power has grown.</p>\r\n<p>You can always feel at home here.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengTe6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮 螃啪釭. 褸機 �醴△� 濱雖 彊堅 陳 瓊嬴輿棻棲 奩骨掘虜.</p>\r\n<p>斜楚 雖旎擎 釭爾棻紫 �徆� 堪擎 唳雖蒂 鬚掘ж堅 氈啊雖? 羅 換縑紫 濠啻曖 褒溘檜 橫替 薑紫 螢嫉朝雖 憲 熱 氈啊捱.</p>\r\n<p>橫繚萇 餌曄蜓堅 蕨瞪籀歲 らж啪 雖頂啪釭.</p>\r\n</body>","gerengw1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎來這裡。這個『說語島』是很久以前開始以<a link=\"gerengw2\">魔法師訓練場</a>而聞名於世。其實最近許多人為了接受騎士的試鍊而來到這裡。大部分具備能力的魔法師離開這島之後，進去歐瑞的象牙塔或在妖精森林附近開自己的研究所。因此在這裡只剩下我在教導學生。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">學習魔法</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"gerengtest\">接受畢業考驗</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengw1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Greetings, worthy pupil. '說語島' has long been a <a link=\"gerengw2\">training ground for wizards</a> like yourself, according to legend.  Nowadays most souls come here to be knights.  As near as I can tell, the teachers left for the Ivory Tower at Oren or set up in a laboratory near the Forest of Elves...now I am the only one left who can teach magic.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengw1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Greetings, worthy pupil. '說語島' has long been a <a link=\"gerengw2\">training ground for wizards</a> like yourself, according to legend.  Nowadays most souls come here to be knights.  As near as I can tell, the teachers left for the Ivory Tower at Oren or set up in a laboratory near the Forest of Elves...now I am the only one left who can teach magic.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengw1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>澀 諮啻. 檜夠 '蜓ж朝 撰'擎 蕨瞪睡攪 <a link=\"gerengw2\">葆徹餌菟曖 熱ч雖</a>煎 嶸貲и 夠檜雖...餌褒 蹂闈菟橫憮朝 螃�鷛� 晦餌陛 腎晦 嬪и 熱溼擊 嫡戲楝 螃朝 餌塋檜 渠睡碟檜雖虜 蜓檜撿. 棟溘氈朝 葆徹餌菟紫 棻菟 撰擊 集釭憮 螃溶曖 鼻嬴鱉縑 菟橫陛剪釭 蹂薑曖 膛 斬籀縑 濠褐曖 翱掘模蒂 頂幗溥憮...檜夠縑憮 з儅菟擊 陛腦艦 虜и 餌塋擎 檜薯 釭夤縑 寰陴懊棻啻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"gerengEv1\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"gerengtest\">褸機 衛я擊 纂艇棻</a>\r\n</body>","gerengw2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉倫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗯...在大陸的魔法師之中，這是一個眾所皆知的傳說。這個島是一個訓練年輕魔法師的地方。但是，由於我是過去１０年唯一在這裡學習魔術的人。不過傳說畢竟是傳說，而我則是剛好為一項研究而來，不然我不會在這裡。我只是來幫助甘特，為騎士們安排一個訓練的場地，所以我並不是這個島的人。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>依照甘特說的，當哈汀和他第一次來這裡的時候，這個島除了怪物什麼也沒有。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>很奇怪的，在甘特建造騎士訓練場之前，這裡一個人也沒有，那表示只有哈汀知道以前曾經發生什麼...\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gerengw2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> Well... It's a fairly well-known legend among wizards of the continent that this island has long been a training ground for young magi...but legend can veer from reality;  I was the only one who studied magic here for the last 10 years - and even I didn't come here to study, I just came to help Gunter, who wanted to make a proving ground for young knights.\r\n<br>\r\n<p> According to Gunter, this island had nothing but monsters - and lots of 'em - on it when he and Hardin first arrived - no wizards to be found.\r\n<br>\r\n<p> It's quite odd that there was no one living here before Gunter built his training ground...perhaps Hardin knows what happened before.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengw2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gereng:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> Well... It's a fairly well-known legend among wizards of the continent that this island has long been a training ground for young magi...but legend can veer from reality;  I was the only one who studied magic here for the last 10 years - and even I didn't come here to study, I just came to help Gunter, who wanted to make a proving ground for young knights.\r\n<br>\r\n<p> According to Gunter, this island had nothing but monsters - and lots of 'em - on it when he and Hardin first arrived - no wizards to be found.\r\n<br>\r\n<p> It's quite odd that there was no one living here before Gunter built his training ground...perhaps Hardin knows what happened before.\r\n</body>\r\n","gerengw2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>旋赭...檜 撰檜 葆徹餌菟曖 熱溼濰檜塭朝 勒 渠睛曖 葆徹餌菟 餌檜縑憮朝 紮 嶸貲и 瞪撲縑 樓ж雖虜...瞪撲擎 橫蛤梱雖釭 瞪撲檜堅, 譆斬 10罹喇 翕寰 檜 撰縑憮 薯渠煎 葆徹 翱掘蒂 и 餌塋檜塭賊 釭 薑紫塭啻. 斜葬堅 釭 羲衛 籀擠睡攪 檜 撰縑 葆徹 翱掘蒂 ж楝 螞 匙檜 嬴棲塭 檜 撰縑 晦餌 熱溼濰擊 虜菟啊棻朝 捱攪蒂 紫辦楝 螞 匙檜棲梱, 檜 撰 轎褐曖 葆徹餌朝 嬴棍撮.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>捱攪曖 蜓縑 評腦賊 濠晦陛 籀擠 ж蛞婁 萃檜憮 檜 撰縑 諮擊 陽 檜 撰擎 諫瞪и 跨蝶攪菟曖 模掉檜歷棻堅 ж渦捱. \r\n<br>\r\n<p>捱攪陛 檜 撰縑 晦餌 熱溼濰擊 撮辦晦 瞪憮睡攪 檜 撰縑 髦湍 餌塋檜 ж釭紫 橈朝 匙紫 檜鼻ж堅...唸措 斜溢棻賊 ж蛞椒虜檜 檜 撰縑憮 鼠蝦 橾檜 橾橫陬朝雖蒂 憲堅 啗褐棻朝 匙檣等...\r\n</body>","giles1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉列斯 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n人的智慧可打敗強大的怪物。但是若敵手是個人就很難對付。你具備了智慧和力量，我想應該沒有問題。 \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","giles1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>韓溯蝶 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n餌塋曖 瞳擎 唸措 餌塋檜撿. 嬴鼠葬 鬼и 惚僭檜塭 ж渦塭紫 餌塋菟曖 雖��朝 渡п鳥 熱陛 橈橫. ж雖虜 鼻渠陛 餌塋檜塭賊 樽晦陛 殖塭雖雖. 斜朝 濠啻 跤雖 彊擎 雖��諦 ��擊 乾堅 氈戲棲梱. \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","glen-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>格林：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你好需要些什麼東西呢？</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","glen-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Glen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'Allo!  What are you looking for?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","glen-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Glen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'Allo!  What are you looking for?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","glen-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>旋溶:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>寰喟ж衛螃. 鼠蝦 僭勒擊 瓊戲衛螃?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n</body>","glen1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>格林：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如果讓傑瑞德知道我把東西賣給惡人，他一定不會放過我的，請你趕快離開商店。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","glen1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Glen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If Gerard finds out that I sold goods to evil people, he will be quite angry. Quickly - out of my shop please!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","glen1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Glen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If Gerard finds out that I sold goods to evil people, he will be quite angry. Quickly - out of my shop please!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","glen1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>旋溶:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>頂陛 學檣縑啪 僭勒擊 っ 匙擊 啪塭萄椒檜 嬴褐棻賊 觼啪 喻ж褒剪蹂. 橡艇 頂 陛啪縑憮 釭陛輿衛螃.</p>\r\n</body>","glen3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>格林：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>稅率是<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">％</font>。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","glen3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Glen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The tax is currently <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","glen3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Glen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The tax is currently <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","glen3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>旋溶:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>檜塭螃.</p>\r\n</body>","gludiobd1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align = center>史萊姆比賽！</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>誰將會是第一個到達終點線？真是刺激得讓人目不轉睛啊！歡迎你光臨史萊姆比賽！ \r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>每一張票只賣１００個金幣，不過為了表示對妖魔城主的尊敬，一點點的抽成是必須的。 \r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gludiobd1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align = center>Slime Racing!</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Who will be the first at the finish line?  Eye-riveting excitement! We welcome you to the slime races!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>tickets cost 100 adena each.\r\n</body>\r\n","gludiobd1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align = center>Slime Racing!</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Who will be the first at the finish line?  Eye-riveting excitement! We welcome you to the slime races!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>tickets cost 100 adena each.\r\n</body>\r\n","gludiobd1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align = center>蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶!</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>羲瞪, 傳 羲瞪! и衛紫 換擊 馭 熱 橈朝 夢霞馬 剩纂朝 唳晦! 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶縑 罹楝碟擊 蟾渠м棲棻!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>じ鰍 1濰渡 100嬴等釭.\r\n\r\n</body>","gludiobd2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=1111ff><p align = center>警告</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>危險區域！未經認可的人，禁止進入此地。 \r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=right>古丁領地－凱登伯爵</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","gludiobd2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=1111ff><p align = center>Warning</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Dangerous area. Unauthorized entry forbidden.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=right>Kent, Count of the Gludio Estate</p>\r\n</body>","gludiobd2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=1111ff><p align = center>Warning</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Dangerous area. Unauthorized entry forbidden.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=right>Kent, Count of the Gludio Estate</p>\r\n</body>","gludiobd2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=1111ff><p align = center>轎殮旎雖</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬪я 雖羲檜嘎煎 橾奩檣曖 轎殮擊 旎л.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=right>旋瑞蛤螃奢 騰お 寥濛</p>\r\n</body>","gora1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>聽著！聽著！『這是世紀之賽！史萊姆競賽』這個在古丁領地非常流行的競賽，即將開始！ \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">檢查每個史萊姆的紀錄</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">買史萊姆競賽的票</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣勝利的票</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","gora1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, Hear! 'Tis the race of the century!  The Slime races, the favorite sport in the Gludio estates, will soon begin!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">Check each slime's record</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">Buy a slime race ticket</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell winning ticket</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gora1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, Hear! 'Tis the race of the century!  The Slime races, the favorite sport in the Gludio estates, will soon begin!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">Check each slime's record</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">Buy a slime race ticket</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell winning ticket</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gora1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 槳縑 間擊 錨啪 ж朝 裊溺и 蝓睡曖 撮啗! 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖曖 貲僭 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶陛 埠 衛濛腌棲棻! \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">陝 蝸塭歜曖 瞪瞳擊 獄棻</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">溯檜蝶 じ鰍擊 骯棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">渡繩 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","gora2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>聽著！聽著！今天比賽已經結束了！明天會安排更多精彩的比賽，所以請務必再來啊。祝你有愉快的一天！ \r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","gora2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There are no more races today, no more! More races are scheduled for tomorrow, so please come back then. Have a nice day!\r\n</body>\r\n","gora2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There are no more races today, no more! More races are scheduled for tomorrow, so please come back then. Have a nice day!\r\n</body>\r\n","gora2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 螃棺曖 唳晦朝 賅舒 部陬蝗棲棻! 棻擠 唳晦朝 陳檜 嫩嬴撿 衛濛ж棲 螃棺擎 檜虜 賅舒 給嬴陛 輿撮蹂~\r\n</body>","gora3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>聽著！聽著！現在比賽正在進行中！要買票的人可能要等一會兒！ \r\n</body>\r\n","gora3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There is a race going on, going on right now!  Those who want to buy tickets must wait a little while!\r\n</body>\r\n","gora3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There is a race going on, going on right now!  Those who want to buy tickets must wait a little while!\r\n</body>\r\n","gora3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 雖旎擎 唳晦醞殮棲棻! 棻擠 唳晦 ル蒂 餌褒 碟擎 褻旎虜 晦棻葬撮蹂!\r\n</body>","gora4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>聽著！聽著！今天競賽的史萊姆的狀況是... \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff size=14 face=\"courier new\"><p>名稱&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;狀態&nbsp;&nbsp;ＡＶＧ.</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#2\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#3\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#5\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#6\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#7\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#8\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#9\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#10\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#11\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#12\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#13\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#14\"></font>\r\n</body>\r\n","gora4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! The condition of today's contestant slimes are...\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff size=14 face=\"courier new\"><p>Name&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Status&nbsp;&nbsp;Avg.</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#2\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#3\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#5\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#6\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#7\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#8\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#9\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#10\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#11\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#12\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#13\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#14\"></font>\r\n</body>\r\n","gora4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! The condition of today's contestant slimes are...\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff size=14 face=\"courier new\"><p>Name&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Status&nbsp;&nbsp;Avg.</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#2\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#3\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#5\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#6\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#7\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#8\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#9\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#10\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#11\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#12\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#13\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#14\"></font>\r\n</body>\r\n","gora4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 螃棺 轎瞪й 蝸塭歜菟曖 鼻鷓朝 蜓檜轄...\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff face=\"掉葡羹\"><p>檜葷&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;鼻鷓&nbsp;蝓睦</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#1\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#2\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#3\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#4\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#5\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#6\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#7\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#8\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#9\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#10\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#11\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#12\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#13\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#14\"></p></font>\r\n</body>","gora5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>聽著！聽著！我們正在準備下一場比賽。請再稍等一下，準備馬上就會完成了！ \r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣勝利的票</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","gora5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! We are preparing for the next race. Please wait, wait just a moment until all preparations are completed!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell winning ticket</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gora5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! We are preparing for the next race. Please wait, wait just a moment until all preparations are completed!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell winning ticket</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gora5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 雖旎擎 棻擠 溯檜蝶蒂 遽綠ж堅 氈朝 醞殮棲棻. 遽綠陛 部陳 陽梱雖 濡衛虜 晦棻葬撮蹂!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">渡繩 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","goraev1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>葛拉：</p></font>\r\n<p>是誰啊！是妖魔統治者<var src=\"#0\"> 血盟的<var src=\"#1\">主人不是嘛？！\r\n<p>史萊姆競技場的買賣很順利，要是有人輸光的話，那最富有的就會是我們妖魔了哪！\r\n對不起...哎呀∼！我這個嘴巴...\r\n<p>我已經把金幣送過去了，你要不要下注玩看看？\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">檢查每個史萊姆的紀錄</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">買史萊姆競賽票</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣勝利的票</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","goraEv1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gora Agni:</p></font>\r\n<p>Oh, look at you. Aren't you <var src=\"#1\">, the lord of blood pledge <var src=\"#0\">?\r\n<p>The slime races go quite well, quite well. Though if someone didn't take the loot, we orcs could be rich by now. ha!... Ouch! What was I saying? Don't stare at me like that - just get the hell out of here with those bags~\r\n<p>...Or would you want to bet?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">Check each slime's record</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">Buy slime race ticket</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell winning ticket</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","goraEv1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gora Agni:</p></font>\r\n<p>Oh, look at you. Aren't you <var src=\"#1\">, the lord of blood pledge <var src=\"#0\">?\r\n<p>The slime races go quite well, quite well. Though if someone didn't take the loot, we orcs could be rich by now. ha!... Ouch! What was I saying? Don't stare at me like that - just get the hell out of here with those bags~\r\n<p>...Or would you want to bet?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">Check each slime's record</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">Buy slime race ticket</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell winning ticket</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","goraEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>堅塭 嬴斜棲:</p></font>\r\n<p>嬴棲, 檜啪 援掘撿. 辦葬 '磁薹 膛' 螃觼菟曖 雖寡濠 <var src=\"#0\"> ⑸裊曖 <var src=\"#1\"> 釭葬陛 嬴棲褐陛.\r\n<p>蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶塭賊 嬴輿 牖褻照蝗棲棻. 援掘援掘陛 嬪縑憮 穫啖陛雖虜 彊戲賊 辦葬菟 螃觼菟紫 旎寞 睡濠陛 腆蘸等蹂, 瓔瓔瓔...橫檜掘~! 檜 殮檜 輿疇橾赭. \r\n<p>捱濠旎擎 檜嘐 爾麻戲棲 釭葬眷憮紫 溯檜蝶 иっ ж堅 陛衛啊熱?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">陝 蝸塭歜曖 瞪瞳擊 獄棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">溯檜蝶 じ鰍擊 骯棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">渡繩 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","gotham-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>高特：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n我們這兒可以替您保管東西。我不知道你們人類是怎麼樣，但是我們『鐵門』是具有永久的歷史且穩固的組織，請你安心地交給我們保管。\r\n<br>\r\n保管一個東西不論多久只要３０金幣，在領回東西時再付錢就可以了。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>個人倉庫：<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\">存放東西</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\">取回東西</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟倉庫：<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\">存放東西</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\">取回東西</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","gotham-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Gotham the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Yer humankind may not understand sech things, but our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of trustworthy service. Yer items are safe with us. <br>\r\n30 adena for 1 item or stack of items regardless of time - to be settled when you retrieve 'em.  No adena, no item!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Blood Pledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gotham-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Gotham the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Yer humankind may not understand sech things, but our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of trustworthy service. Yer items are safe with us. <br>\r\n30 adena for 1 item or stack of items regardless of time - to be settled when you retrieve 'em.  No adena, no item!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Blood Pledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gotham-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 堅氬:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n僭勒擊 蜆嬴 萄董棲棻. 渡褐菟 檣除菟擎 澀 賅腦啊雖虜, 辦葬 '鬼繹曖 僥' 望萄朝 螃楠 羲餌蒂 陛霞 ががи 褻霜檜塭螃.\r\n凳萇 寰褕ж堅 蜆晦紫煙 п蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n陛問擎 僭勒 ж釭渡 鼠褻勒 30嬴等釭, 絲擎 僭勒擊 瓊擊 陽 頂朝 剪蹂.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>偃檣 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑸裊 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gothaml-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>高特：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>喂，像你這樣的新手，我們怎麼可以放心地保管你的東西呢？如果你想要我們幫你保管東西的話，在世界上闖個兩、三年後再來吧。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","gothaml-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Gotham the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ach, a nameless sprig such as yourself may not even have the golden adena to get yer items back! If you want to use our service, make a name for yourself. Come back when you've earned some fame, levels, and adena!\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gothaml-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Gotham the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ach, a nameless sprig such as yourself may not even have the golden adena to get yer items back! If you want to use our service, make a name for yourself. Come back when you've earned some fame, levels, and adena!\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","gothaml-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 堅氬:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>檜瑭蹂, 辦葬陛 劂 圖堅 渡褐偽擎 Е啻晦曖 僭勒擊 蜃嬴遽欽 蜓檜螃? 僭勒擊 蜃晦堅 談棻賊 檜葷擊 覬 陳萼 棻擠縑 螃衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","grguard3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>冠石警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>請你長話短說，我忙著保護冠石的治安。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"ktguard6\">詢問現在的盟主是誰</a>\r\n</body>","grguard3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Giran Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm busy keeping peace in Giran Town. Tell me what you want. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"grguard6\">Ask about the current Lord</a>\r\n</body>","grguard3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Giran Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm busy keeping peace in Giran Town. Tell me what you want. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"grguard6\">Ask about the current Lord</a>\r\n</body>","grguard3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>晦塢撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>陪 晦塢 雖羲曖 纂寰擊 嶸雖ж替塭 夥際螃. 辨勒虜 除欽�� 蜓ж衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"ktguard6\">⑷營曖 艙輿陛 援捱雖 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","grguard6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>甚麼？你說你不知道領主的姓名！！聽清楚，現在此地區的地方領主是<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>血盟的<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>。記住！</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">詢問下次攻城時間</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">對<var src=\"#1\">血盟宣戰。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","grguard6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't know who the lord of this castle is? How could you?\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All right. I'll tell you this time. The current lord is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font> from the Blood Pledge <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>. Try to remember the name of our great lord from now on.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">Ask the time for next siege</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">Declare a war against <var src=\"#1\"></a>\r\n</body>\r\n","grguard6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't know who the lord of this castle is? How could you?\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All right. I'll tell you this time. The current lord is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font> from the Blood Pledge <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>. Try to remember the name of our great lord from now on.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">Ask the time for next siege</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">Declare a war against <var src=\"#1\"></a>\r\n</body>\r\n","grguard6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>凳塭堅? 凱 濠晦 餌朝 雖寞 撩輿椒曖 襄л紫 賅艇欽 蜓檜撿? 澀 菟橫塭, ⑷營 檜 雖寞曖 艙輿朝 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font> ⑸裊 轎褐曖 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>椒檜衛棻. 僅僅�� 晦橘п 舒紫煙 п.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 僖朝棻</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\"><var src=\"#1\"> ⑸裊縑 渠п 奢撩瞪擊 摹樹и棻.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","grguard7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>冠石警衛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>領主宣布的攻城時間為<var src=\"#1\">年<var src=\"#2\">月<var src=\"#3\">日<var src=\"#4\">時<var src=\"#5\">分。你敢打就來吧！\r\n</body>\r\n","grguard7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Giran Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to challenge the Lord come on <var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#1\"> at <var src=\"#4\"> o'clock.\r\n</body>\r\n","grguard7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Giran Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to challenge the Lord come on <var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#1\"> at <var src=\"#4\"> o'clock.\r\n</body>\r\n","grguard7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>晦塢撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿眷憮 嫦ルж褐 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛陝擎 <var src=\"#1\">喇 <var src=\"#2\">錯 <var src=\"#3\">橾 <var src=\"#4\">衛 <var src=\"#5\">碟 檜棻. 渾網 纔賊 渾滬瑭!\r\n</body>","grguard8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>冠石警衛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>領主尚未決定下次何時可以攻城。\r\n</body>\r\n","grguard8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Giran Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The Lord hasn't declared the time for the next siege yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","grguard8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Giran Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Lord hasn't declared the time for the next siege yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","grguard8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>晦塢撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿眷憮朝 嬴霜 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 唸薑ж雖 彊戲樟棻.\r\n</body>","gruman-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>古魯門：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎！有需要什麼嗎？</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gruman-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gruman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome! How may I help you?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","gruman-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gruman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome! How may I help you?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","gruman-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>斜瑞試:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠, 槳椒. 鼠歙擊 紫諦萄萵梱蹂?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","gruman2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>古魯門：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你們這些小流氓！給我閉上嘴後滾出去∼</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gruman2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gruman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Just shut up and go out of here, you young whippersnapper!</p>\r\n</body>","gruman2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gruman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Just shut up and go out of here, you young whippersnapper!</p>\r\n</body>","gruman2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>斜瑞試:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...嬴鼠蜓 蜓堅 頂 陛啪縑憮 釭陛輿褒梱, 學渡 摹儅.</p>\r\n</body>","gulian1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>古利安 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n呵呵...。這村莊太大，所以常常迷路...你也迷路了嗎？\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gulian1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>望葬樹 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n�醴�... 薇濰. 檜 葆擊擎 傘鼠 創橫憮 橫蛤陛 橫蛤檣雖 紫鼠雖 憲 熱陛 橈欽 蜓檜撿... �公� 濠啻紫 釭籀歲 望擊 檠橫幗萼 勒 嬴棋陛? \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","guntere1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哦∼<a link=\"guntere2\">森林深處</a>的靈魂啊，所有 <a link=\"guntere3\">元素</a>的保護者。為何<a link = \"guntere4\">命運</a>會把你帶到<a link=\"guntere5\">這裡</a>呢？</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">要求『甘特的測試』</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","guntere1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, spirit of the <a link=\"guntere2\">Deeper Forest</a>, protector of all <a link=\"guntere3\">elementals</a>, why has <a link = \"guntere4\">fate</a> brought you to <a link=\"guntere5\">this place</a>?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">Request for \"Gunter's test\"</a>\r\n</body>","guntere1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, spirit of the <a link=\"guntere2\">Deeper Forest</a>, protector of all <a link=\"guntere3\">elementals</a>, why has <a link = \"guntere4\">fate</a> brought you to <a link=\"guntere5\">this place</a>?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">Request for \"Gunter's test\"</a>\r\n</body>","guntere1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p><a link=\"guntere2\">爾棻 桶擎 膛</a>曖 �亳�, 賅萇 <a link=\"guntere3\">薑滄</a>曖 爾��濠罹.</p>\r\n<p>鼠蝦 <a link = \"guntere4\">檣翱曖 莫</a>縑 橋�鷑�晦縑 <a link=\"guntere5\">檜楛 夠</a>梱雖 螃啪 腎歷模?</font></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">'捱攪曖 衛я'擊 嫡朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","guntere2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你的家鄉－『迷幻森林』是一個在亞丁所有森林出現之前就已存在的遠古的森林，也是全大陸自然界的母親。</p>\r\n<p>很久以前我曾經拜訪過那個美麗的地方，然而在我記憶中，它就像昨天才發生的一樣。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","guntere2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Your homeland, the 'enchanted forest,' the ancient forest that existed before all the forests of Aden, the mother of the continent's nature.</p>\r\n<p>I visited that beautiful place a long time ago, but I remember it as 'twas yesterday.</p>\r\n</body>","guntere2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Your homeland, the 'enchanted forest,' the ancient forest that existed before all the forests of Aden, the mother of the continent's nature.</p>\r\n<p>I visited that beautiful place a long time ago, but I remember it as 'twas yesterday.</p>\r\n</body>","guntere2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">斜渠曖 堅щ檣 '蹂薑曖 膛'檜撿 蜓煎 嬴筆曖 賅萇 膛爾棻 試盪 氈歷湍 鷓蟾曖 膛, 渠睛曖 賅萇 濠翱曖 橫該棲陛 嬴棲湍陛.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>頂 渠睛縑 氈歷湍 衛瞰 и廓 斜 夠縑 嫦擊 菟罹場懊湍 瞳檜 氈啻虜 斜 陽曖 晦橘擎 嬴霜紫 儅儅ж螃.</font></p>\r\n</body>","guntere3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>純粹的能量以意志去引導其本身！嗯∼傳說在很久以前，有一個年代，魔法比我們現在所能想像還要強大，想要與自然對話的魔法師就創造出了一種形式。</p>\r\n<p>但是當然了，像你一樣的人或 <a link=\"guntere6\">吉倫</a>必定會用更聰明的方法來解決這種事件方面，不是嗎？</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","guntere3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Pure energy with a will to guide itself...according to legend, a long time ago in an age when magic was more powerful than we can imagine, magicians who wished to talk to nature gave it a form to which humans can relate.</p>\r\n<p>But, I know not much of such matters - surely people such as yourself or <a link=\"guntere6\">Gereng</a>must be more knowledgeable, no?</p>\r\n</body>","guntere3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Pure energy with a will to guide itself...according to legend, a long time ago in an age when magic was more powerful than we can imagine, magicians who wished to talk to nature gave it a form to which humans can relate.</p>\r\n<p>But, I know not much of such matters - surely people such as yourself or <a link=\"guntere6\">Gereng</a>must be more knowledgeable, no?</p>\r\n</body>","guntere3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">曖雖陛 氈朝 牖熱и ��曖 唸薑羹’ 橾鎰檜 雖旎婁 綠掖紫 寰腆 薑紫煎 葆徹檜 嫦殖п 氈歷湍 陽縑 濠翱婁 渠�倆炱� 嬪п 葆徹餌菟檜 濠翱擊 '檣除檜 檣衝й 熱 氈朝 ⑽鷓'煎 夥紱歷棻, 塭朝 瞪撲檜 氈雖 彊模?</p>\r\n<p align=justify>檜 睡碟縑 渠п憮朝 釭爾棻 螃�鷛� 渡褐檜釭 <a link=\"guntere6\">啪滅</a> 偽擎 餌塋檜 渦 澀 憲堅 氈戲葬塭堅 儅陝ж螃虜?</font></p>\r\n</body>","guntere4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>妖精們是精神自由且不受約束的生物，但是與凡人的 <a link=\"guntere7\">『關係』</a>，卻像鐵枷一般的約束了妖精。我很了解你的情況，你應該是自由的在森林之母的懷抱裡面，但現在卻被人類社會的網所束縳住。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","guntere4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Elves are free-spirited creatures - completely unfettered...but a <a link=\"guntere7\">'companionship'</a> with a mortal can bind a elf like iron shackles.  I understand your plight, you who should be free within the bosom of the Forest Mother, who are now entwined within the webs of human society.</p>\r\n</body>","guntere4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Elves are free-spirited creatures - completely unfettered...but a <a link=\"guntere7\">'companionship'</a> with a mortal can bind a elf like iron shackles.  I understand your plight, you who should be free within the bosom of the Forest Mother, who are now entwined within the webs of human society.</p>\r\n</body>","guntere4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">蹂薑檜塢 檣除婁曖 <a link=\"guntere7\">'婦啗'</a>縑 樓夢腎朝 襄營’斜匙檜 獄蛤 橫該棲檣 渠鳴葡 寰縑憮 и橈檜 濠嶸煎錶撿 й 斜渠菟擊 葆纂 剪嘐還婁紫 偽擎 檣除 餌�虞� 碳楝菟檜朝 錳檣檜 腎堅 氈棻朝 餌褒, 頂 澀 憲堅 氈棻螃.</font></p>\r\n</body>","guntere5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>這『說語島』長期以來就一直是個訓練魔法師的地方。</p>\r\n<p>現在它是我訓練年輕人的場所，因為我仍然對這個世界抱有希望。</p>\r\n<p>我很驕傲，因為現在我的學生能和像你這樣的妖精一族建立『關係』。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","guntere5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>The '說語島' has long been a training ground for magicians.</p>\r\n<p>Now it is a place where I train youths, for in that way I retain hope for this world.</p>\r\n<p>I am proud that now one of my students can establish a 'companionship' with one of the faerie folk such as you.</p>\r\n</body>","guntere5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>The '說語島' has long been a training ground for magicians.</p>\r\n<p>Now it is a place where I train youths, for in that way I retain hope for this world.</p>\r\n<p>I am proud that now one of my students can establish a 'companionship' with one of the faerie folk such as you.</p>\r\n</body>","guntere5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">檜夠擎 '蜓ж朝 撰', 檜瞪睡攪 葆徹餌曖 熱溼濰檜歷堅 雖旎擎 頂陛 撮鼻縑 渠и 褻斜葆и �騆謊� 勘堅 瞬擎檜菟擊 掖幫ж堅 氈朝 夠檜螃.</p>\r\n<P align=justify>頂陛 陛腦纂堅 氈朝 嬴檜菟 醞縑 渡褐婁 偽擎 蹂薑婁 '婦啗'蒂 裕擊 餌塋檜 氈棻棲, 蝶蝓戲煎憮 檜爾棻 銑蛭и 匙檜 橈掘溥.</font></p>\r\n</body>","guntere6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>他是和我照料一起這個島的魔法師。他就在島的西方的一個小小的魔術師學院裡教書。</p>\r\n<P>他是一個聰明和有知識的男人，所以如果你想要未知的答案，你最好去那裡尋求賢能的建議。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","guntere6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Gereng?   He is a magician who looks after this island with me, teaching at a small magician's academy on the eastern part of the island.</p>\r\n<P>He is a wise and knowledgeable man, so if you seek answers to the unknown, or wish to research in the magical arts, you would do well to ask his sagely advice.</p>\r\n</body>","guntere6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Gereng?   He is a magician who looks after this island with me, teaching at a small magician's academy on the eastern part of the island.</p>\r\n<P>He is a wise and knowledgeable man, so if you seek answers to the unknown, or wish to research in the magical arts, you would do well to ask his sagely advice.</p>\r\n</body>","guntere6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">釭諦 л眷 檜 撰擊 婦葬ж堅 氈朝 葆徹餌塭螃. 撰曖 憮薹縑憮 褻斜葆и 葆徹 з掖蒂 翮堅 氈雖.</p>\r\n<P align=justify>僅僅ж堅 嬴朝 匙紫 號擎 棕擎檜棲 賅腦朝啪 氈棻賊 陛憮 雖��蒂 羶п 爾朝 匙檜 橫飩啊模?</font></p>\r\n</body>","guntere7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>我總是對被你們種族所說的那『關係』感到興趣∼</p>\r\n<P>在人類的關係中，領導者和追隨者的關係好像是不同的，不過在許多方面仍然是相似的。妖精們總是在與他們的『關係』中保護人類，但是它不能被稱為服務...在『關係』之下，你難道不會猶豫對人說你的心意。</p>\r\n<p>我已經聽說過被稱為『平等』的觀念...但是即使那項觀念似乎不能充份地解釋妖精們所謂的『關係』。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","guntere7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>I have always been interested in the 'companionship' spoken of by your kind.</p>\r\n<P align=justify>It seems different with the human bloodpledge of lord and follower, yet in many ways it seems similar. Elves always protect their human 'companion', but it can not be called service - you do not hesitate to speak your mind to your human 'companion'.</p>\r\n<p>It might seem an bonded friendship of some kind, but even that seems an inadequate description.  Odd!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n  ","guntere7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>I have always been interested in the 'companionship' spoken of by your kind.</p>\r\n<P align=justify>It seems different with the human bloodpledge of lord and follower, yet in many ways it seems similar. Elves always protect their human 'companion', but it can not be called service - you do not hesitate to speak your mind to your human 'companion'.</p>\r\n<p>It might seem an bonded friendship of some kind, but even that seems an inadequate description.  Odd!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n  ","guntere7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">橾奩瞳檣 檣除 餌�蛾□倣� 輿謙 婦啗諦朝 棻艇, 渡褐菟檜 蜓ж朝 斜 '婦啗'塭朝 偃喃縑 渠п 釭朝 棺 �儮抶� 陛螳 諮棻螃.</p>\r\n<P align=justify>蹂薑菟擎 棺 濠褐婁 '婦啗'蒂 裕擎 餌塋擊 爾��ж堅 撰晦朝 蛭 ж雖虜, 斜勒 檣除檜 蜓ж朝 犒謙婁朝 棻艇 匙’渡褐菟擎 樹薯釭 濠褐婁 婦啗ж朝 濠縑 渠п 渡渡ж雖.</p>\r\n<P align=justify>釭紫 獄饜縑 氈歷擊 陽 埠還 ゎ蛔檜塭朝 餌鼻縑 渠п 蜓ж堆 ц模虜’渡褐菟曖 偃喃擎 斜匙婁紫 褻旎 棻艇 匙 偽模.</font></p>\r\n</body>","guntereev1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你的教師不是那些『永恆的樹』與『永久的大地』嗎？\r\n<p>我不確定我能指導你，也不想測試你。同樣地，你的種族可能也不了解我的教義、我思考的方法。\r\n<p>你不依照人類的規定生活，但你在仍然居住在人類之中，你的靈魂是自由的。不過如此的自由必須付出代價，而我希望...你是最好的。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","guntereEv1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The eternal trees and timeless earth are your teachers, not one such as myself.\r\n<p>I do not presume that I can teach you, nor test you. Your kind can not possibly understand my teachings or my way of thinking. \r\n<p>You live above human law, yet you live among humans; your soul is free...but such freedom comes at a great price. I wish you the best.\r\n</body>","guntereEv1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The eternal trees and timeless earth are your teachers, not one such as myself.\r\n<p>I do not presume that I can teach you, nor test you. Your kind can not possibly understand my teachings or my way of thinking. \r\n<p>You live above human law, yet you live among humans; your soul is free...but such freedom comes at a great price. I wish you the best.\r\n</body>","guntereEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>斜渠曖 蝶蝓擎 鼠ии 渠雖諦 艙錳擊 餌朝 熱跡 閨檜 嬴棋陛.\r\n<p>釭朝 渡褐擊 陛腦艦熱紫, ゎ陛й 熱紫 橈模檜棻. 渡褐菟曖 餌堅寞衝戲煎朝 釭諦 頂陛 陛腦纂朝 匙菟 餌檜蒂 瞰渠煎 檜пй 熱 橈擊 匙檜晦 陽僥縑.\r\n<p>斜渠朝 檣除曖 徹擊 蟾錯ж罹 檣除 寰縑憮 餌朝 襄營...斜煎 檣п 濠嶸照雖虜...斜煎 檣п 夢п嫡擊 匙檜螃.\r\n</body>","gunterk1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>陌生人啊！你有一個誠實的面孔∼你何時來到這個島的？</p>\r\n<p>由你的衣服判斷，你像是一個胸懷大志的<a link=\"gunterk2\">騎士</a> 吧！在這裡也曾有很多像你這樣懷抱 <a link=\"gunterk3\">夢想</a>的年輕人。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">請求『甘特的測試』</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","gunterk1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have a truthful face... When did you come to this island?</p>\r\n<p>To judge by your clothes, you seem to be <a link=\"gunterk2\">a knight</a> aspirant...There are may youths here with <a link=\"gunterk3\">dreams</a>such as yours.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">Request for \"Gunter's test\"</a>\r\n</body>","gunterk1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have a truthful face... When did you come to this island?</p>\r\n<p>To judge by your clothes, you seem to be <a link=\"gunterk2\">a knight</a> aspirant...There are may youths here with <a link=\"gunterk3\">dreams</a>such as yours.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">Request for \"Gunter's test\"</a>\r\n</body>","gunterk1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">換維檜 彰鼻纂 彊捱.. 檜 撰縛 樹薯 諮朝陛?</p>\r\n<p align=justify>離葡擊 爾棲 <a link=\"gunterk2\">晦餌</a>�贍蜓�檣 蛭и等. 檜夠縑朝 <a link=\"gunterk3\">濠啻諦 偽擎 嗆</a>擊 雖棋 瞬擎檜菟檜 號檜 氈棻啻.</font></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">'捱攪曖 衛я'擊 嫡朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","gunterk2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>用武器戰鬥的能力？這種能力的確是非常重要的。但是年輕的朋友，他們說在那加恩山中，<a link=\"gunterk4\">艾爾摩王國</a>的西方，聽說有些強盜與神秘的劍士對抗著。</p>\r\n<p>一個真正的騎士必須用一雙沉重有力的手，揮舞他的 <a link=\"gunterk5\">武器</a>。</P>\r\n<p>一個騎士必須了解危險會讓你更強壯、更有力量。他也必須沉思有關強壯的人應該為弱者做些什麼。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","gunterk2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>The abilities to fight with weapons? Such abilities are indeed very important. But, young friend, they say that in the Garm mountains, west of <a link=\"gunterk4\">the Kingdom of Elmore</a> ,even the bandits are known to fight with unearthly swordsmanship.</p>\r\n<p>A true knight knows that one must wield his <a link=\"gunterk5\">weapon</a> with caution, and respect.</P>\r\n<p>A knight must understand that dangers lie with becoming more strong, more powerful. With power comes responsibility; while young those with wisdom might stay your hand, but when your power can make the earth shudder, who but yourself will be able to keep your course true?  This great power is why finding a true leader is so important.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterk2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>The abilities to fight with weapons? Such abilities are indeed very important. But, young friend, they say that in the Garm mountains, west of <a link=\"gunterk4\">the Kingdom of Elmore</a> ,even the bandits are known to fight with unearthly swordsmanship.</p>\r\n<p>A true knight knows that one must wield his <a link=\"gunterk5\">weapon</a> with caution, and respect.</P>\r\n<p>A knight must understand that dangers lie with becoming more strong, more powerful. With power comes responsibility; while young those with wisdom might stay your hand, but when your power can make the earth shudder, who but yourself will be able to keep your course true?  This great power is why finding a true leader is so important.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterk2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">鼠晦蒂 棻瑞朝 棟溘? 僭煩 醞蹂ж雖. ж雖虜 瞬擎 耀掘, <a link=\"gunterk4\">縣賅橫 諾措</a> 憮薹曖 陛葷 骯裟縑 轎路ж朝 骯瞳 醞縑憮紫 葆纂 褐籀歲 匐擊 噙朝 餌塋檜 氈棻啻.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>晦餌塢 濠褐檜 陛雖堅 氈朝 <a link=\"gunterk5\">鼠晦</a>曖 鼠啪縑 疇歜擊 替野 還 嬴朝 餌塋虜擊 陛葬酈朝 蜓檜雖.</P>\r\n<p align=justify>鬼п霞棻朝 匙檜 橡葆釭 嬪яж堅 鼠憮遴 橾檣陛蒂 憲堅, 鬼и 濠陛 擒и 濠蒂 嬪п憮 鼠歙擊 п撿 ж朝雖縑 渠п 樹薯釭 餌儀ж朝 濠 虜檜 晦餌塭 碳萵 濠問檜 氈朝 徹檜塭啻.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterk3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>所有的騎士追求某樣相同的事物。他們最大的希望，是遇到一個能了解自已能力的 <a link = \"gunterk6\">君主</a>，而且允許騎士追求騎士的美德。</p>\r\n<p>只有這樣，一個騎士才能對他的君主和他自己理想保持忠誠。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterk3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All knights have a single dream in common - their greatest wish is to meet <a link = \"gunterk6\">a lord</a>who understands the knight's abilities, and allows the knight to pursue chivalrous virtues.</p>\r\n<p>Only then can a knight remain loyal to both his lord and his ideals.  A knight torn between duty and virtue will forever be haunted.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterk3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All knights have a single dream in common - their greatest wish is to meet <a link = \"gunterk6\">a lord</a>who understands the knight's abilities, and allows the knight to pursue chivalrous virtues.</p>\r\n<p>Only then can a knight remain loyal to both his lord and his ideals.  A knight torn between duty and virtue will forever be haunted.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterk3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">晦餌塭賊 援掘釭 錳ж朝 夥陛 氈雖. 斜匙擎 夥煎 濠褐曖 棟溘擊 憲嬴 輿堅, 濠褐曖 嗆擊 譆渠и戲煎 嫦�秷炾� п 輿朝 <a link = \"gunterk6\">輿捱</a>擊 虜釭朝 匙檜撿.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>斜蒂 嬪п 橾л婁 翕衛縑 斜蒂 鱔п 濠褐曖 嗆擊 り纂朝 匙檜雖.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterk4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P>在<a link=\"gunterk7\">大陸</a>北方有一個國家，我正打算前往那個國家。</p>\r\n<p>但∼我聽說他們正在跟那個判王打仗。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterk4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P>A nation on the northen part of <a link=\"gunterk7\">the continent</a>...on which I have turned my back.</p>\r\n<p>But I hear they war with the pretender king these days - ha!</p>\r\n</body>","gunterk4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P>A nation on the northen part of <a link=\"gunterk7\">the continent</a>...on which I have turned my back.</p>\r\n<p>But I hear they war with the pretender king these days - ha!</p>\r\n</body>","gunterk4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\"><a link=\"gunterk7\">渠睛</a> 磁薹縑 氈朝 釭塭雖’頂陛 蛔霞 釭曖 褻措檜晦紫 ж堅.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>雖旎擎 奩諾婁 瞪爵醞檜塭朝 模僥擊 菟歷啻.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterk5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>有一個從大陸來的<a link=\"gunterk8\">商人</a>，他所賣的武器價格很合理。</p>\r\n<p>但是不要忘記，一旦在你的手中握住一個武器，究竟是要以它的力量去傷害或保護就變成你必須思考的責任。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","gunterk5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>A <a link=\"gunterk8\">merchant</a> from the mainland will sell weapons at a reasonable price.</p>\r\n<p>But never forget, once you hold a weapon in your hand, its power to harm or protect becomes your responsibility - this is the true price, not mere adena.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterk5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>A <a link=\"gunterk8\">merchant</a> from the mainland will sell weapons at a reasonable price.</p>\r\n<p>But never forget, once you hold a weapon in your hand, its power to harm or protect becomes your responsibility - this is the true price, not mere adena.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterk5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">檜夠縑憮塭賊 獄饜縑憮 勒傘諦 濰餌蒂 ж朝 <a link=\"gunterk8\">ч鼻</a>縑啪憮 瞳渡и 陛問縑 掘й 熱 氈雖.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>ж雖虜 貲褕ж啪’槳縑 鼠晦蒂 鍊 斜 牖除睡攪 斜 鼠晦陛 濠啻縑啪 睡罹й �� 虜躑曖 疇歜檜 濠啻縑啪 儅曹棻朝 餌褒擊’</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterk6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>他們是人類中的特別的一群。他們並不特別強壯的，也不特別聰明的；但是他們擁有一個光明的態度。</p>\r\n<p>他們了解許多人的夢想，而且編織這些夢想進入一個更大的夢之中。他們不尋求去統治其他的人，而且默默地承擔責任。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","gunterk6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>They are a special breed of people - not particulary strong, nor wise, but they possess a radiant presence.</p>\r\n<p>They understand the dreams of many people and weave them into an even bigger dream; they do not seek to rule over others, but quietly assume responsibility for their own.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n6.   ","gunterk6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>They are a special breed of people - not particulary strong, nor wise, but they possess a radiant presence.</p>\r\n<p>They understand the dreams of many people and weave them into an even bigger dream; they do not seek to rule over others, but quietly assume responsibility for their own.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n6.   ","gunterk6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">撮鼻縑朝 斜楛 餌塋菟檜 氈棻啻 - か滌�� 鬼и 匙紫 嬴棲堅, 繭營瞳檣 雖楞擊 陛霞 匙紫 嬴棲雖虜, 襄營ж朝 匙 虜戲煎 維釭朝 斜楛 餌塋菟檜 蜓橾撮.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>號擎 餌塋菟檜 ヶ堅 氈朝 斜菟虜曖 翎菟擊 翰橫 頂橫 爾棻 贖 翎擊 褒⑷п 釭陞 熱 氈朝 餌塋, 棻艇 餌塋 嬪縑 捱葡ж溥 ж雖 彊堅 斜菟曖 菴縑憮 疇歜擊 韓 熱 氈朝 餌塋檜雖.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterk7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>當然我提到的『大陸』，是指曾經有人居住的那個地方。\r\n<p>你已經忘記了，是吧？記得那是個暴風雨的季節， 而且那幾天沒什麼船航行到那裡。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","gunterk7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>The 'continent' I mentioned is the one I used to live on, before my exile.  \r\n<p>Tis the stormy season, and not many ships travel there these days - and be leery, for gaining entrance to the pier can often be a challenge in itself..\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterk7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>The 'continent' I mentioned is the one I used to live on, before my exile.  \r\n<p>Tis the stormy season, and not many ships travel there these days - and be leery, for gaining entrance to the pier can often be a challenge in itself..\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterk7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">'渠睛'檜塭堅 ж賊 濠啻陛 髦湍 斜 夠 檜諼縑 証 夠檜 氈啊朝陛. 罹晦摹 �褙� '獄饜'塭堅紫 睡腦雖.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>蹂闈 啗瞰縛 晦�襤� 寰謠嬴 寡陛 澀 寰棻棲朝 賅曄檜棻虜’撲葆 濱橫幗萼勒 嬴棲啊雖?</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterk8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>例如有一個被叫做『潘朵拉』的少女，她總是在西北方的碼頭上展示她的商品。\r\n<p>附帶一提的，她是一個年輕不過易怒的少女；但是你可以信賴她，因為她只賣高品質的物品。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","gunterk8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>A lass named 'Pandora' - she always displays her wares by the north-western side pier.\r\n<p>A young but feisty one!  And - you can trust her to sell only quality items.\r\n</body>","gunterk8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>A lass named 'Pandora' - she always displays her wares by the north-western side pier.\r\n<p>A young but feisty one!  And - you can trust her to sell only quality items.\r\n</body>","gunterk8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">'っ紫塭'塭朝 檜葷曖 嬴陛噢塭啻. 檜夠縑憮 濰餌蒂 й 陽朝 樹薯釭 撰 憮磁薹曖 睡舒縑 颶擊 ヴ渦捱.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>瞬雖虜 渡離堅, だ朝 僭勒紫 �捐Я�.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterkev1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>很好∼原先我還懷疑你什麼時候才會問。你接受測試的時刻已經到來。</p>\r\n<p>你聽說過居住在島上西北方，被稱為『夏洛伯』的怪獸嗎？沒錯，也許你和你的朋友已經面對過這樣可怕的怪獸了吧。</p>\r\n<p>現在，你必須自己獨力殺死一隻夏洛伯，並帶回牠的爪子當做證據。這就是我所給你的測試。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterkEv1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>Very well... I was wondering when you would ask. The time has come for you to be tested.</p>\r\n<p>Have you heard of the fearsome beasts called Shelob, which live on the southwest part of the island? Yes, you may have faced such a beast, together with your companions.</p>\r\n<p>Now, however, you must slay a Shelob in singlehanded combat. Bring back the beast's claw as proof - this is the test I lay before you!</p>\r\n</body>","gunterkEv1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>Very well... I was wondering when you would ask. The time has come for you to be tested.</p>\r\n<p>Have you heard of the fearsome beasts called Shelob, which live on the southwest part of the island? Yes, you may have faced such a beast, together with your companions.</p>\r\n<p>Now, however, you must slay a Shelob in singlehanded combat. Bring back the beast's claw as proof - this is the test I lay before you!</p>\r\n</body>","gunterkEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>斜楚...釭紫 螃棺鎢檜 傘曖 晦榆擊 衛яй 謠擎 晦�葆饇� 儅陝ж堅 氈歷棻.</p>\r\n<p>撰曖 磁翕薹縑 餌朝 標煎粽塭朝 跨蝶攪蒂 憲堅 氈替傍...斜楚, 罹殿檜憮塭賊 賃廓鎢 濩嬴獄 橾檜 氈擊 匙檜棻.</p>\r\n<p>斜 標煎粽蒂 �母� 濩嬴, 斜 隸ル煎 斜 標煎粽曖 嫦體擊 陛雖堅 螃傘塭. 檜匙檜 頂陛 傘縑啪 睡婁ж朝 衛溼檜棻.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterkev2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>你還沒準備好去接受最後的測驗。你在這個島之上的試驗還沒有結束！</p>\r\n<p>對你而言，你的武器仍然是一大負擔。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterkEv2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>You are not yet ready for your final test. Your trials on this island are not yet over.</p>\r\n<p>Your weapon is still a great burden to you...</p>\r\n</body>","gunterkEv2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>You are not yet ready for your final test. Your trials on this island are not yet over.</p>\r\n<p>Your weapon is still a great burden to you...</p>\r\n</body>","gunterkEv2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>傘朝 嬴霜 檜 撰縑憮曖 葆雖虞 衛溼擊 剪艦虜и 遽綠陛 腎雖 彊懊棻.</p>\r\n<p>...嬴霜 啻陛 菟堅 氈朝 斜 鼠晦朝 傘縑啪 氈橫憮 鼠剪遴 颶檜 腎堅 氈橫...</p>\r\n</body>","gunterkev3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>恭喜你...。你現在已經準備好承擔手持刀劍的責任。\r\n<p>你已經接受過嚴厲的訓練，也有極好的成就！你不必再停留在這個小島上。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你已經通過在我保護監督之下的『甘特之屋』中所有試驗，紅騎士的劍將會向所有人宣示你是一個傑出的的騎士。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在走吧！祝你在旅程中有好的運氣。願你遇見一位值得你稱他為的君主的人！願殷海薩的教義永遠指導你...\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","gunterkEv3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>...I congratulate you. You are now ready to assume the responsibilty of your sword.\r\n<p>You have endured harsh trials, and you have succeded admirably. You no longer must remain on this tiny island. \r\n<br>\r\n<p>Take this weapon. The Sword of the Red Knight will show to all that you are a worthy knight, and that you have passed all the trials of the 'House of the Red Knight' under my tutelage.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now go. I wish you good luck on your journeys. May you meet a worthy person to call your lord. May Einhasad's benevolent teaching always guide you...\r\n</body>","gunterkEv3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>...I congratulate you. You are now ready to assume the responsibilty of your sword.\r\n<p>You have endured harsh trials, and you have succeded admirably. You no longer must remain on this tiny island. \r\n<br>\r\n<p>Take this weapon. The Sword of the Red Knight will show to all that you are a worthy knight, and that you have passed all the trials of the 'House of the Red Knight' under my tutelage.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now go. I wish you good luck on your journeys. May you meet a worthy person to call your lord. May Einhasad's benevolent teaching always guide you...\r\n</body>","gunterkEv3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<P>...霞褕戲煎 蹴жи棻. 萄蛤橫 傘朝 啻陛 菟堅 氈朝 鼠晦縑 渠п 疇歜擊 韓 熱 氈朝 檣除檜 腎歷掘釭.\r\n<p>堅脹 �こ� 晦除擊 澀 唯筑 輿歷棻. 檜薯 傘朝 渦 檜鼻 檜 謎擎 撰縑 橋衙橫 氈擊 в蹂陛 橈啪 腎歷橫.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 匐擊 陛螳陛剪塭. 檜 碩擎 晦餌曖 匐擎 啻陛 釭曖 雖紫 ж縑 辦葬 '碩擎 晦餌曖 餵'曖 衛溼擊 賅舒 鱔婁и 嗨橫陪 晦餌歜擊 賅舒縑啪 隸貲п 還 匙檜棻. \r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠, 檜薯 陛塭. 陛憮 傘虜曖 捱輿蒂 瓊嬴 億煎遴 賅я縑 釭憮塭. 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 摹и 嗆檜 樹薯釭 傘縑啪 '紫瞪'戲煎 陴晦蒂...\r\n</body>","gunterkev4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>『甘特之屋』不能夠接受你當做一個騎士。  \r\n<p>我以前曾經告訴你，你可能已經是個很會用刀劍的人。但是一個眼中燃燒黑暗之火的戰士不能夠被稱為一個騎士。你現在立刻離開這裡！\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","gunterkEv4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'The House of the Red Knight' cannot accept you as a knight.  \r\n<p>I've told you before...You may be skilled with your blade, but a warrior whose eyes burn with dark fire cannot be called 'knight'. Begone from here!\r\n</body>","gunterkEv4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'The House of the Red Knight' cannot accept you as a knight.  \r\n<p>I've told you before...You may be skilled with your blade, but a warrior whose eyes burn with dark fire cannot be called 'knight'. Begone from here!\r\n</body>","gunterkEv4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>釭朝 傘蒂 辦葬 '碩擎 晦餌曖 餵'曖 晦餌煎 檣薑й 熱 橈棻. \r\n<p>頂 橾瞪縑 傘縑啪 蜓ж雖 彊懊替傍...傘曖 褒溘檜 薯嬴鼠葬 嗨橫釭棻堅 ж渦塭紫, 換 寰縑 匐擎 碳粒擊 氬擎 濠蒂 釭朝 晦餌煎 撮選 熱朝 橈棻. 渡濰 僭楝陛塭!\r\n</body>","gunterkev5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><p>哈哈哈∼焦慮是沒有用的，放輕鬆並保持你自已的步調。\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterkEv5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ha!  Your anxiousness will not help...be relaxed and hold your pace.\r\n</body>","gunterkEv5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ha!  Your anxiousness will not help...be relaxed and hold your pace.\r\n</body>","gunterkEv5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>жжж, ж瑞 嬴藹縑 腎朝 橾檜 嬴棲塢棻...傘鼠 鼠葬ж雖 蜓剪塭.\r\n</body>","gunterp1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>你在哪裡出生和你如何生存到現在，這是我不得不關心的事。</p>\r\n<p>我要知道你是否有 <a link=\"gunterp2\">能力</a> 領導其他的人，而且你是否將會使用那些能力去反對那被憎恨的 <a link=\"gunterp3\">判王</a>。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">請求『甘特的測試』</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>...Where or how you lived until now, I couldn't care less.</p>\r\n<p>What I do want to know is whether you have <a link=\"gunterp2\">the abilities</a> to lead others, and whether you will use those abilities to oppose the accursed <a link=\"gunterp3\">pretender king</a>!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">Request \"Gunter's test\"</a>\r\n</body>","gunterp1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>...Where or how you lived until now, I couldn't care less.</p>\r\n<p>What I do want to know is whether you have <a link=\"gunterp2\">the abilities</a> to lead others, and whether you will use those abilities to oppose the accursed <a link=\"gunterp3\">pretender king</a>!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">Request \"Gunter's test\"</a>\r\n</body>","gunterp1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>...濠啻曖 陛僥檜 橫蛤檣雖, 雖旎梱雖 橫集и 橾擊 п 諮朝雖 釭朝 瞪⑵ 婦褕檜 橈啻.</p>\r\n<p>頂陛 輿跡ж朝 匙擎 螃霜 濠啻縑啪 棻艇 餌塋曖 嬪縑 憮朝 濠煎憮曖 <a link=\"gunterp2\">棟溘</a>檜 氈朝陛, 傳 斜楝и 棟溘擊 盪 盪輿蝶楝遴 <a link=\"gunterp3\">奩諾</a>擊 顫紫ж朝等 餌辨п 還 匙檣陛 塭朝 匙 閨檜塭啻.</font></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"guntertest\">'捱攪曖 衛я'擊 嫡朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","gunterp2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>既然你已經來到這地方，表示你已經聽過了<a link=\"gunterp4\">『甘特之屋』</a>的事，對嗎？</p>\r\n<p>我已經花費許多年去訓練很多年輕天真的青年變成令人尊敬的騎士...所以我比多數人更能了解一個年輕人的心。</P>\r\n<p>你不是一個會在別人下面工作，就感到滿意的那一種人。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>That you have come to this place means you have already heard of <a link=\"gunterp4\">the 'House of the Red Knight'</a>, correct?</p>\r\n<p>I have spent many years training young and foolish lads such as you to become honorable knights...I can read a youngster's heart like a book.</P>\r\n<p>You are not the sort of person satisfied to work beneath another - you were born to be a leader!</p>\r\n</body>","gunterp2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>That you have come to this place means you have already heard of <a link=\"gunterp4\">the 'House of the Red Knight'</a>, correct?</p>\r\n<p>I have spent many years training young and foolish lads such as you to become honorable knights...I can read a youngster's heart like a book.</P>\r\n<p>You are not the sort of person satisfied to work beneath another - you were born to be a leader!</p>\r\n</body>","gunterp2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">濠啻紫 檜 夠縑 瓊嬴螞 虜躑 <a link=\"gunterp4\">'碩擎 晦餌曖 餵'</a>縑 渠и 模僥 薑紫朝 菟橫 爾懊啊雖?</p>\r\n<p align=justify>釭朝 檜夠縑憮 弊賦 褊熱喇簞 繹橈朝 瞬擎 匙菟擊 貲蕨氈朝 晦餌煎 酈辦朝 橾擊 ж堅 氈棻啻’\r\n餌塋擊 爾朝 換擎 �捐Я炴棪� 濠睡ж堅 氈雖.</P>\r\n<p align=justify>濠啻朝 陴曖 壽縑憮 橾ж朝 匙戲煎 虜褶й 餌塋檜 嬴棲撿.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterp3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P>判王肯恩－個擁有可怕力量的人。</p>\r\n<p>在他的眼睛中，我可以看見猶如鋼鐵般的意志以及如同暗夜般黑暗的野心。雖然在那個時候，他還只是一個年輕的騎士，而我則是一個被放逐到島上的<a link=\"gunterp5\">叛逆者</a>。哈哈哈∼∼∼</font></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P>The pretender king Ken Rauhel... a man with fearsome abilities.</p>\r\n<p>Just once was I able to see him, back when I was still living in my homeland. In his eyes I have seen an unbreakable will and an even darker ambition...though at that time, he was still a young knight, and I was <a link=\"gunterp5\">a traitor</a> being exiled to this island...ha!</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterp3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P>The pretender king Ken Rauhel... a man with fearsome abilities.</p>\r\n<p>Just once was I able to see him, back when I was still living in my homeland. In his eyes I have seen an unbreakable will and an even darker ambition...though at that time, he was still a young knight, and I was <a link=\"gunterp5\">a traitor</a> being exiled to this island...ha!</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterp3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">奩諾 騰 塭辦⑦’斜朝 舒溥選 薑紫煎 棟溘氈朝 餌塋檜塭啻.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>頂陛 嬴霜 堅щ縑 氈歷擊 陽 濡械 獄 匙 閨檜雖虜 釭朝 斜曖 換縑憮 鬼檣и 曖雖諦, \r\n斜爾棻紫 鬼渠и 匐擎 踹蜂擊 爾懊橫’綠煙 頂陛 斜蒂 籀擠 爾懊擊 陽 斜朝 瞬擎 晦餌, 釭朝 撰戲煎 \r\n敝щ陛朝 <a link=\"gunterp5\">奩羲濠曖 跺</a>檜歷雖虜 蜓橾撮’жжж.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterp4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>那是我在<a link=\"gunterp6\">『說語島』</a>上的學院名字，我在那裡訓練有抱負的年輕騎士。</p>\r\n<p align=justify>由於<a link=\"gunterp7\">最近發生的一些事件</a>，我不再招收任何新學生。然而，一旦所有事情平靜下來，我會計劃招收更多的學生。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>That is the name of my academy on <a link=\"gunterp6\">the 說語島</a>, where I train aspiring knights.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>Due to some <a link=\"gunterp7\">recent events</a>, I am not accepting any new students - but once everything quiets down, I plan to accept more pupils again.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterp4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>That is the name of my academy on <a link=\"gunterp6\">the 說語島</a>, where I train aspiring knights.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>Due to some <a link=\"gunterp7\">recent events</a>, I am not accepting any new students - but once everything quiets down, I plan to accept more pupils again.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterp4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">檜夠 <a link=\"gunterp6\">蜓ж朝 撰</a>縑憮 頂陛 ж堅 氈朝 晦餌 曄撩模曖 檜葷檜塭啻.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>雖旎擎 <a link=\"gunterp7\">賃陛雖 餌薑</a>檜 氈橫憮 億煎遴 薯濠蒂 嫡堅 氈雖 彊雖虜 覬 霞薑檜 腎賊 棻衛 嫡嬴撿雖.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterp5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>我認為你不要聽到那個故事會比較好。</p>\r\n<p>我能說的是，那件事改變我對『力量』的看法。我曾經認為『力量』是天生的，但是現在我對所有的力量感到懷疑。</font></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Hmmmm...I think it would be better for you not to hear that story.</p>\r\n<p>What I can say is, that event changed my view of 'power.' I used to think 'power' came naturally, but now I view all power with skepticism.</font></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Hmmmm...I think it would be better for you not to hear that story.</p>\r\n<p>What I can say is, that event changed my view of 'power.' I used to think 'power' came naturally, but now I view all power with skepticism.</font></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">濠啻縑啪 菟溥還虜и 檜撿晦朝 嬴棲塭啻.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>斜盪, 頂陛 鷓橫釭 濠塭釭賊憮 傘鼠釭 濠翱蝶毀啪 替郭堅 氈湍 '掏溘'檜塭朝 匙縑 渠п �蛻К� 替郭啪 脹 餌勒檜塭堅虜 蜓п 舒雖.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterp6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>如你所知，它是這個島的名字。</p>\r\n<p>我不確定，但是我認為這奇怪的名字來自這個島，那個曾經是魔法師的一所學校。也許<a link=\"gunterp8\">吉倫</a>知道的更多...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>說語島...as you know, it is the name of this island.</p>\r\n<p>I'm not sure, but I believe that the strange name comes from the fact that this island was once a school for magicians - known for many things, but especially their ability to talk.  Ha!  Mayhaps <a link=\"gunterp8\">Gereng</a> will know more.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>說語島...as you know, it is the name of this island.</p>\r\n<p>I'm not sure, but I believe that the strange name comes from the fact that this island was once a school for magicians - known for many things, but especially their ability to talk.  Ha!  Mayhaps <a link=\"gunterp8\">Gereng</a> will know more.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">檜 撰曖 檜葷檜濫釭.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>旋赭’蕨瞪縑朝 輿煎 葆徹餌菟曖 熱溼濰檜歷晦 陽僥縑 檜楛 檜鼻и 檜葷檜 稱擎 匙 偽棻虜’<a link=\"gunterp8\">啪滅</a>檜塭賊 劃陛 覬 渦 憲雖紫 賅腦啊捱.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterp7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>嗯∼我已經收到消息，聽說判王為了要去搜尋出那些反對他的力量的人，他黑暗魔掌就快伸向這個島了。</p>\r\n<p>乘船到達這裡唯一的方法，是經過西北方的碼頭。所以如果他們要攻擊，他們將會從那個方向來。要保持機警、要小心，務必凡事慎重哪。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Hmm...I have received information that the dark hand of the pretender king reaches even this island, to search out those who oppose his power.</p>\r\n<p>The only way to reach this place by boat is through the north-western piers, so if they do attack, they will arrive from that direction... Always be wary, and watch your step!</p>\r\n</body>","gunterp7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Hmm...I have received information that the dark hand of the pretender king reaches even this island, to search out those who oppose his power.</p>\r\n<p>The only way to reach this place by boat is through the north-western piers, so if they do attack, they will arrive from that direction... Always be wary, and watch your step!</p>\r\n</body>","gunterp7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">擠’奩諾檜 濠褐曖 掏溘擊 嬪⑺ж朝 濠菟擊 儀轎ж晦 嬪п 檜夠縑梱雖 斜 匐擎 槳擊 遘堅 氈棻朝 薑爾陛 氈棻啻.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>檜 撰縑憮 寡蒂 減 熱 氈朝 夠檜塭賊 撰 憮磁薹縑 氈朝 摹雜濰 閨檜棲 斜菟檜 螞棻賊 嬴葆 斜薹戲煎睡攪啊雖’濠啻紫 睡蛤 跺擊 褻褕ж啪釭.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterp8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>他是和我照料一起這個島的魔法師。他就在島的西方的一個小小的魔術師學院裡教書。</p>\r\n<p align=justify>他很聰明也很有知識，懂得很多事情，所以如果有些事你不明暸的事，你可以去尋求他的幫忙。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterp8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Gereng?  He is a fellow magician who looks over this island with me. He teaches at a small magician's academy on the SouthEast side of the town.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>He is a wise man and knowledgeable in many things, so if there is something you do not know, you  should seek his help.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterp8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Gereng?  He is a fellow magician who looks over this island with me. He teaches at a small magician's academy on the SouthEast side of the town.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>He is a wise man and knowledgeable in many things, so if there is something you do not know, you  should seek his help.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterp8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<P align=justify><font face=\"夥鰻\" size=\"12\">釭諦 л眷 檜 撰擊 婦葬ж堅 氈朝 葆徹餌塭啻. 撰曖 憮薹縑憮 褻斜葆и 葆徹 з掖蒂 翮堅 氈雖.</p>\r\n<p align=justify>僅僅ж堅 嬴朝 匙紫 號擎 棕擎檜棲 賅腦朝啪 氈棻賊 陛憮 雖��蒂 羶п 爾朝 匙紫 謠啊雖.</font></p>\r\n</body>","gunterpev1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>啊∼已經過了一段很長的時間，而你也的確沒有白費你在這裡修練的時間。</p>\r\n<p>現在，你應該去尋找擁有『血盟』的朋友、可信賴的朋友、可為彼此保護生命的朋友。聚集五個這樣的人，這就是你的在這個島上的最後試驗。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterpEv1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>...Yes, it has been a long time... And your skills have grown to match the time you have spent here.</p>\r\n<p>You should seek out your 'blood pledge' companions - find trustworthy companions who pledge their lives for each other. Gather five such people...This will be your last trial on this island.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterpEv1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>...Yes, it has been a long time... And your skills have grown to match the time you have spent here.</p>\r\n<p>You should seek out your 'blood pledge' companions - find trustworthy companions who pledge their lives for each other. Gather five such people...This will be your last trial on this island.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterpEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>...斜楚, 弊賦 斜溢啪釭 衛除檜 雖陬掘釭. 斜葬堅 傘曖 晦榆紫 斜 撮錯婁 л眷 雜褒�� 濠塭諮掘釭.</p>\r\n<p>檜薯 陛憮 傘蒂 嬪п 跡獗擊 夥藥還 '⑸裊'擊 賅戲溥鼠釭...傘蒂 檣薑ж罹 傘蒂 嬪п 跡獗擊 勘 熱 氈朝 5貲擊 賅戲朝 匙, 斜匙檜 啻陛 檜夠縑憮 葆雖虞戲煎 熱чй 衛溼檜棻.</p>\r\n</body>","gunterpev2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>能讓你了解自己的極限與能力的，是叫做智慧的能力。在你的心中，你應該知道，依你的技術，還是仍然不足的地方！\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你第一次對我敘述的夢想，現在∼它仍然只是一個夢想...。還是先集中心力在你的技能上吧，你所有的夢想最後將會跟隨著你成長的腳步而實現。\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterpEv2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Acknowledging one's limitations is called wisdom. You know in your heart that your skills are not yet adequate! \r\n<br>\r\n<p>The dream you first spoke to me of...For now, it is still a dream...Concentrate on honing your skills. All else will eventually follow.\r\n</body>","gunterpEv2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Acknowledging one's limitations is called wisdom. You know in your heart that your skills are not yet adequate! \r\n<br>\r\n<p>The dream you first spoke to me of...For now, it is still a dream...Concentrate on honing your skills. All else will eventually follow.\r\n</body>","gunterpEv2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>啻 唳я檜 橾繭и 匙擊 啻 蝶蝶煎 梟殘雖 跤и欽 蜓檜傍!\r\n<br>\r\n<p>啻陛 釭縑啪 籀擠 蜓и 斜 贖 翎擎...斜 翎擎 雖旎曖 傘煎賦朝 鼠葬棻. 給嬴陛憮 覬 渦 薑霞ж紫煙 п.\r\n</body>","gunterpev3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在你知道贏得他人的尊敬所表示的意義了吧！\r\n<p>哈哈哈！老實告訴你，我不確定你是否會成功。不要難過，我已經看過太多年青人祇會用口說說而已。但是我知道，你是不同的！\r\n<p>現在去吧！追求你的夢想，連同你的『血盟』朋友。希望殷海薩的意志將會指引你的道路...\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterpEv3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have succeded! Now you know what it means to earn another's respect!\r\n<p>Hahaha! To be honest, even I wasn't sure you could succeed. Don't be upset...I've seen too many youngsters that are only talk. But, of course, you have proven to be...different. \r\n<p>Now go - go and pursue your dreams, together with your blood pledge companions. May Einhasad's will guide your way...\r\n</body>","gunterpEv3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have succeded! Now you know what it means to earn another's respect!\r\n<p>Hahaha! To be honest, even I wasn't sure you could succeed. Don't be upset...I've seen too many youngsters that are only talk. But, of course, you have proven to be...different. \r\n<p>Now go - go and pursue your dreams, together with your blood pledge companions. May Einhasad's will guide your way...\r\n</body>","gunterpEv3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>萄蛤橫 п麻掘釭! 棻艇 餌塋菟曖 葆擠擊 餌煎濩朝棻朝 匙檜 橫雯 匙檣雖 梟殖懊掘釭!\r\n<p>жжж, 頂陛 檜溢啪 馬問ж朝 勘煎 傘鼠 葆擠 鼻пж雖 蜓剪塭. 撮鼻縑朝 蜓虜 擅憮朝 瞬擎 喫菟檜 傘鼠 號剪萇. 濠啻朝 醱碟�� 馬問й虜и 橾擊 п 魚剪撿.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 蜂饜朝 辦葬 '碩擎 晦餌曖 餵'縑憮曖 熱溼擊 賅舒 葆耀濠縑啪 輿朝 隸ル檜棻. 陛螳陛剪塭.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠, 檜薯 陛塭. 陛憮 傘曖 ⑸裊錳菟婁 л眷 傘曖 翎擊 り藥 爾嬴塭. 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 摹и 嗆檜 樹薯釭 傘縑啪 '紫瞪'戲煎 陴晦蒂...\r\n</body>","gunterpev4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你已經改變了...\r\n<p>當你第一次來這裡的時候，你談論你的夢想，你的眼睛是閃閃發亮的。但是現在你的眼睛卻是渾濁和黑暗的。\r\n<p>是的，你是一個熟練的戰士；但是只要你的思想受到邪惡的感染，我就不能接受你成為一個『甘特之屋』的成員。\r\n<p>現在∼離開我這…\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterpEv4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have changed...\r\n<p>When you first came here, talking of your dreams, your eyes were burning brightly...but now your eyes are dull and dark.\r\n<p>Yes, you are skilled, but as long as your mind is tainted with evil, I can not accept you as a member of 'The House of the Red Knight.'\r\n<p>...Now leave me...\r\n</body>","gunterpEv4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You have changed...\r\n<p>When you first came here, talking of your dreams, your eyes were burning brightly...but now your eyes are dull and dark.\r\n<p>Yes, you are skilled, but as long as your mind is tainted with evil, I can not accept you as a member of 'The House of the Red Knight.'\r\n<p>...Now leave me...\r\n</body>","gunterpEv4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...號檜 滲ц掘釭...\r\n<p>籀擠 啻陛 檜 夠縑 諦憮 釭縑啪 傘曖 翎縑 渠п 蜓й 陽縑 傘曖 換擎 維釭堅 氈歷棻...ж雖虜 雖旎曖 傘曖 換擎 匐堅 饕ж掘釭.\r\n<p>傘曖 棟溘擎 檣薑ж雖虜, 傘曖 葆擠縑 餌學и 匙檜 氈朝 翕寰縑朝 釭朝 傘蒂 '碩擎 晦餌曖 餵' 轎褐曖 餌塋戲煎 檣薑й 熱 橈棻.\r\n<p>...斜虜 釭陛 爾剪塭...\r\n</body>","gunterpev5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哈哈哈∼焦慮是沒有用的，放輕鬆並保持你自已的步調。 \r\n</body>\r\n","gunterpEv5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ha!  Such worrying will not help...be relaxed and hold your pace.\r\n</body>","gunterpEv5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ha!  Such worrying will not help...be relaxed and hold your pace.\r\n</body>","gunterpEv5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>жжж, ж瑞 嬴藹縑 腎朝 橾檜 嬴棲塢棻...傘鼠 鼠葬ж雖 蜓剪塭.\r\n</body>","gunterw1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"gunterw2\">用人類的方法</a>實現<a link=\"gunterw3\">神的旨意</a>的人啊，歡迎你來到這裡，這個島本來就是讓魔法師 <a link=\"gunterw4\">修行</a>的地方，請你安心休息。 \r\n</body>\r\n","gunterw1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, practicioner of <a link=\"gunterw2\">God's will</a>, in <a link=\"gunterw3\">human ways</a>.  This island was meant to be a place of <a link=\"gunterw4\">discipline</a> for wizards... Make yourself at home.\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterw1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, practicioner of <a link=\"gunterw2\">God's will</a>, in <a link=\"gunterw3\">human ways</a>.  This island was meant to be a place of <a link=\"gunterw4\">discipline</a> for wizards... Make yourself at home.\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterw1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"gunterw2\">褐曖 曖雖</a>蒂 <a link=\"gunterw3\">檣除曖 寞徹</a>戲煎 褒繭ж朝 濠罹, 澀 螃樟模. 檜 撰擎 獄楚 <a link=\"gunterw4\">葆徹餌菟曖 熱ч</a>擊 嬪и 夠...ら寰�� 雖頂紫煙 ж衛螃.\r\n</body>","gunterw2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>只要人類生存在這個世上，在世上分別象徵善與惡的兩個神殷海薩和格蘭肯的爭執就不會結束。 \r\n<p>許多人說現在是格蘭肯的時代，所以近來才持續不斷地發生叛亂侵略戰爭。人心惶惶、治安腐敗，若以我們島上的年輕人為例，他們每個人都生氣勃勃，毫不在乎是不是做出了醜惡的事，一點也不知羞恥，這的確是現實。\r\n</body>\r\n","gunterw2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Two gods, Einhasad and Gran Kain, represent the good and the evil of the world...there will always be a struggle amongst the two, as long as humankind exists on this land.\r\n<p>Many people say that we are now in the age of Gran Kain; the continuous invasion wars of the Pretender-King, growing fear amongst the people, the absence of security ...'tis sad indeed.  Even on our island, many youths carry out deeds of evil, impetuously without hesitation... 'Tis shameful, yet it is reality.\r\n</body>","gunterw2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Two gods, Einhasad and Gran Kain, represent the good and the evil of the world...there will always be a struggle amongst the two, as long as humankind exists on this land.\r\n<p>Many people say that we are now in the age of Gran Kain; the continuous invasion wars of the Pretender-King, growing fear amongst the people, the absence of security ...'tis sad indeed.  Even on our island, many youths carry out deeds of evil, impetuously without hesitation... 'Tis shameful, yet it is reality.\r\n</body>","gunterw2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撮鼻曖 摹婁 學擊 鼻癒ж朝 舒 褐 嬴檣ж餌萄諦 斜嫌-蘋檣...檜 階縑 檣除檜 襄營ж朝 檜鼻 檜 舒 撮溘曖 棻羈檜 莒檜朝 陳擎 橈擊 匙檜螃.\r\n<p>號擎 餌塋菟檜 ⑷營朝 斜嫌-蘋檣曖 衛渠塭堅菟 м蛤棻. 譆斬 啗樓腎堅 氈朝 奩諾曖 藹楞瞪爵...�靿鞁� 檣褕婁 纂寰曖 睡營...\r\n<p>辦葬 撰虜 爾渦塭紫 槳縑 蠔擊 萇 瞬擎 喪戮菟檜 ⑸晦縑 跺擊 蜃晦堅 嬴鼠楛 疏葬釵 橈檜 學ч擊 橾鳴堆 и棻螃...睡莖毀晦 斜雖 橈模虜, 斜啪 ⑷褒檜雖.\r\n</body>","gunterw3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>聽說神總是透過人類來顯現它的能力，人類的善行是殷海薩能力的彰顯，惡行是源自格蘭肯，這些各自的榮耀都是由人們所歸於他們的。而且我也聽說不管是善行也好、惡行也好，那些也都只是人類的判斷。\r\n<p>一個人能同時使用黑魔法和白魔法，大概就是因為這個原因。神只是反應結果，祂們不會在過程中強迫你。 \r\n</body>\r\n","gunterw3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It is said that the gods do their work through humans; that good deeds of humankand brings glory to Einhasad, the bad to Gran Kain...  And that, for good or evil, fate occurs through humankind.\r\n<p>This is why one person can practice both black magic and white magic...  The Gods but react to the result, and do not coerce a course.\r\n</body>","gunterw3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It is said that the gods do their work through humans; that good deeds of humankand brings glory to Einhasad, the bad to Gran Kain...  And that, for good or evil, fate occurs through humankind.\r\n<p>This is why one person can practice both black magic and white magic...  The Gods but react to the result, and do not coerce a course.\r\n</body>","gunterw3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>褐擎 樹薯釭 檣除擊 鱔ж罹 嗆擊 り耀棻堅 菟歷模. 檣除曖 摹ч擎 嬴檣ж餌萄縑啪, 學ч擎 斜嫌-蘋檣縑啪 艙惜擊 給葬朝 匙檜塭堅...斜葬堅, 摹ч檜萇 學ч檜萇 斜匙擎 檣除曖 っ欽橾 閨檜塭朝 匙擊 菟歷模.\r\n<p>и 餌塋檜 �皜飪�婁 寥葆徹擊 賅舒 餌辨й 熱 氈朝 匙擎 夥煎 斜楝и 檜嶸 陽僥檜啊雖...褐菟擎 唸婁縑 奩擬й 閨, 婁薑擊 鬼薯ж雖朝 彊朝 匙檜螃.\r\n</body>","gunterw4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>甘特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖然我對武器的使用技巧很熟練，但是關於魔法的訓練不太清楚。\r\n<p>若有關於魔法的訓練現在是由吉倫完全擔當。以村莊為中心，他把家蓋在與這裡反方向的地方，獨自一個人居住。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","gunterw4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I am somewhat skilled in the ways of arms, but know not of the practice of magic. \r\n<p>Gereng is the one that deals with such things - he resides alone, in his home on the opposite side of the island.\r\n</body>","gunterw4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gunter:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I am somewhat skilled in the ways of arms, but know not of the practice of magic. \r\n<p>Gereng is the one that deals with such things - he resides alone, in his home on the opposite side of the island.\r\n</body>","gunterw4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>捱攪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>釭朝 鼠晦蒂 棻瑞朝 匙縑朝 櫛熨ж雖虜, 葆徹曖 熱溼縑 渠п憮朝 澀 賅艇棻螃. \r\n<p>葆徹曖 熱溼縑 渠п憮塭賊 雖旎擎 啪滅檜 瞪氬ж堅 氈雖. 斜朝 葆擊擊 醞褕戲煎 檜夠婁朝 奩渠ら縑 餵擊 撮辦堅 �母� 髦堅 氈棻螃.\r\n</body>","halt1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>赫特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n你好嗎，<var src=\"#0\">我們的傭兵『暴風之刃』兵團，是一個無論何時都可以盡力戰鬥的軍隊。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">徵求已配備的傭兵</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","halt1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Halt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nWelcome, Sir <var src=\"#0\">. We mercenaries of the Storm Blades are ready to fight for you with all our hearts.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">Request assigned mercenaries</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","halt1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Halt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nWelcome, Sir <var src=\"#0\">. We mercenaries of the Storm Blades are ready to fight for you with all our hearts.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">Request assigned mercenaries</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","halt1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辨煽渠濰 йお:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n寰喟ж褊棲梱, <var src=\"#0\">椒. 盪�� 'ァЁ曖 蠔陳欽'曖 辨煽菟擎 樹薯塭紫 瞪溘擊 棻п 諄選 熱 氈啪 遽綠腎橫 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">寡纂嫡擎 辨煽擊 蹂掘и棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","halt2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>赫特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n對不起，總長大人委託的傭兵還未到達。\r\n</body>\r\n","halt2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Halt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sorry Sir. The mercenaries hired by the Chamberlain have not arrived yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","halt2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Halt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sorry Sir. The mercenaries hired by the Chamberlain have not arrived yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","halt2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辨煽渠濰 йお:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n賸歎м棲棻. 嬴霜 衛謙濰椒眷憮 曖煆ж褐 辨煽菟檜 紫雜ж韓 彊懊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>\r\n","halt3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>赫特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n現在我的傭兵人數不夠了，所以無法派置足夠的傭兵到你指定的地點去，你必須再僱請一些傭兵。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","halt3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Halt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nI don't have enough mercenaries - hire more people!\r\n</body>\r\n","halt3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Halt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nI don't have enough mercenaries - hire more people!\r\n</body>\r\n","halt3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辨煽渠濰 йお:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n雖旎 該葩熱陛 褻旎 睡褶п憮 寡纂嫡戲褐 虜躑 煽溘擊 瓣錶萄萵 熱陛 橈啊朝等蹂.  餌塋擊 渦 鉻嬴撿 ж啊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>\r\n","halt4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>赫特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n你是誰？<br>\r\n你要加入我們的傭兵團『暴風之刃』嗎？否則趕快讓開，我很忙。<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","halt4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Halt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nWho goes there!<br>\r\nDo you want to join the Storm Blades? Or are you here to hire us?<br>\r\nNo? Then don't dare bother me, I'm a busy person.<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","halt4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Halt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nWho goes there!<br>\r\nDo you want to join the Storm Blades? Or are you here to hire us?<br>\r\nNo? Then don't dare bother me, I'm a busy person.<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","halt4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辨煽渠濰 йお:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n擬? 渡褐 援掘蹂?<br>\r\n�公� 辦葬 'ァЁ曖 蠔陳欽'縑曖 殮欽�騆謊睎帡�? 嬴棲塭賊 橡艇 陞望檜釭 營襠ж衛螃. 陪 夥際螃.<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","hanna1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>漢娜：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我從萊拉小姐出生時，就已經是她的僕人。她又聰明又親切，每個人都喜愛她。但是在她１６歲變成在一個騎士之後，她總是用各種不同的理由跟她的父親以賽馬利爭執。在康特．古迪亞被肯恩擊敗之後，爭執變得更加嚴重，因而她離開她的家。\r\n<p>我在這裡看見她所受的苦難，我的心像是碎掉一樣！但是她有更深的想法；我目前在萊拉的身邊，所以我現在不會為我的生活感到遺憾。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","hanna1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hanna:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I have been Lady Lyra's servant from the time she was born...she was smart and kind and everyone loved her. After she became a knight at the age of 16, however, she always clashed with her father Ishmael for various reasons. After Count Gludia was defeated by Ken Rauhel, the conflict became more serious and she eventually left her home.\r\n<p>My heart weeps, seeing her suffering here, but I have always been on Lyra's side - so I don't regret my life now.\r\n</body>\r\n","hanna1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hanna:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I have been Lady Lyra's servant from the time she was born...she was smart and kind and everyone loved her. After she became a knight at the age of 16, however, she always clashed with her father Ishmael for various reasons. After Count Gludia was defeated by Ken Rauhel, the conflict became more serious and she eventually left her home.\r\n<p>My heart weeps, seeing her suffering here, but I have always been on Lyra's side - so I don't regret my life now.\r\n</body>\r\n","hanna1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>и釭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>瞪 塭檜塭 嬴噢眷憮 鷓橫釭樟擊 陽睡攪 斜碟曖 跺衛醞擊 菟歷蝗棲棻. 橫溥憮睡攪 該葬紫 謠戲衛堅 葆擠噢紫 雜ж敷憮 輿嬪碟菟曖 餌嫌擊 蛟閡 嫡戲樟港棲棻. ж雖虜 16撮陽 晦餌 歜婦擊 ж褐 �譟帤� 嬴幗椒檜褐 檜蝶葆縣椒婁 棺 罹楝陛雖縑 渠и 曖唯 離檜煎 渠董ж堆 ж樟轄. 旋瑞蛤嬴 寥濛椒檜 騰 塭辦⑦婁 諄錶 ぬ寡ж褐 �贍恓芫� 斜 渠董檜 薄薄 渦 問п雖敷憮, 唸措 嬴噢朝 餵擊 釭螃衛堅 蜓懊港棲棻.\r\n<p>斜 堅辦褐 碟檜 檜楛 яи 夠縑憮 堅儅擊 ж衛朝 勘 爾賊 陛蝙檜 詭橫雖朝 匙 偽雖虜, 塭檜塭 嬴噢陛 劃陛 ж褒 陽縑朝 桶擎 儅陝檜 氈戲褐剪縑蹂.瞪 樹薯釭 塭檜塭 嬴噢 ら檜歷轄. 斜楚憮 盪紫 雖旎曖 儅�偯� �饑裔狫鶼� 彊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","hans1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>漢斯：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你也是帶來要去<a link=\"hans5\">競技場</a>的狗的嗎？\r\n<p>若你讓我來保管牠，我會好好照顧牠的。每一隻只要<var src=\"#0\">金幣就可以。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> 保管動物</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> 找回動物</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">問怎麼馴養動物</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Hans:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Did you perhaps bring dogs for the <a link=\"hans5\">animal tournament</a>?\r\n<p>If you trust your dogs to me, I'll keep them from harm.  I just take <var src=\"#0\"> adena per dog.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Trust Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Hans:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Did you perhaps bring dogs for the <a link=\"hans5\">animal tournament</a>?\r\n<p>If you trust your dogs to me, I'll keep them from harm.  I just take <var src=\"#0\"> adena per dog.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Trust Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>и蝶:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠啻紫 �公� <a link=\"hans5\">癱唯濰</a>縑 頂爾鳥 偃蒂 等葬堅 諮釭?\r\n<p>斜歲 釭縑啪 蜆啖虜 場戲賊 螞瞪�� 爾��п 輿啊啻. и葆葬渡 <var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭縑 蜆嬴輿雖.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> 翕僭擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> 翕僭擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>漢斯：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>對了，等一下，我把這件事結束後就過去。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">問怎麼馴養動物</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Hans:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, just a moment. I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Hans:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, just a moment. I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>и蝶:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴, 褻旎虜 晦棻葬啪. 檜 橾虜 部頂堅 埠 陛紫煙 ж雖.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>漢斯：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>什麼？你沒有保管過動物？\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">問怎麼馴養動物</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Hans:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huh? You never gave any animals to me - really!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Hans:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huh? You never gave any animals to me - really!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>и蝶:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴棲? 濠啻朝 翕僭擊 蜆曹 瞳檜 橈朝等?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>漢斯：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你根本沒有動物要保管丫！\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">問怎麼馴養動物</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Hans:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't even have animals for me to guard!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Hans:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't even have animals for me to guard!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>и蝶:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蜆望 翕僭紫 橈戲賊憮 劂 蜆曹棻朝 剪雖?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>漢斯：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你還沒去過競技場嗎？在那裡的村莊東邊的森林往北邊上去一點就行了。要不要在那裡讓別人看看你的狗有多厲害？只要在鬥狗上贏了就一獲千金。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">問怎麼馴養動物</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Hans:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You don't know about animal tournaments? You can reach 'em by going north from the eastern fire field. Show your dogs' strength over there, and if all goes well, you may make a fortune.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Hans:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You don't know about animal tournaments? You can reach 'em by going north from the eastern fire field. Show your dogs' strength over there, and if all goes well, you may make a fortune.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hans5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>и蝶:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴棲 濠啻 嬴霜 癱唯濰紫 陛爾雖 彊懊欽 蜓檣陛? 盪晦 葆擊 翕薹 �倣�雖縑憮 磁薹戲煎 褻旎虜 螢塭陛賊 脹棻啻. 剪晦憮 濠啻 擁唯曖 棘葷л擊 割葬 憲葬朝 啪 橫雯陛? 渦碳橫 澀虜ж賊 橾�捌絞搧� 喻萵 熱 氈棻啻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hector1-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>工匠海克特：</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>我可以將你的防具加強讓它更加堅固。只需要付材料和製造費。啊，對了，要特別注意喔，使用魔法或捲軸來加強能力的防具，會消失原來的效力。</p>  \r\n\r\n<br><a link=\"hector3\">製造鋼鐵手套。</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"hector4\">製造鋼鐵頭盔</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"hector5\">製造鋼鐵盾牌</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"hector6\">製造鋼鐵長靴</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"hector7\">製造鋼鐵金屬盔甲</a>  \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","hector2-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>海克特：</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>喂，甚麼，幫你工作？限你十秒鐘內消失在我的面前。</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","hector3-c.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>海克特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>要製造鋼鐵手套，需要手套1雙和鋼鐵塊150塊。加工費是25000枚金幣。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request iron gloves\">製造鋼鐵手套</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","hector4-c.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>海克特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>要製造鋼鐵頭盔，需要騎士面甲1頂和鋼鐵塊120塊。加工費是16500枚金幣。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request iron visor\">製造鋼鐵頭盔</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","hector5-c.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>海克特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>要製造鋼鐵盾牌，需要塔盾1面和鋼鐵塊200塊。加工費是16000枚金幣。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request iron shield\">製造鋼鐵盾牌</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","hector6-c.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>海克特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>要製造鋼鐵長靴，需要長靴1雙與鋼鐵塊160塊。加工費是8000枚金幣。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request iron boots\">製造鋼鐵長靴</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","hector7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>海克特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>若要製造鋼鐵金屬盔甲，需要金屬盔甲1件和鋼鐵塊450個。而且需要付30000枚金幣的加工費。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request iron plate mail\">製造鋼鐵金屬盔甲</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","helen1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>海倫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n在東邊的塔頂上有<font fg=ffffff>惡魔</font>住在那裡。呼...惡魔...真是太可怕了..它不會把全部的怪物都帶到這個村子來吧。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","helen1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Helen :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nOn top of the Tower east of town, there lives a <font fg=ffffff>Demon</font>. Ahh... Demon... Isn't it really scary? You don't think he'll invade our town, do you?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","helen1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Helen :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nOn top of the Tower east of town, there is a <font fg=ffffff>Demon</font> living there. Ahh... Demon... Isn't it really scary? You don't think he'll invade our town, do you?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","helen1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>⑦溶 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n翕薹縑 氈朝 鱉 窕渠晦縑朝 <font fg=ffffff>學葆</font>陛 髦堅 氈渠蹂. 橫��... 學葆塭棲... 薑蜓 鼠衛鼠衛ж雖 彊嬴蹂? 撲葆 辦葬 葆擊煎 惚僭菟擊 檜莊堅 藥菟橫 螃雖朝 彊啊轄?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","helen1.html":"body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>海倫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n在東邊的塔頂上<font fg=ffffff>有惡魔</font>住在那裡。呼...惡魔...真是太可怕了..它不會把全部的怪物都帶到這個村子來吧。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","help-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>天堂 說明</p></font>\r\n<font fg=FF00FF><p align=center>天堂 時間:<var src=\"#999\"></p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n請在選單裡選擇你要的項目:\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpgen\"> 一般</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpitm\"> 關於道具</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpcon\"> 關於對話</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpcom\"> 關於戰鬥</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpnpc\"> 關於NPC操作</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpmgc\"> 關於魔法</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpple\"> 關於血盟</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helppar\"> 關於組隊</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helplng\"> 關於語言</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpetc\"> 其他</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","help-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Lineage Help</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nChoose from the below topics:\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpgen\"> General</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpitm\"> Item related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpcon\"> Conversation related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpcom\"> Combat related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpmgc\"> Magic related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpnpc\"> NPC control related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpple\"> Blood Pledge related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helplng\"> Language related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpetc\"> Miscellaneous</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphnt\"> Hints &amp; Tips</a>\r\n</body>","help-e.tbl":"69\r\n\\f:Help      \\f>F1\\f7 or \\f>?\r\n\\f:Walk      \\f>Arrow keys\\f7 or\r\n          Click on map.\r\n\\f:Turn      \\f7Shift click on\r\n          map.\r\n\\f:Say       \\f7Just type or\r\n          Click on input\r\n          area.\r\n\\f:Whisper   \\f>\"\r\n          Shift click on\r\n          input area.\r\n          Enter name or\r\n          select one using\r\n          up/down arrows\r\n          and enter message.\r\n\\f:Shout     \\f>!\r\n          Ctrl click on\r\n          input area.\r\n\\f:Chat      \\f>&\r\n          Talk at chatting\r\n          channel. To unsub\r\n          scribe type \\f>/chat\r\n          \\f>off\\f7.\r\n\\f:Blood Pledge Chat \\f>@\r\n          Chat only with\r\n          your blood pledge\r\n          members.\r\n\\f:Inventory \\f>Tab\r\n\\f:Get       \\f7Click on item.\r\n\\f:Other     \\f7Right click on\r\n\\f: item     \\f7item.\r\n\\f:Drop      \\f7Drag item from\r\n          inventory to map.\r\n\\f:Give      \\f7Drag item from\r\n          inventory to other\r\n          people.\r\n\\f:Use       \\f7Double click on\r\n          item.\r\n\\f:Attack    \\f7Ctrl click on\r\n          target.\r\n\\f:Quit      \\f>Ctrl+Q\r\n\\f>/who \\f:name\r\n          Get info about an\r\n          user.\r\n\\f>/create   \\f7Create a new blood\r\n          pledge. Only for\r\n          prince or\r\n          princess.\r\n\\f>/join     \\f7Join a blood\r\n          pledge. In front\r\n          of the blood\r\n          pledge leader.\r\n\\f>/leave    \\f7Leave your blood\r\n          pledge.\r\n\\f>/exclude \\f:name\r\n          Exclude a person\r\n          from conversation.\r\n          If \\f:name\\f7 is not\r\n          given, show list\r\n          of users currently\r\n          excluded. To can-\r\n          cel exclusion,\r\n          give same command\r\n          one more.\r\n\\f>/chat on \\f7or \\f>off\r\n          Join or leave the\r\n          chatting channel.\r\n\r\n\\f:Cancel input  \\f>ESC\r\n","help-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Lineage Help</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nChoose from the below topics:\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpgen\"> General</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpitm\"> Item related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpcon\"> Conversation related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpcom\"> Combat related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpmgc\"> Magic related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpnpc\"> NPC control related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpple\"> Blood Pledge related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helplng\"> Language related</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpetc\"> Miscellaneous</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphnt\"> Hints &amp; Tips</a>\r\n</body>","help-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>葬棲雖 Help</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n嬴楚醞 錳ж衛朝 о跡擊 葆辦蝶煎 贗葛ж撮蹂:\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpgen\"> 橾奩</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpitm\"> 嬴檜蠱 婦溼</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpcon\"> 渠�� 婦溼</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpcom\"> 瞪癱 婦溼</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpnpc\"> NPC 褻謙 婦溼</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpmgc\"> 葆徹 婦溼</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpple\"> ⑸裊 婦溼</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helppar\"> だじ 婦溼</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helplng\"> 樹橫 婦溼</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helpetc\"> 晦顫</a>\r\n</body>","help-k.tbl":"62\r\n\\f:紫遺蜓   \\f>F1\\f7 傳朝 \\f>?\\f7\r\n\\f:務晦     \\f>�香嚂功f7酈\r\n         裘 �飛橦□� 贗葛.\r\n\\f:寞щ瞪�� \\f7Shift 贗葛.\r\n\\f:蜓ж晦   \\f7斜傖 顫檜ё 傳朝\r\n         殮溘鼻濠縑憮 贗葛.\r\n\\f:敏樓蜓   \\f>\"\\f7\r\n         殮溘鼻濠縑憮 Shift\r\n         贗葛.\r\n         敏樓蜓й 餌塋 檜葷\r\n         擊 殮溘ж剪釭 嬪嬴\r\n         楚 �香嚂扑� 摹鷗и\r\n         菴 瞪й 蜓 殮溘.\r\n\\f:諼纂晦   \\f>!\\f7\r\n         殮溘鼻濠縑憮 Ctrl\r\n         贗葛.\r\n\\f:瓣た     \\f>&\r\n         瓣た瓣割縑憮 檜撿\r\n         晦. 瓣た瓣割擊\r\n         慇橫釭溥賊 \\f>/瓣た\r\n         \\f>莠\\f7.\r\n\\f:⑸裊 瓣た \\f>@\r\n         偽擎 ⑸裊錳郭葬虜\r\n         檜撿晦.\r\n\\f:模雖ヶ   \\f>TAB\\f7\r\n\\f:鄹晦     \\f7僭勒嬪縑憮 贗葛.\r\n\\f:鄹朝牖憮 \\f7僭勒嬪縑憮 螃艇薹\r\n \\f:夥紱晦  \\f7贗葛.\r\n\\f:幗葬晦   \\f7模雖ヶ 孺紫辦縑憮\r\n         裘孺紫辦煎 莓.\r\n\\f:輿晦     \\f7模雖ヶ 孺紫辦縑憮\r\n         棻艇 餌塋縑啪煎 莓.\r\n\\f:餌辨     \\f7模雖ヶ 孺紫辦縑憮\r\n         舒廓 贗葛.\r\n\\f:奢問     \\f7惚僭嬪縑憮 Ctrl\r\n         贗葛.\r\n\\f:部頂晦   \\f>Ctrl+Q\\f7\r\n\\f>/援掘 \\f:檜葷\r\n         餌辨濠縑 婦и 薑爾\r\n         橢晦.\r\n\\f>/⑸裊    \\f7⑸裊 璽撲. 諾濠\r\n         諦 奢輿虜 陛棟.\r\n\\f>/陛殮    \\f7⑸裊縑 陛殮.\r\n         陛殮й ⑸裊曖 諾濠\r\n         �分� 奢輿蒂 葆輿爾\r\n         堅 褒ч.\r\n\\f>/驍黴    \\f7⑸裊縑憮 驍黴.\r\n\\f>/離欽 \\f:檜葷\r\n         餌辨濠蒂 渠�倍□�\r\n         離欽衛霽. \\f:檜葷\\f7擊\r\n         寰噙賊 ⑷營 離欽脹\r\n         餌塋 跡煙擊 爾罹邀.\r\n         離欽擊 ヴ溥賊 偽擎\r\n         貲滄擊 棻衛 殮溘.\r\n\\f>/瓣た 齟 \\f7傳朝 \\f>莠\r\n         瓣た瓣割縑憮 螃朝\r\n         詭衛雖蒂 麵剪釭\r\n         莠.\r\n\\f>/3set    \\f73弊衝 濠っ 摹鷗\r\n\\f>/2set    \\f72弊衝 濠っ 摹鷗\r\n\r\n\\f:殮溘醞 鏃模 \\f>ESC\\f7\r\n","helpcom-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>命令補助說明：戰鬥</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>戰鬥：</font>\r\n<p>在目標上<font fg=ffffff>按左鍵</font>就可以攻擊。只有確定的目標才能以這種方式攻擊。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>強制攻擊：</font>\r\n<p>在目標上按著\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Ｃｔｒｌ鍵</font>的時候，<font fg=ffffff>按左鍵</font> \r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>血盟戰爭：</font>\r\n<p>血盟的領導者可以對另一位血盟的成員宣戰。 \r\n<p>從聊天視窗，輸入\r\n<font fg=ffffff>『／war  血盟名稱』</font>。但是那個血盟的領導者仍可以決定，是否讓他的人去和對方的血盟作戰。 \r\n<p>在二個血盟的成員在戰爭時，一個血盟的成員能在沒有按Ｃｔｒｌ鍵下打另一個的成員；反之亦然。而且安全區域不影響戰爭參加者。這樣的ＰＫ不影響參加者的結盟。守衛者也不用妨礙戰爭。<br>\r\n<p>有三種條件來結束戰爭。\r\n<p> －停戰的協議：在戰爭中任何一個血盟的領導者都可提議停戰，如果這個提議被其他人接受，協議就成立。\r\n<p> 從聊天的視窗，打入\r\n<font fg=ffffff>『／cease  血盟名稱』</font> 提議停戰。 \r\n<p> －投降：如果一個血盟的成員完全地被另一個擊敗，那個血盟領導者就要對他的敵人投降。 \r\n<p> 從聊天的視窗，打入\r\n<font fg=ffffff>『／surrender 血盟名稱』</font> 去投降。 \r\n<p> －殺死敵對的血盟領導者，或使他們失去自己的血盟的領導者。 \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>圍城：</font>\r\n<p>沒有擁城堡的血盟誰可以對有城堡的血盟宣戰。這就是圍成。要宣布圍城，你可以使用相同的命令『／war 擁有城堡的血盟之名』若想知道擁有該城的血盟的名字，你可以試著跟一些商人或城門口的守衛談話。但是圍城需要符合一些條件：\r\n<p> －只有等級25以上的王子／公主才能宣布。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>圍城通常遵從下列的步驟：\r\n<p> －首先想要城堡的血盟必須對擁有該城的血盟宣戰，攻方若超過10個成員在城堡內圍，則不能宣戰。除此以外，擁有城堡的血盟會自動地接受邀戰。\r\n<p> －如想去侵入城堡，攻擊部隊必須破壞城堡的外門，並對抗那些保護城堡的其他的玩家和怪物與傭兵們。發動攻擊的血盟成員能使用他們的武器去破壞門。但是，因為大門有使用材料使硬度增強，所以用銳利的武器，像刀劍或矛，去砍根本就不會損害到大門。不過，銳利的武器能夠在堅硬的表面上施以連續的衝擊與損害。\r\n<p> －當攻擊部隊的成員進入外城牆後，他們就要朝向城堡的統治者所居住的內部城堡前進。在內部的城堡也有一個門，但是不像外部的門那麼堅固。\r\n<p> －進入城堡之後，攻擊部隊的成員只要殺掉統治者就達到勝利、又發動戰爭的血盟王子（或公主）到達王座，戰爭即結束。\r\n<p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>有一件事要記得，太陽下山的時，圍城會自動結束。所以不管你什麼時候開始圍城，你必須堅持到日落，或者攻擊者輸掉戰爭之時。\r\n<p>其他的事物遵從在血盟戰爭的一般規則。但是如果血盟嘗試接管城堡失敗，他們將會被冠上污名當做笑話，也會被守衛狩獵一陣子。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpcom-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Combat</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Attack:</font>\r\n<p> <font fg=ffffff>Left click</font> on target to attack. Only certain objects and creatures may be\r\n attacked this way.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Reckless Attack:</font>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Left click</font> on target while pressing the\r\n <font fg=ffffff>Ctrl key</font> to attack even peaceful creatures or players.\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Wars between pledges:</font>\r\n<p>A Bloodpledge leader can declare war with another pledge.\r\n<p>From the chat window, type\r\n<font fg=ffffff>'/war [bloodpledge name]'</font>. The leader of that blood pledge will decide whether or not to go to war.``\r\n<p>When two pledges are at war, members of one pledge can hit members of the other pledge without pressing the ctrl key, and vice versa. Also, safe areas do not affect war participants. PKing in this way doesn't affect the participants' alignments, and guards do not interfere with the battle.<br>\r\n<p>There are three conditions to end a war.\r\n<p> - Peace Treaty: a truce can be suggested by either leader of warring blood pledges. If the suggestion is accepted, peace is declared.\r\n<p> From the chatting window, type\r\n<font fg=ffffff>'/cease [blood pledge name]'</font> to suggest a truce.\r\n<p> - Surrender : if one pledge is getting trounced by the other, or to end a bloodwar without confirmation from the other leader, the leader of a pledge can surrender to his enemy.\r\n<p> From the chat window, type\r\n<font fg=ffffff>'/surrender [blood pledge name]'</font> to surrender.\r\n<p> - Kill the leader of opponent pledge, or (less preferably) lose your own pledge leader.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Siege:</font>\r\n<p>A pledge who doesn't own the castle can declare the war against a pledge who does. It's called \"laying siege\" to the castle. To declare a siege, you can use the same command - '/war [blood pledge name who owns the castle]'. To learn the name of blood pledge who owns the castle, talk to some merchants or guards at the castle gate. There are some conditions to meet for a siege:\r\n<p> - Only a prince/princess whose level is 25 or higher can declare a siege.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>A siege usually follows the following steps:\r\n<p> - First, the blood pledge who wants the castle has to declare the war against the pledge who owns it. At this point, if the blood pledge who owns the castle has been occupying the castle less than 6 days(24 hours in real time), the pledge can refuse the war request. Having more than 10 members inside the outer castle will also cause the war offer to be rejected. In all other cases, the blood pledge who owns the castle will accept the war automatically.\r\n<p> - To infiltrate the castle, the attacking party has to destroy the outer gate of the castle while fighting other players and NPCs defending the castle. The members of the attacking party can use their weapons to destroy the gate, but since the gate is reinforced with hard materials, edged weapons won't inflict significant damage. Furthermore, edged weapons can be damaged due to the successive impacts on the hard surface.\r\n<p> - Once the members of attacking party get inside the outer wall, they must head for the inner castle where the lord of the castle lives. There is also a gate at the inner castle, but not as strong as the outer gate.\r\n<p> - Once inside the inner castle, the members of the attacking party just have to kill the lord to achieve the victory. If the prince of the blood pledge who initiated the war reaches the spot before the throne, the war will also end.\r\n<p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>One thing to remember is that the siege automatically ends when the sun goes down - so regardless of the time when you started the siege, you have to finish it before sundown, or the attacker will lose the war.\r\n<p>Other things follow the general rules of the usual war between blood pledges.  If the pledge fails the attempt to take over the castle, they will be branded as rebels and hunted by guards for a while to come.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpcom-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Combat</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Attack:</font>\r\n<p> <font fg=ffffff>Left click</font> on target to attack. Only certain objects and creatures may be\r\n attacked this way.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Reckless Attack:</font>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Left click</font> on target while pressing the\r\n <font fg=ffffff>Ctrl key</font> to attack even peaceful creatures or players.\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Wars between pledges:</font>\r\n<p>A Bloodpledge leader can declare war with another pledge.\r\n<p>From the chat window, type\r\n<font fg=ffffff>'/war [bloodpledge name]'</font>. The leader of that blood pledge will decide whether or not to go to war.``\r\n<p>When two pledges are at war, members of one pledge can hit members of the other pledge without pressing the ctrl key, and vice versa. Also, safe areas do not affect war participants. PKing in this way doesn't affect the participants' alignments, and guards do not interfere with the battle.<br>\r\n<p>There are three conditions to end a war.\r\n<p> - Peace Treaty: a truce can be suggested by either leader of warring blood pledges. If the suggestion is accepted, peace is declared.\r\n<p> From the chatting window, type\r\n<font fg=ffffff>'/cease [blood pledge name]'</font> to suggest a truce.\r\n<p> - Surrender : if one pledge is getting trounced by the other, or to end a bloodwar without confirmation from the other leader, the leader of a pledge can surrender to his enemy.\r\n<p> From the chat window, type\r\n<font fg=ffffff>'/surrender [blood pledge name]'</font> to surrender.\r\n<p> - Kill the leader of opponent pledge, or (less preferably) lose your own pledge leader.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Siege:</font>\r\n<p>A pledge who doesn't own the castle can declare the war against a pledge who does. It's called \"laying siege\" to the castle. To declare a siege, you can use the same command - '/war [blood pledge name who owns the castle]'. To learn the name of blood pledge who owns the castle, talk to some merchants or guards at the castle gate. There are some conditions to meet for a siege:\r\n<p> - Only a prince/princess whose level is 25 or higher can declare a siege.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>A siege usually follows the following steps:\r\n<p> - First, the blood pledge who wants the castle has to declare the war against the pledge who owns it. At this point, if the blood pledge who owns the castle has been occupying the castle less than 6 days(24 hours in real time), the pledge can refuse the war request. Having more than 10 members inside the outer castle will also cause the war offer to be rejected. In all other cases, the blood pledge who owns the castle will accept the war automatically.\r\n<p> - To infiltrate the castle, the attacking party has to destroy the outer gate of the castle while fighting other players and NPCs defending the castle. The members of the attacking party can use their weapons to destroy the gate, but since the gate is reinforced with hard materials, edged weapons won't inflict significant damage. Furthermore, edged weapons can be damaged due to the successive impacts on the hard surface.\r\n<p> - Once the members of attacking party get inside the outer wall, they must head for the inner castle where the lord of the castle lives. There is also a gate at the inner castle, but not as strong as the outer gate.\r\n<p> - Once inside the inner castle, the members of the attacking party just have to kill the lord to achieve the victory. If the prince of the blood pledge who initiated the war reaches the spot before the throne, the war will also end.\r\n<p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>One thing to remember is that the siege automatically ends when the sun goes down - so regardless of the time when you started the siege, you have to finish it before sundown, or the attacker will lose the war.\r\n<p>Other things follow the general rules of the usual war between blood pledges.  If the pledge fails the attempt to take over the castle, they will be branded as rebels and hunted by guards for a while to come.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpcom-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 Help: 瞪癱</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>奢問:</font>\r\n<p>奢問ж堅濠 ж朝 渠鼻擊 <font fg=ffffff>豭薹 贗葛</font>м棲棻. 檜 寞徹戲煎 奢問й 熱 氈朝 渠鼻擎 薑п螳 氈蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>鼠離滌 奢問:</font>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Ctrl酈</font>蒂 援艇 鼻鷓縑憮 奢問ж堅濠 ж朝 渠鼻擊 <font fg=ffffff>豭薹 贗葛</font>м棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>⑸裊除曖 瞪爵:</font>\r\n<p>⑸裊曖 捱輿朝 棻艇 ⑸裊縑啪 瞪爵擊 摹んй 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/瞪爵 [瞪爵擊 й ⑸裊 檜葷]'</font>擊 殮溘м棲棻. 檜 摹瞪 ん堅縑 擬瞪й雖 寰й雖朝 鼻渠ら ⑸裊輿陛 唸薑м棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪爵檜 衛濛腎賊 舒 ⑸裊縑 模樓腎橫 氈朝 ⑸裊錳菟擎 憮煎除縑 Ctrl酈蒂 援腦雖 彊嬴紫 奢問擊 й 熱 氈啪 腌棲棻. 傳, 瞪爵醞縑朝 ゎ�� 雖羲檜 鼠衛腎貊, 鼻渠寞擊 避罹紫 撩щ縑 艙щ擊 嫡雖 彊堅, 唳綠煽曖 薯營紫 嫡雖 彊蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<p>瞪爵擊 部頂朝 等縑朝 棻擠婁 偽擎 寞徹檜 氈蝗棲棻:\r\n<p> - 謙瞪: 瞪爵擊 ж堅 氈朝 舒 ⑸裊醞 и ⑸裊檜 謙瞪擊 薯寰ж堅 鼻渠寞 ⑸裊檜 斜匙擊 嫡嬴萄葡戲煎賦 舒 ⑸裊除曖 瞪爵擊 部鳥 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 謙瞪 薯曖朝 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/謙瞪 [瞪爵醞檣 ⑸裊]'</font>擊 殮溘ж賊 腌棲棻. 檜 薯寰擊 嫡嬴菟橾雖曖 罹睡朝 鼻渠寞 ⑸裊檜 唸薑м棲棻.\r\n<p> - о犒: 鼻渠 ⑸裊縑啪 鼠褻勒 о犒м棲棻. 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/о犒 [瞪爵醞檣 ⑸裊]'</font>擊 殮溘м棲棻. 檜 唳辦縑紫 鼻渠寞檜 о犒擊 檣薑п撿虜 м棲棻.\r\n<p> - 鼻渠 ⑸裊曖 ⑸裊輿蒂 避檜剪釭, �分� 濠褐曖 ⑸裊曖 ⑸裊輿陛 鼻渠寞縑 曖п 避歜擊 渡м棲棻.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>奢撩瞪:</font>\r\n<p>撩擊 離雖ж堅 氈雖 彊擎 ⑸裊擎 撩擊 離雖ж堅 氈朝 ⑸裊縑 渠п 奢撩瞪擊 摹んй 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 奢撩瞪擊 摹んж朝 寞徹擎 橾奩瞳檣 ⑸裊 瞪爵婁 葆雙陛雖煎 <font fg=ffffff>'/瞪爵 [撩擊 模嶸ж堅 氈朝 ⑸裊 檜葷]'</font>擊 殮溘ж賊 腌棲棻. ⑷營 撩擊 離雖ж堅 氈朝 ⑸裊曖 檜葷擎 橾睡 鼻檣檜釭 撩 擅 唳綠煽菟縑啪 蜓擊 勘賊 憲 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 欽, 奢撩瞪擊 摹んж晦 嬪п憮朝 棻擠曖 褻勒擊 虜褶ж罹撿 м棲棻:\r\n<p> - 25溯漣 檜鼻曖 ⑸裊輿虜檜 奢撩瞪擊 摹んй 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p> - 撩擊 離雖ж堅 氈朝 ⑸裊輿陛 薑и 奢撩瞪 偃衛 衛除 檜�醴☆� 瞪爵擊 摹んй 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 檜 衛除 羲衛 撩 擅 唳綠煽菟縑啪 蜓擊 勘賊 憲 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>奢撩瞪擎 橾奩瞳戲煎 棻擠婁 偽擎 牖憮蒂 剪蘑棲棻:\r\n<p> - 試盪 撩擊 離雖ж堅 氈朝 ⑸裊縑啪 摹瞪 ん堅蒂 м棲棻. 檜 陽 撩擊 離雖ж堅 氈朝 ⑸裊檜 撩擊 離雖и雖 24衛除(啪歜 衛除戲煎 6橾)檜 瓣 雖釭雖 彊懊棻賊 斜 ⑸裊擎 奢問難 ⑸裊曖 摹瞪 ん堅蒂 剪睡й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 傳 奢問難 ⑸裊檜 撩曖 諼撩 寰縑 10檣 檜鼻擊 檜嘐 霞殮衛麵 場堅 氈擊 唳辦, 撩擊 離雖ж堅 氈朝 ⑸裊擎 斜 ⑸裊曖 摹瞪 ん堅蒂 剪睡й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. ж雖虜 檜 唳辦蒂 薯諼ж堅朝 撩擊 離雖ж堅 氈朝 ⑸裊擎 摹瞪 ん堅蒂 樹薯釭 濠翕瞳戲煎 嫡嬴菟檜啪 腌棲棻.\r\n<p> - 諼撩 寰戲煎 霞殮ж晦 嬪п 撩擊 雖酈朝 PC諦 NPC菟婁 諄辦貊 諼撩僥擊 だ惚п撿 м棲棻. PC陛 陛雖堅 氈朝 鼠晦煎 撩僥擊 奢問ж賊 撩僥擊 睡獎 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 欽, 撩僥擎 欽欽и 跡營蒂 繹煎 爾鬼и ががи 模營煎 虜菟橫螳 氈戲嘎煎 蠔檜釭 璽 蛔 陳檜 氈朝 鼠晦煎 撩僥擊 奢問ж賊 嬪溘紫 奩馬腆 閨渦楝 鼠晦陛 鼻й 嬪я檜 氈蝗棲棻. 鼻и 鼠晦朝 渠濰除縑憮 堅艦 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p> - 諼撩 寰戲煎 霞殮ж賊 棻擠 跡ル朝 艙輿陛 髦堅 氈朝 頂撩殮棲棻. 頂撩縑紫 諼撩婁 偽檜 僥檜 氈雖虜 諼撩僥籀歲 ががж雖朝 彊蝗棲棻. 檜 僥擊 睡熱堅 頂撩 寰戲煎 菟橫骨棲棻.\r\n<p> - 頂撩縑 霞殮ж賊 頂撩 寰縑 氈朝 艙輿蒂 避檜剪釭 奢問難 ⑸裊輿陛 頂撩曖 醞懈縑 氈朝 諾謝 斬籀縑 撥棲棻. 斜楝賊 奢撩瞪擎 奢問難曖 蝓葬煎 部釭啪 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>輿曖п撿 й 匙擎, 奢撩瞪擎 ж瑞п陛 雖朝 牖除縑 唸っ檜 陪棻朝 餌褒殮棲棻. и廓曖 奢撩瞪縑憮 橾衛瞳戲煎 撩擊 離雖ц棻 ж渦塭紫 斜陳 п陛 韓 陽梱雖 檜蒂 餌熱ж雖 跤ж賊 ②橾檜 腌棲棻. 斜陳曖 奢撩瞪曖 蝓濠朝 斜陳 п陛 雖朝 牖除 撩擊 離雖ж堅 氈湍 ⑸裊曖 匙檜 脹棻朝 餌褒擊 貲褕ж褊衛螃.\r\n<p>檜 諼曖 瞪爵縑 渠и 餌о擎 橾奩瞳檣 ⑸裊 瞪爵縑 遽м棲棻. 欽, 奢撩瞪擊 衛紫ц棻陛 ぬи ⑸裊擎 奩羲濠曖 釩檣檜 鎰⑵ 橾薑 晦除翕寰 唳綠煽菟曖 奢問擊 嫡啪 脹棻朝 餌褒擊 貲褕ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>","helpcon-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>指令 說明：對話</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n所有的對話命令必須在交談視窗中進行。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>說話:</font>\r\n<p>輸入你想說的話。只在同一畫面上的使用者才能看到。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>密語:</font>\r\n<p>只有願意聊天的對方才能看到。使用辦法為<font fg=ffffff>\"[使用者ID] [想說的話]</font>.\r\n<p>密語在對話窗顯示為<font fg=ff0000 bg=ffffff>黃色</font>。若不想聽別人說密語，只要打入<font fg=ffffff>『/whisper off』</font>就可以。若想再開啟，請輸入<font fg=ffffff>『/whisper on』</font>。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>大喊:</font>\r\n<p>讓附近地區的玩家聽到自己說的話。使用辦法為<font fg=ffffff>![想說的話]</font>.\r\n<p>喊在對話窗顯示為<font fg=0000ff bg=ffffff>紅色</font>。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>聊天:</font>\r\n<p>只能在對話窗看到的。可傳達所有使用者。若不想看到把它關閉執行。使用辦法為<font fg=ffffff>& [想說的話]</font>.\r\n<p>在對話窗顯示為<font fg=2a2aa5 bg=ffffff>黑色</font>。若想關閉，請輸入<font fg=ffffff>/chat off</font>執行。若想再開，請輸入<font fg=ffffff>/chat on</font>執行。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>血盟對話:</font>\r\n<p>血盟成員之間的對話。使用辦法為<font fg=ffffff>@[想說的話]</font>。\r\n<p>血盟對話在對話窗顯示為<font fg=00bf00 bg=ffffff>綠色</font>。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>隊伍對話:</font>\r\n<p>隊伍之間的對話。使用辦法為<font fg=ffffff># [想說的話]</font>。\r\n<p>隊伍對話在對話窗顯示為<font fg=00bf00 bg=ffffff>綠色</font>。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>對話功能 On/Off:</font>\r\n<p>在對話窗不想看到其它玩家和你的對話，請輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/whisper off'</font> 。想回復其它玩家對你的對話請輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/whisper on'</font>。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>斷絕指定使用者:</font>\r\n<p>在對話窗不想看到指定人的對話時，請輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/exclude [玩家ID]'</font>。你斷絕對方時，對方也會知道你斷絕。若沒有輸入〔玩家ID〕會顯示目前斷絕的玩家的名單。若想跟被斷絕的玩家聊天，請再次輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/exclude [玩家 ID]'</font>執行。<br>此功能想斷絕對方時，在玩家ID上按兩下右鍵執行即可。<br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpcon-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Conversation</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nAll conversation commands are entered through the chat window.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Say:</font>\r\n<p>Type your message on the keyboard, and all players on sight will hear you when you hit return.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Whisper:</font>\r\n<p>To talk only to specified character, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>\"[User ID] [message]</font>.\r\n Whispers from others are shown in a <font fg=ff0000 bg=ffffff>blue</font>.\r\n To prevent others from whispering you, type <font fg=ffffff>/whisper off</font>, and to re-enable whispering, type <font fg=ffffff>/whisper on</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Shout:</font>\r\n<p>Talk to all characters in large area. To use, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>![message]</font>. Shouts are shown in a\r\n <font fg=0000ff bg=ffffff>red</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Chat:</font>\r\n<p>Messages are shown only in the chat window.\r\n Everyone on the server will hear your message, unless their chat function is off.  \r\n To use, type\r\n  <font fg=ffffff>&amp;[message]</font>. It is shown in <font fg=2a2aa5 bg=ffffff>brown</font>.\r\n  To turn off your ability to hear chat, type <font fg=ffffff>/chat off</font>. To turn on, type\r\n  <font fg=ffffff>/chat on</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Bloodpledge Chat:</font>\r\n<p>Chat only with Bloodpledge members. To use, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>@[message]</font>. It is shown in <font fg=00bf00 bg=ffffff>green</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Chatting function On/Off:</font>\r\n<p>When you don't want to display chats, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>'/chat off'</font>  from the chat window. Type\r\n  <font fg=ffffff>'/chat on'</font> to display chats again.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Exclude certain user:</font>\r\n<p>When you want to exclude certain users from your chat window, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>'/exclude [User ID]'</font>. That user is\r\n informed that he has been excluded. If [User ID] is not entered, you'll see the list of users\r\n currently excluded. If you want to receive messages from an excluded character,\r\n type <font fg=ffffff>'/exclude [User ID]'</font> again.<br> Alternatively, right double-click the name of the person you want to exclude.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpcon-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Conversation</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nAll conversation commands are entered through the chat window.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Say:</font>\r\n<p>Type your message on the keyboard, and all players on sight will hear you when you hit return.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Whisper:</font>\r\n<p>To talk only to specified character, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>\"[User ID] [message]</font>.\r\n Whispers from others are shown in a <font fg=ff0000 bg=ffffff>blue</font>.\r\n To prevent others from whispering you, type <font fg=ffffff>/whisper off</font>, and to re-enable whispering, type <font fg=ffffff>/whisper on</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Shout:</font>\r\n<p>Talk to all characters in large area. To use, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>![message]</font>. Shouts are shown in a\r\n <font fg=0000ff bg=ffffff>red</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Chat:</font>\r\n<p>Messages are shown only in the chat window.\r\n Everyone on the server will hear your message, unless their chat function is off.  \r\n To use, type\r\n  <font fg=ffffff>&amp;[message]</font>. It is shown in <font fg=2a2aa5 bg=ffffff>brown</font>.\r\n  To turn off your ability to hear chat, type <font fg=ffffff>/chat off</font>. To turn on, type\r\n  <font fg=ffffff>/chat on</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Bloodpledge Chat:</font>\r\n<p>Chat only with Bloodpledge members. To use, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>@[message]</font>. It is shown in <font fg=00bf00 bg=ffffff>green</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Chatting function On/Off:</font>\r\n<p>When you don't want to display chats, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>'/chat off'</font>  from the chat window. Type\r\n  <font fg=ffffff>'/chat on'</font> to display chats again.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Exclude certain user:</font>\r\n<p>When you want to exclude certain users from your chat window, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>'/exclude [User ID]'</font>. That user is\r\n informed that he has been excluded. If [User ID] is not entered, you'll see the list of users\r\n currently excluded. If you want to receive messages from an excluded character,\r\n type <font fg=ffffff>'/exclude [User ID]'</font> again.<br> Alternatively, right double-click the name of the person you want to exclude.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpcon-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 Help: 渠��</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n晦獄瞳戲煎 賅萇 渠�韭� 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 檜瑞橫餵棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>蜓ж晦:</font>\r\n<p>酈爾萄煎 蜓ж堅濠 ж朝 蜓擊 殮溘м棲棻. �飛橦� 爾檜朝 餌辨濠縑啪虜 蜓檜 瞪殖腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>敏樓蜓:</font>\r\n<p>錳ж朝 餌塋縑啪虜 菟葬啪 蜓й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 餌辨 寞徹擎 <font fg=ffffff>\"[餌辨濠 ID] [蜓ж堅濠 ж朝 蜓]</font>.\r\n<p>敝樓蜓擎 瓣た 璽縑 <font fg=ff0000 bg=ffffff>爾塭儀</font>戲煎 釭褫棲棻. 棻艇 餌塋曖 敏蜓擊 菔雖 彊戲溥賊 <font fg=ffffff>/敏蜓 莠</font>檜塭堅 ж賊 腌棲棻. 棻衛 麵溥賊 <font fg=ffffff>/敏蜓 齟</font>擊 殮溘м棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>諼纂晦:</font>\r\n<p>創擎 奩唳曖 餌塋檜 菟葬紫煙 諼艦 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 餌辨 寞徹擎 <font fg=ffffff>![蜓ж堅濠 ж朝 蜓]</font>.\r\n<p>諼纂晦朝 瓣た 璽縑 <font fg=0000ff bg=ffffff>螃溶雖儀</font>戲煎 釭褫棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>瓣た:</font>\r\n<p>�飛� 鼻欽曖 瓣た璽縑憮虜 爾檜紫煙 瓣た擊 й 熱 氈棻. 瓣た擎 賅萇 餌辨濠縑啪 瞪殖腌棲棻. 瓣た擎 瓣た 晦棟擊 莖賊 爾檜雖 彊蝗棲棻. 餌辨 寞徹擎 <font fg=ffffff>&amp;[蜓ж堅濠 ж朝 蜓]</font>.\r\n<p>瓣た擎 瓣た 璽縑 <font fg=2a2aa5 bg=ffffff>匐擎儀</font>戲煎 ル衛腌棲棻. 瓣た擊 莖溥賊 <font fg=ffffff>/瓣た 莠</font>檜塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. 棻衛 麵溥賊 <font fg=ffffff>/瓣た 齟</font>檜塭堅 殮溘м棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>⑸裊 瓣た:</font>\r\n<p>偽擎 ⑸裊 郭葬虜 瓣た擊 й 熱紫 氈蝗棲棻. 餌辨 寞徹擎 <font fg=ffffff>@[蜓ж堅濠 ж朝 蜓]</font>.\r\n<p>⑸裊 瓣た擎 瓣た 璽縑 <font fg=00bf00 bg=ffffff>翱喬儀</font>戲煎 ル衛腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>だじ 瓣た:</font>\r\n<p>偽擎 だじ 郭葬虜 瓣た擊 й 熱紫 氈蝗棲棻. 餌辨 寞徹擎 <font fg=ffffff>#[蜓ж堅濠 ж朝 蜓]</font>.\r\n<p>だじ 瓣た擎 瓣た 璽縑 <font fg=00bf00 bg=ffffff>翱爾塭儀</font>戲煎 ル衛腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>瓣た 晦棟 On/Off:</font>\r\n<p>瓣た璽縑憮 瓣た擊 爾堅 談雖 彊擊 陽縑朝 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/瓣た 莠'</font> 塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. 棻衛 瓣た擊 爾堅 談擊 陽縑朝 <font fg=ffffff>'/瓣た 齟'</font> 檜塭堅 殮溘м棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>か薑 餌辨濠 離欽:</font>\r\n<p>瓣た璽縑憮 か薑檣戲煎睡攪曖 詭衛雖虜擊 薯諼ж堅 談擊 陽縑朝 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/離欽 [嶸盪 ID]'</font> 擊 殮溘м棲棻. か薑 議葛攪蒂 離欽ж賊 斜 餌褒檜 斜 議葛攪縑啪紫 憲溥餵棲棻. [嶸盪 ID]蒂 殮溘ж雖 彊戲賊 ⑷營 離欽ж堅 氈朝 議葛攪曖 跡煙擊 爾罹鄹棲棻. ⑷營 離欽ж堅 氈朝 餌辨濠煎睡攪曖 詭衛雖蒂 棻衛 嫡堅 談戲賊 棻衛 и廓 <font fg=ffffff>'/離欽 [嶸盪 ID]'</font>蒂 殮溘ж賊 腌棲棻.<br>檜 晦棟擎 瓣た 孺紫辦縑 氈朝 離欽ж晦蒂 錳ж朝 嶸盪曖 檜葷擊 螃艇薹 幗が戲煎 渦綰 贗葛п紫 翕濛м棲棻.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>瞪羹 瓣た 瓣割 摹鷗:</font>\r\n<p>瞪羹 瓣た曖 瓣割擊 摹鷗й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 瓣割擊 滲唳ж賊 斜 瓣割擊 摹鷗и 餌塋菟郭葬虜 瞪羹 瓣た擊 й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 瓣割 摹鷗 貲滄橫朝 <font fg=ffffaf>/瓣割 [瓣割 廓�β</font>殮棲棻. ⑷營 雖錳ж朝 瓣割 廓�ㄣ� 1,2 舒 陛雖殮棲棻. 斜傖 <font fg=ffffaf>/瓣割</font>檜塭堅虜 殮溘ж賊 ⑷營 撲薑脹 瓣割 廓�ㄧ� 獐 熱 氈蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>『動物競技場』是讓你用自己的動物，與其它的動物相對抗的一種比賽。\r\n<p>第一個來的人可以登錄他的動物，並且等其他挑戰者到達…。二個參加者打賭，勝利者可把金錢全部帶走。一旦試過一次，你一定可以很快了解的。\r\n<p>在比賽前，你要對你的動物使用道具或者施法術都沒關係。但是你最好不要用太貴的物品，因為那樣物品的價格搞不好會比你得勝的獎金還要貴。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>以前，一位從歐瑞來的人說這很令人厭惡的。他的意思是我們怎麼忍心讓寵物彼此打鬥。\r\n<p>這算是什麼批評！他甚至不了解我們的情形，我們是這樣地隱瞞我們 <a link=\"helpdog2\">高貴的女主人</a>，藉這樣的方法來賺一些小錢…\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>'Animal Colosseum' is the fighting match in which your animal will fight the other's animal.\r\n<p>The first comer registers his animal and waits until the challenger arrives... Two attendees bet the same money, and the winner takes all.\r\n<p>Giving items or casting spells before the game is all right, but you'd better not to use too expensive items if the price will exceed the winning prize.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...one man from Oren said that the fights were disgusting, asking how could we make our pets fight against each other.\r\n<p>Bah, he doesn't understand we just do this for amusement and some petty cash while avoiding our <a link=\"helpdog2\">noble mistress</a>...\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>'Animal Colosseum' is the fighting match in which your animal will fight the other's animal.\r\n<p>The first comer registers his animal and waits until the challenger arrives... Two attendees bet the same money, and the winner takes all.\r\n<p>Giving items or casting spells before the game is all right, but you'd better not to use too expensive items if the price will exceed the winning prize.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...one man from Oren said that the fights were disgusting, asking how could we make our pets fight against each other.\r\n<p>Bah, he doesn't understand we just do this for amusement and some petty cash while avoiding our <a link=\"helpdog2\">noble mistress</a>...\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>'翕僭 屬煜撮遺'擎 濠晦陛 酈遴 翕僭擊 陴檜 酈遴 翕僭婁 1:1煎 諄辦啪 ж朝 唳晦蹂. \r\n<p>籀擠 螞 餌塋檜 摹熱 蛔煙擊 ж堅 晦棻葬堅 氈戲賊, 釭醞縑 螞 餌塋檜 試盪 螞 餌塋縑啪 紫瞪ж朝 衝檜雖...絲擎 萃檜憮 僅偽檜 勘堅, 檜晦朝 餌塋檜 賅舒 陛螳陛啪 腎朝剪撿. 凳, и廓 п爾賊 旎寞 憲疏嶸.\r\n<p>衛м 瞪縑 翕僭縑啪 嬴檜蠱擊 輿剪釭 葆徹擊 勘橫輿朝勒 輿檣曖 濠嶸蹂. ж雖虜 傘鼠 綠諸 嬴檜蠱擊 號檜 詳罹憮 鼻旎爾棻 綠諄雖朝 橾檜 橈紫煙 輿曖ж澗.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...瞪縑 螃溶縑憮 諮湍 餌塋擎 檜勘 爾堅 ⑹螃蝶毀棻堅 м蛤棻. 橫飩啪 擁諫翕僭擊 陛雖堅 諄遺擊 稱橾 熱 氈替傍朝 剪雖.\r\n<p>寡睡艇 模葬ж堅氈捱. ヲ絲 弊橫爾啊棻堅 堅敝ж褐 罹襟濰椒 換 Яп憮 檜騁ж堅 氈朝 <a link=\"helpdog2\">辦葬菟 餌薑</a>紫 賅腦賊憮 蜓檜撿...\r\n</body>","helpdog2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>我們高貴的女主人<a link=\"helpdog3\">萊拉</a>有崇高的理想，那有愛的自給自足的小耕作社區，聽起來多美好啊！\r\n<p>但是我憎恨它。好的生活、好的食物、好的衣服！那全都是謊言，我們不可能那樣生活。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在它是不可能的…，因為我們沒有力量，但是有一天…，我一定要拿我在這裡賺到的錢來做 <a link=\"helpdog4\">某件事</a>！ \r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","helpdog2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Our mistress <a link=\"helpdog3\">Lyra</a> has high ideas of a small self-supporting farming community, run on nothing but faith. Bah!\r\n<p>I hate it. I want a better life...good food, good clothes! It's all a lie that we can be satisfied with that shabby lifestyle.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's impossible now, because we have nothing, but someday...by earning money with this I'll <a link=\"helpdog4\">do something</a>!\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Our mistress <a link=\"helpdog3\">Lyra</a> has high ideas of a small self-supporting farming community, run on nothing but faith. Bah!\r\n<p>I hate it. I want a better life...good food, good clothes! It's all a lie that we can be satisfied with that shabby lifestyle.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's impossible now, because we have nothing, but someday...by earning money with this I'll <a link=\"helpdog4\">do something</a>!\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>斜剪撿 <a link=\"helpdog3\">塭檜塭 椒</a>擎 �К〥牮簸竀趕�. 餌鼻紫 堅鼻ж衛雖. 濠晝 濠褶ж堅 餌嫌檜 剩纂朝 濛擎 堯襟 奢翕羹! 橡葆釭 詣霞陛. \r\n<p>...斜楚紫 陪 褓橫. 陪 雖旎爾棻 �徆� 澀釭陛堅 談棻堅...謠擎 嫣 詳堅, �ㄟ倆牉曌�! 盪楛 傘盪碟и 儅�倏� 虜褶й 熱 氈棻朝勒 棻 剪騁蜓檜撿!\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...雖旎擎 斜啪 碳陛棟п...辦葬и纔朝 ��檜 橈剪萇. ж雖虜 舒堅 瑭塭, 檜勘煎 絲擊 賅嬴憮 樹薇陛朝 и廓 <a link=\"helpdog4\">菴餵橫 澡橫</a> 獐疏塭堅!\r\n</body>","helpdog3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>我們正在這裡工作的事情萊拉完全不知道的...。大家都很清楚，她決會不喜歡它。\r\n<p>雖然她是一個好領導者...。但是很可惜，她並不了解世界。\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Lyra has no idea that we are working here...obviously, she wouldn't like it.\r\n<p>She is a good leader...but she has much to learn.\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Lyra has no idea that we are working here...obviously, she wouldn't like it.\r\n<p>She is a good leader...but she has much to learn.\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>辦葬菟檜 罹晦憮 檜楛 橾擊 ж堅 氈棻朝 餌褒擎 塭檜塭 椒眷朝 綠塵煎 ж堅 氈棻...奩渠ж褒眷 碟貲ж剪萇.\r\n<p>謠擎 碟檜曹 ж雖虜...斜 碟擎 撮鼻擊 傘鼠 路塭...\r\n</body>","helpdog4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>你不認為我們應該做某些事來告訴大家，那些上流社會的人如何在發動戰爭之後又不理睬我們，甚至讓我們餓死？\r\n<p>即使在那個階層內，還是有許多人來和我們分享意見。但，如果富貴之神眷顧了我們的話，也許… \r\n<br>\r\n<p>喂！你難道不想成為那之中的一份子嗎？\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>I think we should do something to show those muckety-mucks who ignore us, even after declaring war and watching us starve!\r\n<p>...and there are others who shares my ideas even in the Estate. All I need to do is raise up a stake in these games, and they'll see...\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Right, don't you want to be a part of this?\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>I think we should do something to show those muckety-mucks who ignore us, even after declaring war and watching us starve!\r\n<p>...and there are others who shares my ideas even in the Estate. All I need to do is raise up a stake in these games, and they'll see...\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Right, don't you want to be a part of this?\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdog4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>樹薇陛 濠晦啻 詣渠煎 瞪爵擊 п 場堅朝 瞪爵 陽僥縑 掛堅 氈朝 辦葬菟擎 賅艇羹ж朝 堪擎 碟и纔 衙遴 蛻擊 и廓 爾罹醜撿 ж雖 彊啊橫?\r\n<p>...曖諼煎 艙雖 寰縑 陴嬴氈朝 餌塋菟 醞縑憮紫 辦葬嫌 儅陝檜 偽擎 餌塋菟檜 號棻堅. 晦�虜� 澀 濩嬴憮 橾橫釭賊 嬴葆...\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜溢棻, ⑽噢紫 и跟 剪菟橫爾雖 彊啊熱?\r\n</body>","helpdogt-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>動物錦標賽是從８隻動物之中，決定出冠軍。只要你支付登錄費用，登錄你的動物後再等一下下，就可以參加這個遊戲。</p>\r\n<p>比賽將自動地從複賽進行到決賽，在比賽前你可以對你的動物使用道具或者施法術，但是在比賽期間就不可以這樣做了。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>決賽的勝利者和失敗者的登錄費用將會以３：１的比例分配其他８個參賽者。\r\n<p>在動物錦標賽中，你不必進入比賽。你可以預測勝利者而且下賭注，這個賭金的一部份會給冠軍當獎品。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdogt-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>An animal tournament decides a champion from among 8 animals. The game will begin if you register your animal by paying the entry fee and wait for a while.</p>\r\n<p>The game advances automatically from the quarterfinals to the finals. You can give your animal items or cast spells before the game, but you can't aid your critter during the game.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The winner and loser of the final match will get the 8 people's entry fees, dividing them 3:1.\r\n<p>In the animal tournament, you don't have to enter the game - you can also predict the winner and bet your money. Part of this bet will go to the champion as a prize.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdogt-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>An animal tournament decides a champion from among 8 animals. The game will begin if you register your animal by paying the entry fee and wait for a while.</p>\r\n<p>The game advances automatically from the quarterfinals to the finals. You can give your animal items or cast spells before the game, but you can't aid your critter during the game.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The winner and loser of the final match will get the 8 people's entry fees, dividing them 3:1.\r\n<p>In the animal tournament, you don't have to enter the game - you can also predict the winner and bet your money. Part of this bet will go to the champion as a prize.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpdogt-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>翕僭 饜傘試お朝 8葆葬曖 翕僭檜 賅罹 蝓濠 霞轎衝戲煎 辦蝓濠蒂 陛葬朝 唳晦殮棲棻. 霤陛綠蒂 頂堅 摹熱 蛔煙擊 и 棻擠 褻旎 晦棻葬衛賊 唳晦陛 衛濛腌棲棻.\r\n<p>唳晦朝 蕨摹瞪, 4鬼瞪, 唸蝓瞪曖 牖憮煎 濠翕 霞ч腌棲棻. 唳晦 衛濛 瞪 濠晦 翕僭縑啪 嬴檜蠱擊 輿剪釭 葆徹擊 勘橫還 熱 氈蝗棲棻虜, 唳晦 醞除縑朝 碳陛棟м棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>唳晦 辦蝓濠諦 遽辦蝓濠朝 8檣碟曖 霤陛綠蒂 3:1煎 寡碟ж罹 鼻旎戲煎 嫡啪 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>傳 翕僭 饜傘試お朝 摹熱煎 霜蕾 霤陛ж朝 匙 諼縑紫 援陛 辦蝓й 匙檣陛蒂 蕨鼻ж罹 絲擊 勘 熱紫 氈蝗棲棻. 檜 っ絲曖 橾睡紫 辦蝓濠縑啪 鼻旎戲煎 陛啪 腌棲棻.\r\n</body>","helpetc-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>命令輔助說明：其他</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>呼叫輔助說明： </font>\r\n<p>點一下在交談視窗的右邊底部的<font fg=ffffff>問題標示小圖示</font><img src=\"#33\">，或按<font fg=ffffff>Ｆ１鍵</font>。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>使用者資訊： </font>\r\n<p>從交談視窗，鍵入<font fg=ffffff>『/who 玩家 ID』</font>。如果沒有輸入玩家 ID ，則會顯示出現在線上的玩家人數。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>音效開／關：</font>\r\n<p>從交談視窗鍵入<font fg=ffffff>『/music』</font>去關閉音樂。\r\n 再鍵入<font fg=ffffff>『/music』</font> 一次，就可開啟音樂。如果鍵入\r\n <font fg=ffffff>『/sound』</font>，聲音效果也能打開或關閉。\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img></body>\r\n\r\n","helpetc-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Miscellaneous</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Call up Help:</font>\r\n<p>Click on the <font fg=ffffff>question mark icon</font><img src=\"#33\"> on the bottom right\r\n of the chat window, or press the <font fg=ffffff>F1 key</font>.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Information on user:</font>\r\n<p>From the chat window, type <font fg=ffffff>'/who [user name]'</font>. If [user name] is\r\n not entered, the number of users currently logged on is shown.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Sound On/Off:</font>\r\n<p>Type <font fg=ffffff>'/music'</font> from the chat window to turn the music off.\r\n Type <font fg=ffffff>'/music'</font> again to turn music back on. Also, sound effects\r\n may be turned on and off by typing <font fg=ffffff>'/sound'</font>.\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img></body>\r\n","helpetc-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Miscellaneous</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Call up Help:</font>\r\n<p>Click on the <font fg=ffffff>question mark icon</font><img src=\"#33\"> on the bottom right\r\n of the chat window, or press the <font fg=ffffff>F1 key</font>.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Information on user:</font>\r\n<p>From the chat window, type <font fg=ffffff>'/who [user name]'</font>. If [user name] is\r\n not entered, the number of users currently logged on is shown.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Sound On/Off:</font>\r\n<p>Type <font fg=ffffff>'/music'</font> from the chat window to turn the music off.\r\n Type <font fg=ffffff>'/music'</font> again to turn music back on. Also, sound effects\r\n may be turned on and off by typing <font fg=ffffff>'/sound'</font>.\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img></body>\r\n","helpetc-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 Help: 晦顫</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>紫遺蜓 睡腦晦:</font>\r\n<p>瓣た璽 嬴楚 螃艇薹縑 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>僭擠ル 嬴檜夔</font>擊 贗葛ж剪釭 <font fg=ffffff>F1 酈</font>蒂 援落棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>餌辨濠 �挫�:</font>\r\n<p>瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/援掘 [嶸盪 ID]'</font>塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. [嶸盪 ID]蒂 殮溘ж雖 彊懊擊 唳辦 ⑷營 蕾樓ж堅 氈朝 餌辨濠 熱陛 ル衛腌棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>餌遴萄 On/Off:</font>\r\n<p>擠學擊 菔堅 談雖 彊擊 陽縑朝 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/擠學'</font>檜塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. 棻衛 菔堅 談擊 陽縑朝 棻衛 и廓 <font fg=ffffff>'/擠學'</font>檜塭堅 殮溘ж賊 腌棲棻. 葆雙陛雖煎 �膩�擠曖 唳辦朝 <font fg=ffffff>'/模葬'</font>蒂 殮溘ж賊 腌棲棻.<br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>","helpgen-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>指令 說明：一般</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>移動:</font>\r\n<p>利用鍵盤的<font fg=ffffff>方向鍵</font>或者用滑鼠點想要去的地方。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>轉方向:</font>\r\n<p>若沒有移動時，只想轉身，請按著<font fg=ffffff>Shift鍵</font>點方向。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>使用隱藏功能列視窗:</font>\r\n<p>將滑鼠移到畫面作下方之顯示魔法力部分的上方，會出現功能列視窗。功能列視窗的各個功能如下。</p><br>\r\n<p>說明視窗:請按<font fg=ffffff>問號圖示</font><img src=\"#616\">或按<font fg=ffffff>F1鍵</font>。<br>\r\n<p>狀態視窗:請按<font fg=ffffff>人形圖示</font><img src=\"#617\">或按 <font fg=ffffff>Ctrl-A</font>鍵。<br>\r\n<p>魔法視窗:請按<font fg=ffffff>十字架圖示</font><img src=\"#618\">或按<font fg=ffffff>Ctrl-S</font>鍵。<br>\r\n<p>道具視窗:請按<font fg=ffffff>荷包圖示</font><img src=\"#619\">或按<font fg=ffffff>TAB</font>鍵。<br>\r\n<p>離開遊戲視窗:請按<font fg=ffffff>Q字圖示</font><img src=\"#620\">或按<font fg=ffffff>Ctrl-Q或Alt-X</font>鍵。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>變更選擇:</font>\r\n<p>道具和人物疊在一起的時候，游標選擇的狀態之下按<font fg=ffffff>右鍵 </font>可變更對象。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpgen-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: General</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Walk:</font>\r\n<p>When using a keyboard, use the <font fg=ffffff>arrow keys</font>. When using a mouse,\r\n click on your destination.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Turn:</font>\r\n<p>To change the direction of character without moving, click on desired direction while\r\n pressing the <font fg=ffffff>Shift key</font>.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Using the Icons:</font>\r\n<p> Item Window: Click on the <font fg=ffffff>bag icon</font><img src=\"#29\">\r\n                 on the right side of the chat window, or press the\r\n\t\t\t\t <font fg=ffffff>TAB key</font>.<br>\r\n<p> Help Window: Click on the <font fg=ffffff>question-mark icon</font><img src=\"#33\">\r\n                 on the right side of the chat window, or press the\r\n\t\t\t\t <font fg=ffffff>F1 key</font>.<br>\r\n<p> Quit/Restart game: Click on the <font fg=ffffff>\"Quit\" icon</font><img src=\"#35\">\r\n                 on the right side of the chat window, or enter\r\n\t\t\t\t <font fg=ffffff>Ctrl-Q or Alt-X</font>.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Change selection:</p></font>\r\n<p>When items or characters overlap and the cursor is selecting one object,\r\n <font fg=ffffff>right click</font> to change the selected object.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>","helpgen-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: General</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Walk:</font>\r\n<p>When using a keyboard, use the <font fg=ffffff>arrow keys</font>. When using a mouse,\r\n click on your destination.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Turn:</font>\r\n<p>To change the direction of character without moving, click on desired direction while\r\n pressing the <font fg=ffffff>Shift key</font>.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Using the Icons:</font>\r\n<p> Item Window: Click on the <font fg=ffffff>bag icon</font><img src=\"#29\">\r\n                 on the right side of the chat window, or press the\r\n\t\t\t\t <font fg=ffffff>TAB key</font>.<br>\r\n<p> Help Window: Click on the <font fg=ffffff>question-mark icon</font><img src=\"#33\">\r\n                 on the right side of the chat window, or press the\r\n\t\t\t\t <font fg=ffffff>F1 key</font>.<br>\r\n<p> Quit/Restart game: Click on the <font fg=ffffff>\"Quit\" icon</font><img src=\"#35\">\r\n                 on the right side of the chat window, or enter\r\n\t\t\t\t <font fg=ffffff>Ctrl-Q or Alt-X</font>.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Change selection:</p></font>\r\n<p>When items or characters overlap and the cursor is selecting one object,\r\n <font fg=ffffff>right click</font> to change the selected object.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>","helpgen-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 Help: 橾奩</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>檜翕:</font>\r\n<p>酈爾萄曖 <font fg=ffffff>�香嚂� 酈</font>蒂 檜辨ж剪釭, 葆辦蝶煎 �飛曈遛□� 陛晦蒂 錳ж朝 濰模蒂 贗葛м棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>寞щ 瞪��:</font>\r\n<p>檜翕ж雖 彊擎 瓣煎 議葛攪曖 寞щ虜 瞪�納炾簎� ж賊, <font fg=ffffff>Shift 酈</font>蒂 援艇 鼻鷓縑憮 錳ж朝 寞щ擊 贗葛м棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Side Window餌辨:</font>\r\n<p> �飛� 豭薹 ж欽曖 MP ル衛 嶺睡碟縑 葆辦蝶蒂 乾棻渠賊 嬴檜夔夥陛 釭顫陶棲棻. 陝 嬴檜夔擊 贗葛ж賊 棻擠婁 偽擎 晦棟擊 餌辨й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p><br>\r\n<p> 紫遺蜓 璽: <font fg=ffffff>僭擠ル 賅曄曖 嬴檜夔</font><img src=\"#616\">擊 贗葛ж剪釭 <font fg=ffffff>F1酈</font>蒂 援腦賊 嗅棲棻.<br>\r\n<p> 鼻鷓ル衛 璽: <font fg=ffffff>橡掉 賅曄曖 嬴檜夔</font><img src=\"#617\">擊 贗葛ж剪釭 <font fg=ffffff>Ctrl-A</font>酈蒂 援腦賊 嗅棲棻.<br>\r\n<p> 葆徹 璽: <font fg=ffffff>褊濠陛 賅曄曖 嬴檜夔</font><img src=\"#618\">擊 贗葛ж剪釭 <font fg=ffffff>Ctrl-S</font>酈蒂 援腦賊 嗅棲棻.<br>\r\n<p> 嬴檜蠱 璽: <font fg=ffffff>輿該棲 賅曄曖 嬴檜夔</font><img src=\"#619\">擊 贗葛ж剪釭 <font fg=ffffff>TAB酈</font>蒂 援腦賊 嗅棲棻.<br>\r\n<p> 啪歜 醞欽 璽:  <font fg=ffffff>Q濠 嬴檜夔</font><img src=\"#620\">擊 贗葛ж剪釭 <font fg=ffffff>Ctrl-Q �分� Alt-X</font>酈蒂 援腦賊 嗅棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>摹鷗 滲唳:</font>\r\n<p>嬴檜蠱檜釭 議葛攪陛 啜藥螳 氈擊 唳辦, 醴憮陛 摹鷗腎橫 氈朝 鼻鷓縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>螃艇薹 贗葛</font>擊 ж罹 摹鷗腎橫 氈朝 渠鼻擊 滲唳й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helphnt-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>提示＆重點</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n新創的角色的提示和重點在這裡。點選你想知道的人物，就可以得到較多的訊息。 \r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphntp\">王族（王子／公主）</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphntk\">騎士</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphnte\">妖精</a>\r\n<p>魔法師\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphnt-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Hints &amp; tips</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nHints and tips for newbie are here. Click your character class for more information.\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphntp\"> Princes and Princesses</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphntk\"> Knight</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphnte\"> Elf</a>\r\n<p> Wizard\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphnt-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Hints &amp; tips</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nHints and tips for newbie are here. Click your character class for more information.\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphntp\"> Princes and Princesses</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphntk\"> Knight</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphnte\"> Elf</a>\r\n<p> Wizard\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphnt-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>�爩�&amp;そ</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n檜夠縑憮朝 啪歜縑 櫛熨ж雖 彊擎 Ы溯檜橫蒂 嬪п 陝 贗楚蝶滌煎 啪歜曖 蟾奩縑 憲嬴舒賊 紫遺檜 腎朝 雖衝菟擊 模偃м棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphntp\"> 諾濠/奢輿</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphntk\"> 晦餌</a>\r\n<p><a link=\"helphnte\"> 蹂薑</a>\r\n<p> 葆徹餌\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>","helphnte-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>提示＆重點：妖精</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>設定：</font>\r\n<p>妖精們以『迷幻森林』為家，棲息在亞丁王國中部西方的地區。身為自然神的化身，他們通常避免與人類接觸，但是遵循『殷海薩』的教義保護人類或為了與人類之間的友誼，他們和人類保持互動的關係。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>出發位置：</font>\r\n<p>所有的妖精們的起源，都在凱登城北方的歐西思城以東的『迷幻森林』。『迷幻森林』是環繞在世界樹周圍的森林，曾經是殷海薩創造的第一種生物型態。這森林被妖精們和四種守護神種族保護（芮克妮、潘、精靈、安特），因此其中有一些地方不允許人類接近。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>遊戲開始的舞台：</font>\r\n<p>在迷幻森林中沒有金錢的觀念，妖精們必須自己製造他們要的物品。妖精們收集從迷幻森林，眠龍之窟，和守護神那邊得到的材料，並把他們做成物品。這裡會說明，妖精們如何從四種守護神得到材料的目錄，和拿到材料的方法。</p>\r\n<p>芮克妮：有芮克妮的網和各種的線。想要得到芮克妮的網，首先要餵食安特的枝脈後，然後用空手攻擊。</p>\r\n<p>潘：有潘的鬃毛和各種的金屬板。想要得到潘的鬃毛，你必須用武器攻擊潘。但是這個收集鬃毛的過程最好和其他的玩家合作，因為被潘攻擊常會遭到很大的傷害。</p>\r\n<p>精靈：有純粹的米索莉和奧里哈魯根。如果你從眠龍之窟中取得粗糙的米索莉給精靈，精靈就會將它精練成純粹的米索莉。</p>\r\n<p>安特：有安特的枝脈和安特的樹皮。要得到安特的枝脈，你別無選擇必須攻擊安特，但是如果想得到安特的樹皮的話，你必須先餵他喝蘑菇汁之後再攻擊它。</p>\r\n<p>除了那些線索之外，還有其他的材料。如果你與迷幻森林裡的非玩家操縱角色交談，就會得到更多的暗示。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>基本的裝備：</font>\r\n<p>開始遊戲時，所有的妖精會有一把短弓、木製的夾克和 100 支箭。按ＴＡＢ鍵或點一下像袋子一樣的小圖示<img src=\"#29\">就會出現道具清單。點一下道具清單，你就能使用／穿著短弓和夾克，這時你也可以從視窗中檢視其他的物品。</p>\r\n<p>由於他們感覺相當敏銳，所以妖精們能在晚上、在地牢外面等沒有燈籠的情況下看見模糊的物體。只要他們的等級到達２５時，就算在地牢中他們也能看的見。</p>\r\n<p>當被怪物或其他的玩家追殺的時候，你可能失去物品，所以要很小心。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>妖精們可能發現有趣的非玩家操縱角色：</font>\r\n<p> 迷幻森林之母：它是在城鎮中心的巨大的世界樹，並第一隻妖精合併。她繁殖出最先出生的妖精，並指導他們的命運和生活的方法。</p>\r\n<p> 娜魯帕：芮克妮的一位年長者，居住在迷幻森林之母旁邊的洞穴中。她在那裡利用妖精們收集來的材料，為他們製造物品。</p>\r\n<p> 何侖：哈汀的年輕學徒，居住在迷幻森林東方的龍之山谷入口的哈汀魔術研究中心。他能告訴你有關安特的詳細解說，而且教妖精們提升到等級３的法術。</p>\r\n<p> 多特：在艾爾文城鎮的一位非玩家操縱角色。他知道很多與米索莉和精靈相關的知識。</p>\r\n<p> 胡林戴里恩：在艾爾文城鎮的一位非玩家操縱角色。他知道許多關於四個守護神種族的事情。</p>\r\n<p> 那翰：在妖精之中最好棒的音樂家，她知道很多關於潘的事。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>妖精們可能發現有趣的地方：</font>\r\n<p> 世界樹：殷海薩創造的第一種生命型態其中的一種。這裡是元素活動的中心，如果妖精們停留在世界樹的周圍，他們會痊癒地比較快。在艾爾文城鎮中有一棵巨大的世界樹，而在迷幻森林周圍有三棵以上的樹。</p>\r\n<p> 這地下城位於迷幻森林的和歐西思森林的邊界。你能由這裡的怪物手中得到粗糙的米索莉。有一條地球龍居住在第四層樓，但是那條道路現在已經被阻塞了。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphnte-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Hint&amp;Tip: Elf</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Setting:</font>\r\n<p>Elves start in the 'Elven Forest' which lies at the center-western part of the Kingdom of Aden. As avatars of nature, they usually avoid contact with humans, but to protect humans according to the teachings of \"Einhasad\" and/or just for friendship, they often interact with humans.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Starting Location:</font>\r\n<p>All elves start in the 'Elven Forest' to the east of the Orcish Fortress (which itself lies north of Castle Kent.) The 'Elven Forest' is the forest around the World Tree - the first life form Einhasad ever created. This forest is protected by elves and four guardian races (Arachne, Pan, Fairy, Ent), and is thus one of the few places where humans are not allowed.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>The initial stage of the game:</font>\r\n<p>There is no concept of money in the Elven Forest - elves have to make their items themselves. Elves gather materials from the Elven Forest, the Cave of The Sleeping Dragon, and the guardians, and make items from these materials. The materials elves can get from four guardian races (and how to get them) are as follows:</p>\r\n<p>Arachne: Arachnes give webs and all kind of threads. To get webs, attack arachne with your hand after feeding them a Twig of Ent.</p>\r\n<p>Pan: These give Pan's mane and all kind of plates. To get the manes, you must attack a Pan with a weapon. But since a Pan will attack the PC who inflicted the most damage, it's better to cooperate with other players when collecting manes.</p>\r\n<p>Fairy: Faries give Pure Mithril and Oriharukon. If you get rough Mithril from the cave of sleeping dragon and give it to fairies, they will refine it to pure mithril.</p>\r\n<p>Ent: These will give Twigs of Ent and Bark of Ent. To get twigs, you just have to attack an Ent, but to get the bark of Ent you have to attack it after feeding the Ent with fungus juice to reduce the hold of the bark.</p>\r\n<p>Besides those listed, there are other materials...talk to NPCs in the Elven Forest, and they may help you find them.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Basic Equipment:</font>\r\n<p>All elves start the game with a short bow, wooden jacket, and 100 arrows. You can wield/wear the short bow and jacket by double-clicking each in the inventory window (accessible by pressing the TAB key or clicking the bag-like icon<img src=\"#29\">.)</p>\r\n<p>Due to their keen senses, elves can see the glimpses of objects at night without lamps or lanterns outside dungeons. Once they reach level 25, they can see even in dungeons.</p>\r\n<p>Be careful - you may drop items when you are killed by monsters or other characters.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>NPCs whom elves may find interesting:</font>\r\n<p> Mother of the Forest and Elves: this refers to the big World Tree at the center of town, and the first elf merged within the Tree. She can tell first-born elves their fate, and knows the way of life.</p>\r\n<p> Nerupa: An elder of the Arachnes who lives in the cave beside the Mother of the Forest and Elves. She makes items for elves from the materials they collect.</p>\r\n<p> Horun: a young apprentice of Hardin living in a magical research center at the entrance of Dragon Valley, east of the Elven Forest. He can give detailed explanations about the Entkind, and can teaches elves spells up to level 3.</p>\r\n<p> Doett: A NPC in the elven town with extensive knowledge about mithril and fairies.</p>\r\n<p> Hurindalien: A NPC in the elven town, able to tell many things about the four guardian races.</p>\r\n<p> Narhen: The best musician among elves, with great knowledge of the Pan.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Places where elves may find interesting:</font>\r\n<p> World Tree: One of the first life forms Einhasad created, this is the center of elemental activities. If elves stay around the world tree, they heal faster. There is a big world tree in the elven town and three more trees rooted around the Elven Forest.</p>\r\n<p> Cave of The Sleeping Dragon: A dungeon located at the border of the Elven Forest and the Orcish Fortress. You can get rough mithril from the monsters here, and there is an earth dragon living in the fourth floor.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphnte-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Hint&amp;Tip: Elf</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Setting:</font>\r\n<p>Elves start in the 'Elven Forest' which lies at the center-western part of the Kingdom of Aden. As avatars of nature, they usually avoid contact with humans, but to protect humans according to the teachings of \"Einhasad\" and/or just for friendship, they often interact with humans.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Starting Location:</font>\r\n<p>All elves start in the 'Elven Forest' to the east of the Orcish Fortress (which itself lies north of Castle Kent.) The 'Elven Forest' is the forest around the World Tree - the first life form Einhasad ever created. This forest is protected by elves and four guardian races (Arachne, Pan, Fairy, Ent), and is thus one of the few places where humans are not allowed.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>The initial stage of the game:</font>\r\n<p>There is no concept of money in the Elven Forest - elves have to make their items themselves. Elves gather materials from the Elven Forest, the Cave of The Sleeping Dragon, and the guardians, and make items from these materials. The materials elves can get from four guardian races (and how to get them) are as follows:</p>\r\n<p>Arachne: Arachnes give webs and all kind of threads. To get webs, attack arachne with your hand after feeding them a Twig of Ent.</p>\r\n<p>Pan: These give Pan's mane and all kind of plates. To get the manes, you must attack a Pan with a weapon. But since a Pan will attack the PC who inflicted the most damage, it's better to cooperate with other players when collecting manes.</p>\r\n<p>Fairy: Faries give Pure Mithril and Oriharukon. If you get rough Mithril from the cave of sleeping dragon and give it to fairies, they will refine it to pure mithril.</p>\r\n<p>Ent: These will give Twigs of Ent and Bark of Ent. To get twigs, you just have to attack an Ent, but to get the bark of Ent you have to attack it after feeding the Ent with fungus juice to reduce the hold of the bark.</p>\r\n<p>Besides those listed, there are other materials...talk to NPCs in the Elven Forest, and they may help you find them.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Basic Equipment:</font>\r\n<p>All elves start the game with a short bow, wooden jacket, and 100 arrows. You can wield/wear the short bow and jacket by double-clicking each in the inventory window (accessible by pressing the TAB key or clicking the bag-like icon<img src=\"#29\">.)</p>\r\n<p>Due to their keen senses, elves can see the glimpses of objects at night without lamps or lanterns outside dungeons. Once they reach level 25, they can see even in dungeons.</p>\r\n<p>Be careful - you may drop items when you are killed by monsters or other characters.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>NPCs whom elves may find interesting:</font>\r\n<p> Mother of the Forest and Elves: this refers to the big World Tree at the center of town, and the first elf merged within the Tree. She can tell first-born elves their fate, and knows the way of life.</p>\r\n<p> Nerupa: An elder of the Arachnes who lives in the cave beside the Mother of the Forest and Elves. She makes items for elves from the materials they collect.</p>\r\n<p> Horun: a young apprentice of Hardin living in a magical research center at the entrance of Dragon Valley, east of the Elven Forest. He can give detailed explanations about the Entkind, and can teaches elves spells up to level 3.</p>\r\n<p> Doett: A NPC in the elven town with extensive knowledge about mithril and fairies.</p>\r\n<p> Hurindalien: A NPC in the elven town, able to tell many things about the four guardian races.</p>\r\n<p> Narhen: The best musician among elves, with great knowledge of the Pan.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Places where elves may find interesting:</font>\r\n<p> World Tree: One of the first life forms Einhasad created, this is the center of elemental activities. If elves stay around the world tree, they heal faster. There is a big world tree in the elven town and three more trees rooted around the Elven Forest.</p>\r\n<p> Cave of The Sleeping Dragon: A dungeon located at the border of the Elven Forest and the Orcish Fortress. You can get rough mithril from the monsters here, and there is an earth dragon living in the fourth floor.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphnte-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>�爩�&amp;そ: 蹂薑</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>撲薑:</font>\r\n<p>嬴筆 諾措 醞憮睡曖 '蹂薑曖 膛'縑 剪薄擊 葆溼ж堅 氈朝 蹂薑褶菟擎 濠翱曖 �亳鰾� 斜菟曖 か撩鼻 檣除婁 蕾ж朝 匙擊  Яж雖虜 斜 援掘爾棻 檣除擊 嬪п 撮鼻擊 璽褻и '摹и 褐' 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 嗆縑 評塭 陽煎朝 檣除擊 熱��ж晦 嬪п, 陽煎朝 檣除婁曖 辦薑擊 嬪п 斜菟婁 か檜и 婦啗蒂 裕蝗棲棻. \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>衛濛 濰模:</font>\r\n<p>蹂薑 議葛攪朝 騰お撩曖 磁薹, 螃觼蹂億曖 翕薹縑 氈朝 '蹂薑曖 膛'縑憮 衛濛м棲棻. 蹂薑曖 膛擎 嬴檣ж餌萄 褐檜 璽褻и 譆蟾曖 儅貲檣 撮啗熱蒂 醞褕戲煎 ⑽撩脹 膛戲煎 蹂薑婁 膛擊 雖酈朝 4渠 熱��謙褶(嬴塭觼啻, っ, む橫葬, 縛お)菟縑 曖п 嬴筆縑憮 嬴霜 檣除曖 蕾斬擊 ъ塊纂 彊朝 賃 寰腎朝 夠 醞 ж釭殮棲棻. \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>啪歜 蟾奩曖 �撣�:</font>\r\n<p>蹂薑曖 膛擎 �倖� 唳薯陛 鱔辨腎雖 彊晦 陽僥縑, 濠褐檜 噩 嬴檜蠱擊 霜蕾 虜菟橫撿 м棲棻. 蹂薑曖 膛婁 辨檜 濡濠朝 翕掉, 熱��濠菟煎 睡攪 橢擎 營猿蒂 褻мж罹 罹楝陛雖 嬴檜蠱擊 虜菟 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 4渠 熱��謙褶菟煎睡攪 橢擊 熱 氈朝 營猿諦 橢朝 寞徹擎 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>嬴塭觼啻: 嬴塭觼啻曖 剪嘐還婁 陝謙 褒 謙盟蒂 鄹棲棻. 剪嘐還擊 橢朝 寞徹擎 縛お曖 還晦蒂 詳檣 �� 裔槳戲煎 嬴塭觼啻蒂 奢問ж賊 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>っ: っ曖 陞晦瓚婁 陝謙 っ旎 謙盟蒂 鄹棲棻. っ曖 陞晦瓚擊 橢朝 寞徹擎 鼠晦煎 っ擊 奢問ж賊 腎雖虜, っ擎 濠褐縑啪 陛濰 贖 Яп蒂 遽 PC蒂 奢問ж嘎煎, 罹楝貲檜 ⑺溘п憮 陞晦瓚擊 瓣餵ж朝 ら檜 謠蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>む橫葬: 嘐蝶萵檜釭 螃葬ж瑞夔擊 虜菟橫 鄹棲棻. 辨檜 濡濠朝 翕掉曖 跪縑啪憮 釭螃朝 嘐蝶萵 錳戮擊 む橫葬縑啪 陛螳棻 輿賊 む橫葬陛 嘐蝶萵煎 薑薯п 鄹棲棻.\r\n<p>縛お: 縛お曖 還晦諦 縛お曖 皎韓擊 鄹棲棻. 縛お曖 還晦朝 縛お蒂 斜傖 奢問ж賊 腎雖虜, 縛お曖 皎韓擊 橢晦 嬪п憮朝 幗撓ん濠 闆擊 縛お縑啪 詳檣 �� 奢問п撿 м棲棻.\r\n<p>斜 諼縑紫 號擎 營猿菟檜 氈蝗棲棻虜, 渠睡碟 蹂薑曖 膛 NPC菟婁 渠�飛� ж棻爾賊 蔣啪 �爩捂� 瓊擊 熱 氈擊 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>晦獄 濰綠:</font>\r\n<p>蹂薑擎 籀擠 Ы溯檜蒂 衛濛й 陽 穠擎 �偽� 釭鼠陛避褡, 斜葬堅 �香� 100偃蒂 陛雖堅 衛濛м棲棻. 穠擎 �偽� 營韃擎 TAP酈蒂 援腦剪釭 瓣た 殮溘璽 螃艇薹曖 <font fg=ffffff>輿該棲 賅曄曖 嬴檜夔</font><img src=\"#29\">擊 贗葛ж賊 釭螃朝 模雖ヶ璽縑憮 п渡 嬴檜蠱擊 贗葛ж罹 濰綠й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>蹂薑擎 錳楚 嫘換檜 嫩晦 陽僥縑, 湍蟒檜 嬴棋 撿諼縑憮朝 嫘檜 腎橫紫 輿嬪蒂 橫溫Еж啪 獐 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 湍蟒縑憮紫 蹂薑曖 溯漣檜 25檜鼻檣 唳辦 維檜 橈橫紫 餌僭擊 獐 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>馨葛攪陛 惚僭檜釭 棻艇 馨葛攪縑 曖п 避擊 陽 濰綠蒂 雲橫嗑葬朝 唳辦陛 氈戲嘎煎 輿曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>瓊嬴陛獐虜и 餌塋菟:</font>\r\n<p> 膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲: 蹂薑曖 葆擊 醞懈縑 氈朝 渠撮啗熱諦 斜 撮啗熱縑 懦м脹 譆蟾曖 蹂薑擊 蜓м棲棻. 億煎 鷓橫釭朝 蹂薑菟縑啪 斜菟曖 遴貲擊 撲だж堅, 蹂薑曖 й 橾擊 薯衛п 鄹棲棻.\r\n<p> 啻瑞だ: 膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲 壽曖 饜寞縑 餌朝 嬴塭觼啻褶曖 濰煎殮棲棻. 斜喪朝 嗨橫陪 槳營輿煎 蹂薑菟檜 賅嬴螞 營猿蒂 檜辨п 蹂薑菟縑啪 в蹂и 嬴檜蠱擊 薯濛п 輿堅 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p> �ㄦ�: 蹂薑曖 膛 翕薹 辨曖 啗堊 殮掘縑 氈朝 ж蛞曖 葆徹 翱掘模蒂 雖酈朝 ж蛞曖 橫萼 薯濠殮棲棻. 熱��濠 謙褶醞 縛お縑 渠п 濠撮�� 憲溥輿貊, 蹂薑菟縑啪 溯漣3梱雖曖 葆徹擊 陛腦藥 鄹棲棻.\r\n<p> 紫縑お: 蹂薑曖 葆擊 NPC殮棲棻. 嘐蝶萵婁 む橫葬縑 渠п п夢и 雖衝擊 陛雖堅 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p> �譫偌瑀�: 蹂薑曖 葆擊 NPC殮棲棻. 蹂薑婁 膛擊 雖酈朝 4渠 熱��謙褶縑 渠п 號擎 匙擊 憲溥 鄹棲棻.\r\n<p> 釭腦縛: 蹂薑褶 醞 陛濰 嗨橫陪 學餌殮棲棻. っ縑 渠п п夢и 雖衝擊 陛雖堅 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>瓊嬴陛獐虜и 夠菟:</font>\r\n<p> 撮啗熱: 嬴檣ж餌萄 褐檜 虜萇 譆蟾曖 儅貲殮棲棻. 薑滄溘檜 塵餵и 夠檜晦 陽僥縑 蹂薑菟檜 撮啗熱 輿滲檜 氈戲賊 羹溘檜 說葬 �蛹僱侅炴�. 蹂薑曖 葆擊縑 渠撮啗熱陛 氈戲貊 斜諼 膛 夠夠縑 3斜瑞陛 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p> 辨檜 濡濠朝 翕掉: 螃觼 蹂億諦 蹂薑曖 膛 唳啗縑 氈朝 雖ж 湍蟒殮棲棻. 檜夠縑 氈朝 跪擊 避檜賊 嘐蝶萵 錳戮擊 橢擊 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 4類縑朝 雖瑟檜 髦堅 氈雖虜 ⑷營 3類 檜ж朝 虞⑵ 氈朝 鼻鷓殮棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>","helphntk-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>提示＆重點：騎士</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>背景：</font>\r\n<p>騎士是那些聽到有關『不敗的甘特』的傳言，而且旅行到島上，經過他極度嚴格訓練及試練的一群人。一個騎士無止盡地磨鍊他的能力期待能成為最強的人，之後去找到一個能承認他的騎士價值的君主，並宣示效忠。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>開始位置：</font>\r\n<p>騎士玩家從『銀騎士之屋』上的村莊開始遊戲，騎士的學院是那個由被稱為『銀騎士』傑瑞德所經營的。據說因為有一次，他來自亞丁找到這個村莊。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>遊戲初期：</font>\r\n<p>一個騎士必須不只注意騎士的法規，而且也要在戰鬥中變得更強壯。因此，一個騎士玩家必須專心擊敗靠近村莊的怪物，並從中獲得經驗點數和物品。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>基本的裝備：</font>\r\n<p>開始遊戲時，一個騎士會有一把匕首、皮夾克、和二根蠟燭。按ＴＡＢ鍵或點一下像袋子一樣的小圖示<img src=\"#29\">就會出現道具清單。點一下道具清單，你就能使用蠟燭和匕首並穿著皮夾克，這時你也可以從視窗中檢視其他的物品。</p>\r\n<p>蠟燭在晚上用來提供照明的。只要在裝備視窗裡點一下蠟燭的小圖示，就可以使用蠟燭了，不過在使用一段時間之後，蠟燭還是會消耗殆盡。\r\n<p>當被怪物或其他的玩家追殺的時候，玩家可能失去物品，所以要小心。 \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>遇見的人：</font>\r\n<p> 傑瑞德：傑瑞德的銀騎士之屋在村莊的西北方，向他學習並請求他的認證，在通過傑瑞德給予的試煉，就可以得到象徵銀騎士地位的銀騎士之盾。\r\n<p> 吉倫：說話的島上的一個魔法師，他的房子位於村莊的東南方。\r\n<p> 潘朵拉：說話的島上的一個商人，你需要的每件事物幾乎都能向她購買，你能在村莊東北方的碼頭遇見她。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>可以去的地方：</font>\r\n<p> 競技場：位於村莊的南方，競技場是甘特允許在玩家之間的決鬥的唯一場所。在這裡，玩家可以不為物品或經驗點數擔憂而進行決鬥。\r\n<p> 訓練場：這個地方，位於甘特房子的西南方，被甘特用來訓練沒有很多實戰經驗的玩家。如果你認為靠近村莊的怪物是太強的話，那麼你可以在這比較安全的環境中獲得經驗點數。 \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphntk-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Hints&Tips: Knight</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Background:</font>\r\n<p>Knight characters are those who have heard rumors about the 'undefeated' Gunther, and have traveled to the island to train under him. A knight seeks to hone his abilities to the limit, and to find and serve a lord who will acknowledge the knight's worth. \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Starting location:</font>\r\n<p>Knight characters start game play at the 'Silver Knight's Town'.  Many knights choose to head to 說語島 to go to the academy for knights, run by Gunther 'the undefeated,' once a famous knight of Aden, is located on this island. You start out as a student at the academy.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Early in the game:</font>\r\n<p>A knight must not only follow the chivalric code, but also become strong in combat. Therefore, you should concentrate on defeating monsters near the village and obtaining experience points and items.  Additionally, you may quite safely gain experience at the training dummies near town until level 4.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Basic Equipment:</font>\r\n<p>A knight starts the game with a dagger, leather jacket, and two candles. The dagger and jacket may be equipped by clicking on the appropriate item within the Equipment window. The equipment window is shown by pressing the TAB key or clicking on the <font fg=ffffff>Bag-shaped icon</font><img src=\"#29\"> on the right side of the chat window.\r\n<p>Candles are used to provide illumination at night. To use a candle, click on the candle icon within the equipment window. Candles are expended after being used for some time.\r\n<p>You may drop items when killed by monsters or other characters, so be careful.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>People to meet (on 說語島):</font>\r\n<p> Gunter : The instructor at the academy for knights on the 說語島. He will explain about current events, and tell you what tasks you must perform. His house, a cavern dug out of a rocky mountain, is located west of the village.\r\n<p> Gereng: A magician of the 說語島. His house is located southeast of the village.\r\n<p> Pandora: A merchant of the 說語島. Almost everything you need can be bought from her. You can meet Pandora at the docks northeast of the village.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Places to go (on 說語島):</font>\r\n<p> Arena: Located south of the village, the Arena is the only place Gunter allows duels between characters. Here, characters may fight without worrying about items or experience points.\r\n<p> Training  ground: This place, located southwest of Gunter's house, was made by Gunter to train characters without much real-life combat experiences. If you think the mosters near the village are too powerful,  then you can obtain experience points in this relatively safe environment.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphntk-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Hints&Tips: Knight</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Background:</font>\r\n<p>Knight characters are those who have heard rumors about the 'undefeated' Gunther, and have traveled to the island to train under him. A knight seeks to hone his abilities to the limit, and to find and serve a lord who will acknowledge the knight's worth. \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Starting location:</font>\r\n<p>Knight characters start game play at the 'Silver Knight's Town'.  Many knights choose to head to 說語島 to go to the academy for knights, run by Gunther 'the undefeated,' once a famous knight of Aden, is located on this island. You start out as a student at the academy.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Early in the game:</font>\r\n<p>A knight must not only follow the chivalric code, but also become strong in combat. Therefore, you should concentrate on defeating monsters near the village and obtaining experience points and items.  Additionally, you may quite safely gain experience at the training dummies near town until level 4.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Basic Equipment:</font>\r\n<p>A knight starts the game with a dagger, leather jacket, and two candles. The dagger and jacket may be equipped by clicking on the appropriate item within the Equipment window. The equipment window is shown by pressing the TAB key or clicking on the <font fg=ffffff>Bag-shaped icon</font><img src=\"#29\"> on the right side of the chat window.\r\n<p>Candles are used to provide illumination at night. To use a candle, click on the candle icon within the equipment window. Candles are expended after being used for some time.\r\n<p>You may drop items when killed by monsters or other characters, so be careful.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>People to meet (on 說語島):</font>\r\n<p> Gunter : The instructor at the academy for knights on the 說語島. He will explain about current events, and tell you what tasks you must perform. His house, a cavern dug out of a rocky mountain, is located west of the village.\r\n<p> Gereng: A magician of the 說語島. His house is located southeast of the village.\r\n<p> Pandora: A merchant of the 說語島. Almost everything you need can be bought from her. You can meet Pandora at the docks northeast of the village.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Places to go (on 說語島):</font>\r\n<p> Arena: Located south of the village, the Arena is the only place Gunter allows duels between characters. Here, characters may fight without worrying about items or experience points.\r\n<p> Training  ground: This place, located southwest of Gunter's house, was made by Gunter to train characters without much real-life combat experiences. If you think the mosters near the village are too powerful,  then you can obtain experience points in this relatively safe environment.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphntk-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>�爩�&amp;そ: 晦餌</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>撲薑:</font>\r\n<p>晦餌 馨葛攪朝 賅舒 '碳ぬ曖' 捱攪曖 貲撩擊 菔堅 蜓ж朝 撰縑 勒傘陛 �К〥� 晦餌陛 腎晦 嬪и 熱溼擊 ж堅 氈朝 餌塋菟殮棲棻. 檜菟曖 跡瞳擎 蝶蝶煎蒂 斛и梱雖 鬼ж啪 ж朝 匙婁, 濠褐檜 檣薑й 熱 氈朝 �К〥� 捱輿蒂 虜釭 斜陛 翎擊 檜瑞紫煙 善朝 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>衛濛 濰模:</font>\r\n<p>晦餌 馨葛攪陛 籀擠 Ы溯檜蒂 衛濛ж朝 濰模朝 '蜓ж朝 撰'檜塭朝 撰曖 葆擊殮棲棻. 檜夠縑朝 и陽 嬴筆 諾措縑憮 貲撩擊 雲蟻湍 '碳ぬ'曖 捱攪陛 遴艙ж朝 晦餌 曄撩模陛 氈戲貊, 渡褐擎 斜夠曖 唯蝗 晦餌煎 衛濛м棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>啪歜 蟾奩曖 �撣�:</font>\r\n<p>晦餌朝 晦餌紫諦 л眷 譆堅曖 鬼л擊 蹺掘м棲棻. 斜溢晦 陽僥縑 晦餌朝 啪歜 蟾奩縑 葆擊 輿滲縑 氈朝 跨蝶攪蒂 黴纂ж罹 唳я纂諦 嬴檜蠱擊 橢橫 渦 鬼и 跨蝶攪蒂 瓊嬴 釭憮朝 婁薑擊 腎ヴ檜ж啪 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>晦獄 濰綠:</font>\r\n<p>晦餌朝 籀擠 Ы溯檜蒂 衛濛й 陽 欽匐婁 陛避 營韃, 斜葬堅 曄蟾 萃擊 陛雖堅 衛濛м棲棻. 欽匐婁 營韃擎 TAB酈蒂 援腦剪釭 瓣た 殮溘璽 螃艇薹曖 <font fg=ffffff>輿該棲 賅曄曖 嬴檜夔</font><img src=\"#29\">擊 贗葛ж賊 釭螃朝 模雖ヶ璽縑憮 п渡 嬴檜蠱擊 贗葛ж罹 濰綠й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>曄蟾朝 嫘檜 腎歷擊 陽 橫菸擊 嫩�鰼� 嬪п 餌辨ж貊, 餌辨徹擎 模雖ヶ 璽縑憮 曄蟾 嬴檜夔擊 渦綰 贗葛ж賊 腌棲棻. 曄蟾朝 橾薑 衛除 餌辨ж賊 橈橫螳 幗董棲棻.\r\n<p>馨葛攪陛 惚僭檜釭 棻艇 馨葛攪縑 曖п 避擊 陽 濰綠蒂 雲橫嗑葬朝 唳辦陛 氈戲嘎煎 輿曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>瓊嬴陛獐虜и 餌塋菟:</font>\r\n<p> 捱攪: 捱攪朝 蜓ж朝 撰縑憮 晦餌 曄撩模蒂 遴艙ж堅 氈朝 餌塋殮棲棻. 斜朝 馨葛攪縑啪 ⑷營曖 鼻�窕� 撲貲п 輿堅, й 橾擊 薯衛п 鄹棲棻. 斜曖 餵擎 給骯擊 勢堅 雖擎 給餵戲煎賦, 葆擊曖 憮薹縑 氈蝗棲棻. \r\n<p> 啪滅: 啪滅擎 蜓ж朝 撰縑憮 葆徹 熱溼擊 ж堅 氈朝 葆徹餌殮棲棻. 斜曖 餵擎 葆擊曖 翕陴薹縑 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p> っ紫塭: っ紫塭朝 蜓ж朝 撰曖 ч鼻殮棲棻. 撰縑憮 儅�勒牉曌� в蹂и 僭勒曖 渠睡碟擎 斜喪蒂 鱔п 掘殮й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 斜喪朝 葆擊 磁翕薹縑 氈朝 摹雜濰縑憮 虜陳 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>瓊嬴陛獐虜и 夠菟:</font>\r\n<p> 唸癱濰: 葆擊曖 陴薹縑 氈朝 唸癱濰擎 捱攪陛 嶸橾ж啪 馨葛攪郭葬曖 唸癱蒂 ъ辨ж堅 氈朝 濰模殮棲棻. 檜夠縑憮朝 馨葛攪菟郭葬 嬴檜蠱檜釭 唳я纂蒂 副薑ж雖 彊堅 諄選 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p> �こ藝�: 捱攪曖 餵曖 陴憮薹縑 氈朝 �こ藝敻� 褒瞪 唳я檜 橈朝 馨葛攪菟曖 �こ藝� 嬪п 捱攪陛 撲纂и 匙殮棲棻. 葆擊 輿滲曖 跨蝶攪陛 傘鼠 鬼ж棻堅 儅陝ж朝 馨葛攪菟擎 罹晦縑憮 綠掖瞳 寰瞪ж啪 唳я纂蒂 橢擊 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>","helphntp-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>提示&重點︰王族（王子／公主）</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>背景：</font>\r\n<p>王子／公主的角色是王室的血脈，但是被判王否認了他們的繼承權。為了要擊敗冒牌者並宣稱你的長子繼承權，你的角色必須擊敗怪物獲得財富和力量，此外聚集對你忠誠的血盟。 \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>出發位置：</font>\r\n<p>王子／公主的角色在『說語島』上的村莊開始遊戲，你原本出生的地方是在亞丁王國對面，但為了逃避冒牌國王的軍隊，你旅行到了這個島上。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>遊戲初期：</font>\r\n<p>磨練軍事能力是對一位王子／公主開始收回王座的第一步。因此在遊戲初期，一位王子／公主必須專心擊敗在村莊周圍的怪物，並得到經驗點和物品，然後再找更有力的怪物來訓練。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>基本裝備：</font>\r\n<p>開始遊戲時，一位王子／公主會有一把匕首、皮革夾克、和二根蠟燭。按ＴＡＢ鍵或點一下像袋子一樣的小圖示<img src=\"#29\">就會出現道具清單。點一下道具清單，你就能使用蠟燭和匕首並穿上皮夾克，這時你也可以從視窗中檢視其他的物品。</p> \r\n<p>蠟燭在晚上用來提供照明。只要在裝備視窗裡點一下蠟燭的小圖示，就可以使用蠟燭了，不過在使用一段時間之後，蠟燭還是會消耗殆盡。\r\n<p>一個角色被怪物或其他的角色追殺的時候可能失去物品，所以請小心。 \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>遇見的人：</font>\r\n<p> 甘特：在說語島上的騎士學院的教師。他將會說明正確的活動路線，而且告訴你什麼是必須執行什麼任務。他的房子是由一座岩石的山挖成的一個洞窟，位於村莊的西北邊。\r\n<p> 吉倫：說語島上的一個魔法師，他的房子位於村莊的東南方。\r\n<p> 潘朵拉：說語島上的一個商人，你需要的每件事物幾乎都能向她購買，你能在村莊東北方的碼頭遇見她。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>可以去的地方： </font>\r\n<p> 競技場：位於村莊的南方，競技場是甘特允許在玩家之間的決鬥的唯一場所。在這裡，玩家可以不為物品或經驗點數擔憂而進行決鬥。\r\n<p>  訓練場：這個地方，位於甘特房子的西南方，被甘特用來訓練沒有很多實戰經驗的玩家。如果你認為靠近村莊的怪物是太強的話，那麼你可以在這比較安全的環境中獲得經驗點數。 \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphntp-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Hints&amp;Tips: Prince/Princess</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Background:</font>\r\n<p>Prince and Princess characters are those of royal blood, but who are denied their heritage by the Pretender-king. To defeat the Pretender and claim your birthright, your character must defeat monsters to obtain wealth and power, and also gather blood brothers loyal to your cause.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Starting location:</font>\r\n<p>Prince/Princess characters start play at the village on '說語島.' Your character's place of birth is the Kingdom of Aden, located across the sea. You have travelled to this island to elude the Pretender-king's forces. \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Early in the game:</font>\r\n<p>Honing one's martial abilities is the first step for a prince/princess to reclaiming the throne. Therefore, early in the game, a prince/princess must concentrate on defeating monsters around the village to receive experience points and items, and then seek out more powerful monsters.  Also, until you reach level 4, the Training Ground to the west of town is an excellent place to gain experience.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Basic equipment:</font>\r\n<p>A prince/princess starts the game with a dagger, a leather jacket, and two candles. The dagger and jacket may be equipped by clicking on the appropriate item within the Equipment window. The equipment window is shown by pressing the TAB key or clicking on the <font fg=ffffff>Bag-shaped icon</font><img src=\"#29\"> to the right side of the chat window.\r\n<p>Candles are used to provide illumination at night. To use a candle, click on the candle icon within the equipment window. Candles burn out after being used for some time.\r\n<p>You may drop items when killed by monsters or other characters, so be careful.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>People to meet:</font>\r\n<p> Gunter: The instructor at the academy for knights on the 說語島. He will explain about current events, and tell you what tasks you must perform. His house, a cavern dug out of a rocky mountain, is located west of the village.\r\n<p> Gereng: A magician of the 說語島. His house is located southeast of the village.\r\n<p> Pandora: A merchant of the 說語島. Almost everything you need can be bought from her. You can meet Pandora near the docks northeast of the village.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Places to go:</font>\r\n<p> Arena: Located south of the village, the Arena is the only place Gunter allows duels between characters. Here, characters may fight without worrying about items or experience points.\r\n<p> Training  ground: This place, located southwest of Gunter's house, was made by Gunter to train characters without much real-life combat experiences. If you think the mosters near the village are too powerful, then you can obtain experience points in this relatively safe environment.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphntp-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Hints&amp;Tips: Prince/Princess</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Background:</font>\r\n<p>Prince and Princess characters are those of royal blood, but who are denied their heritage by the Pretender-king. To defeat the Pretender and claim your birthright, your character must defeat monsters to obtain wealth and power, and also gather blood brothers loyal to your cause.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Starting location:</font>\r\n<p>Prince/Princess characters start play at the village on '說語島.' Your character's place of birth is the Kingdom of Aden, located across the sea. You have travelled to this island to elude the Pretender-king's forces. \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Early in the game:</font>\r\n<p>Honing one's martial abilities is the first step for a prince/princess to reclaiming the throne. Therefore, early in the game, a prince/princess must concentrate on defeating monsters around the village to receive experience points and items, and then seek out more powerful monsters.  Also, until you reach level 4, the Training Ground to the west of town is an excellent place to gain experience.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Basic equipment:</font>\r\n<p>A prince/princess starts the game with a dagger, a leather jacket, and two candles. The dagger and jacket may be equipped by clicking on the appropriate item within the Equipment window. The equipment window is shown by pressing the TAB key or clicking on the <font fg=ffffff>Bag-shaped icon</font><img src=\"#29\"> to the right side of the chat window.\r\n<p>Candles are used to provide illumination at night. To use a candle, click on the candle icon within the equipment window. Candles burn out after being used for some time.\r\n<p>You may drop items when killed by monsters or other characters, so be careful.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>People to meet:</font>\r\n<p> Gunter: The instructor at the academy for knights on the 說語島. He will explain about current events, and tell you what tasks you must perform. His house, a cavern dug out of a rocky mountain, is located west of the village.\r\n<p> Gereng: A magician of the 說語島. His house is located southeast of the village.\r\n<p> Pandora: A merchant of the 說語島. Almost everything you need can be bought from her. You can meet Pandora near the docks northeast of the village.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Places to go:</font>\r\n<p> Arena: Located south of the village, the Arena is the only place Gunter allows duels between characters. Here, characters may fight without worrying about items or experience points.\r\n<p> Training  ground: This place, located southwest of Gunter's house, was made by Gunter to train characters without much real-life combat experiences. If you think the mosters near the village are too powerful, then you can obtain experience points in this relatively safe environment.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helphntp-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>�爩�&amp;そ: 諾濠/奢輿</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>撲薑:</font>\r\n<p>諾濠/奢輿 馨葛攪朝 賅舒 '奩諾'檜塭朝 襄營縑 曖п 濠褐曖 薑渡и ⑸鱔擊 檣薑嫡雖 跤ж堅 氈朝 餌塋菟殮棲棻. 奩諾擊 僭葬纂堅 濠褐曖 薑渡и 掏葬蒂 瓊晦 嬪п 諾濠/奢輿 馨葛攪朝 跨蝶攪蒂 黴纂ж堅 營骯擊 賅嬴 蝶蝶煎曖 ��擊 酈辦朝 иら, 濠褐擊 紫諦還 ⑸裊擊 賅嬴撿虜 м棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>衛濛 濰模:</font>\r\n<p>諾濠/奢輿 馨葛攪陛 籀擠 Ы溯檜蒂 衛濛ж朝 濰模朝 '蜓ж朝 撰'檜塭朝 撰曖 葆擊殮棲棻. 馨葛攪曖 獄楚 堅щ擎 夥棻 勒傘曖 '嬴筆 諾措'檜貊, ⑷營朝 奩諾曖 槳擊 Яп 檜夠縑 Я褐п 氈朝 匙殮棲棻. \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>啪歜 蟾奩曖 �撣�:</font>\r\n<p>諾濠/奢輿朝 濠褐曖 諾措擊 腎瓊晦 嬪и 贖 翎擊 檜瑞晦 嬪п 辦摹 蝶蝶煎 鬼и ��擊 陛韓 в蹂陛 氈蝗棲棻. 斜溢晦 陽僥縑 諾濠朝 啪歜 蟾奩縑 葆擊 輿滲縑 氈朝 跨蝶攪蒂 黴纂ж罹 唳я纂諦 嬴檜蠱擊 橢橫 渦 鬼и 跨蝶攪蒂 瓊嬴 釭憮朝 婁薑擊 腎ヴ檜ж啪 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>晦獄 濰綠:</font>\r\n<p>諾濠/奢輿朝 籀擠 Ы溯檜蒂 衛濛й 陽 欽匐婁 陛避 營韃, 斜葬堅 曄蟾 萃擊 陛雖堅 衛濛м棲棻. 欽匐婁 營韃擎 TAP酈蒂 援腦剪釭 瓣た 殮溘璽 螃艇薹曖 <font fg=ffffff>輿該棲 賅曄曖 嬴檜夔</font><img src=\"#29\">擊 贗葛ж賊 釭螃朝 模雖ヶ璽縑憮 п渡 嬴檜蠱擊 贗葛ж罹 濰綠й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>曄蟾朝 嫘檜 腎歷擊 陽 橫菸擊 嫩�鰼� 嬪п 餌辨ж貊, 餌辨徹擎 模雖ヶ 璽縑憮 曄蟾 嬴檜夔擊 渦綰 贗葛ж賊 腌棲棻. 曄蟾朝 橾薑 衛除 餌辨ж賊 橈橫螳 幗董棲棻.\r\n<p>馨葛攪陛 惚僭檜釭 棻艇 馨葛攪縑 曖п 避擊 陽 濰綠蒂 雲橫嗑葬朝 唳辦陛 氈戲嘎煎 輿曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>瓊嬴陛獐虜и 餌塋菟:</font>\r\n<p> 捱攪: 捱攪朝 蜓ж朝 撰縑憮 晦餌 曄撩模蒂 遴艙ж堅 氈朝 餌塋殮棲棻. 斜朝 馨葛攪縑啪 ⑷營曖 鼻�窕� 撲貲п 輿堅, й 橾擊 薯衛п 鄹棲棻. 斜曖 餵擎 給骯擊 勢堅 雖擎 給餵戲煎賦, 葆擊曖 憮薹縑 氈蝗棲棻. \r\n<p> 啪滅: 啪滅擎 蜓ж朝 撰縑憮 葆徹 熱溼擊 ж堅 氈朝 葆徹餌殮棲棻. 斜曖 餵擎 葆擊曖 翕陴薹縑 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p> っ紫塭: っ紫塭朝 蜓ж朝 撰曖 ч鼻殮棲棻. 撰縑憮 儅�勒牉曌� в蹂и 僭勒曖 渠睡碟擎 斜喪蒂 鱔п 掘殮й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 斜喪朝 葆擊 磁翕薹縑 氈朝 摹雜濰縑憮 虜陳 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>瓊嬴陛獐虜и 夠菟:</font>\r\n<p> 唸癱濰: 葆擊曖 陴薹縑 氈朝 唸癱濰擎 捱攪陛 嶸橾ж啪 馨葛攪郭葬曖 唸癱蒂 ъ辨ж堅 氈朝 濰模殮棲棻. 檜夠縑憮朝 馨葛攪菟郭葬 嬴檜蠱檜釭 唳я纂蒂 副薑ж雖 彊堅 諄選 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p> �こ藝�: 捱攪曖 餵曖 陴憮薹縑 氈朝 �こ藝敻� 褒瞪 唳я檜 橈朝 馨葛攪菟曖 �こ藝� 嬪п 捱攪陛 撲纂и 匙殮棲棻. 葆擊 輿滲曖 跨蝶攪陛 傘鼠 鬼ж棻堅 儅陝ж朝 馨葛攪菟擎 罹晦縑憮 綠掖瞳 寰瞪ж啪 唳я纂蒂 橢擊 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>","helpitm-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>命令輔助說明：物品</p></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpitm0\">普通的</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpitm1\">職業限定專用物品 </a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpitm-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Item</p></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpitm0\">General</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpitm1\">Item Restrictions for Classes</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpitm-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Item</p></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpitm0\">General</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpitm1\">Item Restrictions for Classes</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpitm-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 Help: 嬴檜蠱</p></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpitm0\">橾奩</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpitm1\">贗楚蝶滌 餌辨 陛棟 嬴檜蠱</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpitm0-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>指令 說明：道具</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>撿道具:</font>\r\n<p>要撿道具，在要撿的道具上按滑鼠左鍵或用滑鼠拉到使用者身上及自己的道具視窗即可。\r\n<p>若幾個道具疊在一起時，按右鍵可選擇下一個道具。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>較多的金幣或箭想要全部拿取時，按下一次滑鼠左鍵即可。在對話窗輸入 <font fg=ffffff>'/getall'</font>執行後可以決定要撿起的數量。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>使用道具:</font>\r\n<p>若要使用身上的道具，在自己的道具視窗，在自己想要使用的道具上按兩下滑鼠左鍵即可。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>丟掉道具:</font>\r\n<p>若想丟掉不需要的道具，將道具用滑鼠拉到地上即可。 <br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>整理道具:</font>\r\n<p>將道具用滑鼠拉到最方便的位置即可。 <br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>給道具:</font>\r\n<p>若要把自己的道具給其他使用者，將道具用滑鼠拉到使用者身上即可。可藉由輸入“/receive on(off)”來決定別人是否可以給你道具。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>選擇多一點的道具:</font>\r\n<p>在道具視窗按著Shift選道具即可。可以一次把幾個道具丟掉或給其他使用者時使用。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>交換道具:</font>\r\n<p>若想交換道具，對著使用者請輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/trade'</font>即可。使用此指令在介面的左方顯示交換道具的視窗。此時請將把道具拉到上面的視窗，對方的道具會顯示於視窗的左下方。首先確認道具後在按OK鍵，若交換道具中有人離開或按Cancel鍵，交換動作會停止。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>使用熱鍵:</font>\r\n<p>使用F5到F8鍵來設定常用的道具。剛開始指定為<font fg=ffffff>F5</font>是'紅色藥水', <font fg=ffffff>F6</font>是'橙色藥水', <font fg=ffffff>F7</font>是'白色藥水', <font fg=ffffff>F8</font>是'翡翠藥水'。若想更改，請輸入 <font fg=ffffff>/F[5~8] [要指定的道具]</font>可行。例如想在F5鍵上使用烏木魔仗，請輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/F5 烏木魔仗'</font>即可。\r\n除此之外首先打開道具窗，在設定熱鍵欄的位置上把您要設定成熱鍵的<font fg=ffffff>道具拉到熱鍵欄</font>即可。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpitm\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpitm0-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Commands Help: Item</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Get item:</font>\r\n<p>Pick up an item from the map by clicking on the item, or use the mouse to drag the item onto\r\n your character or inventory window.\r\n<p>If there are several items at the same location, right click on them to select the next one.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can get 'mergeable' items such as adena and arrows with only a single click. To toggle this, type <font fg=ffffff>'/getall'</font> from the chat window.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Use item:</font>\r\n<p>To use an item from your inventory, double click on the item in your inventory window.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Drop item:</font>\r\n<p>To drop an item you own, drag the item to be dropped from the inventory window onto the map.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Sort items:</font>\r\n<p>Drag items to desired position within the inventory window.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Give item:</font>\r\n<p>To give an item you own to another character, drag item from your inventory window onto the target character.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Select multiple items:</font>\r\n<p>To select multiple items, click on the item while pressing the\r\n <font fg=ffffff>Shift key</font>. You can drop or give multiple items this way.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Item trade:</font>\r\n<p>In order to make a secure trade with another character, the two characters must first face each other. In this position type <font fg=ffffff>'/trade'</font>. When this is done a item trading window will appear on the left side of the game screen. Drag the item you want to give to the other character from your inventory to the upper window.  The items the other character is giving you appear in the lower window. Pressing 'OK', after examining the items, closes the deal.  If you press 'Cancel' or leave the game anytime during the transaction the trade is canceled.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Item Shortcut:</font>\r\n<p>You can use selected items without opening the item window by pressing F5 thru F8. Default items are red potions (healing) for F5, orange potions (extra healing) for F6, clear potions for F7, and cyan potions for F8. To change the assignment, type /F[5~8] [name of item] into the chat window.  For example, if you want to assign an ebony wand to F5, type '/F5 ebony wand'.\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpitm\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpitm0-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Commands Help: Item</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Get item:</font>\r\n<p>Pick up an item from the map by clicking on the item, or use the mouse to drag the item onto\r\n your character or inventory window.\r\n<p>If there are several items at the same location, right click on them to select the next one.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can get 'mergeable' items such as adena and arrows with only a single click. To toggle this, type <font fg=ffffff>'/getall'</font> from the chat window.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Use item:</font>\r\n<p>To use an item from your inventory, double click on the item in your inventory window.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Drop item:</font>\r\n<p>To drop an item you own, drag the item to be dropped from the inventory window onto the map.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Sort items:</font>\r\n<p>Drag items to desired position within the inventory window.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Give item:</font>\r\n<p>To give an item you own to another character, drag item from your inventory window onto the target character.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Select multiple items:</font>\r\n<p>To select multiple items, click on the item while pressing the\r\n <font fg=ffffff>Shift key</font>. You can drop or give multiple items this way.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Item trade:</font>\r\n<p>In order to make a secure trade with another character, the two characters must first face each other. In this position type <font fg=ffffff>'/trade'</font>. When this is done a item trading window will appear on the left side of the game screen. Drag the item you want to give to the other character from your inventory to the upper window.  The items the other character is giving you appear in the lower window. Pressing 'OK', after examining the items, closes the deal.  If you press 'Cancel' or leave the game anytime during the transaction the trade is canceled.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Item Shortcut:</font>\r\n<p>You can use selected items without opening the item window by pressing F5 thru F8. Default items are red potions (healing) for F5, orange potions (extra healing) for F6, clear potions for F7, and cyan potions for F8. To change the assignment, type /F[5~8] [name of item] into the chat window.  For example, if you want to assign an ebony wand to F5, type '/F5 ebony wand'.\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpitm\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpitm0-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 Help: 嬴檜蠱</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>嬴檜蠱 鄹晦:</font>\r\n<p>階縑 雲橫螳 氈朝 嬴檜蠱擊 鄹堅濠 ж賊, 斜 嬴檜蠱擊 贗葛ж剪釭 斜 嬴檜蠱擊 葆辦蝶煎 莊橫 濠褐曖 議葛攪釭 濠褐曖 嬴檜蠱 璽縑 場戲賊 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>罹楝 嬴檜蠱檜 и 濰模縑 啜藥 氈戲賊 螃艇薹 幗が擊 援腦賊 棻擠 嬴檜蠱檜 摹鷗腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴等釭釭 �香麆� 偽檜 僎藥 氈朝 嬴檜蠱擊 и廓曖 贗葛戲煎 醣擊 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/賅舒陛颶'</font> 檜塭堅 殮溘ж賊 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>嬴檜蠱 餌辨:</font>\r\n<p>陛雖堅 氈朝 嬴檜蠱擊 餌辨ж堅濠 ж賊, 濠褐曖 嬴檜蠱 璽縑憮 餌辨ж堅濠 ж朝 嬴檜蠱擊 渦綰 贗葛ж賊 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>嬴檜蠱 幗葬晦:</font>\r\n<p>陛雖堅 氈朝 嬴檜蠱擊 幗葬堅濠 ж賊, 嬴檜蠱 璽縑憮 幗葬堅濠 ж朝 嬴檜蠱擊 葆辦蝶煎 莊橫 階縑 場戲賊 腌棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>嬴檜蠱 薑葬:</font>\r\n<p>嬴檜蠱 璽 頂縑憮 嬴檜蠱菟擊 錳ж朝 嬪纂煎 莊橫 場戲賊 腌棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>嬴檜蠱 輿晦:</font>\r\n<p>陛雖堅 氈朝 嬴檜蠱擊 棻艇 議葛攪縑啪 輿堅濠 й 陽朝, 濠晦 嬴檜蠱 璽縑 氈朝 嬴檜蠱擊 鼻渠 議葛攪縑啪 莊橫 場戲賊 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>罹楝 嬴檜蠱 摹鷗:</font>\r\n<p>嬴檜蠱 璽縑憮 罹楝 嬴檜蠱擊 摹鷗ж溥賊 Shift蒂 援艇 鼻鷓縑憮 嬴檜蠱擊 贗葛ж賊 腌棲棻. 檜 寞徹戲煎 罹楝偃曖 嬴檜蠱擊 и疏廓縑 幗葬剪釭 陴縑啪 還 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>僭勒曖 掖��:</font>\r\n<p>僭勒擊 棻艇 馨葛攪諦 寰瞪ж啪 掖�納炾簎� ж賊 剪楚ж堅濠 ж朝 馨葛攪諦 葆輿獄 鼻鷓縑憮 瓣た 殮溘璽縑 <font fg=ffffff>'/掖��'</font>檜塭堅 殮溘ж賊 腌棲棻. 檜 貲滄橫蒂 殮溘ж賊 啪歜 �飛橉� 謝難縑 嬴檜蠱 掖�紐Ⅷ� 釭顫陶棲棻. 掖�紐Ⅷ� 嶺薹縑 鼻渠寞縑啪 還 嬴檜蠱擊 濠褐曖 嬴檜蠱 璽縑憮 莊橫棻 場戲褊衛螃. 鼻渠寞檜 還 嬴檜蠱擎 掖�紐Ⅷ� 嬴楚薹縑 ル衛腌棲棻. 僭勒擊 �挫恉牮� �� OK 嬴檜夔擊 援腦衛賊 剪楚陛 謙猿腌棲棻. 剪楚醞 樹薯塭紫 Cancel 嬴檜夔擊 援腦剪釭 啪歜縑憮 釭陛賊 剪楚朝 醞雖腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>嬴檜蠱 欽蹴酈 餌辨:</font>\r\n<p>F5縑憮 F8梱雖曖 酈蒂 餌辨ж罹 ゎ模縑 濠輿 餌辨ж朝 嬴檜蠱擊 嬴檜蠱璽擊 翮雖 彊堅紫 ら葬ж啪 餌辨й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 籀擠縑朝 <font fg=ffffff>F5</font>陛 '說除 僭擒', <font fg=ffffff>F6</font>檜 '輿�� 僭擒', <font fg=ffffff>F7</font>檜 '蜈擎 僭擒', <font fg=ffffff>F8</font>檜 '綠鏃 僭擒'戲煎 雖薑腎橫 氈蝗棲棻. 檜匙擊 夥紱溥賊 瓣た 孺紫辦縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>/F[5~8] [雖薑ж堅濠 ж朝 嬴檜蠱]</font>擊 殮溘ж賊 腌棲棻. 蕨蒂 菟橫 F5幗が縑 廓偃 模�� 虞渠蒂 雖薑п憮 餌辨ж堅 談戲賊 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/F5 廓偃 模�� 虞渠'</font>塭堅 殮溘ж衛賊 腌棲棻.\r\n檜諼縑紫 嬴檜蠱璽擊 翱 �� п渡 欽蹴酈曖 嬪纂縑 <font fg=ffffff>陝 嬴檜蠱擊 莊橫棻 場朝 寞徹</font>戲煎 欽蹴酈 雖薑擊 й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpitm\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpitm1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>命令輔助說明：物品</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<body>\r\n<p>下列各項物品只有特定的階級可以使用。 \r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>王子／公主專用：</font>\r\n<p>王冠 \r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>騎士專用：</font>\r\n<p>貝卡合金、騎士面甲、狂戰士斧、塔盾、銀騎士之盾、治癒的魔法頭盔、敏捷的魔法頭盔、力量的魔法頭盔、雙手劍、屠龍劍\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>妖精專用：</font>\r\n<p>艾爾穆的祝福\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>魔法師專用：</font>\r\n<p>巫術之棍，美基之棍、瑪那魔杖\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>魔法師／妖精和騎士專用：</font>\r\n<p>精靈盾牌\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>妖精和魔法師專用：</font>\r\n<p>精靈皮盔\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>騎士和妖精專用：</font>\r\n<p>精靈金屬盔甲、腕甲、十字弓、細劍 \r\n<br><br><font fg=ffffaf>王子／公主和妖精專用：</font>\r\n<p>獨角獸的角\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>王子／公主和騎士專用：</font>\r\n<p>雙手劍、露西錘、巴迪須、戟、槍、露西錘、摩具、金屬盔甲、青銅盔甲、鱗甲、皮甲\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>每個階級都能使用的物品，不在此列。 \r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpitm\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpitm1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Item</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<body>\r\n<p>The following items can be used by only specified classes.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Prince/Princess Only:</font>\r\n<p>Crown\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Knight Only:</font>\r\n<p>Knight Visor, Claymore, Berserker Axe, Tower Shield, Bec De Corbin, Tsurugi, Shield of Silver Knight, Two-handed Shield, Dragon Slayer\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Elf Only:</font>\r\n<p>Yumi, Bless of Elm\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Wizard Only:</font>\r\n<p>All Staffs\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Elf and Wizard Only:</font>\r\n<p>Elven Leather Helm\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Prince/Princess and Elf Only:</font>\r\n<p>Unicorn Horn\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Prince/Princess and Knight Only:</font>\r\n<p>Two Handed Sword, Bardiche, Bill-Guisarme, Halberd, Lance, Lucern Hammer, Voulge, Plate Mail, Splint Mail, Banded Mail, Great Axe, Paladin Sword, Paladin Mail, Axe of Destruction, Bronze Plate Mail,Plate Mail, Great Sword\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Prince/Princess, Elf, and Knight Only:</font>\r\n<p>Katana, Battle Axe, Fauchard, Glaive, Guisarme, War Hammer, Morning Star, Partisan, Ranseur, Trident, Crystal Plate Mail, Chain Mail, Oricsh Chain Mail, Scale Mail, Large Shield, Dawrvish Round Shield, Shield of Reflection, Chain Mail of Magic Resistance, Damascus Sword, Elven Breast Plate, Elven Chain Mail\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Wizard, Elf and Knight Only:</font>\r\n<p> Elven Shield\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>All classes can use the items not listed here.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpitm\">\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","helpitm1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Item</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<body>\r\n<p>The following items can be used by only specified classes.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Prince/Princess Only:</font>\r\n<p>Crown\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Knight Only:</font>\r\n<p>Knight Visor, Claymore, Berserker Axe, Tower Shield, Bec De Corbin, Tsurugi, Shield of Silver Knight, Two-handed Shield, Dragon Slayer\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Elf Only:</font>\r\n<p>Yumi, Bless of Elm\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Wizard Only:</font>\r\n<p>All Staffs\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Elf and Wizard Only:</font>\r\n<p>Elven Leather Helm\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Prince/Princess and Elf Only:</font>\r\n<p>Unicorn Horn\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Prince/Princess and Knight Only:</font>\r\n<p>Two Handed Sword, Bardiche, Bill-Guisarme, Halberd, Lance, Lucern Hammer, Voulge, Plate Mail, Splint Mail, Banded Mail, Great Axe, Paladin Sword, Paladin Mail, Axe of Destruction, Bronze Plate Mail,Plate Mail, Great Sword\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Prince/Princess, Elf, and Knight Only:</font>\r\n<p>Katana, Battle Axe, Fauchard, Glaive, Guisarme, War Hammer, Morning Star, Partisan, Ranseur, Trident, Crystal Plate Mail, Chain Mail, Oricsh Chain Mail, Scale Mail, Large Shield, Dawrvish Round Shield, Shield of Reflection, Chain Mail of Magic Resistance, Damascus Sword, Elven Breast Plate, Elven Chain Mail\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Wizard, Elf and Knight Only:</font>\r\n<p> Elven Shield\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>All classes can use the items not listed here.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpitm\">\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","helpitm1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 Help: 嬴檜蠱</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<body>\r\n<p>陝 贗楚蝶滌煎 濰綠й 熱 氈朝 濰綠朝 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>諾濠/奢輿虜 噩 熱 氈朝 匙:</font>\r\n<p>賊盟婦\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>晦餌虜 噩 熱 氈朝 匙:</font>\r\n<p>晦餌曖 賊骨,葆徹曖 癱掘: 纂嶸,葆徹曖 癱掘: 褐樓,葆徹曖 癱掘: ��,餌陝 寞ぬ,擎晦餌曖 寞ぬ,惜瞪餌曖 紫郭,だ嬴斜葬螃曖 濰璽,漱萄囀綴\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>蹂薑虜 噩 熱 氈朝 匙:</font>\r\n<p>縣葷曖 蹴犒\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>蹂薑婁 葆徹餌虜 噩 熱 氈朝 匙:</font>\r\n<p>蹂薑褶 陛避 癱掘\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>晦餌諦 蹂薑虜 噩 熱 氈朝 匙:</font>\r\n<p>蹂薑褶 っ旎 骨褡,�� 埤鼠,觼煎蝶 爾辦,溯檜Я橫 \r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>諾濠/奢輿諦 晦餌虜 噩 熱 氈朝 匙:</font>\r\n<p>っ旎 骨褡,羶翕 っ旎 骨褡,嘐棺 骨褡,塑 骨褡,渠⑽ 紫郭,夥腦蛤膠,網敝餌葷,晦煽璽,瑞摹п該,嘐棺璽,曄槳匐\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>諾濠/奢輿諦 晦餌, 蹂薑檜 噩 熱 氈朝 匙:</font>\r\n<p>餌蝸 骨褡,螃觼褶 餌蝸 骨褡,綠棺 骨褡,蹂薑褶 �銊�,蹂薑褶 餌蝸 骨褡,葆徹 寞橫 餌蝸 骨褡,贖 寞ぬ,陪爵檜褶 菅斬 寞ぬ,奩餌 寞ぬ,錶п該,瞪癱 紫郭,賅棚蝶顫,鳴雖璽,創擎 璽,敝餌葷,だ腦じ濤,ん穩萄,塢憮,橾獄紫,棻葆蝶醴蝶 匐\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>葆徹餌虜 噩 熱 氈朝 匙:</font>\r\n<p>葆溘曖 雖な檜,葆徹餌曖 雖な檜\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>蹂薑婁 葆徹餌,晦餌陛 噩 熱 氈朝 匙:</font>\r\n<p>蹂薑褶 寞ぬ\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>罹晦縑 釭諦 氈雖 彊擎 鼠晦/寞橫掘朝 晦獄瞳戲煎 援掘釭 餌辨й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpitm\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helplng-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>命令輔助說明：語言</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n『天堂』除了中文外還支援英文、韓文和日文。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>安裝英文－韓文：</font>\r\n<p>\r\n要安裝英文－韓文的輸入模式，按 <font fg=ffffff>空白</font> 鍵同時按 <font fg=ffffff>ＳＨＩＦＴ</font> 鍵。小圖示<img src=\"#41\"> 會顯示英文或是韓文輸入模式 <img src=\"#42\"> 。 \r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>日文輸入：</font>\r\n<p>\r\n日文輸入只有在日文視窗中可用。小圖示 <img src=\"#328\"> 會顯示日文輸入模式。如果你要輸入韓文，要按 <font fg=ffffff>Ｆ２ </font> 鍵。 \r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>日文顯示：</font>\r\n<p>\r\n如果你不是使用日文視窗，但是你想要讀日文，你需要安裝日文字型。你能在  <font fg=ffffff>http://lineage.ncsoft.co.kr/</font>。\r\n在其中的 <font fg=ffffff>ＬＩＮＥＡＧＥ資源</font> 區段和點選 <font fg=ffffff>ＭＳ多語系支援為ＩＥ</font>就可以下載它。或者請到微軟的網站去下載。 \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>韓文輸入方法 </font>\r\n<p>有二個韓文輸入方法。３設定表示使用者可以打入 <font fg=ffffff>“/3set”</font> 並從交談視窗使用３組合鍵盤。切換到 2 組合則請打入 <font fg=ffffff>“/2set”</font>。 \r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>安裝另一個語言版本 </font>\r\n<p>Lineage 設定的語言跟你的視窗語言一樣（如果你使用 Windows95的英文版本，那麼 lineage 所有系統訊息會以英文顯示） 但是如果你更改內定的語言設定，輸入“/lang Chinese”、“/lang korean”、“/lang japanese”或“/lang english”去分別地更換遊戲的語言設定成中文、韓文、日文或英文。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","helplng-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Language</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nLineage currently supports English, Korean, and Japanese.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Toggle English-Korean:</font>\r\n<p>\r\nTo toggle English-Korean input mode, press the <font fg=ffffff>Space</font> key while pressing the <font fg=ffffff>Shift</font> key. The icon <img src=\"#41\"> represents English input mode and <img src=\"#42\"> represents Korean.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Japanese Input:</font>\r\n<p>\r\nJapanese input is available only in Japanese Windows. The icon <img src=\"#328\"> represents Japanese input mode. If you want Korean input, press the <font fg=ffffff>F2</font> key.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Japanese Display:</font>\r\n<p>\r\nIf you are not using Japanese Windows but you want to read Japanese, you need to install Japanese fonts. You can download them at <font fg=ffffff>http://lineage.ncsoft.co.kr/</font>.\r\nGo to the <font fg=ffffff>Lineage Resource</font> section and click on <font fg=ffffff>MS multi language support for IE</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Korean Input Methods</font>\r\n<p>There are two Korean input methods. 3 set users may type <font fg=ffffff>'/3set'</font> from the chatting window to use 3 set keyboard. Switch to 2 set by typing <font fg=ffffff>'/2set'</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Toggle to another language version</font>\r\n<p>Lineage sets its language setting to the same language as your Windows is set up to use (for instance, if you use english version of Windows95, then lineage will display all system messages in english). But if you change this default language setting, type '/lang korean' ,'/lang japanese' or '/lang english' to change the game's language setting to korean, japanese or english, respectively.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helplng-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Language</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nLineage currently supports English, Korean, and Japanese.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Toggle English-Korean:</font>\r\n<p>\r\nTo toggle English-Korean input mode, press the <font fg=ffffff>Space</font> key while pressing the <font fg=ffffff>Shift</font> key. The icon <img src=\"#41\"> represents English input mode and <img src=\"#42\"> represents Korean.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Japanese Input:</font>\r\n<p>\r\nJapanese input is available only in Japanese Windows. The icon <img src=\"#328\"> represents Japanese input mode. If you want Korean input, press the <font fg=ffffff>F2</font> key.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Japanese Display:</font>\r\n<p>\r\nIf you are not using Japanese Windows but you want to read Japanese, you need to install Japanese fonts. You can download them at <font fg=ffffff>http://lineage.ncsoft.co.kr/</font>.\r\nGo to the <font fg=ffffff>Lineage Resource</font> section and click on <font fg=ffffff>MS multi language support for IE</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Korean Input Methods</font>\r\n<p>There are two Korean input methods. 3 set users may type <font fg=ffffff>'/3set'</font> from the chatting window to use 3 set keyboard. Switch to 2 set by typing <font fg=ffffff>'/2set'</font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Toggle to another language version</font>\r\n<p>Lineage sets its language setting to the same language as your Windows is set up to use (for instance, if you use english version of Windows95, then lineage will display all system messages in english). But if you change this default language setting, type '/lang korean' ,'/lang japanese' or '/lang english' to change the game's language setting to korean, japanese or english, respectively.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helplng-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 紫遺蜓: 樹橫</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n葬棲雖朝 ⑷營 и措橫, 艙橫, 橾獄橫,醞措橫蒂 雖錳ж堅 氈蝗棲棻0.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>и艙 瞪��:</font>\r\n<p>\r\nи艙 瞪�素� <font fg=ffffff>Shift</font>蒂 援艇 瓣 <font fg=ffffff>Space</font>蒂 援腦賊 腌棲棻.\r\n<img src=\"#41\"> 嬴檜夔擎 艙僥 鼻鷓蒂 <img src=\"#42\"> 嬴檜夔擎 и旋 鼻鷓蒂 釭顫鹿棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>橾橫 殮溘:</font>\r\n<p>\r\n橾橫 殮溘擎 ⑷營 橾獄橫 孺紫辦縑憮虜 陛棟м棲棻. <img src=\"#328\"> 嬴檜夔檜 橾獄橫 殮溘 鼻鷓蒂 釭顫鹿棲棻.\r\n橾橫 殮溘 鼻鷓縑憮 и措橫 殮溘戲煎 滲�納牁襄� <font fg=ffffff>F2</font>酈蒂 援腦賊 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>醞措橫 殮溘:</font>\r\n<p>\r\n醞措橫 殮溘擎 ⑷營 醞措橫 孺紫辦縑憮虜 陛棟м棲棻.\r\n醞措橫 殮溘 鼻鷓縑憮 и措橫 殮溘戲煎 滲�納牁襄� <font fg=ffffff>F2</font>酈蒂 援腦賊 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>橾獄橫 ル衛:</font>\r\n<p>\r\n橾獄橫 孺紫辦蒂 餌辨ж堅 氈雖 彊雖虜 橾獄橫蒂 檗堅 談棻賊 橾獄橫 アお蒂 撲纂п撿 м棲棻.\r\n橾獄橫 アお朝 <font fg=ffffff>http://lineage.ncsoft.co.kr/</font>曖 <font fg=ffffff>Lineage Resource</font>縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>MS multi language support for IE</font>蒂 贗葛ж賊 棻遴嫡嬴 撲纂й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>酈爾萄 瞪��</font>\r\n<p>3弊衝 餌辨濠朝 瓣た璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/3set'</font>檜塭堅 殮溘ж賊 3弊衝 酈爾萄 撮た擊 餌辨й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 2弊衝 撮た擊 餌辨ж堅 談戲賊 <font fg=ffffff>'/2set'</font>檜塭堅 殮溘ж賊 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>樹橫 滲�� 貲滄</font>\r\n<p>Lineage縑憮朝 晦獄瞳戲煎 install腎橫 氈朝 Windows曖 樹橫縑 評塭 啪歜 衛蝶蠱 頂曖 賅萇 樹橫蒂 ル衛м棲棻(闊, и旋 Windows縑憮朝 и旋煎, 艙僥 Windows縑憮朝 艙橫煎 ル衛腌棲棻). \r\n<p>檜蒂 滲�納炱� 嬪п憮朝 瓣た 殮溘 璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/樹橫 艙橫'</font> �分� <font fg=ffffff>'/樹橫 橾橫'</font> �分� <font fg=ffffff>'/樹橫 醞措橫'</font> 塭 殮溘ж賊 腌棲棻. 棻衛 и旋 ル衛 賅萄煎 瞪�納炱� 嬪п憮朝 <font fg=ffffff>'/樹橫 и措橫'</font>塭 殮溘ж賊 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>命令輔助說明：魔法</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc0\">基本</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc1\">第一級</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc2\">第二級</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc3\">第三級</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc4\">第四級</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc5\">第五級</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc6\">第六級</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc7\">第七級</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc8\">第八級</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc9\">第九級</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc10\">第十級</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc11\">各種的</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Magic</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc0\">General Magic Use</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc1\">1st Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc2\">2nd Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc3\">3rd Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc4\">4th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc5\">5th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc6\">6th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc7\">7th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc8\">8th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc9\">9th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc10\">10th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc11\">Miscellaneous Notes</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Magic</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc0\">General Magic Use</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc1\">1st Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc2\">2nd Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc3\">3rd Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc4\">4th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc5\">5th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc6\">6th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc7\">7th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc8\">8th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc9\">9th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc10\">10th Level</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc11\">Miscellaneous Notes</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 Help: 葆徹</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc0\">橾奩</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc1\">1溯漣</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc2\">2溯漣</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc3\">3溯漣</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc4\">4溯漣</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc5\">5溯漣</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc6\">6溯漣</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc7\">7溯漣</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc8\">8溯漣</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc9\">9溯漣</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc10\">10溯漣</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpmgc11\">晦顫</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc0-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>輔助說明：一般魔法</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>術語：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>施法者</font>：使用法術的人。</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>施法者的魔法等級</font>：這數字指出施法者能學習的最高法術的等級。這施法者的階級和等級有關。每個階級有不同的上限。這些階級標示為，王族（王子／公主）是１／１０，妖精是１／８，魔法師則是１／４。</p>\r\n<p>而上限如下，王族（王子／公主）是２，妖精是６，而魔法師是１０。</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>魔力值（MP)</font>：魔力值顯示法術的力量（增加損害或成功的可能性）。這個數字通常因施法者的智力而定，但是也有一些物品能提昇這項數值。</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>魔攻（Sp）</font>：這是法術等級加上魔力值後，施法者的法術能展現的純粹的力量。你可以在法術視窗上查看這個數字。</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>魔防（MR）</font>：抗魔力讓你有能抵抗一些有害的法術，並且減低被施魔法後所造成的損害。基本上它因你的等級和智慧而定，也有能提升抗魔力的物品，其效用因物品材質不同而有不同的效果。</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>魔法種類</font>：有８種類型的法術：治癒、授予、攻擊、生命、死亡、控制、詛咒、變換。有一些物品能提升特定類型的魔法或抵銷它，怪物對特定類型魔法的抵抗力也有相生或相剋的關係。</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>魔法屬性</font>：魔法有四種屬性分別為風、水、火、土，如果對怪物使用相反屬性的魔法其效果會增加；但是如果屬性是相同的，則效果會減少。玩家的角色也能藉由使用特別的物品而有一個特定的屬性...</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>相性</font>：每個法術必為三個相性（正義、中立、邪惡）其中之一。每個法術能影響施法者的相性，當施法者的相性與法術的相近時，某些魔法也可以得到更大的效果。</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>光線魔法</font>：某些法術會讓施法者射擊一道光線，這些叫做光線魔法。而且某些物品（例如，反射的盾）就只對這個類型的法術有效。</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>魔法目標</font>：每個法術有它自己固定的目標對象，如果你不指出正確的目標位置，法術也不會有作用。\r\n<p> －施法者：只使用在施法者自己身上，所以不必指定目標。\r\n<p> －其他玩家（PC）：只影響螢幕裡的其他玩家角色。\r\n<p> －非玩家操縱角色（NPC）：只影響螢幕裡的那些怪物。 \r\n<p> －血盟：只影響同樣身為施法者的血盟的玩家角色。 \r\n<p> －敵人：影響那些怪物，或在戰爭中，與施法者所屬的血盟成員。\r\n<p> －物品：只影響施法者所帶的物品。 \r\n<p> －位置：只影響螢幕裡的某一點。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>魔法寶石：</font>\r\n<p>一些法術需要魔法寶石，需要的多少在每個法術的輔助說明中都有顯示。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>學習新的法術：</font>\r\n<p>在第３級以下的法術能向非玩家操縱角色魔法師購買而學會。你可以跟住在說語島的吉倫學習，當然在此之前，你必須要有足夠的等級才能學習那些法術。\r\n<p>第４級以上的法術就能從魔法書中學習了。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc0-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: General Magic Use</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Terms:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Caster</font>: The person casting the spell. In this case, probably you, unless you're a Knight - in which case you should find the help file on hitting monsters with pointy things.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Spell Level of the Caster</font>: The number indicates the highest level of spells the caster can learn, and depends on the class and level of the caster. This level increases 1/10 levels for Prince/Princess, 1/8 for Elves, and 1/4 for Wizards.</p>\r\n<p>There is also an upper Spell Level limit per class:  Princes max out at spell level 2, Elves at 6, and Wizards at 10.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Magic Bonus</font>: The magic bonus increases power of the spell(i.e increasing damage or success probability). This number usually depends on the caster's Intelligence. But there are some items which can raise the magic bonus.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Magic Power(Sp Power)</font>: This is the Spell Level + Magic Bonus which shows the net power of caster's spell. You can check this number at the spell window.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Magic Resistance(MR)</font>: Magic Resistance gives you the power to resist harmful spells and also reduces the damage inflicted by magic. Basically it depends on the level and wisdom. There are also items which can raise the magic resistance.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Magic Type</font>: There are 8 types of spells: Heal, Bestow, Attack, Life, Death, Control, Curse, Transform. Some items raise one specific type of magic or negates it. There are also monsters who are more or less resistant to a specific type of magic.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Attribute of Magic</font>: Some spells have one of four attributes (Fire, Earth, Air, Water). The power of magic increases if used on the monster with the opposite attribute. But decreases if the attribute is the same. Player characters can also have a specific attribute by using special items.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Alignment of Magic</font>: Each spell belongs to one of three alignment (Lawful, Neutral, Chaotic). Each spells can affect the caster's alignment also. And some spells gain more power as the caster's alignment gets closer to them.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Beam Magic</font>: Some spells shoot a beam from the caster. These are called Beam Magic, and some items (i.e. Shield of Reflection) only affect this type of spells.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Target of Magic</font>: Every spells have it's own possible target. If you don't specify the correct target, the spell doesn't work.\r\n<p> - Caster: It only affects the caster. You don't have to specify the target.\r\n<p> - PC: It only affects the player character in the screen.\r\n<p> - NPC: It only affects the monsters in the screen.\r\n<p> - Pledge: It only affects the player character whose blood pledge is the same as caster.\r\n<p> - Enemy: It affects the monsters or the members of blood pledge which is at war with the caster's pledge.\r\n<p> - Item: It affects the item caster is carrying.\r\n<p> - Location: It affects the point in the screen.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Material Components:</font>\r\n<p>Some spells require magical gem. Required number is specified at the help for each spells.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Learning New Spells:</font>\r\n<p>The spells of 3rd level of below can be purchased from the NPC wizard. You can learn from Gereng who is living at the east of 說語島. Of course you have to be enough level to learn the spells.\r\n<p>The spells of 4th level or higher can be learned from the spellbooks.\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc0-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: General Magic Use</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Terms:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Caster</font>: The person casting the spell. In this case, probably you, unless you're a Knight - in which case you should find the help file on hitting monsters with pointy things.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Spell Level of the Caster</font>: The number indicates the highest level of spells the caster can learn, and depends on the class and level of the caster. This level increases 1/10 levels for Prince/Princess, 1/8 for Elves, and 1/4 for Wizards.</p>\r\n<p>There is also an upper Spell Level limit per class:  Princes max out at spell level 2, Elves at 6, and Wizards at 10.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Magic Bonus</font>: The magic bonus increases power of the spell(i.e increasing damage or success probability). This number usually depends on the caster's Intelligence. But there are some items which can raise the magic bonus.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Magic Power(Sp Power)</font>: This is the Spell Level + Magic Bonus which shows the net power of caster's spell. You can check this number at the spell window.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Magic Resistance(MR)</font>: Magic Resistance gives you the power to resist harmful spells and also reduces the damage inflicted by magic. Basically it depends on the level and wisdom. There are also items which can raise the magic resistance.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Magic Type</font>: There are 8 types of spells: Heal, Bestow, Attack, Life, Death, Control, Curse, Transform. Some items raise one specific type of magic or negates it. There are also monsters who are more or less resistant to a specific type of magic.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Attribute of Magic</font>: Some spells have one of four attributes (Fire, Earth, Air, Water). The power of magic increases if used on the monster with the opposite attribute. But decreases if the attribute is the same. Player characters can also have a specific attribute by using special items.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Alignment of Magic</font>: Each spell belongs to one of three alignment (Lawful, Neutral, Chaotic). Each spells can affect the caster's alignment also. And some spells gain more power as the caster's alignment gets closer to them.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Beam Magic</font>: Some spells shoot a beam from the caster. These are called Beam Magic, and some items (i.e. Shield of Reflection) only affect this type of spells.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Target of Magic</font>: Every spells have it's own possible target. If you don't specify the correct target, the spell doesn't work.\r\n<p> - Caster: It only affects the caster. You don't have to specify the target.\r\n<p> - PC: It only affects the player character in the screen.\r\n<p> - NPC: It only affects the monsters in the screen.\r\n<p> - Pledge: It only affects the player character whose blood pledge is the same as caster.\r\n<p> - Enemy: It affects the monsters or the members of blood pledge which is at war with the caster's pledge.\r\n<p> - Item: It affects the item caster is carrying.\r\n<p> - Location: It affects the point in the screen.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Material Components:</font>\r\n<p>Some spells require magical gem. Required number is specified at the help for each spells.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Learning New Spells:</font>\r\n<p>The spells of 3rd level of below can be purchased from the NPC wizard. You can learn from Gereng who is living at the east of 說語島. Of course you have to be enough level to learn the spells.\r\n<p>The spells of 4th level or higher can be learned from the spellbooks.\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc0-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 葆徹 橾奩</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>葆徹 辨橫 撲貲:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>獎濠</font>: 葆徹擊 餌辨ж朝 餌塋擊 蜓м棲棻.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>獎濠曖 葆徹 溯漣</font>: 獎濠陛 ⑷營 賃 溯漣梱雖曖 葆徹擊 寡辦堅 餌辨й 熱 氈朝陛蒂 釭顫鹿棲棻. 葆徹 溯漣擎 溯漣婁 桶擎 翱婦檜 氈戲貊, 陝 贗楚蝶葆棻 溯漣縑 評艇 葆徹 溯漣曖 鼻蝓睦檜 棻落棲棻. 諾濠/奢輿朝 衙 10溯漣葆棻, 蹂薑擎 衙 8溯漣葆棻, 葆徹餌朝 衙 4溯漣葆棻 葆徹 溯漣檜 1噶 隸陛м棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>傳 陝 贗楚蝶 葆棻 葆徹 溯漣曖 鼻и檜 氈蝗棲棻. 諾濠/奢輿朝 2溯漣, 蹂薑擎 6溯漣, 葆徹餌朝 10溯漣梱雖曖 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 晦餌朝 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 橈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>葆徹 爾傘蝶</font>: 檜 熱纂陛 堪戲賊 賅萇 謙盟曖 葆徹擊 餌辨й 陽縑 嶸葬(爾棻 號擎 Яп蒂 遽棻萇雖, 葆徹檜 勘萵 �捕�檜 堪嬴霞棻萇雖)м棲棻. 葆徹 爾傘蝶朝 晦獄瞳戲煎 獎濠曖 INT陛 堪擊 熱煙 堪蝗棲棻. 檜 熱纂蒂 堪罹輿朝 嬴檜蠱 蛔紫 襄營м棲棻.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>葆溘(MgPwr)</font>: 檜 熱纂朝 葆徹 溯漣 + 葆徹 爾傘蝶煎賦, 獎濠曖 識м瞳檣 葆徹曖 鬼л擊 釭顫鹿棲棻. 檜 熱纂朝 葆徹璽縑憮 �挫恉� 熱 氈戲貊, 檜 熱纂陛 堪擊 熱煙 葆徹擊 餌辨ж朝等 嶸葬п 餵棲棻.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>葆徹 盪о(MR)</font>: 檜 熱纂陛 堪戲賊 п煎遴 葆徹檜 勘葬晦 橫滑啪 腎堅, 等嘐雖 葆徹擊 蜃嬴紫 瞳擎 等嘐雖虜擊 殮啪 腌棲棻. 晦獄瞳戲煎 獎濠曖 溯漣婁 WIS陛 堪擊 熱煙 葆徹 盪о溘檜 堪蝗棲棻. 檜 熱纂蒂 堪罹輿朝 嬴檜蠱 蛔紫 襄營м棲棻.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>葆徹曖 謙盟</font>: 葆徹縑朝 纂猿, 睡罹, 奢問, 模儅, 避擠, 褻濛, 盪輿, 滲�倣� 8陛雖 謙盟陛 氈蝗棲棻. 嬴檜蠱 醞縑朝 か薑 謙盟曖 葆徹擊 鬼ж啪 ж剪釭, 傳 か薑 謙盟曖 葆徹擊 鼠�褥亳藷偌� 匙菟檜 氈戲貊, 跨蝶攪 醞縑紫 か薑 謙盟曖 葆徹縑 擒ж剪釭 鬼и 匙菟檜 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>葆徹曖 樓撩</font>: 葆徹 醞縑朝 僭, 碳, 渠雖, 夥塋 醞 ж釭曖 樓撩擊 陛雖朝 匙檜 氈蝗棲棻. 樓撩擊 陛雖朝 葆徹擊 奩渠 樓撩擊 陛雖朝 跨蝶攪縑啪 餌辨ж賊 �膩�陛 躓棲棻. 奩渠煎 偽擎 樓撩曖 跨蝶攪縑啪 餌辨ж賊 �膩�陛 還橫蛙棲棻(僭婁 碳擎 憮煎 奩渠, 渠雖諦 夥塋擎 憮煎 奩渠 樓撩殮棲棻). PC紫 嬴檜蠱蛔縑 曖п 樓撩擊 陛雖啪 腎朝 唳辦陛 氈蝗棲棻. </p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>葆徹曖 撩щ</font>: 葆徹縑朝 Lawful, Neutral, Chaotic曖 撮陛雖 撩щ檜 氈蝗棲棻. 陝陝曖 撩щ曖 葆徹擊 餌辨ж賊 斜 葆徹曖 葆徹 溯漣曖 薯培虜躑 獎濠曖 撩щ縑 艙щ擊 嘐蘑棲棻. 撩щ檜 氈朝 葆徹 醞縑朝 獎濠曖 撩щ檜 斜薹戲煎 鬼й 熱煙 嬪溘檜 鬼п雖朝 謙盟曖 匙菟檜 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>惜摹 葆徹</font>: 葆徹 醞縑朝 獎濠煎睡攪 惜摹 ⑽鷓煎 釭陛朝 謙盟陛 氈蝗棲棻. 檜楝и 葆徹擊 '惜摹⑽ 葆徹'檜塭堅 睡腦貊, 檜楝и ⑽鷓曖 葆徹縑 艙щ擊 輿朝 嬴檜蠱 蛔(奩餌 寞ぬ 偽擎)檜 襄營м棲棻.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>葆徹曖 渠鼻</font>: 賅萇 葆徹縑朝 渠鼻檜 氈蝗棲棻. 薑�旁� 渠鼻擊 雖薑ж雖 彊戲賊 葆徹擎 薯渠煎 嫦翕ж雖 彊蝗棲棻. 葆徹曖 渠鼻縑朝 棻擠婁 偽擎 匙檜 氈蝗棲棻:\r\n<p> - 獎濠: 葆徹擊 餌辨ж朝 PC 濠褐縑啪虜 艙щ擊 嘐耀棻\r\n<p> - PC: ⑷營 �飛橦� 襄營ж朝 PC縑啪 艙щ擊 嘐耀棻.\r\n<p> - NPC: ⑷營 �飛橦� 襄營ж朝 跨蝶攪縑啪 艙щ擊 嘐耀棻.\r\n<p> - ⑸裊錳: ⑷營 �飛橦� 襄營ж朝 PC醞 獎濠曖 ⑸裊錳檣 餌塋(菟)縑啪 艙щ擊 嘐耀棻.\r\n<p> - 瞳: ⑷營 �飛橦� 襄營ж朝 跨蝶攪釭 瞪爵醞檣 鼻渠 ⑸裊曖 PC縑啪 艙щ擊 嘐耀棻.\r\n<p> - 嬴檜蠱: 獎濠陛 陛雖堅 氈朝 嬴檜蠱縑 艙щ擊 嘐耀棻.\r\n<p> - 濰模: 渠睡碟 �飛� 頂曖 и 薄檜棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>葆徹 營猿:</font>\r\n<p>葆徹 醞縑朝 '葆溘曖 給'檜塭 碳葬辦朝 葆徹曖 營猿陛 氈橫撿 餌辨й 熱 氈朝 匙菟檜 氈蝗棲棻. в蹂и 璋濠朝 陝 葆徹曖 help縑 貲衛腎橫 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>葆徹 寡辦晦:</font>\r\n<p>3溯漣梱雖曖 葆徹擎 薑п霞 濰模縑 氈朝 葆徹餌 NPC煎睡攪 絲擊 輿堅 寡選 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 蜓ж朝 撰縑憮朝 撰曖 翕薹縑 氈朝 啪滅縑啪 陛賊 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 僭煩 濠晦陛 斜 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈朝 溯漣檜 腎橫撿虜 м棲棻.\r\n<p>4溯漣 檜鼻曖 葆徹擎 褐瞪縑 陛憮 陝 溯漣葆棻 薑п螳 氈朝 曖衝擊 纂瘀撿虜 寡選 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>輔助說明：第１級法術</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>初級治癒術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：大地、治癒\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：４／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個其他角色或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：些微地回復目標的體力，若用在不死身怪物上則可以造成傷害。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>日光術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：授予\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：４／０\r\n<p>期間：２小時\r\n<p>目標：施法者\r\n<p>效果：用咒文召喚光源，只要一段時間內有效。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>保護罩：</font>\r\n<p>類型：轉換\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：３／５\r\n<p>期間：３０分鐘\r\n<p>目標：施法者\r\n<p>效果：降低目標的防禦１點，但是效果不累積。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>光箭：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊、光線\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：３／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：藉由射擊魔法能源對目標施以小型損害。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>指定傳送：</font>\r\n<p>類型：控制\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：５／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：施法者\r\n<p>效果：傳送到任意的位置，但是施法者能用特別的物品『瞬間移動控制戒指』指定位置。\r\n\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","helpmgc1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 1st Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Heal:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Earth, Heal\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 4/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Restores target's hp slightly, and can also be used on Undead to inflict some damage.  Can save buying a lot of red potions initially.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Light:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 4/0\r\n<p>Duration: 2 hours\r\n<p>Target: Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Conjures up a magical light source for the duration.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Shield:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 3/5\r\n<p>Duration: 30 minutes\r\n<p>Target: Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Lowers your AC by 1 for the duration.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Energy Bolt:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Beam\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 3/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Inflicts damage on your target with magical energy...Zzzzt!  A great first spell to choose, this will be one of your most mana-efficient damage spells (at least against single enemies) for several spell levels.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Teleport:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 5/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Teleports to a nearby random location - or, if you can find a ring of teleport control, a caster-chosen location.  Great for escaping tough fights (like Shelobs)\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 1st Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Heal:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Earth, Heal\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 4/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Restores target's hp slightly, and can also be used on Undead to inflict some damage.  Can save buying a lot of red potions initially.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Light:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 4/0\r\n<p>Duration: 2 hours\r\n<p>Target: Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Conjures up a magical light source for the duration.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Shield:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 3/5\r\n<p>Duration: 30 minutes\r\n<p>Target: Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Lowers your AC by 1 for the duration.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Energy Bolt:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Beam\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 3/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Inflicts damage on your target with magical energy...Zzzzt!  A great first spell to choose, this will be one of your most mana-efficient damage spells (at least against single enemies) for several spell levels.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Teleport:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 5/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Teleports to a nearby random location - or, if you can find a ring of teleport control, a caster-chosen location.  Great for escaping tough fights (like Shelobs)\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 1溯漣 葆徹</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>��:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 渠雖, 纂猿\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 4/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC傳朝 NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻曖 HP蒂 褻旎 �蛹厭藷絕炴�. 欽 Undead縑啪 餌辨ж賊 奩渠煎 Яп蒂 還 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>塭檜お:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 睡罹\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 4/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 2衛除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠\r\n<p>�膩�: 雖樓衛除 翕寰 楠欐爾棻 嫩擎 惜錳擊 虜菟橫 鹿棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>褒萄:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 滲��\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 3/5\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 30碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻曖 AC蒂 1頂董棲棻. 欽 檜 葆徹曖 �膩�朝 醞犒腎雖 彊蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>縑傘雖 獐お:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問, 惜摹\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 3/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC�分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 牖熱и 葆徹 縑傘雖蒂 嫦餌ж罹 渠鼻縑啪 濛擎 Яп蒂 鄹棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>蘿葬んお:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 褻濛\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 5/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠\r\n<p>�膩�: 歜曖曖 濰模煎 蘿葬んお м棲棻. 欽, か熱и 嬴檜蠱檣 '牖除檜翕 褻謙 奩雖'蒂 濰雜и 鼻鷓縑憮 餌辨ж賊 濠褐檜 錳ж朝 夠戲煎 蘿葬んお й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc10-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>輔助說明：第１０級法術</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>創造魔法武器：</font>\r\n<p>類型：授予\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：２００／１００\r\n<p>期間：永久的\r\n<p>目標：施法者的一個武器\r\n<p>效果：將正常的武器變成＋１的魔法武器；不影響那些已經是魔法武器的武器。消耗１０個『魔法寶石』。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>流星雨：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊、火\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：７０／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：在螢幕的位置\r\n<p>效果：召喚從天空來的流星而且對目標的３個單元裡面的所有敵人施以極大的損害。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>反射之池：</font>\r\n<p>類型：控制\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：１００／２００\r\n<p>期間：５分鐘\r\n<p>目標：傳送書籤之一\r\n<p>效果：以自己的書籤為中心去觀看一個畫面的狀況，本魔法需要用到特定的道具。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>瞬間停止：</font>\r\n<p>類型：控制\r\n<p>相性：邪惡\r\n<p>魔力／體力：８０／５０\r\n<p>期間：３０秒\r\n<p>目標：在螢幕裡面的所有敵人\r\n<p>效果：有一定的機率麻痺螢幕上所有的怪物，使之無法移動。消耗５個『魔法寶石』。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>究極光裂術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：變形、光線\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：６５／５\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：在目標上施以巨大的損害，使用善神力量的終極破壞魔法。\r\n\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc10-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 10th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Create Magical Weapon:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 200/100\r\n<p>Duration: Permanent\r\n<p>Target: One weapon of caster\r\n<p>Effect: Turns normal weapon into +1 magical weapon. Doesn't affect already magical weapons. Consumes 10 magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Meteor Strike:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Fire\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 70/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: Onscreen location\r\n<p>Effect: Summons meteors from the sky and inflicts huge damage on the all enemies within 3 cells from the target. Rather a long way from Energy Bolt, no?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Reflecting Pool:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 100/200\r\n<p>Duration: 5 minutes\r\n<p>Target:\r\n<p>Effect:\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Stop:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 80/50\r\n<p>Duration: 30 seconds\r\n<p>Target: All enemies in the screen\r\n<p>Effect: Paralyzes all creatures in the screen with no save. Consumes 5 magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Disintegrate:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform, Beam\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 65/5\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Inflicts tremendous damage on the target. This is the Ultimate Destruction magic, but draws on the power of the Good God Einhasad.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc10-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 10th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Create Magical Weapon:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 200/100\r\n<p>Duration: Permanent\r\n<p>Target: One weapon of caster\r\n<p>Effect: Turns normal weapon into +1 magical weapon. Doesn't affect already magical weapons. Consumes 10 magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Meteor Strike:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Fire\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 70/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: Onscreen location\r\n<p>Effect: Summons meteors from the sky and inflicts huge damage on the all enemies within 3 cells from the target. Rather a long way from Energy Bolt, no?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Reflecting Pool:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 100/200\r\n<p>Duration: 5 minutes\r\n<p>Target:\r\n<p>Effect:\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Stop:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 80/50\r\n<p>Duration: 30 seconds\r\n<p>Target: All enemies in the screen\r\n<p>Effect: Paralyzes all creatures in the screen with no save. Consumes 5 magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Disintegrate:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform, Beam\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 65/5\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Inflicts tremendous damage on the target. This is the Ultimate Destruction magic, but draws on the power of the Good God Einhasad.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 10溯漣 葆徹</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>觼葬縑檜お 衙雖鏽 錚ア:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 睡罹\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 200/100\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 艙錳\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠陛 陛雖堅 氈朝 鼠晦\r\n<p>�膩�: 橾奩瞳檣 鼠晦蒂 +1曖 葆徹 鼠晦煎 夥紱橫鄹棲棻. 檜 葆徹擎 +1 檜鼻曖 葆徹 鼠晦縑朝 �膩�陛 橈蝗棲棻. 檜 葆徹縑朝 '葆溘曖 給' 10偃陛 в蹂м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>嘐じ橫 蝶お塭檜觼:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問, 碳\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 70/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: �飛� 寰曖 и 薄\r\n<p>�膩�: ж棺縑憮 褻斜虜 遴戮擊 模�納狤� 渠鼻 輿嬪 3蘊縑 襄營ж朝 賅萇 瞳縑啪 鬼溘и Яп蒂 殮��棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>葬Ы滓た ヴ:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 褻濛\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 100/200\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 5碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: 蘿葬んお 磁葆觼 醞 ж釭\r\n<p>�膩�: 獎濠朝 雖樓 衛除翕寰 獎濠曖 蘿葬んお 磁葆觼 雖薄擊 醞褕戲煎 и�飛暻釔� 鼻�窕� 獐 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 檜 葆徹縑朝 '熱唳'檜塭 碳葬辦朝 葆徹曖 嬴檜蠱檜 в蹂м棲棻. 檜 葆徹縑朝 '葆溘曖 給' 3偃陛 в蹂м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>蝶體:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 褻濛\r\n<p>撩щ: Chaotic\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 80/50\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 30蟾\r\n<p>渠鼻: �飛� 寰曖 賅萇 瞳\r\n<p>�膩�: 獎濠蒂 薯諼и 賅萇 渠鼻擊 橾薑 �捕�煎 雖樓 衛除 翕寰 薑雖衛鑒 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 檜 葆徹縑朝 '葆溘曖 給' 5偃陛 в蹂м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>蛤蝶檣じ斜溯檜お:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 滲��, 惜摹\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 65/5\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: �飛� 寰曖 瞳 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 摹и 褐曖 ��擊 嫡擎 掙斛曖 だ惚 葆徹. ж釭曖 渠鼻縑啪 渠欽�� 贖 Яп蒂 鄹棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>說明：魔法 其他</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>魔法視窗快速鍵:</font>\r\n<p>隨時按<font fg=ffffff>Ctrl＋S</font>可叫出魔法視窗。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>記住傳送的場所:</font>\r\n<p>使用瞬間移動的卷軸或法術配合瞬間移動戒指，可移動到之前去過的場所。</p>\r\n<p>在對話窗輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/bookmark [要記憶的場所名稱]'</font>，就可以記憶現在的位置。以後戴著『瞬間移動控制戒指』，使用瞬間移動的卷軸或法術時，會顯示你所輸入的場所名稱，此時在名稱上按下兩次滑鼠左鍵，可以瞬間移動到你要去的地方。</p>\r\n<p>只輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/bookmark'</font>時，可以看到你所記憶的場所。使用Delete鍵可刪除不要之記憶埸所。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>魔法快速鍵:</font>\r\n<p>像道具一樣你可以在F9~F12指定魔法熱鍵。輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/F(9~11) [魔法名稱]'</font>的指令。除此之外，先打開魔法視窗後，將把<font fg=ffffff>魔法圖示移動</font>到熱鍵欄的位置上。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>快速施法切換鍵:</font>\r\n<p>按<font fg=ffffff>Ctrl＋X</font>，會轉換到快速施法模式。進入模式後在畫面左下窗上顯示最後使用過的魔法，此時自動會使用在指定的目標上。（但開始進入遊戲時沒有之前使用過的魔法，而沒有資料。）再按下Ctrl-X，快速施法模式結束就可以開始普通攻擊模式。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>魔法強制攻擊:</font>\r\n<p>基本上魔法也是跟一般攻擊一樣，需要按Ctrl鍵才能攻擊玩家和一般NPC。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Magic</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Spell Window Shortcut:</font>\r\nYou can press Ctrl-S to bring up your spells window.  Cntl-X will place you in a mode (or remove you from the mode) where you can re-cast your most recent spell just by clicking.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Teleport bookmarking:</font>\r\n<p> You can teleport to a place you've been before using a scroll labeled 'VENZAR BORGAVVE' and a ring of teleport control.\r\n<p>First, you should bookmark the place you want to memorize  - from the chat window, type <font fg=ffffff>'/bookmark [name of the place]'</font>. You can use this bookmark by using the scroll labeled VENZAR BORGAVVE' or a teleport spell if you are wearing a ring of teleport control.\r\n<p>You can see your bookmarks at any time by typing <font fg=ffffff>'/bookmark'</font> into the chat window.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can also register spells to the F9~F12 keys much like you can do with items, from the bottom of the spell window or by using the command <font fg=ffffff>'/F(9~12) [name of spell]</font>'.\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Magic</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Spell Window Shortcut:</font>\r\nYou can press Ctrl-S to bring up your spells window.  Cntl-X will place you in a mode (or remove you from the mode) where you can re-cast your most recent spell just by clicking.\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Teleport bookmarking:</font>\r\n<p> You can teleport to a place you've been before using a scroll labeled 'VENZAR BORGAVVE' and a ring of teleport control.\r\n<p>First, you should bookmark the place you want to memorize  - from the chat window, type <font fg=ffffff>'/bookmark [name of the place]'</font>. You can use this bookmark by using the scroll labeled VENZAR BORGAVVE' or a teleport spell if you are wearing a ring of teleport control.\r\n<p>You can see your bookmarks at any time by typing <font fg=ffffff>'/bookmark'</font> into the chat window.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can also register spells to the F9~F12 keys much like you can do with items, from the bottom of the spell window or by using the command <font fg=ffffff>'/F(9~12) [name of spell]</font>'.\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 葆徹 晦顫</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>葆徹璽 熟飄:</font>\r\n<p>樹薯塭紫 <font fg=ffffff>Ctrl-S</font>蒂 揚楝 葆徹璽擊 碳楝鳥 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>蘿葬んお 濰模曖 晦橘:</font>\r\n<p>葆徹 蝶觼煤檣 '牖除 檜翕 輿僥憮'諦 葆徹 嬴檜蠱檣 '牖除 檜翕 褻謙 奩雖'蒂 餌辨ж罹 濠褐檜 и廓 陛獄 濰模煎 牖除 檜翕擊 й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/晦橘 [晦橘й 濰模 檜葷]'</font>塭堅 殮溘ж賊 濠褐曖 ⑷營 嬪纂陛 晦橘腌棲棻. 檜�� '牖除 檜翕 褻謙 奩雖'蒂 濰綠и 鼻鷓縑憮 '漸濠腦 爾腦陛粽' 蝶觼煤擊 餌辨ж賊 擅曖 寞徹戲煎 晦橘и 濰模 檜葷菟檜 ル衛腎朝等, 斜醞 濠褐檜 陛堅濠 ж朝 濰模貲擊 渦綰 贗葛ж賊 斜 濰模煎 牖除 檜翕 й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>'/晦橘'</font>檜塭堅虜 殮溘й 唳辦 ⑷營 濠褐檜 晦橘ж堅 氈朝 濰模曖 葬蝶お蒂 獐 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>葆徹 熟飄 酈:</font>\r\n<p>嬴檜蠱曖 唳辦諦 葆雙陛雖煎 葆徹紫 F9~F12梱雖曖 酈縑 雖薑й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. <font fg=ffffff>'/F(9~12) [雖薑й 葆徹曖 檜葷]'</font>檜塭堅 雖薑ж衛賊 腌棲棻. 檜諼縑紫 葆徹璽擊 翮堅 п渡 欽蹴酈曖 嬪纂縑 <font fg=ffffff>葆徹 嬴檜夔擊 莊橫棻 場擠</font>戲煎賦 欽蹴酈蒂 雖薑й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>葆徹 賅萄 瞪��:</font>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Ctrl-X</font>蒂 援腦賊 葆徹賅萄煎 瞪�素� 腌棲棻. 葆徹賅萄 翕寰縑朝 �飛� 豭薹 ж欽縑 濠褐檜 陛濰 葆雖虞縑 餌辨и 葆徹檜 ル衛腎貊, 雖薑и 渠鼻縑啪 斜 葆徹擊 濠翕戲煎 餌辨й 熱 氈啪腌棲棻. 欽, 啪歜擊 衛濛й 陽縑朝 檜瞪縑 餌辨и 葆徹檜 橈戲嘎煎 嬴鼠楛 葆徹紫 晦橘腎橫 氈雖 彊蝗棲棻. 棻衛 Ctrl-X蒂 援腦賊 葆徹賅萄朝 謙猿腎堅 鱔鼻奢問檜 陛棟п 餵棲棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>葆徹 鬼薯 奢問:</font>\r\n<p>晦獄瞳戲煎 葆徹紫 橾奩奢問婁 葆雙陛雖煎 Ctrl酈蒂 揚毓擊陽虜 PC縑啪 餌辨擊 й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. </p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>輔助說明：第２級法術</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>解毒術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：生命\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：８／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家\r\n<p>效果：中和目標所中的毒。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>寒冷戰慄：</font>\r\n<p>類型：死亡、水\r\n<p>相性：邪惡\r\n<p>魔力／體力：９／１\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：施法者鄰近的一個其他玩家或家操縱角色 \r\n<p>效果：奪走目標一些體力，而且把它加入施法者。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>毒咒：</font>\r\n<p>類型：詛咒、水\r\n<p>相性：邪惡\r\n<p>魔力／體力：１０／１０\r\n<p>期間：５分鐘\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色、接觸\r\n<p>效果：藉著接觸對目標下毒，毒藥在期間內施以損害，而且每行動一次，便會增加少許的損傷，除非得到解毒的方法。對玩家施法成功後，施法者的屬性會馬上轉為邪惡。須消耗１個『魔法寶石』。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>擬似魔法武器：</font>\r\n<p>類型：授予\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：１５／０\r\n<p>期間：１０分鐘\r\n<p>目標：施法者的武器\r\n<p>效果：目標受損害的等級增加２點，這個武器在期間內被視為魔法武器。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>無所遁形術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：控制\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：８／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：現在的螢幕\r\n<p>效果：在螢幕中找出隱藏的其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色，它能顯示穿著隱形斗蓬、史巴托、高侖石頭怪的其他玩家或其他的隱藏人物。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 2nd Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Cure Poison:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Life\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 8/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC\r\n<p>Effect: Neutralizes poison in the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Chill Touch:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Death, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic*\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 9/1\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC adjacent to the caster.\r\n<p>Effect: Takes some HP from the target and adds it to the caster.  Of course, if you're adjacent, you may well need the healing.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Curse - Poison:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Curse, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic*\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 10/10\r\n<p>Duration: 5 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC, Contact\r\n<p>Effect: Induces the poison to the target by touch. The poison inflicts the damage for the duration. Consumes 1 magic gem.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Enchant Weapon:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 15/0\r\n<p>Duration: 10 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One weapon of the caster\r\n<p>Effect: Raises the target weapon's damage rating by 2. This weapon is also regarded as a magical weapon for the duration. Watch the Knights drool.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Detection:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 8/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: Current Screen\r\n<p>Effect: Locates hidden onscreen PC or NPCs. For instance, it can reveal PCs wearing cloaks of invisibility, spartoi, stone Golem, or other hidden creatures.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 2nd Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Cure Poison:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Life\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 8/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC\r\n<p>Effect: Neutralizes poison in the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Chill Touch:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Death, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic*\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 9/1\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC adjacent to the caster.\r\n<p>Effect: Takes some HP from the target and adds it to the caster.  Of course, if you're adjacent, you may well need the healing.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Curse - Poison:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Curse, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic*\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 10/10\r\n<p>Duration: 5 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC, Contact\r\n<p>Effect: Induces the poison to the target by touch. The poison inflicts the damage for the duration. Consumes 1 magic gem.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Enchant Weapon:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 15/0\r\n<p>Duration: 10 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One weapon of the caster\r\n<p>Effect: Raises the target weapon's damage rating by 2. This weapon is also regarded as a magical weapon for the duration. Watch the Knights drool.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Detection:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 8/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: Current Screen\r\n<p>Effect: Locates hidden onscreen PC or NPCs. For instance, it can reveal PCs wearing cloaks of invisibility, spartoi, stone Golem, or other hidden creatures.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 2溯漣 葆徹</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>聽橫 ん檜闋:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 模儅\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 8/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 絮縑 勘萼 鼻鷓蒂 纂猿м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>艦 攪纂:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 避擠, 僭\r\n<p>撩щ: Chaotic*\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 9/1\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 夥煎 蕙縑 氈朝 PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻曖 HP蒂 擒除 趙橫 濠褐曖 匙戲煎 虜蛙棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>醴蝶-ん檜闋:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 盪輿, 僭\r\n<p>撩щ: Chaotic*\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 10/10\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 5碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC�分� NPC 1檣, 蕾襠\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻擊 絮縑 醞絮衛霾棲棻. 檜 絮擎 鼻渠寞縑啪 1碟除 橾薑 除問戲煎 Яп蒂 殮��棲棻. 檜 葆徹縑朝 '葆溘曖 給' 1偃陛 в蹂м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>檣臘お 錚ア:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 睡罹\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 15/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 10碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠陛 陛雖堅 氈朝 鼠晦 ж釭\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻曖 顫問纂蒂 +2 螢董棲棻. 檜 葆徹檜 勘萼 鼠晦朝 雖樓 衛除翕寰 '葆徹曖 鼠晦'煎 除輿м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>蛤臢暮:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 褻濛\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 8/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: ⑷營�飛�\r\n<p>�膩�: ⑷營 獎濠縑啪 爾檜朝 �飛橦� 獗橫氈朝 PC釭 NPC蒂 瓊嬴鹿棲棻. 檜 葆徹戲煎 癱貲 蜂饜蒂 殮擎 PC釭 獗橫氈朝 蝶だ饜檜, 蝶驛 埤源蛔紫 瓊擊 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>輔助說明：第３級法術</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>極光雷電：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊、空中、光線\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：１４／３\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：在施法者的６個單元裡面的一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：射出閃電而且施以傷害在線上的所有敵人。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>起死回生術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：生命、大地\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：１５／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個不死的非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：用一定的機率破壞不死的怪物；但是也能有５％可能性會引起狂暴的憤怒。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>中級治癒術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：治癒、大地\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：１３／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：回復目標最低限度的體力；它也能施在不死怪物上施以損害。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>闇盲咒術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：詛咒\r\n<p>相性：邪惡\r\n<p>魔力／體力：１７／５\r\n<p>期間：５分鐘\r\n<p>目標：一個鄰近的其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：有一定的機率能使敵人盲目。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>鎧甲護持：</font>\r\n<p>類型：授予\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：２０／０\r\n<p>期間：１０分鐘\r\n<p>目標：施法者的一個護身盔甲\r\n<p>效果：增加目標３點的防禦效果不累積。\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 3rd Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Lightning:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Air, Beam\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 14/3\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: Beam towards one PC or NPC within 6 cells from the caster.\r\n<p>Effect: Shoots lightning, inflicting damage on all enemies between the caster and target.  Orc hordes beware!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Turn Undead:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Life, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 15/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One Undead NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Attempts to destroys an undead monster...but can also induce a berserk rage (with 5% probability).\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Extra Heal:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Heal, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful*\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 13/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Restores target's hp moderately, or can be used on Undead to inflict damage.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Curse - Blind:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Curse\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 17/5\r\n<p>Duration: 5 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One adjacent PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Blinds the target with no savings throw.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Blessed Armor:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 20/0\r\n<p>Duration: 10 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One piece of body armor carried by the caster\r\n<p>Effect: Raises the target armor's AC by 3. The effect is not cumulative.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 3rd Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Lightning:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Air, Beam\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 14/3\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: Beam towards one PC or NPC within 6 cells from the caster.\r\n<p>Effect: Shoots lightning, inflicting damage on all enemies between the caster and target.  Orc hordes beware!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Turn Undead:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Life, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 15/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One Undead NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Attempts to destroys an undead monster...but can also induce a berserk rage (with 5% probability).\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Extra Heal:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Heal, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful*\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 13/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Restores target's hp moderately, or can be used on Undead to inflict damage.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Curse - Blind:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Curse\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 17/5\r\n<p>Duration: 5 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One adjacent PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Blinds the target with no savings throw.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Blessed Armor:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 20/0\r\n<p>Duration: 10 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One piece of body armor carried by the caster\r\n<p>Effect: Raises the target armor's AC by 3. The effect is not cumulative.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 3溯漣 葆徹</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>塭檜お棚:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問, 夥塋, 惜摹\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 14/3\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠煎睡攪 6蘊 頂縑 氈朝 PC1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 獎濠曖 鼠晦煎睡攪 廓偃陛 釭陛 渠鼻擎 僭煩 獎濠諦 渠鼻擊 毚朝 霜摹 寰縑 氈朝 賅萇 瞳縑啪 Яп蒂 遽棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>欐 樹等萄:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 模儅, 渠雖\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 15/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 樹等萄 NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 橾薑 �捕�煎 樹等萄 跨蝶攪蒂 避殮棲棻. 欽 5%曖 �捕�煎 樹等萄蒂 幗憮觼 鼻鷓煎 虜菟 熱紫 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>櫛蝶お塭 ��:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 纂猿, 渠雖\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful*\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 13/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC 塽 NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻曖 HP蒂 擒除 �蛹厭藷絕炴�. 欽 樹等萄 跨蝶攪縑啪 餌辨ж賊 �蛹� 渠褐 Яп蒂 還 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>醴蝶 - 綰塭檣萄:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 盪輿\r\n<p>撩щ: Chaotic\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 17/5\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 5碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: 夥煎 蕙縑 氈朝 PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 橾薑 �捕�煎 渠鼻擊 換檜 試 鼻鷓煎 虜蛙棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>綰溯蝶萄 嬴該:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 睡罹\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 20/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 10碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠陛 陛雖堅 氈朝 骨褡 ж釭\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻曖 AC蒂 3頂董棲棻. 檜 葆徹曖 �膩�朝 醞犒腎雖 彊蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>輔助說明：第４級法術</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>燃燒的火球：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊、火\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：１８／１０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：在施法者的６個單元裡面中的一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：對目標投擲火球而且在目標的二個單元內的所有的敵人也會受傷。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>通暢氣脈術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：授予\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：２３／０\r\n<p>期間：１０分鐘\r\n<p>目標：施法者或屬於相同的血盟者\r\n<p>效果：增加目標５點的靈敏度，但效果不累積。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>壞物術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：轉換、火\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：２６／２０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個鄰近的其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：有某種可能性地損害目標角色的武器。損害的程度因施法者的法術等級而定。須消耗一個『魔法寶石』。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>吸血鬼之吻：</font>\r\n<p>類型：死亡、大地\r\n<p>相性：邪惡\r\n<p>魔力／體力：１５／１\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：在施法者四周３個單元中的一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：吸收攻擊目標角色的體力，並把它轉給施法者。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>緩速術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：控制\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：１５／１０\r\n<p>期間：３分鐘\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：有某種可能性地減慢目標角色的行動速度，須消耗一個『魔法寶石』。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 4th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Fireball:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Fire\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 18/10\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: 2 cells around one PC or NPC target within 6 cells from caster\r\n<p>Effect: Hurls a fireball at the target, inflicting damage on all enemies within two cells from the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Physical Enchant-DEX:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 23/0\r\n<p>Duration: 10 minutes\r\n<p>Target: Caster or PC belonging to the same Bloodpledge.\r\n<p>Effect: Raises the target's Dexterity by 5. The effect is not cumulative.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Weapon Break:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform, Fire\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 26/20\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous/Permanent\r\n<p>Target: One adjacent PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Erodes target's weapon, with no savings throw. The severity of damage depends on the caster's spell level. Consumes one magic gem..\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Slow:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 15/10\r\n<p>Duration: 3 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Slows the target, with no savings throw. Consumes one magic gem.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Vampiric Touch:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Death, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 15/1\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC within 3 cells from caster\r\n<p>Effect: Drains hit points from the target and adds it to the caster's total.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 4th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Fireball:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Fire\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 18/10\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: 2 cells around one PC or NPC target within 6 cells from caster\r\n<p>Effect: Hurls a fireball at the target, inflicting damage on all enemies within two cells from the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Physical Enchant-DEX:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 23/0\r\n<p>Duration: 10 minutes\r\n<p>Target: Caster or PC belonging to the same Bloodpledge.\r\n<p>Effect: Raises the target's Dexterity by 5. The effect is not cumulative.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Weapon Break:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform, Fire\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 26/20\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous/Permanent\r\n<p>Target: One adjacent PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Erodes target's weapon, with no savings throw. The severity of damage depends on the caster's spell level. Consumes one magic gem..\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Slow:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 15/10\r\n<p>Duration: 3 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Slows the target, with no savings throw. Consumes one magic gem.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Vampiric Touch:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Death, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 15/1\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC within 3 cells from caster\r\n<p>Effect: Drains hit points from the target and adds it to the caster's total.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 4溯漣 葆徹</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>だ檜橫獐:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問, 碳\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 18/10\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠煎睡攪 6蘊 檜頂曖 奢除\r\n<p>�膩�: 碳顫朝 �倍停萼� 渠鼻 薄擊 醞褕戲煎 輿滲 2蘊縑 氈朝 瞳縑啪 醞除 薑紫曖 Яп蒂 鄹棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Я雖鏽 檣臘お-DEX:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 睡罹\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 23/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 10碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠 �分� 獎濠曖 ⑸裊錳 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻曖 DEX蒂 5 堪��棲棻. 檜 葆徹曖 �膩�朝 醞犒腎雖 彊蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>錚ア 粽溯檜觼:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 滲��, 碳\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 26/20\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 夥煎 蕙縑 氈朝 PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻檜 濰綠ж堅 氈朝 鼠晦蒂 橾薑 �捕�煎 槳鼻衛霾棲棻. 槳鼻紫朝 獎濠曖 葆徹 溯漣檜 堪擊 熱煙 醴餵棲棻. 檜 葆徹擎 '葆溘曖 給' ж釭蒂 餌辨м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>蝸煎辦:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 褻濛\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 15/10\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 3碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 橾薑 �捕�煎 雖樓 衛除 翕寰 渠鼻曖 ч翕 樓紫陛 1/3檜 腌棲棻. 檜 葆徹擎 '葆溘曖 給' ж釭蒂 餌辨м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>寢だ檜橫葛 攪纂:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 避擠, 渠雖\r\n<p>撩щ: Chaotic\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 15/1\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 3蘊 檜頂曖 PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻曖 HP蒂 鼻渡榆 趙橫 濠褐曖 匙戲煎 虜蛙棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>輔助說明：第５級法術</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>木乃伊的詛咒：</font>\r\n<p>類型：詛咒、大地\r\n<p>相性：邪惡\r\n<p>魔力／體力：３５／３０\r\n<p>期間：１０秒（基本）\r\n<p>目標：一個相連的其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：有一定的機率麻痺目標，使之無法動彈。麻痺期間的長短依照施法者等級而定。須消耗２個『魔法寶石』。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>極道落雷：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊、空氣\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：２３／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：在施法者的６個單元裡面的一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：從天空呼叫閃電並在目標上施以嚴重的損害。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>高級治癒術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：痊癒、大地\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：２０／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：回復目標較多的體力，它也能使用在不死怪物上並施以損害。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>迷魅術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：控制\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：３０／２０\r\n<p>期間：１小時\r\n<p>目標：一個非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：有一定的機率迷惑目標並使它跟隨施法者的命令。當目標的體力值減少時，這個法術的成功機率會增加；不過某些怪物對這法術是免疫的。須消耗２個『魔法寶石』。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>聖潔之光：</font>\r\n<p>類型：生活、空氣\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：２０／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家\r\n<p>效果：解除所有的詛咒。\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 5th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Curse-Paralyze:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Curse, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 35/30\r\n<p>Duration: 10 seconds (base)\r\n<p>Target: One adjacent PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Paralyzes the target with certain probability. The duration increases with the caster's spell level. Consumes two magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Call Lightning:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Air\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 23/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC within 6 cells from caster\r\n<p>Effect: Calls lightning from the sky and inflicts severe damage on the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Greater Heal:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Heal, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 20/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Restores target's hp considerably. Can also be used on Undead to inflict damage.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Tame Monster:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 30/20\r\n<p>Duration: 1 hours\r\n<p>Target: One NPC.\r\n<p>Effect: Charms the target and makes it follow the caster's orders. The probability of success increases as the target's hp decreases. Some monsters are immune to this spell. Consumes two magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Remove Curse:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Life, Air\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 20/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC\r\n<p>Effect: Removes all curses from the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 5th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Curse-Paralyze:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Curse, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 35/30\r\n<p>Duration: 10 seconds (base)\r\n<p>Target: One adjacent PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Paralyzes the target with certain probability. The duration increases with the caster's spell level. Consumes two magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Call Lightning:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Air\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 23/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC within 6 cells from caster\r\n<p>Effect: Calls lightning from the sky and inflicts severe damage on the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Greater Heal:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Heal, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 20/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Restores target's hp considerably. Can also be used on Undead to inflict damage.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Tame Monster:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 30/20\r\n<p>Duration: 1 hours\r\n<p>Target: One NPC.\r\n<p>Effect: Charms the target and makes it follow the caster's orders. The probability of success increases as the target's hp decreases. Some monsters are immune to this spell. Consumes two magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Remove Curse:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Life, Air\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 20/0\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC\r\n<p>Effect: Removes all curses from the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 5溯漣 葆徹</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>醴蝶-ぬ歇塭檜鍔:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 盪輿, 渠雖\r\n<p>撩щ: Chaotic\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 35/30\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 10蟾\r\n<p>渠鼻: 夥煎 蕙縑 氈朝 PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻擊 橾薑 �捕�煎 葆綠衛霾棲棻. 獎濠曖 葆溘檜 堪擊熱煙 雖樓 衛除擎 望橫餵棲棻. 檜 葆徹擎 '葆溘曖 給' 2偃蒂 餌辨м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>屬 塭檜お棚:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問, 夥塋\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 23/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠煎睡攪 6蘊 檜頂曖 剪葬縑 氈朝 PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: ж棺縑憮 廓偃蒂 模�納狤� 渠鼻縑啪 紮 贖 Яп蒂 殮��棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>斜溯檜攪 ��:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 纂猿, 渠雖\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 20/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻曖 HP蒂 紮 �蛹厭藷絕炴�. 欽 樹等萄 跨蝶攪縑啪 餌辨ж賊 �蛹� 渠褐 Яп蒂 還 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>纔檜墅 跨蝶攪:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 褻濛\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 30/20\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 1衛除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 跨蝶攪 NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻擊 譆賊縑 勘橫 橾薑 �捕�煎 濠褐曖 貲滄擊 評腦啪 м棲棻. 渠鼻曖 HP陛 雪擊 熱煙 �捕�擎 堪嬴餵棲棻. 跨蝶攪縑 評塭憮朝 檜 葆徹縑 勘葬雖 彊朝 匙菟紫 氈蝗棲棻. 檜 葆徹擎 '葆溘曖 給' 2偃蒂 餌辨м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>葬鼠粽 醴蝶:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 模儅, 夥塋\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 20/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 橾薑 �捕�煎 渠鼻縑啪 勘溥氈朝 賅萇 盪輿蒂 Д棲棻. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>輔助說明：第６級法術</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>造屍術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：死亡、水\r\n<p>相性：邪惡\r\n<p>魔力／體力：３５／２０\r\n<p>期間：永久的\r\n<p>目標：一個非玩家操縱角色的屍體\r\n<p>效果：從目標的屍體創造僵屍，僵屍會跟隨施法者的命令。消耗２個『魔法寶石』。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>體魄強健術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：授予、火\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：２５／１５\r\n<p>期間：５分鐘\r\n<p>目標：施法者或屬於相同的血盟者\r\n<p>效果：提高目標的５點力量，但效果不累積。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>加速術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：控制、空氣\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：２５／２０\r\n<p>期間：３分鐘\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：增加目標５０％的速度。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>魔法相消術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：轉換\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：３５／１５／２\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：將所有的魔法效果從目標移開。消耗２個『魔法寶石』。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>地裂術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊、大地\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：２０／１５\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：舉起大地塊而且投擲在目標上施以損害。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 6th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Create Zombie:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Death, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 35/20\r\n<p>Duration: Permanent\r\n<p>Target: One NPC corpse\r\n<p>Effect: Creates a zombie from the target corpse. The zombie will follows the caster's orders. Consumes two magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Physical Enchant-STR:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow, Fire\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 25/15\r\n<p>Duration: 5 minutes\r\n<p>Target: Caster or the PC belonging to the same Bloodpledge.\r\n<p>Effect: Raises the target's str by 5. The effect is not cumulative.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Haste:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control, Air\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 25/20\r\n<p>Duration: 3 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Increases the target's speed by 50%.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Cancellation:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 35/15\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Removes all magical effects from the target. Consumes two magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Eruption:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 20/15\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Causes the earth to rise up and inflict damage on the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 6th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Create Zombie:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Death, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 35/20\r\n<p>Duration: Permanent\r\n<p>Target: One NPC corpse\r\n<p>Effect: Creates a zombie from the target corpse. The zombie will follows the caster's orders. Consumes two magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Physical Enchant-STR:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Bestow, Fire\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 25/15\r\n<p>Duration: 5 minutes\r\n<p>Target: Caster or the PC belonging to the same Bloodpledge.\r\n<p>Effect: Raises the target's str by 5. The effect is not cumulative.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Haste:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control, Air\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 25/20\r\n<p>Duration: 3 minutes\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Increases the target's speed by 50%.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Cancellation:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 35/15\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Removes all magical effects from the target. Consumes two magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Eruption:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 20/15\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Causes the earth to rise up and inflict damage on the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 6溯漣 葆徹</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>觼葬縑檜お 覬綠:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 避擠, 僭\r\n<p>撩щ: Chaotic\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 35/20\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 艙錳\r\n<p>渠鼻: NPC曖 衛羹\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻擊 覬綠煎 虜蛙棲棻. 虜菟橫霞 覬綠朝 輿檣曖 蜓擊 評落棲棻. 檜 葆徹縑朝 '葆溘曖 給'檜 2偃 в蹂м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Я雖鏽 檣疆お-STR:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 睡罹, 碳\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 25/15\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 5碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠釭 獎濠曖 ⑸裊錳 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻曖 STR擊 5 螢董棲棻. 檜 葆徹曖 �膩�朝 醞犒腎雖 彊蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>④檜蝶お:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 褻濛, 夥塋\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 25/20\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 3碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠 �分� 獎濠曖 ⑸裊錳 1檣, NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 雖樓 衛除 翕寰 渠鼻曖 ч翕 樓紫陛 1.5寡 脹棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>警蝸溯檜暮:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 滲��\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 35/15\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻縑啪 ⑷營 艙щ擊 嘐纂堅 氈朝 賅萇 葆徹瞳 �膩�蒂 薯剪м棲棻. 檜 葆徹縑朝 '葆溘曖 給'檜 2偃 в蹂м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>檜毀暮:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問, 渠雖\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 20/15\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 寞щ撩檜 氈朝 雖霞戲煎 渠鼻縑啪 紮 鬼溘и Яп蒂 鄹棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>輔助說明：第７級法術</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>體力回復術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：痊癒、大地\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：４０／６０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：螢幕裡除了施法者以外的每個血盟的成員\r\n<p>效果：回復目標的體力。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>冰矛圍籬：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊、水\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：３５／８\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：在目標上施以損害而且用冰困住目標；在冰裡面的目標不能作任何事，但是不受外部的攻擊。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>召喚術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：控制、大地\r\n<p>相性：邪惡\r\n<p>魔力／體力：５０／３０\r\n<p>期間：１小時\r\n<p>目標：施法者\r\n<p>效果：召喚２∼８隻怪物，召喚怪物跟隨施法者的命令；怪物的類型因施法者的等級而定。消耗３個『魔法寶石』。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>神聖的圓：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：４５／１０\r\n<p>期間：５分鐘\r\n<p>目標：除了施法者之外，在施法者周圍５格範圍內的所有血盟成員\r\n<p>效果：以神聖的力量使所有被施法者的命中率+２；防禦率-２，但若施法者自己發動攻擊，或是到攻擊，則此魔法無效。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>龍捲風：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊、空氣\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：４０／２０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：距離施法者３個單元裡面的所有的敵人\r\n<p>效果：以咒文召喚強大旋風而且在目標上施以嚴重的損害。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 7th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Heal All:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Heal, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 40/60\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: Every Bloodpledge member in the screen except the caster\r\n<p>Effect: Restores target's hp somewhat.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Ice Lance:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 35/8\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Inflicts damage on the target and attempts to trap the target in ice. The target in the Ice can do nothing, but is not subject to external attacks.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Summon Monster:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 50/30\r\n<p>Duration: 1 hour\r\n<p>Target: Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Summons 2~8 monsters. Summoned monsters will follow the caster's orders. The type of monster will depends on the caster's spell level. Consumes three magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Holy Circle:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 45/10\r\n<p>Duration: 5 minutes\r\n<p>Target:\r\n<p>Effect:\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Tornado:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Air\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 40/20\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: All enemies within 3 cells of the Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Conjures up a strong tornado to inflict severe damage on targets.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 7th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Heal All:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Heal, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 40/60\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: Every Bloodpledge member in the screen except the caster\r\n<p>Effect: Restores target's hp somewhat.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Ice Lance:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 35/8\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Inflicts damage on the target and attempts to trap the target in ice. The target in the Ice can do nothing, but is not subject to external attacks.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Summon Monster:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 50/30\r\n<p>Duration: 1 hour\r\n<p>Target: Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Summons 2~8 monsters. Summoned monsters will follow the caster's orders. The type of monster will depends on the caster's spell level. Consumes three magic gems.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Holy Circle:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 45/10\r\n<p>Duration: 5 minutes\r\n<p>Target:\r\n<p>Effect:\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Tornado:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Air\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 40/20\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: All enemies within 3 cells of the Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Conjures up a strong tornado to inflict severe damage on targets.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 7溯漣 葆徹</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>�� 螢:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 纂猿, 渠雖\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 40/60\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: ⑷營 �飛橦� 襄營ж朝 獎濠蒂 薯諼и 獎濠曖 賅萇 ⑸裊錳\r\n<p>�膩�: 賅萇 渠鼻縑啪 斜溯檜攪 ��曖 葆徹 �膩�陛 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>嬴檜蝶 楠蝶:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問, 僭\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 35/8\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻縑啪 紮 鬼и Яп蒂 鄹棲棻. 傳 橾薑 �捕�煎 鼻渠蒂 30蟾除 橡擠 樓縑 陛萍棲棻. 橡擠 樓縑 陛萋霞 渠鼻擎 嬴鼠匙紫 й 熱 橈雖虜, 奢問紫 嫡雖 彊蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>憮試 跨蝶攪:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 褻濛, 渠雖\r\n<p>撩щ: Chaotic\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 50/30\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 1衛除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠\r\n<p>�膩�: 2~8葆葬曖 跨蝶攪蒂 模�納桭炴�. 模�秘� 跨蝶攪朝 雖樓 衛除翕寰 獎濠曖 貲滄縑 評落棲棻. 模�秘Ж� 跨蝶攪朝 獎濠曖 葆徹 溯漣縑 評塭 棻落棲棻. 檜 葆徹擎 '葆溘曖 給' 3偃蒂 餌辨м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>�次� 憮贗:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 45/10\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 5碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠 輿嬪 5蘊 頂縑 氈朝, 獎濠蒂 薯諼и 獎濠曖 賅萇 ⑸裊錳\r\n<p>�膩�: 撩蝶楝遴 唸啗煎 賅萇 渠鼻曖 貲醞睦縑 +2, 等嘐雖縑 +2, AC縑 -2曖 �膩�蒂 鄹棲棻. 欽 獎濠 濠褐檜 奢問擊 ж剪釭 奢問擊 渡ж啪 腎賊 檜 �膩�朝 餌塭餵棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>饜啻檜紫:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問, 夥塋\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 40/20\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠 輿嬪 3蘊 頂曖 賅萇 瞳\r\n<p>�膩�: 獎濠 輿嬪 3蘊縑 鬼溘и �蛾戲捆棤鷩� 碳楝 橾戲麵 檜 彰嬪 寰曖 賅萇 瞳縑啪 紮 鬼и Яп蒂 殮��棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>輔助說明：第８級法術</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>全部治癒術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：治癒、大地\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：４０／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：回復目標很多的體力，它也能對不死怪物施以重大損害。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>火牢：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊、火\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力需求：５０／２０\r\n<p>期間：４０秒\r\n<p>目標：在螢幕裡面的位置\r\n<p>效果：創造在目標和施法者之間的火牆。ＰＣ或ＮＰＣ在火牆裡會受到傷害，那期間中，施法者增加法術力量的話，則威力增加。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>冰雪暴：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊、水\r\n<p>相性：邪惡\r\n<p>魔力／體力：６０／１０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：螢幕裡的所有敵人\r\n<p>效果：呼叫冰凍的大風雪並在目標上施以損害。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>隱身術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：轉換\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：６０／６０／１\r\n<p>期間：永久的\r\n<p>目標：施法者\r\n<p>效果：施法者可在其他人中隱藏，但是如果有攻擊或任何其他的侵略的動作就會打破符咒。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>返生術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：生命\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：５０／０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：一個死掉的其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：用完整的體力復活目標。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 8th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Full Heal:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Heal, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 40/0\r\n<p>Duration: Immediate\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Restores target's hp significantly. It can also be used on Undead to inflict massive damage.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Fire Wall:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Fire\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 50/20\r\n<p>Duration: 40 seconds\r\n<p>Target: Location in the screen\r\n<p>Effect: Creates a firewall between a target and the caster. PCs or NPCs in the Firewall will takes damage from the heat. The duration increases with spell power.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Blizzard:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 60/10\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: All enemies onscreen\r\n<p>Effect: Calls a freezing blizzard to inflicts damage on the all enemies within one screen of the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Invisibility:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 60/60/1\r\n<p>Duration: Permanent (until broken, see below)\r\n<p>Target: Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Hides the caster from others - but any attack or any other aggressive action will break the spell.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Resurrection:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Life\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 50/0\r\n<p>Duration: Immediate\r\n<p>Target: One dead PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Resurrects the target with full hp.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 8th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Full Heal:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Heal, Earth\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 40/0\r\n<p>Duration: Immediate\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Restores target's hp significantly. It can also be used on Undead to inflict massive damage.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Fire Wall:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Fire\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 50/20\r\n<p>Duration: 40 seconds\r\n<p>Target: Location in the screen\r\n<p>Effect: Creates a firewall between a target and the caster. PCs or NPCs in the Firewall will takes damage from the heat. The duration increases with spell power.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Blizzard:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 60/10\r\n<p>Duration: Instantaneous\r\n<p>Target: All enemies onscreen\r\n<p>Effect: Calls a freezing blizzard to inflicts damage on the all enemies within one screen of the target.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Invisibility:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 60/60/1\r\n<p>Duration: Permanent (until broken, see below)\r\n<p>Target: Caster\r\n<p>Effect: Hides the caster from others - but any attack or any other aggressive action will break the spell.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Resurrection:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Life\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 50/0\r\n<p>Duration: Immediate\r\n<p>Target: One dead PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Resurrects the target with full hp.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 8溯漣 葆徹</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>ヴ ��:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 纂猿, 渠雖\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 40/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻曖 HP蒂 鼻渡榆 �蛹嘎桭炴�. Undead縑啪 餌辨ж賊 翕橾и 虜躑曖 Яп蒂 殮��棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>だ檜橫 錯:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問, 碳\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 50/20\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 40蟾\r\n<p>渠鼻: �飛� 寰曖 и 薄\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻婁 獎濠蒂 毚朝 摹碟縑 T濠 ⑽戲煎 碳漁擊 虜蛙棲棻. 檜 碳漁縑 殘朝 賅萇 PC諦 NPC朝 衙 蟾葆棻 橾薑榆曖 Яп蒂 殮蝗棲棻. 碳漁檜 雖樓腎朝 衛除擎 獎濠曖 葆溘檜 堪擊熱煙 望橫餵棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>綰葬濠萄:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問, 僭\r\n<p>撩щ: Chaotic\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 60/10\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: �飛樴�縑 氈朝 賅萇 瞳\r\n<p>�膩�: �匹挴� 夥塋戲煎 �飛� 頂曖 賅萇 瞳縑啪 紮 鬼и Яп蒂 殮��棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>檣綠盪網楝じ:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 滲��\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 60/60/1\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: MP陛 雖樓腎朝 翕寰\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠\r\n<p>�膩�: 雖樓 衛除 翕寰 獎濠朝 棻艇 PC釭 NPC縑啪 爾檜雖 彊啪 腌棲棻. 欽 檜翕 諼曖 瞳斛瞳檣 ч翕擊 ж賊 檜 �膩�朝 餌塭餵棲棻. 檜 葆徹檜 雖樓腎朝 翕寰 5蟾縑 1MP陛 模賅腌棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>葬瞰滓暮:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 模儅\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 50/0\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC 1檣曖 衛羹 �分� NPC 1檣曖 衛羹\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻擊 睡�偷藷絕炴�. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>輔助說明：第９級法術</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>力場：</font>\r\n<p>類型：攻擊\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：６０／２０\r\n<p>期間：１０秒\r\n<p>目標：施法者\r\n<p>效果：在距離施法者３格的範圍之內所產生的力量範圍。一旦敵人接觸就會受傷。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>沉睡之霧：</font>\r\n<p>類型：詛咒、水\r\n<p>相性：邪惡\r\n<p>魔力／體力：６０／３５\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：在螢幕裡面的位置\r\n<p>效果：使目標和鄰近２格內的怪物進入睡眠，一旦怪物遭到攻擊就會醒來。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>變形術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：轉換、詛咒\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：６０／３０\r\n<p>期間：１小時\r\n<p>目標：一個其他玩家或非玩家操縱角色\r\n<p>效果：有一定的機率把目標變形一段時間。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>聖結界：</font>\r\n<p>類型：轉換\r\n<p>相性：正義\r\n<p>魔力／體力：８０／５０\r\n<p>期間：３０分鐘\r\n<p>目標：施法者或屬於相同的血盟者\r\n<p>效果：使目標對各種的傷害產生更強的抵抗力，被施法術的目標在這期間內只會受到５０％的損害。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>集體傳送術：</font>\r\n<p>類型：控制\r\n<p>相性：中立\r\n<p>魔力／體力：１００／２０\r\n<p>期間：瞬間\r\n<p>目標：施法者、馴服的怪物、和他在２個單位裡面的血盟成員\r\n<p>效果：傳送目標到任意的位置，施法者能用特別的物品『控制傳送的戒指』控制傳送去的目的地。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 9th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Force Field:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 60/20\r\n<p>Duration: 10 seconds\r\n<p>Target:\r\n<p>Effect:\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Fog of Sleeping:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Curse, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 60/35\r\n<p>Duration: Immediate\r\n<p>Target: Location in the screen.\r\n<p>Effect: Induces slumber to PCs and NPCs within two cells of the target. Sleeping creatures will awaken if attacked.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Shapechange:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform, Curse\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 60/30\r\n<p>Duration: 1 hour\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Shapechanges the target for the duration.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Immunity to Harm:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 80/50\r\n<p>Duration: 30 minutes\r\n<p>Target: Caster or a PC belonging to the same Bloodpledge.\r\n<p>Effect: Makes the target more resistant to all kinds of damage. The target will receive only 50% of the damage for the duration of the spell.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Mass Teleport:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 100/20\r\n<p>Duration: Immediate\r\n<p>Target: Caster, tamed monsters, and Bloodpledge members within 2 cells.\r\n<p>Effect: Teleport targets to a random location. The caster can control the location with a ring of teleport control\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 9th Level Spells</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Force Field:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Attack\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 60/20\r\n<p>Duration: 10 seconds\r\n<p>Target:\r\n<p>Effect:\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Fog of Sleeping:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Curse, Water\r\n<p>Alignment: Chaotic\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 60/35\r\n<p>Duration: Immediate\r\n<p>Target: Location in the screen.\r\n<p>Effect: Induces slumber to PCs and NPCs within two cells of the target. Sleeping creatures will awaken if attacked.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Shapechange:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform, Curse\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 60/30\r\n<p>Duration: 1 hour\r\n<p>Target: One PC or NPC\r\n<p>Effect: Shapechanges the target for the duration.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Immunity to Harm:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Transform\r\n<p>Alignment: Lawful\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 80/50\r\n<p>Duration: 30 minutes\r\n<p>Target: Caster or a PC belonging to the same Bloodpledge.\r\n<p>Effect: Makes the target more resistant to all kinds of damage. The target will receive only 50% of the damage for the duration of the spell.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Mass Teleport:</font>\r\n<p>Type: Control\r\n<p>Alignment: Neutral\r\n<p>MP/HP Requirement: 100/20\r\n<p>Duration: Immediate\r\n<p>Target: Caster, tamed monsters, and Bloodpledge members within 2 cells.\r\n<p>Effect: Teleport targets to a random location. The caster can control the location with a ring of teleport control\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpmgc9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Help: 9溯漣 葆徹</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>ん蝶 в萄:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 奢問\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 60/20\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 10蟾\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠 輿嬪 3蘊 檜頂曖 瞳\r\n<p>�膩�: 獎濠曖 跺 瞪羹縑憮 ��曖 螃塭陛 寞餌腎橫 檜 螃塭縑 湊擎 瞳縑啪 衙蟾渡 橾薑и Яп蒂 殮��棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>ん斜 螃粽 蝸葬ё:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 盪輿, 僭\r\n<p>撩щ: Chaotic\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 60/35\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: �飛� 寰曖 и 撚\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻擊 醞褕戲煎 輿嬪 2撚縑 襄營ж朝 PC釭 NPC蒂 橾薑 �捕�煎 濡營鄴棲棻. 濡萇 PC釭 NPC朝 奢問擊 嫡戲賊 梟橫陶棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>樁檜Щ 羹檣雖:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 滲��, 盪輿\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 60/30\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 1衛除\r\n<p>渠鼻: PC 1檣 �分� NPC 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻擊 雖樓衛除 翕寰 橾薑 �捕�煎 濠褐檜 錳ж朝 跨蝶攪煎 滲�亳藷� 熱 氈蝗棲棻. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>檜嘔 癱 л:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 滲��\r\n<p>撩щ: Lawful\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 80/50\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 30碟\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠 �分� 獎濠曖 ⑸裊錳 1檣\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻擎 雖樓 衛除 翕寰 濠褐縑啪 陛п雖朝 等嘐雖曖 50%虜擊 殮蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>衙蝶 蘿葬んお:</font>\r\n<p>謙盟: 褻濛\r\n<p>撩щ: Neutral\r\n<p>模賅 MP/HP: 100/20\r\n<p>雖樓衛除: 牖除\r\n<p>渠鼻: 獎濠蒂 んл, 獎濠 輿嬪 1蘊縑 氈朝 獎濠曖 ⑸裊錳菟婁 獎濠陛 等葬堅 氈朝 跨蝶攪菟\r\n<p>�膩�: 渠鼻 賅舒蒂 蘿葬んお 衛霾棲棻. 蘿葬んお 雖薄縑 渠и 薯и擎 '蘿葬んお' 葆徹婁 翕橾м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"helpmgc\">\r\n</body>\r\n","helpnpc-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>命令輔助說明：非玩家操縱角色控制</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>遊戲者能以三種方式可以控制非玩家操縱角色\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>雇請傭兵：</font>\r\n<p>一旦某個血盟接管一座城堡，血盟之王子／公主就能雇請，並且分配傭兵給血盟的成員，而且血盟成員們也能藉由以下的命令，來控制傭兵的行動，也就是說，每個血盟成員相當於一個小領主，可以操控著非玩家操縱角色們進行活動。\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>侵略狀態</p></font>\r\n<p>表示傭兵跟隨主人，並且攻擊主人攻擊的怪物、或是攻擊對手的主人或自身的敵人。 \r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>防禦狀態</p></font>\r\n<p>表示傭兵跟隨主人，但只在他們受到攻擊的時候才會攻擊。 \r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>停留</p></font>\r\n<p>表示傭兵在最近的地方休息，且只在他們受到攻擊的時候才會攻擊。\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>警戒</p></font>\r\n<p>表示傭兵會攻擊距離他們最近的怪物，或在某一範圍中對我方血盟成員懷有敵意的其他血盟成員或敵方。 \r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>解散</p></font>\r\n<p>解散傭兵，一旦解散他們，他們的行為就會像那些普通的怪物而且不再受控制。所以使用這個命令的時候要很小心。 \r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=eeeeae>用魔法控制怪物：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=eeeeae>馴服怪物：</font>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpnpc-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: NPC Control</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Players can control NPCs (non-player characters such as monsters) in three ways: Taming monsters, hiring mercenaries, and controlling monsters with magic.  Once under your control, all monsters are controlled the same way:\r\n<br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Once you control an NPC, you can click on it and select the following options:\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>Aggressive state</p></font>\r\n<p>NPCs follow the owner and attack the creature the owner attacks, things attacking the owner, or things that attack the NPC.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>Defensive state</p></font>\r\n<p>NPCs follow the owner and only attack when they are attacked.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>Stay</p></font>\r\n<p>NPCs stay at their current position and only attack when they are attacked.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>Alert</p></font>\r\n<p>NPCs stand at the current position and attack the creatures who attack them or members of the blood pledge who is hostile to the owner's blood pledge in a certain range.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>Dismiss</p></font>\r\n<p>Dismiss. Once dismissed the NPC will act like a normal monster and can't be controlled again...so be careful when using this command.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Hiring mercenaries:</font>\r\n<p>Once a Bloodpledge takes over a castle, the prince of the Bloodpledge can hire and assign mercenaries to the members of the 'pledge. The members of the blood pledge can make commands to mercenaries by clicking on them.\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Controlling monsters with magic:</font>\r\n<p> Certain high-level spells will allow you to control monsters...see the spell section for more details.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Taming monsters:</font>\r\n<p> Using food which the various monsters desire, certain monsters such as dogs are tameable.  A full guide is really warranted here; see www.lineagethebloodpledge.com for details. \r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpnpc-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: NPC Control</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Players can control NPCs (non-player characters such as monsters) in three ways: Taming monsters, hiring mercenaries, and controlling monsters with magic.  Once under your control, all monsters are controlled the same way:\r\n<br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Once you control an NPC, you can click on it and select the following options:\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>Aggressive state</p></font>\r\n<p>NPCs follow the owner and attack the creature the owner attacks, things attacking the owner, or things that attack the NPC.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>Defensive state</p></font>\r\n<p>NPCs follow the owner and only attack when they are attacked.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>Stay</p></font>\r\n<p>NPCs stay at their current position and only attack when they are attacked.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>Alert</p></font>\r\n<p>NPCs stand at the current position and attack the creatures who attack them or members of the blood pledge who is hostile to the owner's blood pledge in a certain range.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>Dismiss</p></font>\r\n<p>Dismiss. Once dismissed the NPC will act like a normal monster and can't be controlled again...so be careful when using this command.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Hiring mercenaries:</font>\r\n<p>Once a Bloodpledge takes over a castle, the prince of the Bloodpledge can hire and assign mercenaries to the members of the 'pledge. The members of the blood pledge can make commands to mercenaries by clicking on them.\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Controlling monsters with magic:</font>\r\n<p> Certain high-level spells will allow you to control monsters...see the spell section for more details.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Taming monsters:</font>\r\n<p> Using food which the various monsters desire, certain monsters such as dogs are tameable.  A full guide is really warranted here; see www.lineagethebloodpledge.com for details. \r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpnpc-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 Help: NPC 褻謙</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撮陛雖 寞徹縑 曖п PC陛 NPC蒂 褻謙й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 斜 寞徹戲煎朝 棻擠婁 偽擎 匙檜 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>辨煽婁曖 啗擒:</font>\r\n<p>撩擊 薄滄ж賊 辨煽擊 堅辨й 熱 氈啪 腌棲棻. 堅辨и 辨煽醞 ж釭蒂 贗葛ж賊 斜 睡渠 瞪羹縑 棻擠婁 偽擎 貲滄擊 頂萵 熱 氈蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>奢問 鷓撮</p></font>\r\n<p>辨煽 睡渠朝 堅辨輿蒂 評塭 檜翕ж棻陛 堅辨輿陛 奢問ж朝 渠鼻檜釭, 堅辨輿蒂 奢問ж朝 渠鼻檜釭, 濠褐擊 奢問ж朝 渠鼻擊 奢問м棲棻.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>寞橫 鷓撮</p></font>\r\n<p>辨煽 睡渠朝 堅辨輿蒂 評塭 檜翕ж棻陛 濠褐擊 奢問ж朝 渠鼻虜擊 奢問м棲棻.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>�瑍�</p></font>\r\n<p>辨煽 睡渠朝 貲滄檜 頂溥霞 濠葬縑憮 遺霜檜雖 彊蝗棲棻. 檜 鼻鷓縑憮 辨煽 睡渠朝 濠褐擊 奢問ж朝 渠鼻虜擊 奢問м棲棻.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>骯偃</p></font>\r\n<p>辨煽 睡渠朝 堅辨輿蒂 醞褕戲煎 詩葬 ぷ雖朝 渠⑽擊 虜蛙棲棻. \r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>唳啗</p></font>\r\n<p>辨煽 睡渠朝 貲滄檜 頂溥霞 濠葬縑憮 遺霜檜雖 彊蝗棲棻. 檜 鼻鷓縑憮 辨煽 睡渠朝 濠褐擊 奢問ж朝 渠鼻檜釭, 堅辨輿曖 ⑸裊婁 瞳渠 婦啗縑 氈朝 ⑸裊錳擊 橾薑 彰嬪 寰縑憮 奢問м棲棻.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>п骯</p></font>\r\n<p>辨煽 睡渠蒂 п骯м棲棻. п骯脹 辨煽 睡渠朝 橾奩 跨蝶攪諦 僅偽檜 鏃晝ж堅 棻衛 褻謙й 熱 橈啪 腎嘎煎 檜 貲滄擊 頂葬衛晦 瞪縑朝 醱碟�� 輿曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=eeeeae>葆徹縑 曖и 跨蝶攪 雖寡:</font>\r\n<p>5溯漣 葆徹 '纔檜墅 跨蝶攪'縑 曖п 瞳 跨蝶攪蒂 橾薑 衛除翕寰 雖寡й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 雖寡и 跨蝶攪縑啪 頂萵 熱 氈朝 貲滄擎 '辨煽'婁 翕橾м棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=eeeeae>翕僭 望菟檜晦:</font>\r\n<p>期渠 蛔曖 か熱и 跨蝶攪菟擎 詳擊 匙擊 輿朝 寞徹戲煎 望菟橾 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 檜楝и 翕僭菟擎 勒鬼й 陽爾棻朝 擒п螳 氈擊 陽 渦 望菟檜晦 蔣蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>か薑 翕僭擊 望菟橾 熱 氈朝 擠衝擎 翕僭 葆棻 棻腦嘎煎, 罹楝陛雖煎 衛紫蒂 п 爾衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<p>嬪曖 舒 陛雖 寞徹縑 曖п '雖寡'и NPC諦朝 殖葬, 望菟罹霞 翕僭擎 輿檣婁 л眷 諄遺戲煎賦 唳я纂蒂 橢橫 溯漣擊 螢萵 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 僭煩 溯漣檜 螃蒂 熱煙 翕僭擎 薄薄 渦 鬼п雖貊, 翕僭縑 評塭憮朝 か熱 棟溘檜 儅晦朝 唳辦紫 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>望菟檣 翕僭縑啪朝 雖樓瞳戲煎 擠衝擊 詳罹輿雖 彊戲賊 寰腌棲棻. 掛輿溥 氈朝等紫 輿檣檜 詳擊 匙擊 輿雖 彊戲賊 翕僭擎 輿檣擊 幗葬堅 集釭陛 幗萵雖紫 賅落棲棻. 橾奩瞳戲煎 期渠縑啪 堅晦蒂 輿賊 啪歜 陳濠煎 ж瑞 薑紫蒂 幗そ棲棻.\r\n<p>望菟檣 翕僭擎 輿檣檜 啪歜縑憮 釭陛紫 啗樓 葬棲雖 撮啗縑 陴嬴氈蝗棲棻. 斜楝и 唳辦蒂 嬪п 撮啗 陝雖縑朝 '擁諫 翕僭 爾婦模'陛 氈蝗棲棻. 擁諫 翕僭 爾婦模縑 翕僭擊 蜆晦賊 輿檣檜 棻衛 瓊戲楝 螢 陽梱雖 爾婦模 輿檣檜 翕僭擊 寰瞪ж啪 蜆嬴鄹棲棻. 僭煩 檜夠縑 氈朝 и擎 翕僭檜 掛輿萵 橾紫 橈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>望菟檣 翕僭擎 罹楝陛雖 嬴檜蠱擊 餌辨й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. か�� '敝�� 輿僥憮'蒂 翕僭縑啪 輿賊 輿檣檜 啪歜縑憮 釭鬲擊 陽 寰瞪ж啪 擁諫 翕僭 爾婦模煎 給嬴骨棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>望菟罹霞 翕僭縑啪虜 頂萵 熱 氈朝 棻擠婁 偽擎 か熱и 貲滄菟檜 氈蝗棲棻:\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>奢問 跡ル 雖薑</p></font>\r\n<p>翕僭擎 輿檣檜 雖薑и か薑 跨蝶攪 �分� PC 1檣擊 奢問м棲棻.\r\n<font fg=ffff0f><p>熱餵</p></font>\r\n<p>翕僭擎 輿檣擊 評塭棻棲棻陛 輿嬪縑 氈朝 僭勒擊 餵橫 輿檣縑啪 鄹棲棻. 翕僭曖 溯漣檜 螃蒂熱煙 詩葬 氈朝 夠縑 氈朝 僭勒梱雖 餵橫螃啪 腌棲棻.\r\n\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>","helppar-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>指令 說明：隊伍</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>只有同一血盟之間的才能組隊伍。一個隊伍人數最多八名。隊員之間可看到體力，打完怪物能分配經驗值。</p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>組隊伍:</font>\r\n<p>對著玩家在對話窗輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/invite'</font>執行。此時會產生新的隊伍。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>邀請隊員:</font>\r\n<p>對著要加入的玩家面前輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/invite'</font>執行。 '/invite'指令只有隊伍的領導者才能使用。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>驅逐隊員:</font>\r\n<p>隊伍的領導者可將隊伍成員從隊伍驅逐。在對話窗輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/banish [玩家名稱]'</font>執行。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>離開隊伍:</font>\r\n<p>在對話窗輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/outparty'</font>執行。若玩家想加入其他隊伍，一定得離開目前的隊伍才行。 <br>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helppar-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Party</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's possible to organize a party of up to 8 players to share experience while grouping. Party members can see each other's HP and chat to just the party members, as well as sharing experience from battles.</p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Creating a party:</font>\r\n<p>Type <font fg=ffffff>'/invite'</font> before the person with whom you would like to form the party; this will create the new party with yourself as the leader.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Inviting new members to the party:</font>\r\n<p>Type <font fg=ffffff>'/invite</font> before the person you want to invite, use the '/invite' command.  This command can only be used by the leader of the party.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Banning party members:</font>\r\n<p>The party leader can ban his party members from his party. Type <font fg=ffffff>'/banparty [character name]'</font> to do this.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Leaving the party:</font>\r\n<p>Type <font fg=ffffff>'/outparty'</font> to leave your party - necessary before joining a new party.  Restarting or quitting will also cause you to leave your party. <br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helppar-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Party</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's possible to organize a party of up to 8 players to share experience while grouping. Party members can see each other's HP and chat to just the party members, as well as sharing experience from battles.</p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Creating a party:</font>\r\n<p>Type <font fg=ffffff>'/invite'</font> before the person with whom you would like to form the party; this will create the new party with yourself as the leader.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Inviting new members to the party:</font>\r\n<p>Type <font fg=ffffff>'/invite</font> before the person you want to invite, use the '/invite' command.  This command can only be used by the leader of the party.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Banning party members:</font>\r\n<p>The party leader can ban his party members from his party. Type <font fg=ffffff>'/banparty [character name]'</font> to do this.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Leaving the party:</font>\r\n<p>Type <font fg=ffffff>'/outparty'</font> to leave your party - necessary before joining a new party.  Restarting or quitting will also cause you to leave your party. <br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helppar-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 Help: だじ</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>翕橾и ⑸裊縑 樓и ⑸裊錳郭葬朝 だじ蒂 掘撩й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. だじ朝 譆渠 8貲梱雖 陛棟ж貊 だじ錳郭葬朝 憮煎 HP陛 爾檜堅 餌傖й 陽 唳я纂蒂 釭援橫 �僱磈� 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>だじ 虜菟晦:</font>\r\n<p>だじ錳戲煎 й 餌辨濠 擅縑憮 瓣た 殮溘璽縑 <font fg=ffffff>'/蟾渠'</font>塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. 斜楝賊 濠褐擊 だじ 葬渦煎 ж朝 億煎遴 だじ陛 儅撩腌棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>だじ縑 蟾渠ж晦:</font>\r\n<p>陛殮衛鑒 餌辨濠 擅縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/蟾渠'</font>塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. '/蟾渠' 貲滄擎 斜 だじ曖 だじ 葬渦虜檜 餌辨й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>だじ錳擊 蹺寞ж晦:</font>\r\n<p>だじ 葬渦朝 濠褐曖 だじ錳擊 だじ縑憮 蹺寞й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/だじ蹺寞 [馨葛攪 檜葷]'</font>檜塭堅 殮溘м棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>だじ縑憮 驍黴:</font>\r\n<p>瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/だじ驍黴'</font> 塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. 檜嘐 だじ縑 菟橫氈朝 議葛攪朝 斜 だじ擊 驍黴ж雖 彊堅朝 億煎遴 だじ縑 陛殮й 熱 橈蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>","helpple-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>指令 說明：血盟</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>創造血盟:</font>\r\n<p>在對話窗輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/create'</font>執行。此指令只限為王子和公主。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>加入血盟:</font>\r\n<p>在盟主面前輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/join'</font>執行。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>看血盟之情報:</font>\r\n<p>在對話窗輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/pledge'</font>執行。加入完成之後才能看血盟之情報。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>驅逐血盟員:</font>\r\n<p>盟主可有將盟員驅逐的權利。在對話窗輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/ban [玩家名稱]'</font>執行。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>離開血盟:</font>\r\n<p>在對話窗輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/leave'</font>執行。若想加入其他血盟，需要離開目前的血盟才行。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>賦予盟員封號:</font>\r\n<p>在對話窗輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/title [玩家ID] [封號]'</font>執行。這指令要等級十以上的君主才能使用。若想自己取稱號，等到等級四十以上且不加入任何血盟才行。<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>上傳血盟徽章:</font>\r\n<p>首先以色素24bit色、大小為16x12像素製作要作為盟徽的圖形並存成bmp檔，把這個檔拷貝在安裝的天堂目錄裡，在對話窗輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/emblem [Bmp圖檔檔名]'</font> 執行。\r\n<p>若想在畫面上試用盟徽，在對話窗輸入<font fg=ffffff>'/checkbmp [Bmp圖檔檔名]'</font>執行。此時圖檔並不會上傳至伺服器，只能測試在畫面上的感覺如何。 <br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>血盟之間的戰爭:</font>\r\n<p>盟主可針對其他盟主宣戰。請參考關於戰鬥之說明檔。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","helpple-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Blood Pledge</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Create a Bloodpledge:</font>\r\n<p>From the chat window, type <font fg=ffffff>'/create'</font>- but this command is\r\n usable only by princes and princesses.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Join a Bloodpledge:</font>\r\n<p>While standing in front of the bloodpledge leader, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>'/join'</font>.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Ban pledge member:</font>\r\n<p>The leader of a pledge can ban his or her pledge members. From the chat window, type <font fg=ffffff>'/ban [character name]'</font>.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Leave a Bloodpledge:</font>\r\n<p>If you want to leave your pledge, type <font fg=ffffff>'/leave'</font> into the chat window. A character must leave their current bloodpledge to join a new one.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Grant a title to a Bloodpledge member:</font>\r\n<p>From the chat window, type <font fg=ffffff>'/title [User ID] [Title to be granted]'</font>. This command is\r\n usable on pledge members by a prince or princess at level 10 or higher, or by any character of level 40\r\n or higher to grant a title to himself, regardless of blood pledge status.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Create an emblem for the Bloodpledge:</font>\r\n<p>From the chat window, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>'/emblem [Emblem bitmap file name]'</font>. The bitmap file should be located in the same directory where Lineage is installed. The format of bitmap file is restricted to 16x12, with 24bit color.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Test emblem bitmap file:</font>\r\n<p>From the chat window, type\r\n<font fg=ffffff>'/checkbmp [Emblem bitmap file name]'</font>. You can test your emblem in the game without uploading it to the server.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>War between the pledges:</font>\r\n<p>A Bloodpledge leader can declare war against another pledge - please consult combat related help for detail.\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img></body>","helpple-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>Command Help: Blood Pledge</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>Create a Bloodpledge:</font>\r\n<p>From the chat window, type <font fg=ffffff>'/create'</font>- but this command is\r\n usable only by princes and princesses.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Join a Bloodpledge:</font>\r\n<p>While standing in front of the bloodpledge leader, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>'/join'</font>.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Ban pledge member:</font>\r\n<p>The leader of a pledge can ban his or her pledge members. From the chat window, type <font fg=ffffff>'/ban [character name]'</font>.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Leave a Bloodpledge:</font>\r\n<p>If you want to leave your pledge, type <font fg=ffffff>'/leave'</font> into the chat window. A character must leave their current bloodpledge to join a new one.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Grant a title to a Bloodpledge member:</font>\r\n<p>From the chat window, type <font fg=ffffff>'/title [User ID] [Title to be granted]'</font>. This command is\r\n usable on pledge members by a prince or princess at level 10 or higher, or by any character of level 40\r\n or higher to grant a title to himself, regardless of blood pledge status.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Create an emblem for the Bloodpledge:</font>\r\n<p>From the chat window, type\r\n <font fg=ffffff>'/emblem [Emblem bitmap file name]'</font>. The bitmap file should be located in the same directory where Lineage is installed. The format of bitmap file is restricted to 16x12, with 24bit color.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>Test emblem bitmap file:</font>\r\n<p>From the chat window, type\r\n<font fg=ffffff>'/checkbmp [Emblem bitmap file name]'</font>. You can test your emblem in the game without uploading it to the server.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>War between the pledges:</font>\r\n<p>A Bloodpledge leader can declare war against another pledge - please consult combat related help for detail.\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img></body>","helpple-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=center>貲滄橫 Help: ⑸裊</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf>⑸裊 虜菟晦:</font>\r\n<p>瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/璽撲'</font> 檜塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. 檜 貲滄擎 諾濠釭 奢輿虜檜 餌辨й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>⑸裊縑 陛殮ж晦:</font>\r\n<p>陛殮ж堅濠 ж朝 ⑸裊曖 裊輿 擅縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/陛殮'</font>檜塭堅 殮溘м棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>⑸裊 薑爾 爾晦:</font>\r\n<p>瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/⑸裊'</font>檜塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. ⑸裊縑 陛殮腎 氈橫撿虜 薑爾陛 ル衛腌棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>⑸裊錳擊 蹺寞ж晦:</font>\r\n<p>⑸裊曖 裊輿朝 濠褐曖 ⑸裊錳擊 ⑸裊縑憮 蹺寞й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/蹺寞 [馨葛攪 檜葷]'</font>檜塭堅 殮溘м棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>⑸裊縑憮 驍黴:</font>\r\n<p>瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/驍黴'</font> 塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. 檜嘐 ⑸裊縑 菟橫氈朝 議葛攪朝 斜 ⑸裊擊 驍黴ж雖 彊堅朝 億煎遴 ⑸裊縑 陛殮й 熱 橈蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>⑸裊錳縑啪 ��蘆 睡罹ж晦:</font>\r\n<p>瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/��蘆 [嶸盪 ID] [睡罹й ��蘆]'</font> 擊 殮溘м棲棻. 檜 貲滄擎 ⑸裊擊 陛霞 10溯漣 檜鼻曖 諾濠釭 奢輿虜檜 餌辨й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. ⑸裊縑 菟雖 彊擎 餌塋檜 蝶蝶煎 濠褐縑啪 ��蘆擊 睡罹ж晦 嬪п憮朝 40溯漣 檜鼻檜橫撿 м棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>⑸裊 僥濰 厥晦:</font>\r\n<p>僥濰縑 餌辨й Bitmap File擊 虜菟橫 Lineage陛 檣蝶驗腎橫氈朝 蛤滓饜葬縑 蘋Яи ��, 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/僥濰 [Bitmap File 檜葷]'</font> 塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. 僥濰檜 腆 熱 氈朝 Bitmap擎 24bit Color縑 觼晦陛 16x12罹撿 м棲棻.\r\n<p>僥濰戲煎 餌辨й Bitmap擊 嘐葬 �飛橦□� 纔蝶おж堅 談擊 陽縑朝 瓣た 殮溘璽縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>'/僥濰�挫� [Bitmap File 檜葷]'</font>塭堅 殮溘м棲棻. 檜溢啪 ц擊 唳辦 憮幗縑朝 Upload腎雖 彊堅 �飛橦� 橫飩啪 爾檜朝雖虜 纔蝶お п 獐 熱 氈蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffaf><p>⑸裊除曖 瞪爵:</font>\r\n<p>⑸裊曖 捱輿朝 棻艇 ⑸裊縑啪 瞪爵擊 摹んй 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 濠撮и 餌о擎 瞪癱 婦溼 Help蒂 霤褻п 輿褊衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"help\"></img>\r\n</body>","hen1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>母雞：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>咕咕咕咕...咕咕咕...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hen1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>buk buk BUKAWK!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hen1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>buk buk BUKAWK!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hen1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>懍髒:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>窒窒渥...窕窒窒...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","herbert1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>哈巴特:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需不需要斗篷或Ｔ恤啊？也許你知道我的手藝，我衣服做得還滿不錯的呢。不過要給我一點酬勞才行。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br><a link=\"herbert3\">製作Ｔ恤</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"herbert4\">製作抗魔法斗篷</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"herbert5\">製作保護者斗篷</a> \r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","herbert1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Herbert the Tailor :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Do you need a cloak or shirt of some sort? I don't want to brag, but I am good at what I do. Why don't you let me try? In return you should prepare my fee.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br><a link=\"herbert3\">Make a T-shirt.</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"herbert4\">Make a Cloak of Magic resistance</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"herbert5\">Make a Cloak of Protection</a> \r\n\r\n</body>","herbert1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Herbert the Tailor :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Do you need a cloak or shirt of some sort? I don't want to brag but I am good at what I do. Why don't you let me try? In return you should prepare my fee.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br><a link=\"herbert3\">Make a T-shirt.</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"herbert4\">Make a Cloak of Magic resistance</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"herbert5\">Make a Cloak of Protection</a> \r\n\r\n</body>","herbert1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>營欽餌 ъ幗お :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐 �公� 蜂饜釭 敷隴 偽擎 匙檜 в蹂ж雖 彊模? 濠嫌й 橾擎 嬴棲雖虜 頂陛 紮 槭噢陛 謠棻辦. и廓 釭縑啪 蜆啖爾朝 勒 橫飩模? 渠褐 斜虜и 熱堅綠朝 遽綠п 輿衛朝 啪 謠擊剪蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br><a link=\"herbert3\">じ敷隴蒂 虜萇棻.</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"herbert4\">葆徹蜂饜蒂 虜萇棻</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"herbert5\">爾�ㄧ豁銝� 虜萇棻</a> \r\n\r\n</body>","herbert2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>哈巴特:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>不好意思。我不想跟一個罪犯交易。請你離開。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","herbert2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Herbert the Tailor :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I am sorry, but I don't deal with your kind. Get Out!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","herbert2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Herbert the Tailor :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I am sorry, but i don't deal with your kind. Get Out!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","herbert2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>營欽餌 ъ幗お :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嘐寰ж雖虜 渡褐偽擎 彰賸濠諦朝 鼻渠ж晦紫 褓模. 綠麵輿衛螃.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","herbert3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>哈巴特:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>若要製作一件Ｔ恤需要三張紅色布料、兩張藍色布料、十張白色布料，另外還得給我三萬金幣。</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request t-shirt\">製作Ｔ恤</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","herbert3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Herbert the Tailor :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p> To make a T-shirt you need 3 red cloths, 2 blue cloths, and 10 white cloths. My service charge will be 30,000 adenas.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request t-shirt\">Make a T-shirt</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","herbert3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Herbert the Tailor :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p> To make a T-shirt you need 3 red cloths, 2 blue cloths, and 10 white cloths. My service charge will be 30,000 adenas.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request t-shirt\">Make a T-shirt</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","herbert3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>營欽餌 ъ幗お :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p> じ敷隴蒂 虜菟溥賊 碩擎 褡馬 3濰, だ塢 褡馬 2濰, ж擔 褡馬 10濰檜 в蹂ж螃. 熱堅綠朝 3虜 嬴等釭蹂.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request t-shirt\">じ敷隴蒂 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","herbert4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>哈巴特:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>製作抗魔法斗篷需要十張紅色布料、兩張藍色布料、一張白色布料。另外還得給我一仟金幣。</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request cloak of magic resistance\">製作抗魔法斗篷 </a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","herbert4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Herbert the Tailor :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p> To make a Cloak of magic resistance you need 10 red cloths, 2 blue cloths, and 1 white cloth. My service charge will be 1,000 adenas.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request cloak of magic resistance\">Make a Cloak of magic resistance</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","herbert4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Herbert the Tailor :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p> To make a Cloak of magic resistance you need 10 red cloths, 2 blue cloths, and 1 white cloth. My service charge will be 1,000 adenas.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request cloak of magic resistance\">Make a Cloak of magic resistance</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","herbert4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>營欽餌 ъ幗お :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p> 葆徹蜂饜蒂 虜菟溥賊 碩擎 褡馬 10濰, だ塢 褡馬 2濰, ж擔 褡馬 1濰檜 в蹂ж螃. 熱堅綠朝 1000 嬴等釭蹂.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request cloak of magic resistance\">葆徹蜂饜蒂 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","herbert5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>哈巴特:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>製作保護者斗篷需要五張紅色布料、五張藍色布料、十張白色布料，另外還要兩萬金幣。</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request cloak of protection\">製作保護者斗篷</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","herbert5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Herbert the Tailor :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p> To make a Cloak of protection you need 5 red cloths, 5 blue cloths, and 10 white cloths. My service charge will be 20,000 adenas.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request cloak of protection\">Make a Cloak of protection</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","herbert5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Herbert the Tailor :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p> To make a Cloak of protection you need 5 red cloths, 5 blue cloths, and 10 white cloths. My service charge will be 20,000 adenas.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request cloak of protection\">Make a Cloak of protection</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","herbert5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>營欽餌 ъ幗お :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p> 爾�ㄧ豁銝� 虜菟溥賊 碩擎 褡馬 5濰, だ塢 褡馬 5濰, ж擔 褡馬 10濰檜 в蹂ж螃. 熱堅綠朝 2虜 嬴等釭蹂.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request cloak of protection\">爾�ㄧ豁銝� 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","horun1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哈囉！今天多麼美好的一個日子呀。<a link=\"horun2\">安特</a> 也看起來很非常好。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如果只有<a link=\"horun3\">我的主人</a>和我在這裡...。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">學習魔法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","horun1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hello! What a nice day today. The <a link=\"horun2\">Ents</a> are looking positively spritely today.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...but if only <a link=\"horun3\">my master</a> were here to enjoy this...</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hello! What a nice day today. The <a link=\"horun2\">Ents</a> are looking positively spritely today.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...but if only <a link=\"horun3\">my master</a> were here to enjoy this...</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>寰喟ж撮蹂! 螃棺紫 霤 謠擎 陳噢啻蹂. <a link=\"horun2\">縛お</a>菟紫 紮 晦碟檜 謠嬴爾檜朝等蹂?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...檜楛 陽 <a link=\"horun3\">蝶蝓椒</a>檜 啗樟戲賊 偽檜 骯疇檜塭紫 ц擊蘸等...</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a>\r\n</body>","horun2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在那些森林的<a link=\"horun4\">守護神</a> 之中，我比較喜歡安特。</p>\r\n<p>在殷海薩所有創造的生物之中，他們是最沉默的。不過他們可能是最有學問的喔！你難道不認為他們是最深入<a link=\"horun5\">世界樹</a>的種族？</p>\r\n<p>...</p>\r\n<p>它的用處不僅僅是因為你能從他們那邊得到<a link=\"horun6\">樹枝或樹皮</a>而已∼</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在再仔細想一想，<a link=\"horun3\">我的主人</a>跟安特可是非常親近。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">學習魔法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","horun2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Among the <a link=\"horun4\">guardians</a> of the forest, I like Ents the most.</p>\r\n<p>They are the most reticent of all the creations of Einhasad, but they are probably the most learned. After all, they are direct descendants of the <a link=\"horun5\">World Tree</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>...</p>\r\n<p>It's not just because you can get <a link=\"horun6\">a twig or bark</a> from them~</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Come to think of it, <a link=\"horun3\">my master</a> was very close with the Ents.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Among the <a link=\"horun4\">guardians</a> of the forest, I like Ents the most.</p>\r\n<p>They are the most reticent of all the creations of Einhasad, but they are probably the most learned. After all, they are direct descendants of the <a link=\"horun5\">World Tree</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>...</p>\r\n<p>It's not just because you can get <a link=\"horun6\">a twig or bark</a> from them~</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Come to think of it, <a link=\"horun3\">my master</a> was very close with the Ents.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>盪朝 檜 膛曖 <a link=\"horun4\">熱��濠菟</a> 醞縑憮 縛お縑啪 陛濰 �ㄟ阱� 陛蹂.</p>\r\n<p>斜菟擎 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 賅萇 璽褻僭 醞 陛濰 婁僧ж雖虜, 陛濰 號擎 匙擊 憲堅 氈轄. 嬴葆 <a link=\"horun5\">撮啗熱</a>諦 陛濰 桶檜 掖盟ж朝 匙紫 偽擎 衝僭檣 縛お菟檜 嬴棍梱蹂?</p>\r\n<p>...</p>\r\n<p>窕 斜菟縑啪憮 <a link=\"horun6\">還晦釭 皎韓</a>擊 橢擊 熱 氈晦 陽僥虜擎 嬴棲塭堅蹂~\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...斜楝堅爾賊 <a link=\"horun3\">蝶蝓椒</a>眷憮紫 縛お諦 桶擎 翱碟擊 陛雖堅 啗樟轄.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a>\r\n</body>","horun3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>即使我可能看起來不怎麼樣，但我也算是偉大巫師哈汀的一個徒弟呢。嘿嘿∼雖然在他離開之後，我已不向以前那般善用魔法，但是我仍然擁有魔法力。</p>\r\n<p>我的主人幾年以前離開這裡只說：「那是我故友的兒子，我必須要去實踐一個舊有的約定。」</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖然他的離去讓我覺得孤單，但那沒關係，因為我從小是一個孤兒，所以我已經習慣了。因為像你一樣的旅人們一次又一次的來拜訪這裡，所以我也閒不下來。</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">學習魔法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","horun3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Even though I might not look like such, I am an apprentice of the great wizard Hardin.  Unfortunately, I never fully completed my training under my master before he left....</p>\r\n<p>He left here several years ago, saying that an old pledge required him to protect his lord's son</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...I felt quite lonely after he left, but it is all right - I was an orphan, so I'm used to it. Furthermore, I have things to distract me such as guests like you visiting me from time to time.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Even though I might not look like such, I am an apprentice of the great wizard Hardin.  Unfortunately, I never fully completed my training under my master before he left....</p>\r\n<p>He left here several years ago, saying that an old pledge required him to protect his lord's son</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...I felt quite lonely after he left, but it is all right - I was an orphan, so I'm used to it. Furthermore, I have things to distract me such as guests like you visiting me from time to time.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>盪朝 檜楚瘋紫 渠葆徹餌 ж蛞曖 薯濠奧棲棻. ж雖虜 葆徹擊 寡遴 晦除檜 斜葬 螃楚腎霞 彊嬴憮 褒溘擎 滲滲纂 跤ж轄, ④④.</p>\r\n<p>蝶蝓椒眷憮朝 賃 п 瞪縑 \"螃楚瞪縑 裕擎 裊擒縑 評塭 裊輿曖 濠衝擊 爾��ж楝 集陪棻.\"塭朝 蜓噪擊 陴晦衛堅 檜夠擊 集釭樟蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...蝶蝓椒檜 集釭敷憮 噩噩ж曹 ж雖虜, 惘雛嬴蹂. 瞪 錳楚 堅嬴艘晦 陽僥縑 諼煎遺縑朝 櫛熨ж剪萇蹂. 傳 罹楝碟菟 偽擎 槳椒菟檜 濠輿 瓊嬴諦 輿衛棲 模橾剪葬紫 氈堅 蜓檜縑蹂.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a>\r\n</body>","horun4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>安特、精靈、芮克妮和潘。根據傳說，在剛開始時他們只有少數，但是當殷海薩創造妖精們的時候，他選擇所創造了那四個種族並命他們成為森林的守護神。</p>\r\n<p>據說他從一棵樹創造出安特；芮克妮來自一個在那棵樹築穴的蜘蛛；潘來自一隻在牧場吃牧草的羊；而精靈則來自飛到樹旁邊的花上，吸取花蜜的蝴蝶。然後祂給予了他們一個任務：「去保護所有森林和森林中善良的妖精，我的守護者們∼」</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>守護神基本上保護妖精們，而且對在森林中的非妖精是很有攻擊性的。但是很例外的，因為我的主人和妖精們是朋友，所以他們很親切的對待我還有我的主人。</p>\r\n<p>如果一個妖精犯下殺死另外一個妖精、人類或守護神的罪，那麼守護神絕不會寬容他的。因此，生氣的守護神的力量的確是很可怕的。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">學習魔法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","horun4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ent, Fairy, Arachne, and Pan. According to legend they were just trifling existences at the beginning, but when Einhasad created elves he selected those four races among his creations to appoint as guardians of the forest and elves.</p>\r\n<p>It's said that He created Ent from a sapling born of the World Tree, Arachne from a spider who made his lair on the World Tree, Pan from a goat grazing nearby grasses, and the Fairy from a butterfly who had flown to the flowers beside the World Tree. He gave these races a duty to protect all the forest and the elves who followed him therin.</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Guardians will protect elves and are aggressive to non-elves in the forest....I am an exception due to my master, and my elven friends.</p>\r\n<p>But even if you are of elven blood, if you have killed other elves, humans, or guardians, then guardians will not tolerate your presence - and the power of angry guardians are indeed something to look upon.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ent, Fairy, Arachne, and Pan. According to legend they were just trifling existences at the beginning, but when Einhasad created elves he selected those four races among his creations to appoint as guardians of the forest and elves.</p>\r\n<p>It's said that He created Ent from a sapling born of the World Tree, Arachne from a spider who made his lair on the World Tree, Pan from a goat grazing nearby grasses, and the Fairy from a butterfly who had flown to the flowers beside the World Tree. He gave these races a duty to protect all the forest and the elves who followed him therin.</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Guardians will protect elves and are aggressive to non-elves in the forest....I am an exception due to my master, and my elven friends.</p>\r\n<p>But even if you are of elven blood, if you have killed other elves, humans, or guardians, then guardians will not tolerate your presence - and the power of angry guardians are indeed something to look upon.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>縛お諦 む橫葬, 嬴塭觼啻, 斜葬堅 っ. 瞪撲縑 曖ж賊 斜菟擎 獄楚 爾澀匙 橈朝 襄營菟檜歷朝等, 嬴檣ж餌萄眷憮 籀擠 蹂薑褶擊 璽褻ж褒 陽 斜菟擊 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 餌學л戲煎睡攪 爾��ж衛晦 嬪п憮 濠褐曖 Я褻僭菟 醞縑憮 4謙褶擊 鉻嬴憮 檜 膛婁 蹂薑菟曖 熱��濠煎 鳴戲樟棻渦捱蹂.</p>\r\n<p>橫萼 釭鼠曖 髡跡縑憮 縛お蒂, 斜 髡跡曖 陛雖縑 餵擊 雖擎 剪嘐縑憮 嬴塭觼啻蒂. 蟾錳縑憮 ヴ擊 嗯堅 氈朝 膩模縑憮 っ擊, 斜葬堅 斜 蕙縑 б 粒縑 陳嬴萇 釭綠縑憮 む橫葬蒂 璽褻ж樟棻堅 м棲棻. 斜葬堅 斜菟縑啪 檜 膛婁 膛縑 餌朝 雜и 蹂薑菟擊 雖酈塭朝 曖鼠蒂 輿樟轄.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>熱��濠菟擎 晦獄瞳戲煎 蹂薑擊 爾��ж貊 膛縑 藹殮ж朝 蹂薑 檜諼曖 謙褶菟擊 瞳渠衛м棲棻. 盪朝 盪曖 蝶蝓椒婁 蹂薑 耀掘菟檜 氈戲棲 覬 蕨諼雖虜 蜓檜轄.</p>\r\n<p>ж雖虜 嬴鼠葬 蹂薑檜塭紫 棻艇 蹂薑檜釭 檣除, �分� 熱��濠蒂 避檣 濠蒂 熱��濠菟擎 辨憮ж雖 彊蝗棲棻. 碟喻и 熱��濠菟曖 ��擎 陛奢й虜ж雖蹂.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a>\r\n</body>","horun5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>它是這個森林由殷海薩創造的第一個生命形式。</p>\r\n<p>依照聖約書，殷海薩在空曠的大地上創造了世界樹。並且取這棵裝滿大地生命力量的世界樹，以其能量創造其他的動物和植物。</p>\r\n<p>世界樹的生命力量集中在森林裡，神用世界樹的葉子創造了妖精，然後就像神所愛的人們一樣，妖精也承諾世界和平的生活。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>因此，當殷海薩和格蘭肯處於對抗的時候，世界樹保護所有的妖精們。這也就是妖精為什麼在世界樹周圍會感到溫暖的原因。</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">學習魔法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ah, the first life form in this forest created by Einhasad.</p>\r\n<p>According to our sacred books, Einhasad created the World Tree on the void earth, and the life force from this World Tree filled the earth and created the other animals and plants.</p>\r\n<p>In this forest where the life force of the World tree is concentrated, Einhasad created elves from a leaf of the World Tree. Elves were promised a peaceful life as the beings most loved by the first life form.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Even at this point, when Einhasad and Gran Kain are fighting, the World Tree benefits every elf...elves can still feel warmth around the World Tree.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ah, the first life form in this forest created by Einhasad.</p>\r\n<p>According to our sacred books, Einhasad created the World Tree on the void earth, and the life force from this World Tree filled the earth and created the other animals and plants.</p>\r\n<p>In this forest where the life force of the World tree is concentrated, Einhasad created elves from a leaf of the World Tree. Elves were promised a peaceful life as the beings most loved by the first life form.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Even at this point, when Einhasad and Gran Kain are fighting, the World Tree benefits every elf...elves can still feel warmth around the World Tree.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 膛縑 梓萇 鷓堅曖 儅貲殮棲棻. 嬴檣ж餌萄陛 璽褻и 譆蟾曖 儅貲羹塭堅紫 ж雖蹂.</p>\r\n<p>唳瞪縑 評腦賊 嬴檣ж餌萄朝 嬴鼠 匙紫 橈朝 渠雖 嬪縑 辦摹 撮啗熱蒂 璽褻ж樟蝗棲棻. 斜楝濠 撮啗熱曖 儅貲溘檜 渠雖縑 醱虜ж罹 雖鼻縑 螞乾 謙盟曖 翕衝僭菟檜 鷓橫釭啪 腎歷雖蹂.</p>\r\n<p>斜葬堅 撮啗熱曖 儅貲溘檜 譆堅煎 餵醞腎橫 氈朝 檜 膛縑憮, 褐眷憮朝 撮啗熱曖 濟擊 餌辨ж罹 蹂薑菟擊 璽褻ж樟蝗棲棻. 蹂薑擎 鷓蟾曖 儅貲縑啪 餌嫌嫡朝 襄營煎賦 檜 膛縑憮 艙錳�� ゎ�風怷� 魂擊 擒樓嫡懊蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎偽檜 嬴檣ж餌萄諦 斜嫌 蘋檣檜 問溺ж啪 諄辦堅 氈朝 陽縑紫 撮啗熱朝 蹂薑菟縑啪 評嗆и 擎��蒂 寡ヴ橫鄹棲棻. 蹂薑菟檜 <font fg=ffffff>撮啗熱 斬籀縑 陛賊 跺婁 葆擠檜 �蛹�</font>腎朝 匙擊 替郭朝 匙紫 夥煎 斜楛 檜嶸 陽僥檜雖蹂.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a>\r\n</body>","horun6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>通常安特的樹枝可以用來做弓或箭。有時他們會用從樹皮抽取而來的線來做衣服，至於比較厚的樹皮則可以用來做盔甲，所以這些材料當然也包含魔法的性質。</p>\r\n<p>舉例來說，安特的樹枝和樹皮可以強烈地影響芮克妮，加速他們產生網或蛻皮的速度。</p>\r\n<p>安特寶貴的水果的療效也非常好。另外也有人說，安特的樹枝可以中和各種的毒素。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你必須攻擊安特，使那些枯掉的小樹枝掉下來，才能得到安特的樹枝。但如果你想要得到一片樹皮，首先必須要用到蘑菇汁，因為安特的樹皮又硬又很難削，所以必須要先使用它來軟化才行。</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">學習魔法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","horun6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Usually twigs of Ent are used for bows or arrows, and sometimes they are used for clothes by extracting thread from them. The thick barks are oft used for armor. But these materials also contain magical properties...</p>\r\n<p>For example, both twigs and barks of Ent affect Arachne strongly, accelerating their speed of producing webs or ecdysis.</p>\r\n<p>Also the precious fruit of Ent is very good for healing...similarly, there is also a legend that a twig of Ent can neutralize all kind of poisons.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To get a twig of Ent, you must simply bash Ents and thus cause their dead twigs to fall...but to get a bark you have to apply <a link=\"horun7\">fungus juice</a> at first because it is quite hard to peel normally.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Usually twigs of Ent are used for bows or arrows, and sometimes they are used for clothes by extracting thread from them. The thick barks are oft used for armor. But these materials also contain magical properties...</p>\r\n<p>For example, both twigs and barks of Ent affect Arachne strongly, accelerating their speed of producing webs or ecdysis.</p>\r\n<p>Also the precious fruit of Ent is very good for healing...similarly, there is also a legend that a twig of Ent can neutralize all kind of poisons.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To get a twig of Ent, you must simply bash Ents and thus cause their dead twigs to fall...but to get a bark you have to apply <a link=\"horun7\">fungus juice</a> at first because it is quite hard to peel normally.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>爾鱔 <font fg=ffffff>縛お曖 還晦</font>朝 <font fg=ffffff>�偯抭� �香�</font>擊 虜菟剪釭 撰嶸蒂 鉻嬴 <font fg=ffffff>褡</font>擊 騁朝等 餌辨腎堅, 舒疏遴 <font fg=ffffff>皎韓</font>擎 除欽и <font fg=ffffff>骨褡</font>擊 虜萄朝等 餌辨腎雖蹂. ж雖虜 檜菟 營猿朝 葆徹瞳檣 �膩�紫 陛雖堅 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>蕨蒂 菟橫 縛お曖 還晦釭 皎韓擎 賅舒 嬴塭觼啻縑啪 鬼ж啪 濛辨п憮, 斜喪菟檜 <font fg=ffffff>剪嘐還</font>擊 鉻啪 ж剪釭 <font fg=ffffff>驍Я蒂 襠霞</font>ж啪 м棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>傳 鼻渡�� 敝и <font fg=ffffff>縛お曖 翮衙朝 羹溘 �蛹嘗�</font>煎 嬴輿 謠港棲棻. 傳 蕨瞪睡攪 <font fg=ffffff>縛お曖 還晦蒂 壅橫 詳戲賊 賅萇 謙盟曖 絮縑 澀 菔朝棻</font>堅菟 ж雖蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>縛お曖 還晦朝 爾鱔 <font fg=ffffff>縛お蒂 舒萄葬賊</font> 避擎 還晦菟檜 雲橫雖棲梱 蔣啪 掘й 熱 氈雖虜, 縛お曖 皎韓擎 試盪 縛お曖 跺縑 <a link=\"horun7\">幗撓 ん濠曖 闆</a>擊 夥艇 棻擠縑 慇晦雖 彊戲賊 欽欽п憮 澀 寰慇啖螳蹂.</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a>\r\n</body>","horun7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>只要去攻擊圍繞在森林裡的蕈類，你就可以得到蘑菇汁。</a>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">學習魔法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can get it by killing Fungii which are quite common around the forest.</a>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can get it by killing Fungii which are quite common around the forest.</a>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">Learn Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horun7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 膛縑憮 �褙� 獐 熱 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>み剪蝶</font>塭朝 跨蝶攪蒂 避檜賊 掘й 熱 氈橫蹂.</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunEv1\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a>\r\n</body>","horunev1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>魔法力量是從善神殷海薩和邪神格蘭肯之間衝突產生的，所以它總是不穩定地附著在善與惡之間。\r\n<p>於是有時人們會因此誤入惡途...。希望你不是他們的其中之一。如果不是，我就願意教你魔法來和你交換<a link=\"horunev4\">我的研究所需要的材料</a>。</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"skillspell\">學習魔法</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp1\">問有關魔法的事</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","horunev1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Magic is power stemming from the conflict between the good God Einhasad and evil God Gran Kain; thus it's always precariously perched between good and evil.\r\n<p>'Tis why sometimes people fall into evil ways...but you are not one of them, are you? If not, I'll teach you magic in exchange for <a link=\"horunev4\">materials I need for my research</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"xchgspell\">Learn Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp1\">Ask about Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunev1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Magic is power stemming from the conflict between the good God Einhasad and evil God Gran Kain; thus it's always precariously perched between good and evil.\r\n<p>'Tis why sometimes people fall into evil ways...but you are not one of them, are you? If not, I'll teach you magic in exchange for <a link=\"horunev4\">materials I need for my research</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"xchgspell\">Learn Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp1\">Ask about Magic</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunev1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>葆徹擎 摹и 褐 嬴檣ж餌萄諦 學и 褐 斜嫌 蘋檣 餌檜曖 癱爵縑 曖п 儅啖陪 ��殮棲棻. 斜溢晦 陽僥縑 葆徹餌菟曖 葆擠擎 樹薯釭 摹л婁 學л 餌檜縑憮 嬴蝸嬴蝸и 還顫晦蒂 ж堅 氈雖蹂.</p>\r\n<p>斜楚憮 陽煎朝 學曖 望煎 緒雖朝 餌塋菟紫 儅晦啪 腌棲棻虜...渡褐檜 �公� 斜楛 餌塋擎 嬴棲啊轄? 斜溢棻賊 薯 <a link=\"horunev4\">葆徹 翱掘縑 в蹂и 營猿</a>菟婁 掖�� 褻勒戲煎 葆徹擊 陛腦藥 萄葬轄.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"xchgspell\">葆徹擊 寡遴棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp1\">葆徹縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunev2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>無論你如何努力的試，但是就我所知，神不會把力量借給像你一樣的騎士。</p>\r\n<p>當然有一些有關終極的魔法戰士傳說，但是我懷疑如此一般的超人真的存在嗎？</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","horunev2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As far as I know the Eisenhad doesn't lend the power of spellcasting to a knight like you however hard you might try.</p>\r\n<p>Of course there is a legend about the ultimate Magic Warrior I have sometimes heard... But I doubt that such a man can exist on this world.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","horunev2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As far as I know the Eisenhad doesn't lend the power of spellcasting to a knight like you however hard you might try.</p>\r\n<p>Of course there is a legend about the ultimate Magic Warrior I have sometimes heard... But I doubt that such a man can exist on this world.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","horunev2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>薯陛 憲晦煎朝 渡褐偽擎 晦餌朝 葆徹擊 嬴鼠葬 奢睡п紫 褐眷憮 ��擊 網溥輿衛晦 彊朝等蹂.</p>\r\n<p>匐婁 葆徹擊 翕衛縑 斛и梱雖 蹺掘и 葆徹 瞪餌曖 瞪撲擎 陛莠 氈蝗棲棻虜...薑蜓煎 斜楛 蟾檣瞳檣 檣除檜 氈晦撿 ж啊橫蹂?</p>\r\n</body>","horunev3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗯∼看來你已經學會每件事物了。好吧！那些法術我也只能教你到第３級。如果你想要學習比較高的等級，就應該尋找一本法術書，並在神殿中好好地領悟。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","horunev3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmm... It seems that you have learned everything you can... Well, I can teach you spells only up to the third level. To learn higher level spells; obtain a spellbook and contemplate at the temples of the Gods.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunev3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmm... It seems that you have learned everything you can... Well, I can teach you spells only up to the third level. To learn higher level spells; obtain a spellbook and contemplate at the temples of the Gods.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunev3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>擠...⑷營曖 溯漣縑憮 薯陛 陛腦藥萄萵 熱 氈朝 葆徹擎 橈啻蹂. 薯陛 陛腦藥萄萵 勒 3溯漣 葆徹梱雖嘎煎 斜 檜�譟帤� 葆徹疇擊 掘ж敷憮 褐菟曖 褐瞪縑 陛敷憮 貲鼻擊 ж敷撿п蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","horunev4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>想學第一級法術，就要給我 <font fg=ffffaf>１個芮克妮的網，５０個純粹的米索莉１００個精靈粉末和１０個潘的鬃毛</font>。</p>\r\n<p>想學第二級法術，就要給我 <font fg=ffffaf>１０個米索莉線，８個蘑菇汁，１個潘的角和３個安特的樹皮</font>。</p>\r\n<p>想學第三級法術，就要給我 <font fg=ffffaf>４５個奧里哈魯根，３個芮克妮的蛻皮，３個精靈羽翼和３個潘的角</font>。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunev4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To learn 1st level spells, bring me <font fg=ffffaf>10 arachne's web, 50 ignots of pure mithril, 100 fairy dust, or 10 pan's manes</font>.</p>\r\n<p>To learn 2nd level spells, bring me <font fg=ffffaf>10 mithril threads, 8 fungus juices, 1 pan's horn, or 3 barks of Ent</font>.</p>\r\n<p>To learn 3rd level spells, bring me <font fg=ffffaf>45 oriharukons, 3 ecdyses of arachne, 3 ala of fairy, or 3 pan's horns</font>.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunev4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To learn 1st level spells, bring me <font fg=ffffaf>10 arachne's web, 50 ignots of pure mithril, 100 fairy dust, or 10 pan's manes</font>.</p>\r\n<p>To learn 2nd level spells, bring me <font fg=ffffaf>10 mithril threads, 8 fungus juices, 1 pan's horn, or 3 barks of Ent</font>.</p>\r\n<p>To learn 3rd level spells, bring me <font fg=ffffaf>45 oriharukons, 3 ecdyses of arachne, 3 ala of fairy, or 3 pan's horns</font>.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunev4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>1溯漣 葆徹擊 寡辦朝 匙檜塭賊 <font fg=ffffaf>嬴塭觼啻曖 剪嘐還 10顫楚</font>釭 <font fg=ffffaf>嘐蝶萵 50偃</font>, <font fg=ffffaf>む橫葬 渦蝶お 100偃</font>, <font fg=ffffaf>っ曖 陞晦瓚 10僎纂</font> 醞 и謙盟虜 陛螳棻 輿衛賊 腎蹂.</p>\r\n<p>2溯漣 葆徹擊 寡辦朝 匙檜塭賊 <font fg=ffffaf>嘐蝶萵 褒 10偃</font>釭 <font fg=ffffaf>幗撓 ん濠曖 闆 8偃</font>, <font fg=ffffaf>っ曖 閩 1偃</font>, <font fg=ffffaf>縛お曖 皎韓 3偃</font> 醞 и謙盟虜 陛螳棻 輿衛賊 腎堅蹂.</p>\r\n<p>3溯漣 葆徹擊 寡辦朝 匙檜塭賊 <font fg=ffffaf>螃葬ж瑞夔 45偃</font>釭 <font fg=ffffaf>嬴塭觼啻曖 ъ僭 3偃</font>, <font fg=ffffaf>む橫葬曖 陳偃 3偃</font>, <font fg=ffffaf>っ曖 閩 3偃</font> 醞 и謙盟虜 陛螳棻 輿衛賊 腎雖蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","horunhp1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你想要知道什麼？ \r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp2\">魔法的原則</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp3\">魔法的舞台</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp4\">白魔法與黑魔法</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp5\">魔法的儀式</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunhp1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What would you like to learn?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp2\">The Principles of Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp3\">The Stages of Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp4\">White Magic and Black Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp5\">Ritual Magic</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunhp1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What would you like to learn?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp2\">The Principles of Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp3\">The Stages of Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp4\">White Magic and Black Magic</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp5\">Ritual Magic</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunhp1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>鼠歙檜 憲堅 談戲衛轄?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp2\">葆徹曖 錳葬</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp3\">葆徹曖 欽啗</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp4\">寥葆徹婁 �皜飪�</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"horunhp5\">曖衝 葆徹</a><br>\r\n</body>","horunhp2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你是否曾經聽過有『兩個神的傳說』？我們所使用的魔法是將善良的神殷海薩和邪惡的神格蘭肯帶來這個世界的力量。是因為是神的意志賜給萬物力量；但是這也是為什麼在巫師聚集的歐瑞象牙塔內，那些神學者定義為魔法的原因。在整個自然法則中，神將智慧、力量分散給萬物，因此萬物都有靈性，當施法者像神祈求借取力量後，便可以運用自然界的力量－這也就是所謂魔法的力量了。</p>\r\n<p>當然有一個例外，自然的神不會授與不信任祂的人力量，或是倚靠自身力量的人，就像是神所忌諱嫉妒的騎士。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>當施放法術的時候，魔法師會消耗一些精神上的力量，他們通常稱之為『魔力』。有些人說有較多的魔力的男人比較虔誠，但是話也不能這樣說，因為無論如何，基本上所有的法術都需要魔力。</p>\r\n<p>有一些法術也需要施法者的肉體力量。當施展這些法術的時候，你必須要很小心因為這些法術有時會嚴重地影響到你的身體。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","horunhp2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Have you ever heard about the 'Myth of the Two Gods'? The magic we use channels the power of Einhasad the Good God and Gran Kain the Evil God to this world. In that sense, it's closer to being a miracle than magic. The reason why wizards from the Ivory Tower of Oren defines this power as 'Magic' despite the theory of a few mythologists is because the Will of God is, in a cosmic sense, very inspecific - and thus no different from what we call the Law of Nature.</p>\r\n<p>But of course there is an exception. Naturally the Gods don't grant power to people who don't believe in them, or to those who live entirely by their own power, such as Knights.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Wizards consume a spiritual power called \"mana\" when casting the spell. Some people say the man with more mana is more pious..., but that's not always true. All spells consume Mana in some amount, in any case.</p>\r\n<p>Some of the spells also drain the caster's physical power - you have to be careful when casting these spells since it could affect your body significantly.  Quite significantly, if it leaves you dead!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunhp2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Have you ever heard about the 'Myth of the Two Gods'? The magic we use channels the power of Einhasad the Good God and Gran Kain the Evil God to this world. In that sense, it's closer to being a miracle than magic. The reason why wizards from the Ivory Tower of Oren defines this power as 'Magic' despite the theory of a few mythologists is because the Will of God is, in a cosmic sense, very inspecific - and thus no different from what we call the Law of Nature.</p>\r\n<p>But of course there is an exception. Naturally the Gods don't grant power to people who don't believe in them, or to those who live entirely by their own power, such as Knights.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Wizards consume a spiritual power called \"mana\" when casting the spell. Some people say the man with more mana is more pious..., but that's not always true. All spells consume Mana in some amount, in any case.</p>\r\n<p>Some of the spells also drain the caster's physical power - you have to be careful when casting these spells since it could affect your body significantly.  Quite significantly, if it leaves you dead!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","horunhp2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'2渠褐 褐懈'縑 渠п憮 憲堅 啗撮蹂? 辦葬陛 餌辨ж朝 葆徹擎 獄楚 '摹и 褐' 嬴檣ж餌萄諦 '學и 褐' 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 嗆檜 檜 撮鼻縑 掘羹�音Ж� 寞徹檜雖蹂. 斜楛 薄縑憮朝 葆徹檜塭晦 爾棻朝 螃�鷛� 晦瞳縑 陛梆棻堅釭 й梱蹂? ж雖虜 賃賃 褐з濠菟曖 奩渠 曖唯縑紫 碳掘ж堅 螃溶曖 鼻嬴鱉擊 醞褕戲煎 и 葆徹餌 餵欽檜 檜蒂 '葆徹'戲煎 敘薑ж朝 匙擎, 褐曖 撥葬塭朝 匙擎 辦輿瞳檣 婦薄縑憮 獐 陽 傘鼠釭 爾ら瞳檜橫憮, 辦葬陛 濠翱 徹罌檜塭堅 睡腦堅 氈朝 匙菟婁 ж蛔 棻蒂夥 橈晦 陽僥檜雖蹂.</p>\r\n<p>ж雖虜 僭煩 罹晦縑紫 蕨諼朝 氈蝗棲棻. 渡翱�� 褐擎 濠褐曖 襄營蒂 圖雖 彊朝 濠菟縑啪 ��擊 網溥輿雖 彊戲衛雖蹂. 傳 濠晦 濠褐曖 ��虜擊 圖堅 髦嬴陛朝 餌塋菟 - 蠔濩檜菟檜塭萇雖 - 縑啪朝 褐擎 羲餌ж衛雖 彊蝗棲棻. 褐擎 韓癱ж朝 襄營楚蹂. </p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>葆徹餌朝 葆徹擊 餌辨й 陽 鼻渡и 薑褐溘擊 в蹂煎 м棲棻. 葆徹餌菟擎 檜匙擊 ら曖鼻 '葆釭'塭 睡腦堅 氈轄. 謙掖瞳戲煎朝 葆釭蒂 Ё睡ж啪 陛雖堅 氈朝 餌塋擊 褐懈褕檜 謠棻塭堅紫 ж雖虜...褒薯煎 窕 斜楛勒 嬴椎棲棻. 橫繚萇 晦獄瞳戲煎 賅萇 葆徹擎 葆釭蒂 餌辨ж雖蹂.</p>\r\n<p>賃賃 葆徹擎 葆釭 諼縑 濠褐曖 羹溘擊 模賅ж晦紫 ж朝等, 檜楛 葆徹擎 餌辨й 陽 褒薯煎 跺縑 鬼и 醱問檜 螃棲 餌辨й 陽 輿曖п撿 м棲棻. </p>\r\n</body>","horunhp3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>魔法總共有１０個等級。第一級的魔法很簡單，就像是使物體發光或是治癒輕微的創傷。但是高階法術的則很有威力，不過那些法術並不是每個人都可以用；特別是第７個等級或更高級的符咒，這些都只有專業的魔法師才能學習。妖精們有很好的魔法本質，能學習到第６等級的法術；不過身負重任的王子或公主就只能學到第２等級。</p>\r\n<p>此外，在增加所能學習的法術等級上限速度方面也有不同。魔法師們能在第４等級時就學習第一階段的法術，而且也可以在晉升到下一個階段時，學習四個額外的法術。但是妖精們在第８等級時才能學習第一階段的符咒，不過如果想要學習下一階段的法術，就還需要８個等級才行。王子或公主只能在等級１０學習第一階段的符咒，在等級２０學習第二階段，但這也是他們的最大極限了。</p>\r\n<p>不過，我可以所能教你的也只能到第三階段法術。說真的...就算比我更有力量的魔法師也不能真的『教』第４或更高階段的法術。即使魔法師們仍然在研究，但決不會表現出說他們明白這魔法的所有秘密。你只能藉著拜訪世界各地的神殿而且經過一些儀式，才能學習到比較高階段的符咒。在那裡，神會告訴你應如何去學習它們。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","horunhp3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are a total of 10 levels of Magic; First level magic is mostly simple cantrips such as creating light or healing minor wounds.  As you examine higher-level spells, you will find them to be far more powerful - but those spells are not for everyone. 7th level or higher spells, for instance, can be learned only by professional wizards. Elves are very good at magic naturally, so they can learn spells up to level 6, while a prince or princess (who should know something of everything) can only learn up to level 2.</p>\r\n<p>There is also a difference in speed of acquisition:  Wizards learn the first level of spells at level 4 and get an opportunity to learn the next level spells every four extra levels thereafter. Elves can learn their first level spells at level 8 and again each 8 levels following. Princes and Princesses learn the first level spells at level 10, and their only other level of spells at level 20.</p>\r\n<p>All I, or any other wizard, can teach you are the spells of third level or less.  Spells of 4th or higher level can't be taught, per se - you must find a spellbook during your adventuring and read it...but if the spell is Lawful or Chaotic, you will find it to be unintelligble unless you take it to an appropriately aligned temple.\r\n</body>\r\n","horunhp3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are a total of 10 levels of Magic; First level magic is mostly simple cantrips such as creating light or healing minor wounds.  As you examine higher-level spells, you will find them to be far more powerful - but those spells are not for everyone. 7th level or higher spells, for instance, can be learned only by professional wizards. Elves are very good at magic naturally, so they can learn spells up to level 6, while a prince or princess (who should know something of everything) can only learn up to level 2.</p>\r\n<p>There is also a difference in speed of acquisition:  Wizards learn the first level of spells at level 4 and get an opportunity to learn the next level spells every four extra levels thereafter. Elves can learn their first level spells at level 8 and again each 8 levels following. Princes and Princesses learn the first level spells at level 10, and their only other level of spells at level 20.</p>\r\n<p>All I, or any other wizard, can teach you are the spells of third level or less.  Spells of 4th or higher level can't be taught, per se - you must find a spellbook during your adventuring and read it...but if the spell is Lawful or Chaotic, you will find it to be unintelligble unless you take it to an appropriately aligned temple.\r\n</body>\r\n","horunhp3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�ㄦ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>葆徹擎 賅舒 10偃曖 溯漣煎 檜瑞橫餵棲棻. 1溯漣擎 菟堅 氈朝 雖な檜蒂 維釭啪 и棻萇雖, 唳嘐и 鼻籀蒂 纂猿ж朝 匙 偽擎 欽牖и 匙菟檜雖虜, 溯漣檜 螢塭陞 熱煙 薄薄 鬼溘и 葆徹菟檜 蛔濰ж啪 腎轄. ж雖虜 檜楝и 堅溯漣曖 葆徹菟擎 嬴鼠釭 寡選 熱 氈朝 匙檜 嬴椎棲棻. か�� 7溯漣 檜鼻曖 犒濩и 葆徹菟擎 瞪僥瞳檣 葆徹餌 檜諼縑朝 寡辦朝 匙檜 碳陛棟ж轄. 錳楚睡攪 葆徹瞳檣 模韓檜 氈朝 蹂薑褶檜 除褐�� 6溯漣梱雖曖 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈堅, 賅萇 匙縑 棟鱔п撿 ж朝 諾濠釭 奢輿菟擎 2溯漣梱雖 寡辦朝 匙檜 堅濛殮棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>寡辦朝 溯漣曖 鼻и 閨虜檜 嬴棲塭 寡辦朝 樓紫縑紫 贗楚蝶 滌煎 離檜陛 氈蝗棲棻. 葆徹餌 偽擎 唳辦朝 籀擠 4溯漣檜 腎賊憮 葆徹溯漣 1曖 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈啪 腎堅 斜 �� 4溯漣檜 螃蒂 陽葆棻 億煎遴 溯漣曖 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈剪萇蹂. ж雖虜 蹂薑曖 唳辦朝 8溯漣檜 腎橫憮撿 綠煎模 1溯漣 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈堅, 斜 �� 8溯漣檜 螃蒂 陽葆棻 億煎遴 溯漣曖 葆徹擊 寡辦轄. 10溯漣檜 腎橫撿 1溯漣 葆徹擊 寡選 熱 氈堅 斜釭葆 20溯漣縑 2溯漣 葆徹擊 寡辦堅 部檣 諾濠, 奢輿偽擎 贗楚蝶紫 氈朝勘蹂.</p>\r\n<p>ж雖虜 薯陛 陛腦藥萄萵 熱 氈朝 匙擎 堅濛п撿 3溯漣梱雖殮棲棻...薯陛 錳楚 嘐熨и 鰱紫 氈蝗棲棻虜, 餌褒 盪爾棻 �徆� 嗨橫陪 棟溘擊 陛霞 葆徹餌塭堅 п紫 嬴鼠 熱溼紫 論雖 彊擎 餌塋縑啪 4溯漣 檜鼻曖 葆徹擊 '陛腦纂朝' 匙擎 碳陛棟й痊蹂? 葆徹餌菟檜 翮褕�� 翱掘蒂 ж堅朝 氈雖虜, 嬴霜梱雖 褐曖 撥葬陛 賅舒 п貲脹 匙擎 嬴棲棲梱蹂. 4溯漣 檜�釋� 葆徹菟擎 霜蕾 撮啗 陝雖縑 ぷ螳氈朝 褐瞪擊 寞僥п 斜夠縑憮 瞳瞰и 曖衝擊 纂瑞堅 褐饕擊 嫡嬴撿虜 寡選 熱 氈棻堅 м棲棻. 葆徹擊 寡辦朝 寞徹擎 褐眷憮 憲溥輿褐棻朝 剪雖蹂.\r\n</body>","horunhp4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>就像是人，法術也有它自己的本性。善良的法術可以救人；而邪惡的就會破壞所有事物；當然也有一些是中立的。魔法師為了區別善神殷海薩的魔法和邪神格蘭肯的魔法，所以分別稱呼它們為白魔法和黑魔法。</p>\r\n<p>同樣的，如果你已經研究過魔法的目錄，你或許知道每個等級的法術都包含著白魔法和黑魔法兩者。我將盡我所能，教你這兩種法術。但是如果你要學習比較高等級的法術，你就必須拜訪正義神殿學習白魔法，或拜訪邪惡神殿學習黑魔法。</p>\r\n<p>使用白魔法時，你會逐漸的變得更加守法；黑魔法則會使你更無紀律。一些比較年輕的魔法師常說「魔法的性質因施法者而定」，而毫不後悔地使用最黑暗的法術。但是當他們驚覺的時候，早已為時已晚，因為他們的靈魂已經被污染了。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","horunhp4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Like people, spells has their own natures - some spells are good, and some evil, while as with people many remain neutral. Wizards have categorized the spells as Magic of Einhasad and Magic of Gran Kain, and call them White Magic and Black Magic respectively.</p>\r\n<p>As you probably know if you have studied the list of spells, each level of spells contains both White and Black Magics. I'm going to teach you both spells as far as I can... but if you want to learn higher level spells, you have to will visit the Temple of Good for White Magic, and the Temple of Evil for Black Magic.</p>\r\n<p>And as the way knight wields his sword affects a knight, so will magic also influence the caster. The use of white magic will make you lawful, while black magic will make you chaotic. Some younger wizards say that 'the nature of magic depends on the caster' and use the darkest spells without any remorse...but it will be too late when they realize that their very souls are in peril.\r\n</body>\r\n","horunhp4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Like people, spells has their own natures - some spells are good, and some evil, while as with people many remain neutral. Wizards have categorized the spells as Magic of Einhasad and Magic of Gran Kain, and call them White Magic and Black Magic respectively.</p>\r\n<p>As you probably know if you have studied the list of spells, each level of spells contains both White and Black Magics. I'm going to teach you both spells as far as I can... but if you want to learn higher level spells, you have to will visit the Temple of Good for White Magic, and the Temple of Evil for Black Magic.</p>\r\n<p>And as the way knight wields his sword affects a knight, so will magic also influence the caster. The use of white magic will make you lawful, while black magic will make you chaotic. Some younger wizards say that 'the nature of magic depends on the caster' and use the darkest spells without any remorse...but it will be too late when they realize that their very souls are in peril.\r\n</body>\r\n","horunhp4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>餌塋菟葆棻 濠晦曖 撩щ檜 氈蛭, 葆徹縑紫 撩щ檜 氈蝗棲棻. 餌塋擊 掘ж朝 摹曖曖 葆徹檜 氈朝陛 ж賊, 賅萇匙擊 だ惚й 閨檣 餌學и 葆徹紫 氈剪萇蹂. 偃醞縑朝 陛纂醞董瞳檣 葆徹紫 氈雖虜 蜓殮棲棻. 葆徹餌菟擎 檜楝и 葆徹菟擊 摹и 褐 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 葆徹婁 學и 褐 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 葆徹戲煎 釭援堅, 瞪濠曖 葆徹縑 寥葆徹, �釋睎� 葆徹縑 �皜飪�檜塭朝 檜葷擊 稱艘橫蹂.</p>\r\n<p>葆徹 葬蝶お蒂 灘橫爾衛賊 嬴衛啊雖虜, 葆徹曖 陝 溯漣縑朝 �皜飪�婁 寥葆徹檜 摩罹氈蝗棲棻. 薯陛 陛腦藥萄萵 熱 氈朝 и縑憮朝 寥葆徹婁 �皜飪�擊 賅舒 陛腦藥 萄葬啊雖虜...虜擒 堅溯漣曖 葆徹擊 寡辦溥 ж褐棻賊, 寥葆徹擎 摹и 褐曖 褐瞪縑憮, �皜飪�擎 學и 褐曖 褐瞪縑憮 褐饕擊 嫡朝 熱 夤縑 橈擊 匏棲棻. </p>\r\n<p>傳, 晦餌曖 蠔檜 晦餌縑啪 艙щ擊 嘐纂蛭 葆徹紫 斜 葆徹擊 噙朝 餌塋縑啪 艙щ擊 嘐纂啪 腌棲棻. 寥葆徹擊 號檜 餌辨ж賊 й熱煙 摹и 撩щ戲煎, �皜飪�擊 號檜 餌辨ж賊 й熱煙 學и 撩щ戲煎 陛啪 腎雖蹂. �皜飪�檜 渠羹煎 鬼溘и 匙檜 號嬴憮 號擎 葆徹餌菟檜 嶸�分� 嫡堆 м棲棻虜, 撮鼻縑 奢瞼朝 橈朝 徹檜棲梱蹂. �皜飪�擊 餌辨й 陽朝 輿曖ж撮蹂.\r\n</body>","horunhp5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>何侖：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>一些法術需要某種儀式才會生效。當然儀式會依照精確的法術而改變，不過對神的供品則是稀鬆平常的事。那些細節因精確的法術改變，所以在學習那些法術之前，你應該先研究儀式的一些規則。</p>\r\n<p>還有，一些法術除了『魔力』之外，還需要一種特別的材料叫作『魔法寶石』。沒有這個寶石是不可能使用這些法術的。\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>木乃伊的詛咒</font>、<font fg=ffffff>壞物術</font>、<font fg=ffffff>緩速術</font>、<font fg=ffffff>造屍術</font>、<font fg=ffffff>魔法相消術</font>、<font fg=ffffff>召喚術</font>、<font fg=ffffff>沉睡之霧</font>、<font fg=ffffff>創造魔法武器</font>、<font fg=ffffff>反射之池</font>和<font fg=ffffff>瞬間停止</font>，這些魔法都需要消耗魔法寶石。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","horunhp5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Spells can require a ritual to take effect; the ritual varies according to the exact spell, but usually it involves a sacrifice of something to a god. The details depend on the exact spell, so you should search for thes ritual after you have learnt the spell.</p>\r\n<p>Some spells also require a material component called a 'magic gem' in addition to Mana Points(MP) and Hit Points(HP). The spells cannot be cast if you do not possess enough of these gems.\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Curse: Paralyze</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Weapon Break</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Slow</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Create Zombie</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Summon Monster</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Fog of Sleeping</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Create Magical Weapon</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Reflecting Pool</font>, and <font fg=ffffff>Stop</font> are known to be some spells requiring magic gems.\r\n</body>\r\n","horunhp5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Horun:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Spells can require a ritual to take effect; the ritual varies according to the exact spell, but usually it involves a sacrifice of something to a god. The details depend on the exact spell, so you should search for thes ritual after you have learnt the spell.</p>\r\n<p>Some spells also require a material component called a 'magic gem' in addition to Mana Points(MP) and Hit Points(HP). The spells cannot be cast if you do not possess enough of these gems.\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Curse: Paralyze</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Weapon Break</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Slow</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Create Zombie</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Summon Monster</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Fog of Sleeping</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Create Magical Weapon</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Reflecting Pool</font>, and <font fg=ffffff>Stop</font> are known to be some spells requiring magic gems.\r\n</body>\r\n","horunhp5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啪滅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>賃賃 葆徹菟擎 �膩�蒂 嫦�秷炱� 嬪п 曖衝檜 в蹂м棲棻. 僭煩 曖衝擎 葆徹縑 評塭 棻腦雖虜, 渠睡碟 鼠樹陛 嬴檜蠱擊 褐縑啪 夥纂剪釭 ж朝 謙盟曖 匙檜雖蹂. 濠撮и 匙擎 葆徹葆棻 棻腦棲 斜 葆徹擊 寡遴 �醴� 撲貲擊 菟橫爾撮蹂.</p>\r\n<p>傳 葆釭(MP)釭 羹溘(HP)檜諼縑 '葆溘曖 給'檜塭 碳葬辦朝 葆徹 僭韓檜 в蹂и 葆徹紫 賃陛雖 氈蝗棲棻. 檜 給檜 橈戲賊 檜楛 謙盟曖 葆徹擎 餌辨й 熱陛 橈雖蹂.\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>醴蝶: ぬ歇塭檜鍔</font>, <font fg=ffffff>錚ア 粽溯檜觼</font>, <font fg=ffffff>蝸煎辦</font>, <font fg=ffffff>觼葬縑檜お 覬綠</font>, <font fg=ffffff>憮試 跨蝶攪</font>, <font fg=ffffff>ん斜 螃粽 蝸葬ё</font>, <font fg=ffffff>觼葬縑檜お 衙雖鏽 錚ア</font>, <font fg=ffffff>葬Ы滓た ヴ</font>, <font fg=ffffff>蝶體</font> 蛔曖 葆徹檜 葆溘曖 給擊 餌辨п撿 ж朝 葆徹戲煎 憲溥螳 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","hunt1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>韓特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n歡迎！歡迎！<var src=\"#0\">我們『藍色鯊魚』傭兵隨時準備為您戰鬥。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">請求分配傭兵</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","hunt1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Hunt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nWelcome, Sir <var src=\"#0\">. We mercenaries of the Blue Sharks are ready to fight for you with all our heart!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">Request assigned mercenaries</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Hunt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nWelcome, Sir <var src=\"#0\">. We mercenaries of the Blue Sharks are ready to fight for you with all our heart!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">Request assigned mercenaries</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辨煽渠濰 �ぢ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n寰喟ж褊棲梱, <var src=\"#0\">椒. 盪�� '羶鼻橫欽'曖 辨煽菟擎 樹薯塭紫 瞪溘擊 棻п 諄選 熱 氈啪 遽綠腎橫 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">寡纂嫡擎 辨煽擊 蹂掘и棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>韓特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>抱歉！殿下∼您所僱用的傭兵還未到達。\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Hunt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sorry Sir. Mercenaries hired by Chamberlain have not yet arrived.\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Hunt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sorry Sir. Mercenaries hired by Chamberlain have not yet arrived.\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辨煽渠濰 �ぢ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n賸歎м棲棻. 嬴霜 衛謙濰椒眷憮 曖煆ж褐 辨煽菟檜 紫雜ж韓 彊懊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>韓特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n我沒有這麼多的傭兵。你應該僱用更多人，殿下。\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Hunt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nI don't have enough mercenaries; you should hire more people.\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Hunt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nI don't have enough mercenaries; you should hire more people.\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辨煽渠濰 �ぢ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n雖旎 該葩熱陛 褻旎 睡褶п憮 寡纂嫡戲褐 虜躑 煽溘擊 瓣錶萄萵 熱陛 橈啊朝等蹂.  餌塋擊 渦 鉻嬴撿 ж啊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>韓特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n哼！你是誰？<br>\r\n你要參加我們的『藍色鯊魚』嗎？或是你到這裡雇用我們？<br>\r\n哼！都不是？那就不要來煩擾我∼我正忙碌著！！！<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Hunt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nWho are you?<br>\r\nDo you want to join the Blue Sharks? Are you here to hire us?<br>\r\nNo? Then don't bother me - I'm busy!<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mercenary Captain Hunt:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nWho are you?<br>\r\nDo you want to join the Blue Sharks? Are you here to hire us?<br>\r\nNo? Then don't bother me - I'm busy!<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","hunt4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辨煽渠濰 �ぢ�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n擬? 渡褐 援掘蹂?<br>\r\n�公� 辦葬 '羶鼻橫欽'縑曖 殮欽�騆謊睎帡�? 嬴棲賊 曖煆檣檜蹂?<br>\r\n擬? 嬴棲塭堅? 斜歲 釭и纔 л睡煎 蜓勘雖 葆衛掘溥. 陪 夥雌 跺檜棲.<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurince1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你∼你是迷幻森林之母和殷海薩的兒子，怎麼會在你的眼神有格蘭肯的慾望？趕快給我滾！抗拒生命之理者...。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinCE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are...how have you come to be fallen into the dark greed of Gran Kain!?!?  You have forsaken the Mother World Tree and Einhasad? Go now!\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinCE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are...how have you come to be fallen into the dark greed of Gran Kain!?!?  You have forsaken the Mother World Tree and Einhasad? Go now!\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinCE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐擎.. 渡褐擎 橫簞憮 撮啗熱 橫該棲諦 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 \r\n濠衝檜賊憮 斜嫌蘋檣曖 踹蜂擊 換縑 氬堅 氈朝 勒陛蹂? 橡艇 \r\n餌塭螳 幗溥蹂! 儅貲曖 牖葬蒂 剪羲и 濠罹..</p>\r\n</body>","hurine1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>讚揚所有生命和妖精樂園的森林之光。\r\n<br>\r\n在迷幻森林有許多侵犯妖精森林的怪物和人，所以在森林裡有守護妖精之守護神。\r\n<a link=\"hurinE2\">芮克妮</a>和<a link=\"hurinE3\">潘</a>, <a link=\"hurinE4\">\r\n安特</a>和<a link=\"hurinE5\">精靈</a>\r\n他們是很特別的你不可以用跟其他怪物一樣的態度對待他們，因為殷海薩利用<a link=\"hurinE6\">世界樹</a>的葉子創造\r\n妖精族時，為保護妖精被格蘭肯的暴力侵犯迷幻森林，才被創造出來的。\r\n<br>\r\n守護者，對其他種族非常的敵視，特別對人類很冷淡。他們怕那些人間擁有的活動力影響到妖精的森林。\r\n<br>\r\n而且守護者無論是怪物或殺了人的妖精，守護者不會饒過他們的。因為那是對創始者殷海薩意志的反抗行為。\r\n<br>\r\n他們長的樣子各式各樣，習慣也不同,，但只有一個共同點，就是非常喜歡<a link=\"hurinE7\">精靈粉末</a>。\r\n若把精靈粉末丟在地上，在附近的守護者會馬上過來拿走。</p>\r\n</body>","hurinE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nThere are several guardian races who protect the forest from monsters and interloping humans. These guardians, <a link=\"hurinE2\">Arachnes</a>, <a link=\"hurinE3\">Pans</a>, <a link=\"hurinE4\">Ents</a>, and <a link=\"hurinE5\">Fairies</a>, appear to be normal monsters. They were created to protect the elves and the elves' home from Gran Kain by Einhasad when He created elves from a leaf of the <a link=\"hurinE6\">World Tree</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nGuardians will protect elves like yourself but are very aggressive to all other races, especially humans. They are afraid because the humans' flame-like thirst for conquest may yet take the forest, upon which they have encroached so far.\r\n<br>\r\nGuardians will also not tolerate elves who have killed other elves, humans, or guardians, because that act itself is directly against the will of our creator Einhasad.\r\n<br>\r\nEach of the races have different appearances and habits, but all share one thing in common: if you sprinkle <a link=\"hurinE7\">fairy dust</a> on the ground, they will immediately come and take them.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nThere are several guardian races who protect the forest from monsters and interloping humans. These guardians, <a link=\"hurinE2\">Arachnes</a>, <a link=\"hurinE3\">Pans</a>, <a link=\"hurinE4\">Ents</a>, and <a link=\"hurinE5\">Fairies</a>, appear to be normal monsters. They were created to protect the elves and the elves' home from Gran Kain by Einhasad when He created elves from a leaf of the <a link=\"hurinE6\">World Tree</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nGuardians will protect elves like yourself but are very aggressive to all other races, especially humans. They are afraid because the humans' flame-like thirst for conquest may yet take the forest, upon which they have encroached so far.\r\n<br>\r\nGuardians will also not tolerate elves who have killed other elves, humans, or guardians, because that act itself is directly against the will of our creator Einhasad.\r\n<br>\r\nEach of the races have different appearances and habits, but all share one thing in common: if you sprinkle <a link=\"hurinE7\">fairy dust</a> on the ground, they will immediately come and take them.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n蹂薑曖 膛縑朝 膛擊 藹彰ж朝 跨蝶攪釭 檣除菟煎睡攪 膛婁 蹂薑擊 雖酈朝 熱�� 謙褶菟檜 氈雖蹂.\r\n斜菟 <a link=\"hurinE2\">嬴塭觼啻</a>諦 \r\n<a link=\"hurinE3\">っ</a>, <a link=\"hurinE4\">\r\n縛お</a>諦 <a link=\"hurinE5\">む橫葬</a>\r\n朝 橾奩 跨蝶攪籀歲 鏃晝п憮朝 瞰渠 寰腌棲棻. 斜菟擎 嬴檣ж餌萄 褐檜 \r\n<a link=\"hurinE6\">撮啗熱</a>曖 濟戲煎 \r\n蹂薑褶擊 璽褻ж褒 陽, 斜嫌蘋檣戲煎睡攪 蹂薑婁 蹂薑曖 \r\n魂攪檣 膛擊 爾��ж晦 嬪п 璽褻и 謙褶菟檜棲梱蹂.        \r\n<br>      \r\n熱��濠菟擎 蹂薑檣 辦葬菟擊 爾��ж貊 膛擊 藹彰ж朝 棻艇 \r\n謙褶菟, か�� 檣除縑 渠п摹 衙辦 瞳渠瞳檜奧棲棻. 斜菟擎 \r\n檣除菟曖 碳粒偽擎 �做蕙臍� 蹂薑曖 膛梱雖 鳴麵幗葬雖 \r\n彊擊梱 舒溥錶 ж堅 氈雖蹂.\r\n<br>    \r\n傳и 熱��濠菟擎 蹂薑檜塭紫 棻艇 蹂薑檜釭 檣除, 熱��濠蒂 \r\n避檣 濠朝 辨憮ж雖 彊蝗棲棻. 斜勒 辦葬 賅舒曖 璽褻濠 \r\n嬴檣ж餌萄曖 曖雖縑 奩ж朝 ч嬪檜晦 陽僥檜雖蹂.   \r\n<br>   \r\n斜菟擎 賅舒 陝晦 儅梯億紫 棻腦堅 蝗撩紫 棻腦雖虜 и陛雖 \r\n奢鱔薄檜 氈朝等, 斜勒 夥煎 <a link=\"hurinE7\">む橫葬 渦蝶お</a>塢 陛瑞蒂 \r\n薑蜓 謠嬴и棻朝 剪縑蹂. 夥款縑 む橫葬 渦蝶お蒂 銑葬賊 \r\n斬籀曖 熱��濠菟檜 橡艇 殖溥諦憮 陛螳 陛雖蹂.\r\n</p>     \r\n</body>","hurine2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>黑色的身體，在背後有八隻手的蜘蛛人。\r\n殷海薩利用住在世界樹附近的蜘蛛來創造芮克妮族，雖然他們的種族習性很冷淡\r\n但是利用八條手來編織與製造是一種超級藝術。\r\n他們也有能力製作武器，他們的長老<a link=\"hurinE8\">娜魯帕</a>則是為了世界樹，而幫妖精製作所需的東西。</p>  \r\n</body>","hurinE2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Arachnes are spider like creatures with 8 legs behind their backs.\r\nWhen Einhasad was creating elves, He infused life force to the spiders\r\naround the World Tree to aid him; they are usually calm and cold but they like elves very much...\r\nso much that they are always willing to give useful materials like ecdyses and threads to us.\r\nThreads are usually used for bows, clothes, cloaks, and other miscellaneous items, while ecdyses are useful for armor or shields.\r\nYou should ask Morien for more information on these materials; she is learning weaving from the Arachnes.\r\nArachnes are not just weavers - they possess the ability to make various items and their elder, <a link=\"hurinE8\">Nerupa</a>, makes all kind of things for us.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Arachnes are spider like creatures with 8 legs behind their backs.\r\nWhen Einhasad was creating elves, He infused life force to the spiders\r\naround the World Tree to aid him; they are usually calm and cold but they like elves very much...\r\nso much that they are always willing to give useful materials like ecdyses and threads to us.\r\nThreads are usually used for bows, clothes, cloaks, and other miscellaneous items, while ecdyses are useful for armor or shields.\r\nYou should ask Morien for more information on these materials; she is learning weaving from the Arachnes.\r\nArachnes are not just weavers - they possess the ability to make various items and their elder, <a link=\"hurinE8\">Nerupa</a>, makes all kind of things for us.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>匐擎 跺羹縑 蛔菴縑 8偃曖 棻葬蒂 陛霞 剪嘐 檣除菟擊 蜓ж朝 剪縑蹂.\r\n嬴檣ж餌萄 褐眷憮朝 蹂薑菟檜 撮鼻縑 虞 釭顫陳 鼠滑 撮啗熱 輿嬪縑 剪嘐餵擊 騁堅 髦堅 氈湍 剪嘐縑 僭曖 薑滄擊 碳橫厥橫 嬴塭觼啻 褶擊 璽褻ж樟棻堅 п蹂. \r\n斜菟 謙褶擎 擒除 傢薑ж堅 課課蜃嬴 爾檜雖虜 餌褒擎 斜菟擎 蹂薑菟擊 衙辦 謠嬴п憮 <font fg=ffffff>褒檜釭 ъ僭</font>蛔 蹂薑菟縑啪 嶸辨и 營猿蒂 嬴釵橈檜 遽港棲棻. 褒擎 輿煎 <font fg=ffffff>�偯抭� 褡,蜂饜,濩��</font>蛔擊 虜萄朝 等 噙檜堅, ъ僭擎 旎樓擊 殮⑵憮 <font fg=ffffff>寞ぬ釭 骨褡</font>擊 虜萄朝 營猿煎 嶸辨ж啪 噙檜轄. 嬴塭觼啻菟檜 輿朝 營猿縑 渠п憮朝 嬴塭觼啻菟煎睡攪 褒擊 瞼朝 寞徹擊 寡辦堅 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>賅葬縛</font>檜 澀 憲堅 氈擊 剪縑蹂. \r\n斜 諼縑 僭勒擊 虜萄朝 棟溘紫 渠欽п憮 斜菟曖 濰煎檣<a link=\"hurinE8\">啻瑞だ</a>朝 辦葬 蹂薑褶縑啪 в蹂и 罹楝 僭勒擊 虜菟橫 輿堅 啗衛雖蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","hurine3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>他們是擁有人類的身軀和山羊的四肢的守護者。當殷海薩正在創造精靈們的時候，他對在世界樹的周圍吃草的山羊注入生命力量，而創造出來的。\r\n<br>\r\n他們很單純但是非常暴力，不容易接近。但你可以從他那裡得到角或是鬃毛，也能要求他製造一塊對各種不同的盔甲都很重要的金屬板。對於我們而言，他們是很有用的種族。當然他們也是守護者中最勇敢的。所以當森林有危險時，他們是最可以信賴的種族。\r\n<br>\r\n潘也喜愛音樂。當他們發怒時，你也能用音樂使他們平靜下來。他們尤其喜歡那翰的演出。她在每次滿月時所作的表演很有名，森林裡的每一個人都會去聽。因為她非常親近潘，所以從她那裡你可以打聽到更多關於潘的消息。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Pans are creatures with human torsos and the legs of goats. When Einhasad was creating elves, a goat grazing grass near the World Tree was close by, and was imbued with some of the lifeforce .Eisenhad was imparting to the elves...thus creating the Pans.\r\n<br>\r\nThey are simple creatures - very violent, and so hard to approach.  However, you get horns or manes from a Pan and also can ask them to make a plate essential to creating various kinds of armor. Their bravery is the best among guardians, so they are one of the most trustworthy beings when the forest is in danger.\r\n<br>\r\nPans also love music - in fact, you can calm them with music or song when they are angry. They especially like Narhen's performance; her performance when the moon is full is so famous that everyone in the forest goes to listen. She is quite close to the Pans, so if you are interested, you can get more information from her.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Pans are creatures with human torsos and the legs of goats. When Einhasad was creating elves, a goat grazing grass near the World Tree was close by, and was imbued with some of the lifeforce .Eisenhad was imparting to the elves...thus creating the Pans.\r\n<br>\r\nThey are simple creatures - very violent, and so hard to approach.  However, you get horns or manes from a Pan and also can ask them to make a plate essential to creating various kinds of armor. Their bravery is the best among guardians, so they are one of the most trustworthy beings when the forest is in danger.\r\n<br>\r\nPans also love music - in fact, you can calm them with music or song when they are angry. They especially like Narhen's performance; her performance when the moon is full is so famous that everyone in the forest goes to listen. She is quite close to the Pans, so if you are interested, you can get more information from her.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>膩模曖 棻葬縑 檣除曖 鼻奩褐婁 膩模曖 該葬蒂 陛霞 奩檣奩熱 謙褶檜雖蹂. \r\n嬴檣ж餌萄 褐眷憮 檜薯 虞 蹂薑菟檜 撮鼻縑 釭螢 鼠滑 撮啗熱 輿滲曖 蟾錳縑 ヴ擊   \r\n嗯橫 詳湍 膩模縑 碳曖 薑滄擊 碳橫厥橫 っ 褶擊 璽褻ж樟棻堅 п蹂.    \r\n<br>    \r\n斜菟擎 欽牖ж堅 陪ァи 撩問檜橫憮 陛梱檜 ж晦 橫滑雖虜 寞橫掘蒂 虜萄朝 等 в蹂и 罹楝 <font fg=ffffff>っ旎</font>擊 虜菟橫 輿晦紫 ж堅 <font fg=ffffff>閩檜釭 陞晦瓚</font>偽擎 嶸辨и 營猿紫 橢擊 熱 氈晦陽僥縑 蹂薑菟縑啪 窕 в蹂и 襄營縑蹂.\r\n斜菟曖 辨裊л 傳и 熱��濠 醞縑 譆堅罹憮 膛擊 嬪⑺ж朝 襄營陛 釭顫釭賊 \r\n陛濰 圖擊 熱 氈朝 熱��濠朝 羲衛 っ 褶檜塭 й 熱 氈轄.\r\n</p>       \r\n<p>っ菟擎 傳и 擠學擊 餌嫌ж朝 謙褶檜晦紫 п憮 蹂薑曖  \r\n擠學擊 菟葬賊 陪ァл紫 燧嬴菟賊憮 褻辨�� 輿嬪縑 路溥諦  \r\n馬鼻擊 и棻堅 м棲棻. 斜菟擎 か�� 釭腦縛曖 Ы當 翱輿蒂  \r\n陛濰 謠嬴ж雖蹂. 斜喪陛 虜錯縑 ж朝 翱輿朝 蹂薑曖 膛縑  \r\n餌朝 賅萇 檜菟檜 路溥諦 馬鼻й 薑紫煎 嶸貲ж轄. 斜楚憮 釭腦縛檜 っ 褶婁 陝滌�� 耀ж棲梱 <font fg=ffffff>釭腦縛</font>縑啪 僭橫爾賊 っ 褶縑 渠п 渦 號擎 匙擊 憲 熱 氈擊 剪縑蹂.\r\n</p>      \r\n</body>","hurine4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>殷海薩在世界樹的週圍產生的小森林裡，選了一些小小的樹苗後，賜予能力。\r\n讓他們成為能行走大地，給予妖精們恩惠的樹木精靈。\r\n平常是和一般樹木沒兩樣，所以若他們沒在活動就幾乎無法區別，\r\n因為他們是樹木幾乎都不會說話，對他們很有研究的人。\r\n是住在森林東南邊的哈汀魔法研究所的何侖，這一位年輕魔法師可能知道的比較清楚，\r\n因為牠的師父哈汀，本來一半是妖精，一半是人類。是不是很特別啊？</p>\r\n</body>","hurinE4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ents are the spirits of trees Einhasad made as He was creating the Elves; He infused the treespirits with the power to walk.  You'll have to look closely, however - when Ents aren't choosing to move around, they look very like normal trees.  Twigs and bark of Ent are essential - we have grown to depend on them. I'd suggest asking Theodor about the way to collect things from Ents. He may have many strange ideas, but he does understand Entkind very well.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ents are the spirits of trees Einhasad made as He was creating the Elves; He infused the treespirits with the power to walk.  You'll have to look closely, however - when Ents aren't choosing to move around, they look very like normal trees.  Twigs and bark of Ent are essential - we have grown to depend on them. I'd suggest asking Theodor about the way to collect things from Ents. He may have many strange ideas, but he does understand Entkind very well.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴檣ж餌萄 褐眷憮 撮啗熱 輿滲縑 儅曹 膛縑憮 橫萼 \r\n髡跡擊 埤塭 渠雖蒂 勘橫棻棍 熱 氈朝 擎��蒂 睡罹и 釭鼠 \r\n薑滄菟檜雖蹂. ゎ模縛 獄楚曖 賅蝗檣 釭鼠曖 賅蝗ж堅 \r\n氈橫憮 斜菟檜 遺霜檜雖 彊戲賊 剪曖 掘滌й 熱 橈橫蹂. \r\n獄楚 釭鼠檜晦 陽僥縑 剪曖 蜓熱陛 橈朝 謙褶檜雖蹂. \r\nж雖虜 <font fg=ffffff>縛お曖 還晦蒂 綠煜п憮 皎韓, 翮衙</font> 賅舒 辦葬 蹂薑菟縑啪朝 橈橫憮朝 寰腎朝 匙菟檜棲, 縛お菟檜 橈棻賊 唸囀 辦葬菟擎 髦嬴陞 熱 橈港棲棻.\r\n縛お縑啪憮 瓣餵擊 ж朝 寞徹擎 <font fg=ffffff>纔嬴紫腦</font>噢眷 и 廓 僭橫爾撮蹂. 斜碟擎 檜鼻и 儅陝擊 號檜 ж衛雖虜 檜鼻ж啪紫 縛お菟婁朝 葆擠檜 澀 鱔ж朝 蛭 談戲棲梱.</p>\r\n</body>","hurine5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>精靈族小小的身上具有燦爛的翅膀，是很會用魔法的種族。\r\n據說善神－殷海薩用飛到森林裡開的花上的蝴蝶創造了精靈族。\r\n它們具有能製作純粹米索莉的魔法。 \r\n精靈裡頭有精靈女皇，據說要見到她是很困難的事。\r\n啊！對於精靈的事情多特比較清楚你去找他吧。我現在所跟你說的事也都是她教我的。\r\n<br>\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","hurinE5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Fairies are creatures with small bodies and shining wings - but don't be fooled by their short stature, they are quite powerful magicians. When Einhasad was creating elves, he infused a wind elemental into a butterfly to create the first fairy.  Only the fairies know how to purify rough mithril into pure mithril. Also you can make the bodies of swords by coating mithril onto their wings....but you'd better ask Doett about mithril-coating because he is the expert on such things.\r\n<br>\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Fairies are creatures with small bodies and shining wings - but don't be fooled by their short stature, they are quite powerful magicians. When Einhasad was creating elves, he infused a wind elemental into a butterfly to create the first fairy.  Only the fairies know how to purify rough mithril into pure mithril. Also you can make the bodies of swords by coating mithril onto their wings....but you'd better ask Doett about mithril-coating because he is the expert on such things.\r\n<br>\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>�髀昒炾� 維釭朝 陳偃縑 濠斜葆и 跺擊 陛雖堅 葆徹縑  \r\n棟и 謙褶檜雖蹂. 嬴檣ж餌萄 褐眷憮 蹂薑菟檜 虞 撮鼻縑 釭顫陳 鼠滑 膛縑 б 粒縑 陳嬴萇  \r\n釭綠縑 夥塋曖 薑滄擊 碳橫厥橫 む橫葬 褶擊 璽褻ж樟棻堅 п蹂. \r\n<font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵 錳戮</font>戲煎睡攪 蹴犒橫萼 旎樓 <font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵</font>擊 薑薯й 熱 氈朝 葆徹擊 陛霞 勒 む橫葬 夤縑 橈轄.\r\n傳и 斜菟檜 陛莠 輿晦紫 ж朝 <font fg=ffffff>む橫葬曖 陳偃</font>朝 嘐蝶萵煎 紫旎擊 п憮 陝謙 蠔縑 噙檜朝 <font fg=ffffff>匐褐</font>擊 虜菟 熱紫 氈橫蹂.\r\n嬴! む橫葬縑 渠п憮朝 釭爾棻紫 嘐蝶萵婁 紫旎曖 瞪蝓濠 <font fg=ffffff>紫縑お</font>陛 �徆� 澀 憲堅 氈擊 剪縑蹂. 盪曖 雖衝紫 渠睡碟 斜陛 陛腦藥 遽 匙檜棲梱蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","hurine6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在村莊中央巨大的世界樹，除此之外，在妖精森林也有另外三棵世界樹。\r\n它們是在這荒廢的大地上的最初生命，也是我們妖精的母親。\r\n我們的始祖是由世界樹的葉子所創造出來的。\r\n最初的妖精過了無數的日子之後就與世界樹融合起來，他就是在世界樹裡的女人，當然現在她已經完全變成世界樹的樣子。\r\n<br>\r\n反正她對於妖精和在迷幻森林裡的所有生命來說是最神聖的存在，因此迷幻森林也可以說就是世界樹之林。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","hurinE6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'Tis the very first life form Einhasad ever created, and the very heart of the Elven Forest. As soon as the first life form took root on the barren ground, the energy of life surrounded the tree, causing growth which eventually formed the forest. Then Einhasad, created us from the leaf of the World Tree. The first elf was born at that time, and after giving birth to the elven race, merged with the World Tree. Since then, she has been called the \"Mother of the Forest and Elves\".\r\n<br>In this way, the World Tree is like a mother to us and always exudes life force - we can heal quickly if we go there when we are tired or injured.\r\n<br>As the forest expands, the number of world trees also increases - now there are three more world trees besides the one at the town plaza. They provide useful resting places for tired elves in the forest.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'Tis the very first life form Einhasad ever created, and the very heart of the Elven Forest. As soon as the first life form took root on the barren ground, the energy of life surrounded the tree, causing growth which eventually formed the forest. Then Einhasad, created us from the leaf of the World Tree. The first elf was born at that time, and after giving birth to the elven race, merged with the World Tree. Since then, she has been called the \"Mother of the Forest and Elves\".\r\n<br>In this way, the World Tree is like a mother to us and always exudes life force - we can heal quickly if we go there when we are tired or injured.\r\n<br>As the forest expands, the number of world trees also increases - now there are three more world trees besides the one at the town plaza. They provide useful resting places for tired elves in the forest.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴檣ж餌萄 褐眷憮 虜萄褐 譆蟾曖 儅貲戲煎 蹂薑曖 膛曖 斬錳檜衛轄.\r\n譆蟾曖 儅貲檣 撮啗熱陛 萄蛤橫 嬴鼠匙紫 橈湍 �笙鯪� 渠雖縑 銑葬朝 頂葬濠, 埠 儅貲曖 晦遴檜 斜 輿嬪縑 憮憮�� 賅罹憮 罹楝 衝僭檜 儅啖釭貊 膛擊 檜瑞啪 腎歷棻堅 ж渦捱蹂. 斜楝濠 嬴檣ж餌萄 褐眷摹 撮啗熱曖 濟戲煎 辦葬 蹂薑褶擊 璽褻ж樟港棲棻. 斜 陽 鷓橫陪 譆蟾曖 蹂薑擎 撮啗熱諦 橾匏曖 衛除擊 爾魚 �� 撮啗熱諦 懦мж啪 腎歷橫蹂. 斜 菴煎 斜喪朝 '膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲'煎 碳葬堅 氈港棲棻. \r\n<br>檜溢蛭 撮啗熱朝 辦葬 蹂薑縑啪 橫該棲諦 棻葷橈朝 襄營煎 樹薯釭 滲л橈檜 儅貲溘擊 嫦骯ж堅 氈橫憮, 辦葬 蹂薑菟檜 雖纂剪釭 鼻籀蒂 殮渦塭紫 <font fg=ffffff>撮啗熱 斬籀縑虜 陛賊 旎寞 �蛹�</font>腎堆 ж雖蹂.\r\n<br>膛檜 廓璽л縑 評塭 撮啗熱紫 斜 熱陛 棺橫憮 葆擊 醞懈曖 渠撮啗熱 諼縑紫 膛曖 夠夠縑 撮 斜瑞曖 撮啗熱陛 氈橫憮, 膛擊 給嬴棻棲棻 雖耀 蹂薑菟縑啪 蹂曹и 蔑攪煎 噙檜堅 氈港棲棻. \r\n</p>\r\n</body>","hurine7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>守護神們喜歡精靈粉末的原因是可以藉著它感覺到森林的氣息，\r\n精靈粉末是只有住在世界樹之母旁邊洞窟的<a link=\"hurinE8\">娜魯帕</a>才能製作。</p> \r\n</body>","hurinE7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Fairy dust is actually dust ground by <a link=\"hurinE8\">Nerupa</a> from the Elemental Stone which you can find in the forest. \r\nGuardians are created by infusing elemental energies into animals and plants, so they are quite fond of fairy dust.  It seems that they can scent home from fairy dust...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Fairy dust is actually dust ground by <a link=\"hurinE8\">Nerupa</a> from the Elemental Stone which you can find in the forest. \r\nGuardians are created by infusing elemental energies into animals and plants, so they are quite fond of fairy dust.  It seems that they can scent home from fairy dust...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>む橫葬 渦蝶お朝 膛擊 給嬴棻棲賊 橢擊 熱 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>薑滄曖 給</font>擊 <a link=\"hurinE8\">啻瑞だ</a>陛 薑薯п 虜菟橫 輿朝 陛瑞縑蹂.\r\n熱��濠菟擎 獄楚 膛曖 翕衝僭縑 嬴檣ж餌萄 褐檜 薑滄擊 碳橫厥橫 璽褻и 謙褶菟檜晦 陽僥縑\r\n獄楚朝 薑滄菟檜轄. 斜楚憮 薑滄曖 晦遴擊 鬼ж啪 替野 熱 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>む橫葬 渦蝶お蒂 薑蜓 謠嬴</font>и港棲棻.\r\n斜菟擎 む橫葬 渦蝶お縑憮 斜菟 堅щ曖 薑鏃蒂 替郭朝 匙 偽嬴蹂.\r\n</p> \r\n</body>","hurine8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>她是芮克妮族的長老，他們具有製作東西才華，製作給我們妖精好多特別的東西。\r\n平常芮克妮族很冷淡，但是很有禮貌。\r\n不過只有那個女孩是最孤僻的，跟她聊的時候最好不要希望她的態度會改變，但她是對我們是很重要的存在。</p>\r\n</body>","hurinE8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>She is the elder of Arachnes and seems to be an old acquaintance of the Mother of the Forest and Elves. She was living in the cave under the World Tree even before I was born...\r\n<br>She has great talent in making items; in fact she makes a variety of things for us. Usually arachnes are cold, but polite...but Nerupa is, well - cranky.  Don't expect to hear pleasant words from her, but don't let that stop you from showing gratitude for her help.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>She is the elder of Arachnes and seems to be an old acquaintance of the Mother of the Forest and Elves. She was living in the cave under the World Tree even before I was born...\r\n<br>She has great talent in making items; in fact she makes a variety of things for us. Usually arachnes are cold, but polite...but Nerupa is, well - cranky.  Don't expect to hear pleasant words from her, but don't let that stop you from showing gratitude for her help.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinE8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜喪朝 嬴塭觼啻 褶曖 濰煎煎 '膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲'諦朝 辦葬菟紫 賅腦朝 螃楚瞪睡攪 か滌и 婦啗檣 匙 偽嬴蹂. 薯陛 鷓橫釭陛 瞪睡攪 <font fg=ffffff>撮啗熱 蕙曖 饜掉</font>縑 餌朝 匙擊 爾賊.. \r\n<br>斜喪朝 羲衛 嬴塭觼啻 褶 醞縑憮紫 僭勒擊 虜萄朝 營輿陛 渠欽п憮, 辦葬 蹂薑菟縑啪 <font fg=ffffff>罹楝陛雖 僭勒擊 虜菟橫 輿堆</font> ж轄. 爾鱔 嬴塭觼啻 褶擎 鼠募募ж堅 課課蜃曹 ж雖虜 蕨曖陛 渠欽�� 夥艇 謙褶檣等 橫翹雖 斜喪虜擎 紮釭 惚ちи 撩問檜橫憮, 斜喪縑啪 謠擎 模葬 菔朝 勒 ん晦ж朝 啪 謠擊 剪縑蹂. 斜楚紫 辦葬菟縑啦  渦й 釭嬪橈檜 堅葆遴 襄營雖蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","HurinE9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>若要採取潘的鬃毛，赤手空拳的攻擊潘就可以了，\r\n但是要小心因為潘的個性是很粗暴的，當潘攻擊的時候，攻擊力量之大可以讓你立刻躺平，躺平∼喔！ \r\n你們小心點，若不想被潘打到躺平，千萬不要用弓箭或武器攻擊潘，赤手空拳的去取得這些鬃毛，如果不相信那就先準備好躺平後的事吧。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","hurinE9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>っ曖 陞晦瓚擊 瓣餵ж溥賊 っ擊 奢問ж賊 腎雖蹂. ж雖虜 \r\nっ擎 撩韓檜 陪ァп憮 濠褐縑啪 陛濰 Яп蒂 號檜 殮�� 濠蒂 \r\n奢問ж棲 輿曖 п撿 腎蹂. っ曖 奢問擊 嫡雖 彊戲溥賊 舒 貲 \r\n檜鼻檜 ⑺溘п憮 и貲檜 �偯� 踐貊 嶸檣ж朝 翕寰 棻艇 \r\nи貲檜 瓣餵擊 ж朝 熱 夤縑 橈雖蹂. っ曖 陞晦瓚擊 \r\n瓣餵ж溥賊 棺 跡獗擊 勘 熱 夤縑 橈橫蹂.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","hurinm1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我真是不懂，你是人類麼能夠避開守護神那銳利的眼睛而到達這。\r\n<br> \r\n我真是無法了解你們，你是殷海薩的孩子，但是為甚麼會擁有格藍肯的慾望？\r\n我無法了解的是怎麼會有站在殷海薩和格藍肯中間的生命。\r\n反正已經有許多妖精為了了解人類，而到人類世界去和人相處，真是搞不懂...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","hurinM1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I don't know how a human. one of the flames that consume everything, could avoid the <a link = \"hurinM2\">guardians</a> long enough to arrive at this sacred place.</p>\r\n<br>\r\nI can't understand you humans - you are sons of Einhasad, but also follow the greed of Gran Kain. It may be simply because you are so difficult to understand that so many elves leave the forest to contact humans...I certainly know not.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinM1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I don't know how a human. one of the flames that consume everything, could avoid the <a link = \"hurinM2\">guardians</a> long enough to arrive at this sacred place.</p>\r\n<br>\r\nI can't understand you humans - you are sons of Einhasad, but also follow the greed of Gran Kain. It may be simply because you are so difficult to understand that so many elves leave the forest to contact humans...I certainly know not.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinM1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>賅萇 匙菟擎 鳴酈朝 碳粒, 檣除檣 渡褐檜 橫飩啪  \r\n<a link = \"hurinM2\">熱��濠</a>菟擊 Яп憮 罹晦梱雖 螢 熱 氈歷朝雖 賅腦啊捱蹂. \r\n<br> \r\n陪 渡褐菟擊 檜пй 熱 橈橫蹂. 橫簞憮 渡褐擎 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 \r\n濠衝檜賊憮, 陽煎朝 斜嫌蘋檣曖 踹蜂擊 評腦晦紫 ж朝 剪轄? \r\n嬴檣ж餌萄諦 斜嫌蘋檣曖 醞除縑 摹 檣除檜塢 儅貲擊 陪 \r\n檜пй 熱 橈橫蹂. ж曹 斜楚憮 號擎 蹂薑菟檜 檣除菟擊 \r\n檜пж晦 嬪п 膛擊 釭陛 檣除菟婁 婦啗蒂 裕朝 雖紫 \r\n賅腦啊雖虜..\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","hurinm2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>胡林戴里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我不知道人類怎麼能避開其他人的眼線，到這裡來了呢？\r\n這實在很令人疑惑？\r\n你也看到過吧！芮克妮、潘、安特和精靈也就是森林的守護者。他們對入侵森林的人類可是不會手下留情的！？\r\n他們討厭人類到這裡來，他們害怕著有一天像你一樣心�堨u有著征服世界的傲慢的人類會奪走這妖精最後的樂園。\r\n<br>\r\n對你來說所有的怪物都是你的獵物，但對上守護者時千萬要小心，他們是殷海薩為了守護妖精和森林才創造出他們的。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","hurinM2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a still a mystery to me as to how you could avoid the guardians...but I suspect that you have seen them already.\r\nArachne, Pan, Ent, and Fairy are the guardians of the forest, and they hate the intruders - especially humans. They are afraid; your arrogance and desire to take over all the world may consume the last resting place of Elves.\r\n<br>\r\nYou may see all monsters as things to hunt, but you'd be careful about the guardians - they are created by Einhasad himself to protect the forest and elves.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinM2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Hurindalien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a still a mystery to me as to how you could avoid the guardians...but I suspect that you have seen them already.\r\nArachne, Pan, Ent, and Fairy are the guardians of the forest, and they hate the intruders - especially humans. They are afraid; your arrogance and desire to take over all the world may consume the last resting place of Elves.\r\n<br>\r\nYou may see all monsters as things to hunt, but you'd be careful about the guardians - they are created by Einhasad himself to protect the forest and elves.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","hurinM2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�譫偌瑀�:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檣除檜 橫飩啪 斜菟曖 換擊 Яп憮 罹晦梱雖 螢 熱  \r\n氈歷朝雖朝曖僥檜雖虜, 渡褐紫 檜嘐 и廓鎢 爾懊擊 剪縑蹂.  \r\n嬴塭觼啻諦 っ, 縛お諦 む橫葬菟檜 夥煎 熱��濠 謙褶檜雖蹂.  \r\n斜菟擎 ъ陛腎雖 彊擎 膛曖 藹殮濠, か�� 檣除菟擊  \r\n褓橫ж轄. 夥煎 渡褐籀歲 賅萇 撮鼻擊 薑犒ж溥朝 匏橈朝  \r\n螃虜檜 檜 撮鼻縑 陴擎 葆雖虞 蹂薑菟曖 爾旎濠葬葆螳  \r\n鳴麵幗萵梱 斜菟擎 舒溥錶 ж堅 氈橫蹂.  \r\n<br> \r\n渡褐縑啦 賅萇 跨蝶攪陛 餌傖馬戲煎虜 爾檜啊雖虜, \r\n熱��濠縑 渠п摹 醱碟�� 輿曖ж朝 匙檜 謠擊 剪縑蹂. 斜菟擎 \r\n夥煎 膛婁 蹂薑擊 雖酈晦 嬪п 嬴檣ж餌萄 褐檜 璽褻и \r\nЯ褻僭菟檜棲梱蹂. \r\n</p> \r\n</body>","inn-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n歡迎光臨,需要什麼服務嗎?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"room\">租房間</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"hall\">租會議廳</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"return\">退租</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"enter\">進入房間或會議廳</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","Inn-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nWelcome. What can I do for you?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"room\">Rent a room</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"hall\">Rent a hall</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"return\">Return a key</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"enter\">Enter the room or hall</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","inn-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nWelcome. What can I do for you?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"room\">Rent a room</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"hall\">Rent a hall</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"return\">Return a key</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"enter\">Enter the room or hall</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","inn-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n寰喟ж撮蹂. 鼠歙擊 紫諦萄萵梱蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"room\"> 寞擊 渠罹и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"hall\"> �池� 渠罹и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"return\"> 渠罹и 寞檜釭 �池� 奩�納挬�</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"enter\"> 寞傳朝 �朵� 菟橫除棻</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","inn1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n我不要租給像你這種邪惡的人，請你離開。\r\n</body>\r\n","Inn1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nHere are no rooms for you and your ilk - be away!\r\n</body>\r\n","Inn1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nHere are no rooms for you and your ilk - be away!\r\n</body>\r\n","inn1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n渡褐偽擎 學檣縑啪 還 寞擎 罹晦橈模. 橫憮 集釭衛螃.\r\n</body>\r\n","inn10-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n王子和公主才能租用集會所。\r\n</body>\r\n","Inn10-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nSorry, but halls are available to princes and princesses only.\r\n</body>\r\n","inn10-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nSorry, but halls are available to princes and princesses only.\r\n</body>\r\n","inn10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n�池� 諾濠釭 奢輿椒虜檜 渠罹й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>\r\n","inn11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">\\：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n我不能把集會所租給像你這樣邪惡的人，請你趕快離開此地。\r\n</body>\r\n","Inn11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nI won't give halls to people like you. Begone.\r\n</body>\r\n","inn11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nI won't give halls to people like you. Begone.\r\n</body>\r\n","inn11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n渡褐偽擎 學檣縑啪 還 �池� 罹晦橈模. 橫憮 集釭衛螃.\r\n</body>\r\n","inn12-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n集會所是算人頭的，每一個人<var src=\"#1\">金幣，<br><br>\r\n請問，你要租幾把鑰匙？<br><br>\r\n","Inn12-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe hall costs <var src=\"#1\"> adena per person.<br><br>\r\nHow many keys would you like?<br><br>\r\n","inn12-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe hall costs <var src=\"#1\"> adena per person.<br><br>\r\nHow many keys would you like?<br><br>\r\n","inn12-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n�池� и 餌塋渡 <var src=\"#1\"> 嬴等釭殮棲棻.<br><br>\r\n翮潸朝 賃 偃釭 網葬衛啊蝗棲梱?<br><br>\r\n","inn15-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n真是抱歉，你已經租借過集會所了。","Inn15-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nSir, you have already rented a hall.\r\n","inn15-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nSir, you have already rented a hall.\r\n","inn15-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n槳椒, 檜嘐 �池� 網葬樟蝗棲棻.","inn16-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n不好意思，目前正好沒有空的集會所。","Inn16-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nI'm sorry, sir, but we don't have any available halls right now.\r\n","inn16-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nI'm sorry, sir, but we don't have any available halls right now.\r\n","inn16-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n賸歎м棲棻. 槳椒. 雖旎擎 綴 �池� 橈蝗棲棻.","inn2-c.html":"body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n這裡的房間是一個人<var src=\"#1\">金幣。<br><br>\r\n你要租幾把鑰匙？<br><br>\r\n","Inn2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe cost for the room is <var src=\"#1\"> adena per person.<br><br>\r\nHow many keys do you want?<br><br>\r\n","inn2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe cost for the room is <var src=\"#1\"> adena per person.<br><br>\r\nHow many keys do you want?<br><br>\r\n","inn2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n寞擎 и 餌塋渡 <var src=\"#1\"> 嬴等釭殮棲棻.<br><br>\r\n翮潸朝 賃 偃釭 網葬衛啊蝗棲梱?<br><br>\r\n","inn20-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n謝謝你。<br>\r\n這裡還給你<var src=\"#1\">金幣。 <br>\r\n謝謝光臨。","Inn20-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThank you, sir. <br>\r\nI'll give you <var src=\"#1\"> adena back. <br>\r\nPlease come again.\r\n","inn20-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThank you, sir. <br>\r\nI'll give you <var src=\"#1\"> adena back. <br>\r\nPlease come again.\r\n","inn20-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n馬餌м棲棻. 槳椒. <br>\r\n罹晦 <var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭蒂 給溥萄葬啊蝗棲棻. <br>\r\n棻擠縑 傳 螃褊衛螃.","inn3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n對不起，你手中的金幣不夠哦！","Inn3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nI'm sorry - but you don't have enough money, sir.\r\n","inn3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nI'm sorry - but you don't have enough money, sir.\r\n","inn3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n槳椒, 賸歎ж雖虜 絲檜 醱碟ж雖 彊蝗棲棻.\r\n","inn4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n要一起使用房間的話，請把鑰匙給其他人，往旁邊的樓梯上去即可。 <br><br>\r\n時間是四個小時，若在這時間內退還鑰匙，就還給你20%的租金。\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n請你好好的休息。\r\n","Inn4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nPlease distribute the keys to the people with whom you want to share the room, and then go to the stairs over there.\r\nYour stay time will be 4 hours - but if you return the room/hall key before this, I'll give you back 20% of the rent fee.\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nPlease have a good time.\r\n\r\n","inn4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nPlease distribute the keys to the people with whom you want to share the room, and then go to the stairs over there.\r\nYour stay time will be 4 hours - but if you return the room/hall key before this, I'll give you back 20% of the rent fee.\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nPlease have a good time.\r\n\r\n","inn4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n寞擊 偽檜 噙褒 碟菟縑啪 翮潸蒂 釭援橫 輿褐 棻擠 盪晦 爾檜朝 啗欽戲煎 螢塭陛衛賊 腌棲棻.<br><br>\r\n渠罹 晦除擎 4衛除檜貊, 晦除 頂縑 渠罹и 寞/�池� 奩陶ж衛賊 盪�騋� 渠罹猿曖 20%蒂 給溥萄董棲棻.\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n嬴鼠薺煙 ら�� 蓮褊衛螃.\r\n\r\n","inn5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n對不起，你已經有租房間了。","Inn5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nSir, you rented a room already.\r\n","inn5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nSir, you rented a room already.\r\n","inn5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n槳椒, 檜嘐 寞擊 網葬樟蝗棲棻.","inn6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n真不好意思，現在沒有房間了。","Inn6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nI'm sorry, sir - but there aren't any available rooms right now.\r\n","inn6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nI'm sorry, sir - but there aren't any available rooms right now.\r\n","inn6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n賸歎м棲棻. 槳椒. 雖旎擎 綴 寞檜 橈蝗棲棻.","intro-c.tbl":"7\r\n<歡迎進入天堂萬人線上遊戲>\r\n\r\n請輸入使用者之帳號和密碼。\r\n\r\n若沒有帳號，請到天堂網站申\r\n請。\r\nhttp://www.lineage.com.tw\r\n","intro-e.tbl":"7\r\nWelcome to Lineage!\r\n\r\nPlease enter your account \r\nname and password. If you \r\ndon't have an account yet, \r\nplease press \"New\" - it's \r\nfree to get a new account.\r\n","intro-j.tbl":"7\r\nWelcome to Lineage!\r\n\r\nPlease enter your account \r\nname and password. If you \r\ndon't have an account yet, \r\nplease press \"New\" - it's \r\nfree to get a new account.\r\n","intro-k.tbl":"8\r\n棻醞 餌辨濠 螞塭檣  啪歜\r\n葬棲雖縑 螃褐 匙擊  �紊�\r\nм棲棻!\r\n\r\n餌辨濠 啗薑婁 懍�ㄧ� 殮溘\r\nж褊衛螃. 啗薑檜 橈戲褐\r\n碟擎 New蒂 揚楝 億煎遴 啗\r\n薑擊 虜萄撮蹂.\r\n","iola1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>艾歐拉 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n有個怪物的名字叫哥布林，它是個非常頑皮的小夥子。它很好奇人使用的東西，所以在地上看到東西，就會立刻撿走。而且它的行動非常快，很難追得上它。雖然它不會直接傷害人，但是確實很討人厭。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","iola1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>檜螢塭 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n斜源萼檜塭朝 窒葆紫梟綠朝 霤戲煎 跤脹 學翕檜奧棲棻. 餌塋菟曖 僭勒縑 婦褕檜 號嬴 夥款縑 雲橫霞 僭勒擊 爾賊 營說葬 殖溥諦 輿錶憮 紫蜂纂雖蹂. 斜陽 ч翕檜 橫鎬釭 營緒艇雖 �母睄� 覲嬴陛晦塢 罹除 ��萇 啪 嬴棲縑蹂. 綠煙 餌塋縑啪 霜蕾 п蒂 郭纂雖朝 彊雖虜 橫繚萇 撾嘐遴 惚僭檣 匙 虜擎 碟貲п蹂.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>殿下，請你下令。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp1\">徵求建言</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">接受收入和支出的報告</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">調整稅率</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">領出資金</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">存入資金</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmael4\">管理傭兵</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">管理城門</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">決定下次圍城時間</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">管理城堡治安</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Orders, my Lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp1\">Ask advice</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">Get report of income and expense</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the tax rate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw adena</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit adena</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmael4\">Manage mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the gates</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">Declare next siege time</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">Control castle security</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Orders, my Lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp1\">Ask advice</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">Get report of income and expense</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the tax rate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw adena</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit adena</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmael4\">Manage mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the gates</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">Declare next siege time</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">Control castle security</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>瞪ж, 鼠歙檜萇 貲滄虜 頂溥 輿衛褫模憮.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp1\">褻樹擊 掘и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">熱殮/雖轎曖 爾堅蒂 嫡朝棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">撮徽擊 褻瞰и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">濠旎擊 檣轎и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">濠旎擊 殮旎и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmael4\">辨煽擊 婦葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">撩僥擊 婦葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 薑и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">撩頂 纂寰擊 婦葬и棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael10-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我們沒有多餘的金錢去修理門。\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael10-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We don't have enough money to repair the gates - we must tax the peasants back to the Stone Age!  Er, sir. \r\n","ishmael10-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We don't have enough money to repair the gates - we must tax the peasants back to the Stone Age!  Er, sir. \r\n","ishmael10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 僥擊 熱葬й虜и 濠旎檜 橈蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","ishmael11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在正在戰爭，直到戰爭結束前都不能去修理門的。\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We are in the middle of war - we can't repair the gate till it ends!\r\n\r\n","ishmael11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We are in the middle of war - we can't repair the gate till it ends!\r\n\r\n","ishmael11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎擎 瞪爵醞檜塭 熱葬陛 碳陛棟м棲棻.\r\n</body>","ishmael12-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>新的稅率將從明天起開始生效。請記得，即使您今天在稍早前更改過稅率，從明天起將會使用這次所訂的新稅率。\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael12-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The new tax rate will be effective for the next day. Please remember that even if you changed the tax rates before, this one will now be tomorrow's tax.\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael12-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The new tax rate will be effective for the next day. Please remember that even if you changed the tax rates before, this one will now be tomorrow's tax.\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael12-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>滲唳脹 撮徽擎 棻擠陳睡攪 瞳辨腎啪 腌棲棻. ж瑞縑 罹楝廓 撮徽擊 夥紱衛渦塭紫 葆雖虞縑 薑п霞 撮徽虜檜 瞳辨脹棻朝 薄擊 貲褕п 輿衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n</body>","ishmael13-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我會遵從您的命令，再補充更多的軍隊。在明天的此時，他們就會到達。\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael13-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Following your orders, I will replenish the army with <var src=\"#1\"> more <var src=\"#0\">s. They'll be available at this time tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael13-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Following your orders, I will replenish the army with <var src=\"#1\"> more <var src=\"#0\">s. They'll be available at this time tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael13-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>碟睡ж褐渠煎 <var src=\"#0\">蒂 <var src=\"#1\">貲 爾醱ж紫煙 ж啊蝗棲棻. 頂橾 偽擎 衛除梱雖朝 爾醱檜 腆 匙殮棲棻.\r\n</body>","ishmael14-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>國庫已經耗盡，我不知道在這種情況下該怎麼管理城堡。請告訴我該怎麼做。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmael1\">給一個指令</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael14-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We have depleted the treasury - I can't manage the castle in this state!  Please tell me what to do.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmael1\">Give an order</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael14-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We have depleted the treasury - I can't manage the castle in this state!  Please tell me what to do.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmael1\">Give an order</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael14-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 濠旎檜 睡褶ж罹 撩曖 晦棟檜 葆綠脹 鼻鷓殮棲棻. 橫飩啪 渠籀п撿 й 雖 貲滄擊 頂溥輿褊衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmael1\">檜蝶葆縣縑啪 雖衛蒂 頂萼棻</a>\r\n</body>","ishmael15-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">殿下，您所能指派的傭兵們，<var src=\"#0\">程度只有他們原來<var src=\"#1\">神力的一半。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ishmael15-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord, You can assign <var src=\"#0\"> only up to <var src=\"#1\"> mercenaries (half of your esteemed Charisma).</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael15-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord, You can assign <var src=\"#0\"> only up to <var src=\"#1\"> mercenaries (half of your esteemed Charisma).</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael15-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿衛罹, <var src=\"#0\">椒眷 寡纂п 萄萵 熱 氈朝 辨煽曖 熱朝 <var src=\"#0\">椒曖 CHR曖 瞰奩檣 <var src=\"#1\">貲 梱雖殮棲棻.</p>\r\n</body>","ishmael2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>昨天的交易報告在這裡。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>今天的總收入：<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">金幣\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">基本的費用：</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">金幣\r\n<p align=left>今天實際的收入：<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">金幣\r\n<p align=left>現在的國庫：<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">金幣\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ishmael2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the report of yesterday's transactions.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Total income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adenas\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">Basic expenses</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adenas\r\n<p align=left>Net income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adenas\r\n<p align=left>Current treasury<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adenas\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the report of yesterday's transactions.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Total income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adenas\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">Basic expenses</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adenas\r\n<p align=left>Net income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adenas\r\n<p align=left>Current treasury<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adenas\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫薯 ж瑞曖 撮旎 熱殮婁 雖轎擎 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>橫薯ж瑞 熱殮:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">晦獄 雖轎</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left>橫薯唸骯:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left>⑷營濠骯識擋<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">嬴等釭\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>費用的記錄在這裡，殿下。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>對國王的貢品<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>控制和平的費用<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>付給僕人的薪水<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>城堡維持費用<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>付給傭兵的薪水<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>其他的費用<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#5\">金幣<p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ishmael3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The record of expenses are here. My lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Tribute to the King<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adenas\r\n<p>Peace control<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adenas\r\n<p>Payment to servants<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adenas\r\n<p>Castle upkeep<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adenas\r\n<p>Payment to Mercenaries<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">adenas\r\n<p align=right><p>Miscellaneous<br>\r\n<var src=\"#5\">adenas\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The record of expenses are here. My lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Tribute to the King<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adenas\r\n<p>Peace control<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adenas\r\n<p>Payment to servants<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adenas\r\n<p>Castle upkeep<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adenas\r\n<p>Payment to Mercenaries<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">adenas\r\n<p align=right><p>Miscellaneous<br>\r\n<var src=\"#5\">adenas\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蓬葆縣</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜廓曖 雖轎 頂羲擎 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>諾縑曖 鼻陶<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>纂寰 嶸雖綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>衛謙菟曖 瑰晝<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>撩曖 嶸雖婦葬綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>辨煽 嶸雖綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>晦顫 濩綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#5\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n</body>","ishmael4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>殿下，您想交給雇來的傭兵怎樣的任務？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">安排這些弓箭手</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">雇用傭兵</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">重新安排雇來的傭兵</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What kind of tasks do you have in for the mercenaries, my lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">Arrange the archers</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">Employ mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">Rearrange hired mercenaries</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What kind of tasks do you have in for the mercenaries, my lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">Arrange the archers</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">Employ mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">Rearrange hired mercenaries</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辨煽縑 渠и 薑疇擊 唸薑п 輿褊衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">撩漁嬪曖 掙熱 寡纂</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">辨煽 堅辨</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">堅辨и 辨煽曖 寡纂</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在城門的狀況如下：\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate_kent outer gate\">修理外城門</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate_kent inner gate\">修理內城門</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the status of the castle gate right now.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate\">Repair the outer gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate\">Repair the inner gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the status of the castle gate right now.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate\">Repair the outer gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate\">Repair the inner gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 撩僥曖 鼻鷓朝 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate_kent outer gate\">諼撩僥擊 熱葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate_kent inner gate\">頂撩僥擊 熱葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"autorepairon\">撩僥 濠翕 熱葬 貲滄擊 頂塢棻.</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"autorepairoff\">撩僥 濠翕 熱葬 貲滄擊 鏃模и棻.</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">殿下，您現在好嗎？\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","ishmael6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord <var src=\"#0\">, How are you doing todays?\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord <var src=\"#0\">, How are you doing todays?\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">椒, 寰喟ж樟蝗棲梱. 蹂闈 覬 橫集褊棲梱?\r\n</body>","ishmael7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你竟敢偷偷地潛入這裡！\r\n<p>警衛！現在馬上把這些惡棍帶出這裡！\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","ishmael7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How dare you sneak in here!\r\n<p>Guards! Take these ruffians out of here - now!\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How dare you sneak in here!\r\n<p>Guards! Take these ruffians out of here - now!\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹晦陛 橫蛞還 憲堅 獗橫菟橫諮朝陛!\r\n<p>唳綠煽! 檜濠菟擊 說葬 罹晦縑憮 莊橫頂紫煙 ж塭!\r\n</body>","ishmael8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我會遵照您的命令，將在明日此時之前，徵募新的傭兵。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","ishmael8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As you ordered, I'll recruit mercenaries by this hour tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As you ordered, I'll recruit mercenaries by this hour tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmael8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>碟睡渠煎 頂橾 偽擎 衛除 梱雖朝 煽餌菟擊 賅嬴螃紫煙 ж啊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","ishmael9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在沒有可用的傭兵。如果您想指派，請先指派我『雇來的傭兵』。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","ishmael9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are no mercenaries available now. If you want to assign them, please let me 'Employ mercenaries' first.\r\n\r\n","ishmael9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are no mercenaries available now. If you want to assign them, please let me 'Employ mercenaries' first.\r\n\r\n","ishmael9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 堅辨и 辨煽檜 橈蝗棲棻. 煽餌蒂 寡纂ж衛溥賊 辦摹 盪縑啪 '辨煽 堅辨' 貲滄擊 頂葬敷憮 辨煽擊 堅辨ж敷撿 ж褫棲棻.\r\n</body>","ishmaelhp1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>殿下，您想知道些什麼？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp2\">關於我和我的任務</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp3\">有關課稅</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp4\">有關管理城堡</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp5\">有關雇來的人</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp6\">有關作戰</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","ishmaelhp1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>What do you want to know, my Lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp2\">About myself and the role of a Lord</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp3\">About Taxes</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp4\">About Managing the Castle</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp5\">About Mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp6\">About War</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>What do you want to know, my Lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp2\">About myself and the role of a Lord</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp3\">About Taxes</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp4\">About Managing the Castle</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp5\">About Mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp6\">About War</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>橫集и 匙縑 渠п 憲堅 談戲褊棲梱, 輿檣檜衛罹?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp2\">艙輿塭朝 雖嬪諦 衛謙濰縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp3\">撮旎縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp4\">撩曖 婦葬縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp5\">辨煽縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp6\">瞪爵縑 渠п</a>\r\n</body>","ishmaelhp2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">殿下，您已經是這個城堡的統治者。而且當這個城堡還叫做古迪歐的時候，我就已經開始管理這個城堡了，我比任何人更了解有關這個城堡和周圍的土地。\r\n<p>這個城堡曾經有過多位優秀的城主統治，但不論是誰，從我成為這個城堡的管家那一刻起，我就一直幫助他們防禦城堡和土地。\r\n<p>我的忠貞不會被限制到某個特定的人之上，除了『古迪歐領地的統治者』以外。因此只要您是這個城堡的統治者，我就會永遠對你忠誠。\r\n<p>您能收取稅金，再加上我所雇用來的傭兵，您將會有至高的力量來統治這個地方。但是請務必考慮人民的生活，不要過度使用您的權力，並好好照顧土地和人民。\r\n<p>請記得身為這個領地的領主，您不能真的完全地離開這個世界。如果你離開這個世界，你的替身將會出現在您離開的那個位置。您的替身會代替您接受所有來自其他人的宣戰。此外，他無法抵抗來自外部的危險，並且容易受傷。所以我勸告您在離開這個世界之前，務必先到一個安全的地方。以免在您離開的這段期間，有人殺掉您的替身。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","ishmaelhp2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord <var src=\"#0\">, You are the Lord of this castle. And I have been in charge of this castle from the days when this castle was called Gludio. I know better than anyone else about this castle and the surrounding lands.\r\n<p>There have been many Lords succeeding one after another since I became the Chamberlain of this castle, but I have always helped them in defending the castle and lands regardless of who they are.\r\n<p>My loyalty is not restricted to one specific person, but rather I am servant to the 'Lord of Gludio Estate'. Thus, as long as you are the Lord of this castle, I will always be loyal to you.\r\n<p>You can gather taxes and hire mercenaries through me, and thus rule this province with supreme power. Considering the livelihood of the people here, please don't overuse your power and take good care of the land and people.\r\n<p>Just in case, please remember that as a Lord of this province you can't really leave this world entirely. If you leave this world, your avatar will appear at the exact place you departed, and accept all wars against you. Furthermore, your avatar will be vulnerable to external dangers, so I advise you to come to a safe place before leaving the world - someone may try to kill your avatar while you are absent.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord <var src=\"#0\">, You are the Lord of this castle. And I have been in charge of this castle from the days when this castle was called Gludio. I know better than anyone else about this castle and the surrounding lands.\r\n<p>There have been many Lords succeeding one after another since I became the Chamberlain of this castle, but I have always helped them in defending the castle and lands regardless of who they are.\r\n<p>My loyalty is not restricted to one specific person, but rather I am servant to the 'Lord of Gludio Estate'. Thus, as long as you are the Lord of this castle, I will always be loyal to you.\r\n<p>You can gather taxes and hire mercenaries through me, and thus rule this province with supreme power. Considering the livelihood of the people here, please don't overuse your power and take good care of the land and people.\r\n<p>Just in case, please remember that as a Lord of this province you can't really leave this world entirely. If you leave this world, your avatar will appear at the exact place you departed, and accept all wars against you. Furthermore, your avatar will be vulnerable to external dangers, so I advise you to come to a safe place before leaving the world - someone may try to kill your avatar while you are absent.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\"> 瞪ж, 渡褐擎 檜 撩曖 艙輿檜褊棲棻. 斜葬堅 盪朝 檜 撩檜 旋瑞蛤螃 撩檜塭 碳葬選 陽睡攪 衛謙濰戲煎賦 檜 撩婁 艙雖蒂 婦йп 諮蝗棲棻. 盪朝 援掘爾棻紫 檜 撩婁 艙雖縑 渠п 澀 憲堅 氈棻 濠睡ж堅 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>斜楚憮 薯陛 籀擠 檜 撩曖 衛謙濰檜 脹 檜�譟� 號擎 碟菟檜 檜 撩曖 艙輿陛 腎樟棻陛朝 黴嬪ж衛堆 ж樟蝗棲棻虜, 盪朝 艙輿陛 橫雯 碟檜 腎衛湍雖 斜碟擊 爾謝ж罹 撩婁 艙雖蒂 雖麵 諮雖蹂.\r\n<p>盪曖 醱撩褕擎 橫替 か薑 偃檣檜 嬴棋, '旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖曖 艙輿'曖 匙殮棲棻. 斜楝嘎煎 瞪ж眷憮 檜 艙雖曖 艙輿煎 啗衛朝 и, 盪朝 瞪ж眷 醱撩擊 棻й 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<p>渡褐眷憮朝 盪蒂 鱔ж罹 檜 雖羲曖 撮旎擊 務堅, 斜 絲戲煎 辨煽擊 堅辨ж罹 雖羲 頂縑憮朝 譆堅曖 掏溘擊 陛雖衛啪 腌棲棻虜, 檜蒂 陴辨ж敷憮朝 寰腌棲棻. 睡蛤 檜夠縑 餌朝 艙團菟擊 儅陝ж衛橫 檜 艙雖蒂 澀 棻蝶溥 輿衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<p>葆雖虞戲煎 喻だ褕縑憮 萄葬朝 蜓噪殮棲棻虜, 檜 雖羲曖 艙輿煎賦 瞪ж眷憮朝 樹薯釭 檜 撮啗縑 襄營ж衛啪 腌棲棻. 瞪ж陛 虜擒 檜 撮啗蒂 集釭敷紫, 瞪ж曖 �亳鑑票� 檜 撮啗縑 陴嬴啗衛啪 腌棲棻. �亳鑑票韭� 睡菜檜и 唳辦陛 嬴棲賊 瞪ж眷 紫瞪ж朝 賅萇 瞪爵擊 嫡嬴菟檜衛啪 腌棲棻. 斜楝棲 瞰渠煎 鼠寞綠и 鼻鷓煎 撩 夤擊 給嬴棻棲雖 葆衛堅 檜 撮啗蒂 集釭褒 陽縑朝 樹薯釭 試盪 寰瞪и 夠縑憮 ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻. 樹薯 橫蛤憮 瞪ж曖 跡獗擊 喻葬朝 濠陛 氈擊雖 賅落棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","ishmaelhp3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>您的人民繳交稅金給您，就如同您呈獻貢品給予國王是一樣的。\r\n<p>因此您有權力調整這個地方的稅金。調整後的稅率將被適用在城堡周圍的村莊裡的商店。甚至也可能影響在古丁村莊裡的商店交易。\r\n<p>你所決定的稅率，會從次天開始生效。即使您在一天內多次更改稅率，你當天最後所設定的最後那一個稅率，才會是次日開始使用的稅率。\r\n<p>聚集來的稅金將會在次日黎明時轉移到城堡來。<br>\r\n<p>所有的稅金都是屬於您，殿下。但是，您不能完全使用它們。因為管理城堡和土地需要花費金錢，此外還要進貢給國王。<br>\r\n<p>若你設定的稅率高，當然進入城堡國庫的稅金就會很多。但是如果提高稅率太多，人民還是會反抗您。所以，當您在調整稅率的時候請務必牢記這一點。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","ishmaelhp3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Taxation is your royal right, and the responsibility of the people living here.  Similiarly, it is your responsibility to pay a tribute to Ken Rauhel, the Lord of all this Kingdom.\r\n<p>You have the power to adjust the Tax of this province. This adjusted tax will be applied to the shops in the village around the castle and even the shops in the Gludin Village, thus affecting all trades nearby.\r\n<p>Once you decide the rate of tax, it will be effective the next day. If you change the tax rate several times in a day, the next day's tax rate will be the last one you set.\r\n<p>Gathered taxes will be transferred to the castle around the dawn of the next day.\r\n<p>All the taxes belong to you, my Lord. But, I humbly suggest you not use them all - it costs money to manage the castle and lands, let alone your tribute to the King.\r\n<p>The higher you set the taxes, the more adena will come to the castle treasury.  If you raise the tax too high, people will not support you - please keep that in mind when you adjust the taxes.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Taxation is your royal right, and the responsibility of the people living here.  Similiarly, it is your responsibility to pay a tribute to Ken Rauhel, the Lord of all this Kingdom.\r\n<p>You have the power to adjust the Tax of this province. This adjusted tax will be applied to the shops in the village around the castle and even the shops in the Gludin Village, thus affecting all trades nearby.\r\n<p>Once you decide the rate of tax, it will be effective the next day. If you change the tax rate several times in a day, the next day's tax rate will be the last one you set.\r\n<p>Gathered taxes will be transferred to the castle around the dawn of the next day.\r\n<p>All the taxes belong to you, my Lord. But, I humbly suggest you not use them all - it costs money to manage the castle and lands, let alone your tribute to the King.\r\n<p>The higher you set the taxes, the more adena will come to the castle treasury.  If you raise the tax too high, people will not support you - please keep that in mind when you adjust the taxes.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撮旎擎 艙雖 輿團縑 渠и 瞪ж曖 掏葬檜濠, 檜 諾措 瞪羹曖 輿檣檜褐 騰 塭辦⑦ わж縑 渠и 鼻陶擊 嬪и 瞪ж曖 曖鼠檜衛晦紫 м棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮朝 檜 雖寞曖 撮徽擊 褻瞰ж褒 熱 氈朝 掏и擊 陛雖堅 啗褊棲棻. 撮徽擎 騰お撩 斬寞曖 葆擊擎 僭煩 п滲陛曖 旋瑞蛞 葆擊縑梱雖 瞳辨腎橫 斜夠曖 螞乾 鼻剪楚 陛問縑 艙щ擊 嘐艦 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮 撮徽擊 唸薑ж衛賊 斜 撮徽擎 棻擠陳 撮旎擊 務擊 陽睡攪 艙щ擊 嘐纂啪 腌棲棻. ж瑞縑 罹楝廓 撮徽擊 滲唳ж褒 唳辦 斜陳 陛濰 葆雖虞縑 疇薑ж褐 撮徽檜 棻擠陳曖 撮徽煎 瞳辨檜 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>ж瑞縑 務橫霞 撮旎擎 斜 棻擠陳 翕ぎ 鼠滑 撩戲煎 賅罹雖啪 腌棲棻.<br>\r\n<p>務橫霞 賅萇 撮旎擎 瞪ж曖 匙殮棲棻. ж雖虜, 撮旎戲煎 務橫霞 賅萇 絲擊 葆擠渠煎 餌辨ж褒 熱朝 橈蝗棲棻. 措諾 わж縑曖 鼻陶檜釭 撩, 艙雖曖 婦葬縑 в蹂и 濠旎檜 氈晦 陽僥檜雖蹂.<br>\r\n<p>僭煩 撮徽擊 堪橾 熱煙 撩曖 旎堅朝 Ё褶п 雖雖虜, 撮徽檜 傘鼠 堪戲賊 僭陛陛 螢塭 艙雖 輿團菟曖 奩嫦擊 餌啪 腌棲棻. 撮徽擊 褻薑ж褒 陽縑朝 棺 斜薄擊 堅溥п 輿褊衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","ishmaelhp4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在城裡管理的一些細節的部分殿下不用擔心，由我來處理就行了。只不過戰爭時，殿下必須親自下令才行。 <br>\r\n<p>在城裡有內城門和外城門。內城門指從內城到往外之門，外城門指圍著內城的外城之門。\r\n<p>殿下和殿下的血盟員可以下令守衛將門開關。城門的開放和城堡的安全有關，殿下要徹底的管理血盟員才是。\r\n<p>若開放外城門等於是將內城開放給敵人，會很危險。但若是將城門一直關著住民無法使用城內的鐵匠設備。城內的設備是城的主要收入來源，若住民無法使用設備，城堡的財政會出現問題。請你好好的考慮何時開關城門是最好。 <br>\r\n<p>而且城門常在戰爭中損毀。若不儘快修理會很危險，可以的話儘快修理是最好的辦法。 \r\n<p>但是在戰爭之狀態之下無法修理，若修理途中發生戰爭，也要中斷修理的動作。修理時需要較多的金錢。若城門全損毀，可能需要數千以上的金幣。所以請你好好的判斷何時修歷史最好的時機。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I can take care of all the minute affairs of the castle, so you don't have to pay attention to such things. But will have to give orders regarding the management of the Castle Gate during the War.\r\n<p>There are two gates in this castle, the inner gate and the outer gate. The inner gate is the one between this inner castle where you are standing right now and the outside. The outer gate is the one located in the outer castle wall which surrounds this inner castle.\r\n<p>As a convenience, you or all of your followers can open/close the inner gate through the Gatekeeper beside the gate. But the outer gate, which is directly related to the security of the whole castle, is accessible to your highness only - please issue orders to me if you want to open or close the outer gate.\r\n<p>If you open the outer gate, it will allow enemies come into the inner castle - very dangerous. But if you keep the Gate closed too long, people will be unable to use the facilities in the castle such as the forge. Since they are the main sources of funding the castle treasury, it could cause financial problems. So, you must consider carefully based upon these facts when you want to close the gates.\r\n<p>Furthermore, both gates can be destroyed by the assault from infiltrators during the war. Once the gates are destroyed, they can be fixed only after the war ends. And if war occurs during the repairs, we stop the repairs. Of course it costs money to repair the Gate; when the gate is destroyed completely, it could cost thousands of adena. You have to decide when we will fix the gates based upon these facts.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I can take care of all the minute affairs of the castle, so you don't have to pay attention to such things. But will have to give orders regarding the management of the Castle Gate during the War.\r\n<p>There are two gates in this castle, the inner gate and the outer gate. The inner gate is the one between this inner castle where you are standing right now and the outside. The outer gate is the one located in the outer castle wall which surrounds this inner castle.\r\n<p>As a convenience, you or all of your followers can open/close the inner gate through the Gatekeeper beside the gate. But the outer gate, which is directly related to the security of the whole castle, is accessible to your highness only - please issue orders to me if you want to open or close the outer gate.\r\n<p>If you open the outer gate, it will allow enemies come into the inner castle - very dangerous. But if you keep the Gate closed too long, people will be unable to use the facilities in the castle such as the forge. Since they are the main sources of funding the castle treasury, it could cause financial problems. So, you must consider carefully based upon these facts when you want to close the gates.\r\n<p>Furthermore, both gates can be destroyed by the assault from infiltrators during the war. Once the gates are destroyed, they can be fixed only after the war ends. And if war occurs during the repairs, we stop the repairs. Of course it costs money to repair the Gate; when the gate is destroyed completely, it could cost thousands of adena. You have to decide when we will fix the gates based upon these facts.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撩曖 ж雛堅 撮撮и 婦葬縑 渠п憮朝 瞪ж眷憮 霜蕾 褐唳噙衛雖 彊嬴紫 薯陛 籀葬蒂 ж堅 氈蝗棲棻. 棻虜 瞪爵衛曖 撩僥曖 婦葬虜躑擎 霜蕾 雖衛蒂 頂溥輿敷撿 м棲棻. <br>\r\n<p>撩縑朝 諼撩僥婁 頂撩僥檜 氈蝗棲棻. 頂撩僥擎 雖旎 啗衛朝 頂撩縑憮 夥梨戲煎 釭陛朝 僥擊 陛葬酈貊, 諼撩僥擎 檜 頂撩擊 舒腦堅 氈朝 諼撩漁縑 氈朝 僥擊 蜓м棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж諦 瞪ж曖 ⑸裊錳菟擎 陝 撩僥 擅縑 氈朝 僥雖晦縑啪 貲滄擊 頂溥憮 翮堅 殘擊 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 撩僥曖 偃寞擎 埠 撩曖 寰爾諦 霜唸腎嘎煎 睡蛤 ⑸裊錳曖 婦葬蒂 繹盪�� ж敷撿 м棲棻.\r\n<p>諼撩僥擊 罹衛賊 瞳菟縑啪 頂撩擊 偃寞ж朝 匙檜 腎嘎煎 嬪ям棲棻虜, 撩僥擊 啗樓 殘堅 啗衛賊 艙雖 輿團菟檜 撩 寰縑 氈朝 渠濰除 蛔曖 衛撲擊 餌辨й 熱陛 橈蝗棲棻. 撩 寰縑 氈朝 衛撲擎 撩曖 輿蹂и 熱殮錳檜晦紫 ж嘎煎 艙團菟檜 檜 衛撲擊 檜辨ж雖 跤ж啪 腎賊 薯薑縑 僥薯陛 儅梢棲棻. 檜薄擊 堅溥ж敷憮 樹薯 撩僥擊 罹殘擊 匙檣陛蒂 儅陝п 輿褊衛螃. <br>\r\n<p>傳 撩僥擎 瞪爵 鼻�窒□韭� 撩 寰戲煎 藹楞ж溥朝 鼠葬菟曖 奢問 陽僥縑 睡憮韓 熱 夤縑 橈蝗棲棻. 諼撩僥擊 睡憮霞 瓣煎 寞纂ж賊 瞪爵衛縑 衙辦 嬪яж嘎煎 褻勒檜 ъ塊и棻賊 窕 堅纂衛晦 夥奧棲棻. \r\n<p>ж雖虜 睡憮霞 撩僥擎 瞪爵 鼻鷓陛 嬴棍 陽夤縑 熱葬й 熱 橈堅, 傳 熱葬醞縑 瞪爵檜 嫦嫦ж賊 熱葬蒂 醞欽й 熱 夤縑 橈蝗棲棻. 僭煩 撩僥擊 熱葬ж朝 等縑朝 釭葷渠煎曖 絲檜 в蹂м棲棻. 撩僥檜 諫だ腎歷擊 唳辦縑朝 熱繭 嬴等釭 檜鼻曖 熱葬綠陛 菟 熱紫 氈蝗棲棻. 斜楝嘎煎 檜楝и 薄擊 澀 儅陝ж衛橫 樹薯 撩僥擊 堅藥撿 й梱蒂 澀 っ欽п 輿衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<p>撩僥檜 濠翕戲煎 熱葬紫煙 貲滄擊 頂葬衛賊 撩僥檜 睡熱橫雖賊 濠翕戲煎 熱葬陛 腌棲棻. 僭煩 熱葬綠 羲衛 濠翕戲煎 釭陛啪 腌棲棻. ж雖虜 奢撩瞪 衛縑朝 檜 貲滄擊 褒чй 熱 橈戲嘎煎 輿曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","ishmaelhp5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在城中已經有負責維持治安的衛兵，但是他們也只負責維持治安而已，在戰爭期間，很難叫得動他們來參與。若我們再考慮到那些大大小小的戰爭攻擊的話，還是先雇請那些可以信賴的傭兵比較妥當。您只要告訴我需要雇用多少傭兵人數和他們的類型，明天的這個時候，我就會為您準備好這些傭兵了。\r\n<p>以城堡的結構看來，有二種類型的傭兵可以防衛我們的城堡。一種是弓箭手，他們可以反擊那些破壞門的敵人。另一種則是保護您和血盟的個人保鑣。</p>\r\n<p>當他們準備妥當後，我就會在城牆的周圍安排弓箭手。\r\n<p>但是您必須決定您需要多少的保鏢，或者您要分配多少的保鏢給您的血盟。\r\n<p>傭兵們會在城外南方角落的兵營中等待著您的命令。一旦您下了決定，請和傭兵隊長韓特說話。然後他將會依照您的命令指派傭兵。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>請記得，雇用傭兵的錢是從稅金中支出的。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","ishmaelhp5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are already guards posted to maintain justice around the castle, but they are to maintain justice only, and not of use during the war. Considering that there are many small and large conflicts in the estate, we'd better prepare for the worst by hiring trustworthy mercenaries.\r\n<p>Once you tell me the number and type of mercenaries, I'll ask around to gather trustworthy mercenaries until same hour of the next day.\r\n<p>There are two types of mercenaries which can defend our castle. One is the archer, who can shoot against the enemies trying to destroy the gate. The other is a personal bodyguard to protect you and members of your blood pledge.\r\n<p>I will arrange archers around the castle wall as soon as they are ready, but you have to decide for yourself how many bodyguards will be assigned to you and your members.\r\n<p>Mercenaries will await your orders in the barracks at the south corner of the outer castle. Once you make up your mind, talk to Hunt, the Captain of the mercenary army <var src=\"#0\">. He will assign mercenaries according to your orders.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Please remember that the money to hire mercenaries will come from the taxes gathered from residents of your land.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are already guards posted to maintain justice around the castle, but they are to maintain justice only, and not of use during the war. Considering that there are many small and large conflicts in the estate, we'd better prepare for the worst by hiring trustworthy mercenaries.\r\n<p>Once you tell me the number and type of mercenaries, I'll ask around to gather trustworthy mercenaries until same hour of the next day.\r\n<p>There are two types of mercenaries which can defend our castle. One is the archer, who can shoot against the enemies trying to destroy the gate. The other is a personal bodyguard to protect you and members of your blood pledge.\r\n<p>I will arrange archers around the castle wall as soon as they are ready, but you have to decide for yourself how many bodyguards will be assigned to you and your members.\r\n<p>Mercenaries will await your orders in the barracks at the south corner of the outer castle. Once you make up your mind, talk to Hunt, the Captain of the mercenary army <var src=\"#0\">. He will assign mercenaries according to your orders.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Please remember that the money to hire mercenaries will come from the taxes gathered from residents of your land.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撩縑朝 檜嘐 撩婁 艙雖曖 纂寰擊 嶸雖ж晦 嬪и 唳綠煽菟檜 氈蝗棲棻虜, 檜菟擎 橫蛤梱雖釭 纂寰擊 氬渡ж晦 嬪и 檣溘橾 閨 瞪爵縑 霜蕾瞳戲煎 翕錳ж晦縑朝 鼠葬陛 氈蝗棲棻. 陛嗣檜釭 蹂闈縑朝 觼堅 濛擎 諄遺檜 艙雖 頂縑憮 橾橫釭堅 氈戲棲, 褒溘氈朝 辨煽擊 堅辨ж罹 虜橾曖 餌鷓縑 渠綠ж朝 匙檜 謠擊 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮 盪縑啪 в蹂и 辨煽曖 謙盟諦 熱虜 蜓噪п 輿衛賊, 薯陛 褒溘氈朝 辨煽菟擊 熱模僥п憮 蜓噪ж褐 棻擠陳 偽擎 衛除梱雖朝 в蹂и 熱蒂 賅嬴螃紫煙 ж啊蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<p>盪�� 撩曖 掘褻鼻 в蹂и 辨煽曖 謙盟朝 舒陛雖陛 氈蝗棲棻. и陛雖朝 諼撩漁 嬪縑憮 撩漁擊 だ惚ж溥堅 ж朝 瞳菟擊 唯營ж晦 嬪и 掙煽菟檜堅, 傳 и陛雖朝 霜蕾 艙輿椒檜釭 艙輿椒曖 ⑸裊菟擊 爾��й 瞪癱錳菟殮棲棻.\r\n<p>掙煽曖 唳辦朝 盪縑啪 摹嫦擊 貲ж衛晦虜 ж賊 濠翕瞳戲煎 撩漁縑 寡纂腌棲棻虜, 瞪癱錳曖 唳辦朝 橾欽 堅辨и �� 艙輿椒婁 ⑸裊碟菟縑啪 檜菟擊 賃貲檜釭 寡纂衛鑒 匙檣雖蒂 艙輿椒眷憮 唸薑ж敷撿 м棲棻.\r\n<p>辨煽菟擎 諼撩曖 陴薹 掘戮縑 氈朝 虞餌縑憮 渠晦ж堅 氈蝗棲棻. 辨煽擊 橫飩啪 寡纂й雖蒂 唸薑ж褐 �醴●�, 虞餌 擅縑憮 辨煽欽 <var src=\"#0\">曖 渠濰 �ぢ挪※� 蜓擊 剪衛賊 斜陛 辨煽擊 в蹂и 虜躑 寡纂п 萄萵 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辨煽擊 堅辨ж朝 絲擎 艙饜 輿團菟縑啪憮 務擎 撮旎檜塭朝 薄擊 膩舒縑 舒衛堅, 澀 儅陝п憮 堅辨ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","ishmaelhp6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如同尊貴的您曾做過的一樣，目前有許多團體正在城外企圖奪取這座城堡。所以如果您想要穩坐本城的統治者的位置，您必須密切地地注意他們。\r\n<p>在您接管城堡後，您必須調整課稅，這樣才有足夠的金錢可以維修在戰爭期間被破壞的城堡。一旦資金充裕，您一定要修理內部和外部的門，這樣會使原來的城堡更堅固。您最好僱用一些傭兵，如此一來那些敵人就不能靠近您。\r\n<p>這時，其他血盟將會來向您的權威挑戰。您必須藉由我來設定下一次的圍城時間。在征服城堡之後的半天之內，您能隨意地改變這時間，但半天之後，您就不能再任意地改變時間。如果您一直都沒有設定時間，那時間將會自動地設定約為１２天之後。\r\n<p>一旦圍城開始，您就必須防護城堡直到日落。即使有時候你會暫時失去你的城堡，只要在日落之前把它搶回來，那麼城堡就依然是您的。而在日落之後，您就必須再一次地設定下一次圍城的時間。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>圍城開始後，最好在外城門那裡就可以阻止這些人。外門很堅固強而且有弓箭手會保護大門。但是您也不能總是讓外部的門關著，因為你將不能確定他們一定是來自外面。為了解決這個問題，還有另一個保護措施，那就是固守內門，即使它不如外門那樣堅固。\r\n<p>此外，沒有人能確定他們不會潛入內城之中。所以殿下，請您務必一定要帶著足夠的傭兵當做您的貼身保鑣。\r\n<p>現在失去城堡最主要的條件是，當然啦...那就是遭到敵人的強攻而被消滅。但是那也不是失去城堡的唯一方法。比如說，假如敵人的王族接管了您的王座，您也同樣會失去城堡。\r\n<p>殿下，正如我之前所說的，失敗者的命運是無法想像的。在處理戰爭事件的時候，請一定要小心慎重考慮。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","ishmaelhp6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Just as your highness once did, there are many groups who planning to take over this castle right now. So if you want to remain as the lord of this castle, you will have to take care of them wisely.\r\n<p>Once you take over the castle, you have to adjust the taxes so that there is enough money to maintain the castle, repairing that which is destroyed during the war. And once you have enough money you have to repair the inner and outer gates (thus strengthening the integrity of the castle) you should hire mercenaries so that the enemies cannot come near you.\r\n<p>After taking the castle, other blood pledges will try to challenge your authority. For them, you must set the next war time with me. You can change this time freely before half of the day passes after conquering the castle, but once this time passes, you can't change the time any more. If you don't set the time until then, the time will be set automatically to about 10 days later.\r\n<p>Once the time arrives, you must defend the castle until sunset. Even if you lose your castle temporarily, you just have to get it back before sunset, then the castle is yours. After sunset, you must set the next siege time again.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Once the war starts, it is best to block the entrance into the outer castle. The outer gate is very strong and the archers will defend the gate. But since you can't always leave the outer gate closed, you must not assume that they will always come from the outside. To deal with this case, there is an another protection - the inner gate,  though it is not as sturdy as the outer gate.\r\n<p>Furthermore, no one can make sure that they won't infiltrate into the inner castle. So please my lord, always take enough mercenaries with you as bodyguards.\r\n<p>Now the most important way to avoid losing your castle is by meeting an untimely demise at the hands of enemies. of course. But 'tis not the only way to lose the castle. If the enemy prince takes over your throne, you will lose as well.\r\n<p>If I may say so, the loser's fate is a horrible one, my lord. Please be wise when dealing with affairs of war.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Ishmael:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Just as your highness once did, there are many groups who planning to take over this castle right now. So if you want to remain as the lord of this castle, you will have to take care of them wisely.\r\n<p>Once you take over the castle, you have to adjust the taxes so that there is enough money to maintain the castle, repairing that which is destroyed during the war. And once you have enough money you have to repair the inner and outer gates (thus strengthening the integrity of the castle) you should hire mercenaries so that the enemies cannot come near you.\r\n<p>After taking the castle, other blood pledges will try to challenge your authority. For them, you must set the next war time with me. You can change this time freely before half of the day passes after conquering the castle, but once this time passes, you can't change the time any more. If you don't set the time until then, the time will be set automatically to about 10 days later.\r\n<p>Once the time arrives, you must defend the castle until sunset. Even if you lose your castle temporarily, you just have to get it back before sunset, then the castle is yours. After sunset, you must set the next siege time again.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Once the war starts, it is best to block the entrance into the outer castle. The outer gate is very strong and the archers will defend the gate. But since you can't always leave the outer gate closed, you must not assume that they will always come from the outside. To deal with this case, there is an another protection - the inner gate,  though it is not as sturdy as the outer gate.\r\n<p>Furthermore, no one can make sure that they won't infiltrate into the inner castle. So please my lord, always take enough mercenaries with you as bodyguards.\r\n<p>Now the most important way to avoid losing your castle is by meeting an untimely demise at the hands of enemies. of course. But 'tis not the only way to lose the castle. If the enemy prince takes over your throne, you will lose as well.\r\n<p>If I may say so, the loser's fate is a horrible one, my lord. Please be wise when dealing with affairs of war.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ishmaelhp6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮 檜瞪縑 斜楝ж樟蛭檜, ⑷營 撩 夤縑朝 檜 撩擊 離雖ж罹 掏溘擊 槳縑 厥堅濠 ж朝 鼠葬菟檜 熱橈檜 號蝗棲棻. 瞪ж眷憮 檜 撩曖 撩輿煎 啗衛晦 嬪п憮朝 檜楝и 鼠葬菟曖 嬪⑺縑 ⑷貲ж啪 渠籀ж衛雖 彊戲賊 寰腌棲棻.\r\n<p>撩擊 槳縑 厥戲樟戲賊, 辦摹 撮徽擊 褻薑ж敷憮 瞪爵戲煎 鼠傘霞 撩曖 纂寰擊 夥煎濩擊 濠旎擊 葆溼ж紫煙 ж褊衛螃. 斜葬堅, 濠旎檜 葆溼腎朝 渠煎 瞪ж眷 瞳偃褕擊 ヶ擎 濠菟檜 輿滲縑 橡壁剪葬雖 跤ж紫煙 頂撩僥, 諼撩僥擊 熱葬ж朝 иら 辨煽擊 堅辨ж罹 撩 頂曖 瞪溘擊 鬼�倆狤忠� м棲棻.\r\n<p>撩擊 離雖ж褐 �醴●� 棻艇 ⑸裊菟曖 紫瞪擊 嫡戲衛啪 腌棲棻. 檜楝и ⑸裊菟婁曖 奢撩瞪擎 艙輿椒檜 唸薑ж褐 衛除縑 чп雖啪 腌棲棻. 撩擊 離雖ж衛堅 釭賊 辦摹 盪縑啪 棻擠 奢撩瞪檜 樹薯 纂瘀韓 匙檣雖蒂 蜓噪п 輿衛褫模憮. 檜 衛除擎 撩擊 離雖ж褐 �� 奩釭瞰檜 雖釭晦 瞪梱雖朝 濠嶸照啪 夥紱褒 熱 氈蝗棲棻虜, 檜 晦除檜 雖釭賊 渦檜鼻 夥紱褒 熱 橈蝗棲棻. 虜擒 檜陽梱雖 棻擠 奢撩瞪檜 衛濛腎朝 衛除擊 薑ж衛雖 彊戲賊 翮�� 薑紫 �譟� 奢撩瞪 蝶馨還檜 濠翕瞳戲煎 濩�鱁� 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>奢撩瞪檜 衛濛腎賊 艙輿眷憮朝 斜陳 п陛 韓 陽梱雖 撩擊 餌熱ж敷撿 м棲棻. 虜擒 橾衛瞳戲煎 撩擊 貍憾晦樟棻堅 ж渦塭紫 п陛 雖晦 瞪縑 棻衛 撩擊 驍�納牮霽椓� 檜 撩擎 啗樓 瞪ж曖 匙檜 腌棲棻. 檜溢啪 и廓 奢撩瞪擊 纂瑞堅 釭衛賊 棻衛 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 唸薑ж衛啪 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橾欽 瞪爵檜 衛濛腎賊, 瞳檜 諼撩僥 寰戲煎 菟橫螃雖 跤ж紫煙 盪雖ж朝 匙檜 陛濰 謠蝗棲棻. 諼撩僥擎 唯堅ж貊, 傳 撩漁 嬪縑朝 掙熱蒂 寡纂й 熱 氈戲嘎煎 嬴捱縑啪 觼啪 嶸葬м棲棻. ж雖虜 樹薯釭 撩僥擊 殘嬴場擊 熱朝 橈戲嘎煎 瞳檜 樹薯釭 諼撩僥 夥梨縑憮虜 路溥螃葬塭堅 儅陝ж朝 匙擎 嬪ям棲棻. 檜楝и 唳辦蒂 嬪п 諼撩僥 爾棻朝 ががж雖 彊雖虜 橫繚萇 嬴捱縑啪朝 頂撩僥檜塭朝 薯 2曖 寞漁檜 襄營м棲棻.\r\n<p>啪棻陛 頂撩僥葆盪 給だ腎朝 嬪晦 鼻�窕� 瞰渠煎 螃雖 彊戲葬塭堅朝 援掘紫 濰氬й 熱 橈蝗棲棻. 斜楝嘎煎 瞪ж, 樹薯釭 醱碟и 熱曖 辨煽擊 ��嬪煽戲煎 等葬堅 氈戲衛晦 夥奧棲棻. \r\n<p>撩擊 貍憾晦啪 腎朝 陛濰 醞蹂и 褻勒擎 僭煩 瞪ж眷憮 藹殮濠曖 槳縑...瑰滲擊 渡ж啪 腎衛朝 匙殮棲棻虜, 斜匙檜 嶸橾и 褻勒擎 嬴椎棲棻. 虜擒 瞳捱曖 ⑸裊輿陛 撩曖 諾謝蒂 離雖ж啪 腎賊 斜陽紫 瞪ж朝 瞪爵縑憮 ぬж衛朝 匙檜 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>諼塋脹 蜓殮棲棻虜, ぬ濠曖 譆�譬� 綠霤и 匙殮棲棻. 瞪ж, 睡蛤 ⑷貲ж啪 渠籀ж罹 輿衛褫模憮.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ishmaelhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","itemdesc-c.tbl":"349\r\n9 是漂浮之眼厚厚的殼裡面的嫩肉。吃完後會題高靈敏的能力。通常作為魔法材料。\r\n10 吃了能夠增加飽度。肚子餓時體力無法恢復。\r\n14 恢復一點體力。\r\n15 恢復多一點體力。\r\n16 喝完之後暫時失明。但是也可以保護看到怪物就會危險的地步。\r\n17 一定的時間動作變快。\r\n18 可以製作想要的道具，但有限制。\r\n19 可以叫出怪物。不過不是能叫出所有怪物。\r\n20 被使用者會變成怪物，若跟變身戒指一起用，可以變為你想要的怪物。\r\n21 可召喚雷電攻擊怪物。 \r\n22 可知其他道具的能力。\r\n23 會傳送到任意的場所，若跟瞬間移動的戒指一起用，可以移動到自己想要去的地方。\r\n24 揭開被詛咒的道具和PC。\r\n25 施魔法在武器上,使武器增加攻擊力。\r\n26 施魔法在盔甲上,使盔甲增加防禦力。\r\n27 破壞現在穿著的盔甲。\r\n28 復活人或者怪物。\r\n52 打開魔王洞穴二樓門的鑰匙\r\n64 跟瞬間移動的卷軸一起用的話，可以傳送到之前標記(bookmark)的場所。\r\n65 若跟變身魔仗一起使用，可以變為自己想要的怪物。\r\n68 比一般箭強。有些怪物受到的打擊較大。\r\n86 妖精的特殊食物。是把精靈食物灌入森林的活力做的。吃下去後在一定的時間內，所有的動作變快。這個食物針對妖精才有效果\r\n104 可穿在盔甲裡面。\r\n105 妖精製作的斗篷，精靈穿時體力恢復的變快。\r\n110 穿了後怪物和其他PC看不到。不主動攻擊或行為才會有效果。\r\n111 針對魔法提高抵抗力的斗篷。施魔法時抵抗力更有效。\r\n114 精靈製作的盾牌。對魔法的抵抗力較低。\r\n119 像針對光箭魔法擁有相當高的防禦力。\r\n121 夏落伯的爪子，沒甚麼效果\r\n123 提高力量的特殊長劍。\r\n126 治療所有毒。\r\n130 恢復較多的體力。\r\n139 只有王子和公主能戴。會提高WIS和CHR。道具的擁有者若死亡就會掉在地上。\r\n142 雖然通常沒甚麼威力，但有很低的機率來一次殺死對方。\r\n152 某位伯爵製作的劍。\r\n162 傳送到最近的村莊。\r\n167 提高魔法抵抗力的鏈甲。魔法施的越多魔法抵抗力越高。\r\n229 提高魔法抵抗力的頭盔。魔法施的越多魔法抵抗力越高。\r\n230 攻擊魔法的打擊+1。\r\n231 攻擊魔法的打擊+3。\r\n232 魔法攻擊力+1。\r\n233 魔法額外點數降低，但攻擊力會提昇的武器。\r\n234 魔法抵抗力提昇一點點。\r\n235 無論是何時狀況都不會損壞的特殊劍。\r\n237 是跟鄰居互相交換的禮物。從很久以前開始有的習俗。\r\n238 跟身邊的自己的盟員一起傳送到任意的場所。跟瞬間移動的戒指一起使用可以傳送到自己想要去的地方。\r\n248 安特的樹枝，含有治療所有毒的成分。\r\n249 是蘑菇汁。可當在各魔法或毒性之原料。\r\n250 歐吉的血。是歐吉的力量之源。\r\n256 精靈女皇製作的高貴金屬。使用與損壞的武器上可減少損壞程度。\r\n261 精靈之翅膀。可以傳送到最近的村莊。\r\n262 召喚怪物的魔法笛子。 \r\n275 古代精靈族的頭盔。敏捷加一。\r\n276 能刺在盔甲的縫隙，比其他劍命中率高。\r\n279 安特的果實。吃完後體力恢復的很多。\r\n280 含歐吉的血的手套。會增加力量。\r\n282 是都佩傑諾的項鍊。 \r\n284 由精靈族最高長者'森林之母'賦予的精靈族之劍。\r\n285 由精靈族最高長者'森林之母'賦予提高敏捷的精靈族之劍。\r\n286 由精靈族最高長者'森林之母'賦予提高魔法的精靈族之劍。\r\n289 提高魔法抵抗力之盾牌。 \r\n291 使騎士可使用治療魔法之特殊頭盔。使用此頭盔耗花的魔力省一半。\r\n292 使騎士能使用迅速魔法之特殊頭盔。使用此頭盔耗花的魔力省一半。\r\n293 使騎士能使用力量魔法之特殊頭盔。使用此頭盔耗花的魔力省一半。\r\n294 能解決修練時的問答問題的提示。\r\n295 普通鑰匙。要進去修練洞穴的浪人房間時使用。\r\n296 在一定的時間動作比綠色藥水還快。但只有騎士才會有效果。\r\n297 集中力提高，比平常使用魔法還更有效果。只有魔法時才會有效果。\r\n299 可以變為怪物的卷軸。持續時間為20~30分鐘的時間而已。\r\n300 將對像強制移動到任意場所之魔仗。\r\n301 將對像強制移動到任意場所之魔仗。\r\n302 在一定的時間讓對像無法談話的魔仗。\r\n303 在一定的時間讓對像呈睡眠狀態的魔仗。被睡眠的使用者過一段時間或被攻擊時才會恢復正常。\r\n304 裝備的話在黑暗的地方也可以看到事物。\r\n305 可防禦全身的盾牌。針對飛過來的武器具有強大的防禦力。但需要用雙手，而無法攜帶武器。\r\n306 提昇力量(Strength) 1的項鍊。\r\n307 提昇敏捷(Dexterity) 1的項鍊。\r\n308 提昇體力(Constitution) 1的項鍊。\r\n309 提昇知識(Intelligence) 1的項鍊。\r\n310 提昇智慧(Wisdom) 1的項鍊。\r\n311 提昇魅力(Charisma) 1的項鍊。\r\n314 提昇體力20點的項鍊.\r\n342 攻擊對方時，漸漸奪取對方魔力的魔杖.\r\n343 哨子，吹了能夠召集自己的寵物。\r\n345 史巴扥的骨骸.\r\n346 由精靈族最高長者'森林之母'賦予'賦予提昇生命力的精靈族之劍.\r\n347 由精靈族最高長者'森林之母'賦予提昇敏捷力的精靈族之弓.\r\n348 能夠恢復武器損害的道具.\r\n","ItemDesc-e.tbl":"349\r\n9 Tender meat inside the tough hide of floating eye. It is usually used as a spell component and has    the power to enhance the consumer's senses.\r\n10 Sates your hunger. Healing doesn't occur when you are hungry.\r\n14 Heals the imbiber's wounds slightly.\r\n15 Cures a fair amount of the wounds of the imbiber.\r\n16 Blinds the imbiber, but protects the imbiber from all kinds of gazing attacks.\r\n17 Makes the imbiber move and attack faster for a while.\r\n18 Conjures up an item when used, but the number of uses is limited.\r\n19 Creates random monster(s), though some monsters can't be created by this wand.\r\n20 Polymorphs the user to a random monster. User can choose the monster if wearing \"ring of polymorph   control\".\r\n21 Attacks one enemy by calling lightning.\r\n22 Identifies the abilities of an item.\r\n23 Teleports the user to a random location. User can choose the location if wearing \"ring of teleport   control\".\r\n24 Removes curse from an item or another player.\r\n25 Enchants a weapon, thus making the weapon stronger.\r\n26 Enchants a piece of body armor, thus making the armor stronger.\r\n27 Destroys the currently worn armor.\r\n28 Resurrects a dead monster or another player.\r\n52 The key to the \"cavern of the demon\" on the second floor of the 說語島 dungeon.\r\n64 Gives the wearer the ability to choose the target location of teleportation when used with a \"scroll of teleportation\".\r\n65 Gives the wearer the ability to choose the monster when used with a \"wand of polymorph\"\r\n68 Stronger arrow than normal arrows. Also, some monsters are particularly vulnerable to silver arrows.\r\n104 Shirt made of pelts which can be worn underneath armor.\r\n105 Cloak made by elves which boosts elven healing ability.\r\n110 Renders the wearer invisible. This effect is broken if the wearer attacks or is attacked.\r\n111 Raises the wearer's magic resistance.\r\n114 Shield made by elves, which also has the power to resist magic.\r\n119 Shield with a mirror-like surface which can reflect gaze attacks.\r\n121 Nail of shelob. A trophy of slaying a shelob with no special powers.\r\n123 Special long sword, which raises the strength of wearer.\r\n126 Removes all poisons from the imbiber.\r\n130 Cures a significant amount of wounds affecting the imbiber.\r\n139 A crown forged for nobility. Only a prince or princess can equip this, and it increases the WIS and CHR of the wearer, and shares the fate of the owner.\r\n142 Normally an insignificant dagger. but this is embedded by a curse which has a small chance of       killing your opponent instantly.\r\n154 Unique sword made for Lord Porche.\r\n162 Teleports user to the nearest town.\r\n167 Chain mail that raises the wearer's magic resistance.\r\n229 Helmet that raises the wearer's magic resistance. Enchanting the help will further raise magic      resistance.\r\n230 Gives a +1 bonus to attack spells.\r\n231 Gives a +3 bonus to attack spells.\r\n232 Increases spell power by +1.\r\n233 Increases strength, but at the sacrifice of spell power.\r\n234 Increases Magic Resistance(MR) slightly.\r\n235 か熱ж啪 薯溼腎橫 頂掘溘檜 斛紫煎 鬼�音� 匐殮棲棻.\r\n237 The present shared with neighbors according to the old custom to celebrate the biggest holiday in Eden \"Birthday of Einhasad\". There is a saying that well-behaved people can get a present from the great God himself.\r\n238 Teleports you and your pledge members around you to the random location. User can choose the location if wearing a \"ring of teleport control\".\r\n248 Twig of Ent who is one of the guardians of Elven Forest. It has a healing property and works on all kind of poisons.\r\n249 The juice from the bag of fungus. Used as an ingredient for spell or poison.\r\n250 Blood of Ogre which is known as the source of Ogre's power.\r\n256 Precious metal made by Fairy Queen. If used on the damaged items, reduces the erosion level with certain probability.\r\n261 The purified wings of fairy. Teleports the user to the nearest town.\r\n262 Magical flute which summons the monsters.\r\n275 The helm named after the ancient elven hero. Increases the dexterity by +1.\r\n276 The sword which can pierce seams of the armor. Boasts more accuracy than other swords.\r\n279 Fruit of Ent who is one of the guardians of Elven Forest. Increases the hit point greatly.\r\n280 The glove made with the Ogre's blood. Increases strength when worn.\r\n282 The necklace of Dupelgenon the wandering wizard.\r\n284 Elven sword imbued with the magic resistance by the \"Mother of the forest and elves\" who is the highest authority in the Elven Forest.\r\n285 Elven sword imbued with the dexterity by the \"Mother of the forest and elves\" who is the highest authority in the Elven Forest.\r\n286 Elven sword imbued with the spell power by the \"Mother of the forest and elves\" who is the highest authority in the Elven Forest.\r\n289 The shield imbued with magic that raises the magic resistance(MR).\r\n291 The helmet that enables knights to use healing spells. It costs half the normal MP to cast these spells.\r\n292 The helmet that enables knights to use speed-enhancement spells. It costs half the normal MP to cast these spells.\r\n293 The helmet that enables knights to use strength and power related spells. It costs half the normal MP to cast these spells.\r\n294 The scroll containing the hint for the quest in the Gerard's training dungeon.\r\n295 Normal key. This can be used to enter the werewolf's room in the training dungeon of Gerard of the \"House of Silver Knights\"\r\n296 The potion that draws the courage from the deep inside and makes you act faster. This is effective only on knights.\r\n297 The potion that stills your heart and makes spell more effective. This potion is effective only on wizards.\r\n299 The scroll that enables you to polymorph into the monster you name. But the duration is shorter than the wands charges.\r\n300 Banishes the target to the random location.\r\n301 Teleports the target to the random location in the screen.\r\n302 Silences the target for a while.\r\n303 The wand that makes the target asleep. The sleeping target will wake up if certain time elapses or is attacked.\r\n304 Gives the infravision to the wearer.\r\n305 The large shield that protects the whole body. It is most effective against the missile weapons. But you need two hands to equip it and thus can't use weapons while wearing it.\r\n306 Raises the strength by 1.\r\n307 Raises the dexterity by 1.\r\n308 Raises the constitution by 1.\r\n309 Raises the intelligence by 1.\r\n310 Raises the wisdom by 1.\r\n311 Raises the charisma by 1.\r\n314 Raises the maximum HP by 20.\r\n342 Steals the target's MP when the attack is successful.\r\n343 The whistle that can be used to call the tamed animals.\r\n345 Bone parts from the spartoi.\r\n346 Elven sword imbued with the life energy by the \"Mother of the forest and elves\" who is the highest authority in the Elven Forest. It raises the wielder's HP.\r\n347 Elven bow imbued with the dexterity by the \"Mother of the forest and elves\" who is the highest authority in the Elven Forest.\r\n348 The item that can repair the eroded weapons.\r\n","ItemDesc-j.tbl":"349\r\n9 Tender meat inside the tough hide of floating eye. It is usually used as a spell component and has    the power to enhance the consumer's senses.\r\n10 Sates your hunger. Healing doesn't occur when you are hungry.\r\n14 Heals the imbiber's wounds slightly.\r\n15 Cures a fair amount of the wounds of the imbiber.\r\n16 Blinds the imbiber, but protects the imbiber from all kinds of gazing attacks.\r\n17 Makes the imbiber move and attack faster for a while.\r\n18 Conjures up an item when used, but the number of uses is limited.\r\n19 Creates random monster(s), though some monsters can't be created by this wand.\r\n20 Polymorphs the user to a random monster. User can choose the monster if wearing \"ring of polymorph   control\".\r\n21 Attacks one enemy by calling lightning.\r\n22 Identifies the abilities of an item.\r\n23 Teleports the user to a random location. User can choose the location if wearing \"ring of teleport   control\".\r\n24 Removes curse from an item or another player.\r\n25 Enchants a weapon, thus making the weapon stronger.\r\n26 Enchants a piece of body armor, thus making the armor stronger.\r\n27 Destroys the currently worn armor.\r\n28 Resurrects a dead monster or another player.\r\n52 The key to the \"cavern of the demon\" on the second floor of the 說語島 dungeon.\r\n64 Gives the wearer the ability to choose the target location of teleportation when used with a \"scroll of teleportation\".\r\n65 Gives the wearer the ability to choose the monster when used with a \"wand of polymorph\"\r\n68 Stronger arrow than normal arrows. Also, some monsters are particularly vulnerable to silver arrows.\r\n104 Shirt made of pelts which can be worn underneath armor.\r\n105 Cloak made by elves which boosts elven healing ability.\r\n110 Renders the wearer invisible. This effect is broken if the wearer attacks or is attacked.\r\n111 Raises the wearer's magic resistance.\r\n114 Shield made by elves, which also has the power to resist magic.\r\n119 Shield with a mirror-like surface which can reflect gaze attacks.\r\n121 Nail of shelob. A trophy of slaying a shelob with no special powers.\r\n123 Special long sword, which raises the strength of wearer.\r\n126 Removes all poisons from the imbiber.\r\n130 Cures a significant amount of wounds affecting the imbiber.\r\n139 A crown forged for nobility. Only a prince or princess can equip this, and it increases the WIS and CHR of the wearer, and shares the fate of the owner.\r\n142 Normally an insignificant dagger. but this is embedded by a curse which has a small chance of       killing your opponent instantly.\r\n154 Unique sword made for Lord Porche.\r\n162 Teleports user to the nearest town.\r\n167 Chain mail that raises the wearer's magic resistance.\r\n229 Helmet that raises the wearer's magic resistance. Enchanting the help will further raise magic      resistance.\r\n230 Gives a +1 bonus to attack spells.\r\n231 Gives a +3 bonus to attack spells.\r\n232 Increases spell power by +1.\r\n233 Increases strength, but at the sacrifice of spell power.\r\n234 Increases Magic Resistance(MR) slightly.\r\n235 か熱ж啪 薯溼腎橫 頂掘溘檜 斛紫煎 鬼�音� 匐殮棲棻.\r\n237 The present shared with neighbors according to the old custom to celebrate the biggest holiday in Eden \"Birthday of Einhasad\". There is a saying that well-behaved people can get a present from the great God himself.\r\n238 Teleports you and your pledge members around you to the random location. User can choose the location if wearing a \"ring of teleport control\".\r\n248 Twig of Ent who is one of the guardians of Elven Forest. It has a healing property and works on all kind of poisons.\r\n249 The juice from the bag of fungus. Used as an ingredient for spell or poison.\r\n250 Blood of Ogre which is known as the source of Ogre's power.\r\n256 Precious metal made by Fairy Queen. If used on the damaged items, reduces the erosion level with certain probability.\r\n261 The purified wings of fairy. Teleports the user to the nearest town.\r\n262 Magical flute which summons the monsters.\r\n275 The helm named after the ancient elven hero. Increases the dexterity by +1.\r\n276 The sword which can pierce seams of the armor. Boasts more accuracy than other swords.\r\n279 Fruit of Ent who is one of the guardians of Elven Forest. Increases the hit point greatly.\r\n280 The glove made with the Ogre's blood. Increases strength when worn.\r\n282 The necklace of Dupelgenon the wandering wizard.\r\n284 Elven sword imbued with the magic resistance by the \"Mother of the forest and elves\" who is the highest authority in the Elven Forest.\r\n285 Elven sword imbued