嬴 橾薑 衛除翕寰 瞪癱衛 爾棻 緒腦啪 遺霜檜啪 腌棲棻. 檜 僭擒擎 晦餌縑啪虜 �膩�陛 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n297 葆衛賊 葆擠檜 濤濤п雖貊 餵醞溘檜 堪嬴螳 葆徹擊 餌辨й 陽 爾棻 贖 �膩�陛 釭紫煙 п 鄹衛棻. 檜 僭擒擎 葆徹餌縑啪虜 �膩�陛 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n299 濠褐檜 錳ж朝 跨蝶攪煎 滲褐й 熱 氈紫煙 п輿朝 輿僥憮殮棲棻. 欽 滲褐 雖樓 衛除擎 20~30碟縑 碳婁м棲棻.\r\n300 渠鼻擊 и �飛� 夤曖 歜曖曖 濰模煎 鬼薯 檜翕衛鑒 熱 氈朝 虞渠殮棲棻.\r\n301 渠鼻擊 и �飛� 寰縑憮 歜曖曖 濰模煎 鬼薯 檜翕衛鑒 熱 氈朝 虞渠殮棲棻.\r\n302 渠鼻檣 餌辨濠陛 橾薑 衛除翕寰 瓣た擊 й 熱 橈紫煙 虜萄朝 虞渠殮棲棻.\r\n303 渠鼻擊 橾薑 衛除 sleep鼻鷓煎 虜萄朝 虞渠殮棲棻. sleep鼻鷓陛 脹 餌辨濠朝 衛除檜 �撣ㄟ鑒� 奢問擊 嫡戲賊 sleep鼻鷓縑憮 慇橫陶棲棻.\r\n304 濰雜ж賊 惜錳檜 橈橫紫 橫菸 樓縑憮 餌僭擊 獐 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n305 螞 跺擊 棻 寞橫й 熱 氈朝 醴棻塢 寞ぬ. 陳嬴螃朝 鼠晦縑 渠п 鬼и 寞橫溘擊 陛雖堅 氈蝗棲棻. 渠褐 曄槳戲煎 菟橫撿 ж晦 陽僥縑 鼠晦蒂 菟 熱 橈蝗棲棻.\r\n306 ��(Strength)擊 1 螢溥 輿朝 跡勘檜殮棲棻.\r\n307 團繪撩(Dexterity)擊 1 螢溥 輿朝 跡勘檜殮棲棻.\r\n308 羹溘(Constitution)擊 1 螢溥 輿朝 跡勘檜殮棲棻.\r\n309 雖衝(Intelligence)擊 1 螢溥 輿朝 跡勘檜殮棲棻.\r\n310 雖��(Wisdom)蒂 1 螢溥 輿朝 跡勘檜殮棲棻.\r\n311 衙溘(Charisma)擊 1 螢溥 輿朝 跡勘檜殮棲棻.\r\n314 譆渠 HP蒂 20 螢溥 輿朝 跡勘檜殮棲棻.\r\n342 渠鼻擊 陽萵 陽葆棻 MP蒂 褻旎噶 趙橫螃朝 雖な檜殮棲棻.\r\n343 碳賊 纔檜墅 脹 偃蒂 濠褐曖 輿嬪煎 碳楝 賅戲朝 �ㄦ蝬饃熏埭炴�.\r\n345 蝶だ饜檜曖 鄙 褻陝殮棲棻.\r\n346 蹂薑曖 膛曖 譆堅 濰煎檣 '膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲'縑 曖п 儅貲溘 щ鼻 棟溘檜 睡罹脹 蹂薑褶 匐殮棲棻.\r\n347 蹂薑曖 膛曖 譆堅 濰煎檣 '膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲'縑 曖п 團繪紫 щ鼻 棟溘檜 睡罹脹 蹂薑褶 �偯埭炴�.\r\n348 鼠晦曖 槳鼻紫蒂 �蛹厭藷偌� 嬴檜蠱殮棲棻.\r\n","jack1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑克:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n你是甚麼人？還不趕快讓路！\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","jack1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jack :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nWho are you? Get out of my way!\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","jack1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jack :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nWho are you? Get out of my way!\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","jack1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>燮 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n凳撿? 啻喫擎. 說葬 望擊 綠酈雖 跤п!\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","jackson-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑克森：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>請你隨便看看，有些有，有些沒有！妖魔類的物品我用低價向你買進。快拿出來給我看！</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n</body>","jackson-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jackson:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Come, come, I've got everything here. Feel free to choose! I'm also buying orcish goods...show me anything you have!!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n<a action=\"jackson1\">Argue about the prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","jackson-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jackson:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Come, come, I've got everything here. Feel free to choose! I'm also buying orcish goods...show me anything you have!!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n<a action=\"jackson1\">Argue about the prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","jackson-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>燮蝦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠濠 氈朝 勒 氈堅 橈朝 勒 橈港棲棻. 蜀渠煎 埤塭 爾撮蹂! 螃觼褶 瞪葬ヶ紫 諄啪 餌菟殮棲棻. 頂場嬴菟 爾撮蹂!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n<a action=\"jackson1\">陛問縑 渠п 評霞棻.</a>\r\n</body>","jackson1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑克森：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你！現在看不到我在路上買東西嗎？如果萊拉大人知道我對付像你長的這麼邪惡的人，我就沒面子去見大人了。</p>\r\n<p>趕快給我滾。</p>\r\n</body>","jackson1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jackson:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you saying that the prices here are expensive? Look, I brought all these goods from Gludio. Why would I do that if I can't leave some margin? Even then my profit is whittled to nothing because the tax rate of Gludio is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>... If you want to argue, go to Kent Castle and kill the prince there!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","jackson1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jackson:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you saying that the prices here are expensive? Look, I brought all these goods from Gludio. Why would I do that if I can't leave some margin? Even then my profit is whittled to nothing because the tax rate of Gludio is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>... If you want to argue, go to Kent Castle and kill the prince there!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","jackson1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>燮蝦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>凳塭堅? 陛問檜 綠諄棻掘? 檜爾蓬, 旋瑞蛤螃縑憮 罹晦梱雖 僭勒擊 陛螳諮戲棲 覬 渦 嫡嬴撿 釭紫 詳堅 髦雖. 斜溢雖 彊嬴紫 旋瑞蛤螃 撮徽檜 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>釭 п憮 檜彌紫 滌煎 寰釭朝等.. 評雖溥賊 騰お撩 艙輿縑啪 評雖蓬.</p>\r\n</body>","jaint1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>杰特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我是這裡的武器商店的主人。所以在這裡的那些武器都是好的喔！哈哈！當然啦，誰的商店不是那樣？\r\n<p>什麼？所以為什麼我在這裡而不去看店？那就要感謝她啦，因為<a link=\"jaint2\">凱蒂</a>現在正在照顧商店，而且生意也很好。所以我就能旅行整個世界，找一些特別的武器和盔甲。所以說我是一個非常幸運的男人。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","jaint1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jaint:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The weapons are good here? Ha! Of course, whose shop is that? Mine!\r\n<p>So why am I here without attending my shop? That's because <a link=\"jaint2\">Catty</a> is taking very good care of the business. Thanks to her, I can travel around the world looking for the unusual weapons and armor.\r\n</body>\r\n","jaint1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jaint:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The weapons are good here? Ha! Of course, whose shop is that? Mine!\r\n<p>So why am I here without attending my shop? That's because <a link=\"jaint2\">Catty</a> is taking very good care of the business. Thanks to her, I can travel around the world looking for the unusual weapons and armor.\r\n</body>\r\n","jaint1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>薯檣お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹晦 鼠晦 鼻薄曖 鼠晦菟檜 謠棻堅? жж! 斜歲, 斜啪 援掘 陛啪檣等. 頂陛 夥煎 檜夠 鼠晦鼻 輿檣檜塭堅. \r\n<p>擬? 謁 斜歲 陛啪蒂 雖酈雖 彊堅 罹晦憮 檜楝堅 氈傍堅? 斜剪撿~ 錶釩 <a link=\"jaint2\">馨じ</a>陛 陛啪蒂 澀 瑭 輿棲梱 斜溢雖. 湯碟縑 釭朝 陛啪橾縑朝 褐唳 寰噙堅 渠睛 罹晦 盪晦蒂 瓊嬴棻棲賊憮 褐晦и 棟溘檜 氈朝 鼠晦釭 寞橫掘蒂 掘唳ж楝 棻棍 熱 氈欽 蜓噪檜撿.\r\n</body>","jaint2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>杰特：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>她是道具店的老闆古魯門的第二個女兒。如你所知，現在她的女兒露西正在店裡。那些女孩們看起雖然長得相似，但是她們的個性都不一樣。凱蒂的個性率直，而且向來喜歡聽騎士的故事。但是露西就太害羞了，我常常不知道她正在想什麼呢。\r\n<p>現在她們也都已經到了適婚年齡了，是該找個好男人的時候...\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","jaint2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jaint:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>She is the second daughter of Gruman, the owner of the item shop. As you know, her daughter Luth is taking care of the business right now. Those girls look almost identical, but they have rather different personalities - Catty is outright and used to enjoy hearing stories of knights, but Luth was too timid.\r\n<p>Now that they are of marriageable age, it's time to look a for good man....\r\n</body>\r\n","jaint2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jaint:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>She is the second daughter of Gruman, the owner of the item shop. As you know, her daughter Luth is taking care of the business right now. Those girls look almost identical, but they have rather different personalities - Catty is outright and used to enjoy hearing stories of knights, but Luth was too timid.\r\n<p>Now that they are of marriageable age, it's time to look a for good man....\r\n</body>\r\n","jaint2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>薯檣お:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濩�香� ж朝 斜瑞虜噢啻 萃簞 詁檜雖. 斜擁 樹棲 - 當檜塭堅 - 朝 嬴幗雖 渠褐 濩�香騔� 爾堅 氈濫模. 斜 嬴檜菟 儅曹勒 綠蝌и等 撩問擎 艙 殖塭憮 蜓檜撿. 馨じ朝 �偌痯炾�, 傳 橫溥憮睡攪 頂陛 п輿朝 晦餌 檜撿晦偽擎勘 霤 謠嬴ц雖. ж雖虜 當擎 蜓熱紫 瞳堅, 劂 儅陝ж朝雖 澀 賅腦啊朝 嬴檜歷棻啻.\r\n<p>檜薇 萃 棻 釭檜紫 離堅 ц戲棲 唸�母� п撿й蘸等...\r\n</body>","james1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>詹姆士:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你聽過嗎？用<a link=\"james2\">銀來製作的武器</a>，具有神秘的力量。狼人和不死系的怪物都很怕銀的力量。 \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","james1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>James :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"james2\">Silver Weapons...</a>Have you heard of them before? Silver Weapons have special powers. Undead monsters and werewolves fear the special power from silver weapons. \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","james1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>James :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"james2\">Silver Weapons...</a>Have you heard of them before? Silver Weapons have special powers. Undead monsters and werewolves fear this special power from silver weapons. \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","james1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>薯歜蝶 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"james2\">擎薯 鼠晦</a>縑 渠п 菟橫爾樟模? 擎戲煎 虜萇 鼠晦朝 褐綠и ��擊 雖棋棻螃. 樹等萄 跨蝶攪釭 期渠檣除菟擎 檜 擎曖 ��擊 舒溥錶ж雖. \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","james2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>詹姆士 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>銀製的武器有較具代表性的有<font fg=ffffff>銀箭</font>、<font fg=ffffff>銀長劍</font>、<font fg=ffffff>銀劍</font>、<font fg=ffffff>銀斧</font>。用米索莉或奧里哈魯根來製作的武器，會有同樣的效果，用<font fg=ffffff>十字弓</font>攻擊狼人或不死系的怪物，也有很好的效果。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","james2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>James :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Most famous silver weapons are... <font fg=ffffff>Silver Arrows</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Silver Long Sword</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Silver Sword</font>, <font fg=ffffff>and Silver Axe.</font> Weapons made out of mithril and oriharaukon have these special powers, so <font fg=ffffff>Rapiers</font>are also useful against undead monsters.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","james2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>James :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Most famous silver weapons are... <font fg=ffffff>Silver Arrows</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Silver Long Sword</font>, <font fg=ffffff>Silver Sword</font>, <font fg=ffffff>and Silver Axe.</font> Weapons made out of mithril and oriharaukon have these special powers, so <font fg=ffffff>Rapiers</font>are also useful against undead monsters.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","james2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>薯歜蝶 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渠ル瞳檣 擎薯 鼠晦煎朝 <font fg=ffffff>擎�香�</font>, <font fg=ffffff>擎濰匐</font>, <font fg=ffffff>擎匐</font>, <font fg=ffffff>擎紫郭</font>陛 氈棻螃. 嘐蝶萵檜釭 螃葬ж瑞夔戲煎 虜萇 鼠晦菟紫 偽擎 �膩�蒂 雖棲晦 陽僥縑 <font fg=ffffff>溯檜Я橫</font>紫 期渠檣除檜釭 樹等萄縑啪 餌辨ж賊 �膩�瞳檜塭啻.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","jason1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑森:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哎∼最近我的斧頭是怎麼了？看來需要拜託海克特修理... \r\n啊？您有甚麼事嗎？\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">賣木頭</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"jason3\">製作木材</a>  </P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","jason1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jason the Wood Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Gosh, My axe has become dull these days... I think I should get it sharpened by Hector the blacksmith... Huh? What did you want?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">Sell Wood</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"jason3\">Make Lumber</a>  </P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","jason1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jason the Wood Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Gosh, My axe has become dull these days... I think I should get it sharpened by Hector the blacksmith... Huh? What did you want?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">Sell Wood</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"jason3\">Make Lumber</a>  </P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","jason1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭鼠鼻檣 薯檜蝦 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>薇濰, 蹂億 紫郭陛 號檜 鼠筑螺橫... 渠濰濰檜 ⑤攪縑啪 檜撿晦п憮 熱摹擊 爾湍陛 п撿雖... 擬? 檜瑭 鼠蝦橾檜雖?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">釭鼠蒂 っ棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"jason3\">跡營蒂 虜萇棻</a>  </P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","jason2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑森:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>幹嘛？要找我麻煩啊？\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","jason2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jason the Wood Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? Want to take this outside?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","jason2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jason the Wood Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? Want to take this outside?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","jason2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭鼠鼻檣 薯檜蝦 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>凳撿? и っ п獐纔撿?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","jason3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑森:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>用一個普通原木，可以製成四塊木材。\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"request timber\">切割木材</a></p>\r\n","jason3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jason the Wood Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Usually you get 4 lumbers for every log of wood.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"request timber\">Trim Lumber</a></p>","jason3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jason the Wood Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Usually you get 4 lumbers for every log of wood.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"request timber\">Trim Lumber</a></p>","jason3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭鼠鼻檣 薯檜蝦 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>爾鱔 鱔釭鼠 ж釭煎 啻 褻陝 薑紫曖 跡營蒂 虜菟橫 鳥 熱 氈雖.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"request timber\">跡營煎 棻蛟朝棻</a></p>","jenny1-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>珍妮:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n獵人戴瑞克的弓真是引人注目。雖然威力稍微弱一點，不過很容易瞄準目標。像我這種人也容易射中目標呢。\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","jenny1-e.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jenny :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nDerek the hunter makes great Bows. It may lack a bit in power but it is easy to target. Even people like me can hit the target I want.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","jenny1-j.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jenny :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nDerek the hunter makes great Bows. It may lack a bit in power but it is easy to target. Even people like me can hit the target I want.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","jenny1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>薯棲 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n餌傖羞 等滓檜 虜萇 �偯� 薑蜓 橾ヶ檜雖蹂. 嬪溘擎 褻旎 擒ж雖虜 薑蜓 褻遽ж晦陛 蔣啪 虜菟橫螳 氈剪萇蹂. 盪偽擎 餌塋紫 蔣啪 跡ル僭縑 貲醞擊 衛鑒 薑紫塭棲梱蹂.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","jessy1-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>傑西 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>你有沒有吃過冠石的美食水果餅？把各種水果放在麵包上，然後烤出來的樣子，真是讓人垂涎三尺。吃一口就會覺得你是世界上最幸福的人。有機會去試試看吧，在小吃店有賣。\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","jessy1-e.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jessy :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>Have you ever tried the famous pancakes from Giran? They're baked with bread and fruits on top and taste great! Once you try them you can't explain this great sensation. You should go try them out at the grocery store.\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","jessy1-j.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jessy :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>Have you ever tried the famous pancakes from Giran? They're baked with bread and fruits on top and taste great! Once you try them you can't explain this great sensation. You should go try them out at the grocery store.\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","jessy1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>薯衛 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>晦塢曖 貲僭 の馨櫛擊 萄敷爾樟釭蹂? 陝謙 婁橾擊 誧嬪縑 橄橫 掘遴 匙檣等, 薑蜓 蛻檜 橾ヶ檜轄. 殮寰縑 厥朝 牖除 檜瑞 蜓й 熱 橈朝 ч犒檜 塵溥螞港棲棻. 衝猿ヶ 陛啪縑憮 つ堅 氈擊纔棲 樹薯 и廓 餌詳橫 爾撮蹂.\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","Joel1-c.HTML":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>喬治：</p></font>\r\n<br><p>我利用骨頭可製造許多物品。您要製造甚麼東西呢？</p>  \r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">販賣骨頭塊</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"lien3\">製造骷髏頭盔</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"lien4\">製造骷髏盔甲</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"lien5\">製造骷髏盾牌</a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","Joel2-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>喬治：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 一塊骨頭塊我出10枚金幣買，要賣嗎？</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request adena10\">販賣骨頭塊</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Joel3-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>喬治：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 若想製造骷髏頭盔，需要皮頭盔與10塊骨頭塊。還需要付手工費800塊金幣。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request skull helmet\">製造骷髏頭盔</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Joel4-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>喬治：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 若要製造骷髏盔甲，需要硬皮背心和20塊骨頭塊作為材料。還需要付手工費500塊金幣。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request bone armor\">製造骷髏盔甲</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Joel5-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>喬治：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 若要製造骨頭盾牌，需要銀丁皮盾和15塊骨頭塊作為材料。還需要付手工費金幣800元。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request bone shield\">製造骨頭盾牌</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","JoelC1-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>喬治：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我不會幫邪惡的人製造物品。</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","johnson1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>詹森：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你對自己的動物是有責任的。\r\n<p>但是，如果有什麼事發生，你也可以把他們以<var src=\"#0\">金幣的價錢托付給我。\r\n<p>啊，當然我只能帶走你自己訓練的動物。我不會帶走被施與魔法的怪物。它們太危險了。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\">託管動物</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\">帶走動物</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">如何馴服野性的動物</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","johnson1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Johnson:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are responsible for your own pets.\r\n<p>But, if something comes up, you can store them with me at only <var src=\"#0\"> adena per pet.\r\n<p>Of course, I can only take animals you trained yourself. I won't take enchanted monsters - especially after hearing about that bugbear incident.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Store Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Johnson:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are responsible for your own pets.\r\n<p>But, if something comes up, you can store them with me at only <var src=\"#0\"> adena per pet.\r\n<p>Of course, I can only take animals you trained yourself. I won't take enchanted monsters - especially after hearing about that bugbear incident.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Store Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>襄蝦:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠晦陛 望菟檣 翕僭擎 部梱雖 疇歜擊 雖堅 爾�ㄧ� п撿雖.\r\n<p>凳, ж雖虜 薑 橫聶 熱 橈朝 橾檜 儅啣擊 陽朝 釭и纔 蜃晦紫煙 ж衛螃, и葆葬渡 <var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭縑 蜆嬴輿雖.\r\n<p>嬴, 僭煩 頂陛 蜆朝 匙擎 渡褐檜 霜蕾 望菟檣 翕僭 閨檜螃. 橫蛤憮 葆徹戲煎 �次� 跨蝶攪 評嬪朝 蜆雖 彊啊棻堅.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> 翕僭擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> 翕僭擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>詹森：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哦，請等一下下。我完成這個之後馬上過去。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">如何馴服動物</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","johnson2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Johnson:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, just a moment - I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Johnson:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, just a moment - I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>襄蝦:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴, 褻旎虜 晦棻溥蹂. 檜 橾虜 部頂堅 埠 陛葬棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>詹森：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>咿？你沒有托管過你的寵物？\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">問養寵物的問題</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Johnson:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You never trusted any animals with me!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Johnson:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You never trusted any animals with me!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>襄蝦:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橡溯? 渡褐擎 翕僭擊 蜆曹 瞳檜 橈朝等蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>詹森：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>什麼？你的動物在哪裡？\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">問有關馴服動物</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","johnson4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Johnson:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? Where are your animals?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Johnson:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? Where are your animals?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","johnson4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>襄蝦:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橡溯? 蜆望 翕僭紫 橈戲賊憮 劂 蜆曹棻朝 剪蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","judice1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>茱迪思：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>說到潘朵拉，讓我一個女人說這個話很怪，但是她真的是很漂亮。我希望她不要把好的裝備都自己收藏起來就好了。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","judice1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Judice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Speaking of Pandora...it's odd for someone like me to say such a thing, but isn't she very beautiful? I wish she would sell her accessories instead of keeping them for herself!\r\n</body>\r\n","judice1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Judice:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Speaking of Pandora...it's odd for someone like me to say such a thing, but isn't she very beautiful? I wish she would sell her accessories instead of keeping them for herself!\r\n</body>\r\n","judice1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>鍬蛤蝶:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>っ紫塭 蜓檣等...罹濠檣 頂陛 蜓ж朝 匙紫 覬 檜鼻ж雖虜, 霤 嘐檣檜轄? 斜 餌塋檜 陛雖堅 氈朝 濰褐掘 偽擎 剪 濠晦虜 ж堅 氈雖 蜓堅 棻艇 餌塋и纔紫 覬 つ賊 謠擊蘸等...\r\n</body>","Julie1-c.HTML":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br><p>購買各種動物皮革。若給我錢，也可幫你利用皮革製作物品。</p>  \r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">販賣皮革</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar3\">製造高級皮</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar4\">製造皮帽子</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar5\">製造皮涼鞋</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar6\">製造皮背心</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar7\">製造皮盾牌</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar8\">製造皮長靴</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar9\">製造皮頭盔</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar10\">製造硬皮背心</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar11\">製造皮盔甲</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar12\">製造皮帶</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","Julie10-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 若想製作硬皮背心，需要給我1件銀釘皮背心，15張高級皮,15塊金屬塊。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request hard leather vest\">製作硬皮背心。</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Julie11-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>以皮背心和皮帶可製造出皮盔甲。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather vest with belt\">製造皮盔甲</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Julie12-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以5張高級皮和2塊金屬塊可製造皮帶。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request belt\">製造皮帶</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Julie2-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 每張皮革以2枚金幣、每件高級皮以30枚金幣購買。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request adena2\">販賣皮革</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request adena30\">販賣高級皮</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Julie3-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以20張皮革可精製出高級皮。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request hard leather\">製造高級皮</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Julie4-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以5張皮革，1塊金屬塊可製造皮帽子。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather cap\">製造皮帽子</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Julie5-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以6張皮革，2個金屬塊可製造皮涼鞋。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather sandal\">製造皮涼鞋。</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Julie6-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以10張皮革可製造出皮背心。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather vest\">製造皮背心</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Julie7-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以7張皮革就可製造皮盾牌。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather shield\">製造皮盾牌</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Julie8-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以1雙銀釘皮涼鞋，10張高級皮及10個金屬塊可製造皮長靴。但需要給我手工費300塊金幣。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather boots\">製造皮長靴</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Julie9-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>朱利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以1個鋼盔，1個皮帽子，5張高級皮，5個金屬塊可製造出皮頭盔。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather helmet\">製造皮頭盔</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","jyta1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉塔：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我是從北方艾爾摩來的旅行者，一個女人穿著這麼骯髒的衣服獨自地旅行實在是很丟臉。不過，那是因為我正在尋找某樣東西。雖然現在我已經旅行了好一段時間。但就是找不到它的下落。\r\n<p>順便一提，你有看過在城鎮的北方旁邊舉辨的史萊姆比賽嗎？那真是讓我吃了一驚。我第一次看到這樣的一個比賽，而且你知道嗎？竟然是<a link=\"jyta2\">妖魔</a>在那裡經營比賽呢。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","jyta1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jyta:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I am a traveller from Elmore, to the North. I am looking for something - I've been travelling for a while now...but couldn't find that which I seek. It's kind of shame that I must travel alone, in such squalid clothes.\r\n<p>...by the way, have you seen the slime race to the north of town? I saw such a game for the first time here, and quite surprised to find out that <a link=\"jyta2\">orcs</a> of all things are running the race.\r\n</body>\r\n","jyta1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jyta:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I am a traveller from Elmore, to the North. I am looking for something - I've been travelling for a while now...but couldn't find that which I seek. It's kind of shame that I must travel alone, in such squalid clothes.\r\n<p>...by the way, have you seen the slime race to the north of town? I saw such a game for the first time here, and quite surprised to find out that <a link=\"jyta2\">orcs</a> of all things are running the race.\r\n</body>\r\n","jyta1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>雖顫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>陪 磁薹 縣賅橫 轎褐曖 罹ч濠縑蹂. 劂 覬 瓊嬴棻棲堅 氈轄. 罹ч 集陪雖朝 紮 腑朝等...嬴霜梱雖 跤瓊堅 氈橫蹂. 罹濠陛 �母� 檜溢啪 雖盪碟и 離葡戲煎 罹ч擊 ж堅 氈棻棲 覬 獐鼻餌陶轄?\r\n<p>...霤, 渡褐 葆擊 嶺薹縑 氈朝 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶 п 疑橫蹂? 陪 罹晦 諦憮 籀擠 盪楛 啾檜陛 氈棻朝 勘 憲懊朝等, 唳晦蒂 霞чж朝啪 <a link=\"jyta2\">螃觼</a>塭朝勘 憲堅 梭礎 啾嫉橫蹂.\r\n</body>","jyta2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>吉塔：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>那些妖魔的領袖是-葛拉的樣子？我想我曾在某處聽過那個名字。好像是在北方的『黑色森林』吧！啊，我記得你稱呼那為『北方森林』？總之∼，當我正停留在 『燃柳村』時，我有聽人提到他是妖魔部落的其中一個酋長。\r\n<p>那些森林裡的妖魔們可以在城鎮中作交易，你不覺得這很奇怪嗎？我不知道這是不是因為森林變得比較難以居住，或這個地方對妖魔們來說真的比森林更好就是了。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","jyta2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jyta:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The chief of the orcs is...Gora, I believe - I think I heard that name somewhere... \"The Black Forest\" at the north, I heard you call \"The Northern Forest\". Anyway, Gora is one of the chieftains of the orc tribe there. I heard that when I was staying at Burnt Willow, the village there.\r\n<p>It's strange that orcs in the forest are making trades in the town. I'm not sure whether the forest became too hard to live in, or if this place is just better for orcs than the forest.\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","jyta2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Jyta:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The chief of the orcs is...Gora, I believe - I think I heard that name somewhere... \"The Black Forest\" at the north, I heard you call \"The Northern Forest\". Anyway, Gora is one of the chieftains of the orc tribe there. I heard that when I was staying at Burnt Willow, the village there.\r\n<p>It's strange that orcs in the forest are making trades in the town. I'm not sure whether the forest became too hard to live in, or if this place is just better for orcs than the forest.\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","jyta2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>雖顫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>盪 螃觼菟 渠濰 檜葷檜 堅塭..塭堅 ц轄? 橫蛤憮 菟橫獄 檜葷檜棻 ц渦棲...磁薹縑 氈朝 '匐擎 膛', 嬴 罹晦憮朝 '磁薹 膛'檜塭堅 ж湍陛? ж罹除 剪晦 餌朝 螃觼 睡褶曖 睡褶濰醞 и貲檜塭湍等蹂? 斜 膛 斬籀縑 氈朝 '廓お 尷煎辦'塭朝 �倣�團 葆擊縑 僧歷擊 陽 菟擎 檜撿晦檣等.\r\n<p>膛縑憮 髦湍 螃觼菟檜 檜楛等梱雖 釭諦憮 濰餌蒂 ж棻棲, 膛 樓檜 髦晦 橫溥錶霞勒雖 嬴棲賊 罹晦陛 膛爾棻 螃觼菟檜 髦晦 渦 謠擎 夠檜 脹 勒雖 賅腦啊啻蹂.\r\n</body>","karim-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>凱倫：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n我們幫人保管物品，你們人類可能不了解，但是我們的『鐵門』公會有很長的服務歷史，你可以信賴我們，\r\n你把物品儲存在我們這裡是很安全的。\r\n<br>\r\n不限制存放時間，儲存１項物品只要３０個金幣。在你取回那些物品的時候再結帳。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>個人倉庫：<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\">存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\">取回物品</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟倉庫：<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\">存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\">取回物品</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","karim-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Karim the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Ye human types may not understand sech things, but our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of -trustworthy- service. Yer items are safe with us. <br>\r\n'N, ye pay jest 30 adena for 1 item regardless of time - settle the account when ye retrieve the items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","karim-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Karim the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Ye human types may not understand sech things, but our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of -trustworthy- service. Yer items are safe with us. <br>\r\n'N, ye pay jest 30 adena for 1 item regardless of time - settle the account when ye retrieve the items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","karim-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 蘋葡:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n僭勒擊 蜆嬴 萄董棲棻. 渡褐菟 檣除菟擎 澀 賅腦啊雖虜, 辦葬 '鬼繹曖 僥' 望萄朝 螃楠 羲餌蒂 陛霞 ががи 褻霜檜塭螃.\r\n凳萇 寰褕ж堅 蜆晦紫煙 п蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n陛問擎 僭勒 ж釭渡 鼠褻勒 30嬴等釭, 絲擎 僭勒擊 瓊擊 陽 頂朝 剪蹂.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>偃檣 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑸裊 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","kariml-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>凱倫：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>嘿，我們為什麼要為一些像你這樣的無名小卒保管物品呢？如果你要使用我們的服務，先為自己爭取到一個稱號吧，當你已經累積一些名望的時候再回來。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","kariml-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Karim the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hoi - why should we store items for a youngster like yerself? If ye want to use our service, go make a name for yerself. Come back when you've earned some fame.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","kariml-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Karim the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hoi - why should we store items for a youngster like yerself? If ye want to use our service, go make a name for yerself. Come back when you've earned some fame.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","kariml-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 蘋葡:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>檜瑭蹂, 辦葬陛 劂 圖堅 渡褐偽擎 Е啻晦曖 僭勒擊 蜃嬴遽欽 蜓檜螃? 僭勒擊 蜃晦堅 談棻賊 檜葷擊 覬 陳萼 棻擠縑 螃衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","kentu1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>『戰士』肯土：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n需要戰士嗎？人類！\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">要求指派戰士</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","kentu1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Warrior Kentu Neruga:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n...Need warriors, Human?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">Request assigned warriors</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kentu1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Warrior Kentu Neruga:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n...Need warriors, Human?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">Request assigned warriors</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kentu1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'瞪餌' 騰癱 啻瑞陛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n...辨餌陛 в蹂и陛, 檣除?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"demand\">寡纂嫡擎 瞪餌蒂 蹂掘и棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kentu2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>『戰士』肯土：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n我仍然在找一些有用的戰士，請你耐心點等吧。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","kentu2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Warrior Kentu Neruga:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nI'm still raising warriors. Be patient.\r\n</body>\r\n","kentu2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Warrior Kentu Neruga:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nI'm still raising warriors. Be patient.\r\n</body>\r\n","kentu2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'瞪餌' 騰癱 啻瑞陛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n嬴霜 瞪餌陛 賅舒 賅檜雖 彊懊棻. 褻旎 渦 晦棻溥塭.\r\n</body>\r\n","kentu3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>『戰士』肯土：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n我現在沒有足夠的人手，告訴你的老闆多找一些戰士吧。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","kentu3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Warrior Kentu Neruga:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nI don't have enough warriors right now - tell your boss to raise more.\r\n</body>\r\n","kentu3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Warrior Kentu Neruga:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nI don't have enough warriors right now - tell your boss to raise more.\r\n</body>\r\n","kentu3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'瞪餌' 騰癱 啻瑞陛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n⑷營 瞪餌菟曖 熱陛 醱碟纂 彊棻. 傘曖 渠濰縑啪 陛憮 瞪餌菟擊 渦 賅餵ж塭堅 ж塭.\r\n</body>\r\n","kentu4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>『戰士』肯土：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n人類，這不是你該來地方，回到你自己的同伴身旁吧。</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","kentu4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'Warrior' Kentu Neruga:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nHuman, this is not the place for you. Return to your own race.</body>\r\n","kentu4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'Warrior' Kentu Neruga:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\nHuman, this is not the place for you. Return to your own race.</body>\r\n","kentu4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'瞪餌' 騰癱 啻瑞陛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n檣除. 檜夠擎 傘�騊橉� 氈擊 夠檜 嬴棲棻. 傘�騊� 謙褶檜 氈朝 夠戲煎 給嬴陛塭.</body>\r\n","kevin1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>凱文:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你要負責照顧自己馴養的寵物才對。\r\n<p> 若發生無法繼續帶著寵物的時候，可以找我寄養。寄養１隻寵物需要給我 <var src=\"#0\">金幣的保管費。\r\n<p> 啊，當然我只接受你自己馴養的寵物而已。不會接受用魔法來暫時馴養的怪物。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\">寄養寵物</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\">取回寵物</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問馴養寵物的方法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kevin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are responsible for your own animals.\r\n<p>But, if something comes up, you can trust them to me at only <var src=\"#0\"> adenas per pet.\r\n<p>Ah, of course I can only take animals you trained yourself. I won't take enchanted monsters. They are too dangerous.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Trust Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kevin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are responsible for your own animals.\r\n<p>But, if something comes up, you can trust them to me at only <var src=\"#0\"> adenas per pet.\r\n<p>Ah, of course I can only take animals you trained yourself. I won't take enchanted monsters. They are too dangerous.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Trust Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>馨綴:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠晦陛 望菟檣 翕僭擎 部梱雖 疇歜擊 雖堅 爾�ㄧ� п撿雖.\r\n<p>凳, ж雖虜 薑 橫聶 熱 橈朝 橾檜 儅啣擊 陽朝 釭и纔 蜆晦紫煙 ж衛螃, и葆葬渡 <var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭縑 蜆嬴輿雖.\r\n<p>嬴, 僭煩 頂陛 蜆朝 匙擎 渡褐檜 霜蕾 望菟檣 翕僭 閨檜螃. 橫蛤憮 葆徹戲煎 �次� 跨蝶攪 評嬪朝 蜆雖 彊啊棻堅.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> 翕僭擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> 翕僭擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>凱文:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>等我一下。我處理這件事之後馬上過去。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問馴養寵物的方法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kevin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, just a moment. I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kevin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh, just a moment. I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>馨綴:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴, 褻旎虜 晦棻溥蹂. 檜 橾虜 部頂堅 埠 陛葬棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>凱文:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>咦？ 你沒有寄養寵物？\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問馴養寵物的方法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kevin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huh? You never trusted any animals to me?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kevin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huh? You never trusted any animals to me?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>馨綴:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橡溯? 渡褐擎 翕僭擊 蜆曹 瞳檜 橈朝等蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>凱文:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 咦？你沒有寄養寵物？\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問馴養寵物的方法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kevin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't even have animals to trust!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kevin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't even have animals to trust!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kevin4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>馨綴:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橡溯? 蜆望 翕僭紫 橈戲賊憮 劂 蜆曹棻朝 剪蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","knight-c.tbl":"32\r\n               騎士\r\n\r\n  騎士擁有最高的力量，\r\n  以及因為天生的才能\r\n    而產生的自尊。\r\n\r\n   在封建制度之下，\r\n  騎士會與君主訂契約，\r\n   並以此賺錢維生。\r\n  但是玩家所扮演的\r\n  是個還未決定君主的\r\n     自由槍騎兵。\r\n\r\n\r\n   騎士所面對的課題\r\n   除了增加實力之外\r\n    就是尋找一個\r\n   值得效忠的君主。\r\n\r\n\r\n    騎士可以善用\r\n  各種的武器和盔甲。\r\n 而且也有可以幫助戰鬥\r\n     的特殊技能。\r\n\r\n             因此，\r\n   騎士的初始力量\r\n比其他任何職業還要高\r\n      不可諱言地，\r\n     騎士是天堂中\r\n      最佳的鬥士\r\n","knight-e.tbl":"43\r\nKnight\r\n\r\nKnights are the\r\nfiercest warriors in\r\nLineage, with the \r\nhighest strength of\r\nany class.  In addition\r\nto this, they have the\r\nability to use more \r\narmor and weapons than\r\nany other class, making\r\nthem quite effective\r\nat both dealing and\r\nabsorbing damage.\r\n\r\nThe primary statistics\r\nfor a Knight should be\r\nSTR and CON, which \r\ncontrol respectively the\r\namount of damage done\r\nand the ability to \r\nrecieve and heal damage.\r\nSecondarily, DEX can\r\nalso be useful, affecting \r\none's ability to hit \r\naccurately.\r\n\r\nThe downside of being a\r\nKnight is that one has no\r\ninnate ability to cast\r\nmagical spells at all -\r\nthey are dependent on \r\npotions and scrolls or \r\nfriendly party members \r\nfor magical support.  \r\n\r\nKnights thus have a vested \r\ninterest in seeking the \r\npatronage of a powerful \r\nBloodpledge leader, but\r\nthey begin the game in Silver\r\nKnight's Town as wandering\r\nand lordless warriors.\r\n","knight-j.tbl":"43\r\nKnight\r\n\r\nKnights are the\r\nfiercest warriors in\r\nLineage, with the \r\nhighest strength of\r\nany class.  In addition\r\nto this, they have the\r\nability to use more \r\narmor and weapons than\r\nany other class, making\r\nthem quite effective\r\nat both dealing and\r\nabsorbing damage.\r\n\r\nThe primary statistics\r\nfor a Knight should be\r\nSTR and CON, which \r\ncontrol respectively the\r\namount of damage done\r\nand the ability to \r\nrecieve and heal damage.\r\nSecondarily, DEX can\r\nalso be useful, affecting \r\none's ability to hit \r\naccurately.\r\n\r\nThe downside of being a\r\nKnight is that one has no\r\ninnate ability to cast\r\nmagical spells at all -\r\nthey are dependent on \r\npotions and scrolls or \r\nfriendly party members \r\nfor magical support.  \r\n\r\nKnights thus have a vested \r\ninterest in seeking the \r\npatronage of a powerful \r\nBloodpledge leader, but\r\nthey begin the game in Silver\r\nKnight's Town as wandering\r\nand lordless warriors.\r\n","knight-k.tbl":"33\r\n晦餌\r\n\r\n顫堅陪 晦榆婁 陝堅曖  喻\r\n溘戲煎 譆堅曖 鼠溘婁  斜\r\n縑 鼻擬ж朝 ヶ問擊  槳縑\r\n厥擎 餌塋菟擊 '晦餌'塭堅\r\n睡落棲棻. 瑰勒 褐碟薯 頂\r\n縑憮曖 晦餌朝 艙輿諦  啗\r\n擒擊 裕堅 斜曖  �秷狤□�\r\n橾ж貊 瑰饜釭 瑰煙擊  嫡\r\n朝 匙檜 橾奩瞳檜雖虜  Ы\r\n溯檜橫 PC煎賦曖 晦餌菟擎\r\n嬴霜 か薑и 輿捱擊  薑ж\r\n雖 彊擎 '濠嶸晦餌'煎  轎\r\n嫦м棲棻. \r\n濠褐曖  棟溘擊  斛и梱雖\r\n莊橫螢葬朝  喻溘擊  ж貊\r\n翕衛縑  濠褐檜  撰望虜и\r\n晦榆擊 陛霞 輿捱擊  瓊嬴\r\n頂朝 匙檜 檜菟曖 渡賊 婁\r\n薯殮棲棻.\r\n\r\n晦餌朝  啪歜縑  襄營ж朝\r\n賅萇 謙盟曖 鼠晦諦  寞橫\r\n掘蒂 餌辨й 熱 氈戲貊 瞪\r\n癱縑 紫遺檜 腎朝 罹楝 陛\r\n雖 晦獎菟擊 陛雖堅  氈蝗\r\n棲棻. \r\n傳 蟾晦 熱纂縑 ��檜 陛濰\r\n堪啪 釭顫釭朝 匙紫  檜菟\r\n殮棲棻. 唸措  瞪癱縑憮朝\r\n檜菟擊 評塭螢 濠陛  橈朝\r\n匙殮棲棻.\r\n","ktguard3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱登城堡警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這裡<a link=\"ktguard4\">已不像以前一樣的安全</a>，你在城堡裡面的行為要謹慎一點。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"ktguard6\">詢問現在的統治者</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The <a link=\"ktguard4\">security</a> around here is not what it used to be - be prudent with your behavior on castle grounds.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"ktguard6\">Ask about the current lord</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The <a link=\"ktguard4\">security</a> around here is not what it used to be - be prudent with your behavior on castle grounds.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"ktguard6\">Ask about the current lord</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>騰お撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 雖羲曖 <a link=\"ktguard4\">纂寰</a>檜 謠雖 彊戲棲 か�� 撩 頂縑憮朝 ч翕擊 濠醞ж紫煙 ж衛螃. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"ktguard6\">⑷營曖 艙輿陛 援捱雖 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","ktguard4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱登城堡警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我不應該大聲地說這件事。但是∼你知道嗎，那個康特凱登在康特古迪歐倒下之後，前來接收了這片領土。康特古迪歐好像是這片領地的最初統治者，他在戰爭期間，反對現任亞丁的國王肯恩羅侯。\r\n<p>事實上，是新指派來的統治者根本不關心在他領域中的人，而且也不想知道在人民之中有<a link=ktguard5>四處流浪著的人</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I shouldn't be saying this out loud...but...Count Kent came to reign over this territory after the fall of Count Gludia, the original lord of Gludio estate, during the war against his highness, Ken Rauhel - the current King of Aden.\r\n<p>The thing is, the newly assigned lord has no concerns for the well being of his domain, no wonder there is <a link=ktguard5>restlessness</a> among the people...\r\n</body>","ktguard4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I shouldn't be saying this out loud...but...Count Kent came to reign over this territory after the fall of Count Gludia, the original lord of Gludio estate, during the war against his highness, Ken Rauhel - the current King of Aden.\r\n<p>The thing is, the newly assigned lord has no concerns for the well being of his domain, no wonder there is <a link=ktguard5>restlessness</a> among the people...\r\n</body>","ktguard4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>騰お撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...檜勒 贖模葬煎 蜓ж晦朝 覬 厭и 檜撿晦檣等...獄楚 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖曖 艙輿艘湍 旋瑞蛤嬴 寥濛檜 騰 塭辦⑦ わж諦曖 瞪爵縑憮 ぬи �� 檜 艙雖蒂 雖旎曖 騰お 寥濛檜 棻蝶葬啪 腎歷棻朝 餌褒擎 憲堅 氈模?\r\n<p>斜楛等 億煎 睡歜и 艙輿塭朝 餌塋擎 濠晦 艙雖蒂 給爾朝等縑朝 瞪⑵ 婦褕檜 橈朝 餌塋檜塭螃. 斜楝棲 <a link=ktguard5>團褕</a>檜 檜溢啪 �靿鞁媮鶬�...\r\n</body>","ktguard5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱登城堡警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>因為你不是這附近的人，也難怪你不知道。其實古丁城鎮曾經像是個生活擾嚷的貿易港口，但現在唯一在附近遊蕩的只剩下運送武器的人類而已了。在北方的森林，湧入了因戰爭而遺失農地的人們，他們集結在被燃燒過的土地附近，形成小型營區，生活和難民差不多。\r\n<p>我不是很正直的一個男人，但是看見人們的感傷而且這情況似乎越演越烈，我已經開始覺得困擾了。\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Since you are not from around here, you wouldn't know...Gludian towns used to bustle with life as a trade harbor, now the only people that wander around are people bearing arms.  In the northern woods, people lost their farmland during the recent war and have now gathered around forming small camps on the burnt-down grounds, living like refugees.\r\n<p>I am not a man of politics, but seeing the sentiments of the people and what goes on around here, I can't but think that something wrong is going on here...\r\n</body>","ktguard5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Since you are not from around here, you wouldn't know...Gludian towns used to bustle with life as a trade harbor, now the only people that wander around are people bearing arms.  In the northern woods, people lost their farmland during the recent war and have now gathered around forming small camps on the burnt-down grounds, living like refugees.\r\n<p>I am not a man of politics, but seeing the sentiments of the people and what goes on around here, I can't but think that something wrong is going on here...\r\n</body>","ktguard5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>騰お撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐擎 諼雖 餌塋檜棲 澀 賅腦啊雖虜...蕨瞪縑朝 鼠羲о戲煎 紮 磁瞳剪葬湍 旋瑞蛞 葆擊紫 蹂闈縛 鼠晦蒂 萇 餌塋菟 閨檜堅...磁薹 膛縑朝 蹂闈 瞪爵戲煎 堯雖蒂 檠擎 餌塋菟檜 �倣�襟擊 虜菟橫憮 陪團籀歲 髦堅 氈棻螃.\r\n<p>釭撿 薑纂朝 澀 賅腦雖虜, 蹂闈 檜斬寞 檣褕擊 爾堅 氈戲賊 劃陛 澀跤腎堅 氈棻朝 儅陝檜 菟曹 萄朝掘溥...\r\n</body>","ktguard6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>甚麼？你竟然不知道那位城主的姓名？你聽清楚，現在這裡的城主是<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>血盟的<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>。記住！</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">詢問下次攻城時間</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">對<var src=\"#1\">血盟宣戰。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't know the lord of this castle?\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All right. I'll tell you...this time. The current lord is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font> from the Bloodpledge <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>. Try to remember the name of our great lord from now on, knave!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">Ask the time for next siege</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">Declare a war against <var src=\"#1\"></a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't know the lord of this castle?\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All right. I'll tell you...this time. The current lord is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font> from the Bloodpledge <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>. Try to remember the name of our great lord from now on, knave!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">Ask the time for next siege</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">Declare a war against <var src=\"#1\"></a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>凳塭堅? 凱 濠晦 餌朝 雖寞 撩輿椒曖 襄л紫 賅艇欽 蜓檜撿? 澀 菟橫塭, ⑷營 檜 雖寞曖 艙輿朝 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font> ⑸裊 轎褐曖 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>椒檜衛棻. 僅僅�� 晦橘п 舒紫煙 п.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 僖朝棻</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\"><var src=\"#1\"> ⑸裊縑 渠п 奢撩瞪擊 摹樹и棻.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱登城堡警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如果你要向統治者挑戰，請在<var src=\"#1\">年<var src=\"#2\">月<var src=\"#3\">日<var src=\"#4\">時<var src=\"#5\">分的時候過來。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ktguard7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to challenge the Lord, come at <var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#1\"> <var src=\"#4\">o'clock.\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to challenge the Lord, come at <var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#1\"> <var src=\"#4\">o'clock.\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>騰お撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿眷憮 嫦ルж褐 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛陝擎 <var src=\"#1\">喇 <var src=\"#2\">錯 <var src=\"#3\">橾 <var src=\"#4\">衛 <var src=\"#5\">碟 檜棻. 渾網 纔賊 渾滬瑭!\r\n</body>","ktguard8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱登城堡警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>統治者尚未宣布下一次圍城的時間。\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The lord of the castle has not declared the time for the next siege yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Kent Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The lord of the castle has not declared the time for the next siege yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","ktguard8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>騰お撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿眷憮朝 嬴霜 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 唸薑ж雖 彊戲樟棻.\r\n</body>","ktguarde1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱登城堡的警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>因為內部的狀況的關係，這條道路已對外地人關閉。\r\n<p>不想要被拘捕的話，就儘管去打它吧，可惡！妖精算什麼！此外，城堡最近實在是亂七八糟。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ktguarde1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Guard of Castle Kent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This road is closed to outsiders, because of inside...circumstances.\r\n<p>Just beat it, if you do not want to get arrested. Besides, this castle is in a mess recently - too many elves, I say!\r\n</body>","ktguarde1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Guard of Castle Kent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This road is closed to outsiders, because of inside...circumstances.\r\n<p>Just beat it, if you do not want to get arrested. Besides, this castle is in a mess recently - too many elves, I say!\r\n</body>","ktguarde1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>騰お撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 撩 頂 餌薑戲煎 檣п 諼睡檣曖 鱔ч擊 旎ж堅 氈棻.\r\n<p>羹ん渡ж雖 彊戲溥賊 檜 斬籀縑憮 橡薩剪葬雖 蜓塭堅. 陛嗣檜釭 蹂闈 撩 碟嬪晦陛 橫熱摹и等 縣Щ塭棲...\r\n</body>","ktguardk1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱登城堡的警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗨！外地人是不允許。哦！騎士先生，真對不起打斷你的話。\r\n<p>是的，那個領地附近有一場大型戰爭。現在維持城內安全的工作，已經超出我們的能力之上。\r\n<p>騎士先生，我們非常的抱歉，現在不能讓你進入。請過一些時候再回來。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","ktguardk1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Guard of Castle Kent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey! Outsiders are not allow...d..  Oh! Sir Knight, I am sorry to interrupt.\r\n<p>We had a big battle near the estate...it is beyond our ability to keep\r\nsecurity inside the castle nowadays.\r\n<p>We are very sorry but.. please come back again at a later time. We can not let you in, Sir Knight.\r\n</body>","ktguardk1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Guard of Castle Kent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey! Outsiders are not allow...d..  Oh! Sir Knight, I am sorry to interrupt.\r\n<p>We had a big battle near the estate...it is beyond our ability to keep\r\nsecurity inside the castle nowadays.\r\n<p>We are very sorry but.. please come back again at a later time. We can not let you in, Sir Knight.\r\n</body>","ktguardk1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>騰お撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜瑭! 雖旎 檜 撩擎 諼睡檣 轎殮旎...嬴, 晦餌椒檜衛捱蹂. 褒滔ц蝗棲棻!\r\n<p>蕨...譆斬 艙雖 睡斬縑憮 贖 瞪癱陛 氈歷戲棲梱蹂...⑷營 盪�騊曋彖幓� 撩 寰 纂寰擊 嶸雖ж朝 匙虜戲煎紫 幔離港棲棻. \r\n<p>薑蜓 賸歎м棲棻虜...橾欽 撩 寰曖 碟嬪晦陛 霞薑脹 棻擠縑 菟楝輿衛雖 彊啊蝗棲梱? 盪�騇彖幓� 晦餌椒擊 菟罹爾頂 萄萵 熱陛 橈蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","ktguardk2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱登城堡的警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗨！沒有人被允許經過這道門。\r\n<p>什麼？你來自甘特之屋？嗚∼老兄！你以為你說你是騎士，你就是了嗎？許多屠殺者最近都聚在一起，使狀況變得更壞了！\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ktguardk2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Guard of castle Kent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey! No one is allowed to pass this gate.\r\n<p>What? You come from the House of the Red Knight?  Do you think that saying so makes you a knight?\r\n<p>To make matters worse, many warriors are gathering recently...beat it!\r\n</body>","ktguardk2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Guard of castle Kent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey! No one is allowed to pass this gate.\r\n<p>What? You come from the House of the Red Knight?  Do you think that saying so makes you a knight?\r\n<p>To make matters worse, many warriors are gathering recently...beat it!\r\n</body>","ktguardk2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>騰お撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜瑭! 雖旎 檜 撩擎 諼睡檣 轎殮旎雖撿!\r\n<p>凳? 渡褐檜 '碩擎 晦餌曖 餵' 轎褐 晦餌塭堅? 檜瑭, 濠晦陛 晦餌塭堅 蜓и棻堅 棻 晦骯還憲嬴? 陛嗣檜釭 蹂闈 蠔濩檜菟檜 賅罹菟橫憮 敝雛擎等...說葬 疏雖塭堅!\r\n</body>","ktguardp1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱登城堡的警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗨！外地人是不允許...。哦！你是來自甘特之屋的人！\r\n<p>是的！那個領地附近有一場大型戰爭，現在維持城內安全的工作，但目前的情形已經超出我們的能力控制範圍之外。\r\n<p>我們非常的抱歉。但是，請過一些時候再回來。我們現在有令在身，所以我們在現在真的不能讓你通過。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ktguardp1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Guard of castle Kent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey! Outsiders are not allow...d..  Oh...Oh! You are the person from the House of the Red Knight!\r\n<p>We had a big battle near the estate... It is above our ability to keep security inside the castle nowadays. \r\n<p>We are very sorry but.. please come back again at a later time.\r\n<p>We have our orders sir...we can not let you in now...\r\n</body>","ktguardp1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Guard of castle Kent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey! Outsiders are not allow...d..  Oh...Oh! You are the person from the House of the Red Knight!\r\n<p>We had a big battle near the estate... It is above our ability to keep security inside the castle nowadays. \r\n<p>We are very sorry but.. please come back again at a later time.\r\n<p>We have our orders sir...we can not let you in now...\r\n</body>","ktguardp1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>騰お撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜瑭! 雖旎 檜 撩擎 諼睡檣 轎殮旎...螃螃, 渡褐眷憮朝 '碩擎 晦餌曖 餵' 轎褐曖 餌塋檜衛捱蹂.\r\n<p>蕨...譆斬 艙雖 睡斬縑憮 贖 瞪癱陛 氈歷戲棲梱蹂...⑷營 盪�騊曋彖幓� 撩 寰 纂寰擊 嶸雖ж朝 匙虜戲煎紫 幔離港棲棻. \r\n<p>薑蜓 賸歎м棲棻虜...橾欽 撩 寰曖 碟嬪晦陛 霞薑脹 棻擠縑 菟楝輿衛雖 彊啊蝗棲梱? 嬪煎睡攪曖 貲滄檜塭...雖旎擎 鱔婁衛麵萄萵 熱陛 橈蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","ktguardp2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>凱登城堡的警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嘿！沒有人被允許經過這道門。\r\n<p>…什麼？你來自甘特之屋？嘿！老兄...你以為我會相信你嗎？許多嗜殺者最近都聚在一起讓狀況變得更糟了。去∼現在給我滾遠一點！\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","ktguardp2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Guard of Castle Kent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey! No one is allowed to pass this gate!\r\n<p>...What? You come from the House of the Red Knight? \r\n<p>It is difficult to know whom to trust...to make matters worse, many warriors are gathering recently. Please go away!\r\n</body>","ktguardp2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Guard of Castle Kent:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey! No one is allowed to pass this gate!\r\n<p>...What? You come from the House of the Red Knight? \r\n<p>It is difficult to know whom to trust...to make matters worse, many warriors are gathering recently. Please go away!\r\n</body>","ktguardp2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>騰お撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜瑭! 雖旎 檜 撩擎 諼睡檣 轎殮旎雖撿!\r\n<p>凳? 渡褐檜 '碩擎 晦餌曖 餵' 轎褐檜塭堅? 檜瑭, 雖旎 斜 蜓擊 釭爾堅 圖戲塢 蜓檜撿? 陛嗣檜釭 蹂闈 檜鼻и 喪戮菟檜 賅罹菟橫憮 敝雛擎等...說葬 疏雖塭堅!\r\n</body>","kuhatin-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>克哈丁:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n我們幫人類保管物品，\r\n我們『鐵門』公會有很長的服務歷史，因此你可信賴我們，你把物品儲存在我們這裡是絕對安全的。\r\n<br>\r\n儲存1件物品要30塊金幣，在你取回哪些物品的時候才結帳。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>個人倉庫:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 儲存物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 取回物品</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟倉庫:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> 儲存物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> 取回物品</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","kuhatin-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kuhatin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Ye humanfolk may not understand sech things, but the 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of -trustworthy- service. Yer items are safe with us. <br>\r\n30 adena for 1 item regardless of time, and ye'll settle the account when ye retrieve the items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kuhatin-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kuhatin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Ye humanfolk may not understand sech things, but the 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of -trustworthy- service. Yer items are safe with us. <br>\r\n30 adena for 1 item regardless of time, and ye'll settle the account when ye retrieve the items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","kuhatin-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 瓔жず:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n僭勒擊 蜆嬴 萄董棲棻. 渡褐菟 檣除菟擎 澀 賅腦啊雖虜, \r\n辦葬 '鬼繹曖 僥' 望萄朝 螃楠 羲餌蒂 陛霞 ががи 褻霜檜塭螃.\r\n凳萇 寰褕ж堅 蜆晦紫煙 п蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n陛問擎 僭勒 ж釭渡 鼠褻勒 30嬴等釭, 絲擎 僭勒擊 瓊擊 陽 頂朝 剪蹂.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>偃檣 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑸裊 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","kuhatinl-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kuhatin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hoi, why should we store items for some unknown such as yerself? If ye want to use our service, make a name for yerself. Come back when ye've earned some fame - and levels!\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","kuhatinl-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Kuhatin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hoi, why should we store items for some unknown such as yerself? If ye want to use our service, make a name for yerself. Come back when ye've earned some fame - and levels!\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","kuhatinl-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 瓔жず:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>檜瑭蹂, 辦葬陛 劂 圖堅 渡褐偽擎 Е啻晦曖 僭勒擊 蜃嬴遽欽 蜓檜螃? 僭勒擊 蜃晦堅 談棻賊 檜葷擊 覬 陳萼 棻擠縑 螃衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","laban1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>拉班 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n哈哈∼！飛啊...飛...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","laban1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Laban :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nHehe, Haha~!... fly... fly...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","laban1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Laban :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nHehe, Haha~!... fly... fly...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","laban1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭奩 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!------- 嬴楚朝 陳棻(fly)蒂 橾睡楝 ぎ萼 嫦擠戲煎 噹 匙歜---------------->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n辦��... 釭塭塭... 釭塭...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","ladar1-c.HTML":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>皮革工匠：</p></font>\r\n<br><p>購買各種動物皮革。若給我錢，也可幫你利用皮革製作物品。</p>  \r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">販賣皮革</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar3\">製造高級皮</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar4\">製造皮帽子</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar5\">製造皮涼鞋</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar6\">製造皮背心</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar7\">製造皮盾牌</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar8\">製造皮長靴</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar9\">製造皮頭盔</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar10\">製造硬皮背心</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar11\">製造皮盔甲</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar12\">製造皮帶</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","ladar1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br><p>I'm buying all kind of furs, and I can make you some nice leather goods.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">Sell furs</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar3\">Make hard leather</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar4\">Make leather cap</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar5\">Make leather sandal</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar6\">Make leather vest</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar7\">Make leather shield</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar8\">Make leather boots</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar9\">Make leather helm</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar10\">Make hard leather vest</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar11\">Make leather vest with belt</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar12\">Make belt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ladar1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br><p>I'm buying all kind of furs, and I can make you some nice leather goods.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">Sell furs</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar3\">Make hard leather</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar4\">Make leather cap</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar5\">Make leather sandal</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar6\">Make leather vest</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar7\">Make leather shield</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar8\">Make leather boots</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar9\">Make leather helm</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar10\">Make hard leather vest</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar11\">Make leather vest with belt</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar12\">Make belt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","ladar1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避撮奢餌:</p></font>\r\n<br><p>陝謙 翕僭陛避 鳶棲棻. 絲擊 輿衛賊 陛避擊 檜辨и\r\n詣霞 僭勒菟擊 虜菟橫 萄葬晦紫 м棲棻.</p>  \r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">陛避擊 っ棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar3\">堅晝Я⑶擊 虜萇棻</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar4\">陛避賅濠蒂 虜萇棻</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar5\">陛避僻殖擊 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar6\">陛避褻郭蒂 虜萇棻</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar7\">陛避寞ぬ蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar8\">陛避睡隴蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar9\">陛避癱掘蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar10\">醞骨陛避褻郭蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar11\">漣お殖萼 陛避褻郭蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar12\">漣お蒂 虜萇棻</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","ladar10-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>皮革工匠：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 若想製作硬皮背心，需要給我１件銀釘皮背心，１５張高級皮革，１５塊金屬塊。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request hard leather vest\">製作硬皮背心。</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar10-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make a hard leather vest with 1 studded leather vest, 15 hard leathers, and 15 lumps of metal.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request hard leather vest\">Request a hard leather vest</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar10-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make a hard leather vest with 1 studded leather vest, 15 hard leathers, and 15 lumps of metal.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request hard leather vest\">Request a hard leather vest</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar10-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避撮奢餌:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 醞骨陛避褻郭朝 癒夢擎 陛避褻郭 1弊, 堅晝Я⑶ 15濰, 繹惚 15偃蒂 輿衛賊 虜菟 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request hard leather vest\">醞骨陛避褻郭蒂 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>","ladar11-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>皮革工匠：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>以皮背心和皮帶可製造出皮盔甲。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather vest with belt\">製造皮盔甲</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar11-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make a leather vest with belt with a (surprisingly) leather vest and a belt.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather vest with belt\">Request a leather vest with belt</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar11-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make a leather vest with belt with a (surprisingly) leather vest and a belt.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather vest with belt\">Request a leather vest with belt</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar11-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避撮奢餌:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 漣お殖萼 陛避褻郭朝 陛避褻郭諦 漣お蒂 輿衛賊 虜菟 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather vest with belt\">漣お殖萼 陛避褻郭蒂 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>","ladar12-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>皮革工匠：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以５張高級皮和２塊金屬塊可製造皮帶。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request belt\">製造皮帶</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar12-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make a belt with 5 hard leather and 2 lumps of metal.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request belt\">Request belt</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","ladar12-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make a belt with 5 hard leather and 2 lumps of metal.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request belt\">Request belt</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","ladar12-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避撮奢餌:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 漣お朝 堅晝Я⑶ 5濰婁 繹惚 2偃蒂 輿衛賊 虜菟 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request belt\">漣お蒂 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>","ladar2-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>皮革工匠：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 每張皮革以２枚金幣、每件高級皮革以３０枚金幣購買。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request adena2\">販賣皮革</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request adena30\">販賣高級皮</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar2-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避撮奢餌:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 翕僭陛避擎 偃渡 2嬴等釭煎 堅晝Я⑶擎 偃渡 30嬴等釭煎 掘殮м棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request adena2\">翕僭陛避擊 っ棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request adena30\">堅晝Я⑶擊 っ棻</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","ladar3-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>皮革工匠：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以２０張皮革可精製出高級皮革。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request hard leather\">製造高級皮革</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar3-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make one hard leather with 20 furs.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request hard leather\">Request hard leather</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar3-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make one hard leather with 20 furs.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request hard leather\">Request hard leather</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar3-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避撮奢餌:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 翕僭陛避擎 20濰戲煎 堅晝Я⑶擊 虜菟 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request hard leather\">堅晝Я⑶擊 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>","ladar4-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>皮革工匠：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以５張皮革，１塊金屬塊可製造皮帽子。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather cap\">製造皮帽子</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar4-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You can make a leather cap with 5 furs and 1 lump of metal.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather cap\">Request leather cap</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar4-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You can make a leather cap with 5 furs and 1 lump of metal.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather cap\">Request leather cap</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar4-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避撮奢餌:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 陛避賅濠朝 翕僭陛避 5濰, 繹惚 1偃煎 虜菟 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather cap\">陛避賅濠蒂 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>","ladar5-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>皮革工匠：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 以６張皮革，２個金屬塊可製造皮涼鞋。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather sandal\">製造皮涼鞋。</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar5-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You can make a leather sandal with 6 furs and 2 lumps of metal.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather sandal\">Request leather sandal.</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar5-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Leather Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You can make a leather sandal with 6 furs and 2 lumps of metal.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request leather sandal\">Request leather sandal.</a></p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","ladar5-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避撮奢餌:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 陛避僻殖擎 