>\r\n<br><p>瞪 鄙蒂 檜辨п 罹楝陛雖 僭勒擊 虜菟 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 鼠歙擊 虜菟橫 萄萵梱蹂?</p>  \r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">鄙褻陝擊 っ棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"lien3\">п埤癱掘蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"lien4\">鄙骨褡擊 虜萇棻</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"lien5\">埤陝寞ぬ蒂 虜萇棻</a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","lien2-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>骨頭工匠：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>一塊骨頭碎片我出１０枚金幣買，要賣嗎？</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request adena10\">販賣骨頭塊</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","lien2-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>鄙 撮奢餌:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 鄙褻陝擎 偃渡 10嬴等釭煎 掖�納� 萄董棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request adena10\">鄙褻陝擊 っ棻</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","lien3-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>骨頭工匠：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 若想製造骷髏頭盔，需要皮頭盔與１０塊骨頭塊。還需要手工費８００枚金幣。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request skull helmet\">製造骷髏頭盔</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","lien3-e.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Bone Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> To make a skull helmet, you need a leather helm and 10 bone pieces. The processing charge is 800 adena.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request skull helmet\">Request skull helmet</a></p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","lien3-j.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Bone Craftsman:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> To make a skull helmet, you need a leather helm and 10 bone pieces. The processing charge is 800 adena.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request skull helmet\">Request skull helmet</a></p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","lien3-k.html":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>鄙 撮奢餌:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> п埤癱掘蒂 虜菟溥賊 陛避癱掘諦 鄙褻陝 10偃陛 в蹂м棲棻. 斜葬堅 爾熱煎 800嬴等釭蒂 輿敷撿 м棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request skull helmet\">п埤癱掘蒂 虜萇棻</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","lien4-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>骨頭工匠：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 若要製造骷髏盔甲，需要硬皮背心和２０塊骨頭塊作為材料。還需要付手工費５００塊金幣。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request bone armor\">製造骷髏盔甲</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","lien4-e