\r\nIE`9","lolia1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>羅利雅：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>目前在旅館中有許多客人。因為他們有些膽小，所以他們大部份都是有武裝的，事實上在那過去有很多旅行者，所以旅館只不過是一個名字。不過變成一個粗暴的世界也不壞啦。嘿嘿。\r\n</body>\r\n","lolia1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lolia:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are many guests in the inn nowadays - it's slightly scary because most of them are armed. There were few people traveling in the past, so the inn was just a name. And they say there is no silver lining in the clouds of war!\r\n</body>\r\n","lolia1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lolia:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are many guests in the inn nowadays - it's slightly scary because most of them are armed. There were few people traveling in the past, so the inn was just a name. And they say there is no silver lining in the clouds of war!\r\n</body>\r\n","lolia1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>煎葬嬴:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂闈縛 罹婦縑 槳椒檜 霤 號嬴蹂. 渠睡碟 鼠濰и 餌塋菟檜塭 覬 鼠撥曹 ж雖虜, 餌褒 蕪陳縑朝 錶釩 罹чж朝 餌塋菟檜 橈橫憮 罹婦檜塭堅朝 檜葷閨檜歷剪萇蹂. яи 撮鼻檜 腎歷棻堅 窕 釭雌 橾虜 氈朝勒 嬴棲渦塭堅蹂, ④④.\r\n<p>ж曹 斜楚紫 蕪陳睡攪 陛莠噶 蹂薑曖 膛擊 鱔婁ж溥棻 褻陪渡и 鼻檣菟檜 檜 罹婦擊 濠輿 檜辨ц晦 陽僥縑, 斜楣盪楣 啗樓й 熱 氈歷轄. 跡獗擊 勘堅 膛擊 鱔婁ж溥朝 斜 餌塋菟 爾賊 霤 渠欽ж棻朝 儅陝檜 萄啻蹂. 斜 餌塋菟擎 膛擊 鱔婁ж朝 綠徹擊 憲堅 氈棻堅菟 ж湍等.. 盪晦 勒傘ら曖 鼠橫噢陛 鼻檣 望萄煎 斜菟婁 耀ж棲梱, 鼠橫噢縑啪 僭橫爾湍雖蹂.\r\n</body>","luka1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>路加：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我想在森林中玩耍，但是大人說那裡很危險的。\r\n<p>可是在森林中才有較多的東西可以玩。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","luka1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Luka:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I want to play in the forest...but the adults say that it's too dangerous.\r\n<p>There are more things to play with in the forest...\r\n</body>\r\n","luka1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Luka:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I want to play in the forest...but the adults say that it's too dangerous.\r\n<p>There are more things to play with in the forest...\r\n</body>\r\n","luka1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>瑞蘋:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>膛縑 陛憮 啾堅 談擎等 橫艇菟檜 嬪яп憮 寰脹棻堅 п蹂. \r\n<p>餵 斬籀爾棻 膛檜 渦 啾疏葬陛 號擎等...\r\n</body>","luke1-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>路凱 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n你是從哪裡來的？歐蘭？印娜多爾？哈哈∼！不要用這樣的眼光看我。我只是要介紹給你好買賣。這裡可是個有很多賺錢機會的好地方...\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","luke1-e.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Luke :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nWhere are you from? Oren? Inadriel? Haha... don't look at me like that. I just want to introduce a little business secret. This is the land of opportunity where you can make a fortune for yourself...\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","luke1-j.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Luke :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nWhere are you from? Oren? Inadriel? Haha... don't look at me like that. I just want to introduce a little business secret. This is the land of opportunity where you can make a fortune for yourself...\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","luke1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>瑞觼 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n渡褐 橫蛤轎褐檜螃? 螃溶? 檣釭萄萵? жж... 斜楛 曖褕蝶楛 換戲煎 陳 爾雖 葆衛螃. 陪 欽雖 渡褐縑啪 謠擎 餌機剪葬蒂 模偃衛麵 輿溥堅 ц擊 閨檜撿. 檜夠擎 薑蜓 熱號擎 絲弊檜陛 氈朝 晦�蛻� 階檜塭堅...\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","luth-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>露西：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你想買些什麼，先生？</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n<a action=\"luth3\">問稅率</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","luth-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Luth:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What would you like, sir?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"luth3\">Ask about the prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","luth-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Luth:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What would you like, sir?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"luth3\">Ask about the prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","luth-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>當:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>寰喟ж撮蹂. 鼠蝦 僭勒擊 瓊戲衛釭蹂?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n<a action=\"luth3\">蹂闈 僭陛縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","luth1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>露西：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>抱歉，先生。但是我們老闆不淮我賣東西給可疑的人。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","luth1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Luth:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm very sorry, sir. But my master said not to sell any goods to your, er, well, 'ilk'.</p>\r\n</body>","luth1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Luth:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm very sorry, sir. But my master said not to sell any goods to your, er, well, 'ilk'.</p>\r\n</body>","luth1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>當:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>槳椒, 渠欽�� 賸歎м棲棻虜...熱鼻и 餌塋縑啪朝 僭勒擊 つ雖 跤ж紫煙 腎橫氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n</body>","luth3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>露西：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>目前的稅率是<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">％</font></p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","luth3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Luth:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Taxes are <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font> now.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","luth3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Luth:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Taxes are <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font> now.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","luth3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>當:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>殮棲棻.</p>\r\n</body>","lyra1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎！你是一個冒險家嗎？或者是傭兵？無論如何，歡迎來到這個『燃柳村』。我是這個村莊的代表萊拉．格蘭因，你可以叫我萊拉。\r\n<p>就像你所看見的，這個村莊正漸漸成為<a link=\"lyra2\">燃燒領域</a>的一部分，如果那裡沒有\r\n<p><a link=\"lyra3\">妖魔們的威脅</a>，我想就會是一個適合人類居住的地方。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyra1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome. Are you an adventurer? Or mercenary? In any case, welcome to Burnt Willow. I'm the representative of this village, Lyra Gregheim. You may call me Lyra.\r\n<p>As you can see, the village is just getting by with <a link=\"lyra2\">burnt fields</a> but this is a good place to live.\r\n<p>If only there were no <a link=\"lyra3\">threat from the orcs</a>, I mean.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome. Are you an adventurer? Or mercenary? In any case, welcome to Burnt Willow. I'm the representative of this village, Lyra Gregheim. You may call me Lyra.\r\n<p>As you can see, the village is just getting by with <a link=\"lyra2\">burnt fields</a> but this is a good place to live.\r\n<p>If only there were no <a link=\"lyra3\">threat from the orcs</a>, I mean.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃撮蹂. 罹ч濠檜褐陛蹂? 嬴棲賊 辨煽? 橫繚萇 檜夠 '廓お 尷煎辦'葆擊縑 螃褐 匙擊 �紊腎桭炴�. 薯陛 檜 葆擊曖 渠ル蒂 蜃堅氈朝 塭檜塭 斜溯斜ж歜殮棲棻. 斜傖 塭檜塭塭堅 碳楝輿撮蹂.\r\n<p>爾衛棻衛Я 盪�� 葆擊擎 <a link=\"lyra2\">�倣�</a>戲煎 斬斬�� 髦嬴陛朝 嬴鼠匙紫 橈朝 葆擊檜雖虜 檣褕擎 謠港棲棻....\r\n<p><a link=\"lyra3\">螃觼菟曖 蝗問</a>虜 橈戲賊 蜓檜轄.\r\n</body>","lyra10-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>亞丁王國裡，大多數的妖魔不會群居成一個團體，但是那森林裡的妖魔不知為何集結成部落了。每個部落有它自己的圖騰，而這裡所有的妖魔也都有著利用動物骨頭做成的圖騰。\r\n<p>正在試圖撈錢的那些妖魔，一定就是在妖魔組織中等級最低下的甘地妖魔。把他們的圖騰拿來給我。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyra10-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Most orcs in the Aden kingdom don't live as a group, but the orcs in this forest have assembled to form tribes. Each tribe serves its own totem and all the orcs here carry their tribe's totem, made from the bones of animals.\r\n<p>The orcs who are transferring the adena are definitely Gandi Orcs, the lowest in the hierarchy...bring me their totems.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra10-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Most orcs in the Aden kingdom don't live as a group, but the orcs in this forest have assembled to form tribes. Each tribe serves its own totem and all the orcs here carry their tribe's totem, made from the bones of animals.\r\n<p>The orcs who are transferring the adena are definitely Gandi Orcs, the lowest in the hierarchy...bring me their totems.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>錳楚 嬴筆 諾措 瞪羹縑 創啪 碟んж朝 螃觼菟擎 贖 鼠葬蒂 虜菟雖 彊堅 髦嬴陛雖虜, 檜夠 膛曖 螃觼菟虜擎 贖 睡褶擊 檜瑞橫憮 陝 睡褶葆棻 ж釭曖 饜蠱擊 撰晦貊 髦嬴陛雖蹂. 檜夠曖 賅萇 螃觼菟擎 奩萄衛 跺縑 翕僭曖 鄙煎 虜萇 濠晦 睡褶曖 饜蠱擊 雖棲堅 氈港棲棻.\r\n<p>絲擊 釭腦堅 氈朝 螃觼菟擎 碟貲�� ⑷營 陛濰 雪擎 雖嬪縑 氈朝 除蛤 螃觼...斜菟曖 饜蠱擊 陛螳螃撮蹂.\r\n</body>","lyra11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你們有個叫『妖魔』的種族吧！他們已經幫你賺了這麼多錢，你還來搶我們的東西！！\r\n<p>你∼真不是人！！ \r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyra11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Not satisifed with the money orcs raise...have you come here to rob us now?\r\n<p>...and you call yourself a man?\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Not satisifed with the money orcs raise...have you come here to rob us now?\r\n<p>...and you call yourself a man?\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>螃觼菟檜 弊橫棻輿朝 絲戲煎 翱貲ж朝 匙戲煎紫 賅濠塭憮 檜薯 辦葬菟 葆擊梱雖 擒驍ж楝 諮釭蹂?\r\n<p>...渡褐啻菟擎 檣除紫 嬴棲撿.\r\n</body>","lyra12-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>就算我們和妖魔打仗，也不代表著我就該相信你這個人類。\r\n<p>我看...你還是去找妖魔他們吧。<var src=\"#0\">或許會接受像你這樣的人。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyra12-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Though we are fighting against orcs, we can't even trust all humans.\r\n<p>People like you should go to the orcish fortress for a job; I'd wager that the lord of Bloodpledge <var src=\"#0\"> will accept even people like you.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra12-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Though we are fighting against orcs, we can't even trust all humans.\r\n<p>People like you should go to the orcish fortress for a job; I'd wager that the lord of Bloodpledge <var src=\"#0\"> will accept even people like you.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra12-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦葬陛 綠煙 螃觼諦 諄辦堅 氈晦朝 ж雖虜, 檣除檜塭堅 棻 圖朝 匙擎 嬴椎棲棻.\r\n<p>渡褐 偽擎 餌塋擎 離塭葬 螃觼 蹂億薹縑 陛憮 堅辨п殖塭堅 蜓п爾朝 啪 橫陽蹂? <var src=\"#0\">曖 ⑸裊輿 偽戲賊 渡褐 偽擎 餌塋紫 晦疏檜 嫡嬴還蘸等.\r\n</body>","lyra2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你從來沒聽說過嗎？這是一種在燃燒後的林地上播種的耕作方法。本來在古迪歐領地周圍的土地，因為鄰近水源的關係，是非常富有的。我們不必仰賴如此原始的方法。但是自從每塊土地都被<a link=\"lyra4\">戰爭</a>毀滅後，我們除了進入這<a link=\"lyra5\">森林</a>以外，別無他法。\r\n</body>","lyra2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Have you never heard of this? 'Tis a farming method which sows seeds on the field after burning the forest. Originally the field around the Gludio Estate was very rich from to the nearby river so we didn't have to rely on such a primitive method...but since the fields are ruined by <a link=\"lyra4\">the war</a> we have no choice but to enter <link=\"lyra5\">the forest</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Have you never heard of this? 'Tis a farming method which sows seeds on the field after burning the forest. Originally the field around the Gludio Estate was very rich from to the nearby river so we didn't have to rely on such a primitive method...but since the fields are ruined by <a link=\"lyra4\">the war</a> we have no choice but to enter <link=\"lyra5\">the forest</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>籀擠 菟橫爾衛釭蹂? 骯檜釭 膛縑 碳擊 雖艇 �� 顫幗萼 弊っ縑 碳驕 營蒂 綠猿煎 寧堯餌蒂 騁朝 堯餌徹檜雖蹂. 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖 輿滲擎 獄楚 鬼擊 郭堅 氈朝 堊璽 雖渠塭 檜楛 繫夢и 階縑憮 餌辨ж朝 錳衛 堯徹擎 餌辨й в蹂陛 橈歷朝等...譆斬縑 氈歷湍 <a link=\"lyra4\">瞪爵</a>戲煎 堯饜陛 賅舒 跤噙啪 腎橫憮 橫聶 熱 橈檜 <link=\"lyra5\">檜 膛</a>戲煎 菟橫螃啪 腎歷港棲棻. \r\n</body>","lyra3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這個『北方森林』從以前就是屬於妖魔部落所有的。那裡本來有著很多的大大小小<a link=\"lyra6\">部落</a>，但是就在大約１０年以前，阿吐巴部落的領袖－單眼沙罕，開始去征服其他的部落後，現在變成了一個很大的部落社區。 \r\n<p>他非常地擔心著他們的家『北方森林』正因為人類侵入而消失的事實。這也正是在森林中，人類和妖魔之間一直都存在著衝突的原因。不過在這裡的人也是戰爭的受害者啊，只有<a link=\"lyra8\">妖魔從戰爭的混亂中得到了利益</a>。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyra3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The North Forest belonged to the orc tribes in the past. Originally there were dozens of small and large <a link=\"lyra6\">tribes</a>, but about 10 years ago One-eyed Seghem the chief of Atuba Tribe started conquering other tribes and now 'tis one big tribal community.\r\n<p>He is greatly worried about the fact that their North Forest home is disappearing to the humans, and that 'tis why there is a constant struggle between humans and orcs in the forest. But the people here are also the victims of the war, it is only <a link=\"lyra8\">the orcs that are gaining benefits</a> from the chaos brought by the war.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The North Forest belonged to the orc tribes in the past. Originally there were dozens of small and large <a link=\"lyra6\">tribes</a>, but about 10 years ago One-eyed Seghem the chief of Atuba Tribe started conquering other tribes and now 'tis one big tribal community.\r\n<p>He is greatly worried about the fact that their North Forest home is disappearing to the humans, and that 'tis why there is a constant struggle between humans and orcs in the forest. But the people here are also the victims of the war, it is only <a link=\"lyra8\">the orcs that are gaining benefits</a> from the chaos brought by the war.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜夠 '磁薹 膛'擎 蕪陳睡攪 か熱и 螃觼 睡褶菟曖 艙羲檜歷蝗棲棻. 錳楚朝 觼堅 濛擎 熱褊偃曖 <a link=\"lyra6\">睡褶</a>檜 陪董ж堅 氈歷雖虜, 雖旎戲煎睡攪 10喇鎢 瞪睡攪 '嬴癱夥'塭朝 睡褶曖 褶濰 '諼換夢檜' 撮啞檜 檜 橾渠曖 輿蹂и 睡褶菟擊 薑犒ж晦 衛濛п憮 雖旎擎 醴棻塢 ж釭曖 睡褶 奢翕羹蒂 ⑽撩ж啪 腎歷轄. \r\n<p>斜朝 檣除菟曖 瞪爵縑 曖п 濠褐菟曖 魂曖 攪瞪檣 '磁薹 膛'檜 餌塭螳 陛堅 氈朝 匙縑 渠п 觼啪 膩溥ж堅 氈蝗棲棻. 蹂鍔擠 檜 膛 寰縑憮 檣除婁 螃觼菟除曖 碟爵檜 莒檜雖 彊朝 匙紫 夥煎 斜 陽僥檜雖蹂. ж雖虜 檜 葆擊 餌塋菟紫 斜菟婁 葆雙陛雖煎 瞪爵曖 Яп濠殮棲棻. <a link=\"lyra8\">瞪爵檜 陛螳螞 �扒儺� ぐ顫 營嘐蒂 爾堅 氈朝 匙擎 螃�鷛� 螃觼 薹</a>檜塢 蜓殮棲棻!\r\n</body>","lyra4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我認為是肯恩羅侯挑起戰爭去打這個領地的統治者－康特．古迪亞。康特．古迪亞過去曾經承諾效忠前國王戴非爾公爵，所以他理所當然地對抗肯恩羅侯。但這樣的入侵行為卻正可讓像康特．古迪亞的人引以為戒了。\r\n<p>這個戰爭在古迪亞領地中的各處留下可怕的傷痕...在下令和肯恩羅侯戰爭的期間，軍團不能離開敗毀的領地。但主要的問題在於這裡生活的人們的精神狀態。你看到那些沈迷在史萊姆賭賽上的人了嗎？\r\n<p>在這麼糟糕的情形下，也只有<a link=\"lyra7\">我的父親</a>關心這樣的狀況...\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyra4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I mean the war raised by Ken Rauhel against Count Gludia, the lord of this estate. Count Gludia promised his loyalty to the previous king Duke Dephil - so he was naturally against Ken Rauhel.\r\n<p>This war left a terrible scar everywhere in the Gludio Estate...by the order of Ken Rauhel, they can't even remove the corpses from the fields ruined during the war. But the main problem is the spirit of the people living here - have you seen those obsessed people around the Slime Race?\r\n<p>And even in this horrible situation <a link=\"lyra7\">my father</a> is only concerned about his status...\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I mean the war raised by Ken Rauhel against Count Gludia, the lord of this estate. Count Gludia promised his loyalty to the previous king Duke Dephil - so he was naturally against Ken Rauhel.\r\n<p>This war left a terrible scar everywhere in the Gludio Estate...by the order of Ken Rauhel, they can't even remove the corpses from the fields ruined during the war. But the main problem is the spirit of the people living here - have you seen those obsessed people around the Slime Race?\r\n<p>And even in this horrible situation <a link=\"lyra7\">my father</a> is only concerned about his status...\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>奩諾 騰 塭辦⑦檜 檜夠曖 獄楚 艙輿艘湍 旋瑞蛤嬴奢縑 渠п 橾戲鑑 瞪爵 蜓殮棲棻. 旋瑞蛤嬴奢擎 摹渠諾 菽觼 等в縑啪 醱撩擊 夥耀 艙輿煎賦 奩諾曖 撥薑縑 渠п憮朝 奩渠曖 殮濰擊 陛雖堅 氈歷雖蹂. 斜楚憮 獄爾晦煎 藹楞擊 渡и 匏棲棻. \r\n<p>檜廓 瞪爵擎 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖 陝雖縑 籀霤и 鼻籀蒂 陴啣轄...瞪爵縑 �硌遠� わъ陛 脹 喱寧擎 奩諾曖 貲縑 評塭 衛羹褻離 纂辦雖 跤ж堅 氈朝 鼻鷓檜棲. ж雖虜 陛濰 僥薯檣 匙擎 艙雖 輿團菟曖 薑褐檜 Яわп螳陛堅 氈棻朝 匙殮棲棻. 渡褐紫 旋瑞蛞 葆擊 蕙縑 儅曹 紫夢濰縑憮 翮惜ж堅 氈朝 餌塋菟擊 爾懊戲賊 憲啊雖蹂?\r\n<p>艙雖陛 檜溢啪 綠霤и 鼻�窒� 籀п氈朝等紫 <a link=\"lyra7\">嬴幗椒</a>眷憮朝 盪溢啪 渡褐曖 雖嬪縑虜 餵雜ж衛棲...\r\n</body>","lyra5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>人們稱這裡是『北方森林』，不過它最初的名字卻是『黑色森林』。也許這是因為妖魔部落居住在那森林的關係，所以才被如此命名。而從古迪歐領地或歐瑞移居來這裡的人，過去以砍伐森林來建造房子或者製造木炭。幸好這裡有著天生優良的氣候因素，所以他們這樣的行為從不會嚴重地損害到森林的本身...然而因為在戰爭時期，對圓木的需求與日俱增，再加上像我們這樣必須為了得到可耕種的土地而燃燒森林的人，樹木也就開始減少。\r\n<p>我知道去破壞這樣的地方很不好...但是我們也是為生活才這樣做。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyra5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>People call this the 'North Forest', but it's original name is 'Black Forest'. Perhaps it is so named because of the orc tribes in the forest. People from Gludio Estate or Oren used to cut the trees in this forest to build houses or make fuel. But, mainly due to good weather, they never inflicted significant damage to the forest itself...but the trees started to dwindle due to the increasing demand for logs during the war and the people like us who burnt the the forest for fields.\r\n<p>I know, I know, it is bad to destroy the forest...but we are doing it only to live.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>People call this the 'North Forest', but it's original name is 'Black Forest'. Perhaps it is so named because of the orc tribes in the forest. People from Gludio Estate or Oren used to cut the trees in this forest to build houses or make fuel. But, mainly due to good weather, they never inflicted significant damage to the forest itself...but the trees started to dwindle due to the increasing demand for logs during the war and the people like us who burnt the the forest for fields.\r\n<p>I know, I know, it is bad to destroy the forest...but we are doing it only to live.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜夠 餌塋菟擎 斜傖 '磁薹 膛'檜塭堅 睡腦雖虜, 錳楚 檜葷擎 '匐擎 膛'殮棲棻. 嬴葆紫 檜 膛縑 蕪陳睡攪 髦堅 氈朝 螃觼 睡褶菟 陽僥縑 稱罹霞 檜葷檜啊雖蹂. 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖釭 檜 膛 磁薹曖 螃溶縑 餌朝 餌塋菟檜 螃楚瞪睡攪 檜 膛曖 釭鼠蒂 漆橫棻陛 翱猿蒂 噙剪釭 餵擊 騁朝 營猿煎 噙堆 ц雖蹂. ж雖虜 錶釩 晦�襤� 謠堅 п憮 雖旎梱雖 膛 濠羹曖 敘賅縑 Яп陛 陛朝 橾擎 橈歷朝等...譆斬 啗樓腎朝 瞪爵戲煎 跡營曖 熱蹂陛 晝隸ж堅, 傳 檜 葆擊 偽擎 �倣�襟檜 棺橫釭賊憮 釭鼠陛 晝問ж啪 還橫菟晦 衛濛ц轄.\r\n<p>棻艇 謙褶曖 魂攪蒂 だ惚ж朝 匙檜 釭際棻朝 匙擎 憲雖虜...辦葬紫 髦晦 嬪п憮朝 橫聶 熱 橈朝 橾檣勘蹂...\r\n</body>","lyra6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>就我所知，在這個森林中一共有五個不一樣的妖魔部落。首先提到的是沙罕的阿吐巴部落，他們可以說是部落的領導者，然後是那魯加戰爭部落，在那裡每個人都稱得上是戰士。還有倚靠阿吐巴的羅孚部落，以及神秘的都達瑪拉部落，聽說在那裡有一些魔法師...而最後則是正在阿吐巴部落陰影之下受難的甘地部落。\r\n<p>根據我讀的書，在這裡還有其他的比較小的部落。特別是那不知羞恥的<a link=\"lyra9\">艾妮部落，</a>，他們利用刺激賭博活動來賺錢，在這附近贏得惡名。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyra6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As far as I know there are five orc tribes of any size in this forest. The first is Seghem's Atuba tribe which is the leader of the tries, and then Neruga - the battle tribe where every orc is a warrior from birth.  Next comes Rova, which depends on Atuba, and Mysterious Duda-Mara which is rumored to have shamans within it. Finally, the weakling Gandi tribe, which is suffering under the Atuba rule.\r\n<p>According to the book I read, there are other, smaller tribes here. Especially the shameless <a link=\"lyra9\">Agni tribe</a> which is making money by inciting gambling activity - quite famous around here.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As far as I know there are five orc tribes of any size in this forest. The first is Seghem's Atuba tribe which is the leader of the tries, and then Neruga - the battle tribe where every orc is a warrior from birth.  Next comes Rova, which depends on Atuba, and Mysterious Duda-Mara which is rumored to have shamans within it. Finally, the weakling Gandi tribe, which is suffering under the Atuba rule.\r\n<p>According to the book I read, there are other, smaller tribes here. Especially the shameless <a link=\"lyra9\">Agni tribe</a> which is making money by inciting gambling activity - quite famous around here.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>薯陛 憲堅 氈朝 夥縑 評腦賊 檜 膛曖 螃觼 睡褶醞 嶸溘и 匙擎 棻撓 睡褶 薑紫 腎蹂. 辦摹 睡褶 奢翕羹 瞪羹蒂 檜莖朝 葬渦問檣 撮啞曖 嬴癱夥 睡褶檜 氈堅, 斜 壽縑 睡褶錳 瞪羹陛 瞪餌塭朝 瞪癱 睡褶 啻瑞陛, 嬴癱夥 睡褶縑 晦儅ж堅 氈朝 煎夥, 睡褶錳醞縑 輿獎擊 噙朝 濠紫 氈棻朝 模僥檜 氈朝 熱熱眷郭曖 睡褶 舒棻-葆塭...斜葬堅 葆雖虞戲煎 嬴癱夥 睡褶 纂ж縑憮 夢п嫡堅 氈棻朝 除蛤 睡褶.\r\n<p>薯陛 檗擎 疇縑 曖ж賊 檜 棻撓 睡褶 檜諼縑紫 撮溘檜 擒и 睡褶菟檜 棻熱 氈棻堅 м棲棻. 雖旎 遠遠蝶毀啪紫 檣除菟曖 餌ч褕擊 褻濰п憮 絲擊 弊堅 氈朝 <a link=\"lyra9\">嬴斜棲 睡褶</a>菟擎 檜 斬寞縑憮朝 紮 嶸貲ж濫嬴蹂?\r\n</body>","lyra7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>以賽馬利．格蘭因，凱登城的總管、這個領地裡面最有影響力的人及我的父親...。我的父親曾經是這個領地的一個貴族，並服侍凱登．古迪亞。但是當康特．古迪亞被肯恩羅侯迫害的時候，他卻選擇成為被羅侯派遣的一個統治者的管家。因為我實在不能夠原諒他， 我便帶著一些農夫來在這裡，放棄了我的地位成為一個騎士。\r\n<p>我知道我是在逃避現實。但是我不能放棄正在受到戰爭迫害的人們。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyra7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ishmael Gregheim, the most powerful person in this estate, is my father. He was a noble of this province and served the Count Gludia, but when the Count was persecuted by Ken Rauhel my father was chosen as a chamberlain by Ken Rauhel. Because I couldn't forgive him, I came to here with some farmers, leaving behind my past and status as a Knight.\r\n<p>Though I ran, I find I can't desert the people suffering from the war.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ishmael Gregheim, the most powerful person in this estate, is my father. He was a noble of this province and served the Count Gludia, but when the Count was persecuted by Ken Rauhel my father was chosen as a chamberlain by Ken Rauhel. Because I couldn't forgive him, I came to here with some farmers, leaving behind my past and status as a Knight.\r\n<p>Though I ran, I find I can't desert the people suffering from the war.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 艙雖曖 譆堅 掏溘濠曖 檜葷擎 檜蝶葆縣 斜溯斜ж歜...斜碟檜 盪曖 嬴幗雖褊棲棻. 嬴幗雖眷憮朝 獄楚 旋瑞蛤嬴 寥濛擊 賅衛湍 檜 雖寞曖 ��褶檜樟朝等, 旋瑞蛤嬴 寥濛檜 騰 塭辦⑦縑 曖п 熨羶渡ж啪 腎濠 埠夥煎 檜 雖寞縑憮曖 艙щ溘擊 寞ぬ煎 騰 塭辦⑦縑 曖п だ唯脹 艙輿縑啪 衛謙濰戲煎 嫦饕腎歷蝗棲棻. 盪朝 斜楝и 嬴幗雖蒂 辨憮й 熱陛 橈橫憮 獄楚曖 晦餌 褐碟擊 幗葬堅 檜夠縑憮 堯團菟婁 л眷 髦堅 氈雖蹂.\r\n<p>唸措 盪朝 ⑷褒煎睡攪 紫蜂耀 匏棲棻. 斜勘 憲堅朝 氈雖虜...瞪爵曖 �釋索儺虞� 檣п 堅鱔嫡堅 氈朝 餌塋菟擊 渦檜鼻 賅艇繫 ж堅 氈擊 熱虜擎 橈歷橫蹂.\r\n</body>","lyra8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>妖魔部落一致堅持我們是侵略者，而他們則是受害人。所以我們之間一直都有些小衝突。即使如此，他們也不會承認他們靠賭博來賺錢！雖然葛拉他不承認，我也是確信那些金幣一定被在戰爭中了。\r\n<p>如果你是一個冒險家。拜託你∼切斷史萊姆比賽和在『北方森林』的歐西思森林之間的金錢管道！我聽說在那夜晚的時候，一些妖魔們會帶著裝滿金幣的袋子，進入這森林之內且消失。我敢說他們正在將利潤從比賽運到歐西斯森林去。 \r\n<p>如果你抓到他們的其中之一，並且帶來那<a link=\"lyra10\">圖騰</a>當做證據，我會從家中拿出一個寶物給你。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyra8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Orc tribes are insisting in unison that we are invaders and they are the victims...that's why there are constant skirmishes going on. Even though they won't admit it, they are raising the money by gambling!  I'm sure that those adena are being used for war.\r\n<p>If you are an adventurer, please disrupt the money line between the slime race and the orcish North Forest!  I heard that during the night, some orcs carrying bags of adena, disappear into the forest. I'd wager that they are transferring the profits from the race to the orcish fortress.\r\n<p>If you get one of them and bring me the <a link=\"lyra10\">totem</a> as an evidence, I'll give you one of the treasures from my family.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Orc tribes are insisting in unison that we are invaders and they are the victims...that's why there are constant skirmishes going on. Even though they won't admit it, they are raising the money by gambling!  I'm sure that those adena are being used for war.\r\n<p>If you are an adventurer, please disrupt the money line between the slime race and the orcish North Forest!  I heard that during the night, some orcs carrying bags of adena, disappear into the forest. I'd wager that they are transferring the profits from the race to the orcish fortress.\r\n<p>If you get one of them and bring me the <a link=\"lyra10\">totem</a> as an evidence, I'll give you one of the treasures from my family.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>螃觼 睡褶菟擎 ж釭偽檜 檣除菟檜 橾寞瞳檣 陛п濠堅, 螃觼朝 Яп濠塭堅 輿濰ж堅 氈蝗棲棻. 斜楚憮 嬴霜梱雖紫 檜 膛縑憮朝 檣除婁 螃觼曖 鼠溘 碟爵檜 莒檜雖 彊堅 氈轄. ж雖虜 螃觼菟擎 辦葬菟縑啪朝 斜溢啪 蜓ж賊憮紫 瞪爵曖 �扒儺� ぐ顫 路楚 紫夢っ擊 弊罹憮 絲擊 弊堅 氈棻堅蹂! 堅塭 濠褐擎 睡薑ж堅 氈雖虜, 碟貲�� 斜 絲擎 螃觼菟曖 捱濠旎戲煎 噙罹雖堅 氈擊 疏縑蹂.\r\n<p>渡褐檜 虜擒 賅я濠塭賊...睡饕萄董棲棻. 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶諦 '磁薹 膛'曖 螃觼 蹂億 餌檜曖 濠旎摹擊 莒橫輿撮蹂! 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶濰縑憮 陛莠噶 嫘縑 絲輿該棲蒂 霞 橾欽曖 螃觼菟檜 檜薹 膛戲煎 餌塭雖堆 и棻朝 檜撿晦蒂 菟擎 瞳檜 氈蝗棲棻. 夥煎 斜喪戮菟檜 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶曖 熱櫛旎擊 螃觼 蹂億煎 褒橫釭腦堅 氈擊疏縑蹂. \r\n<p>斜喪戮菟擊 濩嬴憮 斜 隸剪煎 喪戮菟曖 <a link=\"lyra10\">饜蠱</a>擊 陛螳螃褐棻賊 薯陛 餵擊 釭螢 陽 偽檜 陛雖堅 釭螞 盪�� 餵寰曖 爾僭醞 ж釭蒂 萄葬啊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","lyra9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我敢說你一定在古丁城鎮看過史萊姆競賽吧！現在經營比賽的妖魔是葛拉．艾妮，牠是艾妮部落的領袖。 \r\n<p>雖然那是個成員少於２０人的一個小小的部落，不過自從戰爭後，他們開始這種比賽，讓他們完全不愁吃穿，甚至還比勝過阿吐巴部落過得還要富裕。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyra9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You probably saw the slime race at Gludin town. The orc who is running the race is called Gora Agni, and is the chief of Agni tribe.\r\n<p>Though 'tis a very small tribe with less than 20 members, after opening the game after War, they have revelled in luxury and are enjoying a far richer life than the Atuba Tribe.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You probably saw the slime race at Gludin town. The orc who is running the race is called Gora Agni, and is the chief of Agni tribe.\r\n<p>Though 'tis a very small tribe with less than 20 members, after opening the game after War, they have revelled in luxury and are enjoying a far richer life than the Atuba Tribe.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyra9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐紫 旋瑞蛞 葆擊 蕙縑 氈朝 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶朝 爾懊啊轄? 斜 溯檜蝶蒂 遴艙ж堅 氈朝 螃觼陛 夥煎 堅塭 嬴斜棲, 嬴斜棲 睡褶曖 褶濰檜縑蹂. \r\n<p>睡褶檜塭堅朝 п紫 瞪羹陛 20貲檜 瓣 寰腎朝 濛擎 敘賅檜雖虜, 瞪爵 �� 盪 濰餌蒂 衛濛ж堅 釭憮朝 檣除菟檜 餌辨ж朝 螞乾 僭勒菟擊 餌菟罹 檜薯朝 嬴癱夥 睡褶 跤雖彊啪 髦堅 氈棻渦捱蹂.\r\n</body>","lyraev1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你...看起來像一個冒險家。\r\n<p>拜託！我們需要你的幫忙！\r\n<p>從我的村莊趕來的援軍現在正與妖魔部落對戰。請助我一臂之力。我會<a link=\"lyraEv2\">付錢</a>不會讓你做白工的。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1\">與萊拉訂定契約</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyraEv1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You look like an adventurer.\r\n<p>Please, we need your help!\r\n<p>The guards from my village are fighting with orc tribes right now, please aid us. I'll <a link=\"lyraEv2\">pay</a> for your efforts!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1\">Contract with Lyra</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","lyraEv1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You look like an adventurer.\r\n<p>Please, we need your help!\r\n<p>The guards from my village are fighting with orc tribes right now, please aid us. I'll <a link=\"lyraEv2\">pay</a> for your efforts!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1\">Contract with Lyra</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","lyraEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐...ч儀擊 爾嬴ж棲 賅я濠捱蹂.\r\n<p>睡饕殮棲棻, 盪�騆� 覬 紫諦輿撮蹂!\r\n<p>雖旎 檜 膛 橾渠縑憮 盪�� 葆擊 濠唳欽婁 螃觼 睡褶菟 餌檜縑 諄遺檜 弊橫螺蝗棲棻. <a link=\"lyraEv2\">爾熱</a>朝 萄萵纔棲 檜 諄遺縑 霤陛п輿撮蹂!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1\">塭檜塭諦 啗擒и棻</a>\r\n</body>","lyraev2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如同你所見，我的村莊很窮，所以我們不能付你很多錢…\r\n<p>你知道，在這森林裡的妖魔被五大種族統治。阿吐巴、那魯加、羅孚、都達瑪拉和甘地。牠們不像平常的妖魔一樣分居，雖然崇拜不同的圖騰，但現在他們就像是同一個部落般地生活著。 \r\n<p>將圖騰拿來給我，我會給你一些賞金。因為這裡的妖魔總是帶著他們的圖騰，殺了他們就能得到圖騰。阿吐巴的圖騰值２００個金幣，那魯加的值１００個，羅孚和都達瑪拉的值５０個，甘地的值３０個。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyraEv2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As you can see, my village is a poor one, so we can't pay you much...\r\n<p>The orcs in this forest are ruled by five large tribes: Atuba, Neruga, Rova, Duda-Mara, and Gandi.  Unlike usual orcs, who do not tend to gather in groups, they have been living as tribes - each worshipping different totems.\r\n<p>I'll give you a bounty for those totems; because the orcs here always carry their totems, it'll be proof that you killed them. I'll give you 200 adena for Atuba, 100 for Neruga, 50 for Rova and Duda-Mara, and 30 for Gandi.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyraEv2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As you can see, my village is a poor one, so we can't pay you much...\r\n<p>The orcs in this forest are ruled by five large tribes: Atuba, Neruga, Rova, Duda-Mara, and Gandi.  Unlike usual orcs, who do not tend to gather in groups, they have been living as tribes - each worshipping different totems.\r\n<p>I'll give you a bounty for those totems; because the orcs here always carry their totems, it'll be proof that you killed them. I'll give you 200 adena for Atuba, 100 for Neruga, 50 for Rova and Duda-Mara, and 30 for Gandi.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyraEv2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>爾衛棻衛Я 陛陪и 葆擊檜塭 贖 絲擊 萄萵 熱朝 橈蝗棲棻虜...\r\n<p>嬴衛啊雖虜 ⑷營 檜 膛曖 螃觼朝 棻撓曖 贖 睡褶縑 曖п 鱔纂腎堅 氈蝗棲棻. 嬴癱夥, 啻瑞陛, 煎夥, 舒棻-葆塭, 斜葬堅 除蛤...贖 鼠葬蒂 虜菟雖 彊朝 螃觼曖 橾奩瞳檣 撩韓婁朝 棻腦啪, 檜菟擎 螃楚瞪睡攪 噢褶葆棻 ж釭曖 饜蠱擊 撰晦朝 睡褶 儅�偯� п 諮港棲棻. \r\n<p>檜菟曖 饜蠱 ж釭 葆棻 ⑷鼻旎擊 萄葬晦煎 ж雖蹂. 檜夠曖 螃觼菟擎 棺 濠晦 睡褶曖 饜蠱擊 陛雖堅 棻棲棲 п渡 睡褶曖 螃觼蒂 避檜賊 斜 睡褶曖 饜蠱 ж釭蒂 橢擊 熱 氈擊 匏棲棻. 嬴癱夥 饜蠱擎 200 嬴等釭, 啻瑞陛朝 100, 煎夥諦 舒棻-葆塭朝 50, 斜葬堅 除蛤朝 30嬴等釭 萄葬啊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","lyraev3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>非常感謝你。\r\n<p>如果你同意，你可以一直幫助我們直到戰爭結束嗎？\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1yes\">領取賞金和重新訂契約</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1no\">領取賞金和終止契約</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","lyraEv3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Thank you very much!\r\n<p>Can you help us further until the war ends?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1yes\">Get bounty and renew contract</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1no\">Get bounty and end contract</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","lyraEv3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Thank you very much!\r\n<p>Can you help us further until the war ends?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1yes\">Get bounty and renew contract</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1no\">Get bounty and end contract</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","lyraEv3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>薑蜓 馬餌м棲棻.\r\n<p>惘雛戲衛棻賊, 檜廓 瞪癱陛 部陳 陽梱雖 褻旎 渦 盪�騆� 紫諦輿衛雖 彊啊橫蹂?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1yes\">薑骯�� 營啗擒и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1no\">薑骯�� 啗擒擊 部魚棻</a>\r\n</body>","lyraev4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>非常感謝你。\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1no\">得到賞金</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyraEv4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Thank you very much.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1no\">Get Bounty</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","lyraEv4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Thank you very much.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1no\">Get Bounty</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","lyraEv4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>薑蜓 馬餌м棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"contract1no\">薑骯и棻</a>\r\n</body>","lyraev5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>萊拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我跟你說過的酬勞在這裡，拿去吧！\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","lyraev5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is your promised reward.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyraev5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Lyra:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is your promised reward.\r\n</body>\r\n","lyraEv5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>塭檜塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>擒樓и 爾熱朝 罹晦 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","maeno1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>來呦∼來呦∼賽狗比賽就要開始囉！如果運氣好，一獲千金是很容易的事。\r\n<br>趕快下注喔∼\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">查詢參賽狗的記錄</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">買票</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣中獎的票</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hey~ hey~ A crazy race with crazy dogs will begin now. If you place your bets well you can make a fortune.\r\n<br>Hurry up and come bet~ \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">Check each dog's record</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">Buy dog race ticket</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell winning ticket</a>\r\n</body>","maeno1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hey~ hey~ A crazy race with crazy dogs will begin now. If you place your bets well you can make a fortune.\r\n<br>Hurry up and come bet~ \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">Check each dog's record</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">Buy dog race ticket</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell winning ticket</a>\r\n</body>","maeno1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>④檜~ ④檜~ 雖旎睡攪 嘐耀 偃菟檜 り纂朝 嘐耀 韓輿陛 衛濛脹棻掘. 澀 虜 勘賊 橾�� 繭旎紫 翎檜 嬴棲雖.\r\n<br>橫憮 勘塭掘~ \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">陝 偃曖 瞪瞳擊 獄棻</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"buy\">溯檜蝶 じ鰍擊 骯棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">渡繩 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","maeno2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>今天的比賽到此為止！明天日出後會開始新比賽，今天大家先回去休息吧∼\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There are no more races today! More races are scheduled for tomorrow, so please come back then. Have a nice day!\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There are no more races today! More races are scheduled for tomorrow, so please come back then. Have a nice day!\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 螃棺曖 唳晦朝 賅舒 部陬蝗棲棻! 棻擠 唳晦朝 陳檜 嫩嬴撿 衛濛ж棲 螃棺擎 檜虜 賅舒 給嬴陛 輿撮蹂~\r\n</body>","maeno3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>現在比賽正在進行中！要買票的人等一下場再買吧！\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There is a race going on right now!  Those who want to buy  tickets must wait a little while!\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There is a race going on right now!  Those who want to buy  tickets must wait a little while!\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 雖旎擎 唳晦醞殮棲棻! 棻擠 唳晦 ル蒂 餌褒 碟擎 褻旎虜 晦棻葬撮蹂!\r\n</body>","maeno4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>今天出賽的狗狀態如下...\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff face=\"細明體\"><p>名稱&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;狀態&nbsp;勝率</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">&nbsp;          <var src=\"#1\">     &nbsp;<var src=\"#2\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#3\">&nbsp;          <var src=\"#4\">     &nbsp;<var src=\"#5\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#6\">&nbsp;          <var src=\"#7\">&nbsp;     <var src=\"#8\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#9\">&nbsp;          <var src=\"#10\">&nbsp;     <var src=\"#11\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#12\">&nbsp;          <var src=\"#13\">&nbsp;     <var src=\"#14\"></p></font>\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! The condition of today's contestant dogs are...\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff size=14 face=\"courier new\"><p>Name&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Status&nbsp;&nbsp;Avg.</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#2\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#3\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#5\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#6\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#7\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#8\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#9\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#10\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#11\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#12\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#13\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#14\"></font>\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! The condition of today's contestant dogs are...\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff size=14 face=\"courier new\"><p>Name&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Status&nbsp;&nbsp;Avg.</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#2\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#3\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#5\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#6\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#7\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#8\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#9\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#10\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#11\">\r\n<p align=left><var src=\"#12\">&nbsp;\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#13\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#14\"></font>\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 螃棺 轎瞪й 偃菟曖 鼻鷓朝 蜓檜轄...\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff face=\"掉葡羹\"><p>檜葷&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;鼻鷓&nbsp;蝓睦</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#1\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#2\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#3\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#4\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#5\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#6\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#7\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#8\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#9\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#10\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#11\"></p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#12\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#13\">&nbsp;<var src=\"#14\"></p></font>\r\n</body>","maeno5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>現在正在準備下一場比賽請稍等!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">賣中獎的票</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! We are preparing for the next race. Please wait a moment until all preparations are completed!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell winning ticket</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! We are preparing for the next race. Please wait a moment until all preparations are completed!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">Sell winning ticket</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","maeno5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 雖旎擎 棻擠 溯檜蝶蒂 遽綠ж堅 氈朝 醞殮棲棻. 遽綠陛 部陳 陽梱雖 濡衛虜 晦棻葬撮蹂!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"sell\">渡繩 じ鰍擊 っ棻</a>\r\n</body>","malcom1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>瑪寇恩 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n聽說這個村莊往南邊一直走下去，會出現以森林和湖圍起來的美麗都市。我也想離開這都市住在美麗的地方...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","malcom1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蜓巍 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n檜 葆擊縑憮 陴薹戲煎 軀 頂溥陛賊 膛婁 �ˉ鷊� 萃楝論檣 嬴葷棻遴 紫衛陛 釭顫陪棻朝捱. 釭紫 檜 餉虞и 紫衛蒂 集釭憮 斜楛 夠縑憮 и 廓 髦嬴爾堅 談橫...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mandel1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>曼德:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n冠石是個很不錯的地方，治安很好，物資豐富，也有娛樂地區...。我不知道亞丁國有多大，旦一定比不上冠石城市。\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mandel1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mandel :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nGiran is a wonderful place to live. We got strong guards, lots of resources, lots of entertainment... I don't know about the capital city of Aden but do you think it's better than here?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mandel1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mandel :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nGiran is a wonderful place to live. We got strong guards, lots of resources, lots of entertainment... I don't know about the capital city Aden but do you think it's better than here?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mandel1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>虜筐 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n晦塢擎 薑蜓 髦晦 謠擎 夠檜雖. 纂寰婁 唳綠紫 ががж堅, 僭濠紫 Ё褶ж堅, 啾剪葬紫 Ё睡ж堅... 諾措曖 熱紫 嬴筆檜 橡葆釭 贖 紫衛檣雖朝 路塭紫 罹晦虜 ж啊橫?\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","manus1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>曼那斯 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n不覺得在血盟小屋工作的女僕很漂亮嗎？我喜歡像她們那樣溫柔的女生...哈哈哈。若我有錢，一定馬上買棟血盟小屋。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","manus1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>望葬樹 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n嬴雖お曖縑憮 瑰餌ж朝 ж喪菟 霤 蕨際棻堅 儅陝ж雖 彊釭? 陪 斜溢啪 棻模夠и 罹濠陛 謠嬴... �暪暪�. 釭紫 絲虜 氈歷棻賊 餵и瓣 濰虜 ж朝勒等 蜓檜撿. 縑��...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>馬賓：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>一定要好好地保護你養的寵物。不僅如此，還要負責才行！\r\n<p>不過當有事情發生時，你可以把牠們委託給我保管。每隻收你<var src=\"#0\">金幣！\r\n<p>當然囉！我只幫你照顧你養的寵物！！我可不照顧那些奇奇怪怪的東西的！\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> 保管寵物</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> 取回寵物</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問養育動物的方法</a>\r\n</body>","marbin1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Marbin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are responsible for your own animals.\r\n<p>But, if something comes up, you can trust them to me at only <var src=\"#0\"> adenas per pet.\r\n<p>Ah, of course I can only take animals you trained yourself. I won't take enchanted monsters. They are too dangerous.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Trust Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Marbin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are responsible for your own animals.\r\n<p>But, if something comes up, you can trust them to me at only <var src=\"#0\"> adenas per pet.\r\n<p>Ah, of course I can only take animals you trained yourself. I won't take enchanted monsters. They are too dangerous.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> Trust Animals</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> Take out Animals</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming wild animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>葆綴:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠晦陛 望菟檣 翕僭擎 部梱雖 疇歜擊 雖堅 爾�ㄧ� п撿雖.\r\n<p>凳, ж雖虜 薑 橫聶 熱 橈朝 橾檜 儅啣擊 陽朝 釭и纔 蜆晦紫煙 ж衛螃, и葆葬渡 <var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭縑 蜆嬴輿雖.\r\n<p>嬴, 僭煩 頂陛 蜆朝 匙擎 渡褐檜 霜蕾 望菟檣 翕僭 閨檜螃. 橫蛤憮 葆徹戲煎 �次� 跨蝶攪 評嬪朝 蜆雖 彊啊棻堅.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a action=\"depositnpc\"> 翕僭擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"withdrawnpc\"> 翕僭擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>馬賓：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你等我一下啊！我處理一下事情就馬上就過去。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問養育寵物的方法</a>\r\n</body>","marbin2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Marbin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh - just a moment. I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Marbin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh - just a moment. I'll be there as soon as I finish this.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>葆綴:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴, 褻旎虜 晦棻溥蹂. 檜 橾虜 部頂堅 埠 陛葬棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>馬賓:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哇勒？你沒有在我這寄養過動物。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問馴養動物的方法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Marbin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You never stored any animals with me!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Marbin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You never stored any animals with me!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>葆綴:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橡溯? 渡褐擎 翕僭擊 蜆曹 瞳檜 橈朝等蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>馬賓：</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>咦？你又沒有寵物怎麼委託我？\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">詢問養育寵物的方法</a>\r\n</body>","marbin4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Marbin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't even have animals to store!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Marbin:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't even have animals to store!\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">Ask about taming animals</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marbin4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>葆綴:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橡溯? 蜆望 翕僭紫 橈戲賊憮 劂 蜆曹棻朝 剪蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n <a link=\"helpnpc\">翕僭擊 望菟檜朝 徹擊 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","marcenary2-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<p>城主公佈的下一回攻城時間為 <var src=\"#0\">年 <var src=\"#1\">月 <var src=\"#2\">日 <var src=\"#3\">時 <var src=\"#4\">分。想要城堡就來吧！\r\n</body>\r\n","margaret1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>瑪格瑞特:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哈囉...。今天的食物都很不錯。歡迎還沒吃飯的人光臨。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","margaret1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Margaret the Grocery Shop Owner :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here here... We have lots of delicious foods. If you're hungry come and try them out.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","margaret1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Margaret the Grocery Shop Owner :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here here... We have lots of delicious foods. If you're hungry come and try it out.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","margaret1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衝猿ヶ鼻檣 葆陛滇 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠濠... 螃棺紫 蛻氈朝 擠衝菟檜 號檜 氈蝗棲棻. 轎轎ж褐 碟菟擎 и 廓 諦憮 萄敷爾撮蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","margaret2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>瑪格瑞特:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我不會賣道具給你這種人。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","margaret2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Margaret the grocery Shop Owner :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I will not even sell a crumb of bread to your kind.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","margaret2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Margaret the grocery Shop Owner :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I will not even sell a crumb of bread to your kind.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","margaret2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衝猿ヶ鼻檣 葆陛滇 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐偽擎 餌塋縑啪朝 誧 и褻陝紫 つ 熱 橈橫蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","mayer-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>邁爾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎光臨。\r\n<p>在冠石的道具店什麼都有，從生活用品起到具有特殊功能的卷軸等等。甚麼都有賣喔！！\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"mayer3\">詢問最近的物價</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mayer-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mayer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome customer.\r\n<p>There is nothing we don't sell in this shop. We offer life's essential items and special scrolls with unimaginable powers.\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"mayer3\">Ask about the price</a>\r\n</body>","mayer-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mayer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome customer.\r\n<p>There is nothing we don't sell in this shop. Life's essential items and special scrolls with unimaginable powers.\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"mayer3\">Ask about the price</a>\r\n</body>","mayer-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>詭檜橫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃褊澗. 槳椒.\r\n<p>晦塢曖 濩�俯▼□� 鏃晝ж雖 彊朝 鼻ヶ檜塢 橈港棲棻. 儅�� в熱ヶ睡攪 樵羶陪 晦棟檜 氬曹 輿僥憮梱雖 鼠歙檜萇 氈棻掘蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"mayer3\">蹂闈 僭陛縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","mayer.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>詭檜橫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃褊澗. 槳椒.\r\n<p>晦塢曖 濩�俯▼□� 鏃晝ж雖 彊朝 鼻ヶ檜塢 橈港棲棻. 儅�� в熱ヶ睡攪 樵羶陪 晦棟檜 氬曹 輿僥憮梱雖 鼠歙檜萇 氈棻掘蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"mayer3\">蹂闈 僭陛縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","mayer2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>邁爾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>請你離開這裡，商人也有尊嚴。\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","mayer2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mayer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Get out of my store before you make me angry. Merchants also have some pride.\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","mayer2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mayer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Get out of my store before you make me angry. Merchants also have some pride.\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","mayer2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>詭檜橫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>謠啪 蜓й 陽 頂 陛啪縑憮 釭陛衛螃. 鼻檣紫 貲蕨塭朝 匙檜 氈模.\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","mayer3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>邁爾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在的稅率<font fg=ffffff>是<var src=\"#0\">％</font>。東西賣的越多，越覺得損失。\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","mayer3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mayer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font> is the rate. I think I am losing money as I sell items.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","mayer3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mayer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font> is the rate. I think I am loosing money as I sell items.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","mayer3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>詭檜橫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>檜塭螃. 僭勒擊 つ賊 つ熱煙 槳п虜 爾朝 匙 偽欽 蜓檜螃.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","mellin-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>梅林：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>來來來，歡迎光臨！今天的東西也很豐富喔！</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n<a action=\"mellin3\">詢問最近的市價。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mellin-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mellin:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Come in, come in! We have plenty today!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","mellin-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mellin:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Come in, come in! We have plenty today!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","mellin-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>詬萼:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠-濠, 橫憮螃撮蹂! 螃棺紫 僭勒擎 Ё撩м棲棻!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P><br>\r\n</body>","mellin1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>梅林：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>喂，你以為你是誰啊？你把我們商店看成是什麼！你說什麼就要給你什麼嗎？像你這樣的流氓，我不賣東西給你！</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mellin1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mellin:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey, look! What do you think my shop is!? I have nothing to sell to you, scoundrel!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mellin1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mellin:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey, look! What do you think my shop is!? I have nothing to sell to you, scoundrel!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mellin1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>詬萼:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴~棲 檜瑭蹂! 辦葬 陛啪蒂 劂煎爾堅 諦憮 僭勒擊 頂堤塭 葆塭 ж朝剪撿!? 渡褐偽擎 碳榆寡и纔 つ 僭勒擎 橈橫!</p>\r\n</body>","mellin3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>梅林：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在只有這樣而已，做<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>的事，能算是什麼好事嗎？說實在的，我們的村莊幾乎沒有受風木之城的保護，然而他們卻總是企圖向我們收取稅金。\r\n</body>\r\n","mellin3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mellin:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Nowadays the tax is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>. What good could come from the things <var src=\"#1\"> does?  We are not even protected by Windawood's reign...but they never forget the tax.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mellin3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mellin:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Nowadays the tax is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>. What good could come from the things <var src=\"#1\"> does?  We are not even protected by Windawood's reign...but they never forget the tax.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mellin3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>詬萼:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂闈擎 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>薑紫轄. <var src=\"#1\">檜 ж朝 橾檜棲 凳 謠擎 橾 氈啊橫蹂? 餌褒 辦葬 葆擊擎 孺棻辦萄滄曖 爾�ㄤ� 剪曖 嫡堅 氈雖 彊擎等...撮旎 ж釭朝 部啻輿啪 嫡嬴除棻棲梱.</p>\r\n</body>","mercenary1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>嘿，你現在正在問統治者的名字嗎？你竟然敢忘記你的統治者的名字？好吧，我告訴你，目前的統治者是來自<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font>血盟的<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\">殿下</font>，別再忘記了！\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">問下一次圍城的時間</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mercenary1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hey, are you asking the name of the Lord now? How dare you forget?\r\n<br>\r\nWell, I'll tell you. The current lord is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font> from the Bloodpledge <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font>. Don't forget again!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">Ask the time for next siege</a>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","mercenary1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>Hey, are you asking the name of the Lord now? How dare you forget?\r\n<br>\r\nWell, I'll tell you. The current lord is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font> from the Bloodpledge <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font>. Don't forget again!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">Ask the time for next siege</a>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","mercenary1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>⑷營 檜 雖寞曖 艙輿朝 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\"></font> ⑸裊 轎褐曖 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>椒檜衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","mercenary2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>如果你要向統治者挑戰請在<var src=\"#0\">年<var src=\"#1\">月<var src=\"#2\">日<var src=\"#3\">時<var src=\"#4\">分的時候再來吧！\r\n</body>\r\n","mercenary2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>If you want to challenge the Lord come at <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#0\"> <var src=\"#3\">o'clock.\r\n</body>\r\n","mercenary2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>If you want to challenge the Lord come at <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#0\"> <var src=\"#3\">o'clock.\r\n</body>\r\n","mercenary2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>艙輿眷憮 嫦ルж褐 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛陝擎 <var src=\"#0\">喇 <var src=\"#1\">錯 <var src=\"#2\">橾 <var src=\"#3\">衛 <var src=\"#4\">碟 檜棻. 渾網 纔賊 渾滬瑭!\r\n</body>","mercenary3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>統治者尚未宣布下一次攻城的時間。\r\n</body>\r\n","mercenary3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>The Lord hasn't declared the time for the next siege yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","mercenary3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>The Lord hasn't declared the time for the next siege yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","mercenary3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>艙輿眷憮朝 嬴霜 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 唸薑ж雖 彊戲樟棻.\r\n</body>","merwyn1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>梅溫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n最近的年輕人真不懂禮貌。而且從早到晚吃喝玩樂，真不懂在想甚麼...。你是不是從那邊的<a link=\"merwyn2\">酒店</a>來啊？\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","merwyn1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Merwyn :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nNowadays young people don't respect their elders. Drinking and gambling all the time, just imagine their future... You're not coming from the <a link=\"merwyn2\">Drinking and Gambling</a> place yourself are you?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","merwyn1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Merwyn :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nNowadays young people don't respect their elders. Drinking and gambling all the time, just imagine their future... You're not coming from the <a link=\"merwyn2\">Drinking and Gambling</a> place yourself are you?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","merwyn1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>該孺 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n蹂億 瞬擎 匙菟擎 棻菟 幗腦濰該葬陛 橈橫. 啪棻陛 裔陳 獎婁 喻葷縑 緒螳餌棲 擅陳檜 �虰�... �公� 濠啻紫 蹂 擅 <a link=\"merwyn2\">嶸�黻�</a>縑憮 啾棻 螞 匙擎 嬴棲啊雖?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","merwyn2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>梅溫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n因為那裡的<font fg=ffffff>賽狗</font>跟<font fg=ffffff>彩券</font>，我的財產都被揮霍乾淨。在這裡不只我一個人這樣... \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","merwyn2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Merwyn :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nMany people have lost their lives savings and become homeless because of the <fong fg=ffffff>dog race</font> and <font fg=ffffff>lottery</font>... Tsk tsk... \r\n</body>\r\n","merwyn2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Merwyn :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nThe <font fg=ffffff>dog race</font> and <font fg=ffffff>lottery</font> have caused lots of people their life savings and have become homeless... Tsk tsk... \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","merwyn2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>該孺 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n斜夠曖 <font fg=ffffff>偃 溯檜蝶</font>諦 <font fg=ffffff>犒掏</font> 陽僥縑 營骯擊 棻 鰻霞ж堅 わ檣檜 脹 餌塋檜 и 萃檜 嬴棲撿... 鎳鎖... \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","milkcow-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>乳牛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哞∼∼∼∼</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","milkcow1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>乳牛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哞∼∼∼∼</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","milkcow1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Milkcow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Moo.  Moo, moo.  Moo!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","milkcow1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Milkcow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Moo.  Moo, moo.  Moo!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","milkcow1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>薔模:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>擠該...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","miranda1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>米蘭德：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哎呀∼！我真糊塗，我又忘記看守旅館櫃台就出來了。我怎麼總是這麼馬馬虎虎呢？</p>\r\n<p>每天不是心不在焉地打破碗，不然就是算錯旅館費用</p>\r\n<p>......</p>\r\n<p>......</p>\r\n<p>哎呀∼∼！</p>\r\n<p>真是抱歉，我不知不覺得就向不知情的人開始訴苦了。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","miranda1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Miranda:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Oh my, look at me. I've left the inn counter again.</p>\r\n<p>I'm this distracted... Everyday just absent-minded... breaking dishes... miscalculating the lodging fee...</p>\r\n<p>....</p>\r\n<p>....</p>\r\n<p>...Oh dear.</p>\r\n<p>I'm so sorry.  Now I'm telling strange things even to those who don't know me.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","miranda1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Miranda:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Oh my, look at me. I've left the inn counter again.</p>\r\n<p>I'm this distracted... Everyday just absent-minded... breaking dishes... miscalculating the lodging fee...</p>\r\n<p>....</p>\r\n<p>....</p>\r\n<p>...Oh dear.</p>\r\n<p>I'm so sorry.  Now I'm telling strange things even to those who don't know me.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","miranda1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>嘐塢棻:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...橫該釭, 頂 薑褐覬 瑭. 薯陛 傳 罹婦 蘋遴攪蒂 綠辦堅 釭諦幗溜啻蹂.</p>\r\n<p>薯陛 檜溢啪 薑褐檜 橈棻棲梱蹂... 衙橾 誠-ж堅 氈棻陛 斜萱紫 梟嗑葬堅 熨夢綠 撬紫 澀跤ж堅...</p>\r\n<p>....</p>\r\n<p>....</p>\r\n<p>...橫該釭.</p>\r\n<p>賸歎п蹂. 薯陛 澀 賅腦朝 碟擊 稱濩堅 艙僥紫 賅腦朝 檜撿晦蒂 п 幗溜啻蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","mona1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>夢娜:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你是否要往南邊走?</p>\r\n<br>    \r\n<p>請你小心。託甘特的福，在這個島除了地下訓練場之外，大部分都很安全。不過南邊還有一些很強的<font fg=ffffff>夏洛伯</font>。若沒有從甘特那兒得到騎士的稱號，最好不要去那裡。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mona1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mona:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you, by any chance, going to the Southern Forest?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Be careful. This island is usually safe except for the dungeon because of Lord Gunter, but there are still some strong monsters like <font fg=ffffff>shelob</font> in the South Forest. 'Tis better not to go there unless you are quite confident in yourself.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mona1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mona:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you, by any chance, going to the Southern Forest?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Be careful. This island is usually safe except for the dungeon because of Lord Gunter, but there are still some strong monsters like <font fg=ffffff>shelob</font> in the South Forest. 'Tis better not to go there unless you are quite confident in yourself.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","mona1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賅釭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>�公� 渡褐 陴薹 膛戲煎 陛衛朝 勒陛蹂?</p>\r\n<br>    \r\n<p>...褻褕ж撮蹂. 檜 撰擎 捱攪椒 湯碟縑 湍蟒擊 薯諼ж堅朝 渠羹煎 寰瞪ж雖虜 陴薹 膛縑朝 嬴霜紫 <font fg=ffffff>撚煎粽</font>偽擎 鬼и 跨蝶攪陛 陴嬴氈戲棲梱蹂. 瞳橫紫 捱攪椒縑啪 晦餌曖 蘆�ㄧ� 嫡晦瞪縑朝 寰 陛衛朝 匙檜 謠擊剪縑蹂.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","moncom-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"aggressive\">攻擊狀態</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"defensive\">防禦狀態</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"stay\">停留</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"extend\">散開</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"alert\">警戒</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"dismiss\">解散</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n狀態: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n體力: <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n魔力: <var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\n等級: <var src=\"#5\">\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpnpc\">關於NPC操作之說明</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","moncom-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"aggressive\">Aggressive mode</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"defensive\">Defensive mode</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"stay\">Stay</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"extend\">Extend</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"alert\">Alert</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"dismiss\">Dismiss</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\nMode: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\nHP: <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\nMP: <var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\nLevel: <var src=\"#5\">\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpnpc\">Help with NPC control</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","moncom-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"aggressive\">Aggressive mode</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"defensive\">Defensive mode</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"stay\">Stay</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"extend\">Extend</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"alert\">Alert</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"dismiss\">Dismiss</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\nMode: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\nHP: <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\nMP: <var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\nLevel: <var src=\"#5\">\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpnpc\">Help with NPC control</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","moncom-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#6\"></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"aggressive\">奢問 鷓撮</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"defensive\">寞橫 鷓撮</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"stay\">�瑍�</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"extend\">骯偃</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"alert\">唳啗</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"dismiss\">п骯</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n⑷營 鼻鷓: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\nHP: <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\nMP: <var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\n溯漣: <var src=\"#5\">\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"helpnpc\">NPC褻謙縑 渠и 紫遺蜓</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","moor1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>摩爾：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>本來農產品，例如農作物和水果是古丁領地特產，但像我這樣的<a link=\"moor2\">商人</a>會把它們賣到大的國家像冠石和亞丁。\r\n</body>","moor1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Moor:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Originally agricultural products like crops and fruits were the specialty of the Gludio estate. It's the <a link=\"moor2\">merchant</a> like me who sells them to large countries like Kiran and Aden.\r\n</body>\r\n","moor1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Moor:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Originally agricultural products like crops and fruits were the specialty of the Gludio estate. It's the <a link=\"moor2\">merchant</a> like me who sells them to large countries like Kiran and Aden.\r\n</body>\r\n","moor1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>鼠橫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>獄楚 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖曖 か骯ヶ擎 婁橾檜釭 寧濛僭 偽擎 堯骯僭檜塭螃. 斜勘 晦塢 艙輿措檜釭 嬴筆偽擎 贖 釭塭縑 陛螳棻 だ朝 匙檜 辦葬菟偽擎 <a link=\"moor2\">濰餌纂</a>菟曖 橾檜雖.\r\n</body>","moor2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>摩爾：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>從這裡到那裡賣東西，從這裡再到那裡帶來東西。會這麼麻煩還不都是因為它，\r\n<p>說真的，亞丁離這裡不遠，但是因為迷幻森林和龍之谷的阻擋，所以你不能直接地去那裡，一定要經過冠石，所以冠石城就變得很富有了。\r\n</body>\r\n","moor2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Moor:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sell something from here to there, bring something from there to here...that's about it. Aden isn't far as the dragon flies, but because of the Elven Forest and Dragon Valley, you can't go there directly. Since you have to pass through Kiran, they've become quite wealthy from the trading parties passing through.\r\n</body>\r\n","moor2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Moor:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sell something from here to there, bring something from there to here...that's about it. Aden isn't far as the dragon flies, but because of the Elven Forest and Dragon Valley, you can't go there directly. Since you have to pass through Kiran, they've become quite wealthy from the trading parties passing through.\r\n</body>\r\n","moor2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>鼠橫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹晦憮 釭朝 僭勒 盪晦棻 陛螳棻 つ堅, 盪晦憮 釭朝 僭勒 罹晦 陛螳諦憮 つ堅...凳 斜楛 剪雖. 嬴筆 偽擎 唳辦朝 罹晦憮 霜摹 剪葬朝 陛梱遴等, 蹂薑曖 膛檜釭 辨曖 啗堊 偽擎啪 虞堅 氈橫憮 雖葷望煎朝 跤陛. 繭鼻 晦塢 艙輿措擊 鱔п撿雖. 晦塢 艙輿措檜 鼻機戲煎 �懘炾� 氈朝 匙紫 棻 斜楛 檜嶸塭啻.\r\n<p>ж雖虜 賃賃 匏擊 鼻褒и 耀掘菟擎 綠諸 鱔ч撮 渠褐縑 跡獗擊 勘堅 蹂薑曖 膛擊 雖釭朝 雖葷望煎 棻棲晦紫 ж雖, 餌褒 頂 耀и 耀掘 и 喪戮紫 斜楛 喪戮檜 氈朝等, 斜 耀掘陛 蜓ж望 耀ж啪 雖頂朝 蹂薑菟煎睡攪 'む橫葬 渦蝶お'塭朝 陛瑞蒂 橢擊 熱 氈朝等, 堅勘 熱��濠菟縑啪 夥纂賊 熱��濠菟檜 晦碟檜 謠嬴螳憮 斜ぐ縑 緒螳釭除棻朝 剪撿. 斜楚憮 'む橫葬 渦蝶お'虜 醱碟�� 陛雖堅 氈戲賊 鼠餌�� 膛擊 鱔婁й 熱 氈棻渦捱. 凳. 樂梓и 樽晦曹 и等, 陪 羲衛 寰瞪ж啪 鱔ч撮頂堅 晦塢薹戲煎 陛啊橫. 謁傍ж賊 膛擊 雖釭賊憮 熱��濠菟擊 賃檜釭 虜陳雖紫 賅腦堅, �公籀� 'む橫葬 渦蝶お'陛 棻 雲橫螳 幗葬賊, 第礎橈檜 膛縑 陘⑵ 幗葬朝 剪濫嬴. 斜溢啪 膛縑 褻陪渡и 喪戮菟紫 號棻堅 . 褻陪渡и 喪戮菟 掘п輿堅 爾鼻虜 嫡嬴紫 紮 熱殮檜 竅穢й 痊?\r\n</body>","moran1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫潤 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n聽說訓練完畢的狗可說人的語言，是嗎？嘿嘿...！真了不起。 \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","moran1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賅塢 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n�こ藝� 澀 脹 偃朝 檣除曖 蜓紫 й 熱 氈棻雖蹂? ъ... 霤 啾塭遴 橾檜煎捱蹂. \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","moria1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫麗雅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>冶鍊術具有無限之可能性，你想不想嘗試一下未知的力量？</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a link=\"moria2\">製作法師長袍</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"moria3\">製作法師之帽</a> \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","moria1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Moria the Alchemist:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Alchemy has unlimited possiblities. Don't you want to test the mysterious powers?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","moria1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Moria the Alchemist:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Alchemy has unlimited possiblities. Don't you want to test the mysterious powers?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","moria1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>翱旎獎餌 賅葬嬴:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>翱旎獎擎 鼠ии 陛棟撩檜 氈蝗棲棻. 渡褐... 嘐雖曖 ��擊 衛яп 爾褒 儅陝 橈釭蹂?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","moria2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫麗雅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 製作魔法師長袍的材料需要<font fg=ffffff>高品質藍寶石</font>1個.<font fg=ffffff>魔法寶石</font> 25顆, <font fg=ffffff>白色布料</font>2個, <font fg=ffffff>藍色布料</font> 4個. </p>   \r\n<br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request magician dress\">製作魔法師長袍</a></p>   \r\n   \r\n</body>   \r\n   \r\n","moria3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫麗雅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>製作魔法師之帽所需要的材料有<font fg=ffffff>品質綠寶石</font> 2個.還需要<font fg=ffffff>魔法寶石</font> 20顆,  <font fg=ffffff>白色布料</font> 1個, <font fg=ffffff>藍色布料</font> 1個, <font fg=ffffff>紅色布料</font>1個.</p>   \r\n<br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request magician cap\">製作魔法師之帽.</a></p>   \r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","morience1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>啊！是黑暗精靈，請走開！我很害怕。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienCE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Yeow! A Dark Elf! Please go away - I'm scared!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienCE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Yeow! A Dark Elf! Please go away - I'm scared!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienCE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賅葬縛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>畦學! 橫菸曖 蹂薑檜棻. 薯嫦 盪葬 陛蹂! 傘鼠 鼠憮錶.</p>\r\n</body>","moriene1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗯，我？我目前正在跟芮克妮學習紡織的技術。芮克妮真的有一套，當然創造每件事物的<a link=\"morienE2\">娜魯帕</a>是很偉大的，但是，看著其他的芮克妮移動他們的８隻手去生產<a link=\"morienE3\">網</a>跟<a link=\"morienE4\">線</a>真的是讓我很吃驚。\r\n<br>此外不像我們的軟皮膚，他們那的<a link=\"morienE5\">硬殼</a>能抵抗大部份的矛和劍，還有比芮克妮更完美的種族嗎？\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Me? I'm learning weaving techniques from the Arachnes nowadays...\r\nArachnes are quite something. Of course <a link=\"morienE2\">Nerupa</a> who\r\nmakes everything is great, but watching the other Arachnes move their 8\r\nhands to produce <a link=\"morienE3\">webs</a> and <a link=\"morienE4\">threads</a>\r\nis amazing!\r\n<br>\r\nYnlike our soft skins, their hard <a link=\"morienE5\">shells</a> can\r\nreflect most spears and swords. Could there be more perfect beings than\r\nArachnes?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Me? I'm learning weaving techniques from the Arachnes nowadays...\r\nArachnes are quite something. Of course <a link=\"morienE2\">Nerupa</a> who\r\nmakes everything is great, but watching the other Arachnes move their 8\r\nhands to produce <a link=\"morienE3\">webs</a> and <a link=\"morienE4\">threads</a>\r\nis amazing!\r\n<br>\r\nYnlike our soft skins, their hard <a link=\"morienE5\">shells</a> can\r\nreflect most spears and swords. Could there be more perfect beings than\r\nArachnes?\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賅葬縛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫 盪蹂? 瞪 蹂闈 嬴塭觼啻菟煎睡攪 褒擊 燧朝 徹擊 寡辦堅 氈朝等.. 嬴塭觼啻菟擎 霤 渠欽ж轄? 膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲 蕙曖 饜掉縑 髦賊憮 凳萇雖 虜菟橫 頂朝 <a link=\"morienE2\">啻瑞だ</a> 嬴邀葆紫 渠欽ж雖虜 嬴塭觼啻菟檜 8偃曖 槳擊 遺霜罹憮 <a link=\"morienE3\">剪嘐還</a>檜釭 <a link=\"morienE4\">褒</a>擊 鉻朝 濰賊擊 蕙縑憮 爾堅 氈戲賊 傘鼠 詣氈堅 睡毀棻棲梱蹂. \r\n<br>渦掘釭 翱擒и 辦葬 蹂薑菟婁朝 殖葬 彌晦陛 �撣ㄟ� 欽欽и <a link=\"morienE5\">嬴塭觼啻菟曖 皎韓</a>擎 諷虜и 璽檜釭 蠔擎 棻 い啖幗葬棲梱, 薑蜓 嬴塭觼啻菟籀歲 諫漁и 襄營陛 橫蛤 氈啊橫蹂?</p>\r\n</body>","moriene2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗯？你不知道娜魯帕？你一定是最近才出生，她居住在迷幻森林之母旁邊的洞穴，並為我們製造各種的物品。她總是抱怨我們很討厭，而且還威脅要吃掉我們，但是她還是用我們收集的材料來為我們製作物品。我能看得出來她是非常疼愛我們妖精的，呵呵！\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You don't know Nerupa? You must be born quite recently - she lives in the cave near the Mother of the Forest and Elves and makes all kind of things for us. She always complains about how annoying we are and threatens to eat us... but she always makes things from the materials we have collected.\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You don't know Nerupa? You must be born quite recently - she lives in the cave near the Mother of the Forest and Elves and makes all kind of things for us. She always complains about how annoying we are and threatens to eat us... but she always makes things from the materials we have collected.\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賅葬縛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>擠? 啻瑞だ 嬴邀葆蒂 賅腦褐棻堅蹂? 鷓橫陪雖 橡葆 寰腎歷釭 爾啻? 啻瑞だ 嬴邀葆朝 盪晦 葆擊 醞懈縑 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>渠撮啗熱 '膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲' 蕙曖 饜掉</font>縑 髦賊憮 辦葬 蹂薑菟縑啪 <font fg=ffffff>罹楝 僭勒擊 虜菟橫 輿衛朝</font> 嬴塭觼啻褶 濰煎縑蹂. 參戲煎 爾晦縛 裔陳 蹂薑菟檜 敝雛棻替棲 濩嬴詳啊棻替棲 яи 蜓虜 ж雖虜 辦葬 蹂薑菟檜 營猿蒂 賅嬴陛晦虜 ж賊 橫雯 僭勒檜萇 奩萄衛 虜菟橫 輿衛棲 瞪 橡葆釭 啻瑞だ 嬴邀葆陛 辦葬 蹂薑菟擊 餌嫌ж朝雖 憲 熱 氈棻掘蹂. �噿�!</p>\r\n</body>","moriene3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>來自芮克妮的網有一種凍結的特質，在包裝時經常會用來綑綁東西，實際上，網主要是由安特的樹枝所組成，所以如果你能餵樹枝給芮克妮們食用，\r\n</font>他們就會為你織網。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The silver web of the Arachnes has a congealing property when wrapped, so it is frequently used to bind things. Actually webs are composed primarily of the twigs of Ents.  If you feed twigs to the Arachnes, they will spin webs for you.\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The silver web of the Arachnes has a congealing property when wrapped, so it is frequently used to bind things. Actually webs are composed primarily of the twigs of Ents.  If you feed twigs to the Arachnes, they will spin webs for you.\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賅葬縛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴塭觼啻菟曖 鉻嬴頂朝 擎維 剪嘐還擎 萃萃 馬嬴憮 <font fg=ffffff>擬堅衛酈賊 欽欽�� 殖塭稱晦</font> 陽僥縑 <font fg=ffffff>陝謙 僭勒</font>擊 虜菟晦 嬪п 濠輿 餌辨ж朝 僭勒檜轄. 剪嘐還擎 餌褒 <a link=\"morienE6\">縛お曖 還晦</a>陛 輿撩碟檜塭憮 斜勘 <font fg=ffffff>嬴塭觼啻縑啪 詳檜堅 裔槳戲煎 瓣餵</font>擊 ж賊 嬴塭觼啻菟檜 剪嘐還擊 鉻嬴 還 剪縑蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","moriene4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>芮克妮是非常靈巧的，所以能製造任何東西，但是紡織絲線時的景像，是很令人難以置信的，他們製造的絲線有很高的彈性和強度，所以通常用來做弓弦、衣服、手套、和長靴，但事實上絲線的品質中，我們也不能忽視，用<a link=\"morienE7\">潘的鬃毛</a>當作材料所製成的絲線，\r\n可是實際上仍然是芮克妮在紡織那些絲線，他們才是真正有才能的人。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Arachnes can make anything; watching them spinning thread is really fabulous. The threads have high resilience and strength, and are usually used for bowstrings, clothes, gloves, and boots. Actually we can't ignore the quality of <a link=\"morienE7\">Pan's mane</a>, the material for the threads...but it is Arachnes who are actually spinning the threads. They are quite talented!</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Arachnes can make anything; watching them spinning thread is really fabulous. The threads have high resilience and strength, and are usually used for bowstrings, clothes, gloves, and boots. Actually we can't ignore the quality of <a link=\"morienE7\">Pan's mane</a>, the material for the threads...but it is Arachnes who are actually spinning the threads. They are quite talented!</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賅葬縛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴塭觼啻菟擎 槳營輿陛 謠嬴憮 凳萇 虜菟橫頂雖虜 斜 醞縑憮紫 褒擊 濕朝 賅蝗擎 薑蜓 詣氈橫蹂. 斜菟擎 濕嬴 魚 褒擎 韓晦堅紫 驕溘檜 謠嬴憮 辦葬菟擎 <font fg=ffffff>�� 衛嬪</font>煎 噙晦紫 ж堅 <font fg=ffffff>褡檜釭 濰骨,濰��</font>蒂 虜菟晦紫 п蹂. ж曹 褒曖 營猿煎 噙朝 <a link=\"morienE7\">っ曖 陞晦瓚</a>檜 謠嬴憮 謠擎 褒檜 虜菟橫雖啊雖虜 褒擊 濕朝 勒 嬴塭觼啻棲梱, 薑蜓 嬴塭觼啻菟擎 槳營輿蒂 顫堅 陬棻棲梱蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","moriene5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>芮克妮會像鳥脫毛一樣改變他們的外形，為了要幫助蛻化變形，他們會吃<a link=\"morienE6\">安特的樹皮</a>，因此為了得到他們的蛻化後的皮，有時候我們給他們安特的樹皮，\r\n而且那些蛻下來的皮對製作盔甲、手套和長靴來說，是非常有用的材料。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Arachnes change their shells like birds molt. To facilitate this they eat <a link=\"morienE6\">bark of Ent</a>. To get their ecdyses, we will sometimes give them the bark of Ent; those ecdyses are useful for armor, gloves, and boots.\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Arachnes change their shells like birds molt. To facilitate this they eat <a link=\"morienE6\">bark of Ent</a>. To get their ecdyses, we will sometimes give them the bark of Ent; those ecdyses are useful for armor, gloves, and boots.\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賅葬縛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴塭觼啻菟擎 葆纂 億菟檜 瓚陞檜蒂 ж蛭檜 驍Я蒂 鱔п憮 陸擎 諼Я蒂 億照啪 夥紱橫蹂. 斜菟擎 驍Я蒂 ж晦嬪п 驍Я蒂 錳йж啪 п輿朝 <a link=\"morienE6\">縛お曖 皎韓</a>擊 詳戲棲梱 辦葬 蹂薑菟擎 嬴塭觼啻菟縑啪 縛お曖 皎韓擊 輿堅 驍Яи ъ僭擊 橢晦紫 п蹂. 辦萼 斜 欽欽и ъ僭煎 <font fg=ffffff>骨褡檜釭 濰骨,濰��</font>蒂 虜萄朝 等 嶸辨ж啪 噙堅 氈濫嬴蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","moriene6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我並不是真的知道很多安特的事，他們不多說話看來里爾得和安特非常親近。\r\n好像是他有能讀出植物思想的才能，你為什麼不去問他關於安特的事。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I don't really know much about the Entfolk - they don't talk much. It seems that Theodor is very close to the Ents...he has a talent to read the mind of plants.  Perhaps you should ask him about the Ents.\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I don't really know much about the Entfolk - they don't talk much. It seems that Theodor is very close to the Ents...he has a talent to read the mind of plants.  Perhaps you should ask him about the Ents.\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賅葬縛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>縛お曖 渠п憮朝 瞪 澀 路塭蹂. 僭橫紫 渠港紫 澀 п輿雖 彊堅, <font fg=ffffff>纔螃紫腦</font> 嬴盪噢陛 橫職雖 縛お菟婁 葆擠檜 澀 鱔ж朝 匙 偽湍等.. 纔嬴紫腦 嬴盪噢朝 橫職雖 衝僭曖 葆擠擊 檗朝 營輿陛 氈朝陛瑭蹂. и 廓 陛憮 縛お縑 渠п 僭橫爾撮蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","moriene7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>當我看見潘在森林中狂野的奔跑時，我會害怕也不敢接近，但是只要那翰開始吹奏笛子，潘就會變得很安靜，\r\n這樣想來，關於潘的事也許那翰知道得比較多，你應該拜訪她，順便你也能聽她吹奏笛子。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I am so scared I can't even approach them when I see the Pans running wildly in the forest. But they have become so quiet once Narhen started playing her flute. Come to think of it, Narhen knows much about Pans...you should visit her, and listen to her play as well.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I am so scared I can't even approach them when I see the Pans running wildly in the forest. But they have become so quiet once Narhen started playing her flute. Come to think of it, Narhen knows much about Pans...you should visit her, and listen to her play as well.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienE7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賅葬縛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>膛 樓擊 葆掘 嗨橫棻棲朝 っ菟擎 傘鼠 鼠憮錶憮 瞪 蜓紫 跤 稱檜啊橫蹂. ж雖虜 褐晦и啪 斜溢啪 鼠雖虞雖и っ菟紫 釭腦縛 樹棲曖 Ы當 翱輿虜 菟戲賊 褐晦ж啪紫 褻辨п 雖剪萇蹂. 斜楝堅 爾棲 っ縑 渠п憮朝 <font fg=ffffff>釭腦縛</font> 樹棲陛 澀 憲堅 氈擊 匙 偽擎等.. и 廓 瓊嬴陛 爾撮蹂. 斜喪曖 翱輿紫 菟擊 售.</p>\r\n</body>","morienm1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莫里恩：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>咦！？人類∼？你怎麼能進來這裡，人類是不被允許進來的！在芮克妮注意到你之前，你最好快快離開這裡，因為你的刀劍對他們堅硬的殼是沒有一點用處的。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienM1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Human? How have you come where humans are not allowed?  You'd better leave here right now before the Arachnes notice you - your sword would be useless on their hard shells...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienM1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Morien:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Human? How have you come where humans are not allowed?  You'd better leave here right now before the Arachnes notice you - your sword would be useless on their hard shells...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","morienM1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>賅葬縛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>憾 渡褐擎 檣除? 謁 檣除檜 ъ塊腎雖 彊擎 階檣 檜 夠縑 氈朝 剪縑蹂? 嬴塭觼啻菟縑啪 渡ж晦 瞪縑 橡艇 膛擊 緒螳 釭陛朝 啪 謠擊 痊蹂? 嬴塭觼啻曖 欽欽и 皎韓縑 渡褐曖 陸擎 蠔評孺 菟橫陛雖紫 彊擊纔棲..</p>\r\n</body>","mothere1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎，<a link=\"mothere2\">世界樹的小葉子</a>，你還記得<a link=\"mothere3\">我</a> 祝福你在殷海薩的祝福下誕生的日子嗎？時間真的過得很快。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">開始入會儀式</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, <a link=\"mothere2\">leaf of the World Tree</a>. Do you remember that <a link=\"mothere3\">I</a> blessed you on the day you were born in the name of Einhasad?  Time does pass quickly...</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, <a link=\"mothere2\">leaf of the World Tree</a>. Do you remember that <a link=\"mothere3\">I</a> blessed you on the day you were born in the name of Einhasad?  Time does pass quickly...</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮 諦蹂, <a link=\"mothere2\">撮啗熱曖 橫萼 濟餌敝</a>罹. 渡褐檜 鷓橫陪 陳縑 <a link=\"mothere3\">薯陛</a> 嬴檣ж餌萄曖 檜葷戲煎 蹴犒擊 п 輿歷湍 匙擊 晦橘ж釭蹂? 薑蜓 撮錯檜塢 霤 緒腦捱蹂.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">撩檣衝 檜漸お蒂 纂琿棻</a>\r\n</body>","mothere2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>最初的精靈們全部從世界樹的葉子創造出來，世界樹是由殷海薩創造的至高樹。即使你比<a link=\"mothere4\">守護神</a>的身體虛弱，你也該記得我們是殷海薩<a link=\"mothere5\">最愛護的種族</a>。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">開始入會儀式</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Originally, elves were all created from a leaf of the World Tree. The World tree is the highest being created by Einhasad...even though you are physically weaker than the <a link=\"mothere4\">guardians</a>, you should remember that we are the <a link=\"mothere5\">most beloved race</a> of Einhasad.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Originally, elves were all created from a leaf of the World Tree. The World tree is the highest being created by Einhasad...even though you are physically weaker than the <a link=\"mothere4\">guardians</a>, you should remember that we are the <a link=\"mothere5\">most beloved race</a> of Einhasad.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>譆蟾曖 蹂薑菟擎 賅舒陛 撮啗熱曖 濟戲煎 璽褻腎歷蝗棲棻. 撮啗熱朝 嬴檣ж餌萄陛 賅萇 匙縑 擅憮 璽褻и 雖堅曖 襄營...綠煙 辦葬菟檜 <a link=\"mothere4\">熱��濠</a>菟爾棻 幫羹瞳戲煎 翮蛔ж棻堅 п紫, 樹薯釭 辦葬朝 嬴檣ж餌萄縑啪 陛濰 <a link=\"mothere5\">餌嫌嫡朝 襄營</a>塭朝 餌褒擊 濱橫憮朝 寰腌棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">撩檣衝 檜漸お蒂 纂琿棻</a>\r\n</body>","mothere3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>年輕的精靈們稱我為『迷幻森林之母』</p>\r\n<p>這讓我產生一種奇怪的感覺，即使我現在是<a link=\"mothere6\">世界樹的一部份</a>，我曾經也只是你稱呼為『初代祖先』的其中之一罷了，現在我像世界樹一樣是所有人的母親，但是當我還是一個精靈時，我也曾經有二個兒子呢。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">開始入會儀式</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Young elves call me 'Mother of the Forest and Elves'.</p>\r\n<p>...This gives me a strange feeling. Even though I'm a <a link=\"mothere6\">part of the World Tree</a> right now, once I was just one of the elves whom you call 'the first ancestors'. Now I'm a mother of all as the World Tree, but as an elf I had just two sons.\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Young elves call me 'Mother of the Forest and Elves'.</p>\r\n<p>...This gives me a strange feeling. Even though I'm a <a link=\"mothere6\">part of the World Tree</a> right now, once I was just one of the elves whom you call 'the first ancestors'. Now I'm a mother of all as the World Tree, but as an elf I had just two sons.\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫萼 蹂薑菟擎 盪蒂 '膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲'塭 睡落棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>...瞪 檜 蜓擊 菟擊 陽葆棻 檜鼻и 晦碟檜 菟橫蹂. 雖旎曖 盪朝 碟貲�� <a link=\"mothere6\">撮啗熱曖 橾睡</a>檜雖虜, 蕨瞪縑朝 '譆蟾曖 摹褻菟'檜塭 碳葬辦湍 螃楚脹 蹂薑菟 醞 ж釭艘剪萇蹂. 撮啗熱煎賦 盪朝 罹楝碟 賅舒曖 橫該棲檜雖虜, 蹂薑檜歷湍 陽曖 盪朝 欽雖 舒 貲曖 嬴菟擊 竟嬴憮 望毓擊 閨檜雖蹂.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">撩檣衝 檜漸お蒂 纂琿棻</a>\r\n</body>","mothere4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>當殷海薩第一次創造我們的時候，我們像是小孩子，因此為了保護我們免於格蘭肯的力量迫害，他<a link=\"mothere7\">選擇一些生物</a>並且給予他們強大的力量。\r\n</p>\r\n<p>上帝命令他們保護森林和妖精們，他們從你出生很久很久以前就開始保護這座森林了，而且保護行動一直繼續到現在，即使我們已經能<a link=\"mothere8\">製造武器和盔甲</a>來保護我們自己。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">開始入會儀式</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>When Einhasad first made us, we were as children. To protect us from Gran Kain's evil might, he <a link=\"mothere7\">selected a few creations</a> and gave them great power.</p>\r\n<p>Einhasad ordered these guardians to protect the forest and elves; they have protected us from the beginnings of time. That protection continues even now, when they help us <a link=\"mothere8\">make weapons and armor</a> to protect ourselves.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>When Einhasad first made us, we were as children. To protect us from Gran Kain's evil might, he <a link=\"mothere7\">selected a few creations</a> and gave them great power.</p>\r\n<p>Einhasad ordered these guardians to protect the forest and elves; they have protected us from the beginnings of time. That protection continues even now, when they help us <a link=\"mothere8\">make weapons and armor</a> to protect ourselves.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴檣ж餌萄陛 籀擠 辦葬蒂 虜萄樟擊 陽, 辦葬朝 嬴鼠匙紫 賅腦朝 橫萼嬴檜諦 偽懊蝗棲棻. 斜溢晦 陽僥縑 嬴檣ж餌萄眷憮朝 辦葬蒂 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 撮溘戲煎睡攪 爾��ж衛晦 嬪п 斜曖 <a link=\"mothere7\">Я褻僭菟 醞 賃賃</a>擊 埤塭 斜菟縑啪 贖 ��擊 輿樟蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>褐擎 斜菟縑啪 '蹂薑婁 蹂薑曖 堅щ檣 檜 膛擊 雖酈塭'塭朝 貲滄擊 頂葬樟轄. 辦葬菟擎 晦橘й 熱紫 橈擊 虜躑 螃楚瞪睡攪 斜菟曖 爾�ㄧ� 嫡嬴諮蝗棲棻. 斜葬堅 斜 爾�ㄣ� 辦葬陛 辦葬 槳戲煎 <a link=\"mothere8\">鼠晦諦 寞橫掘蒂 虜菟橫</a> 蝶蝶煎蒂 雖鑒 熱 氈啪 脹 雖旎縑紫 啗樓 檜橫雖堅 氈轄.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">撩檣衝 檜漸お蒂 纂琿棻</a>\r\n</body>","mothere5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你是個受神所眷顧的妖精，但是這也讓你更容易受到格蘭肯甜美的誘惑而受傷。</p>\r\n<p>但是和你不同的是，人類是在殷海薩和格蘭肯之間的衝突中誕生，因為這個事實，他們人類的缺點比我們更多，即使他們總是在善良和邪惡之間動搖，但他們通常不會完全地偏向任何一方去，也因為如此使得他們更容易被愛。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>有一天你也許會和人類相遇，那時沒有人知道他將會領你向何處前進。</p>\r\n<p>但你千萬記得一件事情，如果那個人真值得你去愛，你就應該永遠的愛他。如果你要帶他來這裡，記得要使用精靈粉末去避開守護神們的眼睛。</p>\r\n<p>守護神決不會容忍人類經過森林的，即使他跟你一起也不會通融你們。但是當守護神被他們很喜愛的精靈粉末分心的時候，你的朋友就可以比較安全地經過森林。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">開始入會儀式</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are a being loved by the Good God, but you are vulnerable to Gran Kain's sweet seduction.</p>\r\n<p>But unlike you, humans are born from the conflict between Einhasad and Gran Kain. Due to that fact, even though they always waver between good and evil, they don't usually turn to one side completely. They are far more imperfect than us, and more vulnerable.</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>So you may meet humans someday...and no one knows where he will lead you.</p>\r\n<p>You should remember one thing; if a person deserves your love, you should love him forever. And if you want to bring him here, you may use fairy dust to avert the eyes of guardians.</p>\r\n<p>Guardians are not flexible; they won't tolerate a human even if he is with you...but when they are distracted by the fairy dust that they love the most, your friend can pass through the forest relatively safely.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are a being loved by the Good God, but you are vulnerable to Gran Kain's sweet seduction.</p>\r\n<p>But unlike you, humans are born from the conflict between Einhasad and Gran Kain. Due to that fact, even though they always waver between good and evil, they don't usually turn to one side completely. They are far more imperfect than us, and more vulnerable.</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>So you may meet humans someday...and no one knows where he will lead you.</p>\r\n<p>You should remember one thing; if a person deserves your love, you should love him forever. And if you want to bring him here, you may use fairy dust to avert the eyes of guardians.</p>\r\n<p>Guardians are not flexible; they won't tolerate a human even if he is with you...but when they are distracted by the fairy dust that they love the most, your friend can pass through the forest relatively safely.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐擎 摹и 褐縑啪 餌嫌嫡擎 牖熱и 襄營殮棲棻. ж雖虜 斜溢晦 陽僥縑 и廓 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 殖巍и 絮縑紫 蔣啪 僭菟啪 腎雖蹂.</p>\r\n<p>斜縑 綠п 檣除擎 嬴檣ж餌萄諦 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 艙錳и 諄遺 餌檜縑憮 鷓橫陪 謙褶殮棲棻. ж雖虜 斜溢晦 陽僥縑 檣除擎 摹婁 學 餌檜縑憮 樹薯釭 �蝯曏捂曌音� и薹 儀梃縑 諫瞪�� 僭萄朝 徹檜 橈蝗棲棻. 斜菟擎 辦葬爾棻 �徆� 碳諫瞪ж雖虜, 斜溢晦 陽僥縑 渦遵 餌嫌蝶楝遴 襄營菟殮棲棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>樹薇陛 渡褐縑啪紫 檣除婁曖 檣翱檜 儅望 橾檜 氈擊雖 賅落棲棻. 斜 陽 斜陛 渡褐擊 橫蛤煎 等溥陞雖朝 嬴鼠紫 憲 熱 橈雖蹂.</p>\r\n<p>ж雖虜 и陛雖虜擎 �捐Я炾� 蜓п舒啊蝗棲棻. 虜擒 斜 檣除檜 渡褐檜 餌嫌й虜и 濠檜剪萇, 部梱雖 餌嫌ж褊衛螃. 斜葬堅, 斜蒂 檜夠縑 等溥螃堅 談棻賊 熱��濠菟曖 換擊 給葬啪 ж晦 嬪п <font fg=ffffff>む橫葬 渦蝶お</font>蒂 餌辨ж撮蹂.</p>\r\n<p>熱��濠菟擎 懦鱔撩檜 橈橫憮 渡褐婁 л眷 螃朝 檣除紫 辨憮ж雖 彊擊纔雖虜, 斜菟檜 陛濰 謠嬴ж朝 む橫葬 渦蝶お縑 換檜 つ溥 氈朝 翕寰檜塭賊 綠掖瞳 寰瞪ж啪 膛擊 鱔婁й 熱 氈擊剪縑蹂.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">撩檣衝 檜漸お蒂 纂琿棻</a>\r\n</body>","mothere6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>由於神的祝福，除非來自外面的因素影響否則你們妖精是不會死亡的。但是隨著年齡增長，一些年長的妖精將會失去心智的活力，通常那時候他們就會想要成為大自然的一部份。</p>\r\n<p>在第一次的時候，我想要成為世界樹的一部份，但是愛我的後裔們阻止了我像其他人一樣，完全變得沒有感覺，所以造就了現在的我。</p>\r\n<p>有時我會羨慕那些心中完全平靜的故友們，但是當我看到你們這些年輕的精靈們時，就感到無比地快樂。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">開始入會儀式</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Due to Einhasad's blessing, elves cannot die except by outside sources.  Some of the old ones may lose their mental vigor as age advances; if that occurs they usually want to become one with nature.</p>\r\n<p>At first, I wanted to be one with this World Tree, but my love toward my descendants prevented me from completely merging like the others. This has made me what I am now.</p>\r\n<p>...Sometimes I envy my friends who found complete peace, but the happiness I can feel from seeing you younger elves is incomparable to anything imaginable.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Due to Einhasad's blessing, elves cannot die except by outside sources.  Some of the old ones may lose their mental vigor as age advances; if that occurs they usually want to become one with nature.</p>\r\n<p>At first, I wanted to be one with this World Tree, but my love toward my descendants prevented me from completely merging like the others. This has made me what I am now.</p>\r\n<p>...Sometimes I envy my friends who found complete peace, but the happiness I can feel from seeing you younger elves is incomparable to anything imaginable.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂薑菟擎 摹и 褐曖 蹴犒縑 曖п 諼睡瞳檣 蹂檣檜 嬴棋 檜鼻 避擠擊 蜃檜ж朝 橾擎 橈蝗棲棻. ж雖虜 辦葬 釭檜萇 濠菟 醞 渠睡碟擎 橾薑 檜鼻曖 釭檜陛 腎賊 薑褐瞳戲煎 潸ж罹螳憮 諫瞪�� 濠翱婁 翕�音Ц赯鷏拳漈� 錳ж啪 腎雖蹂.</p>\r\n<p>盪紫 籀擠縑朝 檜 撮啗熱諦 諫瞪�� 翕�倆牁蟆� ц歷蝗棲棻. ж雖虜 啗樓 鷓橫釭朝 盪曖 濠槳菟曖 餌嫌蝶楝遺縑 盪朝 棻艇 檜菟籀歲 鼠馬陝п韓 熱陛 橈渦捱蹂. 斜楚憮 雖旎婁 偽擎 賅蝗檜 腎橫 幗葬堅 蜓懊蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>...陛莠擎 諫瞪и 葆擠曖 ゎ�飛� 橢擎 翕猿菟檜 睡毀晦紫 ж雖虜, 渡褐婁 偽擎 瞬擎 蹂薑菟擊 爾賊憮 替郭朝 ч犒馬婁 濠嫌蝶楝遺擎 鼠歙婁紫 夥羚 熱 橈朝 匙檜轄.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">撩檣衝 檜漸お蒂 纂琿棻</a>\r\n</body>","mothere7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>潘雖然很暴躁，但心中卻是仁慈的。精靈總是開朗和快樂。芮克妮非常關心我們，即使牠有時候相當嚴厲。而安特是四個中最沈默寡言，但最聰明的。</p>\r\n<p>守護神們維持森林裡的秩序，並提供你們需要的許多東西。實際上我們沒有了芮克妮的絲線或精靈的米索莉，我們將無法生存。值得一提的是，現在和我一起生活的<a link=\"mothere9\">那魯帕</a>的技術實在好到沒話說。</p>\r\n<p>而且他們也會在森林中巡邏，以阻止人類的擅入與侵犯。不注意或漠視他們的警告的人類，就會受到嚴重的懲罰。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">開始入會儀式</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Pan, kind in heart if hot-tempered; Fairy, always bright and joyous; Arachne, always caring albiet harsh; and Ent, wisest and most reserved - these are the four guardians.</p>\r\n<p>They maintain order in the forest and provide many of the things you'll need.  We can't survive without the thread from Arachnes or Pure Mithril from the fairies. Especially the skill of <a link=\"mothere9\">Nerupa</a> who lives near me is excellent.</p>\r\n<p>And also they patrol the forest to prevent the human invasion. Humans who don't heed to their warnings, could suffer very much.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Pan, kind in heart if hot-tempered; Fairy, always bright and joyous; Arachne, always caring albiet harsh; and Ent, wisest and most reserved - these are the four guardians.</p>\r\n<p>They maintain order in the forest and provide many of the things you'll need.  We can't survive without the thread from Arachnes or Pure Mithril from the fairies. Especially the skill of <a link=\"mothere9\">Nerupa</a> who lives near me is excellent.</p>\r\n<p>And also they patrol the forest to prevent the human invasion. Humans who don't heed to their warnings, could suffer very much.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撩韓檜 晝и啪 �嚓戔� ж雖虜 葆擠噢朝 堅遴 っ. 樹薯釭 嫩堅 貲嫌и む橫葬. 蜓癱朝 詞詞ж雖虜 褒薯煎朝 陛濰 辦葬蒂 副薑п輿朝 嬴塭觼啻. 斜葬堅 賅萇 熱��濠菟 醞 陛濰 雖��照堅 殮檜 鼠剪遴 縛お.</p>\r\n<p>斜菟擎 檜 膛曖 韓憮蒂 雖酈堅 氈擊 閨虜 嬴棲塭 辦葬 儅�倏� в蹂и 號擎 營猿菟擊 奢晝п 輿晦紫 м棲棻. 褒薯煎 嬴塭觼啻陛 虜菟橫輿朝 褒, む橫葬陛 虜菟橫輿朝 嘐蝶萵 偽擎 匙檜 橈檜 辦葬陛 髦嬴陛朝 匙擎 碳陛棟ж轄. か�� 盪諦 л眷 髦堅 氈朝 嬴塭觼啻褶曖 濰煎 <a link=\"mothere9\">啻瑞だ</a>曖 槭噢朝 饕錯ж港棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>傳 斜菟擎 檣除檜 檜 膛擊 橫雖毀�鷙� 跤ж紫煙 膛擊 牖雞ж朝 橾紫 ж堅 氈蝗棲棻. 斜菟曖 唳堅蒂 鼠衛ж堅 檜 膛縑 菟橫螃朝 檣除菟擎 評莠и 蛻擊 爾啪 腎雖蹂.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">撩檣衝 檜漸お蒂 纂琿棻</a>\r\n</body>","mothere8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你該沒有忘記在這森林中的每件事物都是可以自給自足的吧？同樣的，你應該靠你自己得到你所需要的每樣東西。</p>\r\n<p>不過，如果你帶材料給娜魯帕，她可以為你製造幾乎所有你所需要的東西，至於材料，你能由守護神或森林裡的各種不同的地方獲得。<font fg=ffffff>在城鎮中可以問許多妖精，</font>他們會給你有用的提示。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">開始入會儀式</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You didn't forget that everything in this forest is self-sufficient?  Similarly, you should get everything you need by yourself.</p>\r\n<p>...Nerupa can help you make you almost everything you need if you bring materials to her;  you can get these materials from guardians or various places in the forest.  Ask elves in the town, and they will give you tips.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You didn't forget that everything in this forest is self-sufficient?  Similarly, you should get everything you need by yourself.</p>\r\n<p>...Nerupa can help you make you almost everything you need if you bring materials to her;  you can get these materials from guardians or various places in the forest.  Ask elves in the town, and they will give you tips.</p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 膛曖 賅萇 襄營菟擎 晦獄瞳戲煎 <font fg=ffffff>濠晝 濠褶</font>擊 ж堅 氈棻朝 餌褒擊 濱擎勒 嬴棲啊轄? 濠褐檜 в蹂и勒 濠晦陛 霜蕾 營猿蒂 掘п 虜菟橫 噙朝 匙檜 檜夠曖 徹罌殮棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>...塭堅朝 ж雖虜 渠睡碟曖 僭ヶ菟擎 營猿蒂 陛雖堅 陛賊 <font fg=ffffff>啻瑞だ</font>陛 虜菟橫 鄹棲棻. <font fg=ffffff>營猿菟擎 熱��濠菟檜釭 斜 諼 膛曖 罹楝 夠</font>縑憮 掘й 熱 氈雖蹂. 葆擊縑 氈朝 罹楝 蹂薑菟縑啪 僭橫 爾撮蹂. 號擎 褻樹擊 菟擊 熱 氈擊 匙殮棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">撩檣衝 檜漸お蒂 纂琿棻</a>\r\n</body>","mothere9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>娜魯帕是年老且長壽的守護者，不像我們，守護神的生命是有限的，當然對其他的種族，他們看起來可能也像一個不死的人物。</p>\r\n<p>當她年輕的時候，她是偉大的戰士，同時也是在森林中最好的工匠。如果你想製造某樣東西，你可以使用我旁邊的樓梯下去拜訪她。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">開始入會儀式</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Nerupa is one of the oldest living guardians. Unlike us, guardians' lives are limited. To other beings, they might look like an immortal...but they are not.</p>\r\n<p>When she was young, she was a great warrior and the best artisan in the forest. If you want to make something, get down and see her - you can use the stair beside me to go to her.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Nerupa is one of the oldest living guardians. Unlike us, guardians' lives are limited. To other beings, they might look like an immortal...but they are not.</p>\r\n<p>When she was young, she was a great warrior and the best artisan in the forest. If you want to make something, get down and see her - you can use the stair beside me to go to her.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">Start the initiation</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","mothere9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>啻瑞だ朝 ⑷襄ж朝 陛濰 釭檜萇 熱��濠菟 醞 ж釭殮棲棻. 熱��濠菟擎 辦葬諦朝 殖葬 嶸ии 儅貲擊 陛雖雖蹂. ж曹 棻艇 儅僭菟曖 換戲煎 爾晦縑朝 熱��濠菟紫 醱碟�� '艙錳'擊 替野 薑紫曖 熱貲擊 陛雖堅 氈朝 匙戲煎 綠艦 纔雖虜 蜓殮棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>斜喪朝 瞬橫憮 鬼溘и 瞪餌艘雖虜 翕衛縑 檜 膛 譆堅曖 濰檣檜晦紫 ц蝗棲棻. 渡褐紫 <font fg=ffffff>劃陛 虜菟堅 談擎 匙</font>檜 氈戲賊 斜喪蒂 瓊嬴陛 爾朝啪 橫陽蹂? 薯 夥煎 <font fg=ffffff>蕙縑 氈朝 殮掘</font>蒂 鱔п 雖ж煎 頂溥陛賊 斜喪蒂 虜陳 熱 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"start_event\">撩檣衝 檜漸お蒂 纂琿棻</a>\r\n</body>","motherev1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我真的很高興你已準備好接受一個入會儀式的典禮。</p>\r\n<p>但在入會儀式前，你必須要做一件困難的事。</p>\r\n<p>最近來到森林的一個邪惡魔法師，對森林裡的妖精，不只是妖精們而且是對所有生命的一種威脅，他的名字是都佩傑諾，你的任務就是要擊敗這魔法師。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"motherEv2\">解決問題的方法</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are now ready to take the initiation test!</p>\r\n<p>What you must do for your initiation is...difficult.</p>\r\n<p>Recently an evil sorcerer came to the forest who is a threat not only to elves, but all living things in the forest. His name is Dupelgenon. You task is to defeat this sorcerer.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"motherEv2\">The way to solve the problem</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are now ready to take the initiation test!</p>\r\n<p>What you must do for your initiation is...difficult.</p>\r\n<p>Recently an evil sorcerer came to the forest who is a threat not only to elves, but all living things in the forest. His name is Dupelgenon. You task is to defeat this sorcerer.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"motherEv2\">The way to solve the problem</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>弊賦 渡褐檜 撩檣衝擊 纂瑙 薑紫曖 晦榆擊 乾蹺啪 腎歷棻棲, 晦際晦 斜雖橈啻蹂.</p>\r\n<p>渡褐檜 纂瑞橫撿 й 撩檣衝 婁薯朝 紮 ��萇 匙殮棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>譆斬 膛縑 菟橫諦 辦葬菟 蹂薑褶擊 綠煜и 膛 瞪羹曖 儅貲菟縑啪 п蒂 郭纂朝 翱掘蒂 ж堅 氈朝 葆徹餌陛 и 貲 氈蝗棲棻. 斜曖 檜葷擎 菽ゃ啪凱. 檜 葆徹餌蒂 黴纂ж朝 匙檜 渡褐縑啪 睡婁脹 婁薯殮棲棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"motherEv2\">婁薯蒂 ヰ朝 寞徹</a>\r\n</body>","motherev2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>許多守護神和妖精們經過時，常發現他的洞穴並趕走他。但是他總是在一會兒之後回來又重新開始研究，而且現在的他利用隱身術躲藏在森林之中。</p>\r\n<p>只要藉由使用無所遁形術就能逼使它現身。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>首先我應該祝福你，如果你在外面找到都佩傑諾的影子，這時候要用無所遁形術去破解他的法術，在擊敗他後把他的項鍊帶來給我。</p>\r\n<p>但是，如果他從戰鬥中跑開，不要跟著他而太深入，這只是測試你的智慧、勇氣和技術，你不必冒生命的危險。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在我願你有好的運氣，殷海薩將與你同在！</</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Many guardians and elven rangers used to find his lair and attempt to expel him...but he would always return after a while to start the research anew. Now he has made up his mind to open the laboratory in the hollow south of the Forest.</p>\r\n<p>The only entrance to this hollow is by using the magic gate which Dupelgenon invented, which can only be located by using the Detection spell.  Even if you find the gate, it repels interlopers due to a special curse.  Adding complication, the location of gate changes frequently, and due to the protection, only one person can enter through this gate at a time.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>First, I'll bless you so that you can enter through the gate. If you locate Dupelgenon outside, it means that the gate is near. Use the detection spell to find the gate. Once you enter the hollow, defeat the sorcerer and bring me <font fg=ffffff>the necklace</font> he has.</p>\r\n<p>If he runs from the battle, don't go too much deeper to follow him - this is just to test your wisdom, courage, and skill; you should not risk your life.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now, I wish you good luck. Einhasad be with you!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Many guardians and elven rangers used to find his lair and attempt to expel him...but he would always return after a while to start the research anew. Now he has made up his mind to open the laboratory in the hollow south of the Forest.</p>\r\n<p>The only entrance to this hollow is by using the magic gate which Dupelgenon invented, which can only be located by using the Detection spell.  Even if you find the gate, it repels interlopers due to a special curse.  Adding complication, the location of gate changes frequently, and due to the protection, only one person can enter through this gate at a time.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>First, I'll bless you so that you can enter through the gate. If you locate Dupelgenon outside, it means that the gate is near. Use the detection spell to find the gate. Once you enter the hollow, defeat the sorcerer and bring me <font fg=ffffff>the necklace</font> he has.</p>\r\n<p>If he runs from the battle, don't go too much deeper to follow him - this is just to test your wisdom, courage, and skill; you should not risk your life.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Now, I wish you good luck. Einhasad be with you!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜翕寰 號擎 熱��濠菟婁 蹂薑褶 溯檣盪菟檜 斜曖 模掉擊 嫦唯п憮朝 夷嬴頂堆 ц雖虜...斜陽葆棻 褻旎 氈戲賊 給嬴諦憮 棻衛 翱掘蒂 衛濛п 幗溥憮 嬴輿 堆塢и 雖唳殮棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>斜 葆徹餌朝 賅蝗擊 獗晦朝 等 棟п憮 ゎ模縑朝 棺 賅蝗擊 獗晦朝 等棻 爾鱔曖 蛤臢暮 葆徹戲煎朝 瓊擊 熱陛 橈橫蹂. </p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橾欽 薯陛 渡褐縑啪 蛤臢暮 葆徹戲煎 斜 濠蒂 瓊擊 熱 氈紫煙 蹴犒擊 頂葬啊蝗棲棻. 膛戲煎 釭陛憮 輿嬪蒂 澀 髦Я撮蹂. 斜 葆徹餌曖 <font fg=ffffff>�蝩�檜釭 斜葡濠</font>蒂 瓊擊 熱 氈擊雖紫 賅落棲棻. 嫘縑朝 <font fg=ffffff>惜錳</font>擊 瓊朝 匙紫 紫遺紫 腆 剪縑蹂. 賅蝗擎 瑩啖紫 葆徹 營猿蒂 瓊戲溥賊 蛔碳擊 菟堅 棻棍纔棲梱蹂. 熱鼻и �蝩�擊 嫦唯ж賊 斜夠縑憮 <font fg=ffffff>蛤臢暮 葆徹</font>擊 餌辨ж撮蹂. 斜 棻擠 葆徹餌蒂 黴纂ж堅 斜 濠陛 陛雖堅 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>跡勘檜</font>蒂 陛雖堅 螃賊 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>欽, 斜 葆徹餌朝 掖�勒炾� 營緒腦晦 陽僥縑 濠褐檜 碳葬ж棻堅 儅陝腎賊 旎寞 紫蜂藥 幗萵 剪縑蹂. �母睄� 鼻渠ж賊 寞褕й纔棲 腆 熱 氈戲賊 <font fg=ffffff>濠褐曖 ��</font>戲煎虜 鼻渠ж紫煙 ж撮蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠, 棻喪螃紫煙 ж撮蹂. 嬴檣ж餌萄陛 渡褐婁 л眷 ж褒匏棲棻!</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","motherev3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你還沒準備好面對入會儀式，測試是非常危險的而且你可能必須冒生命的危險，所以先不要著急。</p>\r\n<p>現在先去準備再更進一步地訓練你自己吧。</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are not ready for initiation; the test is very dangerous and you might have to risk your life...so be patient.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now, go and train yourself further.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are not ready for initiation; the test is very dangerous and you might have to risk your life...so be patient.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now, go and train yourself further.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐擎 嬴霜 唳я檜 睡褶м棲棻. 撩檣衝檜塭朝 欽橫陛 瞬擎 葆擠縑 詣氈橫 爾橾鎬紫 賅腦雖虜, 褒薯煎朝 儅貲擊 勘堅 婁薯蒂 ヴ雖 彊戲賊 寰腎朝 嬪яи 匙檜奧棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>濠, 覬 渦 熱溼擊 論堅 棻衛 螃紫煙 ж撮蹂.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>","motherev4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你...你跟隨的是格蘭肯的教義嗎？</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你沒有資格進行我們種族的入會儀式，你應該對你沾滿血腥的雙手感到羞愧。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You...are you following the teachings of Gran Kain...?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...you don't deserve our race's initiation ceremony - be ashamed of your bloody hands.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You...are you following the teachings of Gran Kain...?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...you don't deserve our race's initiation ceremony - be ashamed of your bloody hands.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐...撲葆 斜嫌 蘋檣曖 陛腦藹擊 評腦啪 脹 匙檣陛蹂....?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...渡褐擎 辦葬 謙褶曖 撩檣衝擊 纂蒂 濠問檜 橈蝗棲棻. 賸 橈朝 Я煎 僭萇 斜 槳檜 睡莖楝遴還 嬴撮蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","motherev5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>不要因為一次的失敗就失望，每一天尋求解答的冒險都將使你更強壯和更聰明。</p>\r\n<p>現在，靠自己的力量再試一次！</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"motherEv2\">問有關入會儀式的程序</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Don't be disappointed that you have failed - everyday's adventuring makes you stronger and wiser.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now, do try again!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"motherEv2\">Ask about the initiation procedure</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Don't be disappointed that you have failed - everyday's adventuring makes you stronger and wiser.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now, do try again!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"motherEv2\">Ask about the initiation procedure</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠褐曖 賅я縑 撩婁陛 橈棻堅 傘鼠 褒蜂ж雖 葆撮蹂. 薑港擊 瓊嬴 ④衙朝 ж瑞ж瑞曖 賅я檜撿蜓煎 渡褐擊 爾棻 鬼ж堅 雖��照啪 虜萄朝 錳繭殮棲棻.</p>\r\n<p>濠, 橫眷蒂 よ堅! 棻衛 и廓 衛濛п 瑭蹂!</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"motherEv2\">撩檣衝 瞰離蒂 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","motherev6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我知道你能完成它！恭喜你！</p>\r\n<p>不要為他逃走而擔憂，無論如何他不會那麼快回來的。</p>\r\n<p>現在，當是完成你的入會儀式的一個表徵，我將賜給你一樣武器，你想要哪一把？</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven short sword of constitution\">體質精靈短劍</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven bow of dexterity\">敏捷精靈弓</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven short sword of magic power\">魔法精靈短劍</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I knew that you could do it! Congratulations!</p>\r\n<p>Don't worry about his running - he won't be back soon.</p>\r\n<p>Now, as a token of finishing your initiation, I'll give you a weapon - which would you like?</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven short sword of constitution\">Sword which raises Constitution</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven bow of dexterity\">Bow of Dexterity</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven short sword of magic power\">Sword which raises Magic Power</a>\r\n</body>","motherEv6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I knew that you could do it! Congratulations!</p>\r\n<p>Don't worry about his running - he won't be back soon.</p>\r\n<p>Now, as a token of finishing your initiation, I'll give you a weapon - which would you like?</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven short sword of constitution\">Sword which raises Constitution</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven bow of dexterity\">Bow of Dexterity</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven short sword of magic power\">Sword which raises Magic Power</a>\r\n</body>","motherEv6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐檜 п 鳥 還 憲懊橫蹂! 薑蜓 蹴жм棲棻!</p>\r\n<p>葆徹餌陛 紫蜂除 匙縑 渠п憮朝 傘鼠 褐唳噙雖 蜓嬴蹂. 橫繚萇 и翕寰擎 棻衛 跤給嬴螢纔棲梱 蜓檜轄.</p>\r\n<p>濠, 撩檣曖 隸ル陛 腆 蠔擊 萄葬啊蝗棲棻. 橫雯 蠔擊 錳ж轄?</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven short sword of constitution\">儅貲溘檜 螃腦朝 蠔</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven bow of dexterity\">團繪紫陛 螃腦朝 ��</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"request elven short sword of magic power\">葆溘檜 螃腦朝 蠔</a>\r\n</body>","motherev7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>入會儀式是一次生命中的競賽，也是你的贖罪？</p>\r\n<p>但是我聽說他仍然試著打開森林裡的實驗室，好吧，稍後將會執行入會儀式，這可能是對妖精們有益的任務。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The initiation is a once in a lifetime event.</p>\r\n<p>...But I heard that he is still trying to open the laboratory in the forest. Well, it will be a good task for elves who will take the initiation later.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the forest and elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The initiation is a once in a lifetime event.</p>\r\n<p>...But I heard that he is still trying to open the laboratory in the forest. Well, it will be a good task for elves who will take the initiation later.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撩檣衝擎 橾儅縑 欽 и廓夤縑 橈朝 檜漸お縑蹂. 渡褐曖 撩檣衝擎 �饑萼� 陴雖 彊擊虜и �К〥� 匙檜歷釭蹂?</p>\r\n<p>...ж雖虜 斜 葆徹餌朝 蹂闈縑紫 雖纂雖 彊堅 膛曖 橫蛞陛縑 翱掘模蒂 離溥憮 跤脹 翱掘蒂 ж棻陛朝 夷啖釭堆 и棻渦捱蹂. 凳, 檜 耀掘曖 籀葬朝 檜�醴� 撩檣衝擊 纂蒂 蹂薑菟擊 嬪п 陴啖舒紫煙 ж雖蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","motherev8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哦！你遺失了項鍊？</p>\r\n<p>嗯∼不是我不相信你，但是入會的條件就是帶來項鍊。</p>\r\n<p>幸運地是都佩傑諾自己沒有項鍊也不能進入實驗室，所以如果你再一次找到他並擊敗他，你就能得到另外的一條項鍊。</p>\r\n<p>現在，不要感到沮喪，為了它而出發吧！</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh... You lost the necklace?</p>\r\n<p>Um...it's not that I don't believe you, but the condition of the initiation was bringing the necklace.</p>\r\n<p>Fortunately it seems that Dupelgenon himself can't enter the laboratory without the necklace, so you can get another necklace if you find and defeat him once again.</p>\r\n<p>Now, go for it!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oh... You lost the necklace?</p>\r\n<p>Um...it's not that I don't believe you, but the condition of the initiation was bringing the necklace.</p>\r\n<p>Fortunately it seems that Dupelgenon himself can't enter the laboratory without the necklace, so you can get another necklace if you find and defeat him once again.</p>\r\n<p>Now, go for it!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherEv8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>盪楛...跡勘檜蒂 檠橫幗溜棻堅蹂?</p>\r\n<p>擠...渡褐擊 圖雖 彊朝 匙擎 嬴棲雖虜, <font fg=ffffff>跡勘檜蒂 陛螳諦撿 и棻'</font>塭朝 匙檜 撩檣衝曖 褻勒檜歷戲棲梱蹂.</p>\r\n<p>棻ч�� 菽ゃ啪凱 獄檣紫 斜 跡勘檜陛 橈戲賊 雖ж 翱掘褒縑 跤 菟橫除棻堅 ж棲 菽ゃ啪凱擊 棻衛 瓊嬴憮 籀纂ж賊 樹薯萇雖 跡勘檜朝 橢擊 熱 氈擊疏縑蹂.</p>\r\n<p>濠, 傘鼠 褒蜂ж雖 蜓堅...��擊 頂憮 棻衛 棻喪螃撮蹂!\r\n</body>","motherm1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在這裡看見人類是一件罕見的事情，是其他的<a link=\"motherm2\">妖精</a>帶你進來這裡的嗎？無論如何，如果想讓守護神讓你經過，那你必定要有某樣東西在身邊才行。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherm1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a rare thing to see humans here...did another <a link=\"motherm2\">Elf</a> connected to you bring you here? There must be something to you if the guardians let you pass.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherm1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a rare thing to see humans here...did another <a link=\"motherm2\">Elf</a> connected to you bring you here? There must be something to you if the guardians let you pass.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherm1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檣除檜 檜夠縑 菟橫螃棻棲 萄僥 橾紫 棻 氈捱蹂. 渡褐婁 檣翱檜 氈朝 <a link=\"motherm2\">蹂薑</a> 醞 ж釭陛 渡褐擊 檜夠戲煎 檣紫ц釭蹂? 橫繚萇 熱��濠菟檜 渡褐擊 鱔婁衛鑑 匙擊 爾賊 渡褐縑啪朝 鼠歙檣陛 氈朝啪 碟貲ж捱蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","motherm2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>迷幻森林之母：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這是妖精們神聖的地方，通常你是不能進入這裡，但是規則是規則，結果是結果，我能對一個已經進入這裡的人做什麼呢？</p>\r\n<p>這裡是與你原本生活的世界截然不同的地方，所以對你來說也許會有一點危險，我希望你有一次安全的旅程。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherm2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is a sacred place for elves; as a rule, you can't enter here. A rule is a rule, but the result is tje result. What can I do to one who has already entered here?</p>\r\n<p>This is a different world from the one in which you live. Though it may be little dangerous for you, I hope you have a safe journey.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherm2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Mother of the Forest and Elves:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is a sacred place for elves; as a rule, you can't enter here. A rule is a rule, but the result is tje result. What can I do to one who has already entered here?</p>\r\n<p>This is a different world from the one in which you live. Though it may be little dangerous for you, I hope you have a safe journey.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","motherm2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜夠擎 獄楚 辦葬菟 蹂薑曖 撩雖殮棲棻. 敘罌渠煎塭賊 渡褐擎 檜夠縑 菟橫螢 熱 橈朝 匙檜轄. ж雖虜 敘罌擎 橫蛤梱雖釭 敘罌, 唸婁朝 橫蛤梱雖釭 唸婁殮棲棻. 檜嘐 菟橫螃褐 碟擊 橫翹啊橫蹂.</p>\r\n<p>罹楝碟檜 髦湍 撮鼻婁朝 罹楝陛雖煎 棻艇 夠檜塭 覬 嬪яй鎬紫 賅腦啊蝗棲棻虜, らи 罹ч檜 腎衛望 夥塭啊蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n</body>","narhenCE-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>橫飩啪 脹剪縑蹂? 渡褐曖 擠儀擎 傘鼠釭 剪艦堅 饕п憮 \r\n褻�飛� 檠堅 и橈檜 蹺塊ж朝 億曖 欽蜓葆諦 偽捱蹂. 葆耀 \r\n斜嫌蘋檣曖 餌學и 醒擠模葬籀歲.. 薯嫦 獄楚曖 擠儀擊 瓊望 \r\n夥楚蹂.</p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n","narhence1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>你在幹嘛啊？你的曲子粗俗且骯髒就像是格蘭肯瘋狂的叫聲...\r\n請找到自己的旋律吧。</p>       \r\n</body>       ","narhenCE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What happened to you? Your melody is too coarse and impure - like the insane howl of Gran Kain...\r\nPlease get your own rhythm.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","narhenCE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What happened to you? Your melody is too coarse and impure - like the insane howl of Gran Kain...\r\nPlease get your own rhythm.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","narhenCE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>橫飩啪 脹剪縑蹂? 渡褐曖 擠儀擎 傘鼠釭 剪艦堅 饕п憮 \r\n褻�飛� 檠堅 嘐耀蛭檜 選葬堅 氈橫蹂. 葆纂 斜嫌蘋檣曖 餌學и \r\n醒擠模葬籀歲.. 薯嫦 獄楚曖 擠儀擊 瓊望 夥楚蹂.</p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n","narhene1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>希望這些和諧的旋律能傳達到你的心中。\r\n<br>\r\n當你看見<a link=\"narhenE10\">潘</a>跑過森林的時候你可能認為他們是<a link = \"narhenE2\">率直暴力的</a> 。\r\n但他們實際上是喜愛音樂而且細緻優雅的種族。尤其他們喜歡在月圓時，吹奏<a link=\"narhenE3\">魔法笛子</a>。\r\n<br>他們是我的朋友，並且了解、喜愛我的音樂。\r\n</p>       \r\n       \r\n</body>       ","narhenE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>May you sing with your heart, following harmonious melody...\r\n<br>\r\nWhen you see <a link=\"narhenE10\">Pans</a> moving through the forest you may think that\r\nthey are <a link = \"narhenE2\">straightforward and violent</a>. But they are actually a delicate race, loving music. They especially they like the sounds of <a link=\"narhenE3\">magic flutes</a> at the full moon.\r\n<br>They are my friends; they always understand and love my music.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","narhenE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>May you sing with your heart, following harmonious melody...\r\n<br>\r\nWhen you see <a link=\"narhenE10\">Pans</a> moving through the forest you may think that\r\nthey are <a link = \"narhenE2\">straightforward and violent</a>. But they are actually a delicate race, loving music. They especially they like the sounds of <a link=\"narhenE3\">magic flutes</a> at the full moon.\r\n<br>They are my friends; they always understand and love my music.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","narhenE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>褻�風怷� 擠睦縑 評腦朝 葆擠戲煎 喻楚ж望..\r\n<br>\r\n膛樓擊 剪艦匙 橈檜 殖溥釭陛朝 <a link=\"narhenE10\">っ</a>褶菟擊 橡е 爾賊 傘鼠\r\n<a link = \"narhenE2\"> 霜摹瞳檜堅 陪ァж棻堅</a> 替野雖紫 \r\n賅腦雖虜 餌褒擎 擠學擊 餌嫌ж朝 撰撮и 謙褶菟檜奧棲棻.     \r\nか�� 虜錯縑 睡朝 <a link=\"narhenE3\">葆徹曖 Ы當</a> 翱輿蒂 陛濰 謠嬴п蹂.\r\n<br>斜菟擎 о鼻曖 盪曖 翱輿蒂 陛濰 澀 檜пж堅 餌嫌п輿朝 盪曖 耀掘菟檜轄.       \r\n</p>       \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n","narhene10-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>他們是有人類的軀幹和山羊腿的種族。我聽說殷海薩是從那些在世界樹的周圍放牧的山羊創造出他們的。\r\n<br>    \r\n靠近他們很難，因為他們很率直但是有點暴力，但是他們在那些守護神之中是最勇敢的一群，而且如此有助於保護森林。此外你能從他們那裡得到像<a link=\"narhenE11\">潘的鬃毛</a>之類有用的材料。\r\n</p> \r\n</body>\r\n","narhenE10-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>They are the race with a human torso and the legs of a goat. I heard that Einhasad created them from a goat grazing the grasses around the World Tree.\r\n<br>\r\nIt's hard to get close to them, because they are straightforward and violent, but they are the most courageous among the guardians and thus contribute the most in protecting the forest. Further you can get useful materials like <a link=\"narhenE11\">Pan's mane</a> from them.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","narhenE10-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>They are the race with a human torso and the legs of a goat. I heard that Einhasad created them from a goat grazing the grasses around the World Tree.\r\n<br>\r\nIt's hard to get close to them, because they are straightforward and violent, but they are the most courageous among the guardians and thus contribute the most in protecting the forest. Further you can get useful materials like <a link=\"narhenE11\">Pan's mane</a> from them.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","narhenE10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>膩模曖 棻葬縑 檣除曖 鼻奩褐婁 膩模曖 該葬蒂 陛霞   \r\n謙褶檜雖蹂. 嬴檣ж餌萄 褐眷憮 撮啗熱 輿滲曖 蟾錳縑 ヴ擊   \r\n嗯橫 詳湍 膩模煎 っ 褶擊 璽褻ж樟棻堅 п蹂.\r\n<br>    \r\n陪ァж堅 霜摹瞳檣 撩問檜橫憮 陛梱檜 ж晦 橫滑雖虜  \r\n斜菟曖 辨裊л 傳и 熱��濠 醞縑 譆堅塭憮 膛擊 雖酈朝 橾蛔  \r\n奢褐擎 夥煎 っ菟檜縑蹂. 傳и <a link=\"narhenE11\">っ曖 陞晦瓚</a>偽擎 嶸辨и 營猿蒂 \r\n橢擊 熱紫 氈朝 模醞и 襄營縑蹂.\r\n</p>       \r\n</body>","narhene11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你能要求<a link=\"narhenE7\">芮克妮</a>把潘的鬃毛作成非常柔軟卻堅固的線。然後你可以把它交給 <a link=\"narhenE9\">娜魯帕</a>去製造弓，衣服，斗篷，和其他的事物。你可以使用赤裸的手撫摸他們的鬃毛，這樣就可以得到鬃毛，但是如果你弄痛他們的話，他們會變得很兇暴，所以你要非常小心。\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","narhenE11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can ask <a link=\"narhenE7\">Arachnes</a> to make Pan's mane into thread. The threads from pan's mane are very soft yet tough - it's the essential material for <a link=\"narhenE9\">Nerupa</a> to make bows, clothes, cloaks, and other things. You can collect them using your bare hands by stroking their mane - but they can become violent if you cause them pain...so be very careful when collecting them.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","narhenE11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can ask <a link=\"narhenE7\">Arachnes</a> to make Pan's mane into thread. The threads from pan's mane are very soft yet tough - it's the essential material for <a link=\"narhenE9\">Nerupa</a> to make bows, clothes, cloaks, and other things. You can collect them using your bare hands by stroking their mane - but they can become violent if you cause them pain...so be very careful when collecting them.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","narhenE11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>っ曖 陞晦瓚擎 <a link=\"narhenE7\">嬴塭觼啻</a>菟縑啪 睡饕п 褒煎 虜菟 熱 氈橫蹂. \r\nっ曖 陞晦瓚煎 禮 褒擎 睡萄毀堅紫 韓啖憮 <a link=\"narhenE9\">啻瑞だ</a>\r\n陛 虜菟橫 輿朝 �偯抭� 褡,蜂饜,濩�飛� 虜萄朝等 в熱瞳檣 營猿縑蹂.\r\nっ曖 陞晦瓚擊 橢戲溥賊 っ菟縑啪 棻陛陛 裔槳戲煎 瓣餵擊 ж賊 腎雖虜\r\nっ 褶菟擎 撩韓檜 陪ァп憮 陞晦瓚擊 橢棻陛 褻旎虜 嬴だ紫 望望檜 陳嗨棲梱 \r\nо鼻 跡獗擊 勘堅 褻褕蝶毀啪 瓣餵п撿п蹂.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>","narhene2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>潘以他們狂暴的行為而聞名，因為他們試著去踩在他們面前的每件事物身上，但是這也是因為除了音樂以外沒有東西能抑制他們。他們就是那麼單純的。\r\n<br>  \r\n不過我們精靈們利用牠那個習慣來製造有用的事物。如果你連同蛻皮和米索莉或奧里哈魯根一起帶來。他們會用堅硬的腳蹄踩踏，這樣就可以製造出<a link=\"narhenE4\">米索莉金屬板</a>或<a link=\"narhenE5\">奧里哈魯根金屬板</a>。\r\n<br>此外最害怕他們狂暴的行為的是要侵入森林的人類。潘是森林裡最可信賴的守護神。\r\n</p>     \r\n     \r\n</body>     ","narhenE2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Pans are famous for their ferocity, because they try to trample everything that stands in their way. Nothing except music can restrain them, because of their purity.\r\n<br>\r\nBut we elves can make useful things by taking advantage of that habit. If you bring ecdysis along with mithril or oriharukon, they make <a link=\"narhenE4\">mithril plate</a> or <a link=\"narhenE5\">oriharukon plate</a> by trampling the materials with their hard hooves.\r\n<br>Further, the ones most afraid of their ferocity are the humans who want to invade the forest; Pans are the most trustworthy guardians of the forest.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n     \r\n","narhenE2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Pans are famous for their ferocity, because they try to trample everything that stands in their way. Nothing except music can restrain them, because of their purity.\r\n<br>\r\nBut we elves can make useful things by taking advantage of that habit. If you bring ecdysis along with mithril or oriharukon, they make <a link=\"narhenE4\">mithril plate</a> or <a link=\"narhenE5\">oriharukon plate</a> by trampling the materials with their hard hooves.\r\n<br>Further, the ones most afraid of their ferocity are the humans who want to invade the forest; Pans are the most trustworthy guardians of the forest.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n     \r\n","narhenE2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>ゎ模 っ菟曖 陪ァл擎 嶸貲ж轄. っ菟擎 濠褐檜 擅擊 陛煎 虞朝 勒 鼠褻勒 嫖擊溥堅    \r\nж剪萇蹂. ж雖虜 斜勒 擠學擊 薯諼и 檜 撮鼻 橫替 匙紫 斜 濠嶸煎遴 謙褶擊 掘樓й 牖 橈晦 陽僥檜縑蹂. \r\nっ菟擎 斜 虜躑 牖熱и 謙褶檜剪萇蹂.\r\n<br>  \r\nж雖虜 辦葬 蹂薑菟擎 斜楛 蝗撩擊 檜辨п憮 嶸辨и 匙菟擊   \r\n虜菟晦紫 п蹂. <font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵檜釭 螃葬ж瑞夔</font>擊  \r\n<font fg=ffffff>嬴塭觼啻曖 ъ僭</font>婁 л眷 陛螳陛賊 っ菟擎  \r\n欽欽и 嫦掄戲煎 斜勘 舒萄溥憮 <a link=\"narhenE4\">嘐蝶萵 っ旎</a>檜釭 \r\n<a link=\"narhenE5\">螃葬ж瑞夔   \r\nっ旎</a>擊 虜菟橫 遽港棲棻. \r\n<br>渦掘釭 斜菟曖 陪ァл擊 陛濰 舒溥錶ж朝 匙擎 膛擊 藹彰ж溥朝  \r\n檣除菟檜轄. っ擎 陛濰 圖擠霜и 膛曖 熱��濠縑蹂. \r\n</p>     \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n","narhene3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\"><p align=\"left\">那翰：</p></font>\r\n<p>它是用奧里哈魯根和安特的樹皮做成的笛子。所有的妖精都能用這個演奏來一首動人的歌。潘非常喜歡這支笛子的聲音，所以如果你使用這隻笛子，那麼他將會過來，而且會用他的角來交換。</p>\r\n<p>我知道製造它的方式。只要你給我充足的材料，我就可以做出來。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request magic flute\">製造魔法笛子</a></p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","narhenE3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a flute made of oriharukon and bark of Ent. All elves can play a beautiful song with this; Pan likes the sound of this flute very much, so if you use it then he will come and ask to exchange it with <a link=\"narhenE6\">his horn</a>. But the tone is very vibrant and can sometimes agitate other monsters, because they don't understand the music.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>I know how to make them, so I can make one if you bring me enough materials.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request magic flute\">Make magic flute</a></p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","narhenE3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a flute made of oriharukon and bark of Ent. All elves can play a beautiful song with this; Pan likes the sound of this flute very much, so if you use it then he will come and ask to exchange it with <a link=\"narhenE6\">his horn</a>. But the tone is very vibrant and can sometimes agitate other monsters, because they don't understand the music.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>I know how to make them, so I can make one if you bring me enough materials.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request magic flute\">Make magic flute</a></p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","narhenE3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>螃葬ж瑞夔婁 縛お曖 皎韓</font>煎 虜萄朝 Ы當檜轄. 蹂薑檜塭賊 檜勘煎 援掘釭   \r\n詣霞 翱輿蒂 й 熱陛 氈橫蹂. っ擎 檜 學晦曖 模葬蒂 陛濰  \r\n謠嬴п憮 檜勘 睡腦賊 っ檜 棻陛諦憮 <a link=\"narhenE6\">濠褐曖  \r\n閩</a>婁 蜃夥羚溥堅紫 ж雖蹂. ж雖虜 褻褕ж撮蹂. 檜  \r\n學晦曖 擠儀擎 傘鼠釭 鬼溺п憮 棻艇 跨蝶攪菟擊 濠斛ж晦紫  \r\nж棲梱蹂. 斜菟擎 薑蜓 擠學擊 檜пж堅 氈雖 跤п蹂.</p> \r\n<p>虜萄朝 寞徹擎 薯陛 憲堅   \r\n氈戲棲梱 營猿虜 氈戲賊 樹薯萇 虜菟 熱 氈橫蹂.</p>  \r\n<br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request magic flute\">葆徹曖 Ы當擊 虜萇棻</a></p>  \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n","narhene4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>只要把<a link=\"narhenE8\">純粹的米索莉</a>塗在<a link=\"narhenE7\">芮克妮的蛻皮</a>上就可以做出來。這個金屬板是如此閃亮而堅硬的，而且如果你帶著它到<a link=\"narhenE9\">娜魯帕</a>，她就可以用它來為你製造盔甲或盾牌。</p>\r\n    \r\n</body>    ","narhenE4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make it by coating <a link=\"narhenE8\">mithril</a> on an <a link=\"narhenE7\">ecdysis of Arachne</a>. This plate is light, yet hard and if you take it to <a link=\"narhenE9\">Nerupa</a>, she can use it to make armor or shields.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>    \r\n    \r\n","narhenE4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make it by coating <a link=\"narhenE8\">mithril</a> on an <a link=\"narhenE7\">ecdysis of Arachne</a>. This plate is light, yet hard and if you take it to <a link=\"narhenE9\">Nerupa</a>, she can use it to make armor or shields.</p>\r\n\r\n</body>    \r\n    \r\n","narhenE4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p><a link=\"narhenE7\">嬴塭觼啻曖 ъ僭</a>縑 <a link=\"narhenE8\">嘐蝶萵</a>擊 殮�� っ戲煎 陛滷堅紫\r\n欽欽п憮 <a link=\"narhenE9\">啻瑞だ</a>縑啪 陛螳棻 輿賊 輿煎 <font fg=ffffff>骨褡檜釭 寞ぬ</font>蛔 \r\n寞橫掘蒂 虜菟橫 輿朝等 餌辨脹棻堅 ж渦捱蹂.</p>\r\n    \r\n</body>    \r\n    \r\n","narhene5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>只要把<a link=\"narhenE8\">奧里哈魯根</a>塗在<a link=\"narhenE7\">芮克妮的蛻皮</a>上就可以做出來。我聽說這種東西只有傳說中的獨角獸的角才能刺穿它。 所以如果你帶著它到<a link=\"narhenE9\">娜魯帕</a>，她就可以用它來為你製造盔甲或盾牌。</p>\r\n    \r\n</body>    ","narhenE5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make one by coating <a link=\"narhenE8\">oriharukon</a> on an <a link=\"narhenE7\">ecdysis of Arachne</a>. I heard that once it is made, only a legendary unicorn horn can pierce it. So if you take it to <a link=\"narhenE9\">Nerupa</a>, she can use it to make armor or shields.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","narhenE5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You can make one by coating <a link=\"narhenE8\">oriharukon</a> on an <a link=\"narhenE7\">ecdysis of Arachne</a>. I heard that once it is made, only a legendary unicorn horn can pierce it. So if you take it to <a link=\"narhenE9\">Nerupa</a>, she can use it to make armor or shields.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","narhenE5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p><a link=\"narhenE7\">嬴塭觼啻曖 ъ僭</a>縑 <a link=\"narhenE8\">螃葬ж瑞夔</a>擊 殮�� っ戲煎 斜匙擊 \r\n勢擊 熱 氈朝 匙擎 瞪撲煎虜 瞪п雖朝 嶸棲夔曖 閩閨檜塭堅 \r\nж渦捱蹂. 斜楚憮 檜勘 <a link=\"narhenE9\">啻瑞だ</a>縑啪 陛螳棻 輿賊 輿煎 <font fg=ffffff>骨褡檜釭 寞ぬ</font>蛔 寞橫掘蒂 虜菟橫 輿朝等 噙檜釭 瑭蹂.</p>\r\n    \r\n</body>    \r\n    \r\n","narhene6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>潘的角是他的勇氣和狂暴的象徵。他的角非常地銳利，只要你把<a link=\"narhenE8\">純粹的米索莉和奧里哈魯根</a>塗在在它的表面，你就能帶著它到<a link=\"narhenE9\">娜魯帕</a>那去製作刀劍或矛。</p>\r\n</body>      ","narhenE6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Pan's horn is the symbol of his valor and ferocity; it is very sharp and once you coat it with <a link=\"narhenE8\">mithril or oriharukon</a>, you can take it to <a link=\"narhenE9\">Nerupa</a> to make a sword or spear out of it.\r\n</body>\r\n      \r\n","narhenE6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Pan's horn is the symbol of his valor and ferocity; it is very sharp and once you coat it with <a link=\"narhenE8\">mithril or oriharukon</a>, you can take it to <a link=\"narhenE9\">Nerupa</a> to make a sword or spear out of it.\r\n</body>\r\n      \r\n","narhenE6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>っ曖 閩擎 っ曖 辨裊撩婁 陪ァл曖 鼻癒婁紫 偽轄. っ曖 \r\n閩擎 部檜 銨褶п憮 <a link=\"narhenE8\">嘐蝶萵檜釭 螃葬ж瑞夔戲煎 紫旎</a>п憮 \r\n<a link=\"narhenE9\">啻瑞だ</a>縑啪 陛螳棻 輿賊 <font fg=ffffff>璽檜釭 匐</font>曖 薯濛縑 嶸辨ж啪 噙檣棻堅 п蹂.</p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n","narhene7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>芮克妮是守護神種族之一，而且他們有時候會給你蛻下的皮或為你紡線。這方面的消息，你最好問問里爾得，因為他常和他們在一起。</p>\r\n</body>    ","narhenE7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Arachnes are one of the guardian races and they sometimes give you ecdysis and sometimes spin thread for you. You'd should ask Theordor, for he is very close to them.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n    \r\n","narhenE7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Arachnes are one of the guardian races and they sometimes give you ecdysis and sometimes spin thread for you. You'd should ask Theordor, for he is very close to them.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n    \r\n","narhenE7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>蹂薑曖 膛擊 雖麵輿朝 熱�� 謙褶 醞 ж釭檣 嬴塭觼啻褶菟擎 斜菟曖 欽欽и <font fg=ffffff>皎韓</font>擊 輿晦紫 ж堅 嗨橫陪 槳營輿煎 <font fg=ffffff>褒</font>擊 瞼 輿晦紫 п蹂.\r\n嬴塭觼啻縑 渠п憮朝 斜菟婁 耀и <font fg=ffffff>纔嬴紫腦</font>陛 澀 憲堅 氈堅 氈擊 剪縑蹂.</p>\r\n</body>    \r\n    \r\n","narhene8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>關於金屬方面，像是米索莉或奧里哈魯根，你應該要問多特。</p>\r\n    \r\n</body>    ","narhenE8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You should ask Doett about metals like mithril or oriharukon... </p>\r\n\r\n</body>    \r\n    \r\n","narhenE8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You should ask Doett about metals like mithril or oriharukon... </p>\r\n\r\n</body>    \r\n    \r\n","narhenE8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>嘐蝶萵檜釭 螃葬ж瑞夔</font>偽擎 旎樓縑 渠п憮朝 紫旎曖 瞪蝓濠 <font fg=ffffff>紫縑お</font>陛 澀 憲堅 氈湍等..\r\nи廓 瓊嬴陛憮 僭橫 爾撮蹂.</p>\r\n    \r\n</body>    \r\n    \r\n","narhene9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>我正好說到那位居住在世界樹旁邊洞穴的長老。只要你把那些獨特的材料交給她，她便會用芮克妮獨特的技術來製造各種物品。她是一位慈善的淑女。</p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      ","narhenE9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I was referring to the eldest Arachne who lives in the cave beside the World Tree. She makes all kind of items with the arachnes' unique techniques from materials you bring. She is a benevolent lady, though sometimes very harsh...</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","narhenE9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I was referring to the eldest Arachne who lives in the cave beside the World Tree. She makes all kind of items with the arachnes' unique techniques from materials you bring. She is a benevolent lady, though sometimes very harsh...</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","narhenE9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>膛婁 蹂薑曖 橫該棲塭 碳葬辦朝 葆擊 醞懈曖 <font fg=ffffff>撮啗熱 蕙曖 饜掉</font>縑 髦堅 氈朝 嬴塭觼啻褶 濰煎蒂 蜓ж朝 剪縑蹂.\r\n嬴塭觼啻褶 か嶸曖 槳營輿煎 營猿蒂 賅嬴 陛賊 辦葬 蹂薑菟縑啪 <font fg=ffffff>罹楝 僭勒擊 虜菟橫輿朝</font> 堅葆遴 碟檜縑蹂.\r\n蜓擊 覬 яж啪 ж曹 ж雖虜..</p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n","narhenm1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那翰：</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>你只是個匆匆拜訪世界的人類旅行者。人類的音樂有它自己的特性，而且它依照每個表演者而改變。但是你不必用音樂去接觸世界的起源。你只需要做自己，也許那就是人類生存的本質...</p>\r\n       \r\n</body> ","narhenM1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are a human traveller who just visits the world fleetingly. Human music varies according to each performer, and you don't do music to reach the origin of the world. You just want to express yourself...maybe that's the nature of human existence...</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","narhenM1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Narhen:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are a human traveller who just visits the world fleetingly. Human music varies according to each performer, and you don't do music to reach the origin of the world. You just want to express yourself...maybe that's the nature of human existence...</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","narhenM1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>釭腦縛:</p></font>  \r\n<br>  \r\n<p>渡褐擎 撮鼻縑 濡衛 諮棻陛 棻衛 集釭陛朝 罹ч濠, \r\n檣除檜煎捱蹂. 檣除菟曖 擠學縑朝 и 餌塋, и 餌塋葆棻 \r\n濠晦虜曖 偃撩檜 氈朝 匙檜 絮かп蹂. ж雖虜 模葬蒂 鱔п \r\n撮鼻曖 斬錳縑 蕾斬ж溥朝 擠學擎 ж雖 彊朝 匙 偽嬴蹂. \r\n擠學擊 鱔п 濠褐擊 ル⑷ж溥堅 ж轄. 斜啪 檣除檜塢 襄營曖 \r\n獄韓橾雖紫..</p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n","neil1-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>尼爾:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n冠石跟亞丁很近，所以冠石在軍事方面及政治方面都得看亞丁的臉色。現在冠石的城主一直都在擔心冠石內反王的勢力會增長。 \r\n你也知道受到反王的憎惡的地方，當天就會變成虛無的荒地。隔壁的古丁就是個很好的例子。 <br>\r\n冠石若變成那樣...！嗚嗚...光想到就會起雞皮疙瘩.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","neil1-e.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Neil :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nGiran gets a lot of influence in trades and military from Aden because the locations are close. The current Giran Lord is always worried about rebels that might rise in his town. \r\nIf the King gets mad all hell will break loose in Giran town. Gludin town is a good example of that. <br>\r\nIf that happens here... just thinking about it give me the chills.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","neil1-j.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Neil :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nGiran gets a lot of influence in trades and military from Aden because the locations are close. The current Giran Lord is always worried about rebels that might rise in his town. \r\nIf the King gets mad all hell will break loose in Giran town. Gludin town is a good example of that. <br>\r\nIf that happens here... just thinking about it give me the chills.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","neil1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻橾 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n檜 晦塢擎 嬴筆婁 檣蕾п 氈橫憮 斜楛雖 捱餌瞳戲煎釭 薑纂瞳戲煎 嬴筆曖 換纂蒂 號檜 髦Я朝 ら檜轄. ⑷營 晦塢曖 艙輿朝 ч罹塭紫 奩諾縑啪 奩晦蒂 萄朝 撮溘檜 晦塢頂縑憮 濠塭陳 梱瑭 樹薯釭 堅褕檜奧棲棻. \r\n渡褐紫 模僥擎 櫛�� 菟橫 憲堅 氈啊雖虜 奩諾曖 嘐遺檜塭紫 餌朝 陳縑朝 艙雖陛 齒渠寧檜 腎朝 勒 牖衝除檜剪萇蹂. 蹂 蕙 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖朝 夥煎 斜 獄爾晦檜雖蹂. <br>\r\n檜夠檜 虜擒 斜溢啪 脹棻賊... 戲戲... 儅陝虜п紫 莠鎰ж捱蹂.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","nelson1-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>尼爾森:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n用骨頭碎片製造出來的防具，重量很輕、防禦很強，不過對於魔法的防護效果比較弱。若遇到比較強的符咒，就會被溶化掉。\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","nelson1-e.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nelson :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nArmors that are made from bones are very light and durable but weak against magic. If you try to enchant them they'll evaporate easily.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","nelson1-j.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nelson :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nArmors that are made from bones are very light and durrable but weak against magic. So if you try to enchant them they'll evaporate easily.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","nelson1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啼蝦 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n鄙煎虜萇 寞橫掘菟擎 陛滷堅 ががж釭 葆徹�膩�縑 擒ж棻朝 欽薄檜 氈雖蹂. 斜楚憮 鬼�俯砦挫� 勘賊 蔣啪 隸嫦п 幗葬堆 и港棲棻.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","nenani1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那那米甘地：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我們不像你們人類一樣耕種。狩獵...或搶奪是我們的生活方式。\r\n<p>如果我們像人類一樣耕種，也許我們會變得比較富有也不一定，不過就是沒有人考慮這個提議。我們的守護神是火神帕格立歐...就算我們是被大地限制，我們還是不能抹煞掉我們的戰士精神...\r\n<p>但是有一個例外。比如說那個叫<a link=\"nenani2\">葛拉</a>的妖魔。\r\n</body>\r\n","nenani1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nenani Gandi:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We don't farm like you humans. Hunting... or robbing is our way of life.\r\n<p>Of course it may be possible that we will become richer if we farm like humans. But no one considers that idea. Our guardian is Paagrio the God of Fire...we can't consume our warrior spirits once we are confined to the earth.\r\n<p>...but there are exceptions, such as orcs like <a link=\"nenani2\">Gora</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","nenani1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nenani Gandi:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We don't farm like you humans. Hunting... or robbing is our way of life.\r\n<p>Of course it may be possible that we will become richer if we farm like humans. But no one considers that idea. Our guardian is Paagrio the God of Fire...we can't consume our warrior spirits once we are confined to the earth.\r\n<p>...but there are exceptions, such as orcs like <a link=\"nenani2\">Gora</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","nenani1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻釭棲 除蛤:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦葬 螃觼菟擎 晦獄瞳戲煎 堯餌蒂 騁雖 彊朝棻. 瓣餵檜釭 餌傖...斜葬堅 擒驍檜 辦葬陛 髦嬴陛朝 寞徹檜棻. \r\n<p>僭煩 檣除菟籀歲 堯餌蒂 雖戲賊 辦葬朝 雖旎爾棻 �徆� 睡嶸п韓雖紫 賅腦雖. ж雖虜 螃觼菟醞縑 斜楛 儅陝擊 ж朝 檜朝 嬴鼠紫 橈棻. 螃觼曖 熱�ˊ鰾� 碳曖 褐 だ嬴斜葬螃...渠雖縑 樓夢腎橫憮朝 瞪餌曖 薑褐擊 ж棺 部梱雖 碳鷓選 熱 橈晦 陽僥檜棻.\r\n<p>...ж雖虜 橫蛤縑釭 蕨諼朝 氈棻. <a link=\"nenani2\">堅塭</a> 偽擎 濠紫 氈戲棲.\r\n</body>","nenani2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>那那米甘地：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>葛拉是艾妮部落的領袖。他過去曾經有一些奇特的想法，比如說談論與人類的共存之類的。但是沒有人聽他的。最後他獨自帶領他的部落成員到人類的社會，也很成功地融入了人類社會。\r\n<p>其他妖魔部落的成員視他為一個異教徒，但是他總是用從人類的社會賺來的錢幫助部落。\r\n<p>雖然現在它被用在你們的戰爭上。\r\n</body>\r\n","nenani2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nenani Gandi:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Gora Agni...the chief of Agni Tribe. He used to have some peculiar ideas and kept talking about coexistence with humans. But no one would listen to him, so he took his learning of human society and taught his tribe members to cooperate. And, more or less, succeeded.\r\n<p>Other members of the tribal community regard him as a heretic. But he has always used the money from the human society for the tribal community.\r\n<p>...it's being used for your war right now.\r\n</body>\r\n","nenani2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nenani Gandi:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Gora Agni...the chief of Agni Tribe. He used to have some peculiar ideas and kept talking about coexistence with humans. But no one would listen to him, so he took his learning of human society and taught his tribe members to cooperate. And, more or less, succeeded.\r\n<p>Other members of the tribal community regard him as a heretic. But he has always used the money from the human society for the tribal community.\r\n<p>...it's being used for your war right now.\r\n</body>\r\n","nenani2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻釭棲 除蛤:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>堅塭 嬴斜棲...嬴斜棲 褶曖 褶濰. 斜朝 鼻渡�� か檜и 嫦鼻擊 ж朝 濠煎, 檜瞪睡攪 檣除婁曖 奢襄擊 蜓ж堆 ц棻. ж雖虜 嬴鼠紫 斜曖 檜撿晦蒂 菔雖 彊懊棻. 斜楚憮 斜朝 濠褐曖 睡褶錳菟虜擊 檜莊堅 檣除 餌�虞� 釭鬲棻. 斜葬堅, 贖 撩奢擊 剪舒歷雖.\r\n<p>睡褶 奢翕羹曖 棻艇 掘撩錳菟擎 斜蒂 檜欽濠塭堅 儅陝ж堅 氈棻. ж雖虜 斜朝 檣除 餌�蛾□� 弊橫菟檣 營骯擊 紱遽�� 睡褶 奢翕羹蒂 嬪п 賦 諮棻.\r\n<p>...僭煩 雖旎擎 渡褐啻菟曖 瞪爵 濠旎戲煎 噙檜堅 氈晦朝 ж雖虜...\r\n</body>","nerupace1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你這個黑暗妖精竟敢來這裡？竟敢進入母親樹這裡！我絕不能原諒像你這樣的傢伙！</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaCE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How dare you, dark elf, come here? Right into the bosom of Mother!  And how dare you speak to an elder Guardian! </p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaCE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How dare you, dark elf, come here? Right into the bosom of Mother!  And how dare you speak to an elder Guardian! </p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaCE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>傘偽擎 橫菸曖 碳粒縑 跺擊 湍螳幗萼 蹂薑檜 橫飩啪 罹晦 \r\n螢 熱 氈雖? 馬�� 撮啗熱曖 橫該棲曖 ヶ 寰戲煎 螢 儅陝擊 \r\nж棻棲! 熱��濠 謙褶曖 濰煎煎憮 瞰渠 辨憮й 熱 橈棻! </p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupae1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br><p>破壞它！可惡的妖精，要是你再一次侵入...如果不是為了世界樹，我會立刻吃掉你</p>  \r\n<p>現在你要製造什麼樣的廢物？</p>  \r\n<p><a link=\"nerupaE2\">精靈粉末</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE3\">箭</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE4\">米索莉箭</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE5\">弓</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE6\">精靈弓</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE7\">十字弓</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE8\">精靈匕首</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE9\">鎖子甲破壞者</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE10\">短劍</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE11\">細劍</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE12\">木棒</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE13\">戰斧</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE14\">吉薩</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE15\">精靈之矛</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE16\">法丘</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE17\">木製的夾克</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE18\">木甲</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE19\">精靈護胸金屬板</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE20\">精靈鏈甲</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE21\">精靈金屬盔甲</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE22\">木盾</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE23\">精靈盾牌</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE24\">精靈皮盔</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE25\">艾爾穆的祝福</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE26\">腕甲</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE27\">力量手套</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE28\">精靈斗篷</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE29\">短統靴</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE30\">長靴</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","nerupaE1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br><p>Confound it! Annoying elves invade again... If not for the World Tree, I would eat you like a fly!</p>\r\n<p>Now what kind of garbage you want to make?</p>\r\n<p><a link=\"nerupaE2\">fairy dust</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE3\">arrows</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE4\">mithril arrows</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE5\">bow</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE6\">elven bow</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE7\">crossbow</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE8\">elven dagger</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE9\">mail breaker</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE10\">elven short sword</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE11\">rapier</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE12\">club</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE13\">battle Axe</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE14\">guisarme</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE15\">elven spear</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE16\">fourchard</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE17\">wooden jacket</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE18\">wooden armor</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE19\">elven breast plate</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE20\">elven chain mail</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE21\">elven plate mail</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE22\">wooden shield</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE23\">elven shield</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE24\">elven leather helm</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE25\">bless of elm</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE26\">bracer</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE27\">power glove</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE28\">elven cloak</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE29\">low boots</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE30\">boots</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","nerupaE1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br><p>Confound it! Annoying elves invade again... If not for the World Tree, I would eat you like a fly!</p>\r\n<p>Now what kind of garbage you want to make?</p>\r\n<p><a link=\"nerupaE2\">fairy dust</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE3\">arrows</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE4\">mithril arrows</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE5\">bow</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE6\">elven bow</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE7\">crossbow</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE8\">elven dagger</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE9\">mail breaker</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE10\">elven short sword</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE11\">rapier</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE12\">club</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE13\">battle Axe</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE14\">guisarme</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE15\">elven spear</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE16\">fourchard</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE17\">wooden jacket</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE18\">wooden armor</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE19\">elven breast plate</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE20\">elven chain mail</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE21\">elven plate mail</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE22\">wooden shield</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE23\">elven shield</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE24\">elven leather helm</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE25\">bless of elm</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE26\">bracer</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE27\">power glove</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE28\">elven cloak</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE29\">low boots</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE30\">boots</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","nerupaE1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br><p>敝雛擎 蹂薑菟檜 傳 諮掘試. 縑掘 雖啖錶. 撮啗熱   \r\n喪戮и纔 綸霞 匙虜 橈橫紫, 啻喪戮菟 渡濰 濩嬴詳橫 幗萵   \r\n蘸等..</p>  \r\n<p>斜楚 檜廓縛 橫雯 噙溯晦蒂 虜菟楝 諮釭?</p>  \r\n<p><a link=\"nerupaE2\">む橫葬 渦蝶お</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE3\">�香�</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE4\">嘐蝶萵 �香�</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE5\">��</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE6\">蹂薑褶 ��</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE7\">觼煎蝶 爾辦</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE8\">蹂薑褶 欽匐</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE9\">詭橾 粽溯檜醴</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE10\">蹂薑褶 匐</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE11\">溯檜Я橫</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE12\">跦菅檜</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE13\">瞪癱 紫郭</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE14\">敝餌葷</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE15\">蹂薑褶 璽</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE16\">ん穩萄</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE17\">釭鼠 還晦 褡</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE18\">釭鼠 骨褡</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE19\">蹂薑褶 �銊�</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE20\">蹂薑褶 餌蝸 骨褡</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE21\">蹂薑褶 っ旎 骨褡</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE22\">釭鼠寞ぬ</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE23\">蹂薑褶 寞ぬ</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE24\">蹂薑褶 癱掘</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE25\">縣葷曖 蹴犒</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE26\">�� 埤鼠</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE27\">だ錶 旋煎粽</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE28\">蹂薑褶 蜂饜</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE29\">穠擎 濰��</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"nerupaE30\">濰��</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","nerupae10-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br><p>你需要１個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">長劍的劍身</a>，\r\n５個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹皮</a>，\r\n１５０塊<a link=\"nerupaE33\">純粹的米索莉</a>\r\n和５０個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的網</a>才能製造這個。\r\n</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven short sword\">製造精靈短劍</a></p>         \r\n</body>          \r\n</html>     ","nerupaE10-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br><p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">body of a long sword</a>,\r\n5 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twig of Ent</a>,\r\n150 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lumps of pure mithril</a>,\r\nand 50 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a> to make this.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven short sword\">Make elven short sword</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n","nerupaE10-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br><p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">body of a long sword</a>,\r\n5 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twig of Ent</a>,\r\n150 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lumps of pure mithril</a>,\r\nand 50 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a> to make this.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven short sword\">Make elven short sword</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n","nerupaE10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br><p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">濰匐褐</a> 1偃諦 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 還晦</a>  5偃, \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE33\">嘐蝶萵</a> 150僎纂, <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖 剪嘐還</a> 50顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven short sword\">蹂薑褶 匐擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupae11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">奧里哈魯根劍的劍身</a>，\r\n２個<a link=\"nerupaE35\">精靈羽翼</a>，\r\n５０個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">奧里哈魯根</a>，\r\n１個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">品質紅寶石</a>和２５個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的網</a>才能製造這個。</p>      \r\n<p><a action=\"request rapier\">製造細劍</a></p> \r\n\r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>         ","nerupaE11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">body of oriharukon sword</a>,\r\n2 <a link=\"nerupaE35\">ala of fairy</a>,\r\n50 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">oriharukon</a>,\r\na quality ruby and 25 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request rapier\">Make rapier</a></p>\r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupaE11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">body of oriharukon sword</a>,\r\n2 <a link=\"nerupaE35\">ala of fairy</a>,\r\n50 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">oriharukon</a>,\r\na quality ruby and 25 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request rapier\">Make rapier</a></p>\r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupaE11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">螃葬ж瑞夔 匐褐</a> 1偃諦 \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE35\">む橫葬曖 陳偃</a> 2偃, <a link=\"nerupaE33\">螃葬ж瑞夔</a>    \r\n50僎纂, 堅晝 瑞綠 1偃, <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖    \r\n剪嘐還</a> 25顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>      \r\n<p><a action=\"request rapier\">溯檜Я橫蒂 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>     \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupae12-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１０個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>和\r\n５個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的網</a>才能製造這個。</p>       \r\n<p><a action=\"request club\">製造木棒</a></p>      \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      ","nerupaE12-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> and\r\n5 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request club\">Make club</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupaE12-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> and\r\n5 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request club\">Make club</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupaE12-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 還晦</a> 10偃諦&nbsp; \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖     \r\n剪嘐還</a>  5顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>       \r\n<p><a action=\"request club\">跦菅檜蒂 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>      \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupae13-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">短劍的劍身</a>，\r\n５個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的網</a>，\r\n１０個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>和６０塊<a link=\"nerupaE33\">純粹的米索莉</a>才能製造這個。</p>        \r\n<p><a action=\"request battle axe\">製作戰斧</a></p>       \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       ","nerupaE13-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">body of a short sword</a>,\r\n5 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a>,\r\n10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> and 60 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lumps of pure mithril</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request battle axe\">Make battle axe</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE13-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">body of a short sword</a>,\r\n5 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a>,\r\n10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> and 60 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lumps of pure mithril</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request battle axe\">Make battle axe</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE13-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">欽匐褐</a> 1偃諦&nbsp; <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖      \r\n剪嘐還</a>  5顫楚, <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 還晦</a> 10偃, <a link=\"nerupaE33\">嘐蝶萵</a>   \r\n60僎纂陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>        \r\n<p><a action=\"request battle axe\">瞪癱 紫郭蒂 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>       \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupae14-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">短劍的劍身</a>，\r\n１０個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的網</a>，１０個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>和９０塊<a link=\"nerupaE33\">純粹的米索莉</a>才能製造這個。</p>        \r\n<p><a action=\"request guisarme\">製造吉薩</a></p>       \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       ","nerupaE14-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">body of a short sword</a>,\r\n10 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a>,\r\n10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> and 90 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lumps of pure mithril</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request guisarme\">Make guisarme</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE14-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">body of a short sword</a>,\r\n10 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a>,\r\n10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> and 90 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lumps of pure mithril</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request guisarme\">Make guisarme</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE14-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">欽匐褐</a> 1偃諦&nbsp; <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖      \r\n剪嘐還</a>   10顫楚, <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 還晦</a> 10偃, \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE33\">嘐蝶萵</a>   \r\n90僎纂陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>        \r\n<p><a action=\"request guisarme\">敝餌葷擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>       \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupae15-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">覆上米索莉的角</a>，\r\n３０個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的網</a>\r\n和１０個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>才能製造這個。</p>        \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven spear\">製造精靈之矛</a></p>       \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       ","nerupaE15-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">mithril-coated horn</a>,\r\n30 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a>\r\nand 10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven spear\">Make elven spear</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE15-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">mithril-coated horn</a>,\r\n30 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a>\r\nand 10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven spear\">Make elven spear</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE15-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">嘐蝶萵 紫旎 閩</a> 1偃諦\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖      \r\n剪嘐還</a>   30顫楚, <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 還晦</a> 10偃陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>        \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven spear\">蹂薑褶 璽擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>       \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupae16-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 你需要１個 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">精靈之矛</a>和一個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">覆上奧里哈魯根的角</a>，\r\n ５０個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">芮克妮的網，</a>，\r\n６０個奧里哈魯根和１個品質紅寶石才能製造這個。</p>        \r\n<p><a action=\"request fauchard\">製造法丘</a></p>       \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE16-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a elven spear, a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">oriharukon-coated horn</a>,\r\n50 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a>,\r\n60 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">oriharukon</a> and a quality ruby to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request fauchard\">Make fauchard</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE16-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a elven spear, a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">oriharukon-coated horn</a>,\r\n50 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a>,\r\n60 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">oriharukon</a> and a quality ruby to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request fauchard\">Make fauchard</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE16-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 蹂薑褶 璽 1偃諦 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">螃葬ж瑞夔  \r\n紫旎 閩</a> 1偃, <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖     \r\n剪嘐還</a>    50顫楚, <a link=\"nerupaE33\">螃葬ж瑞夔</a> 60僎纂, 堅晝  \r\n瑞綠 1偃陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>        \r\n<p><a action=\"request fauchard\">ん穩萄蒂 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>       \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupae17-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１０個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>和６個\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">線</a>才能製造這個。</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden jacket\">製造木製的夾克</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     ","nerupaE17-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> and 6\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden jacket\">Make wooden jacket</a></p>\r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupaE17-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> and 6\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden jacket\">Make wooden jacket</a></p>\r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupaE17-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 還晦</a> 10偃諦 \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">褒</a>  \r\n6顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden jacket\">釭鼠 還晦 褡擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupae18-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要２個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹皮</a>和５個\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE36\">潘的鬃毛</a>才能製造這個。</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden armor\">製造木甲</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     ","nerupaE18-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 2 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">bark of Ent</a> and 5\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE36\">Pan's manes</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden armor\">Make wooden armor</a></p>\r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupaE18-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 2 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">bark of Ent</a> and 5\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE36\">Pan's manes</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden armor\">Make wooden armor</a></p>\r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupaE18-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 皎韓</a> 2偃諦 \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE36\">っ曖  \r\n陞晦瓚</a> 5僎纂陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden armor\">釭鼠 骨褡擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupae19-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要２個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的蛻皮</a>和１０個\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">線</a>才能製造這個。</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven breast plate\">製造精靈護胸金屬板</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     ","nerupaE19-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 2 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">ecdysis of arachne</a> and 10\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven breast plate\">Make elven breast plate</a></p>\r\n\r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupaE19-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 2 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">ecdysis of arachne</a> and 10\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven breast plate\">Make elven breast plate</a></p>\r\n\r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupaE19-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖 ъ僭</a> 2偃諦 \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">褒</a>  \r\n10顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven breast plate\">蹂薑褶 �銊念� 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n</html>     \r\n","nerupae2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要1個<a link=\"nerupaE31\">元素石</a>才能製造這個。</p>   \r\n<p><a action=\"request fairydust\">製造精靈粉末</a></p>   \r\n   \r\n</body>   \r\n","nerupaE2-e.html":"r<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You need an <a link=\"nerupaE31\">Elemental Stone</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request fairydust\">Make fairy dust</a></p>\r\n\r\n</body>   \r\n   \r\n","nerupaE2-j.html":"r<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You need an <a link=\"nerupaE31\">Elemental Stone</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request fairydust\">Make fairy dust</a></p>\r\n\r\n</body>   \r\n   \r\n","nerupaE2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE31\">薑滄曖 給</a>檜 в蹂ж雖.</p>   \r\n<p><a action=\"request fairydust\">む橫葬 渦蝶お蒂 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>   \r\n   \r\n</body>   \r\n   \r\n","nerupae20-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要４個<a link=\"nerupaE36\">米索莉金屬板</a>和８０個\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">米索莉線</a>才能製造這個。</p>      \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven chain mail\">製造精靈鏈甲</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      ","nerupaE20-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 4 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">mithril plates</a> and 80\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven chain mail\">Make elven chain mail</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupaE20-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 4 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">mithril plates</a> and 80\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven chain mail\">Make elven chain mail</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupaE20-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">嘐蝶萵 っ旎</a> 4偃諦 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嘐蝶萵  \r\n褒</a> 80顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>      \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven chain mail\">蹂薑褶 餌蝸 骨褡擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupae21-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要８個<a link=\"nerupaE36\">奧里哈魯根金屬板，</a> ２０個\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">米索莉的線</a>和１個高品質鑽石才能製造這個。</p>      \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven plate mail\">製造精靈金屬盔甲</a></p>     \r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE21-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 8 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">oriharukon plates</a>, 20\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a> and 1 top quality diamond to make this.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven plate mail\">Make elven plate mail</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE21-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 8 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">oriharukon plates</a>, 20\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a> and 1 top quality diamond to make this.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven plate mail\">Make elven plate mail</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE21-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">螃葬ж瑞夔 っ旎</a> 8偃諦 \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">嘐蝶萵  \r\n褒</a> 20顫楚, 譆堅晝 棻檜嬴跨萄 1偃陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>      \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven plate mail\">蹂薑褶 っ旎 骨褡擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>     \r\n</body>","nerupae22-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹皮，</a>５個\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克尼的網</a>和５個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>才能製造這個。</p>       \r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden shield\">製造木盾</a></p>      \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       ","nerupaE22-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE32\">bark of Ent</a>, 5\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's web</a> and 5 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden shield\">Make wooden shield</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE22-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE32\">bark of Ent</a>, 5\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's web</a> and 5 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of Ent</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden shield\">Make wooden shield</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE22-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 皎韓</a> 1偃諦 \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖   \r\n剪嘐還</a> 5顫楚, <a link=\"nerupaE32\"> 縛お曖 還晦</a> 5偃陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>       \r\n<p><a action=\"request wooden shield\">釭鼠 寞ぬ擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>      \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupae23-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１個木製的盾，２個<a link=\"nerupaE36\">米索莉金屬板</a>，\r\n５個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的網</a>才能製造這個。</p>       \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven shield\">製造精靈盾牌</a></p>      \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       ","nerupaE23-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a wooden shield, 2 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">mithril plates</a>,\r\n5 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's web</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven shield\">Make elven shield</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE23-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a wooden shield, 2 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">mithril plates</a>,\r\n5 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's web</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven shield\">Make elven shield</a></p>\r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupaE23-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 釭鼠 寞ぬ 1偃諦 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">嘐蝶萵 っ旎</a>   \r\n2偃, <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖 剪嘐還</a> 5顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>       \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven shield\">蹂薑褶 寞ぬ擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>      \r\n       \r\n</body>       \r\n       \r\n</html>       \r\n","nerupae24-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１個<a link=\"nerupaE35\">精靈羽翼</a>，\r\n２個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹皮</a>，\r\n１０個<a link=\"nerupaE36\">潘的鬃毛</a>和２０個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的網</a>才能製造這個。</p>      \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven leather helm\">製造精靈皮盔</a></p>     \r\n\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      ","nerupaE24-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE35\">ala of fairy</a>,\r\n2 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">barks of Ent</a>,\r\n10 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">Pan's mane</a> and 20 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven leather helm\">Make Elven leather helm</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupaE24-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE35\">ala of fairy</a>,\r\n2 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">barks of Ent</a>,\r\n10 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">Pan's mane</a> and 20 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">Arachne's webs</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven leather helm\">Make Elven leather helm</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupaE24-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE35\">む橫葬曖 陳偃</a> 1偃諦 \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖  \r\n皎韓</a> 2偃, <a link=\"nerupaE36\">っ曖 陞晦瓚</a> 10僎纂, <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖  \r\n剪嘐還</a> 20顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>      \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven leather helm\">蹂薑褶 癱掘擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupae25-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 你需要１個精靈皮盔，１個品質鑽石，１個品質藍寶石，１個品質綠寶石，５個魔法寶石，３個<a link=\"nerupaE36\">奧里哈魯根金屬版</a>，１５０條<a link=\"nerupaE34\">米索莉線</a>才能製造這個。</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request bless of elm\">製造艾爾穆的祝福</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      ","nerupaE25-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need an elven leather helm, a quality diamond, a quality emerald, a quality sapphire, 5 magic gems, 3 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">oriharukon plates</a>, 150 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request bless of elm\">Make bless of elm</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaE25-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need an elven leather helm, a quality diamond, a quality emerald, a quality sapphire, 5 magic gems, 3 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">oriharukon plates</a>, 150 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request bless of elm\">Make bless of elm</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaE25-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 蹂薑褶 癱掘 1偃諦 堅晝 棻檜橫跨萄 1偃,  \r\n堅晝 縑該塒萄 1偃, 堅晝 餌だ檜橫 1偃, 葆溘曖 給 5偃 , <a link=\"nerupaE36\">螃葬ж瑞夔 っ旎</a> 3偃 , <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嘐蝶萵  \r\n褒</a> 150顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request bless of elm\">縣葷曖 蹴犒擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n","nerupae26-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要２０條<a link=\"nerupaE34\">米索莉線</a>和３個\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹皮</a>才能製造這個。</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request bracer\">製造腕甲</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      ","nerupaE26-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 20 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a> and 3\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE32\">barks of Ent</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request bracer\">Make bracer</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n","nerupaE26-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 20 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a> and 3\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE32\">barks of Ent</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request bracer\">Make bracer</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n","nerupaE26-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嘐蝶萵 褒</a> 20顫楚諦 \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖  \r\n皎韓</a> 3偃陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request bracer\">�� 埤鼠擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n","nerupae27-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要５個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的蛻皮</a>，２０條<a link=\"nerupaE34\">米索莉線</a>，１滴食人魔的血和１個品質鑽石才能製造這個。</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request power gloves\">製造力量手套</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      ","nerupaE27-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 5 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">ecdysis of archane</a>, 20 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a>, 1 blood of ogre and 1 quality diamond to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request power gloves\">Make power gloves</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>\r\n","nerupaE27-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 5 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">ecdysis of archane</a>, 20 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a>, 1 blood of ogre and 1 quality diamond to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request power gloves\">Make power gloves</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>\r\n","nerupaE27-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖 ъ僭</a> 5偃諦 \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">嘐蝶萵  \r\n褒</a> 20顫楚, 螃辦剪曖 Я 1煽, 堅晝  \r\n棻檜橫跨萄 1偃陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request power gloves\">だ錶 旋煎粽擊 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupae28-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要２個魔法寶石和１０條<a link=\"nerupaE34\">米索莉線</a>１２０個精靈粉末才能製造這個。</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven cloak\">製造精靈斗篷</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      ","nerupaE28-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 2 magic gems, 120 fairy dusts and 10 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven cloak\">Make elven cloak</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupaE28-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 2 magic gems, 120 fairy dusts and 10 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven cloak\">Make elven cloak</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupaE28-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 葆溘曖 給 2偃諦 む橫葬 渦蝶お 120偃, <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嘐蝶萵  \r\n褒</a> 10顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven cloak\">蹂薑褶 蜂饜蒂 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupae29-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要２個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹皮</a>和４條<a link=\"nerupaE34\">線</a>才能製造這個。</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request low boots\">製造短統靴</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      ","nerupaE29-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 2 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">barks of ent</a> and 4 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request low boots\">Make low boots</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n","nerupaE29-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 2 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">barks of ent</a> and 4 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request low boots\">Make low boots</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n","nerupaE29-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 皎韓</a> 2偃諦 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">褒</a> 4顫楚陛  \r\nв蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request low boots\">穠擎 濰�飛� 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n","nerupae3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>才能製造這個。</p>  \r\n<p><a action=\"request arrow\">製造箭</a></p>  \r\n  \r\n</body>  \r\n","nerupaE3-e.html":"r<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You need a <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twig of Ent</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request arrow\">Make arrows</a></p>\r\n  \r\n</body>  \r\n  \r\n","nerupaE3-j.html":"r<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You need a <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twig of Ent</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request arrow\">Make arrows</a></p>\r\n  \r\n</body>  \r\n  \r\n","nerupaE3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 還晦</a>陛   \r\nв蹂ж雖.</p>  \r\n<p><a action=\"request arrow\">�香嚓� 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>  \r\n  \r\n</body>  \r\n  \r\n","nerupae30-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要２個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克尼的蛻皮</a>和１０個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">線</a>才能製造這個。</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request boots\">製造長靴</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      ","nerupaE30-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need two <a link=\"nerupaE34\">ecdysis of arachne</a> and 10 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a> to make boots such as these.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request boots\">Make boots</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupaE30-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need two <a link=\"nerupaE34\">ecdysis of arachne</a> and 10 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a> to make boots such as these.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request boots\">Make boots</a></p>\r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupaE30-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖 ъ僭</a> 2偃諦 \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE34\">褒</a>  \r\n10顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request boots\">濰�飛� 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>     \r\n      \r\n</body>      \r\n      \r\n</html>      \r\n","nerupae31-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>它是一塊擁有特別強勁元素力量的石頭。你可以在森林周圍發現他們。你不是已經知道了嗎？真是笨喔！\r\n<br> \r\n搜尋這個森林。如果幸運的話，你就會找到它的。</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE31-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a stone with especially strong elemental power; you can find them around the forest. You didn't know that already?  Bah, don't they teach you pointy-eared pipsqueaks anything!?!\r\n<br>\r\nSearch the forest. You may find it if fortune smiles upon you.\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaE31-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's a stone with especially strong elemental power; you can find them around the forest. You didn't know that already?  Bah, don't they teach you pointy-eared pipsqueaks anything!?!\r\n<br>\r\nSearch the forest. You may find it if fortune smiles upon you.\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaE31-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂薑曖 膛 罹晦盪晦縑 梃溥 氈朝 薑滄曖 ��檜 か�� 鬼и  \r\n給窖檜蒂 蜓ж朝 剪雖. 斜匙紫 路塭? 鎳鎳 и褕ж曹.. \r\n<br> \r\n膛擊 翮褕�� 給嬴棻棲賊 遴謠啪 嫦唯й雖紫 賅腦雖.\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupae32-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>想要得到這樣東西，你應該問安特！我怎麼知道？<font fg=ffffff>哼！</font>我剛剛聽說，里爾得和安特一樣很懂得低下的事。</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE32-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To get such a thing, you should ask an Ent! Hmpf. I heard that <font fg=ffffff>Theodor</font> is well versed about such lowly things as those blasted leafheads.</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE32-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To get such a thing, you should ask an Ent! Hmpf. I heard that <font fg=ffffff>Theodor</font> is well versed about such lowly things as those blasted leafheads.</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE32-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜楛 勘 掘ж朝 寞徹擎 ヴ鼠渦晦 縛お 喪戮и纔 霜蕾 \r\n僭橫瑭撿雖! 頂陛 橫飩啪 憲嬴? 縛お偽擎 濩蝶楛 匙菟擎 \r\n葆擊縑 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>纔嬴紫腦</font>檜塢 喪戮檜 澀 憲堅 氈棻堅 ж渦捱. 陛憮 僭橫瑭!</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupae33-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我哪裡知道怎麼做這種東西！<font fg=ffffff>安特</font>好像知道關於它的事。去問他！</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE33-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How could I know how to make such a thing! It seems that <font fg=ffffff>Doett</font> knows something about it. Ask him!</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE33-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How could I know how to make such a thing! It seems that <font fg=ffffff>Doett</font> knows something about it. Ask him!</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE33-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜勘 虜萄朝 寞徹擊 頂陛 橫飩啪 憲嬴? 旎樓縑 渠п憮朝 \r\n葆擊縑 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>紫縑お</font>塢 喪戮檜 覬 憲堅 氈朝 匙 偽渦捱. 陛憮 僭橫爾塭掘.</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupae34-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我們芮克妮知道得到這樣的東西的最好方法，這世界上也沒有比我們的八隻手更高貴的東西了。現在我聽說<font fg=ffffff>莫里恩</font>正在試著進行這項技術？他可能知道關於我們芮克妮的事。\r\n<br>我很忙，所以沒有任何事請走開！</p> \r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body> \r\n","nerupaE34-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Arachnes know the best way to get such a thing - nothing can be compared to the elegancies of our 8 hands. Nowadays I heard that <font fg=ffffff>Morien</font> is actually showing some intelligence, for an elf...she may be willing to chat with you.\r\n<br>I'm busy - if you don't have anything in mind just go away!\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body> \r\n","nerupaE34-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Arachnes know the best way to get such a thing - nothing can be compared to the elegancies of our 8 hands. Nowadays I heard that <font fg=ffffff>Morien</font> is actually showing some intelligence, for an elf...she may be willing to chat with you.\r\n<br>I'm busy - if you don't have anything in mind just go away!\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body> \r\n","nerupaE34-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>羲衛 斜楛 勘 掘ж朝 寞徹擎 嬴塭觼啻縑啪 僭橫爾朝 匙檜 譆堅雖, \r\n嬴塭觼啻曖 撰撮и 罹渝 槳菟檜 辦嬴ж堅紫 棟熨ж啪 \r\n遺霜檜朝 斜 賅蝗擎 檜 撮鼻縑摹 馬�� 評蒂 濠陛 橈棻掘. \r\n蹂闈擎 諷 <font fg=ffffff>賅葬縛</font>檜塭朝 蹂薑 嬴陛噢陛 斜 槭噢蒂 寡選溥堅 и棻雖? 斜 擁紫 辦葬 嬴塭觼啻 褶縑 渠п 覬 憲堅 氈擊 疏撿.\r\n<br>陪 夥際棲梱 獐 橾 橈擠 橫憮 陛幗葬塭掘!</p> \r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body> \r\n","nerupae35-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這件事情你應該去問那些慢慢飛的精靈！我怎麼知道？我聽說<font fg=ffffff>多特</font>知道關於精靈的事情。去問他！\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE35-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You should ask those worm fairies for such a thing! I heard that <font fg=ffffff>Doett</font> knows something about fairies. Go and ask him!</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaE35-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You should ask those worm fairies for such a thing! I heard that <font fg=ffffff>Doett</font> knows something about fairies. Go and ask him!</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaE35-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜楛 勘 掘ж朝 寞徹擎 陳偃 殖萼 弊溯 む橫葬 喪戮и纔 \r\n霜蕾 僭橫瑭撿雖! 頂陛 橫飩啪 憲嬴? む橫葬偽擎 濩蝶楛 \r\n匙菟擎 葆擊縑 氈朝 <font fg=ffffff>紫縑お</font>塢 喪戮檜 澀 憲堅 氈棻堅 \r\nж渦捱. 陛憮 僭橫爾塭掘! 殮擎 菁棻 凳ж釭?</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupae36-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>要得到這樣東西你應該問那個有角的傻瓜潘！我怎麼知道？嗯...或許<font fg=ffffff>那翰</font>會知道有關他的事。但她的演奏還是有缺點。就算她的演奏真的很好...但還是不像我們有那麼好的技術。</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE36-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To get such a thing you should ask that horned fool Pan! Hmm.. or, probably <font fg=ffffff>Narhen</font> may know about him. Pans have a real weakness for her musical tinkerings...I suppose her play is acceptable, though not as good as our techniques.</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaE36-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To get such a thing you should ask that horned fool Pan! Hmm.. or, probably <font fg=ffffff>Narhen</font> may know about him. Pans have a real weakness for her musical tinkerings...I suppose her play is acceptable, though not as good as our techniques.</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaE36-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜楛 勘 掘ж朝 寞徹擎 閩陪 夥爾 っ 喪戮и纔 霜蕾 \r\n僭橫瑭撿雖! 頂陛 橫飩啪 憲嬴? っ縑 渠п摹 <font fg=ffffff>釭腦縛</font>檜 澀 憲堅 氈擊痊? 斜 擁曖 Ы當 翱輿塭賊 っ菟檜 餌避擊 跤噙棲梱.\r\n斜 擁曖 翱輿朝 霤 噩虜ж雖. 辦葬 嬴塭觼啻 褶曖 槳營輿 虜躑擎 嬴棲雖虜..</p>\r\n<br><br><img src=\"#331\" link=\"nerupaE1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupae4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">純粹米索莉塊</a>和１個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>才能製造這個。</p>    \r\n<p><a action=\"request mithril arrow\">製造米索莉箭</a></p>     \r\n     \r\n</body>     ","nerupaE4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lump of pure mithril</a> and a <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twig of ent</a> to make this.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request mithril arrow\">Make mithril arrows</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lump of pure mithril</a> and a <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twig of ent</a> to make this.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request mithril arrow\">Make mithril arrows</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">嘐蝶萵</a> 1僎纂諦 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖   \r\n還晦</a> 1偃陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>    \r\n<p><a action=\"request mithril arrow\">嘐蝶萵 �香嚓� 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>     \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n","nerupae5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>和５個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">線</a>才能製造這個。</p>  \r\n<p><a action=\"request bow\">製造弓</a></p>   \r\n   \r\n</body>   ","nerupaE5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twig of ent</a>\r\nand 5 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request bow\">Make bow</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>   \r\n","nerupaE5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twig of ent</a>\r\nand 5 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request bow\">Make bow</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>   \r\n","nerupaE5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 還晦</a> 1偃諦 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">褒</a>   \r\n5顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>  \r\n<p><a action=\"request bow\">�偯� 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>   \r\n   \r\n</body>   \r\n","nerupae6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要１０個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>，\r\n２０個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">純粹的米索莉塊</a>，\r\n２個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">線</a>    \r\n和２個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的蛻皮</a>才能製造這個。</p>    \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven bow\">製造精靈弓</a></p>    \r\n\r\n     \r\n</body>     ","nerupaE6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You need 10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of ent</a>,\r\n20 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lumps of pure mithril</a>,\r\n2 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a>,\r\nand 2 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">ecdysis of arachne</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven bow\">Make elven bow</a></p>\r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n","nerupaE6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You need 10 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of ent</a>,\r\n20 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lumps of pure mithril</a>,\r\n2 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">threads</a>,\r\nand 2 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">ecdysis of arachne</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven bow\">Make elven bow</a></p>\r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n","nerupaE6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 還晦</a>  10偃諦  \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE33\">嘐蝶萵</a>    \r\n20僎纂, <a link=\"nerupaE34\">褒</a>    \r\n 2顫楚, <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖 ъ僭</a> 2偃陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>    \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven bow\">蹂薑褶 �偯� 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n","nerupae7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要８個<a link=\"nerupaE35\">精靈羽翼</a>，\r\n３個<a link=\"nerupaE36\">奧里哈魯根金屬板</a>，\r\n２０個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">米索莉線</a>\r\n和３０<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的網</a>才能製造這個。</p>    \r\n<p><a action=\"request crossbow\">製造十字弓</a></p>   \r\n    \r\n</body>    \r\n","nerupaE7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You need 8 <a link=\"nerupaE35\">ala of fairy</a>,\r\n3 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">oriharukon plate</a>,\r\n20 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril thread</a>,\r\nand an <a link=\"nerupaE34\">arachne's web</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request crossbow\">Make crossbow</a></p>\r\n    \r\n</body>    \r\n","nerupaE7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You need 8 <a link=\"nerupaE35\">ala of fairy</a>,\r\n3 <a link=\"nerupaE36\">oriharukon plate</a>,\r\n20 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">mithril thread</a>,\r\nand an <a link=\"nerupaE34\">arachne's web</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request crossbow\">Make crossbow</a></p>\r\n    \r\n</body>    \r\n","nerupaE7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE35\">む橫葬曖 陳偃</a> 8偃諦 \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE36\">螃葬ж腦夔    \r\nっ旎</a> 3偃, <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嘐蝶萵 褒</a> 20顫楚, <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖    \r\n剪嘐還</a> 30顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>    \r\n<p><a action=\"request crossbow\">觼煎蝶 爾辦蒂 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>   \r\n    \r\n</body>    \r\n","nerupae8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你需要５個<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>，２０個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">純粹的米索莉塊</a>才能製造這個。</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven dagger\">製造精靈匕首</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     ","nerupaE8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 5 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of ent</a>, and 20 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lumps of pure mithril</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven dagger\">Make elven dagger</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need 5 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of ent</a>, and 20 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">lumps of pure mithril</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request elven dagger\">Make elven dagger</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaE8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 還晦</a>   \r\n5偃諦 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">嘐蝶萵</a> 20偃陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request elven dagger\">蹂薑褶 欽匐蒂 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n","nerupae9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br><p>你需要一個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">覆上米索莉的角</a>，１０個\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE32\">安特的樹枝</a>，一個鑽石，一個<a link=\"nerupaE33\">短劍的劍身</a>，５０個<a link=\"nerupaE34\">芮克妮的網</a>才能製造這個。</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request mail breaker\">製造鎖子甲破壞者</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     ","nerupaE9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">mithril-coated horn</a>, 10\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of ent</a>, a diamond, a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">body of short sword</a>, and 50 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">arachne's webs</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request mail breaker\">Make mail breaker</a></p>\r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n","nerupaE9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> You need a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">mithril-coated horn</a>, 10\r\n<a link=\"nerupaE32\">twigs of ent</a>, a diamond, a <a link=\"nerupaE33\">body of short sword</a>, and 50 <a link=\"nerupaE34\">arachne's webs</a> to make this.</p>\r\n<p><a action=\"request mail breaker\">Make mail breaker</a></p>\r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n","nerupaE9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br><p> 斜勘 虜菟溥賊 <a link=\"nerupaE33\">嘐蝶萵 紫旎 閩</a> 1偃諦  \r\n<a link=\"nerupaE32\">縛お曖 還晦</a> 10偃, <a link=\"nerupaE33\">欽匐褐</a> 1偃, 棻檜嬴跨萄    \r\n1偃, <a link=\"nerupaE34\">嬴塭觼啻曖 剪嘐還</a> 50顫楚陛 в蹂ж雖.</p>     \r\n<p><a action=\"request mail breaker\">詭橾 粽溯檜醴蒂 虜蛙棲棻</a></p>    \r\n     \r\n</body>     \r\n     \r\n","nerupam1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>娜魯帕：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>怎麼回事？不是精靈？你怎麼能來這裡？在我撕開你之前，趕快離開這裡！<br>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","nerupaM1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What is this? Elf, did you cut off your ears with your stupidity? How did you come here? Get out of here quickly before I tear you apart!</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaM1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Nerupa:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What is this? Elf, did you cut off your ears with your stupidity? How did you come here? Get out of here quickly before I tear you apart!</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","nerupaM1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>啻瑞だ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>凳撿? 蹂薑檜 嬴棲濫嬴? 膛曖 濠衝檜 嬴棋 喪戮檜 橫飩啪 \r\n罹晦 螢 熱 氈雖? 陞晦陞晦 闐橫憮 蜓溥場晦 瞪縑 橫憮 \r\n疏螳幗溥!</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","newaccount-c.tbl":"46\r\n要創造一個新的帳號。\r\n儘可能填滿表格。\r\n空白的格子\r\n有＊記號者必須填滿。\r\n\r\n３天之後，你應該\r\n登錄你的帳號在\r\nLineage的首頁並進入\r\n遊戲。\r\n\r\n『帳號』：輸入一個\r\n   你要的名字。\r\n   它跟遊戲\r\n   中的角色\r\n   名字不同。\r\n\r\n『密碼』：它應該是\r\n   讓其他的人不\r\n   容易猜到地。\r\n\r\n『確認』：重複這組\r\n   密碼。\r\n\r\n『測驗１和測驗２』： \r\n寫下那些只有你\r\n知道解答的問題。\r\n如果你忘記\r\n你的密碼，你可以\r\n在回答那二個問題後\r\n改變你的密碼\r\n一旦你\r\n輸入這些問題候，\r\n你就不能改變了。\r\n所以小心地選擇他們。\r\n\r\n『真實的名字』：你在真實\r\n   世界的名字。\r\n\r\n『電子郵件』：你的電子\r\n   郵件信箱。\r\n   我們將會\r\n　 由這個信箱提供\r\n   給消費者服務。\r\n   \r\n\r\n『國家』：你的國家\r\n   名字。\r\n","newaccount-e.tbl":"50\r\nTo create a new account,\r\nplease fill out the form \r\nas completely as you can. \r\nBlanks with a \"*\" next to\r\nthem must be filled; other\r\nfields are optional.\r\n\r\nAfter 3 days, you should\r\nregister your account at\r\nthe Lineage home page \r\n(http://www.LineageThe\r\nBloodPledge.com) to \r\nplay further.\r\n\r\n\"Account\": Enter a name\r\n   you like. It is not\r\n   related to your\r\n   character name in the\r\n   game.\r\n\r\n\"Password\": This should be\r\n   something that others \r\n   cannot guess easily.\r\n\r\n\"Confirm\": Repeat your\r\n   password.\r\n\r\n\"Quiz1 and Quiz2\" : Write\r\ndown questions to which\r\nonly you will know the\r\nanswer. If you forget\r\nyour password, you can\r\nchange your password by\r\nanswering those two\r\nquestions. Once you\r\ninput these questions,\r\nyou can't change them -\r\nso choose them carefully.\r\n\r\n\"Real Name\": Your name in\r\n   the real world.\r\n\r\n\"Email\": Your email\r\n   address. You will be\r\n   provided with customer\r\n   service from us\r\n   through this address.\r\n\r\n\"Country\": Your country\r\n   name.\r\n","newaccount-j.tbl":"50\r\nTo create a new account,\r\nplease fill out the form \r\nas completely as you can. \r\nBlanks with a \"*\" next to\r\nthem must be filled; other\r\nfields are optional.\r\n\r\nAfter 3 days, you should\r\nregister your account at\r\nthe Lineage home page \r\n(http://www.LineageThe\r\nBloodPledge.com) to \r\nplay further.\r\n\r\n\"Account\": Enter a name\r\n   you like. It is not\r\n   related to your\r\n   character name in the\r\n   game.\r\n\r\n\"Password\": This should be\r\n   something that others \r\n   cannot guess easily.\r\n\r\n\"Confirm\": Repeat your\r\n   password.\r\n\r\n\"Quiz1 and Quiz2\" : Write\r\ndown questions to which\r\nonly you will know the\r\nanswer. If you forget\r\nyour password, you can\r\nchange your password by\r\nanswering those two\r\nquestions. Once you\r\ninput these questions,\r\nyou can't change them -\r\nso choose them carefully.\r\n\r\n\"Real Name\": Your name in\r\n   the real world.\r\n\r\n\"Email\": Your email\r\n   address. You will be\r\n   provided with customer\r\n   service from us\r\n   through this address.\r\n\r\n\"Country\": Your country\r\n   name.\r\n","newaccount-k.tbl":"68\r\n億煎遴 啗薑擊 虜蛙棲棻.\r\n腆 熱 氈朝 и 緒颶橈檜 濛\r\n撩п 輿衛晦  夥奧棲棻. か\r\n��, *ル衛陛 腎橫 氈朝 睡\r\n碟擎 薑�旁炾�  濛撩ж衛雖\r\n彊戲賊  蛔煙檜 腎雖  彊戲\r\n棲  輿曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n\r\n蛔煙 寞徹:\r\n1. 餌辨ж衛堅濠 ж朝 啗薑\r\n擊 Account 陪縑 晦殮м棲\r\n棻. 艙橫諦 璋濠虜 餌辨й\r\n熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n2. 餌辨ж衛堅濠 ж朝  啗\r\n薑縑 餌辨ж褒 懍�ㄧ� 晦殮\r\nм棲棻. 檜  陽, 殮溘ж褐\r\n懍�ㄧ� �挫恉炱� 嬪п\r\nConfirm 陪縑 棻衛 и 廓\r\n翕橾и 懍�ㄧ� 晦殮п撿 м\r\n棲棻.\r\n\r\n3. Quiz 1塢婁 Quiz 2塢縑\r\nぬ蝶錶萄蒂 濱橫幗溜擊 陽\r\n蒂 渠綠п 濠褐虜檜  渠港\r\nй 熱 氈朝 韓僥擊 瞳蝗棲\r\n棻. ぬ蝶錶萄蒂  濱橫幗溜\r\n擊 陽塭紫 檜 韓僥縑 渠港\r\nй 熱 氈戲賊  ぬ蝶錶萄蒂\r\n滲唳й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n檜 韓僥擎 и廓  殮溘ж衛\r\n賊 滲唳檜 碳陛棟ж貊, 港\r\n擎 嗥橫噙晦紫 �挫恉狤懂�\r\n嶸曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.  か\r\n�� 雖旎 Quiz縑 渠и 港擊\r\n殮溘ж褒 陽 港檜  賅棲攪\r\n鼻縑  釭顫釭嘎煎  爾寰縑\r\n褐唳擊 賦 輿衛晦  夥奧棲\r\n棻. \r\n\r\n4. Real Name縑 濠褐曖 獄\r\n貲擊 瞳蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n5. E-Mail縑 濠褐曖  瞪濠\r\n辦ら 輿模蒂 瞳蝗棲棻. \r\n瞪濠 辦ら 輿模蒂  陛雖堅\r\n啗衛賊 NCSoft縑憮 薯奢ж\r\n朝 罹楝陛雖 憮綠蝶蒂  嫡\r\n戲褒 熱 氈朝 蛔 號擎  か\r\n��陛 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n6. Gender縑朝 濠褐檜  陴\r\n撩檣雖 罹撩檣雖蒂 晦殮м\r\n棲棻. \r\nMale檜 陴撩, Female檜 罹\r\n撩殮棲棻.\r\n\r\n7. 檜�釋� 陪擊 腆 熱  氈\r\nи 濠撮�� 晦殮п  釭骨棲\r\n棻. и措縑 髦堅 啗褐  碟\r\n曖 唳辦 State陪擎 晦殮ж\r\n褒 в蹂陛 橈蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n檜夠縑憮 蛔煙ж褐 啗薑擎\r\n3橾頂縑  葬棲雖 �� む檜雖\r\n縑 氈朝 蛔煙  イ縑憮 薑衝\r\n戲煎  蛔煙擊  ж敷撿 啗樓\r\n啪歜擊 闌晦褒 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n","newaccountk-c.tbl":"77\r\n外國人不能夠在\r\n這個表格創造新的帳號\r\n和登錄。請聯絡\r\n遊戲管理者\r\n（linmaster@ncsoft.co.kr）\r\n去登錄。\r\n\r\n如果你是一個韓國人而且\r\n要申請一個帳號，\r\n儘可能填滿表格。\r\n空白的格子\r\n和有＊記號必須填滿。\r\n\r\n３天之後，你應該\r\n登錄你的帳號在\r\nLineage的首頁並進入\r\n遊戲。\r\n\r\n『帳號』：輸入一個\r\n   你要的名字。\r\n   它跟遊戲\r\n   中的角色\r\n   名字不同。\r\n\r\n『密碼』：它應該是\r\n   讓其他的人不\r\n   容易猜到地。\r\n\r\n『確認』：重複這組\r\n   密碼。\r\n\r\n『測驗１和測驗２』： \r\n寫下那些只有你\r\n知道解答的問題。\r\n如果你忘記\r\n你的密碼，你可以\r\n在回答那二個問題後\r\n改變你的密碼\r\n一旦你\r\n輸入這些問題後，\r\n你就不能改變了。\r\n所以小心地選擇他們。\r\n\r\n『真實的名字』：你在真實\r\n   世界的名字。\r\n\r\n『Ｓ﹒Ｓ﹒號碼』：你的社會安全\r\n   號碼。你只能\r\n   用你的社會安全\r\n   號碼申請一個\r\n   帳號。如果你\r\n   已經有一個\r\n   帳號，不要在這個\r\n   表格申請另外一個\r\n   帳號。你能確認\r\n   你已存在的帳號\r\n   在 http://lineage.\r\n   ncsoft.co.kr/\r\n   lineage_new/register/\r\n   default.asp\r\n\r\n『電子郵件』：你的電子\r\n   郵件信箱。\r\n   你將會\r\n　 由這個信箱提供\r\n   給消費者服務。\r\n   \r\n\r\n你可以不用正式登記\r\n並有３天免費\r\n的時間玩 Lineage。\r\n如果你要繼續玩， \r\n請到我們的網頁\r\nhttp://lineage.ncsoft.\r\nco.kr/lineage_new/\r\n作正式的登記。\r\n","newaccountk-e.tbl":"77\r\nForeigners cannot create\r\na new account and register\r\nat this form. Please \r\ncontact a game admin\r\n(linmaster@ncsoft.co.kr)\r\nto register.\r\n\r\nIf you are Korean and \r\nwant to make an account,\r\nfill out the form as \r\ncompletely as you can. \r\nBlanks with * must be \r\nfilled.\r\n\r\nAfter 3 days, you should\r\nregister your account at\r\nthe Lineage home page to \r\nplay further.\r\n\r\n\"Account\": Enter a name\r\n   you want. It is not\r\n   related to the\r\n   character name in the\r\n   game.\r\n\r\n\"Password\": It should be\r\n   one that others cannot\r\n   guess easily.\r\n\r\n\"Confirm\": Repeat the\r\n   password.\r\n\r\n\"Quiz1 and Quiz2\" : Write\r\ndown the questions that\r\nonly you will know the\r\nanswer. If you forget\r\nyour password, you can\r\nchange your password by\r\nanswering those two\r\nquestions (You can do\r\nthis at the lineage\r\nweb-site). Once you\r\ninput these questions,\r\nyou can't change them -\r\nso choose them carefully.\r\n\r\n\"Real Name\": Your name in\r\n   the real world.\r\n\r\n\"S.S.No\": Your social se\r\n   curity number. You can\r\n   make only one account\r\n   with your social secu\r\n   rity number. If you\r\n   already have an\r\n   account, do not make\r\n   another account at this\r\n   form. You can validate\r\n   your existing account\r\n   at https://secure.line\r\n   age.co.kr/account/secure\r\n   /validateform.asp\r\n\r\n\"Email\": Your email\r\n   address. You will be\r\n   provided with customer\r\n   services from us\r\n   through this address.\r\n\r\nYou can play Lineage for\r\n3 days without payment\r\nand formal registration.\r\nIf you want to play \r\nfurther, please visit \r\nhttps://secure.lineage.co\r\n.kr/account/account.html\r\nfor formal registration.\r\n","newaccountk-j.tbl":"77\r\nForeigners cannot create\r\na new account and register\r\nat this form. Please \r\ncontact a game admin\r\n(linmaster@ncsoft.co.kr)\r\nto register.\r\n\r\nIf you are Korean and \r\nwant to make an account,\r\nfill out the form as \r\ncompletely as you can. \r\nBlanks with * must be \r\nfilled.\r\n\r\nAfter 3 days, you should\r\nregister your account at\r\nthe Lineage home page to \r\nplay further.\r\n\r\n\"Account\": Enter a name\r\n   you want. It is not\r\n   related to the\r\n   character name in the\r\n   game.\r\n\r\n\"Password\": It should be\r\n   one that others cannot\r\n   guess easily.\r\n\r\n\"Confirm\": Repeat the\r\n   password.\r\n\r\n\"Quiz1 and Quiz2\" : Write\r\ndown the questions that\r\nonly you will know the\r\nanswer. If you forget\r\nyour password, you can\r\nchange your password by\r\nanswering those two\r\nquestions (You can do\r\nthis at the lineage\r\nweb-site). Once you\r\ninput these questions,\r\nyou can't change them -\r\nso choose them carefully.\r\n\r\n\"Real Name\": Your name in\r\n   the real world.\r\n\r\n\"S.S.No\": Your social se\r\n   curity number. You can\r\n   make only one account\r\n   with your social secu\r\n   rity number. If you\r\n   already have an\r\n   account, do not make\r\n   another account at this\r\n   form. You can validate\r\n   your existing account\r\n   at https://secure.line\r\n   age.co.kr/account/secure\r\n   /validateform.asp\r\n\r\n\"Email\": Your email\r\n   address. You will be\r\n   provided with customer\r\n   services from us\r\n   through this address.\r\n\r\nYou can play Lineage for\r\n3 days without payment\r\nand formal registration.\r\nIf you want to play \r\nfurther, please visit \r\nhttps://secure.lineage.co\r\n.kr/account/account.html\r\nfor formal registration.\r\n","newaccountk-k.tbl":"81\r\n億煎遴 啗薑擊 虜蛙棲棻.\r\n腆 熱 氈朝 и 緒颶橈檜 濛\r\n撩п 輿衛晦  夥奧棲棻. か\r\n��, *ル衛陛 腎橫 氈朝 睡\r\n碟擎 薑�旁炾�  濛撩ж衛雖\r\n彊戲賊  蛔煙檜 腎雖  彊戲\r\n棲  輿曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n\r\n蛔煙 寞徹:\r\n1. 餌辨ж衛堅濠 ж朝 啗薑\r\n擊 Account 陪縑 晦殮м棲\r\n棻. 艙橫諦 璋濠虜 餌辨й\r\n熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n2. 餌辨ж衛堅濠 ж朝  啗\r\n薑縑 餌辨ж褒 懍�ㄧ� 晦殮\r\nм棲棻. 檜  陽, 殮溘ж褐\r\n懍�ㄧ� �挫恉炱� 嬪п\r\nConfirm 陪縑 棻衛 и 廓\r\n翕橾и 懍�ㄧ� 晦殮п撿 м\r\n棲棻.\r\n\r\n3. Quiz 1塢婁 Quiz 2塢縑\r\nぬ蝶錶萄蒂 濱橫幗溜擊 陽\r\n蒂 渠綠п 濠褐虜檜  渠港\r\nй 熱 氈朝 韓僥擊 瞳蝗棲\r\n棻. ぬ蝶錶萄蒂  濱橫幗溜\r\n擊 陽塭紫 檜 韓僥縑 渠港\r\nй 熱 氈戲賊  ぬ蝶錶萄蒂\r\n滲唳й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n檜 韓僥擎 и廓  殮溘ж衛\r\n賊 滲唳檜 碳陛棟ж貊, 港\r\n擎 嗥橫噙晦紫 �挫恉狤懂�\r\n嶸曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.  か\r\n�� 雖旎 Quiz縑 渠и 港擊\r\n殮溘ж褒 陽 港檜  賅棲攪\r\n鼻縑  釭顫釭嘎煎  爾寰縑\r\n褐唳擊 賦 輿衛晦  夥奧棲\r\n棻. \r\n\r\n4. Real Name縑 濠褐曖 獄\r\n貲擊 瞳蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n5. E-Mail縑 濠褐曖  瞪濠\r\n辦ら 輿模蒂 瞳蝗棲棻. \r\n瞪濠 辦ら 輿模蒂  陛雖堅\r\n啗衛賊 NCSoft縑憮 薯奢ж\r\n朝 罹楝陛雖 憮綠蝶蒂  嫡\r\n戲褒 熱 氈朝 蛔 號擎  か\r\n��陛 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n6. Gender縑朝 濠褐檜  陴\r\n撩檣雖 罹撩檣雖蒂 晦殮м\r\n棲棻.\r\nMale檜 陴撩, Female檜 罹\r\n撩殮棲棻.\r\n\r\n7. S.S. No. 塢縑  濠褐曖\r\n輿團蛔煙廓�ㄧ�  殮溘м棲\r\n棻. ж釭曖 輿團蛔煙 廓��\r\n煎啗薑擊 歜曖渠煎 虜菟 熱\r\n陛氈雖虜 и 啗薑檜 碳嘐\r\n蝶楝遴餌勒戲煎 翱盟腎歷\r\n擊 唳辦п渡 輿團蛔煙廓��\r\n曖 賅萇啗薑檜 碳檜櫛擊 嫡\r\n擊 熱氈戲嘎煎 嶸曖ж衛晦\r\n夥奧棲棻.\r\n\r\n8. 檜�釋� 陪擊 腆 熱 氈\r\nи 濠撮�� 晦殮ж敷撿 м\r\n棲棻. и措縑 髦堅 啗褐\r\n碟曖 唳辦 State陪擎 晦殮\r\nж褒 в蹂陛 橈蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n檜夠縑憮 蛔煙ж褐 啗薑擎\r\n3橾頂縑  葬棲雖 �� む檜雖\r\n縑 氈朝 蛔煙 イ  https://\r\nsecure.lineage.co.kr/acco\r\nunt/account.html縑憮 薑衝\r\n戲煎 蛔煙擊  ж敷撿 啗樓\r\n啪歜擊 闌晦褒 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n","nodim-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>諾丁:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n我是幫人家保管物品的。你們人類可能不知道我們『鐵門』公會的歷史，我們具有很長的歷史和強大的組織架構。放心交給我們保管。\r\n<br>\r\n一項物品３０金幣，當然是在領取物品時支付。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>個人倉庫:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 領取物品</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟倉庫:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\">存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\">領取物品</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","nodim-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Nodim the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Ye human types may not understand sech things, but our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of -trustworthy- service. Yer items are safe with us. <br>\r\n'N, ye pay jest 30 adena for 1 item regardless of time - settle the account when ye retrieve the items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","nodim-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Nodim the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Ye human types may not understand sech things, but our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of -trustworthy- service. Yer items are safe with us. <br>\r\n'N, ye pay jest 30 adena for 1 item regardless of time - settle the account when ye retrieve the items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","nodim-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 喻裂:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n僭勒擊 蜆嬴 萄董棲棻. 渡褐菟 檣除菟擎 澀 賅腦啊雖虜, 辦葬 '鬼繹曖 僥' 望萄朝 螃楠 羲餌蒂 陛霞 ががи 褻霜檜塭螃.\r\n凳萇 寰褕ж堅 蜆晦紫煙 п蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n陛問擎 僭勒 ж釭渡 鼠褻勒 30嬴等釭, 絲擎 僭勒擊 瓊擊 陽 頂朝 剪蹂.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>偃檣 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑸裊 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","nodiml-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>諾丁:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>喂，我幹嘛和你這種人做生意啊？若你要保管物品，等到你的等級到了一個程度再來吧。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","nodiml-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Nodim the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ach, a nameless sprig such as yourself may not even have the golden adenas to get yer items back! If you want to use our service, make a name for yourself. Come back when you've earned some fame, levels, and adenas!\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","nodiml-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Nodim the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ach, a nameless sprig such as yourself may not even have the golden adenas to get yer items back! If you want to use our service, make a name for yourself. Come back when you've earned some fame, levels, and adenas!\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","nodiml-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 喻裂:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>檜瑭蹂, 辦葬陛 劂 圖堅 渡褐偽擎 Е啻晦曖 僭勒擊 蜃嬴遽欽 蜓檜螃? 僭勒擊 蜃晦堅 談棻賊 檜葷擊 覬 陳萼 棻擠縑 螃衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","noitemret-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>你沒有東西存放在我們這�堙C請再檢查一次。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","noitemret-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>We have no items stored under such a name - please check again.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","noitemret-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>We have no items stored under such a name - please check again.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","noitemret-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>槳椒 貲曖煎 蜆啖霞 僭勒擎 橈朝等蹂. 棻衛 и廓 �挫恉� 爾衛轄.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","obscene-c.tbl":"124\r\nfuck\r\nㄇㄉ\r\n他ㄇㄉ\r\n他ㄇ的\r\n死GM\r\n死 GM\r\n馬的\r\n媽的\r\n