r\n擁嘐\r\n擁綠\r\n縑縑綠\r\n縑縑嘐\r\n擁擁綠\r\n擁擁嘐\r\n罹樵煽\r\n膩煽\r\n幫停\r\n嶸遵骨\r\n幫梆\r\n幫��\r\n嶸梆\r\n嶸��\r\n濩盔\r\n褻梱\r\n褻褡\r\n褻��\r\n盪梱\r\n盪濂\r\n薔偽擎\r\n薜偽擎\r\n講梱\r\n謗梱\r\n薔梱\r\n薜梱\r\n褶梱\r\n褻褡梱\r\n褻�停�\r\n講偽擎\r\n謗偽擎\r\n褻陛が\r\n褻梱が\r\n盪梱が\r\n褻褡偽擎\r\n褻�偽偯�\r\n褻褡陛が\r\n褻�偽﹉�\r\n褻褡梱が\r\n褻�停醢�\r\n瞰塭\r\n謗傳\r\n講傳\r\n薔集\r\n薜集\r\n褻傳\r\n講集\r\n謗集\r\n薔集\r\n講嫣\r\n謗嫣\r\n薜嫣\r\n薔嫣\r\n褻誘\r\n褻��\r\n講誘\r\n謗誘\r\n講��\r\n謗��\r\n薜誘\r\n薔誘\r\n薜��\r\n薔��\r\n褻褡誘\r\n褻�偵�\r\n褻褡嫣\r\n褻�偎�\r\n褻褡��\r\n褻褡�V\r\n褻���V\r\n雖塒\r\n雖歇\r\n雖檜塒\r\n雖檜歇\r\n錨歇\r\n錨檜歇\r\n雖煤\r\n講\r\n講梱\r\n襄釭\r\n褻螞釭\r\n隴嫦\r\n隴夥\r\n璽喪\r\n璽揣\r\n璽握\r\n議億郭\r\n議膠葬\r\nじ檜嫦\r\nじ皎\r\nじ符\r\nゝ皎\r\nゝ符\r\nへ聽\r\nぷ聽\r\nん聽\r\n�ㄦ怷�\r\nadmin\r\n詭じ蝶\r\n蘋衛螃む嬴\r\n嘐模Я嬴\r\n贗溯葆じ蝶\r\n","ofo1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>阿福：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖然我現在只是個無名小卒，但我曾經是在國王手下的一個士兵。那時我努力地打仗，因為我認為我正在靠自己的手捍衛我的家園。但是等我回來時...我的妻子卻在戰爭期間死亡；領地...那塊從我的祖父的時候就是我們的領地已經被毀了...在肯恩羅侯變成國王之後，到底有什麼事情是變好的？我們已經一無所有，可是他的領地倒是變大了。\r\n<p>現在只要<a link=\"ofo2\">王子</a>逃回來...世界將會不同...\r\n</body>","ofo1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ofo:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Though I'm not much of a fighter now, I was once a soldier under the Lord. I fought hard then, for I thought I was defending my family by my own hand. But once I came back, I found my wife had died, and our fields, ours from the time of my grandfather, was ruined... What the hell has been improved after that Ken Rauhel became ? We have nothing, however large his estate has become!\r\n<p>If only <a link=\"ofo2\">the prince in exile</a> returns... the world will be different....\r\n</body>\r\n","ofo1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ofo:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Though I'm not much of a fighter now, I was once a soldier under the Lord. I fought hard then, for I thought I was defending my family by my own hand. But once I came back, I found my wife had died, and our fields, ours from the time of my grandfather, was ruined... What the hell has been improved after that Ken Rauhel became ? We have nothing, however large his estate has become!\r\n<p>If only <a link=\"ofo2\">the prince in exile</a> returns... the world will be different....\r\n</body>\r\n","ofo1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>螃ん:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>頂 檜楚瘋紫 瞪縑朝 艙輿椒 壽縑憮 璽擊 菟堅 諄辦湍 捱檣檜歷棻螃. 斜陽撿 頂 陛褶 頂 槳戲煎 雖鑑棻朝 儅陝縑 薑蜓 翮褕�� 諄錫雖. 斬等 給嬴諦 爾棲 斜啪 嬴棲渦塭堅...瞪爵戲煎 睡檣紫 避堅, й嬴幗雖 陽睡攪 陞嬴詳湍 階擎 わъ陛 腎堅...紫渠羹 斜喻鼠 騰 塭辦⑦檣雖陛 諾檜 脹 �醴� 謠嬴霞啪 凳撿! 艙饜陛 創橫螳疑濠 辦葬偽擎 餌塋菟и纔 雲橫雖朝勒 嬴鼠匙紫 橈濫嬴...\r\n<p>諼措戲煎 Я褐п 氈棻朝 <a link=\"ofo2\">諾濠</a>虜 給嬴螃賊 撮鼻檜 �� 菴餵橫 韓蘸等 蜓檜撿...\r\n</body>","ofo2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>阿福：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗨，你還沒有聽過這個謠言嗎？國王杜克和皇后迪雅為了保護兒子，把他藏於國王的血盟之後的故事可是很有名的呢。然後，另外還有一個謠言也說，他將會為了奪回原本屬於他的的王座，再回到亞丁王國來。\r\n<p>先不論他是否會是一個好國王，那都是另一回事了...。但話說回來，在怎麼樣也不會比現在更壞了。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","ofo2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ofo:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Haven't you heard the rumors? The story is, the son of King Duke Dephil and Queen Gadria was hidden by he King's Bloodpledge for his protection. Furthermore, there is a rumor that he will return to the Kingdom of Aden to reclaim his rightful throne.\r\n<p>Whether he will be a good king - now that's another story...but how much worse could it be?\r\n</body>\r\n","ofo2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ofo:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Haven't you heard the rumors? The story is, the son of King Duke Dephil and Queen Gadria was hidden by he King's Bloodpledge for his protection. Furthermore, there is a rumor that he will return to the Kingdom of Aden to reclaim his rightful throne.\r\n<p>Whether he will be a good king - now that's another story...but how much worse could it be?\r\n</body>\r\n","ofo2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>螃ん:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴棲, 渡褐 斜 模僥紫 跤菟橫疑模? 菽觼 等в 諾婁 陛萄葬嬴 諾綠 餌檜縑憮 鷓橫陪 濠衝擊 菽觼 等в曖 ⑸裊菟檜 騰 塭辦⑦曖 槳縑憮 爾��ж晦 嬪п 橫蛞陛縑 獗啣棻朝 檜撿晦朝 嶸貲ж濫嬴. 斜 諾濠陛 濠塭憮 濠晦 濠葬蒂 腎瓊戲溥堅 棻衛 嬴筆 諾措戲煎 給嬴諮棻朝 模僥檜塭螃. \r\n<p>斜 諾濠陛 雜и 諾檜 腆鎬 橫雲鎬撿 傳 賅腦朝 檜撿晦雖虜...橫繚萇 凳陛 橫飩啪 腎萇 雖旎爾棻 釭際啊橫.\r\n</body>","oliver1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>奧力佛 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n現在我們在玩捉迷藏。若有人找你問我的事情，千萬不要告訴人家。不要背叛我！\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","oliver1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>螢葬幗 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n雖旎 辦萼 獎楚濩晦蒂 ж堅 氈朝 醞檜縑蹂. 援捱陛 釭縑 渠п 僭橫瑭紫 瞰渠 蜓ж雖 葆撮蹂. 寡褐ж晦 橈晦!\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orcguard6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>妖魔守衛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在我們受到<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>血盟的 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>的統治。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖然不想承認...。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">詢問下次的攻城時間</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">對<var src=\"#1\">血盟宣戰</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orcguard6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orc Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We are under Biggun <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font> from the blood pledge <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...though I hate to admit it.  Hoomans.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">Ask the next siege time</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">Declare a war against <var src=\"#1\"></a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orcguard6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orc Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We are under Biggun <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font> from the blood pledge <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...though I hate to admit it.  Hoomans.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">Ask the next siege time</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">Declare a war against <var src=\"#1\"></a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orcguard6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>螃觼褶 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎 辦葬 睡褶 奢翕羹朝 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font> ⑸裊 轎褐曖 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>曖 雖寡蒂 嫡堅 氈棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...檣薑ж晦朝 褓雖虜.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 僖朝棻</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\"><var src=\"#1\"> ⑸裊縑 渠п 奢撩瞪擊 摹樹и棻.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orcguard7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>妖魔城堡警衛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>下一回攻城時間為 <var src=\"#0\">年 <var src=\"#1\">月 <var src=\"#2\">日 <var src=\"#3\">時 <var src=\"#4\">分。若想要城堡就來吧！\r\n</body>\r\n","orcguard7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orc Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to challenge the Biggun come at <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#0\"> <var src=\"#3\">o'clock.\r\n</body>\r\n","orcguard7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orc Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to challenge the Biggun come at <var src=\"#1\">/<var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#0\"> <var src=\"#3\">o'clock.\r\n</body>\r\n","orcguard7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>螃觼 陛萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛陝擎 <var src=\"#0\">喇 <var src=\"#1\">錯 <var src=\"#2\">橾 <var src=\"#3\">衛 <var src=\"#4\">碟檜棻. 渾網 纔賊 渾滬瑭!\r\n</body>","orcguard8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>妖魔城堡警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在還沒有宣佈下次圍城的時間。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","orcguard8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orc Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Biggun doesn't declare time for next siege yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","orcguard8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orc Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Biggun doesn't declare time for next siege yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","orcguard8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>螃觼 陛萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴霜 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擎 唸薑腎雖 彊懊棻.\r\n</body>","orckeeper-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>守門人:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗯，人類。\r\n<p>現在沒什麼事，但也只是現在...\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">開城門</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">關城門</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","orckeeper-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gate Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmpf, Human.\r\n<p>Nothing special. At least for now...\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">Open the gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">Close the gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","orckeeper-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gate Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hmpf, Human.\r\n<p>Nothing special. At least for now...\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">Open the gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">Close the gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","orckeeper-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>��, 檣除. \r\n<p>嬴霜梱雖朝 滌橾橈棻. 嬴霜梱雖朝..\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"openigate\">蹂億僥擊 翱棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"closeigate\">蹂億僥擊 殘朝棻</a><br>\r\n</body>","orckeeperop-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>妖魔守衛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>有侵入者！是人類！敵人來偷襲了啊！ \r\n</body>\r\n","orckeeperop-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gate Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Intruder! Human! Enemy!\r\n</body>\r\n","orckeeperop-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Gate Keeper:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Intruder! Human! Enemy!\r\n</body>\r\n","orckeeperop-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僥雖晦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>藹殮濠棻! 檣除檜棻! 瞳檜棻! \r\n</body>","orcpeasant1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>妖魔農夫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哇勒∼太卑鄙了，打沒裝備武器的人！</p>\r\n<p>目前佔領妖魔城堡的 <var src=\"#0\">血盟 <var src=\"#1\">盟主決定下一回戰爭時間為 <var src=\"#2\">年 <var src=\"#3\">月 <var src=\"#4\">日 <var src=\"#5\">時 <var src=\"#6\">分。那時候堂堂正正的再來吧！</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orcpeasant1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orc Peasant:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Uh-oh~ coward human, attack the unarmed!</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\"> of the bloodpledge <var src=\"#1\"> who rules us now, declared the next war time as <var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\">/<var src=\"#2\"> <var src=\"#5\">. So come back then!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orcpeasant1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orc Peasant:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Uh-oh~ coward human, attack the unarmed!</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\"> of the bloodpledge <var src=\"#1\"> who rules us now, declared the next war time as <var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#4\">/<var src=\"#2\"> <var src=\"#5\">. So come back then!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orcpeasant1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>螃觼褶 輿團:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦橫~ 綠匏и 檣除, 鼠濰ж雖 彊擎 濠蒂 陽葬棻棲!</p>\r\n<p>雖旎 辦葬蒂 雖寡ж堅 氈朝 <var src=\"#0\">⑸裊曖 裊輿 <var src=\"#1\">檜 棻擠 瞪爵 衛除擊 <var src=\"#2\">喇 <var src=\"#3\">錯 <var src=\"#4\">橾 <var src=\"#5\">衛 <var src=\"#6\">碟戲煎 薑ц戲棲 斜陽 薑薑渡渡ж啪 諦憮 諄錶塭!</p>\r\n</body>","orcpeasant2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>妖魔農夫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>啊！哦∼懦弱的人類，竟然攻擊赤手空拳的人！</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">是現在領導我們的<var src=\"#1\">血盟的人，他還沒有決定下次戰爭的時間。如果你知道戰士的規矩，就等一下再回來！</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orcpeasant2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orc Peasant:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Uh-oh~ coward human, attack the unarmed!</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\"> of the bloodpledge <var src=\"#1\"> who rules us now, hasn't decided next war time yet. If you know way of warrior, wait and come back later!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orcpeasant2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orc Peasant:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Uh-oh~ coward human, attack the unarmed!</p>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\"> of the bloodpledge <var src=\"#1\"> who rules us now, hasn't decided next war time yet. If you know way of warrior, wait and come back later!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orcpeasant2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>螃觼褶 輿團:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦橫~ 綠匏и 檣除, 鼠濰ж雖 彊擎 濠蒂 陽葬棻棲!</p>\r\n<p>雖旎 辦葬蒂 雖寡ж堅 氈朝 <var src=\"#0\">⑸裊曖 裊輿 <var src=\"#1\">陛 棻擠 瞪爵 衛除擊 嬴霜 跤 薑ж堅 氈棻.\r\n瞪餌曖 蕨曖蒂 嬴朝 檣除檜塭賊 陽蒂 晦棻溥 薑薑渡渡�� 蜃憮塭!</p>\r\n</body>","orim1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>歐林：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>大老遠來跟我買東西...？好吧∼好吧∼你一定是那些冒著極大的危險，想要獲得力量的那些人其中之一吧。\r\n<p>這麼迷戀力量，我不能了解...。不過，我記得<a link=orim2>有個人</a>就跟你一樣固執...\r\n<p>算了算了，反正全都是過去的事了。買你要的，然後讓自己變的更強吧。為了要繼續我的<a link=orim3>實驗</a>...。我需要更多的金錢...<br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","orim1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orim the Shadow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To come all this way to buy from me...  well, well. You must be one of those who take great risks just to obtain power.\r\n<p>Such obsession, I can't understand...  though, I  do remember <a link=orim2>a person</a> with an obsession such as yours...\r\n<p>...Well, It's all a thing of the past. Buy what you will, and become powerful. I need the money... in order to continue my <a link=orim3>experiments</a>...\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orim1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orim the Shadow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To come all this way to buy from me...  well, well. You must be one of those who take great risks just to obtain power.\r\n<p>Such obsession, I can't understand...  though, I  do remember <a link=orim2>a person</a> with an obsession such as yours...\r\n<p>...Well, It's all a thing of the past. Buy what you will, and become powerful. I need the money... in order to continue my <a link=orim3>experiments</a>...\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orim1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'斜葡濠' 螃葡:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>釭縑啪 僭勒擊 餌楝 檜夠梱雖 瓊嬴螃棻棲, 濠啻紫 鬼п雖晦 嬪п 賅萇 匙擊 夥耀 餌塋檣陛爾捱...\r\n<p>橫簞憮 賅萇 餌塋菟擎 斜葬紫 鬼п雖堅 談橫й梱...斜楚, <a link=orim2>斜 餌塋</a>紫 葆雙陛雖艘雖...\r\n<p>...凳, 檜薯 諦憮撿 棻 鼻婦 橈朝 檜撿晦檜雖. 釭曖 葆徹曖 ��擊 餌 鬼п雖紫煙 ж螃. 頂 <a link=orim3>翱掘</a>蒂 嬪п憮 釭朝 絲檜 в蹂ж剪萇...\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","orim2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>歐林：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>他曾經是我的良師和朋友。曾經『亞魅巨』哈汀被認為是他同輩中最有才氣的魔法師...\r\n<p>但只有我知道他的<a link=orim4>秘密</a>，所以我以前的<a link=orim5>夥伴</a>也在這個區域中找我。\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","orim2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orim the Shadow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>He was once my mentor and friend. and was known as the \"Archmage,\" Hardin was acknowledged as the most brilliant wizard of his age...\r\n<p>I alone know his <a link=orim4>secret</a>. That is why my old <a link=orim5>companions</a> are looking for me in this area.\r\n</body>\r\n","orim2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orim the Shadow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>He was once my mentor and friend. and was known as the \"Archmage,\" Hardin was acknowledged as the most brilliant wizard of his age...\r\n<p>I alone know his <a link=orim4>secret</a>. That is why my old <a link=orim5>companions</a> are looking for me in this area.\r\n</body>\r\n","orim2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'斜葡濠' 螃葡:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>и陽 釭曖 蝶蝓檜濠 耀掘艘湍 餌塋, 撮鼻 餌塋菟煎睡攪 '渠葆徹餌'塭 蘆歎嫡湍 繭營 葆徹餌 ж蛞...\r\n<p>釭朝 斜曖 <a link=orim4>綠塵</a>擊 憲堅 氈雖. 釭虜檜 憲堅 氈橫...釭曖 <a link=orim5>翕猿</a>菟檜歷湍 濠菟檜 檜夠縑憮 釭蒂 瓊堅 氈朝 匙紫 夥煎 斜 陽僥檜塭啻.\r\n\r\n</body>","orim3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>歐林：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我正在從事許多的實驗。但是沒有一個是非常實用或者是有利潤的。我尤其對『光』的性質很感興趣。那些看得到的或是看不到的，反射光的和缺乏光的...那就是我為什麼被在象牙塔的同伴叫做『影子』的原因。\r\n<p>這些日子我的實驗已經進行到毀滅合成物的部份。都只是些簡單的小把戲罷了，但他們卻藉由我以前的朋友的眼線想隱瞞我。他們應該會盡全力地找的，不過我倒不覺得他們找得到這個地方的路。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","orim3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orim the Shadow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I am conducting many  experiments, but none have proven practical or profitable. I am especially interested in the properties of light - the seen and the unseen, the reflections and absence of light... 'Tis why I was called \"The Shadow\" by my colleagues at the Ivory Tower.\r\n<p>These days I am applying my experiments in many parts of this ruined complex. Just simple tricks, but they hide me from my ex-companion's eyes. Search as hard as they may, I doubt they can find the path leading to this place.\r\n</body>\r\n","orim3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orim the Shadow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I am conducting many  experiments, but none have proven practical or profitable. I am especially interested in the properties of light - the seen and the unseen, the reflections and absence of light... 'Tis why I was called \"The Shadow\" by my colleagues at the Ivory Tower.\r\n<p>These days I am applying my experiments in many parts of this ruined complex. Just simple tricks, but they hide me from my ex-companion's eyes. Search as hard as they may, I doubt they can find the path leading to this place.\r\n</body>\r\n","orim3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'斜葡濠' 螃葡:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹楝陛雖陛 氈雖虜...擠...滌煎 褒辨瞳檣 翱掘朝 嬴棲撿. 頂陛 婦褕擊 陛雖堅 氈朝 葆徹 碟撿朝 輿煎 '維'縑 婦и 匙檜塭啻. 換縑 爾檜朝 匙婁 爾檜雖 彊朝 匙, 綠蹺橫雖朝 匙婁 斜曖 奩濛辨...頂陛 鼻嬴鱉縑憮 '斜葡濠'塭朝 滌貲擊 陛雖啪 脹 匙紫 斜陽僥檜雖.\r\n<p>譆斬縑朝 翱掘曖 睡骯僭菟擊 檜 嶸瞳曖 罹晦盪晦憮 褒яп 爾堅 氈棻啻. 凳, 釭曖 翕猿菟檜 釭蒂 嫦唯 跤ж堅 氈朝 匙紫 除欽и お葛醞 ж釭撿. 斜菟檜 嬴鼠葬 瓊嬴紫 唸措 檜夠梱雖 頂溥螃朝 望擊 瓊擊 熱朝 橈擊痊?\r\n<p>嬴, 濠啻縑啪梱雖 雖濰檜 氈朝 匙擎 嬴棲撿. 頂陛 槳擊 獄 勒 斜菟曖 馬陝 晦婦檜雖 檜 嶸瞳 濠羹朝 嬴棲剪萇.\r\n</body>","orim4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>歐林：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你為什麼認為哈汀曾經告知騎士甘特有關說語島的事？你認為山羊頭的魔鬼總是在島上？你認為哈汀跟誰學習黑魔法？\r\n誰會教魔法師以樹靈的血穿過自己的血脈？\r\n<p>想一想...會有許多線索出現在你的心中。\r\n</body>\r\n","orim4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orim the Shadow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Why do you think Hardin told a knight like Gunter about the 說語島? Do you think the goat-headed demon was always on the island?  Who do you think taught Hardin black magic? \r\nWho would teach a wizard with the blood of Tree-spirits running through his veins?\r\n<p>...Think about it...you will find there are many clues.\r\n</body>\r\n","orim4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orim the Shadow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Why do you think Hardin told a knight like Gunter about the 說語島? Do you think the goat-headed demon was always on the island?  Who do you think taught Hardin black magic? \r\nWho would teach a wizard with the blood of Tree-spirits running through his veins?\r\n<p>...Think about it...you will find there are many clues.\r\n</body>\r\n","orim4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'斜葡濠' 螃葡:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>ж蛞檜 橫簞憮 晦餌檣 捱攪縑啪 獄楚 葆徹餌曖 熱溼濰檣 斜 撰擊 模偃ц擊 匙 偽擎陛? '蜓ж朝 撰'縑 籀擠睡攪 斜 膩模 該葬曖 學葆陛 髦堅 氈歷擊 匙檜塭 儅陝ж釭? 釭鼠曖 薑滄曖 Я陛 摩檣 斜陛 橫飩啪 �皜飪�擊 寡錫啊朝陛? \r\n<p>...儅陝п 爾啪釭...營猿陛 腆虜и 餌褒擎 號檜 氈棻啻.\r\n</body>","orim5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>歐林：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>他們是一些比較年輕的世代，雖然我曾經稱他們為朋友...。你以你的方式和他們會面了嗎？哈哈哈...卡士伯好嗎？\r\n<p>遵守著哈汀的命令，他們正努力地找我，但是我不希望和他們見面...\r\n<br>\r\n<p>可是有一位我不會介意再見他一面，那就是西瑪...\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","orim5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orim the Shadow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Though I once called them companions, they are companions no more. Have you met them? How is Caspa?\r\n<p>By Hardin's command, they still search for me, but I do not share their desire for a reunion...\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Though, there is one I would not mind seeing again - Sema...\r\n</body>\r\n","orim5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Orim the Shadow:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Though I once called them companions, they are companions no more. Have you met them? How is Caspa?\r\n<p>By Hardin's command, they still search for me, but I do not share their desire for a reunion...\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Though, there is one I would not mind seeing again - Sema...\r\n</body>\r\n","orim5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'斜葡濠' 螃葡:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>翕猿...塭堅朝 п紫 賅舒 釭爾棻朝 擒除 翱寡陛 嬴楚檣 餌塋菟檜雖. 濠啻 �公� 頂溥螃朝 望縑 斜菟擊 虜陬朝陛? жжж....蘋蝶だ朝 澀 氈湍陛?\r\n<p>斜菟檜 ж蛞曖 貲滄縑 評塭 檜夠縑憮 ②腎檜 釭蒂 瓊堅 氈朝 匙擎 滌 鼻婦 橈雖虜...\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...撮葆...斜喪虜擎...и廓鎢 棻衛 爾堅 談棻朝 儅陝紫 萄朝捱...\r\n</body>","orville1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>城主，請您下達命令？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp1\">徵求建議</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">收入/支出的報告</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">調整稅率</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">領出資金</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">存入資金</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orville4\">管理傭兵</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">管理城門</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">指定下一場攻城時間</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">管理城內治安</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Orders, my Lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp1\">Ask an advice</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">Get the report of income/expense</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the tax rate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw adenas</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit adenas</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orville4\">Manage mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">Declare next siege time</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">Control castle security</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Orders, my Lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp1\">Ask an advice</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">Get the report of income/expense</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the tax rate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw adenas</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit adenas</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orville4\">Manage mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">Declare next siege time</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">Control castle security</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿椒, 橫雯 貲滄擊 頂葬衛啊蝗棲梱?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orville1\">褻樹擊 掘и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">熱殮/雖轎曖 爾堅蒂 嫡朝棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">撮徽擊 褻瞰и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">濠旎擊 檣轎и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">濠旎擊 殮旎и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orville4\">辨煽擊 婦葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">撩僥擊 婦葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 薑и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">撩頂 纂寰擊 婦葬и棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville10-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在沒有資金可以修理城門。\r\n</body>\r\n","orville10-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We don't have enough money to repair the gate.\r\n","orville10-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We don't have enough money to repair the gate.\r\n","orville10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 僥擊 熱葬й虜и 濠旎檜 橈蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","orville11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在正在戰爭，無法修理。\r\n</body>\r\n","orville11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We are in the middle of war. We can't repair the gate til it ends.\r\n\r\n","orville11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We are in the middle of war. We can't repair the gate till it ends.\r\n\r\n","orville11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎擎 瞪爵醞檜塭 熱葬陛 碳陛棟м棲棻.\r\n</body>","orville12-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>從明天起實施變更的稅率。一天之內可以做好幾次的稅率變動。但請注意，最後訂出來的稅率才會實施。\r\n</body>\r\n","orville12-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The new tax rate will be effective from the next day. Please remember that even if you changed the tax rate before today, this new rate will be tomorrow's tax rate.\r\n</body>\r\n","orville12-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The new tax rate will be effective from the next day. Please remember that even if you changed the tax rate before today, this new rate will be the tomorrow's tax rate.\r\n</body>\r\n","orville12-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>滲唳脹 撮徽擎 棻擠陳睡攪 瞳辨腎啪 腌棲棻. ж瑞縑 罹楝廓 撮徽擊 夥紱衛渦塭紫 葆雖虞縑 薑п霞 撮徽虜檜 瞳辨脹棻朝 薄擊 貲褕п 輿衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n</body>","orville13-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>聽命您的吩咐，我會把<var src=\"#0\">補充<var src=\"#1\">名。明天到這個時間之內會補好。\r\n</body>\r\n","orville13-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Following your order I will replenish the army with <var src=\"#1\"> more <var src=\"#0\">s. They'll be available at this time tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","orville13-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Following your order I will replenish the army with <var src=\"#1\"> more <var src=\"#0\">s. They'll be available at this time tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","orville13-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>碟睡ж褐渠煎 <var src=\"#0\">蒂 <var src=\"#1\">貲 爾醱ж紫煙 ж啊蝗棲棻. 頂橾 偽擎 衛除梱雖朝 爾醱檜 腆 匙殮棲棻.\r\n</body>","orville14-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>因現在資金不夠，而造成城堡運轉的中止。請下令對策方案。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orville1\">下令給orville</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville14-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We have depleted the treasury. I can't manage the castle in this state. Please tell me what to do.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orville1\">Give an order</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville14-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We have depleted the treasury. I can't manage the castle in this state. Please tell me what to do.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orville1\">Give an order</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville14-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 濠旎檜 睡褶ж罹 撩曖 晦棟檜 葆綠脹 鼻鷓殮棲棻. 橫飩啪 渠籀п撿 й 雖 貲滄擊 頂溥輿褊衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orville1\">螃網縑啪 雖衛蒂 頂萼棻</a>\r\n</body>","orville15-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>城主，配置給<var src=\"#0\">的傭兵共<var src=\"#1\">個人。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville15-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord, You can assign <var src=\"#0\"> only up to <var src=\"#1\"> mercenaries which is half his Charisma.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville15-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord, You can assign <var src=\"#0\"> only up to <var src=\"#1\"> mercenaries which is half his Charisma.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville15-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿衛罹, <var src=\"#0\">椒眷 寡纂п 萄萵 熱 氈朝 辨煽曖 熱朝 <var src=\"#0\">椒曖 CHR曖 瞰奩檣 <var src=\"#1\">貲 梱雖殮棲棻.</p>\r\n</body>","orville2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>昨天之稅金收入支出如下。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>昨天之收入:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">金幣\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">基本支出</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">金幣\r\n<p align=left>昨天結算:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">金幣\r\n<p align=left>現在資產總額<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">金幣\r\n</body>\r\n","orville2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the report of yesterday's transaction.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Total income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adenas\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">Basic expenses</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adenas\r\n<p align=left>Net income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adenas\r\n<p align=left>Current treasury<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adenas\r\n</body>\r\n","orville2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the report of yesterday's transaction.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Total income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adenas\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">Basic expenses</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adenas\r\n<p align=left>Net income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adenas\r\n<p align=left>Current treasury<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adenas\r\n</body>\r\n","orville2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫薯 ж瑞曖 撮旎 熱殮婁 雖轎擎 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>橫薯ж瑞 熱殮:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">晦獄 雖轎</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left>橫薯唸骯:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left>⑷營濠骯識擋<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">嬴等釭\r\n</body>\r\n","orville2.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>歐比:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>昨天之稅金收入支出如下。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>昨天之收入:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">金幣\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">基本支出</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">金幣\r\n<p align=left>昨天結算:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">金幣\r\n<p align=left>現在資產總額<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">金幣\r\n</body>\r\n","orville3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這次的支出內容如下。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>給君主的稅<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>維持治安費用<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>僕人的薪水<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>城堡維持費用<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>傭兵維持費用<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>其他雜費<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#5\">金幣<p>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The record of expenses are here. My lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Tribute to the King<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\"> adenas\r\n<p>Peace control<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\"> adenas\r\n<p>Payment to servants<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\"> adenas\r\n<p>Castle upkeep<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\"> adenas\r\n<p>Payment to Mercenaries<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\"> adenas\r\n<p align=right><p>Miscellaneous<br>\r\n<var src=\"#5\"> adenas\r\n</body>\r\n","orville3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The record of expenses are here. My lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Tribute to the King<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\"> adenas\r\n<p>Peace control<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\"> adenas\r\n<p>Payment to servants<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\"> adenas\r\n<p>Castle upkeep<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\"> adenas\r\n<p>Payment to Mercenaries<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\"> adenas\r\n<p align=right><p>Miscellaneous<br>\r\n<var src=\"#5\"> adenas\r\n</body>\r\n","orville3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜廓曖 雖轎 頂羲擎 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>諾縑曖 鼻陶<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>纂寰 嶸雖綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>衛謙菟曖 瑰晝<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>撩曖 嶸雖婦葬綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>辨煽 嶸雖綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>晦顫 濩綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#5\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n</body>","orville4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>請你決定安排傭兵的政策方案。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">在城堡上面配置的弓箭手</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">僱用傭兵</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">重新安排雇來的傭兵</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What kind of task do you have in your mind regarding mercenaries, my lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">Arrange the archers</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">Employ mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">Rearrange hired mercenaries</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What kind of task do you have in your mind regarding mercenaries, my lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">Arrange the archers</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">Employ mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">Rearrange hired mercenaries</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辨煽縑 渠и 薑疇擊 唸薑п 輿褊衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">撩漁嬪曖 掙熱 寡纂</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">辨煽 堅辨</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">堅辨и 辨煽曖 寡纂</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在城門的狀態如下。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate\">修理外城門</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate\">修理內城門</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the status of the castle gate right now.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate\">Repair the outer gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate\">Repair the inner gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the status of the castle gate right now.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate\">Repair the outer gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate\">Repair the inner gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 撩僥曖 鼻鷓朝 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#5\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#6\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#7\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#8\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#9\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#10\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#11\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate_giran outer gatef\">諼撩 陴僥擊 熱葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate_giran outer gatel\">諼撩 憮僥擊 熱葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate_giran inner gatef\">頂撩 陴僥擊 熱葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate_giran inner gatel\">頂撩 憮僥擊 熱葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate_giran inner gater\">頂撩 翕僥擊 熱葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate_giran castle house door\">⑷婦僥擊 熱葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"autorepairon\">撩僥 濠翕 熱葬 貲滄擊 頂塢棻.</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"autorepairoff\">撩僥 濠翕 熱葬 貲滄擊 鏃模и棻.</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">您好。\r\n</body>\r\n","orville6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My lord <var src=\"#0\">, how are you doing nowadays?\r\n</body>\r\n","orville6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My lord <var src=\"#0\">, how are you doing nowadays?\r\n</body>\r\n","orville6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">椒, 橫憮螃褊衛螃.\r\n</body>","orville7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你以為這是哪裡，竟敢偷偷潛入這裡！\r\n<p>警衛！趕快把他帶走！\r\n</body>\r\n","orville7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Orders, my Lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp1\">Ask an advice</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">Get the report of income/expense</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the tax rate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw adenas</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit adenas</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orville4\">Manage mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">declare next siege time</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Orders, my Lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp1\">Ask an advice</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">Get the report of income/expense</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the tax rate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw adenas</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit adenas</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orville4\">Manage mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">declare next siege time</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orville7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹晦陛 橫蛞還 憲堅 獗橫菟橫諮朝陛!\r\n<p>唳綠煽! 檜濠菟擊 說葬 罹晦縑憮 莊橫頂紫煙 ж塭!\r\n</body>","orville8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我會遵照您的命令，明天這個時間之時會召集好您所要的傭兵。\r\n</body>\r\n","orville8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As you ordered, I'll recruit mercenaries by this hour tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","orville8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As you ordered, I'll recruit mercenaries by this hour tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","orville8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>碟睡渠煎 頂橾 偽擎 衛除 梱雖朝 煽餌菟擊 賅嬴螃紫煙 ж啊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","orville9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>目前沒有可用的傭兵。若要僱用傭兵，請下達 僱用傭兵 的命令才能僱用傭兵。\r\n</body>\r\n","orville9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are no mercenaries available now. If you want to assign them, please let me 'Employ mercenaries' first.\r\n\r\n","orville9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are no mercenaries available now. If you want to assign them, please let me 'Employ mercenaries' first.\r\n\r\n","orville9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 堅辨и 辨煽檜 橈蝗棲棻. 煽餌蒂 寡纂ж衛溥賊 辦摹 盪縑啪 '辨煽 堅辨' 貲滄擊 頂葬敷憮 辨煽擊 堅辨ж敷撿 ж褫棲棻.\r\n</body>","orvillehp1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>殿下，您想知道些什麼？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp2\">關於我和我的任務</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp3\">有關課稅</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp4\">有關管理城堡</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp5\">有關雇來的人</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"ishmaelhp6\">有關作戰</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","orvillehp1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>What do you want to know, my Lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp2\">About me and the role of Lord</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp3\">About Tax</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp4\">About managing the Castle</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp5\">About mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp6\">About War</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>What do you want to know, my Lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp2\">About me and the role of Lord</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp3\">About Tax</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp4\">About managing the Castle</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp5\">About mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp6\">About War</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>橫集и 匙縑 渠п 憲堅 談戲褊棲梱, 輿檣檜衛罹?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp2\">艙輿塭朝 雖嬪諦 衛謙濰縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp3\">撮旎縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp4\">撩曖 婦葬縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp5\">辨煽縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"orvillehp6\">瞪爵縑 渠п</a>\r\n</body>","orvillehp2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">殿下，您已經是這個城堡的統治者。而且當這個城堡還叫做古迪歐的時候，我就已經開始管理這個城堡了，我比任何人更了解有關這個城堡和周圍的土地。\r\n<p>這個城堡曾經有過多位優秀的城主統治，但不論是誰，從我成為這個城堡的管家那一刻起，我就一直幫助他們防禦城堡和土地。\r\n<p>我的忠貞不會被限制到某個特定的人之上，除了『古迪歐領地的統治者』以外。因此只要您是這個城堡的統治者，我就會永遠對你忠誠。\r\n<p>您能收取稅金，再加上我所雇用來的傭兵，您將會有至高的力量來統治這個地方。但是請務必考慮人民的生活，不要過度使用您的權力，並好好照顧土地和人民。\r\n<p>請記得身為這個領地的領主，您不能真的完全地離開這個世界。如果你離開這個世界，你的替身將會出現在您離開的那個位置。您的替身會代替您接受所有來自其他人的宣戰。此外，他無法抵抗來自外部的危險，並且容易受傷。所以我勸告您在離開這個世界之前，務必先到一個安全的地方。以免在您離開的這段期間，有人殺掉您的替身。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","orvillehp2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord <var src=\"#0\">, You are the Lord of this castle. And I have been in charge of this castle from the days when this castle was called Gludio. I know better than anyone else about this castle and lands around.\r\n<p>So even if there were many Lords succeeding one after another since I became the Chamberlain of this castle, I always helped them defending the castle and lands regardless of who they are.\r\n<p>My loyalty is not restricted to one specific person but to the 'Lord of Gludio Estate'. Thus as long as you are the Lord of this castle, I'll be always loyal to you.\r\n<p>You can gather taxes, hire mercenaries through me and thus rule this province with supreme power. But considering the life of people here, please don't overuse your power and take good care of the land and people.\r\n<p>And just in case, please remember that as a Lord of this province you can't really leave the world entirely. If you leave this world, your avatar will appear at the exact place you departed. The avatar accepts all wars against you. Furthermore he is vulnerable to external dangers. So I advise you to come to the safe place before leaving the world. Someone may try to kill your avatar while you are absent.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord <var src=\"#0\">, You are the Lord of this castle. And I have been in charge of this castle from the days when this castle was called Gludio. I know better than anyone else about this castle and lands around.\r\n<p>So even if there were many Lords succeeding one after another since I became the Chamberlain of this castle, I always helped them defending the castle and lands regardless of who they are.\r\n<p>My loyalty is not restricted to one specific person but to the 'Lord of Gludio Estate'. Thus as long as you are the Lord of this castle, I'll be always loyal to you.\r\n<p>You can gather taxes, hire mercenaries through me and thus rule this province with supreme power. But considering the life of people here, please don't overuse your power and take good care of the land and people.\r\n<p>And just in case, please remember that as a Lord of this province you can't really leave the world entirely. If you leave this world, your avatar will appear at the exact place you departed. The avatar accepts all wars against you. Furthermore he is vulnerable to external dangers. So I advise you to come to the safe place before leaving the world. Someone may try to kill your avatar while you are absent.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\"> 瞪ж, 檜薯 渡褐擎 檜 撩曖 艙輿檜褊棲棻. 斜葬堅 盪朝 蘋滂椒檜 撩檜 撮辦褒 陽睡攪 檜 撩縑 衛謙戲煎 檜歷蝗棲棻. 斜楚憮 盪朝 援掘爾棻紫 檜 撩婁 艙雖縑 渠п 澀 憲堅 氈棻 濠睡ж堅 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>籀擠 孺棻辦萄蒂 檜瑁ж樟湍 蘋滂椒擎 鼠繫檜釭 嗨橫陪 艙輿椒檜樟雖虜 3渠陛 �撣� 雖旎 縑萄葛 瞪ж朝 鼠棟ж晦 斜雖橈朝 碟檜樟蝗棲棻. 斜楝棲 撩紫 雖酈雖 跤ж樟雖啊雖虜 盪曖 葆擠擎 檜嘐 斜碟擊 集陪雖 螃楚殮棲棻. 盪朝 螃霜 孺棻辦萄 撩縑 橫選葬朝 碟虜擊 輿檣戲煎 撰晦晦煎 裊撮ц蝗棲棻. 虜擒 輿檣椒檜 孺棻辦萄撩曖 輿團菟擊 雖酈堅 孺棻辦萄曖 艙惜擊 嬴筆縑 萄堪檜朝 и 盪曖 醱撩褕擎 滲л橈擊 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<p>渡褐眷憮朝 盪蒂 鱔ж罹 檜 雖羲曖 撮旎擊 務堅, 斜 絲戲煎 辨煽擊 堅辨ж罹 雖羲 頂縑憮朝 譆堅曖 掏溘擊 陛雖衛啪 腌棲棻虜, 檜蒂 陴辨ж敷憮朝 寰腌棲棻. 睡蛤 檜夠縑 餌朝 艙團菟擊 儅陝ж衛橫 檜 艙雖蒂 澀 棻蝶溥 輿衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<p>葆雖虞戲煎 喻だ褕縑憮 萄葬朝 蜓噪殮棲棻虜, 檜 雖羲曖 艙輿煎賦 瞪ж眷憮朝 樹薯釭 檜 撮啗縑 襄營ж衛啪 腌棲棻. 瞪ж陛 虜擒 檜 撮啗蒂 集釭敷紫, 瞪ж曖 �亳鑑票� 檜 撮啗縑 陴嬴啗衛啪 腌棲棻. �亳鑑票韭� 睡菜檜и 唳辦陛 嬴棲賊 瞪ж眷 紫瞪ж朝 賅萇 瞪爵擊 嫡嬴菟檜衛啪 腌棲棻. 斜楝棲 瞰渠煎 鼠寞綠и 鼻鷓煎 撩 夤擊 給嬴棻棲雖 葆衛堅 檜 撮啗蒂 集釭褒 陽縑朝 樹薯釭 試盪 寰瞪и 夠縑憮 ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻. 樹薯 橫蛤憮 瞪ж曖 跡獗擊 喻葬朝 濠陛 氈擊雖 賅落棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","orvillehp3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>您的人民繳交稅金給您，就如同您呈獻貢品給予國王是一樣的。\r\n<p>因此您有權力調整這個地方的稅金。調整後的稅率將被適用在城堡周圍的村莊裡的商店。甚至也可能影響在古丁村莊裡的商店交易。\r\n<p>你所決定的稅率，會從次天開始生效。即使您在一天內多次更改稅率，你當天最後所設定的最後那一個稅率，才會是次日開始使用的稅率。\r\n<p>聚集來的稅金將會在次日黎明時轉移到城堡來。<br>\r\n<p>所有的稅金都是屬於您，殿下。但是，您不能完全使用它們。因為管理城堡和土地需要花費金錢，此外還要進貢給國王。<br>\r\n<p>若你設定的稅率高，當然進入城堡國庫的稅金就會很多。但是如果提高稅率太多，人民還是會反抗您。所以，當您在調整稅率的時候請務必牢記這一點。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","orvillehp3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Tax is your royal right to the people living here as well as it's your responsibility to pay a tribute to Ken Rauhel who is the Lord of all this Kingdom.\r\n<p>You have the power to adjust the Tax of this province. The adjusted tax will be applied to the shops in the village around the castle and even the shops in the gludin village thus affecting all trades there.\r\n<p>Once you decide the rate of tax, it is to be effective from the next day. If you change the tax rate several times in a day, the next day's tax rate will be the last one you set that day.\r\n<p>Gathered taxes will be transferred to the castle around the dawn of the next day.\r\n<p>All the taxes belong to you, my Lord. But, you can't use them all. Because it costs money to manage the castle and lands let alone the tribute to the King.\r\n<p>The higher you set the tax the more would come to the castle treasury. But if you raise the tax too much, people will not support you. So please keep that in mind when you adjust the tax.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Tax is your royal right to the people living here as well as it's your responsibility to pay a tribute to Ken Rauhel who is the Lord of all this Kingdom.\r\n<p>You have the power to adjust the Tax of this province. The adjusted tax will be applied to the shops in the village around the castle and even the shops in the gludin village thus affecting all trades there.\r\n<p>Once you decide the rate of tax, it is to be effective from the next day. If you change the tax rate several times in a day, the next day's tax rate will be the last one you set that day.\r\n<p>Gathered taxes will be transferred to the castle around the dawn of the next day.\r\n<p>All the taxes belong to you, my Lord. But, you can't use them all. Because it costs money to manage the castle and lands let alone the tribute to the King.\r\n<p>The higher you set the tax the more would come to the castle treasury. But if you raise the tax too much, people will not support you. So please keep that in mind when you adjust the tax.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撮旎擎 艙雖 輿團縑 渠и 瞪ж曖 掏葬檜濠, 檜 諾措 瞪羹曖 輿檣檜褐 騰 塭辦⑦ わж縑 渠и 鼻陶擊 嬪и 瞪ж曖 曖鼠檜衛晦紫 м棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮朝 檜 雖寞曖 撮徽擊 褻瞰ж褒 熱 氈朝 掏и擊 陛雖堅 啗褊棲棻. 撮徽擎 孺棻辦萄撩 斬寞曖 辦萄漱 葆擊擎 僭煩 �硃姦� 傘該縑 氈朝 '擎晦餌曖 餵' 葆擊縑梱雖 瞳辨腎橫 斜夠曖 螞乾 鼻剪楚 陛問縑 艙щ擊 嘐艦 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮 撮徽擊 唸薑ж衛賊 斜 撮徽擎 棻擠陳 撮旎擊 務擊 陽睡攪 艙щ擊 嘐纂啪 腌棲棻. ж瑞縑 罹楝廓 撮徽擊 滲唳ж褒 唳辦 斜陳 陛濰 葆雖虞縑 疇薑ж褐 撮徽檜 棻擠陳曖 撮徽煎 瞳辨檜 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>ж瑞縑 務橫霞 撮旎擎 斜 棻擠陳 翕ぎ 鼠滑 撩戲煎 賅罹雖啪 腌棲棻.<br>\r\n<p>務橫霞 賅萇 撮旎擎 瞪ж曖 匙殮棲棻. ж雖虜, 撮旎戲煎 務橫霞 賅萇 絲擊 葆擠渠煎 餌辨ж褒 熱朝 橈蝗棲棻. 措諾 わж縑曖 鼻陶檜釭 撩, 艙雖曖 婦葬縑 в蹂и 濠旎檜 氈晦 陽僥檜雖蹂.<br>\r\n<p>僭煩 撮徽擊 堪橾 熱煙 撩曖 旎堅朝 Ё褶п 雖雖虜, 撮徽檜 傘鼠 堪戲賊 僭陛陛 螢塭 艙雖 輿團菟曖 奩嫦擊 餌啪 腌棲棻. 撮徽擊 褻薑ж褒 陽縑朝 棺 斜薄擊 堅溥п 輿褊衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","orvillehp4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I can take care of all minute affairs of the castle. So you don't have to pay attention to such things. But you have to dictate me regarding the management of Castle Gate during the War.\r\n<p>There are two gates in this castle, the inner gate and the outer gate. The inner gate is the one between this inner castle where you are standing right now and the outside. The outer gate is the one located in the outer castle wall which surrounds this inner castle.\r\n<p>As a convenience, you or all of your followers can open/close the inner gate through Gatekeeper beside the gate. But the outer gate which is directly related to the security of the whole castle is accessible to your highness only. So please order me if you want to open or close the outer gate.\r\n<p>If you open the outer gate, it will allow enemies come into the inner castle, so it's very dangerous. But if you kept the Gate closed too long, people will be unable to use the facilities in the castle such as the forge. Since they are the main sources of castle treasury, it could cause the financial problem. So you have to consider carefully based upon these facts when you want to close the gate.\r\n<p>Furthermore, both gates can be destroyed by the assault from the infiltrators during the war. Once the gate is destroyed, it can be fixed only after the war ends. And if the war occurs during the repair, we can't help but to stop the repair. Of course it costs money to repair the Gate. When the gate is destroyed completely, it could cost more than thousands of adenas. You have to decide when we will fix the gate based on these facts.\r\n<p>撩僥檜 濠翕戲煎 熱葬紫煙 貲滄擊 頂葬衛賊 撩僥檜 睡熱橫雖賊 濠翕戲煎 熱葬陛 腌棲棻. 僭煩 熱葬綠 羲衛 濠翕戲煎 釭陛啪 腌棲棻. ж雖虜 奢撩瞪 衛縑朝 檜 貲滄擊 褒чй 熱 橈戲嘎煎 輿曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I can take care of all minute affairs of the castle. So you don't have to pay attention to such things. But you have to dictate me regarding the management of Castle Gate during the War.\r\n<p>There are two gates in this castle, the inner gate and the outer gate. The inner gate is the one between this inner castle where you are standing right now and the outside. The outer gate is the one located in the outer castle wall which surrounds this inner castle.\r\n<p>As a convenience, you or all of your followers can open/close the inner gate through Gatekeeper beside the gate. But the outer gate which is directly related to the security of the whole castle is accessible to your highness only. So please order me if you want to open or close the outer gate.\r\n<p>If you open the outer gate, it will allow enemies come into the inner castle, so it's very dangerous. But if you kept the Gate closed too long, people will be unable to use the facilities in the castle such as the forge. Since they are the main sources of castle treasury, it could cause the financial problem. So you have to consider carefully based upon these facts when you want to close the gate.\r\n<p>Furthermore, both gates can be destroyed by the assault from the infiltrators during the war. Once the gate is destroyed, it can be fixed only after the war ends. And if the war occurs during the repair, we can't help but to stop the repair. Of course it costs money to repair the Gate. When the gate is destroyed completely, it could cost more than thousands of adenas. You have to decide when we will fix the gate based on these facts.\r\n<p>撩僥檜 濠翕戲煎 熱葬紫煙 貲滄擊 頂葬衛賊 撩僥檜 睡熱橫雖賊 濠翕戲煎 熱葬陛 腌棲棻. 僭煩 熱葬綠 羲衛 濠翕戲煎 釭陛啪 腌棲棻. ж雖虜 奢撩瞪 衛縑朝 檜 貲滄擊 褒чй 熱 橈戲嘎煎 輿曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撩曖 ж雛堅 撮撮и 婦葬縑 渠п憮朝 瞪ж眷憮 霜蕾 褐唳噙衛雖 彊嬴紫 薯陛 籀葬蒂 ж堅 氈蝗棲棻. 棻虜 瞪爵衛曖 撩僥曖 婦葬虜躑擎 霜蕾 雖衛蒂 頂溥輿敷撿 м棲棻. <br>\r\n<p>撩縑朝 諼撩僥婁 頂撩僥檜 氈蝗棲棻. 頂撩僥擎 雖旎 啗衛朝 頂撩縑憮 夥梨戲煎 釭陛朝 僥擊 陛葬酈貊, 諼撩僥擎 檜 頂撩擊 舒腦堅 氈朝 諼撩漁縑 氈朝 僥擊 蜓м棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж諦 瞪ж曖 ⑸裊錳菟擎 陝 撩僥 擅縑 氈朝 僥雖晦縑啪 貲滄擊 頂溥憮 翮堅 殘擊 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 撩僥曖 偃寞擎 埠 撩曖 寰爾諦 霜唸腎嘎煎 睡蛤 ⑸裊錳曖 婦葬蒂 繹盪�� ж敷撿 м棲棻.\r\n<p>諼撩僥擊 罹衛賊 瞳菟縑啪 頂撩擊 偃寞ж朝 匙檜 腎嘎煎 嬪ям棲棻虜, 撩僥擊 啗樓 殘堅 啗衛賊 艙雖 輿團菟檜 撩 寰縑 氈朝 渠濰除 蛔曖 衛撲擊 餌辨й 熱陛 橈蝗棲棻. 撩 寰縑 氈朝 衛撲擎 撩曖 輿蹂и 熱殮錳檜晦紫 ж嘎煎 艙團菟檜 檜 衛撲擊 檜辨ж雖 跤ж啪 腎賊 薯薑縑 僥薯陛 儅梢棲棻. 檜薄擊 堅溥ж敷憮 樹薯 撩僥擊 罹殘擊 匙檣陛蒂 儅陝п 輿褊衛螃. <br>\r\n<p>傳 撩僥擎 瞪爵 鼻�窒□韭� 撩 寰戲煎 藹楞ж溥朝 鼠葬菟曖 奢問 陽僥縑 睡憮韓 熱 夤縑 橈蝗棲棻. 諼撩僥擊 睡憮霞 瓣煎 寞纂ж賊 瞪爵衛縑 衙辦 嬪яж嘎煎 褻勒檜 ъ塊и棻賊 窕 堅纂衛晦 夥奧棲棻. \r\n<p>ж雖虜 睡憮霞 撩僥擎 瞪爵 鼻鷓陛 嬴棍 陽夤縑 熱葬й 熱 橈堅, 傳 熱葬醞縑 瞪爵檜 嫦嫦ж賊 熱葬蒂 醞欽й 熱 夤縑 橈蝗棲棻. 僭煩 撩僥擊 熱葬ж朝 等縑朝 釭葷渠煎曖 絲檜 в蹂м棲棻. 撩僥檜 諫だ腎歷擊 唳辦縑朝 熱繭 嬴等釭 檜鼻曖 熱葬綠陛 菟 熱紫 氈蝗棲棻. 斜楝嘎煎 檜楝и 薄擊 澀 儅陝ж衛橫 樹薯 撩僥擊 堅藥撿 й梱蒂 澀 っ欽п 輿衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<p>撩僥檜 濠翕戲煎 熱葬紫煙 貲滄擊 頂葬衛賊 撩僥檜 睡熱橫雖賊 濠翕戲煎 熱葬陛 腌棲棻. 僭煩 熱葬綠 羲衛 濠翕戲煎 釭陛啪 腌棲棻. ж雖虜 奢撩瞪 衛縑朝 檜 貲滄擊 褒чй 熱 橈戲嘎煎 輿曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","orvillehp5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are already guards posted to maintain the justice around the castle, but they are to maintain the justice only and hard pressed to use them during the war. Considering that there are many small and large conflicts in the estate, we'd better prepare for the worst by hiring the trustworthy mercenaries.\r\n<p>Once you tell me the number and type of mercenaries, I'll ask around to gather the trustworthy mercenaries until the next day same hour.\r\n<p>There are two types of mercenaries to defend our castle considering the structure of the castle. One is the archer who can shoot against the enemies who are trying to destroy the gate. The other is personal bodyguard to protect you and members of your blood pledge.\r\n<p>I will arrange archers around the castle wall as soon as they are ready. But you have to decide yourself how many bodyguards will be assigned to you and your members.\r\n<p>Mercenaries will wait for your order in the barrack at the south corner of outer castle. Once you make up your mind, talk to Hunt who is the Captain of mercenary army <var src=\"#0\">. Then he will assign mercenaries according to your order.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Please remember that the money to hire mercenaries also come from the taxes gathered from residents of your land.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are already guards posted to maintain the justice around the castle, but they are to maintain the justice only and hard pressed to use them during the war. Considering that there are many small and large conflicts in the estate, we'd better prepare for the worst by hiring the trustworthy mercenaries.\r\n<p>Once you tell me the number and type of mercenaries, I'll ask around to gather the trustworthy mercenaries until the next day same hour.\r\n<p>There are two types of mercenaries to defend our castle considering the structure of the castle. One is the archer who can shoot against the enemies who are trying to destroy the gate. The other is personal bodyguard to protect you and members of your blood pledge.\r\n<p>I will arrange archers around the castle wall as soon as they are ready. But you have to decide yourself how many bodyguards will be assigned to you and your members.\r\n<p>Mercenaries will wait for your order in the barrack at the south corner of outer castle. Once you make up your mind, talk to Hunt who is the Captain of mercenary army <var src=\"#0\">. Then he will assign mercenaries according to your order.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Please remember that the money to hire mercenaries also come from the taxes gathered from residents of your land.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撩縑朝 檜嘐 撩婁 艙雖曖 纂寰擊 嶸雖ж晦 嬪и 唳綠煽菟檜 氈蝗棲棻虜, 檜菟擎 橫蛤梱雖釭 纂寰擊 氬渡ж晦 嬪и 檣溘橾 閨 瞪爵縑 霜蕾瞳戲煎 翕錳ж晦縑朝 鼠葬陛 氈蝗棲棻. 陛嗣檜釭 蹂闈縑朝 觼堅 濛擎 諄遺檜 艙雖 頂縑憮 橾橫釭堅 氈戲棲, 褒溘氈朝 辨煽擊 堅辨ж罹 虜橾曖 餌鷓縑 渠綠ж朝 匙檜 謠擊 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮 盪縑啪 в蹂и 辨煽曖 謙盟諦 熱虜 蜓噪п 輿衛賊, 薯陛 褒溘氈朝 辨煽菟擊 熱模僥п憮 蜓噪ж褐 棻擠陳 偽擎 衛除梱雖朝 в蹂и 熱蒂 賅嬴螃紫煙 ж啊蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<p>盪�� 撩曖 掘褻鼻 в蹂и 辨煽曖 謙盟朝 舒陛雖陛 氈蝗棲棻. и陛雖朝 諼撩漁 嬪縑憮 撩漁擊 だ惚ж溥堅 ж朝 瞳菟擊 唯營ж晦 嬪и 掙煽菟檜堅, 傳 и陛雖朝 霜蕾 艙輿椒檜釭 艙輿椒曖 ⑸裊菟擊 爾��й 瞪癱錳菟殮棲棻.\r\n<p>掙煽曖 唳辦朝 盪縑啪 摹嫦擊 貲ж衛晦虜 ж賊 濠翕瞳戲煎 撩漁縑 寡纂腌棲棻虜, 瞪癱錳曖 唳辦朝 橾欽 堅辨и �� 艙輿椒婁 ⑸裊碟菟縑啪 檜菟擊 賃貲檜釭 寡纂衛鑒 匙檣雖蒂 艙輿椒眷憮 唸薑ж敷撿 м棲棻.\r\n<p>辨煽菟擎 諼撩曖 陴薹 掘戮縑 氈朝 虞餌縑憮 渠晦ж堅 氈蝗棲棻. 辨煽擊 橫飩啪 寡纂й雖蒂 唸薑ж褐 �醴●�, 虞餌 擅縑憮 辨煽欽 <var src=\"#0\">曖 渠濰 йお縑啪 蜓擊 剪衛賊 斜陛 辨煽擊 в蹂и 虜躑 寡纂п 萄萵 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辨煽擊 堅辨ж朝 絲擎 艙饜 輿團菟縑啪憮 務擎 撮旎檜塭朝 薄擊 膩舒縑 舒衛堅, 澀 儅陝п憮 堅辨ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","orvillehp6-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>如同尊貴的您曾做過的一樣，目前有許多團體正在城外企圖奪取這座城堡。所以如果您想要穩坐本城的統治者的位置，您必須密切地地注意他們。\r\n<p>在您接管城堡後，您必須調整課稅，這樣才有足購的金錢可以維修在戰爭期間被破壞的城堡。一旦資金充裕，您一定要修理內部和外部的門，這樣會使原來的城堡更堅固。您最好僱用一些傭兵，如此一來那些敵人就不能靠近您。\r\n<p>這時，其他血盟將會來向您的權威挑戰。您必須藉由我來設定下一次的圍城時間。在征服城堡之後的半天之內，您能隨意地改變這時間，但半天之後，您就不能再任意地改變時間。如果您一直都沒有設定時間，那時間將會自動地設定約為１２天之後。\r\n<p>一旦圍城開始，您就必須防護城堡直到日落。即使有時候你會暫時失去你的城堡，只要在日落之前把它搶回來，那麼城堡就依然是您的。而在日落之後，您就必須再一次地設定下一次圍城的時間。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>圍城開始後，最好在外城門那裡就可以阻止這些人。外門很堅固強而且有弓箭手會保護大門。但是您也不能總是讓外部的門關著，因為你將不能確定他們一定是來自外面。為了解決這個問題，還有另一個保護措施，那就是固守內門，即使它不如外門那樣堅固。\r\n<p>此外，沒有人能確定他們不會潛入內城之中。所以殿下，請您務必一定要帶著足夠的傭兵當做您的貼身保鑣。\r\n<p>現在失去城堡最主要的條件是，當然啦…那就是遭到敵人的強攻而被消滅。但是那也不是失去城堡的唯一方法。比如說，假如敵人的王族接管了您的王座，您也同樣會失去城堡。\r\n<p>殿下，正如我之前所說的，失敗者的命運是無法想像的。在處理戰爭事件的時候，請一定要小心慎重考慮。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","orvillehp6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As your highness did once, there are many groups who are planning to take over this castle outside right now. So if you want to remain as the lord of this castle, you have to take care of them wisely.\r\n<p>Once you take over the castle, you have to adjust the tax so that there is enough money to maintain the castle which is destroyed during the war. And once you have enough money you have to repair the inner and outer gate thus strengthening the integrity of castle. And you'd better hire mercenaries so that the enemies can't come near you.\r\n<p>After taking the castle, other blood pledges will try to challenge your authority. For them you must set the next war time by asking me. You can change this time freely before half of the day passes after conquering the castle but once this time passes, you can't change the time any more. If you don't set the time until then, the time will be set automatically to about 10 days later.\r\n<p>Once the time comes, you have to defend the castle until sunset. Even if you lost your castle temporarily, you just have to get it back before sunset, then the castle is yours. After sunset, you have to set the next siege time again.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Once the war starts, it's better to block their entrance into the outer castle. The outer gate is very strong and the archers will defend the gate. But since you can't always leave the outer gate closed, you must not assume that they will always come from the outside. To deal with this case, there is an another protection which is the inner gate even though it's not so sturdy as the outer gate.\r\n<p>Furthermore, no one can make sure that they won't infiltrate into the inner castle. So please my lord, always take enough mercenaries with you as bodyguards.\r\n<p>Now the most important condition to lose your castle is, well... meeting an unfortunate demise by the hands of enemies of course. But that's not the only way to lose the castle. If the enemy prince takes over your throne, you will lose also.\r\n<p>If I say so, the loser's fate is unthinkable my lord. Please be wise when dealing with war affairs.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Orville:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As your highness did once, there are many groups who are planning to take over this castle outside right now. So if you want to remain as the lord of this castle, you have to take care of them wisely.\r\n<p>Once you take over the castle, you have to adjust the tax so that there is enough money to maintain the castle which is destroyed during the war. And once you have enough money you have to repair the inner and outer gate thus strengthening the integrity of castle. And you'd better hire mercenaries so that the enemies can't come near you.\r\n<p>After taking the castle, other blood pledges will try to challenge your authority. For them you must set the next war time by asking me. You can change this time freely before half of the day passes after conquering the castle but once this time passes, you can't change the time any more. If you don't set the time until then, the time will be set automatically to about 10 days later.\r\n<p>Once the time comes, you have to defend the castle until sunset. Even if you lost your castle temporarily, you just have to get it back before sunset, then the castle is yours. After sunset, you have to set the next siege time again.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Once the war starts, it's better to block their entrance into the outer castle. The outer gate is very strong and the archers will defend the gate. But since you can't always leave the outer gate closed, you must not assume that they will always come from the outside. To deal with this case, there is an another protection which is the inner gate even though it's not so sturdy as the outer gate.\r\n<p>Furthermore, no one can make sure that they won't infiltrate into the inner castle. So please my lord, always take enough mercenaries with you as bodyguards.\r\n<p>Now the most important condition to lose your castle is, well... meeting an unfortunate demise by the hands of enemies of course. But that's not the only way to lose the castle. If the enemy prince takes over your throne, you will lose also.\r\n<p>If I say so, the loser's fate is unthinkable my lord. Please be wise when dealing with war affairs.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","orvillehp6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃網:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮 檜瞪縑 斜楝ж樟蛭檜, ⑷營 撩 夤縑朝 檜 撩擊 離雖ж罹 掏溘擊 槳縑 厥堅濠 ж朝 鼠葬菟檜 熱橈檜 號蝗棲棻. 瞪ж眷憮 檜 撩曖 撩輿煎 啗衛晦 嬪п憮朝 檜楝и 鼠葬菟曖 嬪⑺縑 ⑷貲ж啪 渠籀ж衛雖 彊戲賊 寰腌棲棻.\r\n<p>撩擊 槳縑 厥戲樟戲賊, 辦摹 撮徽擊 褻薑ж敷憮 瞪爵戲煎 鼠傘霞 撩曖 纂寰擊 夥煎濩擊 濠旎擊 葆溼ж紫煙 ж褊衛螃. 斜葬堅, 濠旎檜 葆溼腎朝 渠煎 瞪ж眷 瞳偃褕擊 ヶ擎 濠菟檜 輿滲縑 橡壁剪葬雖 跤ж紫煙 頂撩僥, 諼撩僥擊 熱葬ж朝 иら 辨煽擊 堅辨ж罹 撩 頂曖 瞪溘擊 鬼�倆狤忠� м棲棻.\r\n<p>撩擊 離雖ж褐 �醴●� 棻艇 ⑸裊菟曖 紫瞪擊 嫡戲衛啪 腌棲棻. 檜楝и ⑸裊菟婁曖 奢撩瞪擎 艙輿椒檜 唸薑ж褐 衛除縑 чп雖啪 腌棲棻. 撩擊 離雖ж衛堅 釭賊 辦摹 盪縑啪 棻擠 奢撩瞪檜 樹薯 纂瘀韓 匙檣雖蒂 蜓噪п 輿衛褫模憮. 檜 衛除擎 撩擊 離雖ж褐 �� 奩釭瞰檜 雖釭晦 瞪梱雖朝 濠嶸照啪 夥紱褒 熱 氈蝗棲棻虜, 檜 晦除檜 雖釭賊 渦檜鼻 夥紱褒 熱 橈蝗棲棻. 虜擒 檜陽梱雖 棻擠 奢撩瞪檜 衛濛腎朝 衛除擊 薑ж衛雖 彊戲賊 翮�� 薑紫 �譟� 奢撩瞪 蝶馨還檜 濠翕瞳戲煎 濩�鱁� 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>奢撩瞪檜 衛濛腎賊 艙輿眷憮朝 斜陳 п陛 韓 陽梱雖 撩擊 餌熱ж敷撿 м棲棻. 虜擒 橾衛瞳戲煎 撩擊 貍憾晦樟棻堅 ж渦塭紫 п陛 雖晦 瞪縑 棻衛 撩擊 驍�納牮霽椓� 檜 撩擎 啗樓 瞪ж曖 匙檜 腌棲棻. 檜溢啪 и廓 奢撩瞪擊 纂瑞堅 釭衛賊 棻衛 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 唸薑ж衛啪 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橾欽 瞪爵檜 衛濛腎賊, 瞳檜 諼撩僥 寰戲煎 菟橫螃雖 跤ж紫煙 盪雖ж朝 匙檜 陛濰 謠蝗棲棻. 諼撩僥擎 唯堅ж貊, 傳 撩漁 嬪縑朝 掙熱蒂 寡纂й 熱 氈戲嘎煎 嬴捱縑啪 觼啪 嶸葬м棲棻. ж雖虜 樹薯釭 撩僥擊 殘嬴場擊 熱朝 橈戲嘎煎 瞳檜 樹薯釭 諼撩僥 夥梨縑憮虜 路溥螃葬塭堅 儅陝ж朝 匙擎 嬪ям棲棻. 檜楝и 唳辦蒂 嬪п 諼撩僥 爾棻朝 ががж雖 彊雖虜 橫繚萇 嬴捱縑啪朝 頂撩僥檜塭朝 薯 2曖 寞漁檜 襄營м棲棻.\r\n<p>啪棻陛 頂撩僥葆盪 給だ腎朝 嬪晦 鼻�窕� 瞰渠煎 螃雖 彊戲葬塭堅朝 援掘紫 濰氬й 熱 橈蝗棲棻. 斜楝嘎煎 瞪ж, 樹薯釭 醱碟и 熱曖 辨煽擊 ��嬪煽戲煎 等葬堅 氈戲衛晦 夥奧棲棻. \r\n<p>撩擊 貍憾晦啪 腎朝 陛濰 醞蹂и 褻勒擎 僭煩 瞪ж眷憮 藹殮濠曖 槳縑...瑰滲擊 渡ж啪 腎衛朝 匙殮棲棻虜, 斜匙檜 嶸橾и 褻勒擎 嬴椎棲棻. 虜擒 瞳捱曖 ⑸裊輿陛 撩曖 諾謝蒂 離雖ж啪 腎賊 斜陽紫 瞪ж朝 瞪爵縑憮 ぬж衛朝 匙檜 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>諼塋脹 蜓殮棲棻虜, ぬ濠曖 譆�譬� 綠霤и 匙殮棲棻. 瞪ж, 睡蛤 ⑷貲ж啪 渠籀ж罹 輿衛褫模憮.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","orvillelhp5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在城中已經有負責維持治安的衛兵，但是他們也只負責維持治安而已，在戰爭期間，很難叫得動他們來參與。若我們再考慮到那些大大小小的戰爭攻擊的話，還是先雇請那些可以信賴的傭兵比較妥當。您只要告訴我需要雇用多少傭兵人數和他們的類型，明天的這個時候，我就會為您準備好這些傭兵了。\r\n<p>以城堡的結構看來，有二種類型的傭兵可以防衛我們的城堡。一種是弓箭手，他們可以反擊那些破壞門的敵人。另一種則是保護您和血盟的個人保鑣。</p>\r\n<p>當他們準備妥當後，我就會在城牆的周圍安排弓箭手。\r\n<p>但是您必須決定您需要多少的保鏢，或者您要分配多少的保鏢給您的血盟。\r\n<p>傭兵們會在城外南方角落的兵營中等待著您的命令。一旦您下了決定，請和傭兵隊長說話。然後他將會依照您的命令指派傭兵。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>請記得，雇用傭兵的錢是從稅金中支出的。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"orvillehp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","othmond1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>主人，請你吩咐？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp1\"> 徵求建言</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\"> 接受收入和支出的報告</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\"> 調整稅率</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">領出資金</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">存入資金</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmond4\">管理傭兵</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">管理城門</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">指定下次圍城時間</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">管理城堡治安</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Orders, my Lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp1\">Ask advice</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">Get report of income/expenses</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the tax rates</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw adena</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit adena</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmond4\">Manage mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the gates</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">Declare next siege time</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">Control castle security</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Orders, my Lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp1\">Ask advice</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">Get report of income/expenses</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the tax rates</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw adena</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit adena</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmond4\">Manage mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the gates</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">Declare next siege time</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">Control castle security</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿椒, 橫雯 貲滄擊 頂葬衛啪蝗棲梱?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp1\">褻樹擊 掘и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">熱殮/雖轎曖 爾堅蒂 嫡朝棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">撮徽擊 褻瞰и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">濠旎擊 檣轎и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">濠旎擊 殮旎и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmond4\">辨煽擊 婦葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">撩僥擊 婦葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 薑и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">撩頂 纂寰擊 婦葬и棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond10-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在我們沒有資金可以修理這個門。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","othmond10-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We don't have enough money to repair the gate!\r\n","othmond10-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We don't have enough money to repair the gate!\r\n","othmond10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 僥擊 熱葬й虜и 濠旎檜 橈蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","othmond11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>因為現在正在戰爭中，所以沒有辦法修理。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","othmond11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We are in the middle of war - we can't repair the gates until it ends.\r\n\r\n","othmond11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We are in the middle of war - we can't repair the gates until it ends.\r\n\r\n","othmond11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎擎 瞪爵醞檜塭 熱葬陛 碳陛棟м棲棻.\r\n</body>","othmond12-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>更改後的稅率要從第二天才生效。即使一天好幾次更換稅率，但是您要記住一點，最後設定的稅率才是可生效的。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","othmond12-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The new tax rate will be effective tomorrow. Please remember that even if you changed the tax before, this one will be tomorrow's tax rate.\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond12-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The new tax rate will be effective tomorrow. Please remember that even if you changed the tax before, this one will be tomorrow's tax rate.\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond12-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>滲唳脹 撮徽擎 棻擠陳睡攪 瞳辨腎啪 腌棲棻. ж瑞縑 罹楝廓 撮徽擊 夥紱衛渦塭紫 葆雖虞縑 薑п霞 撮徽虜檜 瞳辨脹棻朝 薄擊 貲褕п 輿衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n</body>","othmond13-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>依您所吩咐的<var src=\"#0\">我會補充好的，<var src=\"#1\">名到明天這個時候之前，我一定會補充完畢的。\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond13-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Following your order, I will replenish the army with <var src=\"#1\"> more <var src=\"#0\">s. They will be available at this time tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond13-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Following your order, I will replenish the army with <var src=\"#1\"> more <var src=\"#0\">s. They will be available at this time tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond13-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>碟睡ж褐渠煎 <var src=\"#0\">蒂 <var src=\"#1\">貲 爾醱ж紫煙 ж啊蝗棲棻. 頂橾 偽擎 衛除梱雖朝 爾醱檜 腆 匙殮棲棻.\r\n</body>","othmond14-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>因為現在資金不足的關係，所以城內所有的機能都是呈現靜止的狀態，請您趕快下令指導我們應該如何來防備。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmond1\">下令指示阿斯特曼。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","othmond14-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We have depleted the treasury, I can't manage the castle in this state!  Please tell me what to do.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmond1\">Give an order</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond14-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We have depleted the treasury, I can't manage the castle in this state!  Please tell me what to do.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmond1\">Give an order</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond14-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 濠旎檜 睡褶ж罹 撩曖 晦棟檜 葆綠脹 鼻鷓殮棲棻. 橫飩啪 渠籀п撿 й 雖 貲滄擊 頂溥輿褊衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmond1\">螃蝶跨萄縑啪 雖衛蒂 頂萼棻</a>\r\n</body>","othmond15-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">殿下啊，能裝備給您的<var src=\"#0\">傭兵數量是您魅力<var src=\"#1\">的一半而已。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond15-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord, You can assign <var src=\"#0\"> up to <var src=\"#1\"> mercenaries (half of his Charisma.)</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond15-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord, You can assign <var src=\"#0\"> up to <var src=\"#1\"> mercenaries (half of his Charisma.)</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond15-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿衛罹, <var src=\"#0\">椒眷 寡纂п 萄萵 熱 氈朝 辨煽曖 熱朝 <var src=\"#0\">椒曖 CHR曖 瞰奩檣 <var src=\"#1\">貲 梱雖殮棲棻.</p>\r\n</body>","othmond16-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>您難道還沒去過嗎？嗯∼就在右邊的房間附近不是有個往下延伸而去的階梯嗎？其實這個城本來是風木之城的始祖『背叛的藍騎士』卡勒所建造的。卡勒為了阻擋和封印魔物，於是命令將城堡建築在這個地方。雖然有危險的怪獸一直不斷的侵害這個城，所幸一直到目前為止，並沒有什麼危險的狀況。而今更是託您之福，這個城堡內的騎士隊才能有如此堅固的訓練營地。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>也許在一般人的觀念中，把城堡建立在危險之中是一件讓人極為不能理解的奇異的舉動。但是卡勒曾經說過，適當的危險有時候可以阻擋內亂，而且能培養人民堅強團結的精神，此外他畢生最大的希望就是，能親自從怪獸的地盤中，把風木之城變成一個可以讓人們平安地過日子的地方。\r\n<br>卡勒就是有這種志向的人。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond16-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Haven't you been there? There are steps going down in the next room. This castle was originally built by Karel, the Blue Knight of Betrayal, who also wanted to seal the monsters in the dungeon. Even though, up until now, there have been no real dangers, the monsters in the dungeon are threatening the castle endlessly. Due to those monsters, this dungeon serves as a training ground for young knights.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It may be hard to believe that he built the castle in the center of danger, but he always said that having danger nearby prevents internal corruption and teaches a strong mind. Most of all, he wanted to build Windawood as the place where commoners can live comfortably without worrying about monsters.\r\n<br>Karel was quite a lord.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond16-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Haven't you been there? There are steps going down in the next room. This castle was originally built by Karel, the Blue Knight of Betrayal, who also wanted to seal the monsters in the dungeon. Even though, up until now, there have been no real dangers, the monsters in the dungeon are threatening the castle endlessly. Due to those monsters, this dungeon serves as a training ground for young knights.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It may be hard to believe that he built the castle in the center of danger, but he always said that having danger nearby prevents internal corruption and teaches a strong mind. Most of all, he wanted to build Windawood as the place where commoners can live comfortably without worrying about monsters.\r\n<br>Karel was quite a lord.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond16-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴霜 陛爾雖 彊戲樟蝗棲梱? 夥煎 螃艇薹 寞縑 湍蟒戲煎 頂溥陛朝 啗欽檜 氈雖 彊蝗棲梱? 檜 撩擎 獄楚 孺棻辦萄曖 衛褻檜褐 '寡褐曖 羶晦餌' 蘋滂椒眷憮 湍蟒擊 虞嬴場擎 瑰檣曖 羲й紫 售ж紫煙 勒蹴擊 貲ж樟蝗棲棻. 嬴霜梱雖 斜溢啪 嬪яи 癒�譬� 橈雖虜, 湍蟒縑憮朝 莒歜橈檜 嬪яи 跨蝶攪菟檜 撩擊 嬪⑺ж堅 氈雖蹂. 湯碟縑 撩曖 晦餌欽縑啪朝 �К〥� 熱溼濰檜 腎堅 氈蝗棲棻.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬪я擊 и陛遴等 撩擊 雖擎 匙檜 橡е 檜пж晦 橫滑啊雖虜, 橫替 薑紫曖 嬪⑺檜 氈朝 匙檜 頂睡曖 睡ぬ蒂 虞堅, 鬼勒и 薑褐擊 晦艇棻堅 蘋滂椒擎 蜓噪ж樟轄. 斜葬堅 鼠歙爾棻 槳熱 孺棻辦萄蒂 跨蝶攪曖 模掉縑憮 檣除菟檜 ら�� 髦 熱 氈朝 夠戲煎 虜菟堅 談橫ж樟戲棲梱蹂.\r\n<br>蘋滂椒擎 斜楛 碟檜樟港棲棻.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>以下是昨天的稅金收入和支出。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>昨天的收入：<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">金幣\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">基本支出</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">金幣\r\n<p align=left>昨天總結：<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">金幣\r\n<p align=left>目前財產總額：<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">金幣\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","othmond2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the report of yesterday's transaction.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Total income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adena\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">Basic expenses</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adena\r\n<p align=left>Net income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adena\r\n<p align=left>Current treasury<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adena\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the report of yesterday's transaction.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Total income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adena\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">Basic expenses</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adena\r\n<p align=left>Net income of the day:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adena\r\n<p align=left>Current treasury<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adena\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫薯 ж瑞曖 撮旎 熱殮婁 雖轎擎 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>橫薯ж瑞 熱殮:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">晦獄 雖轎</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left>橫薯唸骯:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left>⑷營濠骯識擋<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">嬴等釭\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>以下是這次的支出清單。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>上貢給王的貢品<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>管理治安費<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>侍臣的俸祿<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>城內管理費<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>管理傭兵費<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">金幣<p>\r\n<p align=left>其他費用<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#5\">金幣<p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","othmond3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The record of expenses is here, my lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Tribute to the King<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adena\r\n<p>Peace control<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adena\r\n<p>Payment to servants<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adena\r\n<p>Castle upkeep<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adena\r\n<p>Payment to Mercenaries<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">adena\r\n<p align=right><p>Miscellaneous<br>\r\n<var src=\"#5\">adena\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The record of expenses is here, my lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Tribute to the King<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adena\r\n<p>Peace control<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adena\r\n<p>Payment to servants<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adena\r\n<p>Castle upkeep<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adena\r\n<p>Payment to Mercenaries<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">adena\r\n<p align=right><p>Miscellaneous<br>\r\n<var src=\"#5\">adena\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜廓曖 雖轎 頂羲擎 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>諾縑曖 鼻陶<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>纂寰 嶸雖綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>衛謙菟曖 瑰晝<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>撩曖 嶸雖婦葬綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>辨煽 嶸雖綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n<p align=left>晦顫 濩綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#5\">嬴等釭<p>\r\n</body>","othmond4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>請下達關於傭兵的命令。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">城牆上安排射手</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">募集傭兵</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">安排雇用的傭兵</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","othmond4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What kind of task do you have in your mind for the mercenaries, my lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">Arrange the archers</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">Employ mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">Rearrange hired mercenaries</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What kind of task do you have in your mind for the mercenaries, my lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">Arrange the archers</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">Employ mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">Rearrange hired mercenaries</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辨煽縑 渠и 薑疇擊 唸薑п 輿褊衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">撩漁嬪曖 掙熱 寡纂</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">辨煽 堅辨</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">堅辨и 辨煽曖 寡纂</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>目前城門狀態如下。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate_windawood outer gate\">修理外城門</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate_windawood inner gate\">修理內城門</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the status of the castle gates right now.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate\">Repair the outer gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate\">Repair the inner gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the status of the castle gates right now.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate\">Repair the outer gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate\">Repair the inner gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 撩僥曖 鼻鷓朝 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate_windawood outer gate\">諼撩僥擊 熱葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"healigate_windawood inner gate\">頂撩僥擊 熱葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"autorepairon\">撩僥 濠翕 熱葬 貲滄擊 頂塢棻.</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"autorepairoff\">撩僥 濠翕 熱葬 貲滄擊 鏃模и棻.</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">！殿下您好，你注意到<a link=\"othmond16\">城堡地底下</a>的狀態現在變得怎麼樣了嗎？有沒有一些什麼特別危險的徵兆呢？\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","othmond6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My lord <var src=\"#0\">, how are you doing nowadays? How's the situation in the <a link=\"othmond16\">dungeon</a>? Were there any bad signs?\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My lord <var src=\"#0\">, how are you doing nowadays? How's the situation in the <a link=\"othmond16\">dungeon</a>? Were there any bad signs?\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">椒, 橫憮螃褊衛螃. 撩 嬴楚 <a link=\"othmond16\">雖ж 湍蟒</a>曖 鼻鷓朝 橫雅蝗棲郭? か滌�� 嬪яи 癒�譬� 橈歷蝗棲梱?\r\n</body>","othmond7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你以為這裡是什麼地方！你竟敢闖進來！\r\n<p>侍衛兵！趕快把這些人從這裡押出去！\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","othmond7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Your orders, my Lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp1\">Ask advice</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">Get the report of income/expenses</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the tax rates</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw adena</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit adena</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmond4\">Manage mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">Declare next siege time</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Your orders, my Lord.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp1\">Ask advice</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"inex\">Get the report of income/expenses</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the tax rates</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw adena</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit adena</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmond4\">Manage mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">Declare next siege time</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹晦陛 橫蛞還 憲堅 獗橫菟橫諮朝陛!\r\n<p>唳綠煽! 檜濠菟擊 說葬 罹晦縑憮 莊橫頂紫煙 ж塭!\r\n</body>","othmond8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>依照您的吩咐到明天這個時間，我一定把士兵都召集起來。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","othmond8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As you ordered, I'll recruit mercenaries by this hour tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>As you ordered, I'll recruit mercenaries by this hour tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","othmond8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>碟睡渠煎 頂橾 偽擎 衛除 梱雖朝 煽餌菟擊 賅嬴螃紫煙 ж啊蝗棲棻.\r\n</body>","othmond9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>目前我們並沒有雇用傭兵。如果想要安排士兵，首先請您下命令，讓我去『募集傭兵』，這樣才能雇用傭兵。\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","othmond9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are no mercenaries available now. If you want to assign them, please let me 'Employ mercenaries' first.\r\n\r\n","othmond9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are no mercenaries available now. If you want to assign them, please let me 'Employ mercenaries' first.\r\n\r\n","othmond9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 堅辨и 辨煽檜 橈蝗棲棻. 煽餌蒂 寡纂ж衛溥賊 辦摹 盪縑啪 '辨煽 堅辨' 貲滄擊 頂葬敷憮 辨煽擊 堅辨ж敷撿 ж褫棲棻.\r\n</body>","othmondhp1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>殿下，您想知道哪方面的事情呢？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp2\">關於城主和關於城主的任務<</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp3\">關於納稅</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp4\">關於城堡的管理</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp5\">關於傭兵</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp6\">關於戰爭</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>What do you want to know, my Lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp2\">About myself and the role of Lord</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp3\">About Taxes</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp4\">About managing the Castle</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp5\">About Mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp6\">About War</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>What do you want to know, my Lord?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp2\">About myself and the role of Lord</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp3\">About Taxes</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp4\">About managing the Castle</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp5\">About Mercenaries</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp6\">About War</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>橫集и 匙縑 渠п 憲堅 談戲褊棲梱, 輿檣檜衛罹?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp2\">艙輿塭朝 雖嬪諦 衛謙濰縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp3\">撮旎縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp4\">撩曖 婦葬縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp5\">辨煽縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"othmondhp6\">瞪爵縑 渠п</a>\r\n</body>","othmondhp2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">殿下，從今以後您就是這個城的盟主了。打從卡勒城建立起，我就一直擔任著這個城的管家的身分，所以我自信比任何人都了解關於這個城和這裡的地方的一切大大小小的事情，而我也以這身分為傲。\r\n<p>雖然當年建立風木之城的卡勒是一位非常傑出的盟主，但是經過三代之後的艾德利殿下卻是一位極無能的君主。因為他沒有盡心保護這個國家，所以我的心也慢慢地不忠於他。我曾發過誓，只忠心於用心管理風木之城城的主人。只要我的主人是能保護風木之城城的人，把風木之城的光榮發揚於亞丁，我的忠心將永不會改變的。\r\n<p>您可以透過我來收取稅金，用那筆錢來雇用傭兵，而且掌有這個地方最高的權威。但是您不能亂用君主的名聲，並希望您能處處為這個地方的人民著想，請您務必用心地管理這塊土地。\r\n<p>最後，容我多言再提醒您一件重要的事。如今，您已經成為這個地方的領主了，這將意味著您會永遠存在於這個世界之上。如果有一天，當殿下想要離開這個世界時，您的替身還是會留在這裡。若您的替身遇到不得已的情況下的話，那麼您的替身就必須要替代您來接受所有來挑戰殿下的戰爭。為了避免這種情形，請您千萬不要在完全沒有防備的情況下出城。而當您要離開這個世界時，也請您務必在安全的地方離開，因為無時無刻都會出現想要取您性命的人。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","othmondhp2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord <var src=\"#0\">, you are the Lord of this castle.  I have been in charge of this castle from the days when this castle was called Gludio, and I know better than anyone else of this castle and lands around.\r\n<p>Even if there were many Lords succeeding one after another since I became the Chamberlain of this castle, I have always helped in the defense of the castle regardless of who they may be.\r\n<p>My loyalty is not restricted to one specific person, but rather to the 'Lord of Gludio Estate'. Thus, as long as you are the Lord of this castle, I'll be always loyal to you.\r\n<p>You can gather taxes and hire mercenaries through me, and thus rule this province with supreme power. But considering the lives of the people here, please don't overuse your power and take good care of the land and people.\r\n<p>And also, please remember that as a Lord of this province you can't really leave the world entirely. If you leave this world, your avatar will appear at the exact place you departed, and remain to accept all wars against you. Furthermore he is vulnerable to external dangers, so I advise you to come to the safe place before leaving the world lest someone tries to kill your avatar while you are absent.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>My Lord <var src=\"#0\">, you are the Lord of this castle.  I have been in charge of this castle from the days when this castle was called Gludio, and I know better than anyone else of this castle and lands around.\r\n<p>Even if there were many Lords succeeding one after another since I became the Chamberlain of this castle, I have always helped in the defense of the castle regardless of who they may be.\r\n<p>My loyalty is not restricted to one specific person, but rather to the 'Lord of Gludio Estate'. Thus, as long as you are the Lord of this castle, I'll be always loyal to you.\r\n<p>You can gather taxes and hire mercenaries through me, and thus rule this province with supreme power. But considering the lives of the people here, please don't overuse your power and take good care of the land and people.\r\n<p>And also, please remember that as a Lord of this province you can't really leave the world entirely. If you leave this world, your avatar will appear at the exact place you departed, and remain to accept all wars against you. Furthermore he is vulnerable to external dangers, so I advise you to come to the safe place before leaving the world lest someone tries to kill your avatar while you are absent.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\"> 瞪ж, 檜薯 渡褐擎 檜 撩曖 艙輿檜褊棲棻. 斜葬堅 盪朝 蘋滂椒檜 撩檜 撮辦褒 陽睡攪 檜 撩縑 衛謙戲煎 檜歷蝗棲棻. 斜楚憮 盪朝 援掘爾棻紫 檜 撩婁 艙雖縑 渠п 澀 憲堅 氈棻 濠睡ж堅 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n<p>籀擠 孺棻辦萄蒂 檜瑁ж樟湍 蘋滂椒擎 鼠繫檜釭 嗨橫陪 艙輿椒檜樟雖虜 3渠陛 �撣� 雖旎 縑萄葛 瞪ж朝 鼠棟ж晦 斜雖橈朝 碟檜樟蝗棲棻. 斜楝棲 撩紫 雖酈雖 跤ж樟雖啊雖虜 盪曖 葆擠擎 檜嘐 斜碟擊 集陪雖 螃楚殮棲棻. 盪朝 螃霜 孺棻辦萄 撩縑 橫選葬朝 碟虜擊 輿檣戲煎 撰晦晦煎 裊撮ц蝗棲棻. 虜擒 輿檣椒檜 孺棻辦萄撩曖 輿團菟擊 雖酈堅 孺棻辦萄曖 艙惜擊 嬴筆縑 萄堪檜朝 и 盪曖 醱撩褕擎 滲л橈擊 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<p>渡褐眷憮朝 盪蒂 鱔ж罹 檜 雖羲曖 撮旎擊 務堅, 斜 絲戲煎 辨煽擊 堅辨ж罹 雖羲 頂縑憮朝 譆堅曖 掏溘擊 陛雖衛啪 腌棲棻虜, 檜蒂 陴辨ж敷憮朝 寰腌棲棻. 睡蛤 檜夠縑 餌朝 艙團菟擊 儅陝ж衛橫 檜 艙雖蒂 澀 棻蝶溥 輿衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<p>葆雖虞戲煎 喻だ褕縑憮 萄葬朝 蜓噪殮棲棻虜, 檜 雖羲曖 艙輿煎賦 瞪ж眷憮朝 樹薯釭 檜 撮啗縑 襄營ж衛啪 腌棲棻. 瞪ж陛 虜擒 檜 撮啗蒂 集釭敷紫, 瞪ж曖 �亳鑑票� 檜 撮啗縑 陴嬴啗衛啪 腌棲棻. �亳鑑票韭� 睡菜檜и 唳辦陛 嬴棲賊 瞪ж眷 紫瞪ж朝 賅萇 瞪爵擊 嫡嬴菟檜衛啪 腌棲棻. 斜楝棲 瞰渠煎 鼠寞綠и 鼻鷓煎 撩 夤擊 給嬴棻棲雖 葆衛堅 檜 撮啗蒂 集釭褒 陽縑朝 樹薯釭 試盪 寰瞪и 夠縑憮 ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻. 樹薯 橫蛤憮 瞪ж曖 跡獗擊 喻葬朝 濠陛 氈擊雖 賅落棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","othmondhp3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>收取稅金是殿下對這個地方人民應有的權力，這也是奉獻給全國王陛下的一點誠意，所以這是殿下的義務。\r\n<p>殿下，您擁有調整這地方稅率的權限，您所決定的稅率不只是風木之城，包括附近的風木村，皆可以採用通行，而這個稅率也會影響該地方的商業交易價格。\r\n<p>容我提醒殿下一件事。一旦殿下決定稅率之後，那麼稅率就會影響第二天通行的稅率了。倘若殿下在一天之內變更多次稅率，那麼那一天殿下最後決定的稅率，將是第二天通行的稅率。\r\n<p>而一天的稅金收入將在第二天落日的時候，收齊送達城裡。<br>\r\n<p>這一切收回的稅金全部都是屬於殿下的，但是，這些收回的稅金並不能隨便花費。因為這些稅金之中，也包括要奉送給陛下的貢金，除此以外，殿下管理土地時也一定會需要用到這些資金的。<br>\r\n<p>當然，若是越提高稅率城裡的金庫就越富裕。但若稅率太高，物價就會上漲，這樣做就會造成人民的抗議。在調整稅率的過程，希望殿下您一定要慎重地考慮這一點。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","othmondhp3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Taxation is your royal right; similarly it's your responsibility to pay a tribute to Ken Rauhel, the Lord of all this Kingdom.\r\n<p>You have the power to adjust the Tax of this province; the adjusted tax will be applied to the shops in the village around the castle and even the shops in the Gludin Village, thus affecting all trades there.\r\n<p>Once you decide the rate of taxation, it is effective from the next day. If you change the tax rate several times in a day, the next day's tax rate will be the last one you set.\r\n<p>Gathered taxes will be transferred to the castle around dawn the next day.\r\n<p>All the taxes belong to you, my Lord. But, you must spend wisely, because it costs money to manage the castle and lands, let alone the tribute to the King.\r\n<p>The higher you set the taxes the more adena flow into the castle treasury. However, be wise, for if you raise the taxes too much, people will not support you. So please keep that in mind when adjusting the taxes.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Taxation is your royal right; similarly it's your responsibility to pay a tribute to Ken Rauhel, the Lord of all this Kingdom.\r\n<p>You have the power to adjust the Tax of this province; the adjusted tax will be applied to the shops in the village around the castle and even the shops in the Gludin Village, thus affecting all trades there.\r\n<p>Once you decide the rate of taxation, it is effective from the next day. If you change the tax rate several times in a day, the next day's tax rate will be the last one you set.\r\n<p>Gathered taxes will be transferred to the castle around dawn the next day.\r\n<p>All the taxes belong to you, my Lord. But, you must spend wisely, because it costs money to manage the castle and lands, let alone the tribute to the King.\r\n<p>The higher you set the taxes the more adena flow into the castle treasury. However, be wise, for if you raise the taxes too much, people will not support you. So please keep that in mind when adjusting the taxes.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撮旎擎 艙雖 輿團縑 渠и 瞪ж曖 掏葬檜濠, 檜 諾措 瞪羹曖 輿檣檜褐 騰 塭辦⑦ わж縑 渠и 鼻陶擊 嬪и 瞪ж曖 曖鼠檜衛晦紫 м棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮朝 檜 雖寞曖 撮徽擊 褻瞰ж褒 熱 氈朝 掏и擊 陛雖堅 啗褊棲棻. 撮徽擎 孺棻辦萄撩 斬寞曖 辦萄漱 葆擊擎 僭煩 �硃姦� 傘該縑 氈朝 '擎晦餌曖 餵' 葆擊縑梱雖 瞳辨腎橫 斜夠曖 螞乾 鼻剪楚 陛問縑 艙щ擊 嘐艦 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮 撮徽擊 唸薑ж衛賊 斜 撮徽擎 棻擠陳 撮旎擊 務擊 陽睡攪 艙щ擊 嘐纂啪 腌棲棻. ж瑞縑 罹楝廓 撮徽擊 滲唳ж褒 唳辦 斜陳 陛濰 葆雖虞縑 疇薑ж褐 撮徽檜 棻擠陳曖 撮徽煎 瞳辨檜 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>ж瑞縑 務橫霞 撮旎擎 斜 棻擠陳 翕ぎ 鼠滑 撩戲煎 賅罹雖啪 腌棲棻.<br>\r\n<p>務橫霞 賅萇 撮旎擎 瞪ж曖 匙殮棲棻. ж雖虜, 撮旎戲煎 務橫霞 賅萇 絲擊 葆擠渠煎 餌辨ж褒 熱朝 橈蝗棲棻. 措諾 わж縑曖 鼻陶檜釭 撩, 艙雖曖 婦葬縑 в蹂и 濠旎檜 氈晦 陽僥檜雖蹂.<br>\r\n<p>僭煩 撮徽擊 堪橾 熱煙 撩曖 旎堅朝 Ё褶п 雖雖虜, 撮徽檜 傘鼠 堪戲賊 僭陛陛 螢塭 艙雖 輿團菟曖 奩嫦擊 餌啪 腌棲棻. 撮徽擊 褻薑ж褒 陽縑朝 棺 斜薄擊 堅溥п 輿褊衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","othmondhp4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>殿下您不必親自管理這些瑣碎的問題，由我來處理好了。但是發生戰爭時，必須由您親自管理城門。<br>\r\n<p>城堡有外城門和內城門。透過內城門從現在的內城可出去外面，圍著此內城的外城牆壁之間有外城門。\r\n<p>殿下與殿下的血盟成員可下命令給各個城門前面的守門員關閉城門。城門的開放會影響到城堡的安全，因此必須徹底管理血盟成員。\r\n<p>開外城門等於開放於敵人內城，因此非常危險。不過若一直關閉城門，領地住民無法使用城堡裡有的些鐵匠設備。城堡裡的設備是城堡的主要收入，因此若領地住民無法使用此設備，會導致財政上的問題。請參考如上，必須慎重考慮之後開關城門。 <br>\r\n<p>在戰爭情況下，因侵略城堡的敵人而易破壞城門。若放置已被破壞的外城門，戰爭時非常危險，因此若可以修理，就立刻修理吧。\r\n<p>但是戰爭狀態下無法修理城門。且若修理途中發生戰爭，必須中斷修理城門。當然修理城門的時候不要錢。若城門完全被破壞，也許需要很多的金幣。因此修理城門的時候，必須慎重考慮後決定吧。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I can take care of all the bureaucratic affairs of the castle, so you need not pay attention to such things. But I will need instructions regarding the management of the Castle Gates during the War.\r\n<p>There are two gates in this castle, the inner gate and the outer gate. The inner gate is the one between this inner castle, where you are standing right now, and the outside. The outer gate is located in the outer castle wall which surrounds this inner castle.\r\n<p>As a convenience, you or all of your followers can open/close the inner gate through the Gatekeeper beside the gate. But the outer gate, which is directly related to the security of the whole castle, is accessible to your highness only.  Please order me if you want to open or close the outer gate.\r\n<p>If you open the outer gate, it will allow enemies to come into the inner castle, so it's very dangerous. But if you keep the Gate closed too long, people will be unable to use the facilities in the castle such as the forge, and since they are the main sources of castle treasury, it could cause financial problems. So you must calculate carefully when you would like me to close the gate.\r\n<p>Furthermore, both gates can be destroyed by assaults from infiltrators during the war. Once the gates are destroyed, they can be fixed only after the war ends. If the war occurs during the repairs, we must stop the repair work. And, of course, it costs money to repair the Gates. When the gate is destroyed completely, it could cost thousands of adena. You have to decide when we will fix the gates based on these considerations.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I can take care of all the bureaucratic affairs of the castle, so you need not pay attention to such things. But I will need instructions regarding the management of the Castle Gates during the War.\r\n<p>There are two gates in this castle, the inner gate and the outer gate. The inner gate is the one between this inner castle, where you are standing right now, and the outside. The outer gate is located in the outer castle wall which surrounds this inner castle.\r\n<p>As a convenience, you or all of your followers can open/close the inner gate through the Gatekeeper beside the gate. But the outer gate, which is directly related to the security of the whole castle, is accessible to your highness only.  Please order me if you want to open or close the outer gate.\r\n<p>If you open the outer gate, it will allow enemies to come into the inner castle, so it's very dangerous. But if you keep the Gate closed too long, people will be unable to use the facilities in the castle such as the forge, and since they are the main sources of castle treasury, it could cause financial problems. So you must calculate carefully when you would like me to close the gate.\r\n<p>Furthermore, both gates can be destroyed by assaults from infiltrators during the war. Once the gates are destroyed, they can be fixed only after the war ends. If the war occurs during the repairs, we must stop the repair work. And, of course, it costs money to repair the Gates. When the gate is destroyed completely, it could cost thousands of adena. You have to decide when we will fix the gates based on these considerations.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撩曖 ж雛堅 撮撮и 婦葬縑 渠п憮朝 瞪ж眷憮 霜蕾 褐唳噙衛雖 彊嬴紫 薯陛 籀葬蒂 ж堅 氈蝗棲棻. 棻虜 瞪爵衛曖 撩僥曖 婦葬虜躑擎 霜蕾 雖衛蒂 頂溥輿敷撿 м棲棻. <br>\r\n<p>撩縑朝 諼撩僥婁 頂撩僥檜 氈蝗棲棻. 頂撩僥擎 雖旎 啗衛朝 頂撩縑憮 夥梨戲煎 釭陛朝 僥擊 陛葬酈貊, 諼撩僥擎 檜 頂撩擊 舒腦堅 氈朝 諼撩漁縑 氈朝 僥擊 蜓м棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж諦 瞪ж曖 ⑸裊錳菟擎 陝 撩僥 擅縑 氈朝 僥雖晦縑啪 貲滄擊 頂溥憮 翮堅 殘擊 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 撩僥曖 偃寞擎 埠 撩曖 寰爾諦 霜唸腎嘎煎 睡蛤 ⑸裊錳曖 婦葬蒂 繹盪�� ж敷撿 м棲棻.\r\n<p>諼撩僥擊 罹衛賊 瞳菟縑啪 頂撩擊 偃寞ж朝 匙檜 腎嘎煎 嬪ям棲棻虜, 撩僥擊 啗樓 殘堅 啗衛賊 艙雖 輿團菟檜 撩 寰縑 氈朝 渠濰除 蛔曖 衛撲擊 餌辨й 熱陛 橈蝗棲棻. 撩 寰縑 氈朝 衛撲擎 撩曖 輿蹂и 熱殮錳檜晦紫 ж嘎煎 艙團菟檜 檜 衛撲擊 檜辨ж雖 跤ж啪 腎賊 薯薑縑 僥薯陛 儅梢棲棻. 檜薄擊 堅溥ж敷憮 樹薯 撩僥擊 罹殘擊 匙檣陛蒂 儅陝п 輿褊衛螃. <br>\r\n<p>傳 撩僥擎 瞪爵 鼻�窒□韭� 撩 寰戲煎 藹楞ж溥朝 鼠葬菟曖 奢問 陽僥縑 睡憮韓 熱 夤縑 橈蝗棲棻. 諼撩僥擊 睡憮霞 瓣煎 寞纂ж賊 瞪爵衛縑 衙辦 嬪яж嘎煎 褻勒檜 ъ塊и棻賊 窕 堅纂衛晦 夥奧棲棻. \r\n<p>ж雖虜 睡憮霞 撩僥擎 瞪爵 鼻鷓陛 嬴棍 陽夤縑 熱葬й 熱 橈堅, 傳 熱葬醞縑 瞪爵檜 嫦嫦ж賊 熱葬蒂 醞欽й 熱 夤縑 橈蝗棲棻. 僭煩 撩僥擊 熱葬ж朝 等縑朝 釭葷渠煎曖 絲檜 в蹂м棲棻. 撩僥檜 諫だ腎歷擊 唳辦縑朝 熱繭 嬴等釭 檜鼻曖 熱葬綠陛 菟 熱紫 氈蝗棲棻. 斜楝嘎煎 檜楝и 薄擊 澀 儅陝ж衛橫 樹薯 撩僥擊 堅藥撿 й梱蒂 澀 っ欽п 輿衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<p>撩僥檜 濠翕戲煎 熱葬紫煙 貲滄擊 頂葬衛賊 撩僥檜 睡熱橫雖賊 濠翕戲煎 熱葬陛 腌棲棻. 僭煩 熱葬綠 羲衛 濠翕戲煎 釭陛啪 腌棲棻. ж雖虜 奢撩瞪 衛縑朝 檜 貲滄擊 褒чй 熱 橈戲嘎煎 輿曖ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","othmondhp5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖然城裡已經有衛兵在維持城內和地方的治安，但是再怎麼說，他們也只是維持治安的人員而已，不可能直接參與戰爭。再加上目前地方上正在發生大大小小的戰爭，我看還是最好先派遣最優秀的傭兵以防嚴重的事態發生。\r\n<p>只要殿下您告訴我，您所需要的傭兵種類和數量，我就會召集優秀的傭兵，在明天的這個時候，我會把您所需要的人數交給您。<br>\r\n<p>檢視城堡的構造，我們需要有兩種類型的傭兵。一種是專門在城牆上阻止那些來破壞城門傢伙的弓兵，另一種是用來保護殿下或是您血盟的保鏢。\r\n<p>您想要下命令給傭兵時，可以直接告訴我。我會替您把弓兵安排在城堡的城牆上。至於戰士的話，首先就要問殿下您想要安排幾位到您的血盟成員身邊，再做決定。傭兵會在城堡南方的傭兵營內待命。\r\n<p>所以說，您必須先考慮要怎麼安排那些傭兵，再到帳篷前面跟傭兵團團長韓特說一聲就可以了。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在雇傭兵時，你要先想想那也是用人民辛辛苦苦的納稅錢。所以請你仔細考慮吧！！\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","othmondhp5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are already guards posted to maintain security around the castle, but they are to maintain the peace only, and are not of use during the war. Considering that there are many small and large conflicts in the estate, we'd better prepare for the worst by hiring trustworthy mercenaries.\r\n<p>Once you tell me the number and type of mercenaries, I'll ask around to gather trustworthy mercenaries until the same hour of the next day.\r\n<p>There are two types of mercenaries to defend our castle - one is the archer, who can shoot enemies trying to destroy the gate. The others are personal bodyguards to protect you and members of your bloodpledge.\r\n<p>I will arrange archers around the castle wall as soon as they are ready, but you have to decide yourself how many bodyguards will be assigned to you and your members.\r\n<p>Mercenaries will wait for your orders in the barrack at the south corner of outer castle. Once you make up your mind, talk to Hunt, the Captain of the Mercenary army <var src=\"#0\"> - he will assign mercenaries according to your order.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Please remember that the money to hire mercenaries comes from the taxes gathered from residents of your land.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are already guards posted to maintain security around the castle, but they are to maintain the peace only, and are not of use during the war. Considering that there are many small and large conflicts in the estate, we'd better prepare for the worst by hiring trustworthy mercenaries.\r\n<p>Once you tell me the number and type of mercenaries, I'll ask around to gather trustworthy mercenaries until the same hour of the next day.\r\n<p>There are two types of mercenaries to defend our castle - one is the archer, who can shoot enemies trying to destroy the gate. The others are personal bodyguards to protect you and members of your bloodpledge.\r\n<p>I will arrange archers around the castle wall as soon as they are ready, but you have to decide yourself how many bodyguards will be assigned to you and your members.\r\n<p>Mercenaries will wait for your orders in the barrack at the south corner of outer castle. Once you make up your mind, talk to Hunt, the Captain of the Mercenary army <var src=\"#0\"> - he will assign mercenaries according to your order.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Please remember that the money to hire mercenaries comes from the taxes gathered from residents of your land.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撩縑朝 檜嘐 撩婁 艙雖曖 纂寰擊 嶸雖ж晦 嬪и 唳綠煽菟檜 氈蝗棲棻虜, 檜菟擎 橫蛤梱雖釭 纂寰擊 氬渡ж晦 嬪и 檣溘橾 閨 瞪爵縑 霜蕾瞳戲煎 翕錳ж晦縑朝 鼠葬陛 氈蝗棲棻. 陛嗣檜釭 蹂闈縑朝 觼堅 濛擎 諄遺檜 艙雖 頂縑憮 橾橫釭堅 氈戲棲, 褒溘氈朝 辨煽擊 堅辨ж罹 虜橾曖 餌鷓縑 渠綠ж朝 匙檜 謠擊 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮 盪縑啪 в蹂и 辨煽曖 謙盟諦 熱虜 蜓噪п 輿衛賊, 薯陛 褒溘氈朝 辨煽菟擊 熱模僥п憮 蜓噪ж褐 棻擠陳 偽擎 衛除梱雖朝 в蹂и 熱蒂 賅嬴螃紫煙 ж啊蝗棲棻.<br>\r\n<p>盪�� 撩曖 掘褻鼻 в蹂и 辨煽曖 謙盟朝 舒陛雖陛 氈蝗棲棻. и陛雖朝 諼撩漁 嬪縑憮 撩漁擊 だ惚ж溥堅 ж朝 瞳菟擊 唯營ж晦 嬪и 掙煽菟檜堅, 傳 и陛雖朝 霜蕾 艙輿椒檜釭 艙輿椒曖 ⑸裊菟擊 爾��й 瞪癱錳菟殮棲棻.\r\n<p>掙煽曖 唳辦朝 盪縑啪 摹嫦擊 貲ж衛晦虜 ж賊 濠翕瞳戲煎 撩漁縑 寡纂腌棲棻虜, 瞪癱錳曖 唳辦朝 橾欽 堅辨и �� 艙輿椒婁 ⑸裊碟菟縑啪 檜菟擊 賃貲檜釭 寡纂衛鑒 匙檣雖蒂 艙輿椒眷憮 唸薑ж敷撿 м棲棻.\r\n<p>辨煽菟擎 諼撩曖 陴薹 掘戮縑 氈朝 虞餌縑憮 渠晦ж堅 氈蝗棲棻. 辨煽擊 橫飩啪 寡纂й雖蒂 唸薑ж褐 �醴●�, 虞餌 擅縑憮 辨煽欽 <var src=\"#0\">曖 渠濰 йお縑啪 蜓擊 剪衛賊 斜陛 辨煽擊 в蹂и 虜躑 寡纂п 萄萵 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辨煽擊 堅辨ж朝 絲擎 艙饜 輿團菟縑啪憮 務擎 撮旎檜塭朝 薄擊 膩舒縑 舒衛堅, 澀 儅陝п憮 堅辨ж衛晦 夥奧棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","othmondhp6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>城堡總管：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>就如殿下您所知道的，目前城外有很多敵人積極地想要把這個城侵占下來，並且掌控權力。殿下您若想要保住這個城主的寶座，您就不得不使用更加賢明的策略來對付這些外來的威脅。既然您已經成了一國之君，首先要做的，就是調整這個地方的稅率，因為您必須要準備足夠的資金來重建因為戰爭而敗壞的城內治安。一旦資金足夠，就要立刻著手修理內門及外門，以對抗那些對殿下有敵意的人，同時您也必須要雇用一些傭兵，這樣可以強化城內的戰力。\r\n<p>當您成為君主之後，無可避免地，您就一定會受到來自其他血盟的挑戰。像這種與血盟之間的聖戰，完全是由城主您所決定的時間來進行，在您戰勝其它血盟之後守住城堡後，請您再告訴我下一次可以進行圍城的時間。至於時間的決定如下，當您佔領了一個城之後，在日落之前的白晝，您可以任意地更改進行圍城的時間，不過一旦已經超出了限定的時間，您就再也無法更改了。萬一在限定時間之內，您還沒有決定進行圍城的時間，則圍城的計劃就會自動地被定為大約１２天之後。\r\n<p>盟主，當圍城開始之後，那一天，請您就必須要一直堅守城內，直到日落黃昏為止。這個做的原因是，即使城堡在一時之內被來戰的血盟所侵占了，但只要您在傍晚之前重新奪回的話，那麼城依然是盟主您的。在您成功地打完一場勝戰之後，您就必須要再繼續決定下一次進行圍城的時間。\r\n<p>戰爭一旦開始，為了不讓敵人能夠進入外門，您最好事先就做好防備的措施來堅守外門，建議您可以安排一些射手在城牆上看守，這些做法對我軍都十分地有利。但是也不能就總是把城門關起來，因為我們也不能斷定敵人只會在城門外攻擊，這樣的想法其實非常地危險。所以我們為了避免發生這種情況，即使是沒有比外門更為堅固的內門，對我軍來說也是重要的防禦工事。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>除了以上的防禦工事的建造和內外城門的堅守之外，由於任誰也沒有辦法很確切地保證，負責防禦的內門絕對不會被受遭害的狀況之下，請殿下您要無時無刻預備足夠的傭兵來保護這個城。\r\n<p>通常，城之所以會被奪去的其中的因素如下，第一，當然是殿下被交戰血盟成員殺死。\r\n<p>，不過這決不是唯一的因素，如果敵人成員的血盟奪取了國王的寶座，那個時候殿下就是成了戰爭的失敗者。\r\n<p>請恕我冒犯之言，失敗者的下場通常是非常地悲慘的哪！因此，殿下，在做任何決定之前，請您務必要慎重判斷。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","othmondhp6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Like your highness yourself recently did, there are many groups planning to take over this castle right now. So if you want to remain as the lord of this castle, you will have to take care of them.\r\n<p>Once you take over the castle, you have to adjust the tax so that there is enough money to repair the castle, which was damaged during the war. And once you have enough money, you will have to repair the inner and outer gates to strengthen the integrity of the castle. You should hire mercenaries as well so that the enemies can't come near you.\r\n<p>After taking the castle, other bloodpledges will attempt to challenge your authority. For them, you must set the next war time with me. You can change this time freely before half of the day passes after conquering the castle, but once this time passes, you cannot change the time again. If you don't set the time 'til then, the time will be set automatically to about 10 days later.\r\n<p>Once the time arrives, you have to defend the castle until sunset. Even if you lose your castle temporarily, you will have to get it back before the sun falls, and the castle will be yours. After sunset, you must set the next siege time again.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Once the war starts, it is best to block the entrance into the outer castle. The outer gate is very strong and the archers will defend the gate, but since you can't always leave the outer gate closed, you must not assume that the enemies will always come from the outside. To deal with this case, there is an another protection - the inner gate.  It is not so sturdy as the outer gate, however.\r\n<p>Furthermore, it cannot be certain that they won't infiltrate into the inner castle. So please, my lord, always take enough mercenaries with you as bodyguards.\r\n<p>Now the most dreadful way to lose your castle is, well... to meet an unfortunate demise at the hands of enemies, of course. But that's not the only way to lose the castle...if the enemy prince takes over your throne, you will also be defeated.\r\n<p>If I may say so, the fate of the loser is unthinkable, my lord. Please be wise when dealing with war affairs.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Chamberlain Othmond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Like your highness yourself recently did, there are many groups planning to take over this castle right now. So if you want to remain as the lord of this castle, you will have to take care of them.\r\n<p>Once you take over the castle, you have to adjust the tax so that there is enough money to repair the castle, which was damaged during the war. And once you have enough money, you will have to repair the inner and outer gates to strengthen the integrity of the castle. You should hire mercenaries as well so that the enemies can't come near you.\r\n<p>After taking the castle, other bloodpledges will attempt to challenge your authority. For them, you must set the next war time with me. You can change this time freely before half of the day passes after conquering the castle, but once this time passes, you cannot change the time again. If you don't set the time 'til then, the time will be set automatically to about 10 days later.\r\n<p>Once the time arrives, you have to defend the castle until sunset. Even if you lose your castle temporarily, you will have to get it back before the sun falls, and the castle will be yours. After sunset, you must set the next siege time again.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Once the war starts, it is best to block the entrance into the outer castle. The outer gate is very strong and the archers will defend the gate, but since you can't always leave the outer gate closed, you must not assume that the enemies will always come from the outside. To deal with this case, there is an another protection - the inner gate.  It is not so sturdy as the outer gate, however.\r\n<p>Furthermore, it cannot be certain that they won't infiltrate into the inner castle. So please, my lord, always take enough mercenaries with you as bodyguards.\r\n<p>Now the most dreadful way to lose your castle is, well... to meet an unfortunate demise at the hands of enemies, of course. But that's not the only way to lose the castle...if the enemy prince takes over your throne, you will also be defeated.\r\n<p>If I may say so, the fate of the loser is unthinkable, my lord. Please be wise when dealing with war affairs.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","othmondhp6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 螃蝶僥萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>瞪ж眷憮 檜瞪縑 斜楝ж樟蛭檜, ⑷營 撩 夤縑朝 檜 撩擊 離雖ж罹 掏溘擊 槳縑 厥堅濠 ж朝 鼠葬菟檜 熱橈檜 號蝗棲棻. 瞪ж眷憮 檜 撩曖 撩輿煎 啗衛晦 嬪п憮朝 檜楝и 鼠葬菟曖 嬪⑺縑 ⑷貲ж啪 渠籀ж衛雖 彊戲賊 寰腌棲棻.\r\n<p>撩擊 槳縑 厥戲樟戲賊, 辦摹 撮徽擊 褻薑ж敷憮 瞪爵戲煎 鼠傘霞 撩曖 纂寰擊 夥煎濩擊 濠旎擊 葆溼ж紫煙 ж褊衛螃. 斜葬堅, 濠旎檜 葆溼腎朝 渠煎 瞪ж眷 瞳偃褕擊 ヶ擎 濠菟檜 輿滲縑 橡壁剪葬雖 跤ж紫煙 頂撩僥, 諼撩僥擊 熱葬ж朝 иら 辨煽擊 堅辨ж罹 撩 頂曖 瞪溘擊 鬼�倆狤忠� м棲棻.\r\n<p>撩擊 離雖ж褐 �醴●� 棻艇 ⑸裊菟曖 紫瞪擊 嫡戲衛啪 腌棲棻. 檜楝и ⑸裊菟婁曖 奢撩瞪擎 艙輿椒檜 唸薑ж褐 衛除縑 чп雖啪 腌棲棻. 撩擊 離雖ж衛堅 釭賊 辦摹 盪縑啪 棻擠 奢撩瞪檜 樹薯 纂瘀韓 匙檣雖蒂 蜓噪п 輿衛褫模憮. 檜 衛除擎 撩擊 離雖ж褐 �� 奩釭瞰檜 雖釭晦 瞪梱雖朝 濠嶸照啪 夥紱褒 熱 氈蝗棲棻虜, 檜 晦除檜 雖釭賊 渦檜鼻 夥紱褒 熱 橈蝗棲棻. 虜擒 檜陽梱雖 棻擠 奢撩瞪檜 衛濛腎朝 衛除擊 薑ж衛雖 彊戲賊 翮�� 薑紫 �譟� 奢撩瞪 蝶馨還檜 濠翕瞳戲煎 濩�鱁� 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>奢撩瞪檜 衛濛腎賊 艙輿眷憮朝 斜陳 п陛 韓 陽梱雖 撩擊 餌熱ж敷撿 м棲棻. 虜擒 橾衛瞳戲煎 撩擊 貍憾晦樟棻堅 ж渦塭紫 п陛 雖晦 瞪縑 棻衛 撩擊 驍�納牮霽椓� 檜 撩擎 啗樓 瞪ж曖 匙檜 腌棲棻. 檜溢啪 и廓 奢撩瞪擊 纂瑞堅 釭衛賊 棻衛 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 唸薑ж衛啪 腌棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橾欽 瞪爵檜 衛濛腎賊, 瞳檜 諼撩僥 寰戲煎 菟橫螃雖 跤ж紫煙 盪雖ж朝 匙檜 陛濰 謠蝗棲棻. 諼撩僥擎 唯堅ж貊, 傳 撩漁 嬪縑朝 掙熱蒂 寡纂й 熱 氈戲嘎煎 嬴捱縑啪 觼啪 嶸葬м棲棻. ж雖虜 樹薯釭 撩僥擊 殘嬴場擊 熱朝 橈戲嘎煎 瞳檜 樹薯釭 諼撩僥 夥梨縑憮虜 路溥螃葬塭堅 儅陝ж朝 匙擎 嬪ям棲棻. 檜楝и 唳辦蒂 嬪п 諼撩僥 爾棻朝 ががж雖 彊雖虜 橫繚萇 嬴捱縑啪朝 頂撩僥檜塭朝 薯 2曖 寞漁檜 襄營м棲棻.\r\n<p>啪棻陛 頂撩僥葆盪 給だ腎朝 嬪晦 鼻�窕� 瞰渠煎 螃雖 彊戲葬塭堅朝 援掘紫 濰氬й 熱 橈蝗棲棻. 斜楝嘎煎 瞪ж, 樹薯釭 醱碟и 熱曖 辨煽擊 ��嬪煽戲煎 等葬堅 氈戲衛晦 夥奧棲棻. \r\n<p>撩擊 貍憾晦啪 腎朝 陛濰 醞蹂и 褻勒擎 僭煩 瞪ж眷憮 藹殮濠曖 槳縑...瑰滲擊 渡ж啪 腎衛朝 匙殮棲棻虜, 斜匙檜 嶸橾и 褻勒擎 嬴椎棲棻. 虜擒 瞳捱曖 ⑸裊輿陛 撩曖 諾謝蒂 離雖ж啪 腎賊 斜陽紫 瞪ж朝 瞪爵縑憮 ぬж衛朝 匙檜 腌棲棻.\r\n<p>諼塋脹 蜓殮棲棻虜, ぬ濠曖 譆�譬� 綠霤и 匙殮棲棻. 瞪ж, 睡蛤 ⑷貲ж啪 渠籀ж罹 輿衛褫模憮.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"othmondhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","overdepos-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p>我們能儲存的物品數目有一個限制，就是不能超過１００項物品。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n\r\n","overdepos-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p>There is a limit to the number items we can store - no more than 100 items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","overdepos-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p>There is a limit to the number items we can store - no more than 100 items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","overdepos-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p>蜆晦褒 熱 氈朝 僭勒 и啗朝 100偃梱雖殮棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","pandora-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘朵拉:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎光臨∼請問找甚麼物品？在這裡所賣的都是從大陸運來的品質最佳的產品∼</p>\r\n<p>你已用不到的物品、裝備也可以賣給我</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"pandoraEv4\">詢問有關夏洛伯。</a><br>\r\n<a link = \"pandoraEv1\">詢問古丁的消息 </a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","pandora-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the Peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hello? How are you today?</p>\r\n<p>All these goods are fresh from the mainland...please take a look!</p>\r\n<p>Feel free to talk to me when you have stuff to sell~</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"pandoraEv4\">Ask about the Shelobs.</a><br>\r\n<a link = \"pandoraEv1\">Ask about the mainland</a>\r\n</body>","pandora-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the Peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hello? How are you today?</p>\r\n<p>All these goods are fresh from the mainland...please take a look!</p>\r\n<p>Feel free to talk to me when you have stuff to sell~</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"pandoraEv4\">Ask about the Shelobs.</a><br>\r\n<a link = \"pandoraEv1\">Ask about the mainland</a>\r\n</body>","pandora-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 っ紫塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃撮蹂~ 鼠蝦 僭勒擊 瓊戲衛轄? 鏃晝ヶ擎 賅舒 獄饜縑憮 熱殮и ヶ韓 謠擎 僭勒菟殮棲棻~</p>\r\n<p>斜薹縑憮 в蹂 橈朝 謠擎 僭勒擎 餌晦紫 п蹂.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link = \"pandoraEv4\">撚煎粽縑 渠п 僖朝棻.</a><br>\r\n<a link = \"pandoraEv1\">旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖曖 模衝縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a><br>\r\n</body>","pandora1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘朵拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>謝謝你的購買∼</p>\r\n<p>有別的東西要買或賣嗎？</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n</body>","pandora1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the Peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Thank you for buying~</p>\r\n<p>Would you like to buy or sell?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n</body>","pandora1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the Peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Thank you for buying~</p>\r\n<p>Would you like to buy or sell?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n</body>","pandora1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 っ紫塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>馬餌м棲棻~</p>\r\n<p>�公� 傳 в蹂ж褐勒 橈戲撮蹂?</p>\r\n<p>в蹂 橈朝 僭勒 氈戲衛賊 餌晦紫 п蹂~</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","pandora2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘朵拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗨，它比外表看起來更昂貴唷！</p>\r\n<p>你需要“更多”的金幣。</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey, it's more expensive than it looks!</p>\r\n<p>You need *more* adena.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey, it's more expensive than it looks!</p>\r\n<p>You need *more* adena.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 っ紫塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜剪 瑭蹂, 斜勒 爾晦爾棻 綠諸 僭勒檜塭堅蹂</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘朵拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>它很棒，我買下了！</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Very nice - I'll buy it!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Very nice - I'll buy it!</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 っ紫塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>��...惘雛擎 僭勒檜啻蹂, 餌啊橫蹂. 陛問擎 嬴梱 唸薑и 勘煎 惘雛啊轄?</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘朵拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在這附近購物很簡單。</p>\r\n<p>人民不是在尋找它。</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's very easy to shop around here.</p>\r\n<p>People are not looking for it.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It's very easy to shop around here.</p>\r\n<p>People are not looking for it.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 っ紫塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜勒 蹂闈 僭勒檜 號嬴憮 寰釭陛蹂. 釭醞縑 棻衛 螃撮蹂.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#316\" link=\"pandora\"></img>\r\n</body>","pandora5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘朵拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你以為我會跟像你這樣的人交易嗎？門都沒有！</p>\r\n</body>","pandora5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Out, out, out!  Go kill some more weaklings, you big bully! </p>\r\n</body>","pandora5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Out, out, out!  Go kill some more weaklings, you big bully! </p>\r\n</body>","pandora5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 っ紫塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐 偽檜 釭雌 餌塋и纔 つ 僭勒擎 橈橫蹂!</p>\r\n<p>...凳, 釭醞縑 偃褕ж剪萇 棻衛 и廓 儅陝п 爾轄^^</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraev1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘朵拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>很好，讓我想想...去年在重大的<a link = pandoraEv3>攻擊那些叛徒</a>之後，<a link = pandoraEv2>古丁領地</a>附近就變得很安靜。似乎每個人害怕判王。大多數其他的國家若不是和亞丁聯盟而且保持友好關係中，就是宣布他們自己是中立國。</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraEv1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Well, lets see... After the massive <a link = pandoraEv3>attack on the rebels</a> last year, near the <a link = pandoraEv2>Gludio Estate</a>, everything has been quiet - it seems everyone fears the Pretender King. Most other countries are either allied to Aden and remain on friendly terms, or they declare themselves to be neutral.</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraEv1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Well, lets see... After the massive <a link = pandoraEv3>attack on the rebels</a> last year, near the <a link = pandoraEv2>Gludio Estate</a>, everything has been quiet - it seems everyone fears the Pretender King. Most other countries are either allied to Aden and remain on friendly terms, or they declare themselves to be neutral.</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 っ紫塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>旋赭蹂~ 濛喇縑 <a link = pandoraEv2>旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖</a> 斬籀縑憮 渠渠瞳檣 <a link = pandoraEv3>奩塢捱 霞憶</a>檜 氈歷湍 棻擠睡攪朝 褻辨ж啻蹂. 羲衛 奩諾檜 鼠撥曹 鼠憮遴陛瑭蹂. ⑷營 鼻�窕虞帤� 澀п撿 醞董檜堅, 渠睡碟曖 釭塭菟擎 嬴筆縑 渠п - 瞳橫紫 ル賊瞳戲煎朝 - 渠欽�� 辦��瞳檜縑蹂.</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraev2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘朵拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>什麼？你從不曾離開這個島嗎？或者你是來自北方？離開這個島的船只停靠一個單一港口，就是在古丁領地裡面的那一個。但是當然，這你已經知道了，不是嗎？ \r\n</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraEv2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddling:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Have you never left this island?  Boats leave this island to only a single port  - the one within Gludio Estate. Of course, you probably already knew that, didn't you? \r\n</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraEv2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddling:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Have you never left this island?  Boats leave this island to only a single port  - the one within Gludio Estate. Of course, you probably already knew that, didn't you? \r\n</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraEv2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 っ紫塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>擬? 渡褐 罹晦 饜夢檜? 嬴棲賊 磁睡 雖寞 餌塋檣陛? 醞睡 檜陴縑憮 檜 撰縑 寡陛 釭陛朝 о掘塭堅朝 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖 и捱等 閨檜濫嬴蹂?</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraev3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘朵拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>戰鬥就發生在離大陸港口不遠的地方，所以我有時候會看見可怕的戰爭。因戰鬥而死亡的屍體被留在戰場上任其腐爛。沒有人敢移走那些遺體或埋葬他們，惟恐激怒了判王...你難道不認為這是一個粗暴和充滿苦難的世界嗎？</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraEv3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The fighting occurs not far from the mainland port, so I sometimes get to see some gruesome battles. The bodies of the dead are left on the battlefeild to rot; no one removes the bodies or buries them, for fear of angering the Pretender King...of course, battles even happen here sometimes with ruffians attempting to prey on the weak.</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraEv3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The fighting occurs not far from the mainland port, so I sometimes get to see some gruesome battles. The bodies of the dead are left on the battlefeild to rot; no one removes the bodies or buries them, for fear of angering the Pretender King...of course, battles even happen here sometimes with ruffians attempting to prey on the weak.</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraEv3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 っ紫塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>曖諼煎 獄饜薹 о掘縑憮 陛梱諦憮 釭紫 罹晦 螢 陽葆棻 陛莠 爾朝等 薑蜓 莠鎰п蹂. 瞪癱陛 氈歷湍 ゎ錳縑朝 嬴霜紫 衛羹陛 闌綠ж棻堅蹂. 嬴葆 奩諾 褐唳擊 勒萄葬朝啪 鼠憮錶憮 籀葬蒂 寰ж堅 氈朝 匙 偽擎等...霤 陝夢и 撮鼻檜轄?</p>\r\n</body>","pandoraEv4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘朵拉:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你也看過嗎？看過那<font fg=ffffff>巨大的</font>蜘蛛？牠常在島的南邊及西邊出沒，牠的動作迅速，且具有尖利的爪子。對此島不熟悉的人容易遭到牠的毒手。若要往<font fg=ffffff>西南方森林</font>冒險，一定要特別要小心。隨時會受到牠的攻擊。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","PandoraEv4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Did you see them? Those big <font fg=ffffff>spider-like monsters</font>? They frequent the southern and western forests...and are very fast and can kill novice adventurers instantly with their strong talons. So if you venture into the <font fg=ffffff>forest</font>, always be alert...Shelobs may attack you anytime.  Keep a teleportation scroll ready!  Very cheap today!\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","PandoraEv4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pandora the peddler:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Did you see them? Those big <font fg=ffffff>spider-like monsters</font>? They frequent the southern and western forests...and are very fast and can kill novice adventurers instantly with their strong talons. So if you venture into the <font fg=ffffff>forest</font>, always be alert...Shelobs may attack you anytime.  Keep a teleportation scroll ready!  Very cheap today!\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","pandoraEv4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>ч鼻 っ紫塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐紫 爾樟釭蹂? 斜 贖 <font fg=ffffff>剪嘐惚僭</font>擊? 撰曖 陴薹婁 憮薹 膛縑 濠輿 轎路ж朝 惚僭檣等, ч翕檜 營緒艇等棻 鬼溘и 嫦體擊 乾堅 氈晦 陽僥縑 嘐熨и 罹ч濠菟擎 避擠擊 渡ж晦 橾墨奧棲棻. <font fg=ffffff>膛樓</font>擊 罹чй 隆 о鼻 褻褕ж撮蹂. 撚煎粽陛 渡褐擊 喻葬堅 氈擊雖紫 賅腦棲梱 蜓檜縑蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","pane1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嘿，滾到一邊去！否則我會讓你躺平！<a link=\"pane2\">躺平</a>哦！\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane3\">問米索莉金屬板的事</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane4\">問奧里哈魯根金屬板的事</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane5\">問鬃毛的事</a>\r\n</body>","pane1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Eih, stap asahde! Elsewise I'll make y' <a link=\"pane2\">flat</a> also!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane3\">Ask about mithril plate</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane4\">Ask about oriharukon plate</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane5\">Ask about mane</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","pane1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Eih, stap asahde! Elsewise I'll make y' <a link=\"pane2\">flat</a> also!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane3\">Ask about mithril plate</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane4\">Ask about oriharukon plate</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane5\">Ask about mane</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","pane1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>っ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜瑭, 綠麵! 寰綠酈賊 傘紫 <a link=\"pane2\">陶濛ж啪</a> 虜菟橫幗萼棻!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane3\">嘐蝶萵 っ旎 薯濛擊 睡饕и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane4\">螃葬ж瑞夔 っ旎 薯濛擊 睡饕и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane5\">陞晦瓚曖 瓣餵縑 渠п 樽晦и棻</a>\r\n</body>","pane2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哈哈哈！我的嗜好是聽好聽的音樂和使東西變得一片平坦。無論有多難，我都有把握能使任何東西平得紙一樣！\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane3\">問米索莉金屬板的事</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane4\">問奧里哈魯根金屬板的事</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane5\">問鬃毛的事</a>\r\n</body>","pane2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hahaha! My hebby es lestening t' geid music and mahking things flat - flat like paper howeiver hard th'are!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane3\">Ask about mithril plate</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane4\">Ask about oriharukon plate</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane5\">Ask about mane</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","pane2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hahaha! My hebby es lestening t' geid music and mahking things flat - flat like paper howeiver hard th'are!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane3\">Ask about mithril plate</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane4\">Ask about oriharukon plate</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane5\">Ask about mane</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","pane2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>っ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>жжж! �黻傺� 擠學擊 菔朝 匙婁 凳萇 騁檜啖 幗葬朝啪 頂 鏃嘐雖. 嬴鼠葬 欽欽и 匙檜塭堅 п紫 頂 槳縑 勘葬賊 瞪睡 謙檜濰 偽檜 虜菟橫輿葆!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane3\">嘐蝶萵 っ旎 薯濛擊 睡饕и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane4\">螃葬ж瑞夔 っ旎 薯濛擊 睡饕и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"pane5\">陞晦瓚曖 瓣餵縑 渠п 樽晦и棻</a>\r\n</body>","pane3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哈哈∼我剛剛才從那些東西上面踩過，鍛鍊<font fg=ffffff>身體</font>？我的皮膚很堅硬，所以你那粗糙的劍根本就不能刺穿我，哈哈哈！\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request mithril plate\">索取米索莉金屬板</a></p>\r\n</body>","pane3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Haah~ I heird that yeir makin' <font fg=ffffff>armor</font> from'em. Is yeir puir skin so weak?!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request mithril plate\">Request Mithril plate</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","pane3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Haah~ I heird that yeir makin' <font fg=ffffff>armor</font> from'em. Is yeir puir skin so weak?!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request mithril plate\">Request Mithril plate</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","pane3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>っ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>ж嬴~ 釭撿 頂 擅縑 場罹霞 勘 頂 霜撩渠煎 葆掘 嫖擊 閨檜雖虜, 傘�� 蹂薑菟擎 斜勘 檜橫憮 <font fg=ffffff>骨褡</font>擊 虜菟橫 殮朝棻雖? 斜楛 骨骨и 勘 殮晦爾欽 Я睡蒂 欽溼ж朝 匙檜 橫陽? 釭曖 Я睡朝 檣除菟曖 褻濩и 匐評嬪朝 菟橫陛雖紫 彊朝棻堅 жжж!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request mithril plate\">嘐蝶萵 っ旎 薯濛擊 睡饕и棻</a></p>\r\n</body>","pane4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哈哈∼我剛剛才從那些東西上面踩過，要不要我幫你鍛鍊<font fg=ffffff>身體</font>？我的皮膚很堅硬，所以你那粗糙的劍根本就不能刺穿我，哈哈哈！\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request oriharukon plate\">索取奧里哈魯根金屬板</a></p>\r\n</body>","pane4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>っ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Haah~ I jeist trample the theings bef're me, but I heird y're making <font fg=ffffff>armor</font> from'em. How abaht training y'r sken rath'r than making seich things? My skin is tougher th'n yeir crude swords - hahaha!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request oriharukon plate\">Request Oriharukon plate</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","pane4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>っ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Haah~ I jeist trample the theings bef're me, but I heird y're making <font fg=ffffff>armor</font> from'em. How abaht training y'r sken rath'r than making seich things? My skin is tougher th'n yeir crude swords - hahaha!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request oriharukon plate\">Request Oriharukon plate</a></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","pane4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>っ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>ж嬴~ 釭撿 頂 擅縑 場罹霞 勘 頂 霜撩渠煎 葆掘 嫖擊 閨檜雖虜, 傘�� 蹂薑菟擎 斜勘 檜橫憮 <font fg=ffffff>骨褡</font>擊 虜菟橫 殮朝棻雖? 斜楛 骨骨и 勘 殮晦爾欽 Я睡蒂 欽溼ж朝 匙檜 橫陽? 釭曖 Я睡朝 檣除菟曖 褻濩и 匐評嬪朝 菟橫陛雖紫 彊朝棻堅 жжж!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request oriharukon plate\">螃葬ж瑞夔 っ旎 薯濛擊 睡饕и棻</a></p>\r\n</body>","pane5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>哼？你要我美好的鬃毛？！唔，可憐的妖精，你甚至沒有和我相似的美好又有光澤的鬃毛∼你將會用這製做線然後作成衣服和箭吧？如果你真的想要...拿去吧...但是你要小心地用你的手來拿。假如你藉由使用武器傷害我...即使你們是妖精我也不會寬容。</p>\r\n\r\n</body>","pane5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Heih? Yeir wahnt me mane! Hmpf, puir elves who dein't even heive a shiny mane like me~ Yein'a mehke threads out'f this, n clothes and errows?  take it...but be ceireful n'yese your bare hands. If you hurt wi' weapons.. I won't stand fer eit!</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","pane5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Heih? Yeir wahnt me mane! Hmpf, puir elves who dein't even heive a shiny mane like me~ Yein'a mehke threads out'f this, n clothes and errows?  take it...but be ceireful n'yese your bare hands. If you hurt wi' weapons.. I won't stand fer eit!</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","pane5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>っ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>凳? 釭曖 詣霞 陞晦瓚擊 陛雖堅 談棻堅! �� 釭籀歲 彌晦釭堅 詣霞 陞晦瓚紫 橈朝 碳誰и 蹂薑菟嬴~ 傘�騊橉� 檜勘煎 <font fg=ffffff>褒擊 虜菟橫 褡, 濩�韋� �香�</font>擊 虜萇棻雖? 凳 薑 錳ж賊 и廓 陛螳陛 瑭 ж雖虜 <font fg=ffffff>裔槳</font>戲煎 髦髦п撿п! 虜擒 鼠晦偽擎 勘 賦憮 嬴Щ啪 ж賊 嬴鼠葬 蹂薑檜塭紫 辨憮ж雖 彊擊纔棲</p>\r\n</body>","panev1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗨，多動人的笛聲啊，我用我的角來和你交換笛子好嗎？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request pan's horn\">用笛子交換角</a>\r\n</body>","panEv1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Eey, theet flute seinds maghty fine. Weel yeir trahd it feir me horn?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request pan's horn\">Exchange the flute with horn</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","panEv1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Eey, theet flute seinds maghty fine. Weel yeir trahd it feir me horn?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request pan's horn\">Exchange the flute with horn</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","panEv1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>っ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜瑭, 斜 Я葬 擠儀 霤 謠捱. 頂陛 頂 閩擊 ж釭 還纔棲 夥紱雖 彊啊橫?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"request pan's horn\">閩婁 Я葬蒂 掖�納挬�</a>\r\n</body>","panm1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>潘：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嘿，站到旁邊！否則我將使你躺平！\r\n</body>","panm1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Stap aseede, eir I'll criush yeir leeke in grahp!\r\n</body>\r\n","panm1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Stap aseede, eir I'll criush yeir leeke in grahp!\r\n</body>\r\n","panm1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>っ:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜瑭, 綠麵! 寰綠酈賊 傘紫 陶濛ж啪 虜菟橫幗萼棻!\r\n</body>","parameter-c.tbl":"70\r\n每個角色有\r\n６種屬性。\r\n而每個屬性\r\n又有下列\r\n各項特點。\r\n\r\n力量（ＳＴＲ）\r\n\r\n力量表示肉體的力量。\r\n這個屬性是最重要的\r\n原因\r\n不只在戰爭方面\r\n更包括了其他所有。\r\n\r\n智力（ＩＮＴ）\r\n\r\n智力顯示一個人的學習\r\n能力和好奇心的程度。\r\n這個屬性\r\n主要影響\r\n的事物是施展魔法\r\n和技術。\r\n\r\n精神（ＷＩＳ）\r\n\r\n精神顯示一個力量\r\n可以了解人們，自然\r\n和上帝。誰有高度精神\r\n就有充分的\r\n潛力去示範\r\n超自然的力量像是\r\n魔法當然也有\r\n抵抗那些\r\n的力量。\r\n\r\n靈敏（ＤＥＸ）\r\n\r\n靈敏度顯示一個人\r\n能移動多快\r\n和是否擅長手的技術。\r\n高靈敏度有益武器的使用，\r\n尤其是弓，以及任何在\r\n使用上需要用到手的靈巧\r\n的技術。\r\n\r\n體質（ＣＯＮ）\r\n\r\n體質顯示一個人的健康\r\n能力。誰有高的生存\r\n意志被傷害較低\r\n而且很快地恢復。\r\n意志影響\r\n攜帶物品的能力。\r\n\r\n魅力（ＣＨＡ）\r\n\r\n魅力顯示出\r\n吸引另一個人的能力。\r\n雖然天生的外表\r\n與它有關，但領導能力\r\n和被其他人尊敬\r\n對它來說是更\r\n重要的。在各種\r\n貿易中誰有\r\n高的魅力是\r\n有益的。血盟\r\n領導者(王子，\r\n公主) 必須有高的\r\n魅力。","parameter-e.tbl":"54\r\nEach character has\r\n6 different attributes:\r\n\r\nStrength(STR)\r\n\r\nSTR is physical power,\r\naffecting both combat\r\ndamage and your ability\r\nto carry items.\r\n\r\nIntelligence(INT)\r\n\r\nINT determines your \r\nSpell Power, which\r\naffects how well your \r\nspells will take affect.\r\n\r\nWisdom(WIS)\r\n\r\nWIS will affect both\r\nyour innate magic\r\nresistance and also \r\nhelps to determine how\r\nmany MP (Mana or Magic\r\nPoints) you gain each\r\nlevel (used to power your \r\nspells).\r\n\r\nDexterity(DEX)\r\n\r\nDEX determines your\r\nattack accuracy, \r\nespecially with missile\r\nweapons such as bows.\r\n\r\nConstitution(CON)\r\n\r\nCON controls how many\r\nHP you gain at each level\r\nand also determines how\r\nquickly you will heal.\r\n\r\nCharisma(CHA)\r\n\r\nCHA determines how many\r\nmonsters you can tame and\r\ncan affect store prices.\r\nIf you are a Prince \r\nor Princess, CHA is \r\nespecially important \r\nas it will determine \r\nhow many players can join \r\nyour Bloodpledge.\r\n\r\n","parameter-j.tbl":"54\r\nEach character has\r\n6 different attributes:\r\n\r\nStrength(STR)\r\n\r\nSTR is physical power,\r\naffecting both combat\r\ndamage and your ability\r\nto carry items.\r\n\r\nIntelligence(INT)\r\n\r\nINT determines your \r\nSpell Power, which\r\naffects how well your \r\nspells will take affect.\r\n\r\nWisdom(WIS)\r\n\r\nWIS will affect both\r\nyour innate magic\r\nresistance and also \r\nhelps to determine how\r\nmany MP (Mana or Magic\r\nPoints) you gain each\r\nlevel (used to power your \r\nspells).\r\n\r\nDexterity(DEX)\r\n\r\nDEX determines your\r\nattack accuracy, \r\nespecially with missile\r\nweapons such as bows.\r\n\r\nConstitution(CON)\r\n\r\nCON controls how many\r\nHP you gain at each level\r\nand also determines how\r\nquickly you will heal.\r\n\r\nCharisma(CHA)\r\n\r\nCHA determines how many\r\nmonsters you can tame and\r\ncan affect store prices.\r\nIf you are a Prince \r\nor Princess, CHA is \r\nespecially important \r\nas it will determine \r\nhow many players can join \r\nyour Bloodpledge.\r\n\r\n","parameter-k.tbl":"91\r\n議葛攪縑朝 憮煎 棻艇 6陛\r\n雖 棟溘纂陛 襄營м棲棻.\r\n陝 棟溘纂曖 か癒擎  棻擠\r\n婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n1. ��(STR)\r\n\r\nSTR擎 Strength曖  擒濠煎\r\n賦, 議葛攪曖 僭葬瞳檣 ��\r\n擊 釭顫鹿棲棻. 檜朝 啪歜\r\n曖 瞪癱縑憮 陛濰 觼啪 艙\r\nщ擊 嘐纂朝 熱纂殮棲棻.\r\n傳, 瞪癱縑憮虜躑 澀 釭顫\r\n釭雖朝 彊雖虜 瞪癱  檜諼\r\n曖 棻艇 撮撮и  睡碟縑憮\r\n紫 艙щ擊 嘐纂朝  醞蹂и\r\n熱纂塭 й 熱 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n2. 雖棟(INT)\r\n\r\nINT朝 Intelligence曖  擒\r\n濠煎賦, 馨葛攪陛  橡葆釭\r\n奢睡蒂 號檜  ц朝陛,  傳\r\n橡葆釭 з僥瞳檣 鬚掘褕檜\r\n氈朝陛蒂 釭顫鹿棲棻.\r\nINT朝 輿煎 葆徹 晦棟, 蝶\r\n鑒 晦棟 蛔 �鏽耋�戲煎 寡\r\n錶釭陛撿 ж朝 棟溘縑  艙\r\nщ擊 嘐蘑棲棻.\r\n\r\n3. 雖��(WIS)\r\n\r\nWIS朝 Wisdom曖 擒濠煎賦,\r\n顫堅陪  雖��煎遺擊  釭顫\r\n頂朝  熱纂煎  餌塋婁  濠\r\n翱, 褐縑  渠и  檜п溘擊\r\n釭顫鹿棲棻.\r\nWIS陛 堪擎 議葛攪朝 葆徹\r\n婁 偽擎 蟾濠翱瞳檣  ��擊\r\n餌辨ж晦 嬪и 濡營棟溘檜\r\nЁ睡ж貊, 傳  斜縑  渠и\r\n盪о溘紫 堪蝗棲棻.\r\n\r\n4. 團繪撩(DEX)\r\n\r\nDEX朝 Dexterity曖 擒濠煎\r\n賦 斜 議葛攪陛 跺擊 橡葆\r\n釭 燬諄啪 遺霜擊 熱 氈朝\r\n陛, 槳營輿諦 換賭嘐陛 橡\r\n葆釭  謠擎雖蒂  釭顫頂朝\r\n熱纂殮棲棻.\r\nDEX陛 堪擎 議葛攪朝 陝謙\r\n鼠晦, か�� �� 蛔曖  癱餌\r\n鼠晦蒂 棻瑙陽  嶸葬ж貊,\r\n槳營輿蒂 в蹂煎 ж朝  蝶\r\n鑒擊 餌辨й 陽紫  嶸葬м\r\n棲棻.\r\n\r\n5. 羹溘(CON)\r\n\r\nCON擎 Constitution曖  擒\r\n濠煎賦, 斜 議葛攪陛 橡葆\r\n釭 勒鬼и陛,  傳  橡葆釭\r\n勒濰и 跺擊 ж堅  氈朝陛\r\n蒂 釭顫鹿棲棻.\r\nCON檜 堪擎 議葛攪朝 號擎\r\nЯп蒂  殮堅紫  髦嬴陴擊\r\n熱 氈戲貊, 鼻籀曖 �蛹僱�\r\n緒腦棻. 傳,  CON檜  堪擎\r\n議葛攪朝  棻艇  餌塋爾棻\r\n號擎 僭勒擊 菟 熱 氈蝗棲\r\n棻.\r\n\r\n6. 衙溘(CHA)\r\n\r\nCHA朝 斜 議葛攪陛 陛  橡\r\n葆釭 衙溘氈堅 棻艇  餌塋\r\n擊 莖朝 棟溘檜  氈朝陛蒂\r\n釭顫鹿棲棻. 顫堅陪  諼賅\r\n紫 婦啗腎雖虜 橡掉檜  跤\r\n儅啣渦塭紫 鱔樂溘檜 氈堅\r\n棻艇 餌塋縑啪 褐煆諦  襄\r\n唳擊 嫡朝 餌塋擎 檜 熱纂\r\n陛 堪蝗棲棻.\r\nCHA陛 堪擎 議葛攪朝 螞乾\r\n謙盟曖  剪楚縑憮  檜菜擊\r\n獐 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 傳, 諾濠\r\n釭 奢輿諦 偽檜 棻艇 餌塋\r\n曖 嬪縑 憮憮 ⑸裊擊 檜莊\r\n橫 釭陛撿 ж朝  餌塋縑啪\r\n朝 窕 в蹂и 熱纂殮棲棻.\r\n","party-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>隊伍情報</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n隊伍領導者: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n隊伍成員:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","Party-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Party Information</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nLeader: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nMembers:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","Party-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Party Information</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nLeader: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nMembers:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","party-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>だじ 薑爾</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nだじ 雖紫濠: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nだじ 掘撩錳:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","patguard-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>警衛:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>我正在巡查這一帶。不要妨礙我！\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","patguard-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Patrol guard:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>I'm patrolling this area - don't try to get in the way!\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","patguard-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Patrol guard:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>I'm patrolling this area - don't try to get in the way!\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","patguard-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>唳綠煽:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>陪 檜 睡斬擊 牖雞 醞檜螃. 斜楝棲 望 虞雖 蜓堅 橫憮 綠酈衛螃!\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","paul1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>保羅:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎光臨。我是從象牙塔派過來的法師叫保羅。\r\n<p>為了針對魔法於公益上之運用，在此為您提供服務。\r\n<p>你需要甚麼樣的服務？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">傳送到對岸</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","paul1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Wizard Paul:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, traveller. I am Paul of the Ivory Tower at Oren.\r\n<p>The Ivory Tower offers many services to the public.\r\n<p>What kind of service do you want?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">Teleport to the other side of the river</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","paul1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Wizard Paul:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, traveller. I am Paul of the Ivory Tower at Oren.\r\n<p>The Ivory Tower offers many services to the public.\r\n<p>What kind of service do you want?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">Teleport to the other side of the river</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","paul1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>葆徹餌 だ選:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃衛螃. 釭朝 螃溶曖 '鼻嬴鱉'縑憮 檜夠戲煎 だ唯釭螞 葆徹餌 だ選殮棲棻.\r\n<p>螃溶曖 鼻嬴鱉擎 葆徹曖 奢櫛縑曖 �倏蹀� 嬪п 罹楝陛雖 憮綠蝶蒂 ж堅 氈雖蹂. \r\n<p>渡褐擎 橫雯 憮綠蝶蒂 錳ж褊棲梱?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">鬼 勒傘ら戲煎 ��溯んおи棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","philip1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>菲力浦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>買賣高品質的皮革。\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","philip1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Philip the Fur Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Buy and sell quality furs.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","philip1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Philip the Fur Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Buy and sell quality furs.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","philip1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避鼻檣 в董 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>韓 謠擎 陛避 餌堅 で棲棻.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","philip2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>菲力浦:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>不好意思。我不能跟邪惡的人交易。\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","philip2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Philip the Fur Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sorry. I do not deal with your kind.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","philip2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Philip the Fur Merchant :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sorry. I do not deal with your kind.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","philip2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避鼻檣 в董 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>賸歎м棲棻. 學檣婁朝 剪楚ж雖 彊蝗棲棻.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","pierre1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辟芮 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n只要有人住的地方，就會有騙子。這裡也不例外。您也小心吧。要注意觀察週邊的人。不管做什麼事都要慎重考慮！！\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","pierre1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Я縑腦 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n餌塋檜 餌朝 夠檜賊 樹薯釭 棻艇 餌塋擊 樓檜溥朝 餌晦羞菟檜 儅啖釭朝 匙 偽嬴蹂. 檜夠紫 蕨諼朝 嬴棲雖蹂. 渡褐紫 褻褕ж撮蹂. 橾欽 渡褐 輿嬪 餌塋睡攪 曖褕п 爾朝 啪 謠擊 勘蹂. 斜葬堅 樹薯釭 褐醞ж撮蹂.\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","pig1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>豬：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>ㄍㄡˊ.......</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","pig1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pig:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oink!  Oink!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","pig1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Pig:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Oink!  Oink!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","pig1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>腋雖:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>羚羚...</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","Pin1-c.HTML":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蘋：</p></font>\r\n<br><p>你跟我說的話，我會馬上轉告我師父，立刻製作給你。你需要甚麼？</p>  \r\n\r\n<p><a action=\"sell\">賣金屬塊</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin3\">製作銀釘皮帽</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin4\">製作銀釘皮涼鞋</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin5\">製作銀釘皮背心</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"farlin6\">製作銀釘皮盾</a>  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","Pin2-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蘋：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我出5枚金幣1塊金屬塊的價錢來收購金屬塊。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request adena5\">賣金屬塊</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Pin3-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蘋：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 若要做銀釘皮帽，需要皮帽子和10個金屬塊，2張高級皮。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather cap\">製作銀頂皮帽</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Pin4-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蘋：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>若要製作銀釘皮涼鞋，需要皮涼鞋和12個金屬塊，3張高級皮。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather sandal\">製作銀釘皮涼鞋</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","Pin5-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蘋：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> 若要製作銀釘皮背心，需要皮背心和10個金屬塊，2張高級皮。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather vest\"> 製作銀釘皮背心</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","Pin6-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蘋：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>若要製作銀釘皮盾，需要皮盾牌和20個金屬塊，5張高級皮。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><a action=\"request studded leather shield\">製作銀釘皮盾</a></p>\r\n   \r\n</body>","PinC1-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left> 蘋：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我的師父叫我不要像你這種人說話。</p>\r\n\r\n   \r\n</body>\r\n","pledge-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟情報</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n血盟名稱: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n在線上的血盟成員:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","Pledge-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Information</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nPledge Name: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nMembers on-line:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","pledge-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Information</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nPledge Name: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nMembers on-line:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","pledge-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑸裊 薑爾</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n⑸裊 檜葷: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n蕾樓и ⑸裊錳:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","pledgeM-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟訊息</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n血盟名稱: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n加入的血盟成員:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n整體血盟成員:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","pledgeM-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Information</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nPledge Name: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nMembers on-line:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nAll Members:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","pledgeM-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Information</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nPledge Name: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nMembers on-line:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nAll Members:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","pledgeM-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑸裊 薑爾</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n⑸裊 檜葷: <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n蕾樓и ⑸裊錳:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n瞪羹 ⑸裊錳:<br>\r\n<var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","prince-c.tbl":"31\r\n王子／公主\r\n\r\n為了要奪回\r\n他的／她的王國，他／她\r\n隱藏他的／她的身分\r\n而且聚集他的部下。\r\n雖然他們的劍術是\r\n次於騎士，和\r\n會魔法的魔法師\r\n而且他們沒有\r\n如妖精，小偷和\r\n鍛冶師的技術，\r\n但他們能帶著王室的王冠\r\n與偉大非凡的領導力，\r\n是其他的階級是沒有的。\r\n\r\n王子／公主\r\n在戰爭裡面的能力。\r\n他們能穿著\r\n大多數的裝備\r\n除了一些較特別的之外\r\n而且他們也不會元素魔法。\r\n他們最重要的特點\r\n是他們能創造\r\n『血盟』。只有他們\r\n能這樣做。他們是\r\n天堂裡的主要角色。\r\n王子／公主必須\r\n集合他的人且\r\n擊敗『國王』。","prince-e.tbl":"49\r\nPrince/Princess\r\n\r\nThe world of Lineage\r\nis host to a number of\r\nwandering scions of\r\nroyal blood known as\r\nPrinces and Princesses.\r\nThese noble souls seek\r\nto regain the throne\r\ncurrently held by the \r\nPretender-King, and \r\ntowards this end lead\r\nBloodpledges of their\r\ncompanions to take over\r\nthe various castles and\r\nlands in the world of\r\nLineage.\r\n\r\nThough Knights are \r\nstronger, Wizards know\r\nmore magic, and Elves\r\nare more versatile, \r\nPrinces and Princesses\r\nhave an ability which\r\nno one else does - \r\nthey can use their \r\ngreat charisma to \r\nlead Bloodpledges and\r\nhold the thrones of\r\ncastles.\r\n\r\nThe most important \r\nability for a Prince or\r\nPrincess is Charisma,\r\nto be able to maximize\r\nthe amount of their\r\nfollowers.  Beyond this,\r\nmany choose to \r\nemphasize their CON, so\r\nthat they can withstand \r\ndamage during wars and \r\nsieges.\r\n\r\nThose of royal blood can \r\nalso use most weapons \r\nand armor.  They begin\r\ntheir quest to regain \r\nthe throne on Talking \r\nIsland.\r\n","prince-j.tbl":"49\r\nPrince/Princess\r\n\r\nThe world of Lineage\r\nis host to a number of\r\nwandering scions of\r\nroyal blood known as\r\nPrinces and Princesses.\r\nThese noble souls seek\r\nto regain the throne\r\ncurrently held by the \r\nPretender-King, and \r\ntowards this end lead\r\nBloodpledges of their\r\ncompanions to take over\r\nthe various castles and\r\nlands in the world of\r\nLineage.\r\n\r\nThough Knights are \r\nstronger, Wizards know\r\nmore magic, and Elves\r\nare more versatile, \r\nPrinces and Princesses\r\nhave an ability which\r\nno one else does - \r\nthey can use their \r\ngreat charisma to \r\nlead Bloodpledges and\r\nhold the thrones of\r\ncastles.\r\n\r\nThe most important \r\nability for a Prince or\r\nPrincess is Charisma,\r\nto be able to maximize\r\nthe amount of their\r\nfollowers.  Beyond this,\r\nmany choose to \r\nemphasize their CON, so\r\nthat they can withstand \r\ndamage during wars and \r\nsieges.\r\n\r\nThose of royal blood can \r\nalso use most weapons \r\nand armor.  They begin\r\ntheir quest to regain \r\nthe throne on Talking \r\nIsland.\r\n","prince-k.tbl":"33\r\n諾濠/奢輿\r\n\r\n濠褐曖 諾措擊 腎瓊晦  嬪\r\nп 薑羹蒂 獗晦堅  翕猿蒂\r\n賅戲堅 氈朝 檜菟擎  綠煙\r\n晦餌爾棻 匐獎 棟溘檜  雲\r\n橫雖堅 葆徹餌爾棻 葆徹縑\r\n櫛熨ж雖 跤ж貊 蹂薑檜釭\r\n紫舜, 晦獎濠陛 陛雖朝 か\r\n熱и 棟溘擎 橈雖虜, 斜菟\r\n醞 斜 援掘紫 陛雖雖 跤и\r\n饕錯и  艙紫溘婁  餌塋擊\r\n檜莖朝 衙溘戲煎 濠翱蝶毀\r\n啪 雖紫濠曖 濠葬縑  螃腦\r\n朝, 斜楝и 餌塋殮棲棻.\r\n\r\n諾濠/奢輿朝 瞪癱縑  氈橫\r\n憮 ゎ敕瞳檣 棟溘擊  嫦��\r\nм棲棻. 賃賃 瞪僥瞳檣 鼠\r\n晦蒂 薯諼и 渠睡碟曖  鼠\r\n晦諦 寞橫掘蒂 濰綠й  熱\r\n氈戲貊 蟾爾瞳檣 葆徹  棟\r\n溘紫 陛雖堅 氈蝗棲棻.\r\n檜菟曖 陛濰 贖  か癒檜塭\r\n賊 鼠歙爾棻紫 '⑸裊擊 虜\r\n菟 熱 氈棻'塭朝 匙橾  匙\r\n殮棲棻.  ⑸裊擊  賅擊 熱\r\n氈朝 匙擎 檜菟  閨檜貊, \r\n渡翱��  檜菟縑啪朝  啪歜\r\n瞪羹曖 輿檣奢戲煎賦 濠褐\r\n擊 紫選 ⑸裊擊 賅嬴 奩諾\r\n擊 僭葬纂朝 羲й擊  蜆啪\r\n腌棲棻.\r\n","princess-e.tbl":"10\r\nPrincess\r\n\r\nPrincess can be a team leader,\r\ngood at weapons and armors,\r\nno good at magic.\r\n\r\nShe should find 5 characters\r\nwho will be her guardian\r\nstars and regain his\r\nkingdom with them.\r\n","princess-k.tbl":"10\r\n奢輿\r\n\r\n奢輿朝 ぜ葬渦陛 腆 熱 氈戲貊\r\n鼠晦諦 骨褡擊 殮擊 熱 氈堅\r\n葆徹擎 澀 餌辨ж雖 跤и棻.\r\n\r\n奢輿曖 歜鼠朝 濠褐曖 熱�ˉ瑰�\r\n腆 5貲曖 檣僭擊 賅嬴 偽檜 ��\r\n擊 賅嬴 奩諾擊 鼠鎬腦堅 諾措\r\n擊 腎瓊朝 匙檜棻.\r\n","quiz-c.tbl":"55\r\n進入測驗和答案\r\n的提示\r\n\r\n（１） 一旦你輸入你的\r\n 測驗和答案，你將\r\n 不能改變他們。所以\r\n 當輸入的時候，\r\n 要小心。\r\n\r\n（２） 正確地證明\r\n 你是一個帳號\r\n 的合法擁有人，\r\n 你應該\r\n 提供正確的答案\r\n 在這個地方。\r\n 所以要注意\r\n 大／小寫字母\r\n 和字之間的\r\n 空格。\r\n\r\n（３） 當你登錄問題的時候，\r\n 選擇他們\r\n 因為只有你\r\n 知道答案。\r\n 並且，你的測驗必須是\r\n 至少１０個字母長度\r\n 和４個字母長度\r\n 的答案。\r\n 如果你使用太短的\r\n 答案，它可能\r\n 洩漏給其他人。\r\n 所以請你得\r\n 非常小心。\r\n\r\n（４） 一旦你忘記你的密碼，\r\n 你能改變你的密碼\r\n 經由在 lineage\r\n 網站上正確地回答\r\n 兩個測驗(http://www.\r\n lineage.co.kr). \r\n 現在這個\r\n 只可用在韓國的\r\n 伺服器。\r\n\r\n（４） 測驗和答案的一個\r\n 例子：\r\n\r\n測驗１：你最喜歡的\r\n        電影名稱\r\n        是什麼？\r\n答案：南方公園\r\n測驗２：我的初戀情人的名字\r\n        是什麼？\r\n答案：芭菲\r\n","quiz-e.tbl":"55\r\nTips for entering \r\nquestions and answers\r\n\r\n(1) Once you input your\r\n questions and answers, \r\n you can't change them - \r\n so be careful when \r\n entering those fields.\r\n\r\n(2) To correctly prove\r\n that you are the\r\n rightful owner of an\r\n account, you should\r\n provide the exact answer\r\n you used for each field.\r\n So be careful about\r\n capital/lowercase \r\n letters and extra blanks \r\n between words.\r\n\r\n(3) When you register the\r\n questions, choose them\r\n so that only you will\r\n know the answer.\r\n Also, your question must \r\n be at least 10 characters\r\n long and your answers 4\r\n characters long.\r\n If you use too short\r\n an answer, it could be\r\n too easy for others to\r\n solve, so please exercise \r\n extreme caution.\r\n\r\n(4) If you forget your\r\n password, you can change\r\n your password by\r\n answering both quizzes\r\n correctly on the lineage\r\n web-site(http://www.\r\n lineage.co.kr). Right\r\n now this feature is\r\n available only to Korean\r\n servers.\r\n\r\n(5) An example of questions\r\n and answers:\r\n\r\nQuiz 1: What is the title\r\n        of movie I\r\n        enjoyed the most?\r\nAnswer: Battlefield Earth\r\nQuiz 2: What is the name\r\n        of my first love?\r\nAnswer: Stevie\r\n","quiz-j.tbl":"55\r\nTips for entering \r\nquestions and answers\r\n\r\n(1) Once you input your\r\n questions and answers, \r\n you can't change them - \r\n so be careful when \r\n entering those fields.\r\n\r\n(2) To correctly prove\r\n that you are the\r\n rightful owner of an\r\n account, you should\r\n provide the exact answer\r\n you used for each field.\r\n So be careful about\r\n capital/lowercase \r\n letters and extra blanks \r\n between words.\r\n\r\n(3) When you register the\r\n questions, choose them\r\n so that only you will\r\n know the answer.\r\n Also, your question must \r\n be at least 10 characters\r\n long and your answers 4\r\n characters long.\r\n If you use too short\r\n an answer, it could be\r\n too easy for others to\r\n solve, so please exercise \r\n extreme caution.\r\n\r\n(4) If you forget your\r\n password, you can change\r\n your password by\r\n answering both quizzes\r\n correctly on the lineage\r\n web-site(http://www.\r\n lineage.co.kr). Right\r\n now this feature is\r\n available only to Korean\r\n servers.\r\n\r\n(5) An example of questions\r\n and answers:\r\n\r\nQuiz 1: What is the title\r\n        of movie I\r\n        enjoyed the most?\r\nAnswer: Battlefield Earth\r\nQuiz 2: What is the name\r\n        of my first love?\r\nAnswer: Stevie\r\n","quiz-k.tbl":"47\r\n韓僥婁 港 蛔煙衛 嶸曖餌о\r\n\r\n(1) и 廓  蛔煙脹  韓僥婁\r\n 港擎 熱薑檜 碳陛棟м棲棻\r\n . 斜楝嘎煎 褐醞ж啪 韓僥\r\n 婁 港擊 摹薑п 輿衛晦 夥\r\n 奧棲棻.\r\n\r\n(2) 港寰 殮溘曖 唳辦縑朝 \r\n 嗥橫噙晦梱雖紫  �挫恉牊�\r\n 煎 嗥橫噙晦縑 輿曖ж衛晦\r\n 夥奧棲棻.\r\n\r\n(3) 韓僥擊 蛔煙ж褒  陽縑\r\n 朝 奩萄衛 濠褐虜檜  港й\r\n 熱 氈朝 韓僥戲煎  蛔煙п\r\n 輿褊衛螃. 傳, 韓僥曖  譆\r\n 模 望檜朝 5濠, 港曖 譆模\r\n 望檜朝  2濠殮棲棻.  港檜\r\n 穠擊 唳辦 ぬ蝶錶萄陛  嫦\r\n 陝腆 辦溥陛 氈戲棲 腆 熱\r\n 氈戲賊 望啪 п 輿衛晦 夥\r\n 奧棲棻.\r\n\r\n(4) 獄檣曖 嬴檜蛤, 輿團蛔\r\n 煙廓�� 斜葬堅 嘐葬  蛔煙\r\n и 韓僥縑 渠и 港 賅舒陛\r\n 橾纂ж艘擊  唳辦  餌辨濠\r\n 獄檣歜擊 檣薑ж罹 綠塵廓\r\n �ㄧ� 滲唳й 熱 氈朝 濠問\r\n 擊 睡罹м棲棻. 褒薯煎 懍\r\n �ㄧ� 濱橫幗葬樟擊 唳辦, \r\n 葬棲雖 �事靺攽�(http://\r\n www.lineage.co.kr)縑憮 '\r\n 懍�ㄧ� 濱橫幗溜擊 唳辦' \r\n 詭景蒂 檜辨ж衛晦 夥奧棲\r\n 棻.\r\n\r\n(5) 蛔煙й 熱 氈朝 韓僥婁\r\n 港曖 蕨:\r\n\r\nQuiz 1: 頂陛 陛濰 馬貲桶啪\r\n\t獄 艙�韭�?\r\nAnswer: 綰溯檜萄 楝傘\r\nQuiz 2: 頂 羅餌嫌曖 檜葷擎\r\n\t?\r\nAnswer: �垮瞍�\r\n","RaiseAttr-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>恭喜！</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n請選擇您所要提昇的屬性。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-str\">力量</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-dex\">敏捷</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-con\">體質</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-int\">智力</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-wis\">精神</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-cha\">魅力</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n您所選擇的屬性將提昇１點。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","RaiseAttr-e.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Congratulations!!</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nPlease choose the attribute you want to raise.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-str\">Strength</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-dex\">Dexterity</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-con\">Constitution</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-int\">Intelligence</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-wis\">Wisdom</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-cha\">Charisma</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe selected attribute will be raised by one.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","RaiseAttr-j.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>Congratulations!!</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nPlease choose the attribute you want to raise.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-str\">Strength</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-dex\">Dexterity</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-con\">Constitution</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-int\">Intelligence</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-wis\">Wisdom</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-cha\">Charisma</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe selected attribute will be raised by one.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","RaiseAttr-k.html":"<body>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff>蹴жм棲棻!</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n螢葬衛堅 談擎 棟溘纂蒂 摹鷗п 輿撮蹂.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-str\">Strength</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-dex\">Dexterity</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-con\">Constitution</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-int\">Intelligence</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-wis\">Wisdom</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"raise-cha\">Charisma</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n摹鷗ж褐 棟溘纂陛 1 隸陛й 匙殮棲棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","randal1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蘭道:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>為了預防萬一，你最好隨身攜帶一些藥水...。請你挑挑看。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","randal1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Randal :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You should always carry potions with you in case of emergencies... Do you see anything you like?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","randal1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Randal :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You should always carry potions with you in case of emergencies... Do you see anything you like?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","randal1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>擒ヶ鼻檣 塢殖 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>虜橾曖 唳辦蒂 渠綠п憮 擒擎 о鼻 遽綠蒂 п舒朝 啪 謠雖... 濠 и 廓 埤塭爾啪釭.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","randal2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>蘭道:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>難道，你連老人家都要傷害嗎？</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","randal2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Randal :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You're not trying to hurt an old man like me are you?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","randal2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Randal :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You're not trying to hurt an old man like me are you?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","randal2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>擒ヶ鼻檣 塢殖 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>撲葆 濠啻, 釭偽擎 喻檣葆盪紫 п纂溥朝 勒 嬴棲啊雖?</p>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","randith1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>藍迪西： </p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>請問有什麼事嗎？\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"fix\">修理壞掉的武器\r\n\r\n</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"randith2\">詢問為何武器會損傷</a>\r\n\r\n</body>","randith1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Randith the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What do ya want?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"fix\">Check and repair damaged weapons</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"randith2\">Ask how weapons get damaged</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","randith1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Randith the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What do ya want?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"fix\">Check and repair damaged weapons</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"randith2\">Ask how weapons get damaged</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","randith1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜 塢蛤蝶:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>鼠蝦 橾檜衛轄?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"fix\">睡憮霞 鼠晦蒂 熱摹и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"randith2\">鼠晦陛 樹薯 睡憮雖釭 僭橫獄棻</a>\r\n\r\n</body>","randith2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>藍迪西：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>有一些怪獸，即使是牙崩齒碎也仍會用來破壞城門，而且牠們也會破壞武器或盾牌。對付那些像石頭一樣堅固的傢伙，用刀或槍是沒什麼用的，雖然能不能使用武器是一個問題，但說真的用砍或刺的武器來對付他們是真的沒辦法造成什麼傷害，不過能用斧頭或流星錘那些鈍器類武器的話就沒問題了。\r\n\r\n</body>","randith2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Randith the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Your sword'll lose its teeth if ya hit stone or a castle door with it. Also, haven't ya heard of monsters who can erode your armor or weapons? It's jest braindamaged to hit a stone golem with a sword or spear - it does more harm to yer weapon than it does the critter. Hit it with something blunt or heavy like a morning star or axe.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","randith2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Randith the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Your sword'll lose its teeth if ya hit stone or a castle door with it. Also, haven't ya heard of monsters who can erode your armor or weapons? It's jest braindamaged to hit a stone golem with a sword or spear - it does more harm to yer weapon than it does the critter. Hit it with something blunt or heavy like a morning star or axe.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","randith2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜 塢蛤蝶:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蠔煎 撩僥偽檜 欽欽и 匙擊 頂葬藥憮 檜說檜 緒韓熱紫 氈堅, 傳 跨蝶攪醞縑朝 鼠晦釭 寞橫掘蒂 睡衝衛酈朝 喪戮菟紫 氈轄. 給埤源偽擎 喪戮擊 蠔檜釭 璽戲煎 鼻渠ж朝勒 鼠賅и 橾殮棲棻. 鼠晦陛 跤噙啪 腎朝匙紫 僥薯雖虜, 餌褒 斜楛 漆剪釭 鎬腦朝 鼠晦煎朝 斜喪戮縑啪 檜溢棻й Яп蒂 殮�� 熱陛 橈剪萇蹂. 紫郭釭 賅棚 蝶顫偽擎 菩晦盟塭賊 滌 僥薯 橈雖虜 蜓殮棲棻.\r\n</body>","randith3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>藍迪西：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>到目前為止看起來好像沒什麼問題，你的武器保養得不錯啊。</p>\r\n</body>","randith3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Randith the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>They all look fine for now - it seems that you have taken good care of your weapons.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","randith3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Randith the blacksmith:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>They all look fine for now - it seems that you have taken good care of your weapons.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","randith3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>渠濰濰檜 塢蛤蝶:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴霜梱霞 滌 僥薯 橈橫爾檜朝等蹂. 鼠晦 槳韓檜 紮 澀腎橫氈啻蹂?</p>\r\n</body>","raymond1-e.bak":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>King of losers:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, travellers! You are a loser. So you want a quick money? ha ha ha! poor soul. I pity you!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"raymond4\">Do you want to see you loser's companions?</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","raymond1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Raymond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hear, Hear! 'Tis the race of the century!  The Slime races, the favorite sport in the Gludio Estates, will soon begin!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">Check slime's records</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","raymond1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Raymond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hear, Hear! 'Tis the race of the century!  The Slime races, the favorite sport in the Gludio Estates, will soon begin!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">Check slime's records</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","raymond1-k.bak":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>溯檜跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 槳縑 間擊 錨啪 ж朝 裊溺и 蝓睡曖 撮啗! 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖曖 貲僭 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶陛 埠 衛濛腌棲棻! \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a link=\"raymond4\">陝 蝸塭歜曖 瞪瞳擊 獄棻</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","raymond1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>溯檜跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 槳縑 間擊 錨啪 ж朝 裊溺и 蝓睡曖 撮啗! 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖曖 貲僭 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶陛 埠 衛濛腌棲棻! \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"status\">陝 蝸塭歜曖 瞪瞳擊 獄棻</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","raymond2-e.bak":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>溯檜跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 螃棺曖 唳晦朝 賅舒 部陬蝗棲棻! 棻擠 唳晦朝 陳檜 嫩嬴撿 衛濛ж棲 螃棺擎 檜虜 賅舒 給嬴陛 輿撮蹂~\r\n</body>","raymond2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Raymond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There are no more races today! More races are scheduled for tomorrow, so please come back then, and have a nice day!\r\n</body>\r\n","raymond2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Raymond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There are no more races today! More races are scheduled for tomorrow, so please come back then, and have a nice day!\r\n</body>\r\n","raymond2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>溯檜跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 螃棺曖 唳晦朝 賅舒 部陬蝗棲棻! 棻擠 唳晦朝 陳檜 嫩嬴撿 衛濛ж棲 螃棺擎 檜虜 賅舒 給嬴陛 輿撮蹂~\r\n</body>","raymond3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Raymond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There is a race going on right now!  Those who want to buy tickets must wait a little while!\r\n</body>\r\n","raymond3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Raymond:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hear, hear! There is a race going on right now!  Those who want to buy tickets must wait a little while!\r\n</body>\r\n","raymond3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>溯檜跨萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠~ 濠, 雖旎擎 