ink he'd pay some attention to giving 'em less reason to escape.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Though they are, after all, humans and thus not much a threat as <a link=\"rohan2\">Orcs</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","rohan1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Roahn:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are armed - what business do you have in this town?\r\n<p>...\r\n<p>Hahaha, I'm sorry. I thought that you were sent by Kent to keep us in line.\r\n<p>My name is Rohan. I'm chief of security here.\r\n<p>We are despised by not only the orcs, but by the high-ups of Kent. The lord guy is very sensitive to the reduction of his income by escaping farmers; you'd think he'd pay some attention to giving 'em less reason to escape.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Though they are, after all, humans and thus not much a threat as <a link=\"rohan2\">Orcs</a>.\r\n</body>\r\n","rohan1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>煎и:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>鼠濰擊 ж堅 氈捱. 檜 葆擊縑朝 鼠蝦 獐橾檜雖?\r\n<p>...\r\n<p>嬴жжж, 嘐寰ж啪 腎歷模. 陪 傳 騰お撩曖 艙輿陛 爾魚 饜弊渠檣陛 п憮.\r\n<p>檣餌陛 棵歷捱. 頂 檜葷擎 煎и. 檜 葆擊曖 濠唳欽濰擊 蜃堅 氈啻.\r\n<p>檜 葆擊擎 膛曖 螃觼菟縑啪閨虜 嬴棲塭 騰お撩曖 嬪薑濠菟縑啪紫 嘐遺擊 餌堅 氈雖. 艙輿塭朝 濛濠陛 艙團菟曖 儅�倏●� 瞪⑵ 褐唳紫 寰噙賊憮 堯團菟檜 檜驍п憮 濠晦 熱�挫� 還橫萄朝剪縛 團馬ж剪萇...\r\n<br>\r\n<p>僭煩 斜喪戮菟紫 偽擎 餌塋檜棲 <a link=\"rohan2\">螃觼</a>菟虜躑 嬪⑺檜 腎霞 彊雖虜 蜓橾撮.\r\n</body>","rohan2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>羅瀚：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你可能已經知道這個，我們正在與俗稱『阿吐巴』的妖魔部落戰爭中。雖然可能看起來像是我們侵入他們的土地...但是自那時以後就沒有土地可以耕作，我們不能夠因饑餓死亡。當然，我們沒有意思要在這裡永遠停留。但是也沒有任何和他們談判的可能。 \r\n<p>萊拉也正在煩惱這件事...如果我可以幫忙她的話...\r\n</body>","rohan2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Rohan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You may already know this, but we are at war with with something called the 'Atuba Tribal Community'. It may look like like we invaded their turf...but since we had no fields to cultivate, we couldn't just starve. Of course, we have no intention of staying here forever, but there is no chance of negotiation with them.\r\n<p>Lyra is also worrying about that...if only I could help her...\r\n</body>\r\n","rohan2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Rohan:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You may already know this, but we are at war with with something called the 'Atuba Tribal Community'. It may look like like we invaded their turf...but since we had no fields to cultivate, we couldn't just starve. Of course, we have no intention of staying here forever, but there is no chance of negotiation with them.\r\n<p>Lyra is also worrying about that...if only I could help her...\r\n</body>\r\n","rohan2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>煎и:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜嘐 憲堅 氈朝雖朝 賅腦啊雖虜, 辦葬 葆擊擎 ⑷營 '嬴癱夥 睡褶 奢翕羹'塭朝 螃觼 睡褶婁 瞪爵擊 ж堅 氈啻. 賅曄億煎 爾賊 碟貲�� 辦葬陛 斜菟曖 剪輿雖蒂 藹彰и 匙檜雖虜...渡濰 唳濛й 階檜 橈朝等 辦葬塭堅 導嬴憮 避擊牖 橈雖 彊雖 彊釭. 傳, 辦葬塭堅 樹薯梱雖 檜楛 夠縑憮 氈擊 儅陝擎 橈橫. ж雖虜 螃觼 睡褶婁朝 瞪⑵ 渠�倣� 罹雖陛 橈橫. \r\n<p>塭檜塭紫 斜匙 陽僥縑 堅團ж堅 氈雖...頂陛 褻旎檜塭紫 斜喪曖 ��檜 腎歷戲賊 謠啊朝等...\r\n</body>","ruka1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>魯卡：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>好餓...\r\n</body>","ruka1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ruka:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Hungry...\r\n</body>\r\n","ruka1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ruka:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Hungry...\r\n</body>\r\n","ruka1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>瑞蘋:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...寡堅だ...\r\n</body>","ruu1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>露都達瑪拉：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>由於部落領袖-沙罕的努力，部落間的共和體制是可行的...，這使我們妖魔間團結起來。現在他正在日漸衰弱中，其他的種族開始騷動。如果他死亡，我們將會像以前一樣被分散吧。\r\n<p>大的部落像是阿吐巴或那魯加將會沒事，但是那些較小的部落像是羅孚或甘地已經習慣於現在的體制，也許會無法適應，也或著他們可能會被人類所吸引，就像葛拉...\r\n</body>","ruu1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ruu Duda-Mara:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The current tribal community is possible due solely to the efforts of the Chief of the Seghem Tribe...now that he is getting weaker, the other tribes are in turmoil. Maybe if he dies, they will scatter like before.\r\n<p>Large tribes like the Atuba or Neru will be all right, but the smaller tribes like Rova or Gandi who are accustomed to the communal system would end up crushed or absorbed...\r\n</body>\r\n","ruu1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Ruu Duda-Mara:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The current tribal community is possible due solely to the efforts of the Chief of the Seghem Tribe...now that he is getting weaker, the other tribes are in turmoil. Maybe if he dies, they will scatter like before.\r\n<p>Large tribes like the Atuba or Neru will be all right, but the smaller tribes like Rova or Gandi who are accustomed to the communal system would end up crushed or absorbed...\r\n</body>\r\n","ruu1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>瑞 舒棻-葆塭:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎曖 睡褶 奢翕羹朝 橫蛤梱雖釭 撮啞 識 褶濰曖 棟溘縑 曖и 匙...斜曖 跺檜 潸擒п雖堅 氈朝 雖旎 螃觼 睡褶菟擎 翕蹂ж堅 氈棻. 嬴葆紫 識褶濰檜 避戲賊 棻衛 蕪陳婁 偽檜 睡褶滌煎 �蟛轀� 髦啪 腎啊雖.\r\n<p>嬴癱夥棻 啻瑞陛 偽擎 贖 睡褶擎 惘雛雖虜, 贖 餵欽 儅�倏� 櫛熨п霞 煎夥釭 除蛤諦 偽擎 模敘賅 睡褶檜 骨濠晦 �母� 雲橫螳 釭陛撿 и棻賊 樵羶陪 堅儅擊 п撿 й 匙檜棻. 嬴棲賊 贖 睡褶縑 �篲鷁Ж讔�...\r\n</body>","sally1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莎麗:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n你也想要擁有<a link=\"sally2\">血盟小屋</a>嗎？如果你想要的話，只要一有空屋就得趕快參加<a link=\"sally3\">拍賣</a>...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sally1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sally :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nDo you also need a <a link=\"sally2\">house</a>? If you want a house you must join the <a link=\"sally3\">auction</a>...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sally1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sally :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nDo you also need a <a link=\"sally2\">house</a>? If you want a house you must join the <a link=\"sally3\">auction</a> quick...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sally1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僵葬 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n渡褐紫 �公� <a link=\"sally2\">餵</a>檜 в蹂и陛? 餵擊 橢戲溥賊 綴餵檜 儅啣擊 陽 營說葬 <a link=\"sally3\">唳衙</a>縑 霤罹п撿 и棻啻...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sally2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莎麗:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n擁有血盟小屋的人，把它當成秘密基地。活動範圍也較大。雖然保有血盟小屋需要付出費用，不過有很多好處...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sally2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sally :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nA pledge who owns a house can start a lot of activities at Agit. It may cost a lot to buy and maintain a house, but there are many avantages of owning the house...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sally2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sally :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nA pledge who owns a house can start a lot of activities at Agit. It may cost a lot to buy and maintain a house, but there are many avantages of owning the house...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sally2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僵葬 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n餵擊 陛霞 ⑸裊擎 斜夠擊 嬴雖お煎 鳴嬴 渦遵 �偎萩� �做螃� й 熱 氈雖. 餵擊 餌堅 嶸雖ж朝等朝 絲檜 號檜 菟橫陛曹 ж雖虜, 斜楚紫 罹楝陛雖 謠擎 薄檜 號棻啻...\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sally3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>莎麗:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n拍賣的話，只有王族才能參加。想知道詳細的規定，請找在<font fg=ffffff>拍賣公佈欄</font>旁邊的那位小姐。\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sally3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sally :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nOnly the pledge leader can join the auction. For more information go to the <font fg=ffffff>auction board</font> and ask the lady standing next to it.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sally3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sally :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nOnly the pledge leader can join the auction. For more information go to the <font fg=ffffff>auction board</font> and ask the lady standing next to it.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sally3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>僵葬 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n唳衙縑朝 捱輿虜檜 霤罹й 熱 氈棻啻. 濠撮и 匙擎 盪晦 <font fg=ffffff>唳衙 啪衛っ</font>縑 陛憮 蕙縑氈朝 嬴陛噢縑啪 僭橫爾衛啪釭.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>義工:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n在我們周圍有許多生活貧苦的人和自食其力的青少年。你們所捐獻的將會對這些人有所幫助。<br>\r\n捐獻的次數達到 <var src=\"#0\">次的時候，為這些人提供的金額將變更多。<br>\r\n謝謝你們的合作和參與。<br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"donate\"> 捐出</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Salvation Army:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nThere are many people starving in the world. If you can spare items you don't need right now, they can be used to help those not-so-fortunate people.<br>\r\nIf the total number of items you donate exceeds <var src=\"#0\">, we can truly help those people.<br>\r\nI hope you have the virtuous soul needed to help them.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"donate\"> donate items</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Salvation Army:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nThere are many people starving in the world. If you can spare items you don't need right now, they can be used to help those not-so-fortunate people.<br>\r\nIf the total number of items you donate exceeds <var src=\"#0\">, we can truly help those people.<br>\r\nI hope you have the virtuous soul needed to help them.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"donate\"> donate items</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>濠錳瑰餌濠:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n翱蜓翱衛蒂 蜃檜ж罹 輿嬪縑朝 橫溥遺擊 啕朝 號擎 檜醒菟檜 氈蝗棲棻. 罹楝碟眷憮 漆ヴ橫 輿褐 褻斜葆и 薑撩檜 檜菟縑啪 贖 紫遺檜 腆 匙殮棲棻.<br>\r\n晦睡�蜈鰤� <var src=\"#0\">廓擊 給だй陽 碳辦檜醒擊 嬪п 噙罹韓 旎擋檜 陛濰 號嬴餵棲棻.<br>\r\n號擎 霤罹諦 撩錳 睡饕萄董棲棻.<br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"donate\"> 晦睡и棻</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>義工:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n謝謝您。祝你幸福。\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n謝謝。\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>至目前伺服器累積捐獻次數為 <var src=\"#0\">次。</font>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Salvation Army:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThanks for your kindness. May you and your family have a warm winter.<br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffff>The total number of items people have donated so far is <var src=\"#0\">.</font>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Salvation Army:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThanks for your kindness. May you and your family have a warm winter.<br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffff>The total number of items people have donated so far is <var src=\"#0\">.</font>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>濠錳瑰餌濠:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n爾頂輿褐 評嗆и 葆擠 馬餌ж啪 嫡啊蝗棲棻. 闌匏堅 ч犒и 啖選 爾頂衛望 晦錳м棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n馬餌м棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑷營梱雖 憮幗 識晦睡�蝦鶼� <var src=\"#0\">廓殮棲棻.</font>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>義工:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n謝謝你，你已達到目標捐獻次數。\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n謝謝。\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Salvation Army:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nThanks for your kindness, sir.\r\nBut we have already collected enough items to help other people.\r\nPerhaps next year...\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Salvation Army:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nThanks for your kindness, sir.\r\nBut we have already collected enough items to help other people.\r\nPerhaps next year...\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","Salvation3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>濠錳瑰餌濠:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n葆擠擎 堅蛾蝗棲棻虜 檜嘐 跡ルи 晦睡�蝦鷏� 殖撩ж艘蝗棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n馬餌м棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","sanita1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>聖妮塔：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我曾經和其他的人到過東部的村莊為領地找尋新的領主人選。當我們都找遍附近所有區域以後，我們就試著更深入到森林的內部...\r\n<p>然後突然地一些武裝的妖精出現阻擋了我們的路，他們驅逐我們並且說：「這裡是人類所不能進入的」。 \r\n<p>說實話，當我還是一個小孩的時候，我就時常聽說迷幻森林是多麼地、多麼地美麗，但是我從來沒想到我真的能夠到那�堙C\r\n<p>唔，即使我不能夠真的進入那個地方...那些樹和妖精的神秘空氣仍然是...非常地棒...非常寧靜的。\r\n</body>","sanita1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sanita:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I have been to the east of the village searching for new places we could plant fields. Since we had been to every near area, we tried to go deeper into the forest... Then suddenly some armed elves blocked our way and expelled us saying 'This is not for humans to enter'.\r\n<p>To tell the truth, I heard about the Elven Forest pretty often when I was a kid, but I never thought that I could get there, really. Well, even though I couldn't really enter there... the trees and the mysterious air of the elves were... well... very serene.\r\n</body>\r\n","sanita1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sanita:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I have been to the east of the village searching for new places we could plant fields. Since we had been to every near area, we tried to go deeper into the forest... Then suddenly some armed elves blocked our way and expelled us saying 'This is not for humans to enter'.\r\n<p>To tell the truth, I heard about the Elven Forest pretty often when I was a kid, but I never thought that I could get there, really. Well, even though I couldn't really enter there... the trees and the mysterious air of the elves were... well... very serene.\r\n</body>\r\n","sanita1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>餌棲顫:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>譆斬 �倣� �贍蜂鷏� 憲嬴爾溥堅 餌塋菟 賃檜嫌 葆擊曖 翕薹縑 陛 疑橫蹂. 陛梱遴等朝 弊賦 棻 и廓噶 給嬴獄等塭 斜陽朝 覬 桶熨�鰼轀� 菟橫鬲歷朝等...骨濠晦 鼠濰и 蹂薑菟檜 望擊 虞堅 '檜夠擎 檣除菟檜 菟橫螢 熱 氈朝 夠檜 嬴棲棻'塭堅 ж賊憮 辦葬蒂 夷嬴幗葬雖 彊啊橫蹂?\r\n<p>ж晦餌 磁薹 膛縑憮 翕薹戲煎 陛賊 蹂薑曖 膛檜 氈棻朝 檜撿晦朝 橫溜擊 陽睡攪 蕪陳 檜撿晦 綠蝌ж啪 棺 菟橫 螃曹 ц雖虜, 褒薯煎 斜夠縑 陛啪 腆還擎 路嫉橫蹂. 夥煎 夷啖釭曹 ц雖虜 斜 膛曖 釭鼠釭, 斜夠縑憮 餌朝 蹂薑菟曖 褐綠и 碟嬪晦朝...凳塒梱, 覬 か滌и啪 氈渦塭堅蹂.\r\n<p>斜 �醴△� �倣� �贍蜂鷏� 憲嬴爾楝 蹂薑曖 膛 斬籀煎 除 餌塋菟檜 給嬴螃雖 彊朝 唳辦陛 陛莠 儅啖蹂. 膛縑憮 褻陪擊 渡и勒雖.. 鼠繫 副薑檜 腋蹂.\r\n<p>賅я濠椒, 薯嫦 膛戲煎 陛敷憮 餌塭霞 餌塋菟檜 橫飩啪 脹 勒雖 憲嬴瑭輿撮蹂. 僭煩 蹂薑 膛曖 熱��濠菟擎 鼠繫 鼠撥雖虜, 蹂薑菟檜 噙朝 む橫葬 渦蝶お塭朝 匙戲煎 熱��濠菟擊 濡營選 熱 氈棻堅 ж渦捱蹂.\r\n</body>","sauram-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>蘇瑞耳:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n我是幫人家保管物品的。你們人類可能不明白，我們是具有久遠的歷史和直得信賴的服務。請放心讓我們保管。\r\n<br>\r\n一項物品只要３０金幣，當然是領回你的東西時支付。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>個人倉庫:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 取出物品</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟倉庫:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\">存放物品</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\">取出物品</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","sauram-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Sauram the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Yer humankind may not understand sech things, but our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of trustworthy service. Yer items are safe with us. <br>\r\n30 adena for 1 item or stack of items regardless of time - to be settled when you retrieve 'em.  No adena, no item!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Blood Pledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>","sauram-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Sauram the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Yer humankind may not understand sech things, but our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of trustworthy service. Yer items are safe with us. <br>\r\n30 adena for 1 item or stack of items regardless of time - to be settled when you retrieve 'em.  No adena, no item!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Blood Pledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>","sauram-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 餌辦塋:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n僭勒擊 蜆嬴 萄董棲棻. 渡褐菟 檣除菟擎 澀 賅腦啊雖虜, 辦葬 '鬼繹曖 僥' 望萄朝 螃楠 羲餌蒂 陛霞 ががи 褻霜檜塭螃.\r\n凳萇 寰褕ж堅 蜆晦紫煙 п蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n陛問擎 僭勒 ж釭渡 鼠褻勒 30嬴等釭, 絲擎 僭勒擊 瓊擊 陽 頂朝 剪蹂.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>偃檣 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑸裊 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","sauraml-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>蘇瑞耳:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>喂∼！我幹嘛和你這種人做生意啊？若你要保管物品，等到你的等級到了一個程度再來吧。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","sauraml-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Sauram the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ach, a nameless sprig such as yourself may not even have the golden adena to get yer items back! If you want to use our service, make a name for yourself. Come back when you've earned some fame, levels, and adena!\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","sauraml-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Sauram the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Ach, a nameless sprig such as yourself may not even have the golden adena to get yer items back! If you want to use our service, make a name for yourself. Come back when you've earned some fame, levels, and adena!\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","sauraml-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 餌辦塋:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>檜瑭蹂, 辦葬陛 劂 圖堅 渡褐偽擎 Е啻晦曖 僭勒擊 蜃嬴遽欽 蜓檜螃? 僭勒擊 蜃晦堅 談棻賊 檜葷擊 覬 陳萼 棻擠縑 螃衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>人類，這次你又要甚麼東西ㄚ?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp1\">詢問現在的狀況</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">調整稅率</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">領出資金</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">存入資金</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghem4\">管理傭兵</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">管理城門</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">指定圍城時間</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">管理城內治安</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huamn, what is it this time?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp1\">Ask about the current situation</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the interest rate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw money</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit money</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghem4\">Manage warriors</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the Gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">Set the next war time</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">Control castle security</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Huamn, what is it this time?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp1\">Ask about the current situation</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">Adjust the interest rate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">Withdraw money</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">Deposit money</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghem4\">Manage warriors</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">Manage the Gate</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">Set the next war time</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">Control castle security</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檣除, 檜廓縑朝 傳 鼠歙擊 錳ж朝陛?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp1\">⑷ 鼻�窒� 渠п 僭橫獄棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"tax\">熱櫛睦擊 褻瞰и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"withdrawal\">濠旎擊 檣轎и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"cdeposit\">濠旎擊 殮旎и棻</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghem4\">煽餌蒂 婦葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"castlegate\">蹂億僥擊 婦葬и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"asktime\">棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 薑и棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"security\">蹂億頂 纂寰擊 婦葬и棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem10-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>看來我們的錢似乎不太夠。\r\n</body>","seghem10-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It seems that we are out of adena.\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem10-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>It seems that we are out of adena.\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem10-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎擎 蹂億僥擊 熱葬й虜и 絲檜 橈熱棻.\r\n</body>","seghem11-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你怎麼在戰爭中修理大門？\r\n</body>","seghem11-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How are you going to fix the gate during the War?  Magic?\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem11-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How are you going to fix the gate during the War?  Magic?\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem11-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎擎 瞪爵醞檣等 橫飩啪 僥擊 熱葬и棻朝 剪蹂?\r\n</body>","seghem12-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>葛拉從明天就會開始使用改變後的新稅率。你可得好好地記得，就算你經常改變稅率，他也只會聽從你最後的決定。\r\n</body>","seghem12-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Gora will apply the changed interest rate tomorrow. You'd better remember that he will only listen to your last decision, however often you change the rate.\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem12-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Gora will apply the changed interest rate tomorrow. You'd better remember that he will only listen to your last decision, however often you change the rate.\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem12-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>滲唳脹 熱櫛睦擎 堅塭陛 棻擠陳睡攪 瞳辨衛鑒剪蹂. ж瑞縑 罹楝廓 熱櫛睦擊 夥脯疑濠 堅塭朝 渡褐檜 葆雖虞戲煎 и 蜓虜 菟擊 纔棲 斜楛還 嬴蓬.\r\n</body>","seghem13-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>屬於<var src=\"#1\">的<var src=\"#0\">戰士嗎…到了明天的這個時間之前，我會試著去找齊的...。\r\n</body>","seghem13-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#1\"> warriors of <var src=\"#0\">...I'll try to get them till this time tomorrow...\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem13-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#1\"> warriors of <var src=\"#0\">...I'll try to get them till this time tomorrow...\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem13-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><var src=\"#0\">蒂 <var src=\"#1\">貲檜塭...頂橾 偽擎 衛除梱雖朝 賅嬴 爾葬棻.\r\n</body>","seghem14-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗨！人類。因為我們的國庫是空的，所以我們不能做任何事情。你要做什麼？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghem1\">命令沙罕阿吐巴</a>\r\n</body>","seghem14-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey human. We can't do anything because our treasury is empty. What are you going to do?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghem1\">Order Seghem</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem14-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey human. We can't do anything because our treasury is empty. What are you going to do?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghem1\">Order Seghem</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem14-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜爾蓬 檣除 曄奩. 雖旎擎 璽堅陛 纖 綠橫憮 嬴鼠 橾紫 й 熱陛 橈棻辦. 橫翹啊模?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghem1\">撮啞縑啪 雖衛蒂 頂萼棻</a>\r\n</body>","seghem15-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>考慮你屬下<var src=\"#0\"><var src=\"#1\">的魅力值，他能得到忠實追隨者的數目是依照<var src=\"#1\">來決定的。別太貪婪。</p>\r\n</body>","seghem15-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Considering your follower <var src=\"#0\">'s CHR, he can get up to <var src=\"#1\"> henchmen - don't be too greedy.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem15-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Considering your follower <var src=\"#0\">'s CHR, he can get up to <var src=\"#1\"> henchmen - don't be too greedy.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem15-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐曖 睡ж檣 <var src=\"#0\">曖 CHR煎 爾嬴ж勒等 渡褐擊 評蒂 瞪餌曖 熱朝 譆渠 <var src=\"#1\">貲 梱雖檜捱. 踹褕擊 睡葬雖 蜓塭.</p>\r\n</body>","seghem2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這是最近的財政情形\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>昨天的收入：<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">金幣\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">基本的開支：</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">金幣\r\n<p align=left>昨天的收入：<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">金幣\r\n<p align=left>目前的國庫：<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">金幣\r\n</body>","seghem2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is the current financial situation:\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Yesterday's income:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adena\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">Basic expenditure</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adena\r\n<p align=left>Net income of yesterday:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adena\r\n<p align=left>Current treasury<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adena\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is the current financial situation:\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>Yesterday's income:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">adena\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">Basic expenditure</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adena\r\n<p align=left>Net income of yesterday:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adena\r\n<p align=left>Current treasury<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adena\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>營薑擎 渠醱 檜溢啪 給嬴陛堅 氈模.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>橫薯ж瑞 熱殮:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left><a action=\"stdex\">晦獄 雖轎</a><br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left>橫薯唸骯:<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">嬴等釭\r\n<p align=left>⑷營濠骯識擋<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">嬴等釭\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=left>購買武器<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">金幣\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=left>購買食物<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">金幣\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=left>戰士薪資<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">金幣\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=left>其它雜項支出<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">金幣\r\n</body>","seghem3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=left>Weapon Purchases<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adena<p>\r\n<p align=left>Food Purchases<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adena<p>\r\n<p align=left>Warriors Payment<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adena<p>\r\n<p align=left>Miscellaneous<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">adena<p>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=left>Weapon Purchases<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">adena<p>\r\n<p align=left>Food Purchases<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">adena<p>\r\n<p align=left>Warriors Payment<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">adena<p>\r\n<p align=left>Miscellaneous<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">adena<p>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥</p></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=left>鼠晦 掘殮<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=left>衝猿 掘殮<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#2\">嬴等釭\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=left>辨煽 嶸雖綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#3\">嬴等釭\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=left>晦顫 濩綠<br>\r\n<p align=right><var src=\"#4\">嬴等釭\r\n</body>","seghem4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你要如何安排戰士？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">安排射手</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">召募戰士</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">分配戰士</a><br>\r\n</body>","seghem4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How are you going to arrange your warriors?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">Arrange archers</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">Raise Warriors</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">Assign Warriors</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>How are you going to arrange your warriors?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">Arrange archers</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">Raise Warriors</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">Assign Warriors</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>瞪餌菟擊 橫飩啪 寡纂ж啊模?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"archer\">蜂瑞嬪曖 掙熱 寡纂</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"employ\">煽餌 離轎</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"arrange\">離轎и 煽餌曖 寡纂</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這是現在門的狀態。\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate\">修理城門</a><br>\r\n</body>","seghem5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is the current state of the Gate.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate\">Repair the Gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>This is the current state of the Gate.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate\">Repair the Gate</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂億曖 僥擎 ⑷營 檜楛 鼻鷓蹂.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"healegate\">蹂億僥擊 熱葬и棻</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>人類，是什麼風把你吹來？\r\n</body>","seghem6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Human, what has brought you to me?\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Human, what has brought you to me?\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檣除, 釭и纔 鼠蝦 獐橾檣陛.\r\n</body>","seghem7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這是什麼鬼時間。我討厭人類，給我滾開！\r\n</body>","seghem7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What is it this time!?  I'm sick and tired of humans, just get out of my way!\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What is it this time!?  I'm sick and tired of humans, just get out of my way!\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>凱 傳 劃陛. 檣除檜塭賊 檜薯 雖晚雖晚ж棲 說葬 頂 擅縑憮 餌塭螳 幗溥!\r\n</body>","seghem8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=\"ffffff\">\r\n<p align=\"left\">沙罕阿吐巴：</p>\r\n</font>\r\n<p><br>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>好的。我會要他們準備好以等待明天的這個時間。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n","seghem8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All right. I'll make them ready until this time tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All right. I'll make them ready until this time tomorrow.\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>憲啊模. 頂 橫飩啪萇 頂橾 偽擎 衛除梱雖朝 憲嬴爾葬棻.\r\n</body>","seghem9-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在我沒有多餘的戰士。如果你要戰士，你必須下令我『召募戰士』去訓練他們。\r\n</body>","seghem9-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I have no warriors to spare right now. If you want warriors, you must raise them by asking me to 'raise soldiers'.\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem9-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I have no warriors to spare right now. If you want warriors, you must raise them by asking me to 'raise soldiers'.\r\n</body>\r\n","seghem9-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛謙濰 檜蝶葆縣:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎 渠晦醞檣 瞪餌陛 橈模. 瞪餌陛 в蹂ж棻賊 辦摹 釭縑啪 '煽餌 離轎' 擊 曖煆п憮 煽餌蒂 離轎ж罹撿 й疏蹂.\r\n</body>","seghemhp1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>所以...你所關心的是什麼？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp1\">森林裡的人類</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp2\">史萊姆賭賽的收益</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp3\">管理城堡</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp4\">管理傭兵</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp5\">攻城</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp6\">戰爭</a>\r\n</body>","seghemhp1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>So what are concerns you?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp2\">Atuba tribal system</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp3\">The humans in the forest</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp4\">Profit from the slime race</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp5\">Managing the fortress</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp6\">Managing the soldiers</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp7\">War</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>So what are concerns you?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp2\">Atuba tribal system</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp3\">The humans in the forest</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp4\">Profit from the slime race</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp5\">Managing the fortress</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp6\">Managing the soldiers</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp7\">War</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>凳陛 斜葬 憲堅 談戲褐陛?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp2\">嬴癱夥 睡褶 奢翕羹縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp3\">�倣�團婁曖 諄遺縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp4\">蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶曖 熱櫛縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp5\">蹂億曖 婦葬縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp6\">煽餌縑 渠п</a><br>\r\n<a link=\"seghemhp7\">瞪爵縑 渠п</a>\r\n</body>","seghemhp2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>真的如此嗎？\r\n<p>依照吟遊詩人所訴說關於部落的傳說，這森林裡的妖魔是由火神-『帕格立歐』所創造，並使我們成為最接近他的種族。\r\n<p>在外面大陸上出沒也被人類稱為妖魔的東西根本什麼也不是，只是『帕格立歐』在製造我們之前一個失敗的實驗品。\r\n<p>以火神的尖牙為圖騰的阿吐巴部落，是所有的部落裡最光榮的部落。那也是『帕格立歐』讓我們統合起這森林裡的妖魔所有種族的原因。\r\n<p>事實上我現在做的事，就是被魔法師和都達瑪拉部落族承認的『火神的意志』。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>但是...。現在你們人類毀滅我偉大的工作...。我非常地難過的...。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","seghemhp2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Is that so?\r\n<p>According to tribal legends told by our storytellers, the orcs in this forest are made by Paagrio himself thus making us the closest race to Him.\r\n<p>The thing outside which humans call orc, is nothing but a failed experiment Paagrio performed before making us.\r\n<p>The Atuba Tribe, whose totem is the Fang of Fire God, is the most glorious tribe of all the tribes. That's why Paagrio let us unite all the tribes of orcs in this forest.\r\n<p>The fact that my task is the will of Fire God is recognized even by the shamans of Duda-Mara tribe.\r\n<p>But... Now you people have ruined my grand task... I'm very sorry.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...Is that so?\r\n<p>According to tribal legends told by our storytellers, the orcs in this forest are made by Paagrio himself thus making us the closest race to Him.\r\n<p>The thing outside which humans call orc, is nothing but a failed experiment Paagrio performed before making us.\r\n<p>The Atuba Tribe, whose totem is the Fang of Fire God, is the most glorious tribe of all the tribes. That's why Paagrio let us unite all the tribes of orcs in this forest.\r\n<p>The fact that my task is the will of Fire God is recognized even by the shamans of Duda-Mara tribe.\r\n<p>But... Now you people have ruined my grand task... I'm very sorry.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>...斜溢捱.\r\n<p>睡褶曖 檜撿晦羞菟檜 蜓ж朝 睡褶曖 瞪撲縑 評腦賊, 檜 膛縑 髦堅 氈朝 螃觼菟擎 だ嬴斜葬螃 褐檜 霜蕾 虜萇, 碳曖 褐縑 陛濰 陛梱遴 睡褶檜塭 и棻. \r\n<p>膛 夥梨縑 氈朝, 檣除菟檜 螃觼塭堅 睡腦朝 匙菟擎 だ嬴斜葬螃眷憮 辦葬蒂 虜菟晦 嬪п 試盪 虜萇 濰陪馬縑 雖釭雖 彊雖. \r\n<p>碳曖 褐曖 歎夠棲蒂 饜蠱戲煎 ж朝 辦葬 嬴癱夥 睡褶擎 檜 膛曖 賅萇 螃觼 睡褶醞縑憮紫 陛濰 艙惜蝶楝遴 睡褶檜歷棻. 斜溢晦 陽僥縑 だ嬴斜葬螃眷憮朝 棻艇 睡褶檜 嬴棋 夥煎 辦葬 睡褶縑啪 檜 膛曖 螃觼菟擊 鱔мж朝 醞歜擊 蜃晦褐 匙檜棻. \r\n<p>釭曖 嬪機檜 碳曖 褐曖 嗆檜塭朝 匙擎 舒棻-葆塭 睡褶曖 輿獎餌菟紫 賅舒 檣薑ж朝 橾檜棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>ж雖虜...釭曖 嬪機檜 檣除菟曖 槳縑 曖п 鼠傘雖棻棲...釭朝 碟ж棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","seghemhp3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>很久很久以前，人類十分地害怕我們，當然也因此沒有人敢進入這個森林裡。但是自從你們人類間發生戰爭後，一些戰敗者開始進入了這個森林之內，而且放肆地燃燒森林。從那時起，他們開始為食物開始跟我們競爭。\r\n<p>他們在想什麼？難道他們以為所有的陸地都是他們的嗎？這個地方附近的森林和山是『火神』親自賜給我們的！所以我們要為它而戰。\r\n<p>但是人類是強壯的...。我不得不同意。而我也知道如果這種情形繼續下去，我們會是痛苦的一方。我之所以會服從你，是因為你想要統治人類，正好和我們誠摯地希望將那些人類的垃圾驅逐出這神聖的地方是一樣的，即使那表示我們必須信賴一個人類。\r\n<p>當然我們是可以盡我們所能地和人類戰鬥，直到我們燒盡了自己生命的火焰為止。那通常是我們的作風...但是我沒有選擇那條道路。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>目前在燃柳村的人類似乎訂出了懸賞我們部落圖騰的獎金，甚至試著切斷史萊姆賭賽和我們的種族之間的連繫。為了我們種族請盡力抵抗這些威脅...『領袖』。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","seghemhp3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Long ago, humans were afraid of us and thus didn't dare come into this forest. But some of the losers from your human war started to creep into the forest and burn sections of it. That's when they started to compete against us for food.\r\n<p>What are they thinking? Are they thinking that all the lands are theirs? The forest and mountains around this place was given by the Fire God himself. So we fought.\r\n<p>But humans are strong... I can't help but agree. And I know that if it keeps going, we are the one who will be sorry. The reason why we submitted to you was because your desire to rule met with our sincere hope to expel those human garbages from the sacred place even if that means that we have to rely on the humans ourselves.\r\n<p>...It was possible that we could try to kill as many of you humans as possible until we are nothing but an extinguished flame. Such is usually our way...but I didn't take that road.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Nowadays the humans at the burnt field seem to be setting a bounty for the totem of my tribe, and even trying to cut the transfer line between the slime race and our tribe. For us both please do your best against these threats, 'Chief'.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Long ago, humans were afraid of us and thus didn't dare come into this forest. But some of the losers from your human war started to creep into the forest and burn sections of it. That's when they started to compete against us for food.\r\n<p>What are they thinking? Are they thinking that all the lands are theirs? The forest and mountains around this place was given by the Fire God himself. So we fought.\r\n<p>But humans are strong... I can't help but agree. And I know that if it keeps going, we are the one who will be sorry. The reason why we submitted to you was because your desire to rule met with our sincere hope to expel those human garbages from the sacred place even if that means that we have to rely on the humans ourselves.\r\n<p>...It was possible that we could try to kill as many of you humans as possible until we are nothing but an extinguished flame. Such is usually our way...but I didn't take that road.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Nowadays the humans at the burnt field seem to be setting a bounty for the totem of my tribe, and even trying to cut the transfer line between the slime race and our tribe. For us both please do your best against these threats, 'Chief'.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蕪陳 檣除菟擎 辦葬蒂 匏頂橫 檜 膛曖 桶熨и 夠梱雖朝 菟橫螃雖 彊懊歷棻. ж雖虜 橡葆瞪睡攪 傘�� 檣除菟除曖 諄遺縑憮 霞 喪戮菟檜 檜夠縑 菟橫諦憮朝 膛擊 碳鷓辦堅 辦葬諦 膛曖 詳擊 匙擊 場堅 諄辦晦 衛濛ц棻. \r\n<p>檣除菟擎 紫渠羹 鼠歙擊 儅陝ж堅 氈朝 匙檣陛? 檜 撮鼻 賅萇 階檜 濠褐菟曖 匙檜塭堅塭紫 儅陝ж朝 匙檣陛? 檜 橾渠曖 膛婁 骯菟擎 碳曖 褐眷憮 辦葬菟 螃觼縑啪 輿褐 匙檜棻. 斜楚憮 辦葬朝 諄錫棻.\r\n<p>ж雖虜 檣除菟擎 鬼ж棻...斜勒 檣薑й 熱 夤縑 橈棻. 檜楝и 鼻�窕� 啗樓腎賊 碳葬и 匙擎 辦葬 薹檜塭朝 匙紫 憲堅 氈棻. 辦葬陛 渡褐縑啪 犒謙ж堅 ⑺溘ж朝 匙擎 撮溘擊 陛雖堅 談棻朝 渡褐曖 撿蜂婁, 檣除曖 ��擊 網橫憮塭紫 謙褶擊 嶸雖ж堅濠 ж朝 釭曖 儅陝檜 澀 蜃嬴 雲橫螺晦 陽僥檜棻. \r\n<p>...辦葬朝 渡褐菟檜勒 盪 陛隸蝶楝遴 �倣�團 葆擊 喫菟檜勒 除縑 �徆� 渦 號擎 熱蒂 避檜堅 瞪資п 幗萵 熱紫 氈歷棻. 斜匙檜 辦葬曖 錳楚 寞徹檜雖虜...釭朝 斜 望擊 鷗ж雖 彊懊棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>蹂鍔擠 �倣�團 葆擊縑憮朝 辦葬 睡褶曖 饜蠱縑 ⑷鼻旎擊 勘堅, 傳 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶諦 辦葬 睡褶 餌檜曖 濠旎摹擊 莒戲溥 ж朝 賅曄檜渦捱. 憮煎蒂 嬪п 檜楝и 嬪⑺縑 澀 渠籀п 輿衛螃, '渠濰'.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","seghemhp4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>關於葛拉．艾妮的盟邦出賣我們這件事，我仍然是非常遺憾。 \r\n<p>不可諱言，有一些人類是真的很不喜歡史萊姆賭賽...。而我也看不出來有任何理由會讓你拒絕了葛拉那邊的提議。再更進一步地說吧，我們可以用那些金錢來提高我們的力量，所以我當然不會對目前的契約的事做任何的評論。\r\n<p>但是...要小心。最近在燃柳村那些討厭的人類有著很奇怪的行動。也許他們已經發現我們的主要的經濟來源就是史萊姆賭賽。他們可能會試著採取一些行動...。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","seghemhp4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm still very upset about the alliance with Gora Agni - he betrayed our communal system.\r\n<p>Nevertheless, it's true that there are some humans who don't like the slime races... I can see no reason why you reject Gora's offer. Furthermore, we can raise our strength with that money, so I won't say anything about the current contract.\r\n<p>To get the slime race profit, one of your members has to visit Gora. If he speaks to Gora, Gora will send his henchman to deliver the profit here.\r\n<p>But... Be careful. Recently those pesky humans at the burnt field are acting strangely. Mayhaps they have already found out that our main financial source is the slime races, and they may try to intercept the carrier. You must have some of your powerful members accompany him.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm still very upset about the alliance with Gora Agni - he betrayed our communal system.\r\n<p>Nevertheless, it's true that there are some humans who don't like the slime races... I can see no reason why you reject Gora's offer. Furthermore, we can raise our strength with that money, so I won't say anything about the current contract.\r\n<p>To get the slime race profit, one of your members has to visit Gora. If he speaks to Gora, Gora will send his henchman to deliver the profit here.\r\n<p>But... Be careful. Recently those pesky humans at the burnt field are acting strangely. Mayhaps they have already found out that our main financial source is the slime races, and they may try to intercept the carrier. You must have some of your powerful members accompany him.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嬴鼠葬 螃觼 蹂億蒂 鬼ж啪 酈辦晦 嬪п憮塭堆 ж雖虜 睡褶 奢翕羹蒂 寡褐и 堅塭 嬴斜棲諦 槳擊 濩擎 匙縑 渠п 釭朝 嬴霜紫 褕�� 晦碟 釭緒ж堅 氈棻. \r\n<p>橫繚萇, 檣除菟 醞縑朝 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶蒂 滌煎 謠啪 儅陝ж雖 彊朝 鼠濰 撮溘紫 號戲棲梱...堅塭陛 渡褐檜 薯衛и 唳綠 蹂掘蒂 剪瞰й 檜嶸朝 橈歷擊 匙檜棻. 斜 絲戲煎 辦葬陛 鬼п雖堅 氈朝 匙紫 餌褒檜棻. 斜楝棲 雖旎曖 鼻鷓縑 渠п憮朝 殮擊 棻僭紫煙 ж雖.\r\n<p>蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶曖 熱櫛旎擊 嫡嬴螃晦 嬪п憮朝 渡褐啻 ⑸裊錳醞 ж釭陛 霜蕾 堅塭蒂 寞僥ж朝 熱 夤縑 橈棻. 堅塭縑啪 蜓擊 勘賊 斜陛 斜翕寰 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶縑憮 賅檣 熱殮擊 濠晦 熱ж蒂 衛麵憮 檜薹梱雖 遴奩衛麵 還 匙檜棻.\r\n<p>ж雖虜...輿曖ж紫煙 ж塭. 譆斬 �倣�團 葆擊薹 翕щ檜 檜鼻ж棻. 嬴葆紫 辦葬曖 濠旎錳檜 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶塭朝 餌褒檜 嫦陝脹 匙 偽棻. 餌塋菟擊 ヴ橫憮 濠旎擊 釭腦朝 螃觼菟擊 蝗問й 儅陝檣 匙偽渦捱. 絲擊 釭蒂 陽朝 窕 罹楝貲曖 褒溘濠菟擊 渠翕ж紫煙 ж衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","seghemhp5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>就算你介入，我們還是有自己的生活方式，我不會接受你任何的命令來管理城堡。但是純粹只是為戰爭而控制城門的話，我會試著服從你的命令。\r\n<p>你能隨時命令我打開或關閉城門。不論你打不打開它都不關我的事，但是它可能會影響部落。所以除非真的需要，否則不要關門。\r\n<p>我們儘可能做出最堅固的門，但是它不是無敵的。如果它因為你的命令而損害，我也會修復它。不過這樣會花費金錢，而且即使有錢，在戰爭期間內也是無法修理。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","seghemhp5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We have our own way of living without your interference - I take no orders for managing the fortress.  I will try to follow your orders for affairs with the Main Gate, which is purely made for War.\r\n<p>You can always open or close the Gate by ordering me. Whether you open it or not is none of my business, but it may affect the tribe. So do not close the Gate unless absolutely necessary.\r\n<p>We made the Gate as sturdy as possible, but it's not invincible. I'll fix the Gate if it is damaged, if so ordered. But it costs adena, and all the money in the world can't fix it during the War.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>We have our own way of living without your interference - I take no orders for managing the fortress.  I will try to follow your orders for affairs with the Main Gate, which is purely made for War.\r\n<p>You can always open or close the Gate by ordering me. Whether you open it or not is none of my business, but it may affect the tribe. So do not close the Gate unless absolutely necessary.\r\n<p>We made the Gate as sturdy as possible, but it's not invincible. I'll fix the Gate if it is damaged, if so ordered. But it costs adena, and all the money in the world can't fix it during the War.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐檜 褐唳噙雖 彊嬴紫 辦葬縑啪朝 辦葬 釭葷渠煎曖 髦嬴陛朝 寞衝檜 氈棻. 斜楝嘎煎 蹂億曖 橾奩瞳檣 遴艙縑 渠п憮朝 渡褐曖 雖衛朝 嫡雖 彊啊棻. ж雖虜 牖熱ж啪 瞪爵 跡瞳戲煎 虜菟橫霞 蹂億曖 薑僥縑 渠п憮虜擎 渡褐曖 嗆擊 評腦紫煙 ж啊棻. \r\n<p>僥擎 渡褐檜 釭縑啪 蜓擊 ж賊 翮葆萇雖 翮堅 殘擊 熱 氈棻. 僥擊 翮堅 殘堅朝 渡褐 葆擠檜雖虜, 僥擊 樹薯釭 殘堅 氈橫憮撿 睡褶團縑啪 Яп陛 除棻. 窕 в蹂и 陽陛 嬴棲賊 撩僥擎 わ潸ж雖 蜓嬴 殖塭.\r\n<p>撩僥擎 腆 熱 氈朝 и ががж啪 虜菟曹 ц雖虜 奢問擊 嫡戲賊 橫聶 熱 橈檜 睡憮霞棻. 僥曖 熱葬 羲衛 釭縑啪 蜓擊 ж賊 堅纂紫煙 ж啊棻. ж雖虜 僥擊 堅纂朝等縑朝 絲檜 в蹂ж堅, 絲檜 氈橫紫 瞪爵醞縑朝 熱葬朝 碳陛棟ж棻. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","seghemhp6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>為了這個大家共同的利益，我提供我的屬下給你。他們會與你『合作』，但是絕對不會給予你他們的忠誠的心。 \r\n<p>我們全部的妖魔都擁有戰士的才能。但是除了那魯加部落外，我們沒有任何軍隊的觀念。所以如果你要使用我部落中的戰士，你必須供養他們。只要你下命令給我，我就會處理那些細節。\r\n<p>塔上的射手只要挑好，馬上就可以就定位。但至於其他的戰士，你就應該讓我知道你需要多少戰士分配到你的部隊中。\r\n<p>如果你的成員與『戰士之中的戰士』－肯土．那魯加說話，他就會給他們那些戰士。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","seghemhp6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm providing you with my followers only because there is a common profit. They will 'cooperate', but won't give their hearts.\r\n<p>All of our orcs have a talent as warriors, but we don't have any concept of an army except for the Neruga tribe. So if you want to use the warriors of my tribe, you have to raise them. I'll process the details once so ordered.\r\n<p>Archers for the tower will be assigned as soon as picked. But for other warriors, you should let me know how many warriors to assign to your pledge members.\r\n<p>...If your members talk to Kent Neruga 'the warrior among warriors' he will give them the assigned warriors.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I'm providing you with my followers only because there is a common profit. They will 'cooperate', but won't give their hearts.\r\n<p>All of our orcs have a talent as warriors, but we don't have any concept of an army except for the Neruga tribe. So if you want to use the warriors of my tribe, you have to raise them. I'll process the details once so ordered.\r\n<p>Archers for the tower will be assigned as soon as picked. But for other warriors, you should let me know how many warriors to assign to your pledge members.\r\n<p>...If your members talk to Kent Neruga 'the warrior among warriors' he will give them the assigned warriors.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐縑啪 釭曖 睡ж蒂 薯奢ж朝 匙擎 橫蛤梱雖釭 渡褐婁 釭 餌檜縑 奢鱔 檜櫛檜 氈晦 陽僥檜棻. 斜菟擎 橫蛤梱雖釭 渡褐縑啪 '⑺溘'й 閨, 醱撩擊 夥纂雖朝 彊擊 匙檜棻. \r\n<p>辦葬 螃觼朝 賅萇 睡褶錳檜 瞪餌曖 濠韓擊 陛雖堅 氈棻. ж雖虜 斜楛 虜躑 啻瑞陛 睡褶擊 薯諼и 棻艇 睡褶縑朝 鼻綠捱檜塭朝 偃喃擎 橈棻. 斜楝棲 渡褐檜 橫集и 濛瞪縑萇 辦葬 睡褶曖 瞪餌菟擊 餌辨ж堅 談棻賊 辦摹 煽餌蒂 離轎ж雖 彊戲賊 寰脹棻. 煽餌曖 離轎擎 釭縑啪 蜓擊 ж賊 頂陛 п 場紫煙 ж啊棻.\r\n<p>蜂瑞縑 螢塭陞 掙煽檜撿 離轎虜 ж賊 夥煎 濠葬縑 寡纂腎雖虜, 斜 諼曖 瞪餌菟曖 唳辦朝 渡褐檜 釭縑啪 橫集и 辨煽擊 渡褐 ⑸裊錳 援掘縑啪 賃貲 寡纂衛鑒 匙檣雖蒂 唸薑ж罹 憲溥輿橫撿 и棻. \r\n<p>...渡褐 ⑸裊錳菟檜 '瞪餌 醞曖 瞪餌'檣 騰癱 啻瑞陛縑啪 蜓擊 勘賊 斜陛 渡褐檜 寡纂и 渠煎 瞪餌菟擊 渡褐 ⑸裊錳菟縑啪 頂橫還 匙檜螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","seghemhp7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>沙罕阿吐巴：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我認為你要清楚知道目前的狀況有多危險。如果你要與我們在生意方面保存長久的關係，你就要保護城堡使我們免於其他人類的威脅，包括那些來自燃柳村的人。\r\n<p>如果你要控制我們，就應該儘快地由史萊姆賭賽得到金幣。但是如果你贏得太多，那些沉迷者可能會發瘋， 所以你最好小心一點。\r\n<p>一旦你接管城堡，其他的血盟將會試著來奪走它。為了防範這些人的侵犯，你必須要設定下一次攻城時間。你可以透過我來設定攻城的時間。在你設定之後，你的競爭者就可以來和你挑戰。假如在你接管城堡之後的半天內，你沒有設定出下一次圍城的時間，那時間將會直接被自動地設定成大約１２天以後。\r\n<p>一旦攻城開始，你必須保護城堡直到日落。如果你擁有城堡直到日落，那麼直到下一次攻城時間前，這個城堡都會安然地屬於你。\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我們的城堡的設計可以逐退在外部的門的敵人。所以要記得，一旦城門被攻破，那將會非常危險。當然，你不能死，所以最好在你旁邊有足夠的戰士。\r\n<p>如果你被其他交戰的血盟成員殺死，或著王座被拿走的話...那麼城堡將會落入他們的手上。我也不希望它會發生。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","seghemhp7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I think you know well how dangerous the current situation is. If you want to keep in business with us for long, you have to protect the fortress from the threat of other humans, including those from the burnt fields.\r\n<p>If you want to keep us under control, you should get the adena from the slime race as soon as possible. But if you take too much, some addicts of yours may get mad, so you'd better be careful.\r\n<p>Once you take over the fortress, other pledges will try to take it from you. For them, you have to set the next siege time. You can set the time through me. Your competitors can challenge you after the time you set, and if you don't set the next siege time before half of the day passes after you took over the castle, the time will be set to approximately 10 days later.\r\n<p>As soon as the siege begins, you have to protect the fortress until sunset. That is, this fortress will be safely yours again till the next siege time, if you have the fortress at sunset.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Our fortress is designed to repel enemies at the outer gate, so remember that once it is penetrated, the fortress as a whole will be in danger. Of course, you must not die, so you'd better keep sufficient warriors at your side.\r\n<p>If you are killed by other pledge members, or this throne is taken...then the fortress will be in their hands. I hope that this won't happen, but I've seen it before.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Seghem Atuba:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I think you know well how dangerous the current situation is. If you want to keep in business with us for long, you have to protect the fortress from the threat of other humans, including those from the burnt fields.\r\n<p>If you want to keep us under control, you should get the adena from the slime race as soon as possible. But if you take too much, some addicts of yours may get mad, so you'd better be careful.\r\n<p>Once you take over the fortress, other pledges will try to take it from you. For them, you have to set the next siege time. You can set the time through me. Your competitors can challenge you after the time you set, and if you don't set the next siege time before half of the day passes after you took over the castle, the time will be set to approximately 10 days later.\r\n<p>As soon as the siege begins, you have to protect the fortress until sunset. That is, this fortress will be safely yours again till the next siege time, if you have the fortress at sunset.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Our fortress is designed to repel enemies at the outer gate, so remember that once it is penetrated, the fortress as a whole will be in danger. Of course, you must not die, so you'd better keep sufficient warriors at your side.\r\n<p>If you are killed by other pledge members, or this throne is taken...then the fortress will be in their hands. I hope that this won't happen, but I've seen it before.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","seghemhp7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>撮啞 嬴癱夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖旎檜 橡葆釭 嬪晝и 鼻�窕恔鶼� 渡褐檜 渦 澀 憲堅 氈擊 匙檜棻. 渡褐檜 辦葬諦曖 婦啗蒂 螃概翕寰 嶸雖ж晦 嬪п憮朝 �倣�團 葆擊擊 綠煜и 檣除菟曖 嬪⑺戲煎睡攪 檜 蹂億蒂 寰瞪ж啪 雖麵頂雖 彊戲賊 寰腎雖.\r\n<p>橾欽 辦葬蒂 雖寡ж堅 談棻賊 渡褐檜 魚 嬴檜蛤橫 渠煎 蝸塭歜 溯檜蝶縑憮 翮褕�� 絲擊 貍頂紫煙 ж塭. ж雖虜 傘鼠 號擎 絲擊 貍頂溥堅 ж賊 溯檜蝶縑 醞絮脹 渡褐 翕褶菟檜 渡褐擊 避檜溥堅 陪葬蒂 艦纔棲 瞳渡�� ж紫煙. \r\n<p>渡褐檜 橾欽 辦葬 蹂億蒂 離雖ц戲賊 檜 蹂億蒂 離雖ж堅濠 ж朝 棻艇 ⑸裊菟曖 莒歜橈朝 紫瞪擊 嫡啪 腆 匙檜棻. 檜蒂 嬪п 渡褐擎 棻擠 奢撩瞪檜 樹薯 氈擊雖蒂 唸薑ж雖 彊戲賊 寰脹棻. 奢撩瞪 衛除擎 釭蒂 鱔п 唸薑й 熱 氈棻. 渡褐曖 唳爵濠菟擎 渡褐檜 薑и 衛除 檜�醴●� 樹薯萇雖 渡褐縑啪 瞪爵擊 勘 熱 氈棻. 蹂億蒂 薄滄и 雖 奩釭瞰 寰縑 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 薑ж雖 彊戲賊 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擎 翮�� 薑紫 �譟� 詣渠煎 唸薑腎橫 幗萼棻朝 匙縑 輿曖ж塭.\r\n<p>奢撩瞪檜 衛濛腎賊 渡褐擎 薑п霞 衛除戲煎睡攪 棻擠 橾路陽梱雖 檜 蹂億蒂 雖麵撿 и棻. 蓮遴 蜓煎 棻擠 橾路 陽 渡褐檜 罹瞪�� 檜 蹂億蒂 離雖ж堅 氈棻賊 渡褐擎 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除梱雖 檜 蹂億蒂 寰瞪ж啪 嶸雖й 熱 氈啪 脹棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>辦葬 蹂億朝 晦獄瞳戲煎 諼撩僥縑憮 賅萇 諼瞳擊 寞橫ж紫煙 腎橫 氈棻. 斜楝嘎煎 諼撩僥檜 給だ腎賊 蹂億 瞪羹陛 嬪я縑 緒雖啪 脹棻朝 薄擊 貲褕ж堅 檜夠擊 餌熱ж紫煙 ж塭. 傳, 渡褐檜 避橫憮撿 檜撿晦陛 寰腎棲 樹薯釭 醱碟и 熱曖 瞪餌蒂 啁縑 舒紫煙 ж塭. \r\n<p>渡褐檜 鼻渠寞 ⑸裊曖 槳縑 避剪釭, 檜夠曖 諾謝陛 薄滄脹棻賊...嬴葆紫 檜 蹂億朝 斜 ⑸裊曖 槳縑 剩橫陛啊雖. 斜溢啪 腎雖 彊晦蒂 除瞰�� 夥塭朝 夥檜棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"seghemhp1\"></img>\r\n</body>","shalina1-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>夏麗娜:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>有某些裝備收集成套的話，會發揮特別的功效。例如提昇體力，額外增加防禦力等效果。收集一些相似的名稱的防具來裝備看看。\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","shalina1-e.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Shalina :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>When you have items and complete the set, they give you a special Bonus. For example they can raise your maximum Hit Points, or give you bonus Armor Class. Collect armors with similar names and try them on all at once to find out what bonus they give. \r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","shalina1-j.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Shalina :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>When you have items and complete the set, they give you a special Bonus. For example they can raise your maximum Hit Point, or give you bonus Armor Class. Collect armors with similar names and try them on all at once to find out what bonus it gives. \r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","shalina1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>髦葬釭 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>嬴檜蠱 醞縑朝 衛葬鍔蒂 瞪睡 賅戲啪 腎賊 か熱и 棟溘擊 嫦�秷炴� 匙菟檜 氈蝗棲棻. 蕨蒂 菟賊 譆渠 羹溘擊 螢溥遽棻湍雖, 寞橫溘擊 隸陛衛麵 遽棻湍雖 ж朝 �膩�陛 釭顫釭雖蹂. 綠蝌и 檜葷擊 陛霞 寞橫掘菟擊 睡嬪滌煎 賅嬴憮 賅舒 雜辨п 爾撮蹂. \r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","sherwin1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>雪爾溫 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n錢是很可怕的東西。為了這個東西，有些朋友因此吵架，破壞關係了友誼。你也不要跟朋友借錢喔。 \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","sherwin1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>敷孺 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n絲檜塢 霤 鼠憮遴 僭勒橾撮. 斜匙 陽僥縑 螃楠撮錯 論嬴螞 辦薑檜 ж瑞嬴藹縑 鼠傘韓 熱紫 氈戲棲 蜓橾撮. 濠啻紫 瞰耀и 耀掘諦朝 絲剪楚朝 ж雖 彊朝 匙檜 謠擊 剪撿. \r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","shipevi1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>港口主人\r\n</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗯？你在 『甘特之屋』受訓，對嗎？很抱歉，除非你獲得甘特的承認，否則我不能把<a link=\"shipEvI2\">票</a>賣給你。甘特先生說不可以把票給像你一樣的壞蛋。</p>\r\n</body>","shipEvI1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hm? You train at the 'House of the Red Knight,' right? Sorry, but I can't sell you a <a link=\"shipEvI2\">ticket</a> unless you are accepted by Gunter. Sir Gunter said not to sell tickets to wicked ones like you.</p>\r\n</body>","shipEvI1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hm? You train at the 'House of the Red Knight,' right? Sorry, but I can't sell you a <a link=\"shipEvI2\">ticket</a> unless you are accepted by Gunter. Sir Gunter said not to sell tickets to wicked ones like you.</p>\r\n</body>","shipEvI1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>摹雜濰 婦葬檣</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>擬? 濠喧 '碩擎 晦餌曖 餵'曖 �こ羶�檜濫嬴? 檜瑭, 釭紫 寡蒂 鷓錶輿堅朝 談雖虜 捱攪椒檜 濠啻偽檜 餌學и 餌塋縑啪朝 <a link=\"shipEvI2\">ル</a>蒂 つ雖 蜓塭堅 ж樟棻堅.</p>\r\n<p>凳, 翮褕�� ж賊 樹薇除 檣薑 嫡擊纔棲, 傘鼠 釭際啪 儅陝ж雖 蜓嬴醜.</p>\r\n</body>","shipevi2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>港口主人</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗯∼如果你這麼堅持的話...我想我可以在某些方面幫助你。稍後在我下班之後，再過來找我吧。那時候我就在村莊附近等你。</p>\r\n<p></font></p>\r\n</body>","shipEvI2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hm...If you insist...I may be able to help you in some way...come to me later, after my shift is over. I'll be in the village. </p>\r\n</body>","shipEvI2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hm...If you insist...I may be able to help you in some way...come to me later, after my shift is over. I'll be in the village. </p>\r\n</body>","shipEvI2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>摹雜濰 婦葬檣</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>戲~擠, 傳 斜溢啪梱雖 蜓и棻賊 瞰渠煎 跤掘ж朝 勒 嬴棲雖虜 蜓檜撿...釭醞縑 頂 橾 部陪 棻擠縑 葆擊煎 釭蒂 瓊嬴螃塭堅. 頂陛 橫飩啪萇 п 爾雖.</p>\r\n<p></font></p>\r\n</body>","shipevi3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>港口主人</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>到古丁的船費是３００金幣。你要坐船嗎嗎？\r\n<br><br>現在的時間是<var src=\"#999\">.<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"shipEvI7\">詢問開船時間</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"entership\">坐船</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</body>\r\n","shipEvI3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The fare to Gludio is 300 adena. Will you pay?\r\n<br><br>By the way, it's <var src=\"#999\"> now.<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"shipEvI7\">Ask the ship schedule</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"entership\">Enter the ship</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</body>\r\n","shipEvI3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The fare to Gludio is 300 adena. Will you pay?\r\n<br><br>By the way, it's <var src=\"#999\"> now.<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"shipEvI7\">Ask the ship schedule</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"entership\">Enter the ship</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</body>\r\n","shipEvI3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>摹雜濰 婦葬檣</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖梱雖 陛朝 寡ら擎 ら紫 300嬴等釭檣等, 餌衛啊蝗棲梱?\r\n<br><br>霤堅煎 ⑷營 衛除擎 <var src=\"#999\"> 殮棲棻.<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"shipEvI7\">寡曖 蝶馨鍰擊 僖朝棻</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"entership\">寡縑 驕棻</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</body>\r\n","shipevi4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>港口主人</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嗯？一隻妖精？我考慮看看應該對一隻妖精收多少錢...\r\n<p>好，妖精的船費是１０００金幣。這很公平，對吧？\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</body>","shipEvI4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hm? An elf? I wonder how much I should charge for you fairyfolk...\r\n<p>Okay, the fare for elves is 1000 adena. Fair enough, right?\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#318\" action=\"cancel\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","shipEvI4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hm? An elf? I wonder how much I should charge for you fairyfolk...\r\n<p>Okay, the fare for elves is 1000 adena. Fair enough, right?\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#318\" action=\"cancel\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","shipEvI4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>摹雜濰 婦葬檣</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>擬? 蹂薑檜濫嬴? 戲~擠, 蹂薑擎 寡駁擊 橡葆蒂 嫡嬴撿 ж釭...\r\n<p>凳, 斜楚. и 1000 嬴等釭 薑紫 頂堅 顫塭堅. 橫陽?\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</body>","shipevi5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>港口主人</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嘿嘿嘿...！一般來說，我需要甘特先生許可才能做這件事...。\r\n<p>不過...如果有個１０００枚金幣的話...。我可是冒著生命危險在為你提供服務，付錢，不然你就自已想法子過去。\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#318\" action=\"cancel\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","shipEvI5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Normally, I'd need Sir Gunter's permission to do this...\r\n<p>Pay me no less than 1000 adena. I'm putting myself at risk for this...No price can be too high. Pay the price, or forget about the whole deal.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#318\" action=\"cancel\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","shipEvI5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Normally, I'd need Sir Gunter's permission to do this...\r\n<p>Pay me no less than 1000 adena. I'm putting myself at risk for this...No price can be too high. Pay the price, or forget about the whole deal.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#318\" action=\"cancel\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","shipEvI5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>摹雜濰 婦葬檣</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>④④④, 錳楚朝 捱攪椒曖 ъ塊擊 嫡嬴撿虜 つ 熱 氈朝 勒等...\r\n<p>1000嬴等釭 薑紫縑 橫飩蝗棲梱? 盪紫 跡獗 勘堅 ж朝 濰餌塭憮 檜薑紫朝 嫡嬴撿啊橫蹂.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#318\" action=\"cancel\"></img></p>\r\n</body>","shipevi6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>港口主人</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在晚上，當沒有船進來的時候，我為什麼還要留著那裡？當我下班的時候，我會在城鎮中讓我疲倦的骨頭好好地休息...\r\n<p>所以...這些日子有什麼有趣的事情嗎？\r\n</body>","shipEvI6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Why should I stay there at night, when no ships come in? When I'm not working, I rest my weary bones here in town...\r\n<p>So...Anything interesting happening these days?\r\n</body>","shipEvI6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Why should I stay there at night, when no ships come in? When I'm not working, I rest my weary bones here in town...\r\n<p>So...Anything interesting happening these days?\r\n</body>","shipEvI6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>摹雜濰 婦葬檣</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>寡陛 寰菟橫螃朝 嫘縑撿 剪晦 憮氈橫憮 凳ж啊蝗棲梱. 釭紫 葆擊縑憮 嫘檜蝸擎 Яж朝剪轄, 凳.\r\n<p>...蹂闈 凳 營嘐氈朝 橾檜塭紫 氈蝗棲梱?\r\n</body>","ShipEvI7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>港口主人</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>到古丁的開船時間如下。\r\n<br>\r\n<br> 08:00 - 09:00\r\n<br> 12:00 - 13:00\r\n<br> 16:00 - 17:00\r\n<br> 20:00 - 21:00\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ShipEvI3\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ShipEvI7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor Master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the time table for the ship to the Gludio Estate.\r\n<br>\r\n<br> 08:00 - 09:00\r\n<br> 12:00 - 13:00\r\n<br> 16:00 - 17:00\r\n<br> 20:00 - 21:00\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ShipEvI3\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ShipEvI7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Harbor Master</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the time table for the ship to the Gludio Estate.\r\n<br>\r\n<br> 08:00 - 09:00\r\n<br> 12:00 - 13:00\r\n<br> 16:00 - 17:00\r\n<br> 20:00 - 21:00\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ShipEvI3\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ShipEvI7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>摹雜濰 婦葬檣</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖縑 陛朝 寡曖 衛除 纔檜綰擎 棻擠婁 偽熱棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<br> 08:00 - 09:00\r\n<br> 12:00 - 13:00\r\n<br> 16:00 - 17:00\r\n<br> 20:00 - 21:00\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ShipEvI3\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","shipevm1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>水手</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在船上的所有人聽著∼船很快就要出發了！\r\n<p>搭船到『說語島』單程的費用是<var src=\"#0\">金幣喔。\r\n<br><br>現在時間是<var src=\"#999\">.<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"shipEvM2\">詢問開船時間</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#318\" action=\"cancel\"></img></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","shipEvM1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sailor</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All aboard~ The ship is leaving soon!\r\n<p>The one-way ship fare to the '說語島' is <var src=\"#0\"> adena.\r\n<br><br>By the way, it's <var src=\"#999\"> now.<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"shipEvM2\">Ask the ship schedule</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"entership\">Enter the ship</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#318\" action=\"cancel\"></img></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","shipEvM1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sailor</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All aboard~ The ship is leaving soon!\r\n<p>The one-way ship fare to the '說語島' is <var src=\"#0\"> adena.\r\n<br><br>By the way, it's <var src=\"#999\"> now.<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"shipEvM2\">Ask the ship schedule</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"entership\">Enter the ship</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#318\" action=\"cancel\"></img></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","shipEvM1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>摹錳</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>濠濠, 憮舒腦撮蹂~ 寡陛 埠 轎嫦м棲棻~\r\n<p>'蜓ж朝 撰'梱雖 陛朝 寡ら擎 ら紫 <var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭殮棲棻.\r\n<br><br>霤堅煎 ⑷營 衛除擎 <var src=\"#999\"> 殮棲棻.<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"shipEvM2\">寡曖 蝶馨鍰擊 僖朝棻</a><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#318\" action=\"cancel\"></img></p>\r\n</body>\r\n","ShipEvM2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>水手</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>到說語島的開船時間如下。\r\n<br>\r\n<br> 06:00 - 07:00\r\n<br> 10:00 - 11:00\r\n<br> 14:00 - 15:00\r\n<br> 18:00 - 19:00\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ShipEvM1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ShipEvM2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sailor</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the time table for the ship to 說語島.\r\n<br>\r\n<br> 06:00 - 07:00\r\n<br> 10:00 - 11:00\r\n<br> 14:00 - 15:00\r\n<br> 18:00 - 19:00\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ShipEvM1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ShipEvM2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sailor</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the time table for the ship to 說語島.\r\n<br>\r\n<br> 06:00 - 07:00\r\n<br> 10:00 - 11:00\r\n<br> 14:00 - 15:00\r\n<br> 18:00 - 19:00\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ShipEvM1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","ShipEvM2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>摹錳</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>'蜓ж朝 撰'縑 陛朝 寡曖 衛除 纔檜綰擎 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻.\r\n<br>\r\n<br> 06:00 - 07:00\r\n<br> 10:00 - 11:00\r\n<br> 14:00 - 15:00\r\n<br> 18:00 - 19:00\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#331\" link=\"ShipEvM1\"></img>\r\n</body>\r\n","sidney1-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>席德尼:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n在家裡都沒有東西，看上去就會讓人產生寂寞的感覺？那你買一些家具啊。你可以去找安東，他會幫你製作一些漂亮的家具和飾品。\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","sidney1-e.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sidney :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nDoes your house feel empty? If that is so, why don't you try buying some furniture. Anton will make great furniture and decorations for your house.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","sidney1-j.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Sidney :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\nDoes your house feel empty? If that is so, why don't you try buying some furniture. Anton will make great furniture and decorations for your house.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","sidney1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>衛萄棲 :</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>\r\n餵寰縑 嬴鼠 匙紫 橈橫 ъ瞪ж棻掘蹂? 斜溢棻賊 陛掘蒂 餌憮 寡纂п 爾撮蹂. 奢蕨餌 寰驛縑啪陛賊 斜陛 詣霞 陛掘諦 濰衝ヶ菟擊 虜菟橫 還 匙殮棲棻.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","spelldesc-c.tbl":"80\r\n0 初級治癒術 (4/0)\r\n1 日光術 (4/0)\r\n2 保護罩 (3/5)\r\n3 光箭 (3/0)\r\n4 指定傳送 (5/0)\r\n8 解毒術 (8/0)\r\n9 寒冷戰慄 (9/1)\r\n10 毒咒 (10/10/1)\r\n11 擬似魔法武器 (15/0)\r\n12 無所遁形術 (8/0)\r\n16 極光雷電 (14/3)\r\n17 起死回生術 (15/0)\r\n18 中級治癒術 (13/0)\r\n19 闇盲咒術 (17/5)\r\n20 鎧甲護持 (20/0)\r\n24 燃燒的火球 (18/10)\r\n25 通暢氣脈術 (23/0)\r\n26 壞物術 (26/20)\r\n27 吸血鬼之吻 (15/1)\r\n28 緩速術 (15/10)\r\n32 木乃伊的詛咒 (35/30)\r\n33 極道落雷 (23/0)\r\n34 高級治癒術 (20/0)\r\n35 迷魅術 (30/20/2)\r\n36 聖潔之光 (20/0)\r\n40 造屍術 (35/20)\r\n41 體魄強健術 (25/15)\r\n42 加速術 (25/20)\r\n43 魔法相消術 (35/15/2)\r\n44 地裂術 (20/15)\r\n48 體力回復術 (40/60)\r\n49 冰矛圍籬 (35/8)\r\n50 召喚術 (50/30/3)\r\n51 神聖的圓 (45/10)\r\n52 龍捲風 (40/20)\r\n56 全部治癒術 (40/0)\r\n57 火牢 (50/20)\r\n58 冰雪暴 (60/10)\r\n59 隱身術 (60/60/1)\r\n60 返生術 (50/0)\r\n64 力場 (60/20)\r\n65 沈睡之霧 (60/35)\r\n66 變形術 (6