al money it may create side effects such as hacking,bug exploitation and stealing. For more information email your server GameMaster.\r\nOur company operates certain departments against hacking. Even though it is called the hacking department we also deal with account issues. We do not have any legal responsibilities that have to deal with your account issues but we are always trying to raise our level of customer service . Recently we have been receiving fake reports and have difficulties providing the best service possible. We have checked game logs and have not found anything regarding your report. The report by %s has been found untrue and is currently blocked. Please check your report again to see if you have made any mistakes in your details and information. For more information contact the hacking department or email your server GameMaster.\r\n@You cannot use our services for non-intended purposes such as. - Giving or selling your account for real money-Selling your items for real money <From the end user license agreement> According to the User Agreement your account has been blocked. When you buy and sell items for real money it may create side effects such as hacking, bug exploitation and stealing. For more information email your server GameMaster. \r\n@You cannot use our services for non-intended purposes such as. -In game bug exploitation <From the end user license agreement> According to the User Agreement your account has been blocked. When exploiting bug our company cannot please out costomers with full satisfaction and it undermines the balance of the game. If you can explain this bug in great detail to the GameMaster, they will determine whether you can have access to your account again.\r\n@You cannot use our services for non-intended purposes such as. -Making fun of other users, threatening, harassing one user constantly, making other users feel unconfortable. <From the end user license agreement> According to the User Agreement your account has been blocked. Conning other players is an act that makes fluent game play impossible and also causes mental stress to the other users. For more information email your server GameMaster.\r\nOur company operates certain departments against hacking. Even though it is called the hacking department we also deal with account issues. We do not have any legal responsibilities that have to deal with your account issues but we are always trying to raise our level of costomer service. Recently we have been receiving fake reports and have difficulties providing the best service possible. If you do not reply with your social security number within 5 days we will see this matter as a false report and block the account. Your account has been block due to the false report from %s. For more information contect the hacking department or email your Gamemasters.\r\n@You cannot use our services for non-intended purposes such as. -Making fun of other users, threatening, harassing one user constantly, making other users feel unconfortable. <From the end user license agreement> According to the User Agreement your account has been blocked. When you interupt game play it causes other users harm and makes it harder for us to provide good customer service. For more information email your server GameMaster\r\n@You cannot use our services for non-intended purposes such as. -Making fun of other users, threatening, harassing one user constantly, making other users feel unconfortable. <From the end user license agreement> According to the User Agreement your account has been blocked. Global chatting is not for just one player it is for everybody to use and watch. For more information email your server GameMaster. \r\n@You cannot use our services for non-intended purposes such as. -Without the permission of NC Interactive, changing lineage client program, hacking lineage server, changing copy writed materials on lineage websites <From the end user license agreement> according to the user agreement your account has been blocked. Using illegal program or changing lineage client program can cause a great deal of trouble for us all. For more information email your server GameMaster.\r\nYour account has been blocked due to your request. In order to activate your account again you must fax us your social security number to (02-556-0658). When you send us your fax please give us your account information and a brief description why you wanted your account blocked.\r\nYour account has been blocked due to a report that stated the credit card was not yours. For mor information regarding this please contact the Lineage customer service at (02-2008-6600).\r\nYour account has been blocked due to a report that stated that you did not use your own Cell phone to pay. For more information please contact us at (080-6114-114). Please email your Gamemaster's for any other information regarding this.\r\nThe current chat channel is %d.\r\nYou can't drop any more items at that location.\r\n\\f1%0 is not willing to receive an item.\r\nreceive\r\nquiet\r\nAdministrator has something important to say. Please chat later.\r\nwanted\r\nWhat do you want your house to be called?\r\nThe house name is too long.\r\nThe house name is invalid.\r\nIf your pledge wants to keep using this house you must keep paying me taxes because this house is on my land.%n Therefore you must pay %0adenas by %1month %2day %3time to the maid that is provided in your house.%n%n\r\nI heard that you haven't paid %0yet. %nIf you dont pay the taxes by %1month %2day %3time I will have no choice but to kick you out of this house.%n%n\r\nYou didn't pay %0taxes yet on your house. As I warned you before I'll have to take this house away from you immediately.%n%n\r\nOnly the pledge leader can use this command.\r\nYou should be at least level 25 to participate in the bidding.\r\nYou already own the castle.\r\nYou already own the house.\r\nYou can't buy the house during the siege.\r\nYou are already participating in another bidding.\r\nCongratulations.%nyou have won the final bid at %0adenas.%nnow you can go to the house you have purchased and use all the facilities.%nThank you.%n%n\r\nI am sorry to say but there was someone who offered more than your bid so you cannot claim that house.%nHere is %0adenas that was your deposit back from that auction.%nThank you.%n%n\r\nYou have won the auction but due to the circumstances that have changed you can't own the house.Please understand that we have totake away your ownership of the house.%nThank you.%n%n\r\nThe house that you have put up for the auction has been sold for %1adenas.%nI'll take off 10%% for my service fees and give you %0adenas.%nThank you.%n%n\r\nNobody has offered the amount you have asked for your house so the auction has been cancelled.%nSo the ownership of the house is still yours.%nThank you.%n%n\r\nNobody has offered the amount you have asked for your house so the auction has been cancelled.%nBut, I can't give you back the ownership of your house due to certain circumstances.%nPlease understand.\r\nYou have to pay taxes first.\r\n\\f1The exchange items are too heavy. You can't put any more items.\r\nHere is the list of all houses in the castle %s.\r\nYour lottery ticket turns out to be blank.\r\nYour lottery ticket turns out to a coupon for one more ticket.\r\nYou won 500 adenas!\r\nYou won 5000 adenas!!\r\nCongratulations! You won 1000000 adenas!!!!!!\r\n\\f1You can't escape from here.\r\n\\f1You can't put it there.\r\nThe fee is %d adenas.\r\nTopic:\r\nAuthor:\r\nBoard number:\r\nWrite the title.\r\n\\f1You can't take it off here.\r\n\\f1Your partner is not playing the game.\r\n\\f1Your partner is in the area that you can't go.\r\nYour partner is playing the game right now.\r\nYour partner has just logged in.\r\nAccount %0 has just logged in from %1.\r\nYour pk count is %0. If your pk count reaches %1, you will be sent to the hell.\r\nYour pk count is %0 and sent to the hell. You have to stay here for %1 minutes.\r\n\\f3N