r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\"></p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我在森林迷路的時後，還以為我死定了，沒想到竟然會在這種地方遇到人。\r\n<p>我會付給你足夠的報酬，我可以給你<var src=\"#1\">金幣，拜託你把我帶到附近的村莊，我身上真的只有這些。\r\n<p>報酬的話，等我到了村莊的旅館再拿給你。</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>接受提議 \r\n<p><a action=\"yes\">是 </a>\r\n<p><a action=\"no\">不是 </a>\r\n</body>","suffererM1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\"></p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>膛縑憮 望擊 檠橫幗溜擊 陽縑朝 薑蜓 避朝 還 憲懊朝等, 檜楛 等憮 檣除擊 爾啪 腎棻棲 葆纂 翎虜 偽捱蹂.\r\n<p>薯陛 醱碟�� 餌滔蒂 萄萵纔棲.. 嬴 嬴棲 <var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭蒂 萄萵纔棲 薯嫦 覬 釭蒂 斬籀曖 葆擊煎 等溥棻 醜蹂. 薑蜓 陛霞啪 斜匙 夤縑 橈橫蹂.\r\n<p>餌滔旎擎 葆擊曖 罹婦縑 紫雜ж朝 闊衛 萄萵眷蹂.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>薯曖蒂 嫡嬴菟檣棻.\r\n<p><a action=\"yes\">蕨</a>\r\n<p><a action=\"no\">嬴棲螃</a>\r\n</body>","suffererm2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\"></p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>報酬的話，等我到了旅館再付給你。\r\n<p>因為我也無法完全相信你。\r\n</body>","suffererM2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\"></p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>餌滔旎擎 葆擊曖 罹婦縑 紫雜ж朝 闊衛 萄萵眷蹂.\r\n<p>盪紫 渡褐擊 諫瞪�� 圖擊 熱朝 橈濫嬴蹂.\r\n</body>","suffererm3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\"></p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>這位是我的救命恩人，在迷幻森林遭遇困難時，是他救了我。 \r\n<p>迷幻森林真的是一個又美麗又可怕的地方。\r\n</body>","suffererM3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\"></p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>檜 碟擎 薯 儅貲曖 擎檣檜縑蹂. 蹂薑曖 膛縑憮 褻陪渡ц歷朝等, 檜碟檜 掘п輿樟剪萇蹂. \r\n<p>蹂薑曖 膛擎 薑蜓 嬴葷港堅紫 鼠憮遴 夠檜渦捱蹂.\r\n</body>","taga1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>泰加羅孚 ：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>為了農作物而燒掉森林？真是狗屁不通。\r\n<p>人類缺乏戰士的精神。如果他們有，他們將會藉由狩獵生存而不用去傷害森林！沒有狩獵能力的人一定會死。\r\n<p>人類因為不知道這點。這就是為什麼他們對其他種族充滿敵意的原因！\r\n</body>","taga1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Taga Rova:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Burning the forest for crops? What foolishness!\r\n<p>Humans lack warrior spirit. If they didn't, they would live by hunting without harming the forest!\r\n<p>Those without the ability to hunt deserve death. Humans don't know this - that's why they are so hostile to other races!\r\n</body>\r\n","taga1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Taga Rova:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Burning the forest for crops? What foolishness!\r\n<p>Humans lack warrior spirit. If they didn't, they would live by hunting without harming the forest!\r\n<p>Those without the ability to hunt deserve death. Humans don't know this - that's why they are so hostile to other races!\r\n</body>\r\n","taga1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>顫陛 煎夥:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>寧擊 虜萄溥堅 膛擊 鷓遴棻? 斜楛 夥爾偽擎!\r\n<p>檣除菟縑啪朝 瞪餌曖 薑褐檜 睡褶ж棻. 檣除菟檜 辦葬諦 偽擎 瞪餌曖 薑褐擊 陛螺渦塭賊 膛擊 斜渠煎 堤舒渦塭紫 瞪錳檜 餌傖擊 п憮 髦 熱 氈擊 匙檜棻.\r\n<p>蝶蝶煎 餌傖й 熱 橈朝 陴濠朝 避橫撿 и棻. 檣除菟擎 檜楛 雖��蒂 賅腦晦 陽僥縑 棻艇 謙褶菟縑啪 釭際啪 渠й 熱 夤縑 橈朝 匙檜棻.\r\n</body>","tanya1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>坦雅 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n甚麼？你因為我是女生所以看不起我嗎？！走開啦！\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","tanya1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>顫傍 :</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n凳撿? 凱! 罹濠塭堅 辦蝗啪 罹晦棻除 贖 囀 棻纂朝 熱陛 氈橫. 橫憮 望擊 綠酈雖 跤п!\r\n</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","tarkin-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>塔奇：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n我們幫人保管物品，你們人類可能不了解，但是我們的『鐵門』公會有很長的服務歷史，你可以信賴我們，\r\n你把物品儲存在我們這裡是很安全的。\r\n<br>\r\n不限制時間，儲存１項物品要３０個金幣。在你取回那些物品的時候再結帳。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>個人倉庫：<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\">存放東西</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\">取回東西</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>血盟倉庫：<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\">存放東西</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\">取回東西</a><br><br>\r\n</body>","tarkin-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Tarkin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of trustworthy service - your items are safe with us. <br>\r\n30 adena for 1 item regardless of time. You'll settle the account when you retrieve the items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","tarkin-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Tarkin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\nWe store items. Our 'Iron Gate' guild has a long history of trustworthy service - your items are safe with us. <br>\r\n30 adena for 1 item regardless of time. You'll settle the account when you retrieve the items.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Personal Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> retrieve item</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Bloodpledge Storage Space:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> store item</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> retrieve item</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","tarkin-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 顫腦鑑:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n僭勒擊 蜆嬴 萄董棲棻. 渡褐菟 檣除菟擎 澀 賅腦啊雖虜, 辦葬 '鬼繹曖 僥' 望萄朝 螃楠 羲餌蒂 陛霞 ががи 褻霜檜塭螃.\r\n凳萇 寰褕ж堅 蜆晦紫煙 п蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n陛問擎 僭勒 ж釭渡 鼠褻勒 30嬴等釭, 絲擎 僭勒擊 瓊擊 陽 頂朝 剪蹂.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>偃檣 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>⑸裊 璽堅:<br></font>\r\n <a action=\"deposit-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 蜆曹棻</a><br>\r\n <a action=\"retrieve-pledge\"> 僭勒擊 瓊朝棻</a><br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","tarkinl-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>塔奇：</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>喂，像你這樣的新手，我們怎麼可以放心的保管你的東西呢？如果你想保管東西的話，在江湖上闖個兩、三年再來吧。\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>","tarkinl-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Tarkin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey, why should we store items for some nameless whelp such as yerself?  If you want to use our services, make a name for yerself, and come back when you've earned some fame.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","tarkinl-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>Tarkin the dwarf:</font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey, why should we store items for some nameless whelp such as yerself?  If you want to use our services, make a name for yerself, and come back when you've earned some fame.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","tarkinl-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff>陪爵檜 顫腦鑑:</font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>檜瑭蹂, 辦葬陛 劂 圖堅 渡褐偽擎 Е啻晦曖 僭勒擊 蜆嬴遽欽 蜓檜螃? 僭勒擊 蜆晦堅 談棻賊 檜葷擊 覬 陳萼 棻擠縑 螃衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire1-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>燃柳村居民:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你好！我正在尋找願意移居 <a link=\"telefire4\">燃柳村</a>的人。\r\n<p>我們需要耕田的農夫，但常常妖魔自從北邊過來這裡攻擊我們，因此很需要能阻擋這些妖魔的戰士。\r\n<p>我們不管你是 <font fg=ffffff>犯人或邪神的信徒</font>也無所謂。只要來這裡...\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我們村子裡的人都很粗魯，所以希望能和你這麼善良的人成為鄰居。\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fire field farmer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hello.  I'm looking for the people who will move to <a link=\"telefire4\">our town</a>.\r\n<p>We are in need of farmers who will till the forest and also warriors who can defend us against orcs from the northern orcish fortress.\r\n<p>Thus we don't mind about <font fg=ffffff>criminals or followers of Gran Kain</font>...if you can only come and help us...\r\n<br>\r\n<p>But because there are only ruffians, I don't want to recommend it to good people like you.\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fire field farmer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hello.  I'm looking for the people who will move to <a link=\"telefire4\">our town</a>.\r\n<p>We are in need of farmers who will till the forest and also warriors who can defend us against orcs from the northern orcish fortress.\r\n<p>Thus we don't mind about <font fg=ffffff>criminals or followers of Gran Kain</font>...if you can only come and help us...\r\n<br>\r\n<p>But because there are only ruffians, I don't want to recommend it to good people like you.\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�倣�團 襟 輿團:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>寰喟ж蓬. 陪 <a link=\"telefire4\">�倣�團 襟</a>戲煎 檜輿й 餌塋擊 掘ж楝 諮模.\r\n<p>膛擊 偃除п憮 寧擊 橾掉 橾羞紫 賅濠塭堅 螃觼 蹂億曖 磁薹 螃觼菟曖 奢問擊 虞嬴還 瞪餌紫 睡褶ж螃.\r\n<p>斜楚憮 <font fg=ffffff>彰賸濠釭 賸檣, 斜嫌蘋檣曖 褐濠</font>塭紫 鼻婦橈模檜棻. 諦輿晦虜 и棻賊..\r\n<br>\r\n<p>ж雖虜 錶釩 剪耀 餌塋菟閨檜塭, 渡褐籀歲 摹и 餌塋縑啦 掏ж堅 談雖 彊掘楫.\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire2-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>燃柳村居民:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>嘿！對，就是你。唉∼！不要用那種懷疑眼神來看我。我有個很好的提案！\r\n<br>\r\n<p>我看你啊，因犯了重大罪行，而無路可去吧！要不要到我們 <a link=\"telefire4\">燃柳村</a>工作？\r\n<p>那裡是剛設立的村莊，由於還沒有警衛，因此有許多像你這樣的罪犯住在那裡。同樣處境的人之間可互相悔悟以前犯過的罪，<font fg=ffffff>因此有犯過罪的人適合住在這村莊</font>。\r\n<p>怎麼樣？我不會害你...若有意思就跟我說吧。</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">有心意去</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fire field farmer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey, you! What? Don't stare at me like that! I have a good suggestion for you.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You seem to have nowhere to go because of the crimes you committed... Won't you come to <a link=\"telefire4\">our town</a>?\r\n<p>We just built the town, so there are no guards, and even the serious criminals like you can live without problems. It's a good town for people like you to live, and we need the protection.\r\n<p>What do you think? There is no harm... so tell me if you want.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">I want to go there</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fire field farmer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Hey, you! What? Don't stare at me like that! I have a good suggestion for you.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You seem to have nowhere to go because of the crimes you committed... Won't you come to <a link=\"telefire4\">our town</a>?\r\n<p>We just built the town, so there are no guards, and even the serious criminals like you can live without problems. It's a good town for people like you to live, and we need the protection.\r\n<p>What do you think? There is no harm... so tell me if you want.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">I want to go there</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�倣�團 襟 輿團:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜爾蓬. 剪晦 ⑽噢. 嬴嬴..棲 斜溢啪 喻溥爾雖 蜓掘楫. 渡褐縑啪 謠擎 薯寰擊 й 纔棲梱.\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渡褐 爾嬴ж棲 醞賸蒂 盪韓楝憮 陞 夠檜 橈橫爾檜朝 等.. �公� <a link=\"telefire4\">�倣�團 襟</a>縑憮 橾й 儅陝 橈熱?\r\n<p>剪曹 虞 儅曹 葆擊檜塭 唳綠煽紫 橈堅, 渡褐籀歲 醞賸檣紫 號檜 髦堅 氈棻辦. 偽擎 籀雖曖 餌塋郭葬 <font fg=ffffff>賸蒂 斯辦纂貊 髦晦縛 詞 瞳渡и 葆擊</font>檜塭棲梱.\r\n<p>橫飩熱? 釭際啦 寰й 纔棲.. 儅陝氈擠 蜓ж辦.</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">陞 葆擠檜 氈棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire3-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>燃柳村住民:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>真的嗎？好！你一定不會後悔的。\r\n<p>我有歐林法師給我的瞬間移動捲軸，但你也需要付一點金幣。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport firefieldtown\">燃柳村: <var src=\"#0\">金幣</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fire field farmer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You will go? Good decision!\r\n<p>I have some scrolls of teleportation from the wizard of Oren; I'll send you right away, if you are willing to part with a few adena.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport firefieldtown\">Town of fire field farmers: <var src=\"#0\">Adenas</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fire field farmer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You will go? Good decision!\r\n<p>I have some scrolls of teleportation from the wizard of Oren; I'll send you right away, if you are willing to part with a few adena.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport firefieldtown\">Town of fire field farmers: <var src=\"#0\">Adenas</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�倣�團 襟 輿團:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>除棻掘? 謠嬴! 謠模檜棻. 澀 唸薑ц熱.\r\n<p>釭縑啪 螃溶曖 葆徹餌陛 遽 檜翕 輿僥憮陛 氈戲棲 絲 賃ヲ虜 輿賊 旎寞 爾頂萄葬葬棻.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport firefieldtown\">�倣�團 襟: <var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭</a><br>\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire4-c.HTML":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>燃柳村住民:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>燃柳村位於古丁北部的黑暗森林附近。\r\n<p>因為北方的妖魔在那裡，因此人們不願去那裡，以前判王在古丁引起戰爭，因戰爭而失去房子和田地的住民去那裡，燒掉森林後，在那裡耕田。算是剛產生的村莊。\r\n<p>雖然常常受到妖魔的攻擊，但為了生存只有忍耐。\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fire field farmer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Our town is in the northern Black Forest.\r\n<p>Originally people shunned the area because of the northern orc tribes, but after the recent war - in which that evil Pretender-King swept the Gludio Estates - many people who had lost their homes and farms entered that forest and cultivated ground by burning the trees.  It's a relatively new town.\r\n<p>Northern orcs are constantly invading the town to claim their forest... but we don't have any choice.\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Fire field farmer:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Our town is in the northern Black Forest.\r\n<p>Originally people shunned the area because of the northern orc tribes, but after the recent war - in which that evil Pretender-King swept the Gludio Estates - many people who had lost their homes and farms entered that forest and cultivated ground by burning the trees.  It's a relatively new town.\r\n<p>Northern orcs are constantly invading the town to claim their forest... but we don't have any choice.\r\n</body>\r\n","telefire4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>�倣�團 襟 輿團:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>�倣�團 襟擎 盪晦 旋瑞蛤螃 磁薹 匐擎 膛縑 氈棻辦.\r\n<p>錳楚 磁薹 螃觼菟檜 髦堅 氈橫憮 餌塋菟擎 寰陛湍 夠檜雖虜, 剪 釭雌 奩諾檜 旋瑞蛤螃 艙雖蒂 誕 噩橫幗萼 瞪爵氈濫熱. 斜楚憮 瞪爵鱔縑 餵婁 寧擊 檠擎 輿團檜 剪望 菟橫陛憮 膛擊 鷓錶 寧擊 橾掘堅 氈模. 檜薯 虞 儅曹 葆擊檜雖.\r\n<p>膛擊 貍憾曹 磁薹 螃觼菟檜 蹂億蒂 撮錶憮 嫣詳蛭檜 藥菟橫 螃雖虜 橫翹啊熱. 殮縑 ヴ艦檜塭紫 ж溥賊 橫聶 熱 橈雖 彊熱?\r\n</body>\r\n","telegiran1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>爾瑪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎光臨。我是從象牙塔派來的魔法師爾瑪。\r\n<p>象牙塔為了魔法能用於公益上而執行許多服務。\r\n<p>你要甚麼服務？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">傳送至附近地區</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","telegiran1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>葆徹餌 尷葆:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃撮蹂. 盪朝 螃溶曖 '鼻嬴鱉'縑憮 檜夠戲煎 だ唯釭螞 葆徹餌 尷葆縑蹂.\r\n<p>螃溶曖 鼻嬴鱉擎 葆徹曖 奢櫛縑曖 �倏蹀� 嬪п 罹楝陛雖 憮綠蝶蒂 ж堅 氈橫蹂.\r\n<p>渡褐擎 橫雯 憮綠蝶蒂 錳ж撮蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">檣斬 雖羲戲煎 蘿溯んおи棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","telegiran2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>爾瑪:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>在此可傳送的地區和費用如下。要傳送至那個村莊？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport giran-kent\">凱登村: <var src=\"#0\"> 金幣</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport giran-dragonvalley\">龍之谷入口: <var src=\"#1\"> 金幣</a><br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","telegiran2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>葆徹餌 尷葆:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 夠縑憮 陞 熱 氈朝 雖羲婁 蹂旎擎 棻擠婁 偽嬴蹂. 橫替 葆擊煎 陛衛啊橫蹂?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport giran-kent\">騰お撩 葆擊: <var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport giran-dragonvalley\">辨曖 啗堊 殮掘: <var src=\"#1\">嬴等釭</a><br>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n","telegludin1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>史提夫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎，旅行者。我是來自歐瑞的『象牙塔』的史提夫。\r\n<p>歐瑞的『象牙塔』正在試著為大眾提供服務。\r\n<p>你需要什麼樣的服務？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">傳送到最近的城鎮</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","telegludin1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Wizard Steve:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, traveller. I'm Steve from the Ivory Tower at Oren.\r\n<p>The Ivory Tower is offering many services to the public.\r\n<p>What kind of service do you want?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">Teleport to nearest town</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","telegludin1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Wizard Steve:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, traveller. I'm Steve from the Ivory Tower at Oren.\r\n<p>The Ivory Tower is offering many services to the public.\r\n<p>What kind of service do you want?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">Teleport to nearest town</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","telegludin1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>葆徹餌 蝶じ粽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃衛螃. 釭朝 螃溶曖 '鼻嬴鱉'縑憮 檜夠戲煎 だ唯釭螞 葆徹餌 蝶じ粽殮棲棻.\r\n<p>螃溶曖 鼻嬴鱉擎 葆徹曖 奢櫛縑曖 �倏蹀� 嬪п 罹楝陛雖 憮綠蝶蒂 ж堅 氈雖蹂. \r\n<p>渡褐擎 橫雯 憮綠蝶蒂 錳ж褊棲梱?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">檣斬 葆擊煎 蘿溯んおи棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","telegludin2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>史提夫：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這裡是可去的城鎮和所需的費用。你要去哪�堜O？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport gludin-island\">說語島：<var src=\"#0\"> 金幣</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport gludin-kent\">凱登村莊：<var src=\"#1\"> 金幣</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport gludin-willow\">燃柳村：<var src=\"#2\"> 金幣</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport gludin-woods\">風木村：<var src=\"#3\"> 金幣</a>\r\n</body>","telegludin2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffff