ant?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">Teleport to nearest town</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","teleisland1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Wizard Lucas:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Welcome, traveller. I'm Lucas from the Ivory Tower at Oren.\r\n<p>The Ivory Tower is offering many services to the public.\r\n<p>What kind of service do you want?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">Teleport to nearest town</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","teleisland1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>葆徹餌 瑞蘋蝶:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃衛螃. 釭朝 螃溶曖 '鼻嬴鱉'縑憮 檜夠戲煎 だ唯釭螞 葆徹餌 瑞蘋蝶殮棲棻.\r\n<p>螃溶曖 鼻嬴鱉擎 葆徹曖 奢櫛縑曖 �倏蹀� 嬪п 罹楝陛雖 憮綠蝶蒂 ж堅 氈雖蹂. \r\n<p>渡褐擎 橫雯 憮綠蝶蒂 錳ж褊棲梱?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleportURL\">檣斬 葆擊煎 蘿溯んおи棻</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","teleisland2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>盧卡斯：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>這裡是可去的城鎮和所需的費用。你要去哪�堜O？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport island-gludin\">古丁城鎮：1500 金幣</a>\r\n</body>","teleisland2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Wizard Lucas:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the list of available towns and the corresponding fares. Where do you want to go?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport island-gludin\">Gludin Town: <var src=\"#0\"> adena</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","teleisland2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Wizard Lucas:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Here is the list of available towns and the corresponding fares. Where do you want to go?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport island-gludin\">Gludin Town: <var src=\"#0\"> adena</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","teleisland2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>葆徹餌 瑞蘋蝶:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>檜 夠縑憮 陞 熱 氈朝 葆擊婁 蹂旎擎 棻擠婁 偽蝗棲棻. 橫替 葆擊煎 陛衛啊蝗棲梱?\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"teleport island-gludin\">旋瑞蛞 葆擊: <var src=\"#0\">嬴等釭</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","telekent1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>史坦利：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>歡迎，旅行者。我是來自歐瑞『象牙塔』的史坦利。\r\n<p>歐瑞的『象牙塔』正在試著為大眾提供服務。\r\n<p>你需要什麼樣的服務？\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a link=\"telekent2\">傳送到最近的城鎮</a>\r\n</body>","telekent1-