br><a link=\"ladar10\">製作硬皮背心</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar11\">製作皮盔甲</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar12\">製作皮帶</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n","vincent1-e.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Vincent:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>What would you like to make?</p>  \r\n\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar3\">Make hard leather</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar4\">Make leather cap</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar5\">Make leather sandal</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar6\">Make leather vest</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar7\">Make leather shield</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar8\">Make leather boots</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar9\">Make leather helmit</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar10\">Make hard leather vest</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar11\">Make leather vest with belt</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar12\">Make belt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","vincent1-j.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Vincent:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>What would you like to make?</p>  \r\n\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar3\">Make hard leather</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar4\">Make leather cap</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar5\">Make leather sandal</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar6\">Make leather vest</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar7\">Make leather shield</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar8\">Make leather boots</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar9\">Make leather helmit</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar10\">Make hard leather vest</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar11\">Make leather vest with belt</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar12\">Make belt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","vincent1-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避撮奢餌 綴撫お:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>鼠歙擊 虜菟橫 萄萵梱蹂?</p>  \r\n\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar3\">堅晝Я⑶擊 虜萇棻</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar4\">陛避賅濠蒂 虜萇棻</a>\r\n<br><a link=\"ladar5\">陛避僻殖擊 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar6\">陛避褻郭蒂 虜萇棻</a> \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar7\">陛避寞ぬ蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar8\">陛避睡隴蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar9\">陛避癱掘蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar10\">醞骨陛避褻郭蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar11\">漣お殖萼 陛避褻郭蒂 虜萇棻</a>  \r\n<br><a link=\"ladar12\">漣お蒂 虜萇棻</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","vincent2-c.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>文森:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>我無法幫你製作任何東西.</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","vincent2-e.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Vincent:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>I will not make anything for criminals like you.</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","vincent2-j.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Vincent:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>I will not make anything for criminals like you.</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","vincent2-k.html":"<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>陛避撮奢餌 綴撫お:</p></font>\r\n\r\n<br><p>彰賸濠縑啪朝 嬴鼠匙紫 虜菟橫 萄萵 熱 橈蝗棲棻.</p>  \r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n","wdguard3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>風木之城警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>現在<a link=\"wdguard4\">這裡</a>的治安不是很好，尤其在城內，大家的行動要小心一點。\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"ktguard6\">詢問現在的盟主是誰</a>\r\n</body>","wdguard3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Windawood Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The <a link=\"wdguard4\">security</a> around here is not what it used to be - be prudent on your behavior within castle grounds.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"ktguard6\">Ask about the current lord</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Windawood Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The <a link=\"wdguard4\">security</a> around here is not what it used to be - be prudent on your behavior within castle grounds.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"ktguard6\">Ask about the current lord</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>孺棻辦萄撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>⑷營 雖羲曖 <a link=\"wdguard4\">纂寰</a>檜 謠雖 彊戲棲 か�� 撩 頂縑憮朝 ч翕擊 濠醞ж紫煙 ж衛螃.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"ktguard6\">⑷營曖 艙輿陛 援捱雖 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","wdguard4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>風木之城警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>從以前開始風木之城附近就有很多怪獸出沒，因為大地的大部分變成了黃土，風木之城的始祖卡勒為了使這樣的地方也能讓人居住，於是就把怪獸藏身的<a link=wdguard5>地下洞窟\r\n</a>摧毀，建立了風木之城，因此我們風木之城有著強健的戰鬥力，這也是我們一直引以為傲的。","wdguard4-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Windawood Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I shouldn't be saying this out loud...but...did you know that Count Kent came to reign over this territory after the fall of Count Gludia, the original lord of Gludio Estate, during the war against his highness, Ken Rauhel, the current King of Aden?\r\n<p>The thing is that the newly assigned lord has no concerns for the well being of his domain, no wonder there is <a link=wdguard5>restlessness</a> among the people...\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard4-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Windawood Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I shouldn't be saying this out loud...but...did you know that Count Kent came to reign over this territory after the fall of Count Gludia, the original lord of Gludio Estate, during the war against his highness, Ken Rauhel, the current King of Aden?\r\n<p>The thing is that the newly assigned lord has no concerns for the well being of his domain, no wonder there is <a link=wdguard5>restlessness</a> among the people...\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard4-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>孺棻辦萄撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>孺棻辦萄朝 獄楚睡攪 跨蝶攪陛 濠輿 轎路ж朝 雖羲檜螃. 艙雖曖 渠睡碟檜 �硃姦鷊� 腎橫 氈戲棲 蜓檜螃. 孺棻辦萄曖 衛褻檜褐 蘋滂 驕ん萄椒擎 檜楛 夠檜塭紫 餌塋檜 髦 熱 氈朝 夠戲煎 虜菟晦 嬪п 跨蝶攪曖 獄剪雖檣 <a link=wdguard5>湍蟒</a>擊 模鰻ж衛堅 孺棻辦萄 撩擊 撮辦樟轄. 斜楚憮 辦葬 孺棻辦萄曖 晦餌欽擎 褒瞪縑 鬼и 鬼勒и 晦餌欽歜擊 棺 濠嫌蝶毀啪 儅陝и棻螃.","wdguard5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>風木之城警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>雖然很難相信，但這城確實建立在地下監獄之上。傳說卡勒在毀滅怪獸的地下洞窟時，和惡魔的首領『巴列斯』戰鬥，在決鬥最後兩人都沒有傷到對方的致命部位，因此卡勒就在地下監獄的上面建立一個城來封印牠，同時也成為了這地區的統治者。因為往地下監獄的入口在城內，所以必須定期的巡邏。\r\n</body>","wdguard5-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Windawood Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Since you are not from around here, you wouldn't know...the Gludian towns used to bustle with life as trade harbors, and now the only people that wander around are people bearing arms... in the northern woods, people who have lost their farmland during the recent war, gather around forming small camps on burnt-down grounds living like refugees.\r\n<p>I am not a man of politics, but seeing the sentiments of the people and what goes on around here, the thought that there has got to be something wrong going on bothers me...\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard5-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Windawood Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Since you are not from around here, you wouldn't know...the Gludian towns used to bustle with life as trade harbors, and now the only people that wander around are people bearing arms... in the northern woods, people who have lost their farmland during the recent war, gather around forming small camps on burnt-down grounds living like refugees.\r\n<p>I am not a man of politics, but seeing the sentiments of the people and what goes on around here, the thought that there has got to be something wrong going on bothers me...\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard5-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>孺棻辦萄撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>圖晦雖 彊啊雖虜 檜 撩擎 斜 湍蟒 嬪縑 撮遴 匙檜螃. 蘋滂椒擎 跨蝶攪曖 獄剪雖檣 湍蟒擊 模鰻ж棻陛 唸措 舒跡檣 漆溯蝶塭朝 學葆諦 諄辦啪 腎歷棻堅 ж螃. 唸瞪 部縑 萃 棻 纂貲顫蒂 陳葬雖 跤ж堅 渠褐 蘋滂椒擎 湍蟒 嬪縑 撩擊 論嬴 湍蟒擊 馬衛ж朝 翕衛縑 檜 雖羲曖 雖寡濠陛 腎樟棻堅 瞪п霞棻螃. 湍蟒戲煎 菟橫陛朝 殮掘朝 頂撩縑 氈橫憮 撩曖 晦餌菟檜 薑晦瞳戲煎 湍蟒擊 牖�裔挬棪� ж渦捱蹂.\r\n</body>","wdguard6-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>甚麼？你不知道那位城主的姓名？你聽清楚，現在這裡的城主是 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font> 血盟的 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>。記住！</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\"> 詢問下次攻城時間 </a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">對<var src=\"#1\">血盟宣戰。</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard6-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't know who the lord of this castle is?\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All right, I'll tell you this time. The current lord is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font> from the Bloodpledge <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>. Try to remember the name of our great lord next time!.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">Ask the time for the next siege</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">Declare a war against <var src=\"#1\"></a>\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard6-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>What? You don't know who the lord of this castle is?\r\n<br>\r\n<p>All right, I'll tell you this time. The current lord is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font> from the Bloodpledge <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font>. Try to remember the name of our great lord next time!.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">Ask the time for the next siege</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\">Declare a war against <var src=\"#1\"></a>\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard6-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left><var src=\"#0\">:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>凳塭堅? 凱 濠晦 餌朝 雖寞 撩輿椒曖 襄л紫 賅艇欽 蜓檜撿? 澀 菟橫塭, ⑷營 檜 雖寞曖 艙輿朝 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#1\"></font> ⑸裊 轎褐曖 <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#2\"></font>椒檜衛棻. 僅僅�� 晦橘п 舒紫煙 п.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"askwartime\">棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 僖朝棻</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action =\"declarewar\"><var src=\"#1\"> ⑸裊縑 渠п 奢撩瞪擊 摹樹и棻.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard7-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>風木之城警衛:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>城主公佈的下一回攻城時間為 <var src=\"#1\">年 <var src=\"#2\">月 <var src=\"#3\">日 <var src=\"#4\">時 <var src=\"#5\">分。若有勇氣就來吧！\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard7-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Windawood Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to challenge our Lord, come at <var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#1\"> <var src=\"#4\">o'clock.\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard7-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Windawood Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you want to challenge our Lord, come at <var src=\"#2\">/<var src=\"#3\">/<var src=\"#1\"> <var src=\"#4\">o'clock.\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard7-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>孺棻辦萄撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿眷憮 嫦ルж褐 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛陝擎 <var src=\"#1\">喇 <var src=\"#2\">錯 <var src=\"#3\">橾 <var src=\"#4\">衛 <var src=\"#5\">碟 檜棻. 渾網 纔賊 渾滬瑭!\r\n</body>","wdguard8-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>風木之城警衛：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>盟主還未決定下次圍城的時間。\r\n</body>","wdguard8-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Windawood Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Our Lord hasn't declared the time for the next siege yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard8-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Windawood Castle Guard:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Our Lord hasn't declared the time for the next siege yet.\r\n</body>\r\n","wdguard8-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>孺棻辦萄撩 唳綠煽:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>艙輿眷憮朝 嬴霜 棻擠 奢撩瞪 衛除擊 唸薑ж雖 彊戲樟棻.\r\n</body>","werner-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>溫諾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>冠石物資豐富，物品種類多，又很便宜。請隨便你挑。</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"mayer3\">詢問目前的物價</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","werner-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Werner:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Giran has many resources, so the prices are low and quality is good. Pick whatever you like.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"mayer3\">Ask about the current price</a>\r\n</body>","werner-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Werner:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Giran has many resources, so the prices are low and quality is good. Pick what ever you like.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"mayer3\">Ask about the current price</a>\r\n</body>","werner-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>錶傘:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>晦塢擎 僭濠陛 Ё睡п憮 僭勒檜 謙盟紫 號堅 陛問紫 諄蹂. 葆擠盔 埤塭 爾撮蹂.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"mayer3\">蹂闈 僭陛縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","werner.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>錶傘:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>晦塢擎 僭濠陛 Ё睡п憮 僭勒檜 謙盟紫 號堅 陛問紫 諄蹂. 葆擠盔 埤塭 爾撮蹂.</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"mayer3\">蹂闈 僭陛縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","werner2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>溫諾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>再靠近我就叫治安隊來，不要小看我喔。\r\n</body>\r\n","werner2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Werner:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you come any closer I will call the guards. Don't think you can bully me around.\r\n</body>","werner2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Werner:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If you come any closer i will call the guards. Don't think you can bully me around.\r\n</body>","werner2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>錶傘:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>渦 檜鼻 陛梱檜 螃賊 纂寰渠蒂 睡腦啊模. 陳 辦蝗啪 爾雖 葆衛螃.\r\n</body>","werner3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>溫諾:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p現在的稅率是<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>。成本低有甚麼用啊！得付那麼多稅金。</p>\r\n</body>\r\n","werner3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Werner:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font> is the tax rate. Even at wholesale prices, it doesn't seem like it since the taxes are so high.</p>\r\n</body>","werner3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Werner:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font> is the tax rate. Even at wholesale prices, it doesn't seem like it since the taxes are so high.</p>\r\n</body>","werner3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>錶傘:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p> <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>薑紫塭螃. 錳陛虜 諄賊 凳ж釭蹂. 撮旎檜 號檜 稱朝等..</p>\r\n</body>","wizard-c.tbl":"31\r\n       魔法師\r\n\r\n    魔法師是聖職者。\r\n   他們了解這個世界\r\n    正在善神殷海薩\r\n   與惡神格藍肯之間\r\n     反覆地搖擺著。\r\n\r\n     但是很明顯地，\r\n 他們對神的力量的興趣\r\n  遠超過於對神的信心，\r\n 因此，沒有人將魔法師\r\n   當作純粹的聖徒，\r\n   自然也不受尊重。\r\n\r\n  在施放強力魔法時，\r\n 他們的身體會很虛弱。\r\n    精神力的高低，\r\n 則影響著魔法準確度。\r\n\r\n     他們的能力\r\n  以及魔法師的相性，\r\n  與其信奉的神有關。\r\n\r\n 尊敬殷海薩並行善者，\r\n 被稱為『白魔法師』。\r\n       相反地，\r\n 尊敬格蘭肯並做惡者，\r\n 就被稱為『黑魔法師』。\r\n\r\n","wizard-e.tbl":"54\r\nWizard\r\n\r\nWizards are a combination\r\nof standard magicians and\r\nclergy, deriving their \r\npowers from forces loosed\r\nin the struggle between\r\nthe good god Einhasad and\r\nEinhasad's nemesis, Gran\r\nKain.  \r\n\r\nAs Wizards cast spells\r\nand perform deeds, their\r\nalliance with one god or\r\nthe other will grow \r\nstronger, but they are\r\nrarely truly devoted in \r\neither direction - most\r\nwizards care more for the\r\nuse of their power than\r\nthe root of it.\r\n\r\nWizards pay for this \r\npower by being physically\r\nthe weakest of the classes\r\nof Lineage - being very \r\nvulernable to physical\r\nattacks and unable to\r\nuse the best armor and\r\nweapons.  In return, they\r\nare the most powerful\r\nmagic-weilders, and while\r\ninitially weak, they \r\ncan cast spells at the\r\nhigher levels that are\r\nfearsome indeed.\r\n\r\nThe most important \r\nstatistics to a Wizard \r\nare usually INT and WIS, \r\nwhich control both how\r\npowerful their spells are\r\nand how many MP the wizard\r\nhas available to cast\r\nspells.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, many wizards\r\nbalance this with a high\r\nCON so that their physical\r\nfrailty is bolstered with\r\na few extra HP, especially\r\nsince some powerful spells\r\ndrain not just MP but also\r\nthe wizard's life force.\r\n","wizard-j.tbl":"54\r\nWizard\r\n\r\nWizards are a combination\r\nof standard magicians and\r\nclergy, deriving their \r\npowers from forces loosed\r\nin the struggle between\r\nthe good god Einhasad and\r\nEinhasad's nemesis, Gran\r\nKain.  \r\n\r\nAs Wizards cast spells\r\nand perform deeds, their\r\nalliance with one god or\r\nthe other will grow \r\nstronger, but they are\r\nrarely truly devoted in \r\neither direction - most\r\nwizards care more for the\r\nuse of their power than\r\nthe root of it.\r\n\r\nWizards pay for this \r\npower by being physically\r\nthe weakest of the classes\r\nof Lineage - being very \r\nvulernable to physical\r\nattacks and unable to\r\nuse the best armor and\r\nweapons.  In return, they\r\nare the most powerful\r\nmagic-weilders, and while\r\ninitially weak, they \r\ncan cast spells at the\r\nhigher levels that are\r\nfearsome indeed.\r\n\r\nThe most important \r\nstatistics to a Wizard \r\nare usually INT and WIS, \r\nwhich control both how\r\npowerful their spells are\r\nand how many MP the wizard\r\nhas available to cast\r\nspells.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, many wizards\r\nbalance this with a high\r\nCON so that their physical\r\nfrailty is bolstered with\r\na few extra HP, especially\r\nsince some powerful spells\r\ndrain not just MP but also\r\nthe wizard's life force.\r\n","wizard-k.tbl":"36\r\n葆徹餌\r\n\r\n葆徹餌菟擎  撮啗曖  賅萇\r\n罌擊 '摹и 褐'  嬴檣ж餌\r\n萄諦 '學и 褐'  斜嫌蘋檣\r\n曖 癱爵戲煎 檜пж堅  氈\r\n朝, 橫雯 賊縑憮朝 撩霜濠\r\n塭堅紫 й 熱 氈朝 餌塋菟\r\n殮棲棻. \r\nж雖虜 檜菟檜 牖熱и  謙\r\n掖陛煎 罹啖雖雖 彊朝  檜\r\n嶸朝 檜楝и 掘紫釭 斜 褐\r\n濠羹縑  渠и  褐懈爾棻朝\r\n斜 掘紫縑 曖п 儅啖螳 釭\r\n螃朝 ��擊 翱掘ж堅  掘餌\r\nж朝 等縑 渦遵 婦褕檜 號\r\n晦 陽僥殮棲棻.\r\n\r\n葆徹餌菟擎 幫羹瞳檣 瞪癱\r\n棟溘擎  綴擒ж雖虜  渠褐\r\n罹楝 陛雖 鬼溘и  葆徹擊\r\n餌辨й 熱 氈蝗棲棻. 檜菟\r\n曖 棟溘檜 褐婁 桶擎 婦啗\r\n蒂 陛雖朝 檜鼻 檜菟曖 撩\r\nщ擎 斜菟檜 餌辨ж朝  葆\r\n徹縑紫 贖 艙щ擊  嘐蘑棲\r\n棻. \r\n葆徹餌菟 偃偃檣曖 撩щ檜\r\n釭 餌鼻擎 薯  陝陝檜雖虜\r\n橾奩瞳戲煎  嬴檣ж餌萄曖\r\n嗆擊 嫡菟橫 摹и 橾擊 ж\r\n朝 葆徹餌菟擊 '寥葆徹餌'\r\n, 斜嫌蘋檣曖 嗆擊 嫡菟橫\r\n學и 橾擊 чж朝  葆徹餌\r\n菟擊 '�皜飪�餌'塭 睡落棲\r\n棻.\r\n","woodford1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>伍得福：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你問我正在這裡的生活好嗎？別再提了。在這兒，我一整天的收入也只夠餬口。你如何能夠想像我<a link=\"woodford2\">生活的辛苦</a>？\r\n</body>","woodford1-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Woodford:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you asking me about life here? Please don't; all I get by working here from dawn till dark go straight into our mouths directly. You couldn't even imagine my <a link=\"woodford2\">life.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","woodford1-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Woodford:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Are you asking me about life here? Please don't; all I get by working here from dawn till dark go straight into our mouths directly. You couldn't even imagine my <a link=\"woodford2\">life.</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","woodford1-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辦萄ん萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>罹晦憮 餌朝啪 橫飩傍堅蹂? 嬴檜掘 蜓紫 葆澗. 衙橾偽檜 翕ぎ 陽 橾橫釭憮 梭梭п韓 陽梱雖 橾п紫 啖辦 殮縑 ヴ艦й 薑紫夤縑朝 寰腎雖. 階 寰 睡藥獄 餌塋擎 檜 <a link=\"woodford2\">堅儅</a> 賅蒂疏蹂. \r\n</body>","woodford2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>伍得福：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>是啊，當我在那個領地的時候，生活是比較容易，那兒有富有的土壤、好的工具...但是我更滿意現在。在那時候，那些看來很高貴的人帶走我種的東西，除了貧窮之外，沒有留下任何東西...現在，至少我的家庭能得到我所收割的每樣作物。\r\n</body>","woodford2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Woodford:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Yes, it was easier when I was at the Estate. Rich soil, good tools...but I'm more satisfied now. Then the high-ups took everything I had raised, giving me nothing but poverty...well, now at least my family can get everything I grow.\r\n</body>\r\n","woodford2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>Woodford:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Yes, it was easier when I was at the Estate. Rich soil, good tools...but I'm more satisfied now. Then the high-ups took everything I had raised, giving me nothing but poverty...well, now at least my family can get everything I grow.\r\n</body>\r\n","woodford2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>辦萄ん萄:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>斜楚紫 艙饜縑憮 寧堯餌 雖擊陽朝 雖旎爾欽 らц棻辦. 階紫 晦葷雖堅, 晦掘紫 渦 謠堅 蜓檜撿. ж雖虜 樂霜�� 蜓п 雖旎檜 葆擠擎 渦 らж雖. 斜陽撿 ��菟罹 堯餌 雖橫疑濠 嬪縑憮 棻 陛螳陛棲 嬴鼠葬 Ё濛檜橫紫 斜葬 謠韓 彊懊剪萇. 雖旎擎 斜楚紫 頂陛 務擎勒 辦葬 陛褶菟檜 詳擊 熱 氈戲棲梱...\r\n</body>","y_pass_01-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffff00>請關注對話窗口上的提示做輸入:</font><br>\r\n請先輸入 \"舊密碼\"<br>\r\n再輸入 \"新密碼\"<br>\r\n再次輸入 \"新密碼\"，有出現 密碼變更完成。 即可<br>\r\n<font fg=ffff00><var src=\"#0\"> </font><br>\r\n</body>","y_s_0-c.html":"<body>\r\n活動/贊助商人：<BR>\r\n   <font fg=ffff00>歡迎使用本領取系統 </font><BR>\r\n   <font fg=ffff00>若您是要領取贊助或活動獎勵</font><BR>\r\n   <font fg=ffff00>請點選下方\"領取道具\"即可 </font><BR>\r\n<BR>\r\n<a action=\"2\">「全部領取」</a><br>\r\n</body>","y_shop-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=91FEFF><p align=left>商人：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<font fg=B23AEE><p align=left></p>\r\n<p>●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●</p>\r\n<p>┌─────────────┐</p>\r\n<font fg=B23AEE><p align=left></p>\r\n<font fg=3399ff><p align=left></p>\r\n<p>歡迎您選購</p>\r\n<p>商店內有許多補給品提供給勇者們</p>\r\n<p>可以在此補充須多需要冒險的道具</p>\r\n<p>貨品售出概不退換，請自行注意!</p>\r\n<p>再次感謝您的支持!</p>\r\n</p><p align=left></p></font>\r\n<font fg=B23AEE><p align=left></p>\r\n<p>└─────────────┘</p>\r\n<p>●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●</p>\r\n<font fg=B23AEE><p align=left></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<a action=\"a\">進行購買</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","y_who-c.html":"<body>\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<font fg=\"00FFFF\">☆ ╮歡迎光臨╭ ☆</font><br>\r\n<font fg=\"ccffcc\">感謝<font fg=\"3399ff\"><var src=\"#998\"></var><font fg=\"ccffcc\">使用</p><br>\r\n<font fg=\"00ff00\">經驗</font> - <var src=\"#0\"><br>\r\n<font fg=\"00ff00\">掉寶</font> - <var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n<font fg=\"00ff00\">金幣</font> - <var src=\"#2\"><br>\r\n<font fg=\"00ff00\">正義</font> - <var src=\"#3\"><br>\r\n<font fg=\"00ff00\">負重</font> - <var src=\"#4\"><br>\r\n<font fg=\"00ff00\">手點上限</font> - <var src=\"#5\"><br>\r\n============================<br>\r\n<font fg=\"00ff00\">目前時間</font> - <var src=\"#6\"><br>\r\n<font fg=\"00ff00\">重啟時間</font> - <var src=\"#7\"><br>\r\n============================<br>\r\n<font fg=\"ccffcc\">天堂 時間:<font fg=\"3399ff\"><var src=\"#999\"></var><br>\r\n<font fg=\"00FFFF\">指令說明</font><br>\r\nskill / 查技能 = 顯示狀態秒數<br>\r\nreloc / 解卡點 = 解除座標異常<br>\r\n<font fg=\"00FFFF\">變卷說明</font><br>\r\n使用變卷後輸入 none 可恢復原貌\r\n</body>","y_x_1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<center>\r\n<a action=\"s\">「出售道具」</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"i\">「查看寄售道具」</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"l\">「出售記錄」</a><br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n寄售說明:<br>\r\n每件寄售道具手續費用<font fg=ffff66><var src=\"#0\"></font>個貨幣<br>\r\n寄售時間以<font fg=ffff66><var src=\"#1\"></font>天為限<br>\r\n最低出售價限制為<font fg=ffff66><var src=\"#2\"></font>個貨幣<br>\r\n最高出售價限制為<font fg=ffff66><var src=\"#3\"></font>個貨幣<br>\r\n不接受未鑑定道具<br>\r\n不接受具有使用時間限制的道具<br>\r\n任意拍賣造成損失團隊概不負責<br>\r\n</center>\r\n</body>","y_x_2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>拍賣紀錄</p></font>\r\n頁面(<var src=\"#0\">)<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#464\"></img><var src=\"#1\"><br>\r\n狀態: <a action=\"0\"><var src=\"#2\"> </a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#464\"></img><font fg=ffff00><var src=\"#3\"></font><br>\r\n狀態: <a action=\"1\"><var src=\"#4\"> </a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#464\"></img><var src=\"#5\"><br>\r\n狀態: <a action=\"2\"><var src=\"#6\"> </a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#464\"></img><font fg=ffff00><var src=\"#7\"></font><br>\r\n狀態: <a action=\"3\"><var src=\"#8\"> </a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#464\"></img><var src=\"#9\"><br>\r\n狀態: <a action=\"4\"><var src=\"#10\"> </a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#464\"></img><font fg=ffff00><var src=\"#11\"></font><br>\r\n狀態: <a action=\"5\"><var src=\"#12\"> </a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#464\"></img><var src=\"#13\"><br>\r\n狀態: <a action=\"6\"><var src=\"#14\"> </a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#464\"></img><font fg=ffff00><var src=\"#15\"></font><br>\r\n狀態: <a action=\"7\"><var src=\"#16\"> </a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#464\"></img><var src=\"#17\"><br>\r\n狀態: <a action=\"8\"><var src=\"#18\"> </a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"#464\"></img><font fg=ffff00><var src=\"#19\"></font><br>\r\n狀態: <a action=\"9\"><var src=\"#20\"> </a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"up\">上頁</a> / <a action=\"dn\">下頁</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</body>","y_x_3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<img src=\"#871\"></img>\r\n</body>","y_x_4-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>託售管理員：</p></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n這是你的託售資料:<br>\r\n物品名稱:<font fg=ffff66><var src=\"#0\"></font><br>\r\n售價:<font fg=ffff66><var src=\"#1\"></font>貨幣<br>\r\n託售到期:<font fg=ffff66><var src=\"#2\"></font><br>\r\n<br>\r\n託售時間你隨時可以來查看商品狀態!!\r\n</body>","y_x_5-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>託售管理員：</p></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n這是你的託售資料:<br>\r\n物品名稱:<font fg=ffff00><var src=\"#0\"></font><br>\r\n售價:<font fg=ffff00><var src=\"#1\"></font>貨幣<br>\r\n託售到期:<font fg=ffff00><var src=\"#2\"></font><br>\r\n<br>\r\n你確定要取消託售嗎??<br><br>\r\n<a action=\"over\">我要取消託售!</a><br>\r\n<a action=\"no\">算了在賣賣看!</a><br>\r\n</body>","y_x_e-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>出售管理員:</p></font>\r\n一次只能決定一樣託售物品!!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","y_x_e1-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>出售管理員:</p></font>\r\n找不到你要出售的物品數據!!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","ysorya-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>索拉雅：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>請進。我們這兒曾經是專門研究魔法最棒的地方，但是，因為這些日子沒有好東西進來，我已經決定經手一般的物品。\r\n<p>哦，如果你剛好有任何使用完的魔杖，把他們給我好了，我買。通常那些東西是不能重新補充能源的，不過現在歐瑞的『象牙塔』正在收集用來研究魔法再製。\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ysorya3\">問價格</a>\r\n</body>","ysorya-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'Sorcerer' Ysorya:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Come in. We used to specialize in magical equipment, but I have decided to deal with mundane items since no good things are coming in these days.\r\n<p>Oh, and if you happen to have any used-up wands, bring them to me, I'll buy them. Usually those things are un-rechargeable, but The Ivory Tower at Oren is collecting them for their magical research.\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ysorya3\">Ask about the prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ysorya-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'Sorcerer' Ysorya:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Come in. We used to specialize in magical equipment, but I have decided to deal with mundane items since no good things are coming in these days.\r\n<p>Oh, and if you happen to have any used-up wands, bring them to me, I'll buy them. Usually those things are un-rechargeable, but The Ivory Tower at Oren is collecting them for their magical research.\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ysorya3\">Ask about the prices</a>\r\n</body>\r\n","ysorya-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'輿獎餌' 檜模葬撿:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>橫憮螃撮蹂. 罹曹 錳楚 葆徹 僭ヶ擊 瞪僥戲煎 ж朝 陛啪檜雖虜, 蹂闈 僭勒檜 艙 寰菟橫諦憮 濩�音� 鏃晝ж晦煎 ц港棲棻.\r\n<p>嬴, 斜葬堅 �公� 棻 噹 葆徹 虞渠陛 氈戲賊 釭и纔 陛螳諦蹂. 頂陛 餌 還纔棲梱. 獄楚 и廓 虜菟橫霞 葆徹 僭ヶ擎 營餌辨檜 寰腎朝 勘煎 憲堅 氈朝等, 螃溶曖 鼻嬴鱉縑憮 蹂闈 葆徹曖 營�倏踸� 渠п 翱掘и棻賊憮 棻 噹 虞渠蒂 賅戲渦塭堅蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n<p align=center>\r\n<img src=\"#312\" action=\"buy\"></img>\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<img src=\"#314\" action=\"sell\"></img></P>\r\n<br>\r\n<a action=\"ysorya3\">蹂闈 僭陛縑 渠п 僖朝棻</a>\r\n</body>","ysorya2-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>索拉雅：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>你不是我喜歡的類型。走開！\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","ysorya2-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'Sorcerer' Ysorya:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are not my type. Go away!\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ysorya2-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'Sorcerer' Ysorya:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>You are not my type. Go away!\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ysorya2-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'輿獎餌' 檜模葬撿:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>寰つ嬴蹂. 証等陛憮 憲嬴瑭蹂.\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","ysorya3-c.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>索拉雅：</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>稅大概是<font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">％</font>吧。就算它有效吧，但也是加在原始價格之上的，別想騙我。\r\n<br>\r\n</body>","ysorya3-e.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'Sorcerer' Ysorya:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The tax is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>. But the tax is based on the original price even if it's a used item, so don't dare to deceive me.\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ysorya3-j.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'Sorcerer' Ysorya:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The tax is <font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>. But the tax is based on the original price even if it's a used item, so don't dare to deceive me.\r\n<br>\r\n</body>\r\n","ysorya3-k.html":"<body>\r\n<font fg=ffffff><p align=left>'輿獎餌' 檜模葬撿:</p></font>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><font fg=ffffff><var src=\"#0\">%</font>薑紫橾匏棲棻. 斜楚紫 醞堅 僭勒擊 髦 陽朝 錳楚 僭勒 陛問戲煎 啗骯й纔棲 餌晦艦 儅陝 蜓嬴蹂.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n</body>"}